export default {"format":"cadcraft-help","version":1,"app":"takeoffcraft","name":"TakeoffDesk","common":"basics","sections":{"start":"Getting started","tasks":"Walkthroughs","switching":"Coming from other software","reference":"Reference","trouble":"Troubleshooting and limits"},"variants":{"os":{"mac":"Mac","windows":"Windows","linux":"Linux"},"browser":{"chromium":"Chrome or Edge","firefox":"Firefox","safari":"Safari"},"shell":{"web":"In the browser","desktop":"Desktop app"},"net":{"online":"Online","offline":"Offline"},"input":{"mouse":"Mouse","touch":"Touch"}},"topics":[{"slug":"getting-started","scope":"takeoffcraft","title":"Getting started with TakeoffDesk","summary":"What TakeoffDesk does, where it runs, and your first measured and priced item from a PDF plan set.","section":"start","order":10,"keywords":["start","first takeoff","quick start","introduction","estimate","quantity takeoff","plan set","pdf"],"headings":[{"id":"where-it-runs","text":"Where it runs","level":2},{"id":"your-first-takeoff-in-ten-steps","text":"Your first takeoff in ten steps","level":2},{"id":"what-to-read-next","text":"What to read next","level":2}],"html":"\u003Cp\u003ETakeoffDesk measures plan sets, PDFs and DWG or DXF drawings, and turns the measurements into a priced estimate. You open the files (a drawing counts straight from its blocks: see \u003Ca href=\"/tutorials/takeoffcraft/open-a-drawing\" data-topic=\"takeoffcraft/open-a-drawing\"\u003EOpen a DWG or DXF drawing\u003C/a\u003E), give each sheet a scale (a drawing brings its own), make \u003Cstrong\u003Eitems\u003C/strong\u003E (a wall type, a floor finish, a fixture), and click on the sheets to take them off. Quantities, costs and the job total update as you go. You can export the estimate as a spreadsheet and a copy of the PDFs with your takeoff drawn in.\u003C/p\u003E\n\u003Cp\u003EIf you have done takeoff in other programs, read \u003Ca href=\"/tutorials/takeoffcraft/coming-from\" data-topic=\"takeoffcraft/coming-from\"\u003EComing from other takeoff software\u003C/a\u003E next. Some things work differently here.\u003C/p\u003E\n\u003Ch2 id=\"where-it-runs\"\u003EWhere it runs\u003C/h2\u003E\n\u003Cp\u003ETakeoffDesk runs in your web browser. Open TakeoffDesk and the screen is ready at once; there is nothing to install.\u003C/p\u003E\n\u003Cul\u003E\u003Cli\u003E\u003Cstrong\u003EYour PDFs stay on your computer.\u003C/strong\u003E They are opened by the browser and never uploaded. Saving is a download.\u003C/li\u003E\u003Cli\u003EIt works in current Chrome, Edge, Firefox and Safari. See \u003Ca href=\"/tutorials/basics/browsers\" data-topic=\"basics/browsers\"\u003EBrowsers and computers\u003C/a\u003E.\u003C/li\u003E\u003Cli\u003EIt works with no internet connection once you choose \u003Cspan class=\"hui\"\u003ESave for offline\u003C/span\u003E in the app bar and it says \u003Cspan class=\"hui\"\u003EOffline ready\u003C/span\u003E. See \u003Ca href=\"/tutorials/basics/offline\" data-topic=\"basics/offline\"\u003EWorking offline\u003C/a\u003E.\u003C/li\u003E\u003Cli\u003ECloud saving is not available: your files stay on your computer.\u003C/li\u003E\u003C/ul\u003E\n\u003Ch2 id=\"your-first-takeoff-in-ten-steps\"\u003EYour first takeoff in ten steps\u003C/h2\u003E\n\u003Cp\u003EThis walk-through measures one wall type and prices it. It takes a few minutes on any plan you have.\u003C/p\u003E\n\u003Col\u003E\u003Cli\u003EChoose \u003Cspan class=\"hui\"\u003EOpen plans\u003C/span\u003E in the \u003Cspan class=\"hui\"\u003EFile\u003C/span\u003E group of the toolbar (or press \u003Ckbd class=\"hk\"\u003E\u003Cspan class=\"k-mac\" title=\"Command O\"\u003E⌘O\u003C/span\u003E\u003Cspan class=\"k-pc\"\u003ECtrl+O\u003C/span\u003E\u003C/kbd\u003E), pick one or more PDFs, and choose Open. You can also drop the PDFs anywhere on the page. The sheets appear on the left and the first sheet opens in the middle.\u003C/li\u003E\u003Cli\u003EFind the sheet&#039;s printed scale in its title block or under a drawing title.\u003C/li\u003E\u003Cli\u003EOpen the \u003Cspan class=\"hui\"\u003EPreset\u003C/span\u003E list in the \u003Cspan class=\"hui\"\u003EScale\u003C/span\u003E group and pick that scale, for example \u003Ccode\u003E1/4&quot; = 1&#039;-0&quot;\u003C/code\u003E. The bar at the bottom of the sheet now says &quot;Scale 1/4&quot; = 1&#039;-0&quot;&quot;.\u003C/li\u003E\u003Cli\u003EChoose \u003Cspan class=\"hui\"\u003ECheck\u003C/span\u003E (or press \u003Ckbd class=\"hk\"\u003E\u003Cspan class=\"k-mac\" title=\"D\"\u003ED\u003C/span\u003E\u003Cspan class=\"k-pc\"\u003ED\u003C/span\u003E\u003C/kbd\u003E) and click the two ends of a dimension printed on the drawing. The readout in the status bar at the bottom left should match the printed dimension. If it does not, see \u003Ca href=\"/tutorials/takeoffcraft/set-the-scale\" data-topic=\"takeoffcraft/set-the-scale\"\u003ESet the scale\u003C/a\u003E.\u003C/li\u003E\u003Cli\u003EIn the \u003Cspan class=\"hui\"\u003EItems\u003C/span\u003E panel on the right, choose \u003Cspan class=\"hui\"\u003ENew item\u003C/span\u003E, type a name like \u003Ccode\u003EInterior wall type A\u003C/code\u003E, leave the type on \u003Cspan class=\"hui\"\u003ELinear (length)\u003C/span\u003E, and choose \u003Cspan class=\"hui\"\u003EAdd\u003C/span\u003E.\u003C/li\u003E\u003Cli\u003EChoose \u003Cspan class=\"hui\"\u003ELinear\u003C/span\u003E in the toolbar (or press \u003Ckbd class=\"hk\"\u003E\u003Cspan class=\"k-mac\" title=\"L\"\u003EL\u003C/span\u003E\u003Cspan class=\"k-pc\"\u003EL\u003C/span\u003E\u003C/kbd\u003E).\u003C/li\u003E\u003Cli\u003EClick the start of a wall, then each corner along it. Double-click, press \u003Ckbd class=\"hk\"\u003E\u003Cspan class=\"k-mac\" title=\"Return\"\u003EReturn\u003C/span\u003E\u003Cspan class=\"k-pc\"\u003EEnter\u003C/span\u003E\u003C/kbd\u003E or right-click to finish the run. The run is drawn in the item&#039;s color and its length appears next to the item.\u003C/li\u003E\u003Cli\u003EIn the item editor under \u003Cspan class=\"hui\"\u003EItems\u003C/span\u003E, type \u003Ccode\u003E9&#039;-0&quot;\u003C/code\u003E in \u003Cspan class=\"hui\"\u003EHeight\u003C/span\u003E, \u003Ccode\u003E0.85\u003C/code\u003E in \u003Cspan class=\"hui\"\u003EMaterial $/LF\u003C/span\u003E and \u003Ccode\u003E1.20\u003C/code\u003E in \u003Cspan class=\"hui\"\u003ELabor $/LF\u003C/span\u003E. The \u003Cspan class=\"hui\"\u003EQuantities\u003C/span\u003E table at the bottom shows the length, the extended material and labor, and the \u003Cspan class=\"hui\"\u003EJob total\u003C/span\u003E.\u003C/li\u003E\u003Cli\u003EChoose \u003Cspan class=\"hui\"\u003ESave takeoff\u003C/span\u003E (or press \u003Ckbd class=\"hk\"\u003E\u003Cspan class=\"k-mac\" title=\"Command S\"\u003E⌘S\u003C/span\u003E\u003Cspan class=\"k-pc\"\u003ECtrl+S\u003C/span\u003E\u003C/kbd\u003E). Your browser downloads a \u003Ccode\u003E.takeoff.json\u003C/code\u003E file. It holds your items, scales and marks, and reopens on top of the same PDFs.\u003C/li\u003E\u003Cli\u003EOpen the \u003Cspan class=\"hui\"\u003EExport\u003C/span\u003E menu in the toolbar and choose \u003Cspan class=\"hui\"\u003EXLSX\u003C/span\u003E to download the estimate as a spreadsheet.\u003C/li\u003E\u003C/ol\u003E\n\u003Caside class=\"hc hc-tip\"\u003E\u003Cp class=\"hc-label\"\u003ETip\u003C/p\u003E\n\u003Cp\u003EPress \u003Ckbd class=\"hk\"\u003E\u003Cspan class=\"k-mac\" title=\"Esc\"\u003EEsc\u003C/span\u003E\u003Cspan class=\"k-pc\"\u003EEsc\u003C/span\u003E\u003C/kbd\u003E to stop whatever you are doing and go back to the \u003Cspan class=\"hui\"\u003ESelect\u003C/span\u003E tool. \u003Ckbd class=\"hk\"\u003E\u003Cspan class=\"k-mac\" title=\"Command Z\"\u003E⌘Z\u003C/span\u003E\u003Cspan class=\"k-pc\"\u003ECtrl+Z\u003C/span\u003E\u003C/kbd\u003E undoes any change.\u003C/p\u003E\n\u003C/aside\u003E\n\u003Ch2 id=\"what-to-read-next\"\u003EWhat to read next\u003C/h2\u003E\n\u003Cul\u003E\u003Cli\u003E\u003Ca href=\"/tutorials/takeoffcraft/workspace\" data-topic=\"takeoffcraft/workspace\"\u003EThe TakeoffDesk screen\u003C/a\u003E names every part of the window.\u003C/li\u003E\u003Cli\u003E\u003Ca href=\"/tutorials/takeoffcraft/open-plan-set\" data-topic=\"takeoffcraft/open-plan-set\"\u003EStart a takeoff and open a plan set\u003C/a\u003E covers several PDFs and the sheets list.\u003C/li\u003E\u003Cli\u003E\u003Ca href=\"/tutorials/takeoffcraft/create-items\" data-topic=\"takeoffcraft/create-items\"\u003ECreate takeoff items\u003C/a\u003E explains types, units, waste and rates.\u003C/li\u003E\u003Cli\u003E\u003Ca href=\"/tutorials/takeoffcraft/assemblies\" data-topic=\"takeoffcraft/assemblies\"\u003EAssemblies and formulas\u003C/a\u003E turns one measurement into studs, sheets of board and more.\u003C/li\u003E\u003Cli\u003E\u003Ca href=\"/tutorials/takeoffcraft/keyboard\" data-topic=\"takeoffcraft/keyboard\"\u003EKeyboard and mouse\u003C/a\u003E lists every key.\u003C/li\u003E\u003C/ul\u003E","text":"TakeoffDesk measures plan sets, PDFs and DWG or DXF drawings, and turns the measurements into a priced estimate. You open the files (a drawing counts straight from its blocks: see Open a DWG or DXF drawing), give each sheet a scale (a drawing brings its own), make items (a wall type, a floor finish, a fixture), and click on the sheets to take them off. Quantities, costs and the job total update as you go. You can export the estimate as a spreadsheet and a copy of the PDFs with your takeoff drawn in. If you have done takeoff in other programs, read Coming from other takeoff software next. Some things work differently here. Where it runs TakeoffDesk runs in your web browser. Open TakeoffDesk and the screen is ready at once; there is nothing to install. Your PDFs stay on your computer. They are opened by the browser and never uploaded. Saving is a download. It works in current Chrome, Edge, Firefox and Safari. See Browsers and computers. It works with no internet connection once you choose Save for offline in the app bar and it says Offline ready. See Working offline. Cloud saving is not available: your files stay on your computer. Your first takeoff in ten steps This walk-through measures one wall type and prices it. It takes a few minutes on any plan you have. Choose Open plans in the File group of the toolbar (or press Ctrl+O), pick one or more PDFs, and choose Open. You can also drop the PDFs anywhere on the page. The sheets appear on the left and the first sheet opens in the middle. Find the sheet's printed scale in its title block or under a drawing title. Open the Preset list in the Scale group and pick that scale, for example 1/4\" = 1'-0\". The bar at the bottom of the sheet now says \"Scale 1/4\" = 1'-0\"\". Choose Check (or press D) and click the two ends of a dimension printed on the drawing. The readout in the status bar at the bottom left should match the printed dimension. If it does not, see Set the scale. In the Items panel on the right, choose New item, type a name like Interior wall type A, leave the type on Linear (length), and choose Add. Choose Linear in the toolbar (or press L). Click the start of a wall, then each corner along it. Double-click, press Enter or right-click to finish the run. The run is drawn in the item's color and its length appears next to the item. In the item editor under Items, type 9'-0\" in Height, 0.85 in Material $/LF and 1.20 in Labor $/LF. The Quantities table at the bottom shows the length, the extended material and labor, and the Job total. Choose Save takeoff (or press Ctrl+S). Your browser downloads a .takeoff.json file. It holds your items, scales and marks, and reopens on top of the same PDFs. Open the Export menu in the toolbar and choose XLSX to download the estimate as a spreadsheet. Press Esc to stop whatever you are doing and go back to the Select tool. Ctrl+Z undoes any change. What to read next The TakeoffDesk screen names every part of the window. Start a takeoff and open a plan set covers several PDFs and the sheets list. Create takeoff items explains types, units, waste and rates. Assemblies and formulas turns one measurement into studs, sheets of board and more. Keyboard and mouse lists every key.","lang":"en"},{"slug":"workspace","scope":"takeoffcraft","title":"The TakeoffDesk screen","summary":"A tour of the window by on-screen name - the toolbar, the sheets list, the sheet, the Items panel, the Quantities table and the status bar.","section":"start","order":20,"keywords":["screen","layout","layouts","ribbon","project browser","toolbox","info box","toolbar","panels","sheets list","items panel","quantities","status bar","tour","interface"],"headings":[{"id":"the-toolbar","text":"The toolbar","level":2},{"id":"sheets-left","text":"Sheets (left)","level":2},{"id":"the-sheet-middle","text":"The sheet (middle)","level":2},{"id":"items-right","text":"Items (right)","level":2},{"id":"quantities-bottom","text":"Quantities (bottom)","level":2},{"id":"status-bar-bottom","text":"Status bar (bottom)","level":2},{"id":"other-layouts","text":"Other layouts","level":2},{"id":"full-screen-and-themes","text":"Full screen and themes","level":2}],"html":"\u003Cp\u003ETakeoffDesk fills the browser window under the app bar. From top to bottom and left to right:\u003C/p\u003E\n\u003Cdiv class=\"ht-wrap\"\u003E\u003Ctable class=\"ht\"\u003E\u003Cthead\u003E\u003Ctr\u003E\u003Cth scope=\"col\"\u003EPart\u003C/th\u003E\u003Cth scope=\"col\"\u003EWhere\u003C/th\u003E\u003Cth scope=\"col\"\u003EWhat it is for\u003C/th\u003E\u003C/tr\u003E\u003C/thead\u003E\u003Ctbody\u003E\u003Ctr\u003E\u003Ctd\u003EApp bar\u003C/td\u003E\u003Ctd\u003EVery top\u003C/td\u003E\u003Ctd\u003EThe app name, the version, \u003Cspan class=\"hui\"\u003EAbout TakeoffDesk\u003C/span\u003E, \u003Cspan class=\"hui\"\u003EHelp\u003C/span\u003E (\u003Ckbd class=\"hk\"\u003E\u003Cspan class=\"k-mac\" title=\"F1\"\u003EF1\u003C/span\u003E\u003Cspan class=\"k-pc\"\u003EF1\u003C/span\u003E\u003C/kbd\u003E), \u003Cspan class=\"hui\"\u003ESave for offline\u003C/span\u003E, \u003Cspan class=\"hui\"\u003ESettings\u003C/span\u003E (\u003Ckbd class=\"hk\"\u003E\u003Cspan class=\"k-mac\" title=\"Command ,\"\u003E⌘,\u003C/span\u003E\u003Cspan class=\"k-pc\"\u003ECtrl+,\u003C/span\u003E\u003C/kbd\u003E), the \u003Cspan class=\"hui\"\u003EFull screen\u003C/span\u003E button and the \u003Cspan class=\"hui\"\u003EPaper\u003C/span\u003E / \u003Cspan class=\"hui\"\u003EModel\u003C/span\u003E theme switch.\u003C/td\u003E\u003C/tr\u003E\u003Ctr\u003E\u003Ctd\u003EToolbar\u003C/td\u003E\u003Ctd\u003EUnder the app bar\u003C/td\u003E\u003Ctd\u003EEvery command, in groups: \u003Cspan class=\"hui\"\u003EFile\u003C/span\u003E, \u003Cspan class=\"hui\"\u003EExport\u003C/span\u003E, \u003Cspan class=\"hui\"\u003EScale\u003C/span\u003E, \u003Cspan class=\"hui\"\u003ETakeoff\u003C/span\u003E, \u003Cspan class=\"hui\"\u003EEdit\u003C/span\u003E, \u003Cspan class=\"hui\"\u003EView\u003C/span\u003E.\u003C/td\u003E\u003C/tr\u003E\u003Ctr\u003E\u003Ctd\u003ESheets\u003C/td\u003E\u003Ctd\u003ELeft\u003C/td\u003E\u003Ctd\u003EEvery page of every open PDF, with a thumbnail, its scale and its mark count.\u003C/td\u003E\u003C/tr\u003E\u003Ctr\u003E\u003Ctd\u003EThe sheet\u003C/td\u003E\u003Ctd\u003EMiddle\u003C/td\u003E\u003Ctd\u003EThe open page. You measure here.\u003C/td\u003E\u003C/tr\u003E\u003Ctr\u003E\u003Ctd\u003EItems\u003C/td\u003E\u003Ctd\u003ERight\u003C/td\u003E\u003Ctd\u003EYour takeoff items, the selected item&#039;s settings, and the selected mark.\u003C/td\u003E\u003C/tr\u003E\u003Ctr\u003E\u003Ctd\u003EQuantities\u003C/td\u003E\u003Ctd\u003EBottom\u003C/td\u003E\u003Ctd\u003EQuantities and costs by item or by sheet, and the job total.\u003C/td\u003E\u003C/tr\u003E\u003Ctr\u003E\u003Ctd\u003EStatus bar\u003C/td\u003E\u003Ctd\u003EVery bottom\u003C/td\u003E\u003Ctd\u003EThe live measurement, messages, the 45° hint and the zoom.\u003C/td\u003E\u003C/tr\u003E\u003C/tbody\u003E\u003C/table\u003E\u003C/div\u003E\n\u003Ch2 id=\"the-toolbar\"\u003EThe toolbar\u003C/h2\u003E\n\u003Cp\u003EHover over any button to see what it does and its key.\u003C/p\u003E\n\u003Cdiv class=\"ht-wrap\"\u003E\u003Ctable class=\"ht\"\u003E\u003Cthead\u003E\u003Ctr\u003E\u003Cth scope=\"col\"\u003EGroup\u003C/th\u003E\u003Cth scope=\"col\"\u003EButtons\u003C/th\u003E\u003C/tr\u003E\u003C/thead\u003E\u003Ctbody\u003E\u003Ctr\u003E\u003Ctd\u003E\u003Cspan class=\"hui\"\u003EFile\u003C/span\u003E\u003C/td\u003E\u003Ctd\u003E\u003Cspan class=\"hui\"\u003ENew\u003C/span\u003E (empty takeoff), \u003Cspan class=\"hui\"\u003EOpen PDFs\u003C/span\u003E (\u003Ckbd class=\"hk\"\u003E\u003Cspan class=\"k-mac\" title=\"Command O\"\u003E⌘O\u003C/span\u003E\u003Cspan class=\"k-pc\"\u003ECtrl+O\u003C/span\u003E\u003C/kbd\u003E), \u003Cspan class=\"hui\"\u003EOpen takeoff\u003C/span\u003E (a \u003Ccode\u003E.takeoff.json\u003C/code\u003E project), \u003Cspan class=\"hui\"\u003ESave takeoff\u003C/span\u003E (\u003Ckbd class=\"hk\"\u003E\u003Cspan class=\"k-mac\" title=\"Command S\"\u003E⌘S\u003C/span\u003E\u003Cspan class=\"k-pc\"\u003ECtrl+S\u003C/span\u003E\u003C/kbd\u003E)\u003C/td\u003E\u003C/tr\u003E\u003Ctr\u003E\u003Ctd\u003E\u003Cspan class=\"hui\"\u003EExport\u003C/span\u003E\u003C/td\u003E\u003Ctd\u003EOne menu: \u003Cspan class=\"hui\"\u003EXLSX\u003C/span\u003E, \u003Cspan class=\"hui\"\u003ECSV\u003C/span\u003E, \u003Cspan class=\"hui\"\u003EMarked PDF\u003C/span\u003E\u003C/td\u003E\u003C/tr\u003E\u003Ctr\u003E\u003Ctd\u003E\u003Cspan class=\"hui\"\u003EScale\u003C/span\u003E\u003C/td\u003E\u003Ctd\u003E\u003Cspan class=\"hui\"\u003ECalibrate\u003C/span\u003E (\u003Ckbd class=\"hk\"\u003E\u003Cspan class=\"k-mac\" title=\"K\"\u003EK\u003C/span\u003E\u003Cspan class=\"k-pc\"\u003EK\u003C/span\u003E\u003C/kbd\u003E), \u003Cspan class=\"hui\"\u003ECheck\u003C/span\u003E (\u003Ckbd class=\"hk\"\u003E\u003Cspan class=\"k-mac\" title=\"D\"\u003ED\u003C/span\u003E\u003Cspan class=\"k-pc\"\u003ED\u003C/span\u003E\u003C/kbd\u003E), and the \u003Cspan class=\"hui\"\u003EPreset\u003C/span\u003E list\u003C/td\u003E\u003C/tr\u003E\u003Ctr\u003E\u003Ctd\u003E\u003Cspan class=\"hui\"\u003ETakeoff\u003C/span\u003E\u003C/td\u003E\u003Ctd\u003E\u003Cspan class=\"hui\"\u003ESelect\u003C/span\u003E (\u003Ckbd class=\"hk\"\u003E\u003Cspan class=\"k-mac\" title=\"V\"\u003EV\u003C/span\u003E\u003Cspan class=\"k-pc\"\u003EV\u003C/span\u003E\u003C/kbd\u003E), \u003Cspan class=\"hui\"\u003ELinear\u003C/span\u003E (\u003Ckbd class=\"hk\"\u003E\u003Cspan class=\"k-mac\" title=\"L\"\u003EL\u003C/span\u003E\u003Cspan class=\"k-pc\"\u003EL\u003C/span\u003E\u003C/kbd\u003E), \u003Cspan class=\"hui\"\u003EArea\u003C/span\u003E (\u003Ckbd class=\"hk\"\u003E\u003Cspan class=\"k-mac\" title=\"A\"\u003EA\u003C/span\u003E\u003Cspan class=\"k-pc\"\u003EA\u003C/span\u003E\u003C/kbd\u003E), \u003Cspan class=\"hui\"\u003ECircle\u003C/span\u003E (\u003Ckbd class=\"hk\"\u003E\u003Cspan class=\"k-mac\" title=\"O\"\u003EO\u003C/span\u003E\u003Cspan class=\"k-pc\"\u003EO\u003C/span\u003E\u003C/kbd\u003E), \u003Cspan class=\"hui\"\u003EArc\u003C/span\u003E (\u003Ckbd class=\"hk\"\u003E\u003Cspan class=\"k-mac\" title=\"R\"\u003ER\u003C/span\u003E\u003Cspan class=\"k-pc\"\u003ER\u003C/span\u003E\u003C/kbd\u003E, an on/off switch), \u003Cspan class=\"hui\"\u003EDeduct\u003C/span\u003E (\u003Ckbd class=\"hk\"\u003E\u003Cspan class=\"k-mac\" title=\"E\"\u003EE\u003C/span\u003E\u003Cspan class=\"k-pc\"\u003EE\u003C/span\u003E\u003C/kbd\u003E, an on/off switch), \u003Cspan class=\"hui\"\u003ECut-out\u003C/span\u003E (\u003Ckbd class=\"hk\"\u003E\u003Cspan class=\"k-mac\" title=\"X\"\u003EX\u003C/span\u003E\u003Cspan class=\"k-pc\"\u003EX\u003C/span\u003E\u003C/kbd\u003E), \u003Cspan class=\"hui\"\u003ECount\u003C/span\u003E (\u003Ckbd class=\"hk\"\u003E\u003Cspan class=\"k-mac\" title=\"C\"\u003EC\u003C/span\u003E\u003Cspan class=\"k-pc\"\u003EC\u003C/span\u003E\u003C/kbd\u003E), \u003Cspan class=\"hui\"\u003EAuto count\u003C/span\u003E (\u003Ckbd class=\"hk\"\u003E\u003Cspan class=\"k-mac\" title=\"S\"\u003ES\u003C/span\u003E\u003Cspan class=\"k-pc\"\u003ES\u003C/span\u003E\u003C/kbd\u003E)\u003C/td\u003E\u003C/tr\u003E\u003Ctr\u003E\u003Ctd\u003E\u003Cspan class=\"hui\"\u003EEdit\u003C/span\u003E\u003C/td\u003E\u003Ctd\u003E\u003Cspan class=\"hui\"\u003EUndo\u003C/span\u003E (\u003Ckbd class=\"hk\"\u003E\u003Cspan class=\"k-mac\" title=\"Command Z\"\u003E⌘Z\u003C/span\u003E\u003Cspan class=\"k-pc\"\u003ECtrl+Z\u003C/span\u003E\u003C/kbd\u003E), \u003Cspan class=\"hui\"\u003ERedo\u003C/span\u003E (\u003Ckbd class=\"hk\"\u003E\u003Cspan class=\"k-mac\" title=\"Command Y\"\u003E⌘Y\u003C/span\u003E\u003Cspan class=\"k-pc\"\u003ECtrl+Y\u003C/span\u003E\u003C/kbd\u003E), \u003Cspan class=\"hui\"\u003ECopy\u003C/span\u003E (\u003Ckbd class=\"hk\"\u003E\u003Cspan class=\"k-mac\" title=\"Command C\"\u003E⌘C\u003C/span\u003E\u003Cspan class=\"k-pc\"\u003ECtrl+C\u003C/span\u003E\u003C/kbd\u003E), \u003Cspan class=\"hui\"\u003EPaste\u003C/span\u003E (\u003Ckbd class=\"hk\"\u003E\u003Cspan class=\"k-mac\" title=\"Command V\"\u003E⌘V\u003C/span\u003E\u003Cspan class=\"k-pc\"\u003ECtrl+V\u003C/span\u003E\u003C/kbd\u003E), and \u003Cspan class=\"hui\"\u003EMore\u003C/span\u003E: \u003Cspan class=\"hui\"\u003ECut\u003C/span\u003E, \u003Cspan class=\"hui\"\u003ECopy\u003C/span\u003E, \u003Cspan class=\"hui\"\u003EPaste\u003C/span\u003E, \u003Cspan class=\"hui\"\u003EPaste in place\u003C/span\u003E, \u003Cspan class=\"hui\"\u003EDuplicate\u003C/span\u003E, \u003Cspan class=\"hui\"\u003EDelete\u003C/span\u003E, \u003Cspan class=\"hui\"\u003ESelect all\u003C/span\u003E, \u003Cspan class=\"hui\"\u003ESelect none\u003C/span\u003E\u003C/td\u003E\u003C/tr\u003E\u003Ctr\u003E\u003Ctd\u003E\u003Cspan class=\"hui\"\u003EView\u003C/span\u003E\u003C/td\u003E\u003Ctd\u003E\u003Cspan class=\"hui\"\u003EFit page\u003C/span\u003E (\u003Ckbd class=\"hk\"\u003E\u003Cspan class=\"k-mac\" title=\"F\"\u003EF\u003C/span\u003E\u003Cspan class=\"k-pc\"\u003EF\u003C/span\u003E\u003C/kbd\u003E), \u003Cspan class=\"hui\"\u003EFit width\u003C/span\u003E (\u003Ckbd class=\"hk\"\u003E\u003Cspan class=\"k-mac\" title=\"W\"\u003EW\u003C/span\u003E\u003Cspan class=\"k-pc\"\u003EW\u003C/span\u003E\u003C/kbd\u003E)\u003C/td\u003E\u003C/tr\u003E\u003C/tbody\u003E\u003C/table\u003E\u003C/div\u003E\n\u003Cp\u003EThe tool you are using is shown pressed. The \u003Cspan class=\"hui\"\u003EArc\u003C/span\u003E and \u003Cspan class=\"hui\"\u003EDeduct\u003C/span\u003E buttons stay pressed while they are on.\u003C/p\u003E\n\u003Ch2 id=\"sheets-left\"\u003ESheets (left)\u003C/h2\u003E\n\u003Cul\u003E\u003Cli\u003E\u003Cstrong\u003ESearch sheets\u003C/strong\u003E filters the list by sheet name, file name or page label.\u003C/li\u003E\u003Cli\u003EEach sheet shows a thumbnail (drawn as you scroll), its name, and either its scale or \u003Cstrong\u003ENo scale\u003C/strong\u003E.\u003C/li\u003E\u003Cli\u003EThe right side of each row shows how many marks the sheet has. While an item is highlighted, it shows how many of that item&#039;s marks are on the sheet instead.\u003C/li\u003E\u003Cli\u003EClick a sheet to open it. \u003Ckbd class=\"hk\"\u003E\u003Cspan class=\"k-mac\" title=\"fn ↓\"\u003Efn ↓\u003C/span\u003E\u003Cspan class=\"k-pc\"\u003EPage Down\u003C/span\u003E\u003C/kbd\u003E and \u003Ckbd class=\"hk\"\u003E\u003Cspan class=\"k-mac\" title=\"fn ↑\"\u003Efn ↑\u003C/span\u003E\u003Cspan class=\"k-pc\"\u003EPage Up\u003C/span\u003E\u003C/kbd\u003E move to the next and previous sheet in the list.\u003C/li\u003E\u003Cli\u003EWhen a takeoff covers PDFs that are not open, a note under the list names them. See \u003Ca href=\"/tutorials/takeoffcraft/save-and-reopen\" data-topic=\"takeoffcraft/save-and-reopen\"\u003ESave and reopen a takeoff\u003C/a\u003E.\u003C/li\u003E\u003C/ul\u003E\n\u003Cp\u003ESheet names come from the PDF: a page label such as \u003Ccode\u003EA-101\u003C/code\u003E becomes the sheet name. A page with no label is named after its file and page number, like &quot;Plans, page 3&quot;. With several PDFs open, labeled sheets also show the file name.\u003C/p\u003E\n\u003Ch2 id=\"the-sheet-middle\"\u003EThe sheet (middle)\u003C/h2\u003E\n\u003Cul\u003E\u003Cli\u003EThe bar under the sheet shows the sheet name and its scale, or &quot;No scale yet: pick a preset or calibrate&quot;. Its buttons: \u003Cspan class=\"hui\"\u003EMarkupCraft\u003C/span\u003E (when that app can take the PDF; see \u003Ca href=\"/tutorials/takeoffcraft/open-plan-set\" data-topic=\"takeoffcraft/open-plan-set\"\u003EStart a takeoff and open a plan set\u003C/a\u003E), \u003Cspan class=\"hui\"\u003ECompare\u003C/span\u003E (an older version of the sheet over this one: \u003Ca href=\"/tutorials/takeoffcraft/compare-revisions\" data-topic=\"takeoffcraft/compare-revisions\"\u003ECompare a revised sheet\u003C/a\u003E), &quot;(n) to check&quot; (flagged marks, when there are any) and \u003Cspan class=\"hui\"\u003E3D\u003C/span\u003E (the \u003Ca href=\"/tutorials/takeoffcraft/check-in-3d\" data-topic=\"takeoffcraft/check-in-3d\"\u003E3D check view\u003C/a\u003E).\u003C/li\u003E\u003Cli\u003EBefore any PDF is open, the middle shows a short five-step guide.\u003C/li\u003E\u003Cli\u003EThe wheel zooms at the pointer. Drag to pan. See \u003Ca href=\"/tutorials/takeoffcraft/keyboard\" data-topic=\"takeoffcraft/keyboard\"\u003EKeyboard and mouse\u003C/a\u003E.\u003C/li\u003E\u003Cli\u003EWhile you use \u003Cspan class=\"hui\"\u003EAuto count\u003C/span\u003E, a bar with its controls appears at the top of the sheet.\u003C/li\u003E\u003C/ul\u003E\n\u003Ch2 id=\"items-right\"\u003EItems (right)\u003C/h2\u003E\n\u003Cp\u003EAt the top, the \u003Cspan class=\"hui\"\u003EBid area\u003C/span\u003E list: the building, floor or phase new marks go in (\u003Ca href=\"/tutorials/takeoffcraft/bid-areas\" data-topic=\"takeoffcraft/bid-areas\"\u003EBid areas\u003C/a\u003E).\u003C/p\u003E\n\u003Cul\u003E\u003Cli\u003E\u003Cspan class=\"hui\"\u003ENew item\u003C/span\u003E opens a small form: a name, a type (\u003Cspan class=\"hui\"\u003ELinear (length)\u003C/span\u003E, \u003Cspan class=\"hui\"\u003EArea\u003C/span\u003E or \u003Cspan class=\"hui\"\u003ECount\u003C/span\u003E) and \u003Cspan class=\"hui\"\u003EAdd\u003C/span\u003E.\u003C/li\u003E\u003Cli\u003EThe list shows each item&#039;s color, type icon, name and quantity. Click an item to draw with it and highlight its marks on every sheet. Click it again to stop highlighting.\u003C/li\u003E\u003Cli\u003EUnder the list, \u003Cstrong\u003EItem: (name)\u003C/strong\u003E is the item editor: name, type, color, unit, height or depth, waste, material and labor rates, the measured values, and the \u003Cspan class=\"hui\"\u003EAssembly\u003C/span\u003E. See \u003Ca href=\"/tutorials/takeoffcraft/create-items\" data-topic=\"takeoffcraft/create-items\"\u003ECreate takeoff items\u003C/a\u003E.\u003C/li\u003E\u003Cli\u003E\u003Cstrong\u003ESelected mark\u003C/strong\u003E appears when you select a mark: which item it belongs to, its sheet, its measurements, and buttons such as \u003Cspan class=\"hui\"\u003EAdd a cut-out\u003C/span\u003E and \u003Cspan class=\"hui\"\u003EDelete mark\u003C/span\u003E. With several marks selected it becomes \u003Cstrong\u003ESelected marks\u003C/strong\u003E: how many of each item, and \u003Cspan class=\"hui\"\u003ECopy\u003C/span\u003E, \u003Cspan class=\"hui\"\u003EDuplicate\u003C/span\u003E, \u003Cspan class=\"hui\"\u003ECut\u003C/span\u003E and \u003Cspan class=\"hui\"\u003EDelete marks\u003C/span\u003E.\u003C/li\u003E\u003Cli\u003EThe item editor ends with \u003Cspan class=\"hui\"\u003ECopy item\u003C/span\u003E and \u003Cspan class=\"hui\"\u003EDuplicate item\u003C/span\u003E: an item with its assembly and costs, without marks. See \u003Ca href=\"/tutorials/takeoffcraft/copy-paste\" data-topic=\"takeoffcraft/copy-paste\"\u003ECopy, paste and duplicate marks\u003C/a\u003E.\u003C/li\u003E\u003C/ul\u003E\n\u003Ch2 id=\"quantities-bottom\"\u003EQuantities (bottom)\u003C/h2\u003E\n\u003Cul\u003E\u003Cli\u003E\u003Cspan class=\"hui\"\u003EBy item\u003C/span\u003E lists every item and its assembly components with quantity, waste, rates and extended costs. You can type waste and rates straight into the table.\u003C/li\u003E\u003Cli\u003E\u003Cspan class=\"hui\"\u003EBy sheet\u003C/span\u003E lists each item&#039;s quantity on each sheet.\u003C/li\u003E\u003Cli\u003EA warning starting with \u003Cstrong\u003EIncomplete:\u003C/strong\u003E appears when something is left out of the totals.\u003C/li\u003E\u003Cli\u003E\u003Cspan class=\"hui\"\u003EJob total\u003C/span\u003E is at the right of the header.\u003C/li\u003E\u003Cli\u003EThe arrow button at the far right hides or shows the table to give the sheet more room.\u003C/li\u003E\u003C/ul\u003E\n\u003Cp\u003ESee \u003Ca href=\"/tutorials/takeoffcraft/read-quantities\" data-topic=\"takeoffcraft/read-quantities\"\u003ERead quantities and the estimate\u003C/a\u003E.\u003C/p\u003E\n\u003Ch2 id=\"status-bar-bottom\"\u003EStatus bar (bottom)\u003C/h2\u003E\n\u003Cp\u003EFrom left to right: the live measurement while you draw (length, area, radius or a check result), the \u003Cspan class=\"hui\"\u003EType\u003C/span\u003E box while you type a length, messages from TakeoffDesk, the reminder &quot;Shift snaps to 45°&quot; (or &quot;Snaps to 45°; Shift frees the angle&quot; when that is on in \u003Ca href=\"/tutorials/takeoffcraft/settings\" data-topic=\"takeoffcraft/settings\"\u003ESettings\u003C/a\u003E), the \u003Cspan class=\"hui\"\u003ESnap\u003C/span\u003E button (snapping to the drawing&#039;s lines, on when highlighted; \u003Ckbd class=\"hk\"\u003E\u003Cspan class=\"k-mac\" title=\"F3\"\u003EF3\u003C/span\u003E\u003Cspan class=\"k-pc\"\u003EF3\u003C/span\u003E\u003C/kbd\u003E), and the zoom percentage.\u003C/p\u003E\n\u003Caside class=\"hc hc-tip\"\u003E\u003Cp class=\"hc-label\"\u003ETip\u003C/p\u003E\n\u003Cp\u003ERead the status bar when something does not happen. TakeoffDesk explains there why it refused a click, for example &quot;This sheet has no scale yet&quot;.\u003C/p\u003E\n\u003C/aside\u003E\n\u003Ch2 id=\"other-layouts\"\u003EOther layouts\u003C/h2\u003E\n\u003Cp\u003EEverything above is the \u003Cspan class=\"hui\"\u003ETakeoffDesk classic\u003C/span\u003E layout, the start. \u003Cspan class=\"hui\"\u003ESettings\u003C/span\u003E (\u003Ckbd class=\"hk\"\u003E\u003Cspan class=\"k-mac\" title=\"Command ,\"\u003E⌘,\u003C/span\u003E\u003Cspan class=\"k-pc\"\u003ECtrl+,\u003C/span\u003E\u003C/kbd\u003E) › \u003Cspan class=\"hui\"\u003EGlobal\u003C/span\u003E › \u003Cspan class=\"hui\"\u003ELayout\u003C/span\u003E offers two more; the same tools and keys work in all three, and picking \u003Cspan class=\"hui\"\u003ETakeoffDesk classic\u003C/span\u003E again puts every control back where it was.\u003C/p\u003E\n\u003Cdiv class=\"ht-wrap\"\u003E\u003Ctable class=\"ht\"\u003E\u003Cthead\u003E\u003Ctr\u003E\u003Cth scope=\"col\"\u003ELayout\u003C/th\u003E\u003Cth scope=\"col\"\u003EIn TakeoffDesk\u003C/th\u003E\u003C/tr\u003E\u003C/thead\u003E\u003Ctbody\u003E\u003Ctr\u003E\u003Ctd\u003E\u003Cspan class=\"hui\"\u003ERibbon and project browser\u003C/span\u003E\u003C/td\u003E\u003Ctd\u003EThe \u003Cspan class=\"hui\"\u003ETakeoff ribbon\u003C/span\u003E across the top (\u003Ca href=\"/tutorials/takeoffcraft/menus-keys-and-mouse\" data-topic=\"takeoffcraft/menus-keys-and-mouse\"\u003EMenus, keys and mouse\u003C/a\u003E), a bar for the running tool, a tab for each sheet you open (a drawing&#039;s Model and layouts are sheets too) with the scale presets and \u003Cspan class=\"hui\"\u003EFit page\u003C/span\u003E under the sheet. The left panel holds \u003Cspan class=\"hui\"\u003EProperties\u003C/span\u003E (the selected item, note or mark) over the \u003Cspan class=\"hui\"\u003ETakeoff browser\u003C/span\u003E: \u003Cspan class=\"hui\"\u003ESheets\u003C/span\u003E (click one to open it in a tab), \u003Cspan class=\"hui\"\u003EConditions\u003C/span\u003E (click one to draw with it) and \u003Cspan class=\"hui\"\u003EEstimate\u003C/span\u003E (each item&#039;s total and the job total); the thumbnails are its second tab.\u003C/td\u003E\u003C/tr\u003E\u003Ctr\u003E\u003Ctd\u003E\u003Cspan class=\"hui\"\u003EToolbox and info box\u003C/span\u003E\u003C/td\u003E\u003Ctd\u003EThe toolbar over the sheet, an info box with the \u003Cspan class=\"hui\"\u003EBid area\u003C/span\u003E, the running tool or the selection and the sheet bar, a column of the takeoff tools on the left, a tab for every sheet, and \u003Cspan class=\"hui\"\u003ESnap\u003C/span\u003E and the zoom under the sheet.\u003C/td\u003E\u003C/tr\u003E\u003C/tbody\u003E\u003C/table\u003E\u003C/div\u003E\n\u003Cp\u003EWhile the \u003Ca href=\"/tutorials/takeoffcraft/check-in-3d\" data-topic=\"takeoffcraft/check-in-3d\"\u003E3D check view\u003C/a\u003E is open, the sheet tabs and the bar under the sheet step aside; close the 3D view to measure again. On a phone the phone layout always runs.\u003C/p\u003E\n\u003Ch2 id=\"full-screen-and-themes\"\u003EFull screen and themes\u003C/h2\u003E\n\u003Cp\u003EThe \u003Cspan class=\"hui\"\u003EFull screen\u003C/span\u003E button in the app bar, or \u003Ckbd class=\"hk\"\u003E\u003Cspan class=\"k-mac\" title=\"Control Shift F\"\u003E⌃⇧F\u003C/span\u003E\u003Cspan class=\"k-pc\"\u003ECtrl+Shift+F\u003C/span\u003E\u003C/kbd\u003E (Control on every platform, also on a Mac), cycles through normal, full screen, and full screen with the bars hidden. With the bars hidden, move the pointer to the top edge to show them again.\u003C/p\u003E\n\u003Cp\u003E\u003Cspan class=\"hui\"\u003EPaper\u003C/span\u003E is the light theme and \u003Cspan class=\"hui\"\u003EModel\u003C/span\u003E the dark one. In \u003Cspan class=\"hui\"\u003EModel\u003C/span\u003E the drawing is shown inverted (light lines on dark) on screen only; exports are never changed.\u003C/p\u003E","text":"TakeoffDesk fills the browser window under the app bar. From top to bottom and left to right: Part Where What it is for App bar Very top The app name, the version, About TakeoffDesk, Help (F1), Save for offline, Settings (Ctrl+,), the Full screen button and the Paper / Model theme switch. Toolbar Under the app bar Every command, in groups: File, Export, Scale, Takeoff, Edit, View. Sheets Left Every page of every open PDF, with a thumbnail, its scale and its mark count. The sheet Middle The open page. You measure here. Items Right Your takeoff items, the selected item's settings, and the selected mark. Quantities Bottom Quantities and costs by item or by sheet, and the job total. Status bar Very bottom The live measurement, messages, the 45° hint and the zoom. The toolbar Hover over any button to see what it does and its key. Group Buttons File New (empty takeoff), Open PDFs (Ctrl+O), Open takeoff (a .takeoff.json project), Save takeoff (Ctrl+S) Export One menu: XLSX, CSV, Marked PDF Scale Calibrate (K), Check (D), and the Preset list Takeoff Select (V), Linear (L), Area (A), Circle (O), Arc (R, an on/off switch), Deduct (E, an on/off switch), Cut-out (X), Count (C), Auto count (S) Edit Undo (Ctrl+Z), Redo (Ctrl+Y), Copy (Ctrl+C), Paste (Ctrl+V), and More: Cut, Copy, Paste, Paste in place, Duplicate, Delete, Select all, Select none View Fit page (F), Fit width (W) The tool you are using is shown pressed. The Arc and Deduct buttons stay pressed while they are on. Sheets (left) Search sheets filters the list by sheet name, file name or page label. Each sheet shows a thumbnail (drawn as you scroll), its name, and either its scale or No scale. The right side of each row shows how many marks the sheet has. While an item is highlighted, it shows how many of that item's marks are on the sheet instead. Click a sheet to open it. Page Down and Page Up move to the next and previous sheet in the list. When a takeoff covers PDFs that are not open, a note under the list names them. See Save and reopen a takeoff. Sheet names come from the PDF: a page label such as A-101 becomes the sheet name. A page with no label is named after its file and page number, like \"Plans, page 3\". With several PDFs open, labeled sheets also show the file name. The sheet (middle) The bar under the sheet shows the sheet name and its scale, or \"No scale yet: pick a preset or calibrate\". Its buttons: MarkupCraft (when that app can take the PDF; see Start a takeoff and open a plan set), Compare (an older version of the sheet over this one: Compare a revised sheet), \"(n) to check\" (flagged marks, when there are any) and 3D (the 3D check view). Before any PDF is open, the middle shows a short five-step guide. The wheel zooms at the pointer. Drag to pan. See Keyboard and mouse. While you use Auto count, a bar with its controls appears at the top of the sheet. Items (right) At the top, the Bid area list: the building, floor or phase new marks go in (Bid areas). New item opens a small form: a name, a type (Linear (length), Area or Count) and Add. The list shows each item's color, type icon, name and quantity. Click an item to draw with it and highlight its marks on every sheet. Click it again to stop highlighting. Under the list, Item: (name) is the item editor: name, type, color, unit, height or depth, waste, material and labor rates, the measured values, and the Assembly. See Create takeoff items. Selected mark appears when you select a mark: which item it belongs to, its sheet, its measurements, and buttons such as Add a cut-out and Delete mark. With several marks selected it becomes Selected marks: how many of each item, and Copy, Duplicate, Cut and Delete marks. The item editor ends with Copy item and Duplicate item: an item with its assembly and costs, without marks. See Copy, paste and duplicate marks. Quantities (bottom) By item lists every item and its assembly components with quantity, waste, rates and extended costs. You can type waste and rates straight into the table. By sheet lists each item's quantity on each sheet. A warning starting with Incomplete: appears when something is left out of the totals. Job total is at the right of the header. The arrow button at the far right hides or shows the table to give the sheet more room. See Read quantities and the estimate. Status bar (bottom) From left to right: the live measurement while you draw (length, area, radius or a check result), the Type box while you type a length, messages from TakeoffDesk, the reminder \"Shift snaps to 45°\" (or \"Snaps to 45°; Shift frees the angle\" when that is on in Settings), the Snap button (snapping to the drawing's lines, on when highlighted; F3), and the zoom percentage. Read the status bar when something does not happen. TakeoffDesk explains there why it refused a click, for example \"This sheet has no scale yet\". Other layouts Everything above is the TakeoffDesk classic layout, the start. Settings (Ctrl+,) › Global › Layout offers two more; the same tools and keys work in all three, and picking TakeoffDesk classic again puts every control back where it was. Layout In TakeoffDesk Ribbon and project browser The Takeoff ribbon across the top (Menus, keys and mouse), a bar for the running tool, a tab for each sheet you open (a drawing's Model and layouts are sheets too) with the scale presets and Fit page under the sheet. The left panel holds Properties (the selected item, note or mark) over the Takeoff browser: Sheets (click one to open it in a tab), Conditions (click one to draw with it) and Estimate (each item's total and the job total); the thumbnails are its second tab. Toolbox and info box The toolbar over the sheet, an info box with the Bid area, the running tool or the selection and the sheet bar, a column of the takeoff tools on the left, a tab for every sheet, and Snap and the zoom under the sheet. While the 3D check view is open, the sheet tabs and the bar under the sheet step aside; close the 3D view to measure again. On a phone the phone layout always runs. Full screen and themes The Full screen button in the app bar, or Ctrl+Shift+F (Control on every platform, also on a Mac), cycles through normal, full screen, and full screen with the bars hidden. With the bars hidden, move the pointer to the top edge to show them again. Paper is the light theme and Model the dark one. In Model the drawing is shown inverted (light lines on dark) on screen only; exports are never changed.","lang":"en"},{"slug":"files","scope":"takeoffcraft","title":"Files TakeoffDesk opens and saves","summary":"PDFs in, a takeoff project file, spreadsheets and marked PDFs out - what each holds, where it goes, and what changes online, offline and between browsers.","section":"start","order":30,"keywords":["files","formats","pdf","takeoff.json","project file","xlsx","csv","marked pdf","download","save","open","offline"],"headings":[{"id":"what-it-opens","text":"What it opens","level":2},{"id":"what-it-saves","text":"What it saves","level":2},{"id":"where-downloads-go","text":"Where downloads go","level":2},{"id":"why-the-project-file-and-the-pdfs-are-separate","text":"Why the project file and the PDFs are separate","level":2},{"id":"online-and-offline","text":"Online and offline","level":2},{"id":"spreadsheets","text":"Spreadsheets","level":2},{"id":"desktop-and-cloud","text":"Desktop and cloud","level":2}],"html":"\u003Ch2 id=\"what-it-opens\"\u003EWhat it opens\u003C/h2\u003E\n\u003Cdiv class=\"ht-wrap\"\u003E\u003Ctable class=\"ht\"\u003E\u003Cthead\u003E\u003Ctr\u003E\u003Cth scope=\"col\"\u003EFile\u003C/th\u003E\u003Cth scope=\"col\"\u003EHow\u003C/th\u003E\u003Cth scope=\"col\"\u003ENotes\u003C/th\u003E\u003C/tr\u003E\u003C/thead\u003E\u003Ctbody\u003E\u003Ctr\u003E\u003Ctd\u003EPDF (\u003Ccode\u003E.pdf\u003C/code\u003E)\u003C/td\u003E\u003Ctd\u003E\u003Cspan class=\"hui\"\u003EOpen plans\u003C/span\u003E, \u003Ckbd class=\"hk\"\u003E\u003Cspan class=\"k-mac\" title=\"Command O\"\u003E⌘O\u003C/span\u003E\u003Cspan class=\"k-pc\"\u003ECtrl+O\u003C/span\u003E\u003C/kbd\u003E, or drop on the page\u003C/td\u003E\u003Ctd\u003ESeveral at once. Each page becomes a sheet.\u003C/td\u003E\u003C/tr\u003E\u003Ctr\u003E\u003Ctd\u003ETakeoff project (\u003Ccode\u003E.takeoff.json\u003C/code\u003E)\u003C/td\u003E\u003Ctd\u003E\u003Cspan class=\"hui\"\u003EOpen takeoff\u003C/span\u003E, or drop on the page\u003C/td\u003E\u003Ctd\u003EYour items, scales and marks. You can drop it together with its PDFs.\u003C/td\u003E\u003C/tr\u003E\u003C/tbody\u003E\u003C/table\u003E\u003C/div\u003E\n\u003Cp\u003EOther files dropped on the page are skipped, and the status bar names them.\u003C/p\u003E\n\u003Cul\u003E\u003Cli\u003E\u003Cstrong\u003EPassword-protected PDFs\u003C/strong\u003E do not open: &quot;(name) is password-protected. Open an unprotected copy.&quot;\u003C/li\u003E\u003Cli\u003E\u003Cstrong\u003EThe same PDF twice\u003C/strong\u003E is opened once: &quot;(name) is already open.&quot; TakeoffDesk knows files by their contents, not their names.\u003C/li\u003E\u003Cli\u003E\u003Cstrong\u003EScanned PDFs\u003C/strong\u003E open and measure like any other; TakeoffDesk does not need the text in the PDF.\u003C/li\u003E\u003Cli\u003E\u003Cstrong\u003ELarge plan sets\u003C/strong\u003E: every PDF is read in full when it opens (to fingerprint it), so a very large file takes a moment. Thumbnails are drawn one at a time as you scroll.\u003C/li\u003E\u003C/ul\u003E\n\u003Ch2 id=\"what-it-saves\"\u003EWhat it saves\u003C/h2\u003E\n\u003Cp\u003EEvery save is a download. Nothing is written back into your PDFs.\u003C/p\u003E\n\u003Cdiv class=\"ht-wrap\"\u003E\u003Ctable class=\"ht\"\u003E\u003Cthead\u003E\u003Ctr\u003E\u003Cth scope=\"col\"\u003EYou choose\u003C/th\u003E\u003Cth scope=\"col\"\u003EYou get\u003C/th\u003E\u003Cth scope=\"col\"\u003EWhat is in it\u003C/th\u003E\u003C/tr\u003E\u003C/thead\u003E\u003Ctbody\u003E\u003Ctr\u003E\u003Ctd\u003E\u003Cspan class=\"hui\"\u003ESave takeoff\u003C/span\u003E\u003C/td\u003E\u003Ctd\u003E\u003Ccode\u003E(name).takeoff.json\u003C/code\u003E\u003C/td\u003E\u003Ctd\u003EItems, assemblies, rates, sheet scales and every mark, keyed to each PDF by its contents. No PDF pages.\u003C/td\u003E\u003C/tr\u003E\u003Ctr\u003E\u003Ctd\u003E\u003Cspan class=\"hui\"\u003EXLSX\u003C/span\u003E\u003C/td\u003E\u003Ctd\u003E\u003Ccode\u003E(name).xlsx\u003C/code\u003E\u003C/td\u003E\u003Ctd\u003EFour worksheets: Estimate (with live formulas), By sheet, Marks, Scales.\u003C/td\u003E\u003C/tr\u003E\u003Ctr\u003E\u003Ctd\u003E\u003Cspan class=\"hui\"\u003ECSV\u003C/span\u003E\u003C/td\u003E\u003Ctd\u003E\u003Ccode\u003E(name).csv\u003C/code\u003E\u003C/td\u003E\u003Ctd\u003EThe estimate as plain values, one row per item and component.\u003C/td\u003E\u003C/tr\u003E\u003Ctr\u003E\u003Ctd\u003E\u003Cspan class=\"hui\"\u003EMarked PDF\u003C/span\u003E\u003C/td\u003E\u003Ctd\u003E\u003Ccode\u003E(PDF name) (takeoff).pdf\u003C/code\u003E\u003C/td\u003E\u003Ctd\u003EA copy of each open PDF that has marks, with the takeoff drawn on its pages and a legend. One file per PDF.\u003C/td\u003E\u003C/tr\u003E\u003C/tbody\u003E\u003C/table\u003E\u003C/div\u003E\n\u003Cp\u003EThe name is taken from the first PDF you opened in this takeoff. There is no rename box yet: rename the downloaded file if you want another name.\u003C/p\u003E\n\u003Cp\u003ESee \u003Ca href=\"/tutorials/takeoffcraft/export-estimate\" data-topic=\"takeoffcraft/export-estimate\"\u003EExport the estimate and a marked PDF\u003C/a\u003E and \u003Ca href=\"/tutorials/takeoffcraft/export-columns\" data-topic=\"takeoffcraft/export-columns\"\u003EExport columns\u003C/a\u003E.\u003C/p\u003E\n\u003Ch2 id=\"where-downloads-go\"\u003EWhere downloads go\u003C/h2\u003E\n\u003Cp\u003EYour browser saves them where it saves every download, usually the Downloads folder. Find it in \u003Cspan class=\"hp\"\u003E\u003Cspan class=\"hpv\" data-v=\"os:mac\" title=\"Mac\"\u003EFinder\u003C/span\u003E\u003Cspan class=\"hp-sep\"\u003E / \u003C/span\u003E\u003Cspan class=\"hpv\" data-v=\"os:windows\" title=\"Windows\"\u003EFile Explorer\u003C/span\u003E\u003Cspan class=\"hp-sep\"\u003E / \u003C/span\u003E\u003Cspan class=\"hpv\" data-v=\"os:linux\" title=\"Linux\"\u003Eyour file manager\u003C/span\u003E\u003C/span\u003E. If your browser is set to ask where to save each file, it asks.\u003C/p\u003E\n\u003Cdiv class=\"hv\" data-v=\"browser:chromium\"\u003E\u003Cp class=\"hv-label\"\u003EChrome or Edge\u003C/p\u003E\n\u003Cp\u003E\u003Cspan class=\"hui\"\u003EMarked PDF\u003C/span\u003E with several marked PDFs downloads several files at once. Chrome and Edge may ask once whether this site may download multiple files. Choose Allow.\u003C/p\u003E\n\u003C/div\u003E\n\u003Cdiv class=\"hv\" data-v=\"browser:safari\"\u003E\u003Cp class=\"hv-label\"\u003ESafari\u003C/p\u003E\n\u003Cp\u003ESafari saves to Downloads unless you changed the download location in Safari Settings, under General.\u003C/p\u003E\n\u003C/div\u003E\n\u003Ch2 id=\"why-the-project-file-and-the-pdfs-are-separate\"\u003EWhy the project file and the PDFs are separate\u003C/h2\u003E\n\u003Cp\u003EThe \u003Ccode\u003E.takeoff.json\u003C/code\u003E file holds only your takeoff. It finds its PDFs again by their contents (a fingerprint of each file), so:\u003C/p\u003E\n\u003Cul\u003E\u003Cli\u003ERenaming or moving a PDF does not matter.\u003C/li\u003E\u003Cli\u003EA PDF that was changed or saved again by another program counts as a different file, even with the same name.\u003C/li\u003E\u003Cli\u003EMarks on PDFs that are not open still count in the totals.\u003C/li\u003E\u003C/ul\u003E\n\u003Cp\u003ESee \u003Ca href=\"/tutorials/takeoffcraft/save-and-reopen\" data-topic=\"takeoffcraft/save-and-reopen\"\u003ESave and reopen a takeoff\u003C/a\u003E.\u003C/p\u003E\n\u003Ch2 id=\"online-and-offline\"\u003EOnline and offline\u003C/h2\u003E\n\u003Cp\u003EYour PDFs and takeoffs never leave your computer, online or offline. The connection matters only for loading TakeoffDesk itself.\u003C/p\u003E\n\u003Cp\u003ETo work with no connection, save the app first, while you are online:\u003C/p\u003E\n\u003Col\u003E\u003Cli\u003EChoose \u003Cspan class=\"hui\"\u003ESave for offline\u003C/span\u003E in the app bar at the top. The button counts up, &quot;Saving 12 of 40&quot;, while it saves.\u003C/li\u003E\u003Cli\u003EWait for \u003Cspan class=\"hui\"\u003EOffline ready\u003C/span\u003E.\u003C/li\u003E\u003C/ol\u003E\n\u003Cp\u003ESaving TakeoffDesk keeps the app, this help, the PDF reader, the PDF writer used by \u003Cspan class=\"hui\"\u003EMarked PDF\u003C/span\u003E and the auto count worker in your browser, about 6 MB. Once it says \u003Cspan class=\"hui\"\u003EOffline ready\u003C/span\u003E, everything works offline: opening PDFs, measuring, \u003Cspan class=\"hui\"\u003EAuto count\u003C/span\u003E, \u003Cspan class=\"hui\"\u003ESave takeoff\u003C/span\u003E, \u003Cspan class=\"hui\"\u003EXLSX\u003C/span\u003E, \u003Cspan class=\"hui\"\u003ECSV\u003C/span\u003E and \u003Cspan class=\"hui\"\u003EMarked PDF\u003C/span\u003E.\u003C/p\u003E\n\u003Cdiv class=\"ht-wrap\"\u003E\u003Ctable class=\"ht\"\u003E\u003Cthead\u003E\u003Ctr\u003E\u003Cth scope=\"col\"\u003EThe button says\u003C/th\u003E\u003Cth scope=\"col\"\u003EMeaning\u003C/th\u003E\u003C/tr\u003E\u003C/thead\u003E\u003Ctbody\u003E\u003Ctr\u003E\u003Ctd\u003E\u003Cspan class=\"hui\"\u003ESave for offline\u003C/span\u003E\u003C/td\u003E\u003Ctd\u003ENot saved in this browser yet. Choose it to save.\u003C/td\u003E\u003C/tr\u003E\u003Ctr\u003E\u003Ctd\u003ESaving (n) of (m)\u003C/td\u003E\u003Ctd\u003ESaving now.\u003C/td\u003E\u003C/tr\u003E\u003Ctr\u003E\u003Ctd\u003E\u003Cspan class=\"hui\"\u003EOffline ready\u003C/span\u003E\u003C/td\u003E\u003Ctd\u003ESaved. Choose it for \u003Cspan class=\"hui\"\u003ESave again (get the newest version)\u003C/span\u003E or \u003Cspan class=\"hui\"\u003ERemove the offline copy\u003C/span\u003E.\u003C/td\u003E\u003C/tr\u003E\u003Ctr\u003E\u003Ctd\u003E\u003Cspan class=\"hui\"\u003ECould not save\u003C/span\u003E\u003C/td\u003E\u003Ctd\u003ESome files did not download. Check your connection and choose it again.\u003C/td\u003E\u003C/tr\u003E\u003Ctr\u003E\u003Ctd\u003E\u003Cspan class=\"hui\"\u003EOffline not available\u003C/span\u003E\u003C/td\u003E\u003Ctd\u003EThis browser window cannot keep an offline copy (private windows and some managed computers block it).\u003C/td\u003E\u003C/tr\u003E\u003C/tbody\u003E\u003C/table\u003E\u003C/div\u003E\n\u003Cp\u003EMore, including how long a saved copy lasts in each browser: \u003Ca href=\"/tutorials/basics/offline\" data-topic=\"basics/offline\"\u003EWorking offline\u003C/a\u003E.\u003C/p\u003E\n\u003Cdiv class=\"hv\" data-v=\"net:offline\"\u003E\u003Cp class=\"hv-label\"\u003EOffline\u003C/p\u003E\n\u003Cp\u003EYou are offline. If the app bar shows \u003Cspan class=\"hui\"\u003EOffline ready\u003C/span\u003E, everything works. If it does not, the parts TakeoffDesk has not loaded yet in this tab (the PDF writer for \u003Cspan class=\"hui\"\u003EMarked PDF\u003C/span\u003E, the auto count worker) cannot load now, and \u003Cspan class=\"hui\"\u003EMarked PDF\u003C/span\u003E stops with &quot;The marked PDF could not be written&quot;. Your takeoff is safe either way: \u003Cspan class=\"hui\"\u003ESave takeoff\u003C/span\u003E, \u003Cspan class=\"hui\"\u003EXLSX\u003C/span\u003E and \u003Cspan class=\"hui\"\u003ECSV\u003C/span\u003E need no connection. Do not reload the tab until you are online again.\u003C/p\u003E\n\u003C/div\u003E\n\u003Cdiv class=\"hv\" data-v=\"net:online\"\u003E\u003Cp class=\"hv-label\"\u003EOnline\u003C/p\u003E\n\u003Cp\u003EYou are online. Before a site visit or a flight, choose \u003Cspan class=\"hui\"\u003ESave for offline\u003C/span\u003E and wait for \u003Cspan class=\"hui\"\u003EOffline ready\u003C/span\u003E.\u003C/p\u003E\n\u003C/div\u003E\n\u003Ch2 id=\"spreadsheets\"\u003ESpreadsheets\u003C/h2\u003E\n\u003Cp\u003EThe XLSX keeps live formulas, so a spreadsheet program recalculates the estimate when it opens the file and keeps it right when you change a rate or waste there. The workbook has been checked in LibreOffice Calc, which recalculated every total to the same cent. It has not been opened in Excel yet.\u003C/p\u003E\n\u003Cp\u003EThe CSV is plain values with a byte order mark, so spreadsheet programs read characters such as m² correctly.\u003C/p\u003E\n\u003Ch2 id=\"desktop-and-cloud\"\u003EDesktop and cloud\u003C/h2\u003E\n\u003Cdiv class=\"hv\" data-v=\"shell:desktop\"\u003E\u003Cp class=\"hv-label\"\u003EDesktop app\u003C/p\u003E\n\u003Cp\u003ETakeoffDesk runs in the browser; there is no installer.\u003C/p\u003E\n\u003C/div\u003E\n\u003Cp\u003ECloud saving is not available yet. Keep your \u003Ccode\u003E.takeoff.json\u003C/code\u003E files with the job&#039;s PDFs, and back them up like any other file. See \u003Ca href=\"/tutorials/basics/your-files\" data-topic=\"basics/your-files\"\u003EWhere your files go\u003C/a\u003E.\u003C/p\u003E","text":"What it opens File How Notes PDF (.pdf) Open plans, Ctrl+O, or drop on the page Several at once. Each page becomes a sheet. Takeoff project (.takeoff.json) Open takeoff, or drop on the page Your items, scales and marks. You can drop it together with its PDFs. Other files dropped on the page are skipped, and the status bar names them. Password-protected PDFs do not open: \"(name) is password-protected. Open an unprotected copy.\" The same PDF twice is opened once: \"(name) is already open.\" TakeoffDesk knows files by their contents, not their names. Scanned PDFs open and measure like any other; TakeoffDesk does not need the text in the PDF. Large plan sets: every PDF is read in full when it opens (to fingerprint it), so a very large file takes a moment. Thumbnails are drawn one at a time as you scroll. What it saves Every save is a download. Nothing is written back into your PDFs. You choose You get What is in it Save takeoff (name).takeoff.json Items, assemblies, rates, sheet scales and every mark, keyed to each PDF by its contents. No PDF pages. XLSX (name).xlsx Four worksheets: Estimate (with live formulas), By sheet, Marks, Scales. CSV (name).csv The estimate as plain values, one row per item and component. Marked PDF (PDF name) (takeoff).pdf A copy of each open PDF that has marks, with the takeoff drawn on its pages and a legend. One file per PDF. The name is taken from the first PDF you opened in this takeoff. There is no rename box yet: rename the downloaded file if you want another name. See Export the estimate and a marked PDF and Export columns. Where downloads go Your browser saves them where it saves every download, usually the Downloads folder. Find it in Finder / File Explorer / your file manager. If your browser is set to ask where to save each file, it asks. Marked PDF with several marked PDFs downloads several files at once. Chrome and Edge may ask once whether this site may download multiple files. Choose Allow. Safari saves to Downloads unless you changed the download location in Safari Settings, under General. Why the project file and the PDFs are separate The .takeoff.json file holds only your takeoff. It finds its PDFs again by their contents (a fingerprint of each file), so: Renaming or moving a PDF does not matter. A PDF that was changed or saved again by another program counts as a different file, even with the same name. Marks on PDFs that are not open still count in the totals. See Save and reopen a takeoff. Online and offline Your PDFs and takeoffs never leave your computer, online or offline. The connection matters only for loading TakeoffDesk itself. To work with no connection, save the app first, while you are online: Choose Save for offline in the app bar at the top. The button counts up, \"Saving 12 of 40\", while it saves. Wait for Offline ready. Saving TakeoffDesk keeps the app, this help, the PDF reader, the PDF writer used by Marked PDF and the auto count worker in your browser, about 6 MB. Once it says Offline ready, everything works offline: opening PDFs, measuring, Auto count, Save takeoff, XLSX, CSV and Marked PDF. The button says Meaning Save for offline Not saved in this browser yet. Choose it to save. Saving (n) of (m) Saving now. Offline ready Saved. Choose it for Save again (get the newest version) or Remove the offline copy. Could not save Some files did not download. Check your connection and choose it again. Offline not available This browser window cannot keep an offline copy (private windows and some managed computers block it). More, including how long a saved copy lasts in each browser: Working offline. You are offline. If the app bar shows Offline ready, everything works. If it does not, the parts TakeoffDesk has not loaded yet in this tab (the PDF writer for Marked PDF, the auto count worker) cannot load now, and Marked PDF stops with \"The marked PDF could not be written\". Your takeoff is safe either way: Save takeoff, XLSX and CSV need no connection. Do not reload the tab until you are online again. You are online. Before a site visit or a flight, choose Save for offline and wait for Offline ready. Spreadsheets The XLSX keeps live formulas, so a spreadsheet program recalculates the estimate when it opens the file and keeps it right when you change a rate or waste there. The workbook has been checked in LibreOffice Calc, which recalculated every total to the same cent. It has not been opened in Excel yet. The CSV is plain values with a byte order mark, so spreadsheet programs read characters such as m² correctly. Desktop and cloud TakeoffDesk runs in the browser; there is no installer. Cloud saving is not available yet. Keep your .takeoff.json files with the job's PDFs, and back them up like any other file. See Where your files go.","lang":"en"},{"slug":"open-plan-set","scope":"takeoffcraft","title":"\"Počnite predmjer i otvorite skup nacrta\"","summary":"\"Otvorite jedan ili više PDF-ova kao skup nacrta, snađite se među listovima i prelazite između njih.\"","section":"tasks","order":10,"keywords":["\"otvori","skup nacrta","više pdf-ova","više datoteka","listovi","crteži","oznake stranica","popis listova","navigacija","ispuštanje","predaja","otvori u drugoj aplikaciji","označavanje\""],"headings":[{"id":"otvorite-pdf-ove","text":"Otvorite PDF-ove","level":2},{"id":"crte-i-uz-pdf-ove","text":"Crteži uz PDF-ove","level":2},{"id":"pdf-predan-iz-druge-aplikacije","text":"PDF predan iz druge aplikacije","level":2},{"id":"prona-ite-list","text":"Pronađite list","level":2},{"id":"kako-se-listovi-imenuju","text":"Kako se listovi imenuju","level":2},{"id":"razgledajte-list","text":"Razgledajte list","level":2},{"id":"dalje","text":"Dalje","level":2}],"html":"\u003Cp\u003ESkup nacrta često je nekoliko PDF-ova: arhitektonski, konstrukcijski, strojarski. TakeoffDesk ih otvara jedan uz drugi kao jedan popis listova, a jedan predmjer može obuhvatiti sve njih.\u003C/p\u003E\n\u003Ch2 id=\"otvorite-pdf-ove\"\u003EOtvorite PDF-ove\u003C/h2\u003E\n\u003Col\u003E\u003Cli\u003EOdaberite \u003Cspan class=\"hui\"\u003EOtvori nacrte\u003C/span\u003E u grupi \u003Cspan class=\"hui\"\u003EDatoteka\u003C/span\u003E ili pritisnite \u003Ckbd class=\"hk\"\u003E\u003Cspan class=\"k-mac\" title=\"Command O\"\u003E⌘O\u003C/span\u003E\u003Cspan class=\"k-pc\"\u003ECtrl+O\u003C/span\u003E\u003C/kbd\u003E. (Drugi stilovi izbornika to zovu \u003Cspan class=\"hui\"\u003EOtvori PDF-ove…\u003C/span\u003E.)\u003C/li\u003E\u003Cli\u003EU dijaloškom okviru datoteka odaberite svaki PDF iz skupa. Držite \u003Cspan class=\"hp\"\u003E\u003Cspan class=\"hpv\" data-v=\"os:mac\" title=\"Mac\"\u003ECommand\u003C/span\u003E\u003Cspan class=\"hp-sep\"\u003E / \u003C/span\u003E\u003Cspan class=\"hpv\" data-v=\"os:windows\" title=\"Windows\"\u003ECtrl\u003C/span\u003E\u003Cspan class=\"hp-sep\"\u003E / \u003C/span\u003E\u003Cspan class=\"hpv\" data-v=\"os:linux\" title=\"Linux\"\u003ECtrl\u003C/span\u003E\u003C/span\u003E za odabir više, ili \u003Ckbd class=\"hk\"\u003E\u003Cspan class=\"k-mac\" title=\"Shift\"\u003E⇧\u003C/span\u003E\u003Cspan class=\"k-pc\"\u003EShift\u003C/span\u003E\u003C/kbd\u003E za odabir raspona.\u003C/li\u003E\u003Cli\u003EOdaberite Otvori. Dok se svaka datoteka čita, prikazuje se poruka „Otvaranje (name)…“. Zatim se svaka stranica pojavi pod \u003Cspan class=\"hui\"\u003EListovi\u003C/span\u003E, a otvara se prva stranica prvog novog PDF-a.\u003C/li\u003E\u003C/ol\u003E\n\u003Cp\u003EPDF-ove možete povući i iz \u003Cspan class=\"hp\"\u003E\u003Cspan class=\"hpv\" data-v=\"os:mac\" title=\"Mac\"\u003EFinder\u003C/span\u003E\u003Cspan class=\"hp-sep\"\u003E / \u003C/span\u003E\u003Cspan class=\"hpv\" data-v=\"os:windows\" title=\"Windows\"\u003EIstraživač datoteka\u003C/span\u003E\u003Cspan class=\"hp-sep\"\u003E / \u003C/span\u003E\u003Cspan class=\"hpv\" data-v=\"os:linux\" title=\"Linux\"\u003Evašeg upravitelja datoteka\u003C/span\u003E\u003C/span\u003E i ispustiti bilo gdje na TakeoffDesk. Dok povlačite, pojavljuje se okvir „Ispustite PDF-ove, DWG ili DXF crteže ili .takeoff.json“.\u003C/p\u003E\n\u003Cp\u003EDa dodate još PDF-ova kasnije, ponovite isto. PDF-ovi koji su već otvoreni se preskaču.\u003C/p\u003E\n\u003Cp\u003EPočetni zaslon također navodi PDF-ove i predmjere koje ste nedavno otvorili, u preglednicima koji dopuštaju stranici ponovno otvoriti datoteku (Chrome i Edge). Kliknite jedan da ga otvorite; preglednik možda najprije traži dopuštenje. Vidi \u003Ca href=\"/tutorials/basics/your-files\" data-topic=\"basics/your-files\"\u003EVaše datoteke\u003C/a\u003E.\u003C/p\u003E\n\u003Caside class=\"hc hc-note\"\u003E\u003Cp class=\"hc-label\"\u003ENote\u003C/p\u003E\n\u003Cp\u003ENišta se ne učitava na poslužitelj. Preglednik čita PDF-ove na vašem računalu, a oni nestaju iz TakeoffDeska kad zatvorite karticu ili odaberete \u003Cspan class=\"hui\"\u003ENovo\u003C/span\u003E.\u003C/p\u003E\n\u003C/aside\u003E\n\u003Ch2 id=\"crte-i-uz-pdf-ove\"\u003ECrteži uz PDF-ove\u003C/h2\u003E\n\u003Cp\u003E\u003Cspan class=\"hui\"\u003EOtvori nacrte\u003C/span\u003E prihvaća i DWG i DXF crteže, sami ili zajedno s PDF-ovima: prostor modela i layouti svakog crteža postaju listovi na istom popisu. Vidi \u003Ca href=\"/tutorials/takeoffcraft/open-a-drawing\" data-topic=\"takeoffcraft/open-a-drawing\"\u003EOtvorite DWG ili DXF crtež\u003C/a\u003E, zatim \u003Ca href=\"/tutorials/takeoffcraft/count-from-a-drawing\" data-topic=\"takeoffcraft/count-from-a-drawing\"\u003EBrojanje iz crteža\u003C/a\u003E.\u003C/p\u003E\n\u003Ch2 id=\"pdf-predan-iz-druge-aplikacije\"\u003EPDF predan iz druge aplikacije\u003C/h2\u003E\n\u003Cp\u003EDruga aplikacija iz paketa može vam predati PDF koji ima otvoren: otvara TakeoffDesk u novoj kartici i PDF se tamo otvara kao da ste ga ispustili. Statusna traka kaže „Otvoreno: (name), predano iz (app). Izvorna datoteka nije promijenjena.“ Ništa se ne učitava na poslužitelj; datoteka prolazi kroz pohranu ovog preglednika i nestaje iz nje čim se otvori.\u003C/p\u003E\n\u003Cp\u003EAko statusna traka kaže da PDF „nije stigao“, kartica je predugo čekala ili je PDF već otvoren u drugoj kartici: otvorite ga s \u003Cspan class=\"hui\"\u003EOtvori nacrte\u003C/span\u003E.\u003C/p\u003E\n\u003Cp\u003EObratno, kad MarkupCraft radi tamo gdje ste i može primiti datoteku, traka lista ispod crteža ima gumb \u003Cspan class=\"hui\"\u003EMarkupCraft\u003C/span\u003E: otvara PDF lista na ekranu u MarkupCraftu, u novoj kartici, za pregled i označavanje.\u003C/p\u003E\n\u003Ch2 id=\"prona-ite-list\"\u003EPronađite list\u003C/h2\u003E\n\u003Cul\u003E\u003Cli\u003EPomičite popis \u003Cspan class=\"hui\"\u003EListovi\u003C/span\u003E lijevo i kliknite list.\u003C/li\u003E\u003Cli\u003EUpišite u \u003Cstrong\u003EPretraži listove\u003C/strong\u003E na vrhu popisa za filtriranje po broju lista, nazivu datoteke ili oznaci stranice. Brojka uz \u003Cspan class=\"hui\"\u003EListovi\u003C/span\u003E pokazuje „3 od 40“ dok je filter uključen.\u003C/li\u003E\u003Cli\u003EPritisnite \u003Ckbd class=\"hk\"\u003E\u003Cspan class=\"k-mac\" title=\"fn ↓\"\u003Efn ↓\u003C/span\u003E\u003Cspan class=\"k-pc\"\u003EPage Down\u003C/span\u003E\u003C/kbd\u003E za sljedeći list, a \u003Ckbd class=\"hk\"\u003E\u003Cspan class=\"k-mac\" title=\"fn ↑\"\u003Efn ↑\u003C/span\u003E\u003Cspan class=\"k-pc\"\u003EPage Up\u003C/span\u003E\u003C/kbd\u003E za prethodni. Prate popis onako kako je filtriran.\u003C/li\u003E\u003C/ul\u003E\n\u003Cdiv class=\"hv\" data-v=\"os:mac\"\u003E\u003Cp class=\"hv-label\"\u003EMac\u003C/p\u003E\n\u003Cp\u003ENa Mac tipkovnici bez tipki Page Up i Page Down pritisnite fn sa strelicom gore ili dolje.\u003C/p\u003E\n\u003C/div\u003E\n\u003Ch2 id=\"kako-se-listovi-imenuju\"\u003EKako se listovi imenuju\u003C/h2\u003E\n\u003Cul\u003E\u003Cli\u003EStranica kojoj PDF daje oznaku, poput \u003Ccode\u003EA-101\u003C/code\u003E, imenuje se tom oznakom.\u003C/li\u003E\u003Cli\u003EStranica bez oznake (ili oznake koja je samo njezin broj) zove se „(naziv datoteke), stranica (n)“.\u003C/li\u003E\u003Cli\u003EKad je otvoreno više PDF-ova, listovi s oznakom nose i naziv datoteke: „A-101 — Architectural“.\u003C/li\u003E\u003C/ul\u003E\n\u003Cp\u003ENazive listova još nije moguće upisati ručno.\u003C/p\u003E\n\u003Ch2 id=\"razgledajte-list\"\u003ERazgledajte list\u003C/h2\u003E\n\u003Cul\u003E\u003Cli\u003EOkretanjem kotačića miša zumirate prema pokazivaču.\u003C/li\u003E\u003Cli\u003EPovucite lijevom ili srednjom tipkom za pomicanje prikaza. S \u003Cspan class=\"hui\"\u003EAutobrojanje\u003C/span\u003E, ili kad počnete na kutu oznake, držite \u003Ckbd class=\"hk\"\u003E\u003Cspan class=\"k-mac\" title=\"Space\"\u003ESpace\u003C/span\u003E\u003Cspan class=\"k-pc\"\u003ESpace\u003C/span\u003E\u003C/kbd\u003E dok povlačite, ili povucite srednjom tipkom.\u003C/li\u003E\u003Cli\u003EPritisnite \u003Ckbd class=\"hk\"\u003E\u003Cspan class=\"k-mac\" title=\"F\"\u003EF\u003C/span\u003E\u003Cspan class=\"k-pc\"\u003EF\u003C/span\u003E\u003C/kbd\u003E ili odaberite \u003Cspan class=\"hui\"\u003EPrilagodi stranicu\u003C/span\u003E da vidite cijeli list; \u003Ckbd class=\"hk\"\u003E\u003Cspan class=\"k-mac\" title=\"W\"\u003EW\u003C/span\u003E\u003Cspan class=\"k-pc\"\u003EW\u003C/span\u003E\u003C/kbd\u003E ili \u003Cspan class=\"hui\"\u003EPrilagodi širinu\u003C/span\u003E prilagođava njegovu širinu.\u003C/li\u003E\u003Cli\u003EPritisnite \u003Ckbd class=\"hk\"\u003E\u003Cspan class=\"k-mac\" title=\"+\"\u003E+\u003C/span\u003E\u003Cspan class=\"k-pc\"\u003E+\u003C/span\u003E\u003C/kbd\u003E ili \u003Ckbd class=\"hk\"\u003E\u003Cspan class=\"k-mac\" title=\"=\"\u003E=\u003C/span\u003E\u003Cspan class=\"k-pc\"\u003E=\u003C/span\u003E\u003C/kbd\u003E za zumiranje prema unutra, a \u003Ckbd class=\"hk\"\u003E\u003Cspan class=\"k-mac\" title=\"−\"\u003E−\u003C/span\u003E\u003Cspan class=\"k-pc\"\u003E−\u003C/span\u003E\u003C/kbd\u003E za zumiranje prema van, oko sredine prikaza.\u003C/li\u003E\u003C/ul\u003E\n\u003Cp\u003ESvaki list pamti vlastito zumiranje i položaj dok je otvoren.\u003C/p\u003E\n\u003Ch2 id=\"dalje\"\u003EDalje\u003C/h2\u003E\n\u003Cp\u003EPrije mjerenja lista treba mu mjerilo: \u003Ca href=\"/tutorials/takeoffcraft/set-the-scale\" data-topic=\"takeoffcraft/set-the-scale\"\u003EPostavite mjerilo\u003C/a\u003E.\u003C/p\u003E","text":"Skup nacrta često je nekoliko PDF-ova: arhitektonski, konstrukcijski, strojarski. TakeoffDesk ih otvara jedan uz drugi kao jedan popis listova, a jedan predmjer može obuhvatiti sve njih. Otvorite PDF-ove Odaberite Otvori nacrte u grupi Datoteka ili pritisnite Ctrl+O. (Drugi stilovi izbornika to zovu Otvori PDF-ove….) U dijaloškom okviru datoteka odaberite svaki PDF iz skupa. Držite Command / Ctrl / Ctrl za odabir više, ili Shift za odabir raspona. Odaberite Otvori. Dok se svaka datoteka čita, prikazuje se poruka „Otvaranje (name)…“. Zatim se svaka stranica pojavi pod Listovi, a otvara se prva stranica prvog novog PDF-a. PDF-ove možete povući i iz Finder / Istraživač datoteka / vašeg upravitelja datoteka i ispustiti bilo gdje na TakeoffDesk. Dok povlačite, pojavljuje se okvir „Ispustite PDF-ove, DWG ili DXF crteže ili .takeoff.json“. Da dodate još PDF-ova kasnije, ponovite isto. PDF-ovi koji su već otvoreni se preskaču. Početni zaslon također navodi PDF-ove i predmjere koje ste nedavno otvorili, u preglednicima koji dopuštaju stranici ponovno otvoriti datoteku (Chrome i Edge). Kliknite jedan da ga otvorite; preglednik možda najprije traži dopuštenje. Vidi Vaše datoteke. Ništa se ne učitava na poslužitelj. Preglednik čita PDF-ove na vašem računalu, a oni nestaju iz TakeoffDeska kad zatvorite karticu ili odaberete Novo. Crteži uz PDF-ove Otvori nacrte prihvaća i DWG i DXF crteže, sami ili zajedno s PDF-ovima: prostor modela i layouti svakog crteža postaju listovi na istom popisu. Vidi Otvorite DWG ili DXF crtež, zatim Brojanje iz crteža. PDF predan iz druge aplikacije Druga aplikacija iz paketa može vam predati PDF koji ima otvoren: otvara TakeoffDesk u novoj kartici i PDF se tamo otvara kao da ste ga ispustili. Statusna traka kaže „Otvoreno: (name), predano iz (app). Izvorna datoteka nije promijenjena.“ Ništa se ne učitava na poslužitelj; datoteka prolazi kroz pohranu ovog preglednika i nestaje iz nje čim se otvori. Ako statusna traka kaže da PDF „nije stigao“, kartica je predugo čekala ili je PDF već otvoren u drugoj kartici: otvorite ga s Otvori nacrte. Obratno, kad MarkupCraft radi tamo gdje ste i može primiti datoteku, traka lista ispod crteža ima gumb MarkupCraft: otvara PDF lista na ekranu u MarkupCraftu, u novoj kartici, za pregled i označavanje. Pronađite list Pomičite popis Listovi lijevo i kliknite list. Upišite u Pretraži listove na vrhu popisa za filtriranje po broju lista, nazivu datoteke ili oznaci stranice. Brojka uz Listovi pokazuje „3 od 40“ dok je filter uključen. Pritisnite Page Down za sljedeći list, a Page Up za prethodni. Prate popis onako kako je filtriran. Na Mac tipkovnici bez tipki Page Up i Page Down pritisnite fn sa strelicom gore ili dolje. Kako se listovi imenuju Stranica kojoj PDF daje oznaku, poput A-101, imenuje se tom oznakom. Stranica bez oznake (ili oznake koja je samo njezin broj) zove se „(naziv datoteke), stranica (n)“. Kad je otvoreno više PDF-ova, listovi s oznakom nose i naziv datoteke: „A-101 — Architectural“. Nazive listova još nije moguće upisati ručno. Razgledajte list Okretanjem kotačića miša zumirate prema pokazivaču. Povucite lijevom ili srednjom tipkom za pomicanje prikaza. S Autobrojanje, ili kad počnete na kutu oznake, držite Space dok povlačite, ili povucite srednjom tipkom. Pritisnite F ili odaberite Prilagodi stranicu da vidite cijeli list; W ili Prilagodi širinu prilagođava njegovu širinu. Pritisnite + ili = za zumiranje prema unutra, a − za zumiranje prema van, oko sredine prikaza. Svaki list pamti vlastito zumiranje i položaj dok je otvoren. Dalje Prije mjerenja lista treba mu mjerilo: Postavite mjerilo.","lang":"hr"},{"slug":"open-a-drawing","scope":"takeoffcraft","title":"\"Otvorite DWG ili DXF crtež\"","summary":"\"Otvorite datoteku crteža kao listove (prostor modela i svaki layout), započnite s mjerilom koje crtež daje, prikažite ili sakrijte njegove slojeve i uvedite vezane crteže.\"","section":"tasks","order":12,"keywords":["\"dwg","dxf","cad","crtež","otvori crtež","layouti","prostor modela","papirni prostor","listovi","jedinice","insunits","mjerilo viewporta","xref","vezani crtež","slojevi","zamrznuti","bez pdf-a","ispis","bez ispisa\""],"headings":[{"id":"otvorite-crte","text":"Otvorite crtež","level":2},{"id":"listovi","text":"Listovi","level":2},{"id":"mjerilo","text":"Mjerilo","level":2},{"id":"slojevi","text":"Slojevi","level":2},{"id":"vezani-crte-i-xref","text":"Vezani crteži (Xref)","level":2},{"id":"ograni-enja","text":"Ograničenja","level":2}],"html":"\u003Cp\u003ETakeoffDesk otvara DWG ili DXF crtež kao što otvara PDF: ne morate ga prije toga ispisati u PDF. Brojanje iz samog crteža je točno, jer crtež zna što je svaki objekt. Vidi \u003Ca href=\"/tutorials/takeoffcraft/count-from-a-drawing\" data-topic=\"takeoffcraft/count-from-a-drawing\"\u003EBrojanje iz crteža\u003C/a\u003E.\u003C/p\u003E\n\u003Ch2 id=\"otvorite-crte\"\u003EOtvorite crtež\u003C/h2\u003E\n\u003Col\u003E\u003Cli\u003EOdaberite \u003Cspan class=\"hui\"\u003EOtvori nacrte\u003C/span\u003E u grupi \u003Cspan class=\"hui\"\u003EDatoteka\u003C/span\u003E ili pritisnite \u003Ckbd class=\"hk\"\u003E\u003Cspan class=\"k-mac\" title=\"Command O\"\u003E⌘O\u003C/span\u003E\u003Cspan class=\"k-pc\"\u003ECtrl+O\u003C/span\u003E\u003C/kbd\u003E.\u003C/li\u003E\u003Cli\u003EOdaberite DWG ili DXF datoteku. Možete odabrati više, a uz njih i PDF-ove.\u003C/li\u003E\u003Cli\u003EOdaberite Otvori.\u003C/li\u003E\u003C/ol\u003E\n\u003Cp\u003ECrteže možete i ispustiti na TakeoffDesk, kao PDF-ove. Ništa se ne učitava na poslužitelj: preglednik čita datoteku na vašem računalu.\u003C/p\u003E\n\u003Cp\u003ETakeoffDesk čita DWG od AutoCAD 2000 do 2018 i ASCII DXF od R12 do 2018. Odbija binarni DXF (spremite ga kao ASCII ili kao DWG) i datoteku koja nije ni jedno ni drugo, i kaže zašto. Oštećena datoteka se otvori s onim što se moglo pročitati, a poruka to kaže; brojke mogu biti nepotpune.\u003C/p\u003E\n\u003Ch2 id=\"listovi\"\u003EListovi\u003C/h2\u003E\n\u003Cul\u003E\u003Cli\u003E\u003Cstrong\u003EModel\u003C/strong\u003E je prostor modela crteža.\u003C/li\u003E\u003Cli\u003E\u003Cstrong\u003ESvaki layout\u003C/strong\u003E (kartica papirnog prostora) je list, nazvan po svojoj kartici, po redu kartica. Layout prikazuje model kroz svoje viewporte, kako se ispisuje.\u003C/li\u003E\u003C/ul\u003E\n\u003Cp\u003EZumiranje, pomicanje prikaza, hvatanje za linije samog crteža, oznake, bilješke, \u003Cspan class=\"hui\"\u003EKalibriraj\u003C/span\u003E i ostalo rade kao na PDF-u. Listovi crteža spremaju se u predmjer prema nazivu datoteke i otisku sadržaja, kao PDF: ponovno otvorite istu datoteku i oznake su na njezinim listovima.\u003C/p\u003E\n\u003Ch2 id=\"mjerilo\"\u003EMjerilo\u003C/h2\u003E\n\u003Cp\u003EList počinje s mjerilom koje crtež daje:\u003C/p\u003E\n\u003Cul\u003E\u003Cli\u003E\u003Cstrong\u003ELayout\u003C/strong\u003E preuzima mjerilo svog najvećeg viewporta. Mjerilo kao 1/2&quot; = 1&#039;-0&quot; zove se kao predložak koji jest; svako drugo prikazuje se kao „Iz viewporta crteža: 1&quot; = 2.5&#039;“. Ako layout ima viewporte u drugim mjerilima, najveći postavlja mjerilo lista: ostale provjerite s \u003Cspan class=\"hui\"\u003EProvjeri\u003C/span\u003E.\u003C/li\u003E\u003Cli\u003E\u003Cstrong\u003EModel\u003C/strong\u003E preuzima jedinice crteža (inči, milimetri, stope…) kao mjerilo: „Jedinice crteža (inči)“.\u003C/li\u003E\u003Cli\u003E\u003Cstrong\u003ECrtež bez jedinica\u003C/strong\u003E (crtež nikad nije rekao je li jedinica inč ili milimetar) nema mjerilo: list kaže „Bez mjerila“, a mjerenje na njemu je odbijeno, kao na PDF-u bez mjerila. Brojanje ne treba mjerilo. Zadajte ga s \u003Cspan class=\"hui\"\u003EKalibriraj\u003C/span\u003E.\u003C/li\u003E\u003C/ul\u003E\n\u003Cp\u003E\u003Cspan class=\"hui\"\u003EKalibriraj\u003C/span\u003E, \u003Cspan class=\"hui\"\u003EProvjeri\u003C/span\u003E i popis \u003Cspan class=\"hui\"\u003EPredložak\u003C/span\u003E mijenjaju mjerilo u bilo kojem trenutku i nadjačavaju mjerilo crteža. Popis \u003Cspan class=\"hui\"\u003EPredložak\u003C/span\u003E je isključen za Model, koji nema veličinu papira.\u003C/p\u003E\n\u003Ch2 id=\"slojevi\"\u003ESlojevi\u003C/h2\u003E\n\u003Cp\u003E\u003Cspan class=\"hui\"\u003ESlojevi\u003C/span\u003E na traci lista navodi slojeve crteža i koliko objekata svaki ima na ovom listu. Slojevi koje je datoteka isključila ili zamrznula počinju skriveni. Odznačite sloj da ga sakrijete ili označite skriveni da ga prikažete: list se ponovno iscrta, a skriveno se ne broji i ne nudi se za \u003Cspan class=\"hui\"\u003EMjeri crtež\u003C/span\u003E, osim ako zatražite da se broje i skriveni slojevi. \u003Cspan class=\"hui\"\u003EPrikaži sve\u003C/span\u003E prikazuje svaki sloj; \u003Cspan class=\"hui\"\u003ENatrag na slojeve iz datoteke\u003C/span\u003E poništava vaše promjene. Izbor slojeva vrijedi za ovu sesiju, a ne za datoteku predmjera.\u003C/p\u003E\n\u003Ch2 id=\"vezani-crte-i-xref\"\u003EVezani crteži (Xref)\u003C/h2\u003E\n\u003Cp\u003ECrtež koji povezuje druge crteže prikazuje ih tamo gdje su umetnuti. TakeoffDesk pronalazi vezani crtež među \u003Cstrong\u003Eotvorenim datotekama\u003C/strong\u003E po nazivu datoteke: otvorite glavni crtež i njegov vezani crtež zajedno (ili jedan za drugim). Dok to ne učinite, statusna traka kaže koliko vezanih crteža nije pronađeno, što nedostaje u njihovom sadržaju, a brojanja to navode.\u003C/p\u003E\n\u003Ch2 id=\"ograni-enja\"\u003EOgraničenja\u003C/h2\u003E\n\u003Cul\u003E\u003Cli\u003EObjekte koje TakeoffDesk ne može pročitati ili postaviti (proxy objekti, nepoznate klase) navedeni su u prozoru brojanja po vrsti; nikad se ne izostavljaju bez riječi.\u003C/li\u003E\u003Cli\u003EVrlo veliki crteži crtaju se djelomično, a brojanja staju na ograničenju, uz poruku. Umjesto toga otvorite PDF ispis takvog crteža.\u003C/li\u003E\u003Cli\u003ECrtež se crta crno i u vlastitim bojama, potamnjenim za bijeli papir. Tablice stilova ispisa i dodjele olovaka se ne primjenjuju.\u003C/li\u003E\u003C/ul\u003E","text":"TakeoffDesk otvara DWG ili DXF crtež kao što otvara PDF: ne morate ga prije toga ispisati u PDF. Brojanje iz samog crteža je točno, jer crtež zna što je svaki objekt. Vidi Brojanje iz crteža. Otvorite crtež Odaberite Otvori nacrte u grupi Datoteka ili pritisnite Ctrl+O. Odaberite DWG ili DXF datoteku. Možete odabrati više, a uz njih i PDF-ove. Odaberite Otvori. Crteže možete i ispustiti na TakeoffDesk, kao PDF-ove. Ništa se ne učitava na poslužitelj: preglednik čita datoteku na vašem računalu. TakeoffDesk čita DWG od AutoCAD 2000 do 2018 i ASCII DXF od R12 do 2018. Odbija binarni DXF (spremite ga kao ASCII ili kao DWG) i datoteku koja nije ni jedno ni drugo, i kaže zašto. Oštećena datoteka se otvori s onim što se moglo pročitati, a poruka to kaže; brojke mogu biti nepotpune. Listovi Model je prostor modela crteža. Svaki layout (kartica papirnog prostora) je list, nazvan po svojoj kartici, po redu kartica. Layout prikazuje model kroz svoje viewporte, kako se ispisuje. Zumiranje, pomicanje prikaza, hvatanje za linije samog crteža, oznake, bilješke, Kalibriraj i ostalo rade kao na PDF-u. Listovi crteža spremaju se u predmjer prema nazivu datoteke i otisku sadržaja, kao PDF: ponovno otvorite istu datoteku i oznake su na njezinim listovima. Mjerilo List počinje s mjerilom koje crtež daje: Layout preuzima mjerilo svog najvećeg viewporta. Mjerilo kao 1/2\" = 1'-0\" zove se kao predložak koji jest; svako drugo prikazuje se kao „Iz viewporta crteža: 1\" = 2.5'“. Ako layout ima viewporte u drugim mjerilima, najveći postavlja mjerilo lista: ostale provjerite s Provjeri. Model preuzima jedinice crteža (inči, milimetri, stope…) kao mjerilo: „Jedinice crteža (inči)“. Crtež bez jedinica (crtež nikad nije rekao je li jedinica inč ili milimetar) nema mjerilo: list kaže „Bez mjerila“, a mjerenje na njemu je odbijeno, kao na PDF-u bez mjerila. Brojanje ne treba mjerilo. Zadajte ga s Kalibriraj. Kalibriraj, Provjeri i popis Predložak mijenjaju mjerilo u bilo kojem trenutku i nadjačavaju mjerilo crteža. Popis Predložak je isključen za Model, koji nema veličinu papira. Slojevi Slojevi na traci lista navodi slojeve crteža i koliko objekata svaki ima na ovom listu. Slojevi koje je datoteka isključila ili zamrznula počinju skriveni. Odznačite sloj da ga sakrijete ili označite skriveni da ga prikažete: list se ponovno iscrta, a skriveno se ne broji i ne nudi se za Mjeri crtež, osim ako zatražite da se broje i skriveni slojevi. Prikaži sve prikazuje svaki sloj; Natrag na slojeve iz datoteke poništava vaše promjene. Izbor slojeva vrijedi za ovu sesiju, a ne za datoteku predmjera. Vezani crteži (Xref) Crtež koji povezuje druge crteže prikazuje ih tamo gdje su umetnuti. TakeoffDesk pronalazi vezani crtež među otvorenim datotekama po nazivu datoteke: otvorite glavni crtež i njegov vezani crtež zajedno (ili jedan za drugim). Dok to ne učinite, statusna traka kaže koliko vezanih crteža nije pronađeno, što nedostaje u njihovom sadržaju, a brojanja to navode. Ograničenja Objekte koje TakeoffDesk ne može pročitati ili postaviti (proxy objekti, nepoznate klase) navedeni su u prozoru brojanja po vrsti; nikad se ne izostavljaju bez riječi. Vrlo veliki crteži crtaju se djelomično, a brojanja staju na ograničenju, uz poruku. Umjesto toga otvorite PDF ispis takvog crteža. Crtež se crta crno i u vlastitim bojama, potamnjenim za bijeli papir. Tablice stilova ispisa i dodjele olovaka se ne primjenjuju.","lang":"hr"},{"slug":"open-an-ifc-file","scope":"takeoffcraft","title":"\"Uzimanje količina iz IFC 4.3 datoteke\"","summary":"\"Otvorite IFC 4.3 datoteku ceste, pruge, mosta ili zemljanih radova i dobijete brojanje po klasi, s duljinama, površinama i volumenima koje datoteka navodi, kao tipizirane količine.\"","section":"tasks","order":13,"keywords":["\"ifc","ifc4x3","ifc 4.3","cesta","pruga","most","kolnik","rubnjak","sloj","zemljani radovi","ležaj","infrastruktura","količine","bim","civil","tipizirane količine\""],"headings":[{"id":"otvorite-datoteku","text":"Otvorite datoteku","level":2},{"id":"to-ne-radi","text":"Što ne radi","level":2}],"html":"\u003Cp\u003EIFC 4.3 datoteka može sadržavati ceste, pruge, mostove, pomorske radove i dijelove od kojih su sastavljeni: kolničke konstrukcije, slojeve, rubnjake, tračnice, zemljane radove, ležajeve, pilote i još mnogo toga. TakeoffDesk ih čita i pretvara u tipizirane količine koje možete cijeniti.\u003C/p\u003E\n\u003Ch2 id=\"otvorite-datoteku\"\u003EOtvorite datoteku\u003C/h2\u003E\n\u003Col\u003E\u003Cli\u003EOdaberite \u003Cspan class=\"hui\"\u003EOtvori nacrte\u003C/span\u003E u grupi \u003Cspan class=\"hui\"\u003EDatoteka\u003C/span\u003E ili pritisnite \u003Ckbd class=\"hk\"\u003E\u003Cspan class=\"k-mac\" title=\"Command O\"\u003E⌘O\u003C/span\u003E\u003Cspan class=\"k-pc\"\u003ECtrl+O\u003C/span\u003E\u003C/kbd\u003E.\u003C/li\u003E\u003Cli\u003EOdaberite IFC datoteku (možete je odabrati uz PDF-ove) ili je ispustite na TakeoffDesk.\u003C/li\u003E\u003C/ol\u003E\n\u003Cp\u003EZa svaku klasu i predefinirani tip stvara se jedna tipizirana količina, na primjer „Kolnik (fleksibilni): brojanje“ i, kad ih datoteka navodi, „duljina“ u m, „površina“ u m² i „volumen“ u m³. Napomena uz svaku stavku kaže koliko je elemenata prebrojeno i koliko ih nema navedenu količinu. Otvaranje novije datoteke istog naziva ažurira te količine umjesto dodavanja novih.\u003C/p\u003E\n\u003Ch2 id=\"to-ne-radi\"\u003EŠto ne radi\u003C/h2\u003E\n\u003Cul\u003E\u003Cli\u003EČita skupove količina (IfcElementQuantity) koje datoteka sadrži. Ne mjeri 3D oblike, pa se element bez skupa količina broji, ali ne dodaje duljinu, površinu ni volumen.\u003C/li\u003E\u003Cli\u003EČitaju se samo infrastrukturne klase IFC 4.3. Zgradarska datoteka (zidovi, vrata, ploče) ovdje se ne pretvara u količine; datoteka koja nije IFC 4.3 to kaže i ništa ne unosi.\u003C/li\u003E\u003Cli\u003EJedinice su jedinice datoteke, pretvorene u metre.\u003C/li\u003E\u003C/ul\u003E","text":"IFC 4.3 datoteka može sadržavati ceste, pruge, mostove, pomorske radove i dijelove od kojih su sastavljeni: kolničke konstrukcije, slojeve, rubnjake, tračnice, zemljane radove, ležajeve, pilote i još mnogo toga. TakeoffDesk ih čita i pretvara u tipizirane količine koje možete cijeniti. Otvorite datoteku Odaberite Otvori nacrte u grupi Datoteka ili pritisnite Ctrl+O. Odaberite IFC datoteku (možete je odabrati uz PDF-ove) ili je ispustite na TakeoffDesk. Za svaku klasu i predefinirani tip stvara se jedna tipizirana količina, na primjer „Kolnik (fleksibilni): brojanje“ i, kad ih datoteka navodi, „duljina“ u m, „površina“ u m² i „volumen“ u m³. Napomena uz svaku stavku kaže koliko je elemenata prebrojeno i koliko ih nema navedenu količinu. Otvaranje novije datoteke istog naziva ažurira te količine umjesto dodavanja novih. Što ne radi Čita skupove količina (IfcElementQuantity) koje datoteka sadrži. Ne mjeri 3D oblike, pa se element bez skupa količina broji, ali ne dodaje duljinu, površinu ni volumen. Čitaju se samo infrastrukturne klase IFC 4.3. Zgradarska datoteka (zidovi, vrata, ploče) ovdje se ne pretvara u količine; datoteka koja nije IFC 4.3 to kaže i ništa ne unosi. Jedinice su jedinice datoteke, pretvorene u metre.","lang":"hr"},{"slug":"set-the-scale","scope":"takeoffcraft","title":"Postavljanje mjerila","summary":"Dajte svakom listu mjerilo pomoću predloška ili kalibracijom na poznatoj mjeri, provjerite ga i saznajte zašto listovi bez mjerila nisu uključeni u ukupne iznose.","section":"tasks","order":20,"keywords":["otkrij mjerilo","pročitaj mjerilo","mjerilo iz teksta","svi listovi","mjerilo","kalibriraj","predložak","provjeri mjerilo","provjera","poznata mjera","bez mjerila","nema mjerila","omjer","postavi mjerilo"],"headings":[{"id":"upotreba-predlo-ka-kada-je-pdf-ispisan-u-punoj-veli-ini","text":"Upotreba predloška (kada je PDF ispisan u punoj veličini)","level":2},{"id":"itanje-mjerila-iz-teksta-listova","text":"Čitanje mjerila iz teksta listova","level":2},{"id":"kalibracija-na-poznatoj-mjeri","text":"Kalibracija na poznatoj mjeri","level":2},{"id":"provjera-mjerila","text":"Provjera mjerila","level":2},{"id":"promjena-mjerila","text":"Promjena mjerila","level":2},{"id":"za-to-listovi-bez-mjerila-nisu-brojeni-kao-nula","text":"Zašto listovi bez mjerila nisu brojeni kao nula","level":2},{"id":"savjeti","text":"Savjeti","level":2}],"html":"\u003Cp\u003ESvaki list ima vlastito mjerilo. Vi ga postavljate ili pustite da TakeoffDesk pročita mjerilo iz teksta listova (u nastavku), a zatim ga provjerite. Dok list nema mjerilo, \u003Cspan class=\"hui\"\u003ELinearno\u003C/span\u003E, \u003Cspan class=\"hui\"\u003EPovršina\u003C/span\u003E, \u003Cspan class=\"hui\"\u003EKružnica\u003C/span\u003E i \u003Cspan class=\"hui\"\u003EOtvor\u003C/span\u003E odbijaju mjeriti na njemu. \u003Cspan class=\"hui\"\u003EBroji\u003C/span\u003E i \u003Cspan class=\"hui\"\u003EAutobrojanje\u003C/span\u003E rade bez mjerila.\u003C/p\u003E\n\u003Cp\u003EPopis listova prikazuje mjerilo svakog lista ili \u003Cstrong\u003ENema mjerila\u003C/strong\u003E. Traka ispod otvorenog lista kaže isto.\u003C/p\u003E\n\u003Ch2 id=\"upotreba-predlo-ka-kada-je-pdf-ispisan-u-punoj-veli-ini\"\u003EUpotreba predloška (kada je PDF ispisan u punoj veličini)\u003C/h2\u003E\n\u003Col\u003E\u003Cli\u003EOtvorite list.\u003C/li\u003E\u003Cli\u003EOtvorite popis \u003Cspan class=\"hui\"\u003EPredložak\u003C/span\u003E u grupi \u003Cspan class=\"hui\"\u003EMjerilo\u003C/span\u003E.\u003C/li\u003E\u003Cli\u003EOdaberite mjerilo ispisano na crtežu, na primjer \u003Ccode\u003E1/8&quot; = 1&#039;-0&quot;\u003C/code\u003E pod Arhitektonsko. Statusna traka kaže „Mjerilo za ovaj list: 1/8&quot; = 1&#039;-0&quot;.“\u003C/li\u003E\u003Cli\u003EProvjerite ga (u nastavku).\u003C/li\u003E\u003C/ol\u003E\n\u003Cp\u003EPredložak pretpostavlja da je PDF prava papirna veličina za koju je crtež napravljen. Ako je netko napravio PDF s „prilagodi stranici“ ili je riječ o setu u polovičnoj veličini, predložak je pogrešan. Umjesto njega kalibrirajte.\u003C/p\u003E\n\u003Cp\u003ECijeli popis nalazi se u \u003Ca href=\"/tutorials/takeoffcraft/scale-presets\" data-topic=\"takeoffcraft/scale-presets\"\u003EPredlošci mjerila\u003C/a\u003E.\u003C/p\u003E\n\u003Ch2 id=\"itanje-mjerila-iz-teksta-listova\"\u003EČitanje mjerila iz teksta listova\u003C/h2\u003E\n\u003Cp\u003EVećina crteža navodi svoje mjerilo: \u003Ccode\u003ESCALE: 1/4&quot; = 1&#039;-0&quot;\u003C/code\u003E u zaglavlju, \u003Ccode\u003E1:100\u003C/code\u003E ispod pogleda. TakeoffDesk ga može pročitati i postaviti svaki list odjednom.\u003C/p\u003E\n\u003Col\u003E\u003Cli\u003EOtvorite popis \u003Cspan class=\"hui\"\u003EPredložak\u003C/span\u003E i odaberite \u003Cspan class=\"hui\"\u003EIz teksta listova…\u003C/span\u003E (na vrhu).\u003C/li\u003E\u003Cli\u003EPopis prikazuje svaki list: njegovo trenutno mjerilo i što njegov tekst kaže — \u003Cstrong\u003ENavodi 1/4&quot; = 1&#039;-0&quot;\u003C/strong\u003E, \u003Cstrong\u003ENema mjerila u tekstu\u003C/strong\u003E ili \u003Cstrong\u003ENavodi da nije u mjerilu\u003C/strong\u003E (NTS).\u003C/li\u003E\u003Cli\u003EListovi bez mjerila koji ga navode označeni su kvačicom. Označite ili odznačite bilo koji, zatim odaberite \u003Cspan class=\"hui\"\u003EPostavi označena mjerila\u003C/span\u003E. Jedan \u003Ckbd class=\"hk\"\u003E\u003Cspan class=\"k-mac\" title=\"Command Z\"\u003E⌘Z\u003C/span\u003E\u003Cspan class=\"k-pc\"\u003ECtrl+Z\u003C/span\u003E\u003C/kbd\u003E sve vraća.\u003C/li\u003E\u003Cli\u003EProvjerite jednu dimenziju na svakom listu pomoću \u003Cspan class=\"hui\"\u003EProvjeri\u003C/span\u003E (u nastavku): predložak je ispravan samo ako je PDF ispisan u punoj veličini.\u003C/li\u003E\u003C/ol\u003E\n\u003Cp\u003EČita arhitektonske (\u003Ccode\u003E3/16&quot; = 1&#039;-0&quot;\u003C/code\u003E, \u003Ccode\u003E1 1/2&quot; = 1&#039;-0&quot;\u003C/code\u003E), inženjerske (\u003Ccode\u003E1&quot; = 20&#039;\u003C/code\u003E) i metričke (\u003Ccode\u003E1:50\u003C/code\u003E) zapise koji odgovaraju \u003Ca href=\"/tutorials/takeoffcraft/scale-presets\" data-topic=\"takeoffcraft/scale-presets\"\u003Epredlošku\u003C/a\u003E. Kada list navodi više od jednog mjerila (plan s uvećanim detaljima), uzima ono koje navodi najčešće, a onaj napisan nakon riječi SCALE broji se dvostruko; ostali su prikazani crveno da ih provjerite. Skenirani list nema tekst: mjerilo postavite ručno.\u003C/p\u003E\n\u003Ch2 id=\"kalibracija-na-poznatoj-mjeri\"\u003EKalibracija na poznatoj mjeri\u003C/h2\u003E\n\u003Cp\u003EKoristite ovo kada nema tiskanog mjerila kojem vjerujete, kada je set promijenjene veličine ili kada list kaže „nije u mjerilu“, a ima dimenzije.\u003C/p\u003E\n\u003Col\u003E\u003Cli\u003EOtvorite list i uvećajte dugu dimenziju koju znate, poput razmaka mreže ili ukupne dimenzije zgrade. Što je duža, to je točnije.\u003C/li\u003E\u003Cli\u003EOdaberite \u003Cspan class=\"hui\"\u003EKalibriraj\u003C/span\u003E u grupi \u003Cspan class=\"hui\"\u003EMjerilo\u003C/span\u003E, ili pritisnite \u003Ckbd class=\"hk\"\u003E\u003Cspan class=\"k-mac\" title=\"K\"\u003EK\u003C/span\u003E\u003Cspan class=\"k-pc\"\u003EK\u003C/span\u003E\u003C/kbd\u003E.\u003C/li\u003E\u003Cli\u003EKliknite jedan kraj dimenzije. Uvećajte svaki kraj za preciznost; između klikova možete uvećavati i pomicati prikaz.\u003C/li\u003E\u003Cli\u003EKliknite drugi kraj. Držite \u003Ckbd class=\"hk\"\u003E\u003Cspan class=\"k-mac\" title=\"Shift\"\u003E⇧\u003C/span\u003E\u003Cspan class=\"k-pc\"\u003EShift\u003C/span\u003E\u003C/kbd\u003E da linija ostane pod 0°, 45° ili 90°. Otvara se dijaloški okvir \u003Cstrong\u003EKalibriraj ovaj list\u003C/strong\u003E.\u003C/li\u003E\u003Cli\u003EUpišite stvarnu udaljenost u \u003Cstrong\u003EStvarna udaljenost\u003C/strong\u003E, na primjer \u003Ccode\u003E24&#039;-6 1/2&quot;\u003C/code\u003E, \u003Ccode\u003E24.5\u003C/code\u003E (decimalne stope), \u003Ccode\u003E30&quot;\u003C/code\u003E ili \u003Ccode\u003E7.5 m\u003C/code\u003E. Vidi \u003Ca href=\"/tutorials/takeoffcraft/entry-formats\" data-topic=\"takeoffcraft/entry-formats\"\u003EUnos duljine, cijene i postotka\u003C/a\u003E.\u003C/li\u003E\u003Cli\u003EOdaberite \u003Cspan class=\"hui\"\u003EPostavi mjerilo\u003C/span\u003E. Statusna traka prikazuje mjerilo kao „1&quot; = (n)&#039;“, a kada je unutar 0.5% nekog predloška, kaže koji, na primjer „što odgovara 1/4&quot; = 1&#039;-0&quot; (odaberite taj predložak za točno mjerilo)“. TakeoffDesk se vraća na alat \u003Cspan class=\"hui\"\u003EOdaberi\u003C/span\u003E.\u003C/li\u003E\u003C/ol\u003E\n\u003Cp\u003EKada kalibracija odgovara predlošku, odabir tog predloška daje točno mjerilo umjesto onog koje ovisi o tome gdje ste kliknuli.\u003C/p\u003E\n\u003Ch2 id=\"provjera-mjerila\"\u003EProvjera mjerila\u003C/h2\u003E\n\u003Cp\u003EUvijek provjerite novo mjerilo na drugoj dimenziji.\u003C/p\u003E\n\u003Col\u003E\u003Cli\u003EOdaberite \u003Cspan class=\"hui\"\u003EProvjeri\u003C/span\u003E u grupi \u003Cspan class=\"hui\"\u003EMjerilo\u003C/span\u003E, ili pritisnite \u003Ckbd class=\"hk\"\u003E\u003Cspan class=\"k-mac\" title=\"D\"\u003ED\u003C/span\u003E\u003Cspan class=\"k-pc\"\u003ED\u003C/span\u003E\u003C/kbd\u003E.\u003C/li\u003E\u003Cli\u003EKliknite oba kraja dimenzije ispisane na crtežu. Statusna traka prikazuje „Provjera: 12&#039;-6&quot;“ s istom duljinom u decimalnim stopama i metrima, a linija provjere ostaje na listu s njezinom duljinom.\u003C/li\u003E\u003Cli\u003EUsporedite je s ispisanom dimenzijom. Ako se ne podudara, kalibrirajte na dužoj dimenziji.\u003C/li\u003E\u003C/ol\u003E\n\u003Cp\u003EPritisnite \u003Ckbd class=\"hk\"\u003E\u003Cspan class=\"k-mac\" title=\"Esc\"\u003EEsc\u003C/span\u003E\u003Cspan class=\"k-pc\"\u003EEsc\u003C/span\u003E\u003C/kbd\u003E da uklonite liniju provjere.\u003C/p\u003E\n\u003Ch2 id=\"promjena-mjerila\"\u003EPromjena mjerila\u003C/h2\u003E\n\u003Cp\u003EOdaberite drugi predložak ili ponovno kalibrirajte. Ako list već ima mjerenja, TakeoffDesk pita \u003Cstrong\u003EPromijeniti mjerilo ovog lista?\u003C/strong\u003E i kaže koliko će se mjerenja ponovno izmjeriti. Odaberite \u003Cspan class=\"hui\"\u003EPromijeni mjerilo\u003C/span\u003E. Svaka dionica i površina na listu ponovno se mjeri na novom mjerilu. To možete poništiti s \u003Ckbd class=\"hk\"\u003E\u003Cspan class=\"k-mac\" title=\"Command Z\"\u003E⌘Z\u003C/span\u003E\u003Cspan class=\"k-pc\"\u003ECtrl+Z\u003C/span\u003E\u003C/kbd\u003E.\u003C/p\u003E\n\u003Ch2 id=\"za-to-listovi-bez-mjerila-nisu-brojeni-kao-nula\"\u003EZašto listovi bez mjerila nisu brojeni kao nula\u003C/h2\u003E\n\u003Cp\u003EOznaka na listu bez mjerila nema stvarnu duljinu ili površinu. TakeoffDesk je nikad ne broji kao nulu, jer bi tiho učinio vaš predračun preniskim. Umjesto toga:\u003C/p\u003E\n\u003Cul\u003E\u003Cli\u003Eizostavlja te oznake iz ukupnih iznosa,\u003C/li\u003E\u003Cli\u003Euz stavku u \u003Cspan class=\"hui\"\u003EKoličine\u003C/span\u003E prikazuje „+(n) bez mjerila“,\u003C/li\u003E\u003Cli\u003Eu zaglavlju tablice prikazuje „Nepotpuno: (n) oznaka na listovima bez mjerila (nije uključeno u ukupne)“,\u003C/li\u003E\u003Cli\u003Eupisuje broj u stupac bilješki izvezene tablice.\u003C/li\u003E\u003C/ul\u003E\n\u003Cp\u003EOvo se može dogoditi kada otvorite projekt čija mjerila nikada nisu postavljena. Dajte listu mjerilo i oznake se odmah broje. Oznake brojanja uvijek se broje; ne trebaju mjerilo.\u003C/p\u003E\n\u003Ch2 id=\"savjeti\"\u003ESavjeti\u003C/h2\u003E\n\u003Cul\u003E\u003Cli\u003EPostavite mjerilo na svakom listu koji ćete mjeriti prije početka. Pregledajte popis listova za \u003Cstrong\u003ENema mjerila\u003C/strong\u003E da pronađete preostale (okvir za pretragu gleda nazive listova, a ne mjerila).\u003C/li\u003E\u003Cli\u003EDetalji i uvećani planovi na istom listu često koriste drugo mjerilo. TakeoffDesk ima jedno mjerilo po listu; vidi \u003Ca href=\"/tutorials/takeoffcraft/not-built-yet\" data-topic=\"takeoffcraft/not-built-yet\"\u003EŠto još nije izrađeno\u003C/a\u003E.\u003C/li\u003E\u003Cli\u003EMetrički crteži: odaberite metrički predložak poput \u003Ccode\u003E1:100\u003C/code\u003E, ili kalibrirajte metričkom udaljenošću poput \u003Ccode\u003E6000 mm\u003C/code\u003E.\u003C/li\u003E\u003C/ul\u003E","text":"Svaki list ima vlastito mjerilo. Vi ga postavljate ili pustite da TakeoffDesk pročita mjerilo iz teksta listova (u nastavku), a zatim ga provjerite. Dok list nema mjerilo, Linearno, Površina, Kružnica i Otvor odbijaju mjeriti na njemu. Broji i Autobrojanje rade bez mjerila. Popis listova prikazuje mjerilo svakog lista ili Nema mjerila. Traka ispod otvorenog lista kaže isto. Upotreba predloška (kada je PDF ispisan u punoj veličini) Otvorite list. Otvorite popis Predložak u grupi Mjerilo. Odaberite mjerilo ispisano na crtežu, na primjer 1/8\" = 1'-0\" pod Arhitektonsko. Statusna traka kaže „Mjerilo za ovaj list: 1/8\" = 1'-0\".“ Provjerite ga (u nastavku). Predložak pretpostavlja da je PDF prava papirna veličina za koju je crtež napravljen. Ako je netko napravio PDF s „prilagodi stranici“ ili je riječ o setu u polovičnoj veličini, predložak je pogrešan. Umjesto njega kalibrirajte. Cijeli popis nalazi se u Predlošci mjerila. Čitanje mjerila iz teksta listova Većina crteža navodi svoje mjerilo: SCALE: 1/4\" = 1'-0\" u zaglavlju, 1:100 ispod pogleda. TakeoffDesk ga može pročitati i postaviti svaki list odjednom. Otvorite popis Predložak i odaberite Iz teksta listova… (na vrhu). Popis prikazuje svaki list: njegovo trenutno mjerilo i što njegov tekst kaže — Navodi 1/4\" = 1'-0\", Nema mjerila u tekstu ili Navodi da nije u mjerilu (NTS). Listovi bez mjerila koji ga navode označeni su kvačicom. Označite ili odznačite bilo koji, zatim odaberite Postavi označena mjerila. Jedan Ctrl+Z sve vraća. Provjerite jednu dimenziju na svakom listu pomoću Provjeri (u nastavku): predložak je ispravan samo ako je PDF ispisan u punoj veličini. Čita arhitektonske (3/16\" = 1'-0\", 1 1/2\" = 1'-0\"), inženjerske (1\" = 20') i metričke (1:50) zapise koji odgovaraju predlošku. Kada list navodi više od jednog mjerila (plan s uvećanim detaljima), uzima ono koje navodi najčešće, a onaj napisan nakon riječi SCALE broji se dvostruko; ostali su prikazani crveno da ih provjerite. Skenirani list nema tekst: mjerilo postavite ručno. Kalibracija na poznatoj mjeri Koristite ovo kada nema tiskanog mjerila kojem vjerujete, kada je set promijenjene veličine ili kada list kaže „nije u mjerilu“, a ima dimenzije. Otvorite list i uvećajte dugu dimenziju koju znate, poput razmaka mreže ili ukupne dimenzije zgrade. Što je duža, to je točnije. Odaberite Kalibriraj u grupi Mjerilo, ili pritisnite K. Kliknite jedan kraj dimenzije. Uvećajte svaki kraj za preciznost; između klikova možete uvećavati i pomicati prikaz. Kliknite drugi kraj. Držite Shift da linija ostane pod 0°, 45° ili 90°. Otvara se dijaloški okvir Kalibriraj ovaj list. Upišite stvarnu udaljenost u Stvarna udaljenost, na primjer 24'-6 1/2\", 24.5 (decimalne stope), 30\" ili 7.5 m. Vidi Unos duljine, cijene i postotka. Odaberite Postavi mjerilo. Statusna traka prikazuje mjerilo kao „1\" = (n)'“, a kada je unutar 0.5% nekog predloška, kaže koji, na primjer „što odgovara 1/4\" = 1'-0\" (odaberite taj predložak za točno mjerilo)“. TakeoffDesk se vraća na alat Odaberi. Kada kalibracija odgovara predlošku, odabir tog predloška daje točno mjerilo umjesto onog koje ovisi o tome gdje ste kliknuli. Provjera mjerila Uvijek provjerite novo mjerilo na drugoj dimenziji. Odaberite Provjeri u grupi Mjerilo, ili pritisnite D. Kliknite oba kraja dimenzije ispisane na crtežu. Statusna traka prikazuje „Provjera: 12'-6\"“ s istom duljinom u decimalnim stopama i metrima, a linija provjere ostaje na listu s njezinom duljinom. Usporedite je s ispisanom dimenzijom. Ako se ne podudara, kalibrirajte na dužoj dimenziji. Pritisnite Esc da uklonite liniju provjere. Promjena mjerila Odaberite drugi predložak ili ponovno kalibrirajte. Ako list već ima mjerenja, TakeoffDesk pita Promijeniti mjerilo ovog lista? i kaže koliko će se mjerenja ponovno izmjeriti. Odaberite Promijeni mjerilo. Svaka dionica i površina na listu ponovno se mjeri na novom mjerilu. To možete poništiti s Ctrl+Z. Zašto listovi bez mjerila nisu brojeni kao nula Oznaka na listu bez mjerila nema stvarnu duljinu ili površinu. TakeoffDesk je nikad ne broji kao nulu, jer bi tiho učinio vaš predračun preniskim. Umjesto toga: izostavlja te oznake iz ukupnih iznosa, uz stavku u Količine prikazuje „+(n) bez mjerila“, u zaglavlju tablice prikazuje „Nepotpuno: (n) oznaka na listovima bez mjerila (nije uključeno u ukupne)“, upisuje broj u stupac bilješki izvezene tablice. Ovo se može dogoditi kada otvorite projekt čija mjerila nikada nisu postavljena. Dajte listu mjerilo i oznake se odmah broje. Oznake brojanja uvijek se broje; ne trebaju mjerilo. Savjeti Postavite mjerilo na svakom listu koji ćete mjeriti prije početka. Pregledajte popis listova za Nema mjerila da pronađete preostale (okvir za pretragu gleda nazive listova, a ne mjerila). Detalji i uvećani planovi na istom listu često koriste drugo mjerilo. TakeoffDesk ima jedno mjerilo po listu; vidi Što još nije izrađeno. Metrički crteži: odaberite metrički predložak poput 1:100, ili kalibrirajte metričkom udaljenošću poput 6000 mm.","lang":"hr"},{"slug":"create-items","scope":"takeoffcraft","title":"Create takeoff items","summary":"Make linear, area and count items and set their unit, height or depth, waste and material and labor rates.","section":"tasks","order":30,"keywords":["crew","production rate","crew size","wage","hours","man-hours","worker-hours","crew-days","labor hours","item","new item","condition","multi-condition","also measure","several types","room","linear","area","count","unit","height","depth","waste","material","labor","rate","color","cost"],"headings":[{"id":"typed-quantities-no-drawing","text":"Typed quantities (no drawing)","level":2},{"id":"make-an-item","text":"Make an item","level":2},{"id":"pick-the-item-you-draw-with","text":"Pick the item you draw with","level":2},{"id":"set-up-the-item","text":"Set up the item","level":2},{"id":"one-item-several-kinds-of-marks","text":"One item, several kinds of marks","level":2},{"id":"rates-in-the-table","text":"Rates in the table","level":2},{"id":"how-pricing-works","text":"How pricing works","level":2},{"id":"labor-by-crew","text":"Labor by crew","level":2},{"id":"metric-items","text":"Metric items","level":2},{"id":"next","text":"Next","level":2}],"html":"\u003Cp\u003EAn \u003Cstrong\u003Eitem\u003C/strong\u003E is one thing you measure and price: a wall type, a floor finish, a ceiling, a door, a light fixture. Every mark you draw belongs to an item. Other programs call these conditions.\u003C/p\u003E\n\u003Cp\u003EEach item has a type (and can take other kinds of marks too, see \u003Ca href=\"/tutorials/takeoffcraft/create-items#one-item-several-kinds-of-marks\" data-topic=\"takeoffcraft/create-items\" data-hash=\"one-item-several-kinds-of-marks\"\u003EOne item, several kinds of marks\u003C/a\u003E):\u003C/p\u003E\n\u003Cdiv class=\"ht-wrap\"\u003E\u003Ctable class=\"ht\"\u003E\u003Cthead\u003E\u003Ctr\u003E\u003Cth scope=\"col\"\u003EType\u003C/th\u003E\u003Cth scope=\"col\"\u003EYou draw\u003C/th\u003E\u003Cth scope=\"col\"\u003EIt reports\u003C/th\u003E\u003Cth scope=\"col\"\u003EUnits\u003C/th\u003E\u003C/tr\u003E\u003C/thead\u003E\u003Ctbody\u003E\u003Ctr\u003E\u003Ctd\u003ELinear\u003C/td\u003E\u003Ctd\u003ERuns of connected points\u003C/td\u003E\u003Ctd\u003ELength, number of runs, and wall area when it has a height\u003C/td\u003E\u003Ctd\u003ELF or m\u003C/td\u003E\u003C/tr\u003E\u003Ctr\u003E\u003Ctd\u003EArea\u003C/td\u003E\u003Ctd\u003EClosed outlines, with cut-outs\u003C/td\u003E\u003Ctd\u003EArea, perimeter, number of areas\u003C/td\u003E\u003Ctd\u003ESF, SY, SQ, ac, ha or m²\u003C/td\u003E\u003C/tr\u003E\u003Ctr\u003E\u003Ctd\u003ECount\u003C/td\u003E\u003Ctd\u003EOne click per thing\u003C/td\u003E\u003Ctd\u003EHow many\u003C/td\u003E\u003Ctd\u003EEA\u003C/td\u003E\u003C/tr\u003E\u003Ctr\u003E\u003Ctd\u003ETyped quantity\u003C/td\u003E\u003Ctd\u003ENothing: you type the quantity\u003C/td\u003E\u003Ctd\u003EThe number you typed (or one brought in from CivilCraft)\u003C/td\u003E\u003Ctd\u003ELS, EA, CY, m³, lb, TON, kg, t, LF, m, SF, SY, SQ, ac, ha or m²\u003C/td\u003E\u003C/tr\u003E\u003C/tbody\u003E\u003C/table\u003E\u003C/div\u003E\n\u003Ch2 id=\"typed-quantities-no-drawing\"\u003ETyped quantities (no drawing)\u003C/h2\u003E\n\u003Cp\u003ESome things in an estimate are never drawn: mobilization, permits, a contingency, a lump-sum subcontract, the cut and fill CivilCraft worked out. Make them a \u003Cstrong\u003ETyped quantity\u003C/strong\u003E:\u003C/p\u003E\n\u003Col\u003E\u003Cli\u003EChoose \u003Cspan class=\"hui\"\u003ENew item\u003C/span\u003E, type a name, pick \u003Cspan class=\"hui\"\u003ETyped quantity (no drawing)\u003C/span\u003E and choose \u003Cspan class=\"hui\"\u003EAdd\u003C/span\u003E.\u003C/li\u003E\u003Cli\u003EIn the item editor pick the \u003Cspan class=\"hui\"\u003EUnit\u003C/span\u003E (LS for a lump sum) and type the \u003Cspan class=\"hui\"\u003EQuantity\u003C/span\u003E: \u003Ccode\u003E1\u003C/code\u003E, \u003Ccode\u003E2.5\u003C/code\u003E or \u003Ccode\u003E1,250\u003C/code\u003E.\u003C/li\u003E\u003Cli\u003ESet waste and rates as for any other item. An assembly&#039;s formulas use \u003Ccode\u003EQ\u003C/code\u003E, the quantity, for example \u003Ccode\u003Eceil(Q / 12)\u003C/code\u003E truck loads.\u003C/li\u003E\u003C/ol\u003E\n\u003Cp\u003EA typed quantity takes no marks and never makes the estimate incomplete. When the takeoff has bid areas, the editor also has \u003Cspan class=\"hui\"\u003EBid area\u003C/span\u003E: the quantity then counts in that area, its alternates and its totals, just as a mark there would. Quantities brought in from another app say where they came from, see \u003Ca href=\"/tutorials/takeoffcraft/earthwork#cut-and-fill-from-civilcraft\" data-topic=\"takeoffcraft/earthwork\" data-hash=\"cut-and-fill-from-civilcraft\"\u003EEarthwork and spot elevations\u003C/a\u003E.\u003C/p\u003E\n\u003Ch2 id=\"make-an-item\"\u003EMake an item\u003C/h2\u003E\n\u003Col\u003E\u003Cli\u003EIn the \u003Cspan class=\"hui\"\u003EItems\u003C/span\u003E panel on the right, choose \u003Cspan class=\"hui\"\u003ENew item\u003C/span\u003E.\u003C/li\u003E\u003Cli\u003EType a name, like \u003Ccode\u003EInterior wall type A\u003C/code\u003E or \u003Ccode\u003ECarpet tile\u003C/code\u003E.\u003C/li\u003E\u003Cli\u003EPick the type: \u003Cspan class=\"hui\"\u003ELinear (length)\u003C/span\u003E, \u003Cspan class=\"hui\"\u003EArea\u003C/span\u003E or \u003Cspan class=\"hui\"\u003ECount\u003C/span\u003E.\u003C/li\u003E\u003Cli\u003EChoose \u003Cspan class=\"hui\"\u003EAdd\u003C/span\u003E (or press \u003Ckbd class=\"hk\"\u003E\u003Cspan class=\"k-mac\" title=\"Return\"\u003EReturn\u003C/span\u003E\u003Cspan class=\"k-pc\"\u003EEnter\u003C/span\u003E\u003C/kbd\u003E). The item appears in the list with its own color, becomes the item you draw with, and its editor opens below the list. The status bar tells you which tool to pick next.\u003C/li\u003E\u003C/ol\u003E\n\u003Cp\u003EPress \u003Ckbd class=\"hk\"\u003E\u003Cspan class=\"k-mac\" title=\"Esc\"\u003EEsc\u003C/span\u003E\u003Cspan class=\"k-pc\"\u003EEsc\u003C/span\u003E\u003C/kbd\u003E in the form to close it without adding an item.\u003C/p\u003E\n\u003Caside class=\"hc hc-tip\"\u003E\u003Cp class=\"hc-label\"\u003ETip\u003C/p\u003E\n\u003Cp\u003EIf you pick a measuring tool first, TakeoffDesk uses the last item of the right type, or opens the \u003Cspan class=\"hui\"\u003ENew item\u003C/span\u003E form with that type already chosen.\u003C/p\u003E\n\u003C/aside\u003E\n\u003Ch2 id=\"pick-the-item-you-draw-with\"\u003EPick the item you draw with\u003C/h2\u003E\n\u003Cp\u003EClick an item in the list. It becomes the item new marks go to, and its marks are highlighted on every sheet while the others fade. The view stays where it is: if the open sheet has none of its marks, the status bar says so and the sheet list shows how many each sheet has. Click the item again to stop highlighting; it stays the item you draw with.\u003C/p\u003E\n\u003Cp\u003EClicking a mark with the \u003Cspan class=\"hui\"\u003ESelect\u003C/span\u003E tool also makes its item the current one.\u003C/p\u003E\n\u003Ch2 id=\"set-up-the-item\"\u003ESet up the item\u003C/h2\u003E\n\u003Cp\u003EThe item editor (\u003Cstrong\u003EItem: (name)\u003C/strong\u003E) has these fields. Each one is saved when you leave the field or press \u003Ckbd class=\"hk\"\u003E\u003Cspan class=\"k-mac\" title=\"Return\"\u003EReturn\u003C/span\u003E\u003Cspan class=\"k-pc\"\u003EEnter\u003C/span\u003E\u003C/kbd\u003E, and each change can be undone.\u003C/p\u003E\n\u003Cdiv class=\"ht-wrap\"\u003E\u003Ctable class=\"ht\"\u003E\u003Cthead\u003E\u003Ctr\u003E\u003Cth scope=\"col\"\u003EField\u003C/th\u003E\u003Cth scope=\"col\"\u003EWhat it does\u003C/th\u003E\u003C/tr\u003E\u003C/thead\u003E\u003Ctbody\u003E\u003Ctr\u003E\u003Ctd\u003E\u003Cspan class=\"hui\"\u003EName\u003C/span\u003E\u003C/td\u003E\u003Ctd\u003EShown in the list, the tables and the exports.\u003C/td\u003E\u003C/tr\u003E\u003Ctr\u003E\u003Ctd\u003E\u003Cspan class=\"hui\"\u003EType\u003C/span\u003E\u003C/td\u003E\u003Ctd\u003ELinear, Area or Count. It is locked once the item has marks (&quot;An item with marks keeps its type&quot;).\u003C/td\u003E\u003C/tr\u003E\u003Ctr\u003E\u003Ctd\u003E\u003Cspan class=\"hui\"\u003EColor\u003C/span\u003E\u003C/td\u003E\u003Ctd\u003EThe color of its marks on screen and in the marked PDF.\u003C/td\u003E\u003C/tr\u003E\u003Ctr\u003E\u003Ctd\u003E\u003Cspan class=\"hui\"\u003EUnit\u003C/span\u003E\u003C/td\u003E\u003Ctd\u003EWhat the quantity is reported in: LF or m for linear; SF, SY, SQ, ac, ha or m² for area; EA for count.\u003C/td\u003E\u003C/tr\u003E\u003Ctr\u003E\u003Ctd\u003E\u003Cspan class=\"hui\"\u003EAlso measure\u003C/span\u003E\u003C/td\u003E\u003Ctd\u003EThe other kinds of marks the item takes, each with its own unit. See below.\u003C/td\u003E\u003C/tr\u003E\u003Ctr\u003E\u003Ctd\u003E\u003Cspan class=\"hui\"\u003EHeight\u003C/span\u003E (linear)\u003C/td\u003E\u003Ctd\u003EA wall height. The item then also reports wall area (length × height). Runs that came from a BimCraft model carry their doors and windows: those are taken out once, and the item says the gross area, the openings and the net. A takeoff from a BimCraft project that chose a measurement method is measured by that method here too (the note names it, with its source, and says it is unchecked by a quantity surveyor); the method cannot be changed in TakeoffDesk. Bricks or blocks and mortar from a wall type arrive as two components: the units to order and the mortar volume.\u003C/td\u003E\u003C/tr\u003E\u003Ctr\u003E\u003Ctd\u003E\u003Cspan class=\"hui\"\u003EDepth\u003C/span\u003E (area)\u003C/td\u003E\u003Ctd\u003EA depth or thickness, used in assembly formulas (for example concrete volume).\u003C/td\u003E\u003C/tr\u003E\u003Ctr\u003E\u003Ctd\u003E\u003Cspan class=\"hui\"\u003EWaste %\u003C/span\u003E\u003C/td\u003E\u003Ctd\u003EAdded to the quantity before pricing: 10 means quantity × 1.10.\u003C/td\u003E\u003C/tr\u003E\u003Ctr\u003E\u003Ctd\u003E\u003Cspan class=\"hui\"\u003EMaterial $/LF\u003C/span\u003E\u003C/td\u003E\u003Ctd\u003EMaterial cost per unit. The label follows the unit: $/SF, $/EA and so on.\u003C/td\u003E\u003C/tr\u003E\u003Ctr\u003E\u003Ctd\u003E\u003Cspan class=\"hui\"\u003ELabor $/LF\u003C/span\u003E\u003C/td\u003E\u003Ctd\u003ELabor cost per unit.\u003C/td\u003E\u003C/tr\u003E\u003Ctr\u003E\u003Ctd\u003E\u003Cspan class=\"hui\"\u003ECSI number\u003C/span\u003E\u003C/td\u003E\u003Ctd\u003EIts CSI MasterFormat number, like \u003Ccode\u003E09 21 16\u003C/code\u003E (or just the division, \u003Ccode\u003E09\u003C/code\u003E). The workbook&#039;s By division worksheet groups costs by it. Items from \u003Ca href=\"/tutorials/takeoffcraft/trade-packs\" data-topic=\"takeoffcraft/trade-packs\"\u003Etrade packs\u003C/a\u003E have one already.\u003C/td\u003E\u003C/tr\u003E\u003C/tbody\u003E\u003C/table\u003E\u003C/div\u003E\n\u003Cp\u003EHeight and depth take feet and inches (\u003Ccode\u003E9&#039;-0&quot;\u003C/code\u003E, \u003Ccode\u003E8&#039; 6&quot;\u003C/code\u003E) or decimal feet (\u003Ccode\u003E9\u003C/code\u003E) for imperial units, and meters (\u003Ccode\u003E2.7\u003C/code\u003E, \u003Ccode\u003E2700 mm\u003C/code\u003E) for metric units. Rates take amounts like \u003Ccode\u003E12.50\u003C/code\u003E or \u003Ccode\u003E$1,250\u003C/code\u003E, up to four decimals. See \u003Ca href=\"/tutorials/takeoffcraft/entry-formats\" data-topic=\"takeoffcraft/entry-formats\"\u003ELength, rate and percent entry\u003C/a\u003E.\u003C/p\u003E\n\u003Cp\u003EBelow the fields, \u003Cstrong\u003EMeasured\u003C/strong\u003E shows the totals the item&#039;s formulas can use, with their letters: Length (L), Runs (N), Wall area (A) for linear; Area (A), Perimeter (P), Areas (N) for area; Count (N) for count.\u003C/p\u003E\n\u003Ch2 id=\"one-item-several-kinds-of-marks\"\u003EOne item, several kinds of marks\u003C/h2\u003E\n\u003Cp\u003ESome things are measured more than one way: a room has a floor (an area), a base along its walls (a length) and doors (a count). Instead of three items, make one:\u003C/p\u003E\n\u003Col\u003E\u003Cli\u003EMake the item with its main type, such as an area item \u003Ccode\u003ERoom 101\u003C/code\u003E.\u003C/li\u003E\u003Cli\u003EUnder \u003Cspan class=\"hui\"\u003EAlso measure\u003C/span\u003E in its editor, tick \u003Cspan class=\"hui\"\u003ELinear\u003C/span\u003E, \u003Cspan class=\"hui\"\u003ECount\u003C/span\u003E or both. Each one gets a unit next to it.\u003C/li\u003E\u003Cli\u003EDraw with any tool whose kind the item takes: with \u003Ccode\u003ERoom 101\u003C/code\u003E current, \u003Cspan class=\"hui\"\u003EArea\u003C/span\u003E draws its floor, \u003Cspan class=\"hui\"\u003ELinear\u003C/span\u003E its base and \u003Cspan class=\"hui\"\u003ECount\u003C/span\u003E its doors. TakeoffDesk does not ask for another item.\u003C/li\u003E\u003C/ol\u003E\n\u003Cp\u003EThe items list shows every quantity (\u003Ccode\u003E50.00 SF + 2 EA\u003C/code\u003E). In the quantities table the item&#039;s row has its main quantity, and each other kind gets its own row below it, such as \u003Cstrong\u003ERoom 101 (count)\u003C/strong\u003E, with its own waste and material and labor rates. The exports, the per-sheet table and the marked PDF&#039;s legend list them the same way.\u003C/p\u003E\n\u003Cp\u003EThe main type&#039;s fields stay the main type&#039;s own: the height or depth, the pitch, back-outs and the 3D shape apply to its marks only. A base run drawn for an area item is measured plainly along the plan, and shows flat in 3D. Assembly formulas use the main type&#039;s totals.\u003C/p\u003E\n\u003Cp\u003EA kind can be unticked only while the item has no marks of it; delete them, or move them to another item under \u003Cstrong\u003ESelected mark\u003C/strong\u003E, first. Marks can move to any item that takes their kind.\u003C/p\u003E\n\u003Cp\u003EFurther down is the \u003Cspan class=\"hui\"\u003EAssembly\u003C/span\u003E: components such as studs or board, each with its own formula and rates. See \u003Ca href=\"/tutorials/takeoffcraft/assemblies\" data-topic=\"takeoffcraft/assemblies\"\u003EAssemblies and formulas\u003C/a\u003E.\u003C/p\u003E\n\u003Cp\u003EAt the bottom: \u003Cspan class=\"hui\"\u003EMove up\u003C/span\u003E and \u003Cspan class=\"hui\"\u003EMove down\u003C/span\u003E change the item&#039;s place in the list and in the exports, and \u003Cspan class=\"hui\"\u003EDelete item\u003C/span\u003E removes it with all its marks (after asking; you can undo it).\u003C/p\u003E\n\u003Cp\u003EArea items also have \u003Cstrong\u003EPitch\u003C/strong\u003E (roof planes measured on the slope: \u003Ca href=\"/tutorials/takeoffcraft/roofs-and-slopes\" data-topic=\"takeoffcraft/roofs-and-slopes\"\u003ERoofs and slopes\u003C/a\u003E) and \u003Cstrong\u003EBack-out\u003C/strong\u003E (their marks come off other items&#039; areas: \u003Ca href=\"/tutorials/takeoffcraft/measure-areas#back-outs-columns-shafts-and-openings-taken-out-of-several-items\" data-topic=\"takeoffcraft/measure-areas\" data-hash=\"back-outs-columns-shafts-and-openings-taken-out-of-several-items\"\u003EMeasure areas\u003C/a\u003E). Linear items have \u003Cstrong\u003ESlope\u003C/strong\u003E (Level, Rake, Hip or valley) and, for rakes and hips, \u003Cstrong\u003EPitch\u003C/strong\u003E.\u003C/p\u003E\n\u003Ch2 id=\"rates-in-the-table\"\u003ERates in the table\u003C/h2\u003E\n\u003Cp\u003EYou can also type \u003Cspan class=\"hui\"\u003EWaste %\u003C/span\u003E, material and labor rates straight into the \u003Cspan class=\"hui\"\u003EQuantities\u003C/span\u003E table at the bottom (\u003Cspan class=\"hui\"\u003EBy item\u003C/span\u003E). It is the same setting as in the editor.\u003C/p\u003E\n\u003Ch2 id=\"how-pricing-works\"\u003EHow pricing works\u003C/h2\u003E\n\u003Cp\u003EFor each item and each assembly component:\u003C/p\u003E\n\u003Col\u003E\u003Cli\u003E\u003Cstrong\u003EWith waste\u003C/strong\u003E = quantity × (1 + waste %).\u003C/li\u003E\u003Cli\u003E\u003Cstrong\u003EMaterial\u003C/strong\u003E = with waste × material per unit, rounded to the cent.\u003C/li\u003E\u003Cli\u003E\u003Cstrong\u003ELabor\u003C/strong\u003E = with waste × labor per unit, rounded to the cent.\u003C/li\u003E\u003Cli\u003E\u003Cstrong\u003ETotal\u003C/strong\u003E = material + labor.\u003C/li\u003E\u003C/ol\u003E\n\u003Cp\u003EThe \u003Cspan class=\"hui\"\u003EJob total\u003C/span\u003E adds every item and every component. An item can carry its own rates and an assembly at the same time; both are counted, so leave the item&#039;s rates at 0 when its components carry the cost.\u003C/p\u003E\n\u003Ch2 id=\"labor-by-crew\"\u003ELabor by crew\u003C/h2\u003E\n\u003Cp\u003EInstead of a labor rate per unit, an item&#039;s labor can come from a crew: how much it puts in per hour, how many people, and what each earns. Under \u003Cspan class=\"hui\"\u003ELabor by crew\u003C/span\u003E in the item editor, tick \u003Cspan class=\"hui\"\u003EPrice labor from a crew\u003C/span\u003E and fill in:\u003C/p\u003E\n\u003Cdiv class=\"ht-wrap\"\u003E\u003Ctable class=\"ht\"\u003E\u003Cthead\u003E\u003Ctr\u003E\u003Cth scope=\"col\"\u003EField\u003C/th\u003E\u003Cth scope=\"col\"\u003EExample\u003C/th\u003E\u003C/tr\u003E\u003C/thead\u003E\u003Ctbody\u003E\u003Ctr\u003E\u003Ctd\u003E\u003Cspan class=\"hui\"\u003EProduction\u003C/span\u003E\u003C/td\u003E\u003Ctd\u003E\u003Ccode\u003E20\u003C/code\u003E LF an hour (in the item&#039;s unit) for the whole crew\u003C/td\u003E\u003C/tr\u003E\u003Ctr\u003E\u003Ctd\u003E\u003Cspan class=\"hui\"\u003ECrew size\u003C/span\u003E\u003C/td\u003E\u003Ctd\u003E\u003Ccode\u003E2\u003C/code\u003E people\u003C/td\u003E\u003C/tr\u003E\u003Ctr\u003E\u003Ctd\u003E\u003Cspan class=\"hui\"\u003EWage $/hour each\u003C/span\u003E\u003C/td\u003E\u003Ctd\u003E\u003Ccode\u003E45\u003C/code\u003E\u003C/td\u003E\u003C/tr\u003E\u003C/tbody\u003E\u003C/table\u003E\u003C/div\u003E\n\u003Cp\u003ETakeoffDesk works out, from the quantity with waste:\u003C/p\u003E\n\u003Cul\u003E\u003Cli\u003E\u003Cstrong\u003Ecrew-hours\u003C/strong\u003E = quantity ÷ production (110 LF ÷ 20 = 5.5),\u003C/li\u003E\u003Cli\u003E\u003Cstrong\u003Eworker-hours\u003C/strong\u003E = crew-hours × crew size (11),\u003C/li\u003E\u003Cli\u003E\u003Cstrong\u003Ecrew-days\u003C/strong\u003E = crew-hours ÷ 8 (0.69),\u003C/li\u003E\u003Cli\u003E\u003Cstrong\u003Elabor\u003C/strong\u003E = worker-hours × wage ($495.00).\u003C/li\u003E\u003C/ul\u003E\n\u003Cp\u003EThe editor shows the result and the rate it comes to ($4.50/LF). The item&#039;s own labor rate is then read-only, in the editor and in the table. The header of the \u003Cspan class=\"hui\"\u003EQuantities\u003C/span\u003E table adds the job&#039;s worker-hours and crew-days. The exports note each crew&#039;s hours, and in the workbook the labor cell is a formula on the crew (\u003Ccode\u003EROUND(F2/20*2*45,2)\u003C/code\u003E). Untick the box to go back to a rate per unit.\u003C/p\u003E\n\u003Ch2 id=\"metric-items\"\u003EMetric items\u003C/h2\u003E\n\u003Cp\u003EPick m (linear) or m² (area) as the unit. Quantities, heights and formula values are then in meters. The sheet scale can be any preset or calibration; units and scales are independent.\u003C/p\u003E\n\u003Ch2 id=\"next\"\u003ENext\u003C/h2\u003E\n\u003Cul\u003E\u003Cli\u003E\u003Ca href=\"/tutorials/takeoffcraft/measure-linear\" data-topic=\"takeoffcraft/measure-linear\"\u003EMeasure linear runs\u003C/a\u003E\u003C/li\u003E\u003Cli\u003E\u003Ca href=\"/tutorials/takeoffcraft/measure-areas\" data-topic=\"takeoffcraft/measure-areas\"\u003EMeasure areas with cut-outs\u003C/a\u003E\u003C/li\u003E\u003Cli\u003E\u003Ca href=\"/tutorials/takeoffcraft/count-by-hand\" data-topic=\"takeoffcraft/count-by-hand\"\u003ECount by hand\u003C/a\u003E\u003C/li\u003E\u003C/ul\u003E","text":"An item is one thing you measure and price: a wall type, a floor finish, a ceiling, a door, a light fixture. Every mark you draw belongs to an item. Other programs call these conditions. Each item has a type (and can take other kinds of marks too, see One item, several kinds of marks): Type You draw It reports Units Linear Runs of connected points Length, number of runs, and wall area when it has a height LF or m Area Closed outlines, with cut-outs Area, perimeter, number of areas SF, SY, SQ, ac, ha or m² Count One click per thing How many EA Typed quantity Nothing: you type the quantity The number you typed (or one brought in from CivilCraft) LS, EA, CY, m³, lb, TON, kg, t, LF, m, SF, SY, SQ, ac, ha or m² Typed quantities (no drawing) Some things in an estimate are never drawn: mobilization, permits, a contingency, a lump-sum subcontract, the cut and fill CivilCraft worked out. Make them a Typed quantity: Choose New item, type a name, pick Typed quantity (no drawing) and choose Add. In the item editor pick the Unit (LS for a lump sum) and type the Quantity: 1, 2.5 or 1,250. Set waste and rates as for any other item. An assembly's formulas use Q, the quantity, for example ceil(Q / 12) truck loads. A typed quantity takes no marks and never makes the estimate incomplete. When the takeoff has bid areas, the editor also has Bid area: the quantity then counts in that area, its alternates and its totals, just as a mark there would. Quantities brought in from another app say where they came from, see Earthwork and spot elevations. Make an item In the Items panel on the right, choose New item. Type a name, like Interior wall type A or Carpet tile. Pick the type: Linear (length), Area or Count. Choose Add (or press Enter). The item appears in the list with its own color, becomes the item you draw with, and its editor opens below the list. The status bar tells you which tool to pick next. Press Esc in the form to close it without adding an item. If you pick a measuring tool first, TakeoffDesk uses the last item of the right type, or opens the New item form with that type already chosen. Pick the item you draw with Click an item in the list. It becomes the item new marks go to, and its marks are highlighted on every sheet while the others fade. The view stays where it is: if the open sheet has none of its marks, the status bar says so and the sheet list shows how many each sheet has. Click the item again to stop highlighting; it stays the item you draw with. Clicking a mark with the Select tool also makes its item the current one. Set up the item The item editor (Item: (name)) has these fields. Each one is saved when you leave the field or press Enter, and each change can be undone. Field What it does Name Shown in the list, the tables and the exports. Type Linear, Area or Count. It is locked once the item has marks (\"An item with marks keeps its type\"). Color The color of its marks on screen and in the marked PDF. Unit What the quantity is reported in: LF or m for linear; SF, SY, SQ, ac, ha or m² for area; EA for count. Also measure The other kinds of marks the item takes, each with its own unit. See below. Height (linear) A wall height. The item then also reports wall area (length × height). Runs that came from a BimCraft model carry their doors and windows: those are taken out once, and the item says the gross area, the openings and the net. A takeoff from a BimCraft project that chose a measurement method is measured by that method here too (the note names it, with its source, and says it is unchecked by a quantity surveyor); the method cannot be changed in TakeoffDesk. Bricks or blocks and mortar from a wall type arrive as two components: the units to order and the mortar volume. Depth (area) A depth or thickness, used in assembly formulas (for example concrete volume). Waste % Added to the quantity before pricing: 10 means quantity × 1.10. Material $/LF Material cost per unit. The label follows the unit: $/SF, $/EA and so on. Labor $/LF Labor cost per unit. CSI number Its CSI MasterFormat number, like 09 21 16 (or just the division, 09). The workbook's By division worksheet groups costs by it. Items from trade packs have one already. Height and depth take feet and inches (9'-0\", 8' 6\") or decimal feet (9) for imperial units, and meters (2.7, 2700 mm) for metric units. Rates take amounts like 12.50 or $1,250, up to four decimals. See Length, rate and percent entry. Below the fields, Measured shows the totals the item's formulas can use, with their letters: Length (L), Runs (N), Wall area (A) for linear; Area (A), Perimeter (P), Areas (N) for area; Count (N) for count. One item, several kinds of marks Some things are measured more than one way: a room has a floor (an area), a base along its walls (a length) and doors (a count). Instead of three items, make one: Make the item with its main type, such as an area item Room 101. Under Also measure in its editor, tick Linear, Count or both. Each one gets a unit next to it. Draw with any tool whose kind the item takes: with Room 101 current, Area draws its floor, Linear its base and Count its doors. TakeoffDesk does not ask for another item. The items list shows every quantity (50.00 SF + 2 EA). In the quantities table the item's row has its main quantity, and each other kind gets its own row below it, such as Room 101 (count), with its own waste and material and labor rates. The exports, the per-sheet table and the marked PDF's legend list them the same way. The main type's fields stay the main type's own: the height or depth, the pitch, back-outs and the 3D shape apply to its marks only. A base run drawn for an area item is measured plainly along the plan, and shows flat in 3D. Assembly formulas use the main type's totals. A kind can be unticked only while the item has no marks of it; delete them, or move them to another item under Selected mark, first. Marks can move to any item that takes their kind. Further down is the Assembly: components such as studs or board, each with its own formula and rates. See Assemblies and formulas. At the bottom: Move up and Move down change the item's place in the list and in the exports, and Delete item removes it with all its marks (after asking; you can undo it). Area items also have Pitch (roof planes measured on the slope: Roofs and slopes) and Back-out (their marks come off other items' areas: Measure areas). Linear items have Slope (Level, Rake, Hip or valley) and, for rakes and hips, Pitch. Rates in the table You can also type Waste %, material and labor rates straight into the Quantities table at the bottom (By item). It is the same setting as in the editor. How pricing works For each item and each assembly component: With waste = quantity × (1 + waste %). Material = with waste × material per unit, rounded to the cent. Labor = with waste × labor per unit, rounded to the cent. Total = material + labor. The Job total adds every item and every component. An item can carry its own rates and an assembly at the same time; both are counted, so leave the item's rates at 0 when its components carry the cost. Labor by crew Instead of a labor rate per unit, an item's labor can come from a crew: how much it puts in per hour, how many people, and what each earns. Under Labor by crew in the item editor, tick Price labor from a crew and fill in: Field Example Production 20 LF an hour (in the item's unit) for the whole crew Crew size 2 people Wage $/hour each 45 TakeoffDesk works out, from the quantity with waste: crew-hours = quantity ÷ production (110 LF ÷ 20 = 5.5), worker-hours = crew-hours × crew size (11), crew-days = crew-hours ÷ 8 (0.69), labor = worker-hours × wage ($495.00). The editor shows the result and the rate it comes to ($4.50/LF). The item's own labor rate is then read-only, in the editor and in the table. The header of the Quantities table adds the job's worker-hours and crew-days. The exports note each crew's hours, and in the workbook the labor cell is a formula on the crew (ROUND(F2/20*2*45,2)). Untick the box to go back to a rate per unit. Metric items Pick m (linear) or m² (area) as the unit. Quantities, heights and formula values are then in meters. The sheet scale can be any preset or calibration; units and scales are independent. Next Measure linear runs Measure areas with cut-outs Count by hand","lang":"en"},{"slug":"measure-from-a-drawing","scope":"takeoffcraft","title":"Mjerenje iz crteža","summary":"Uzmite duljine i površine iz vlastitih linija, lukova, polilinija i šrafura crteža odabirom objekata, uz točne lukove i rupe, umjesto ocrtavanja klikovima.","section":"tasks","order":33,"keywords":["mjeri crtež","geometrija","polilinija","luk","kružnica","šrafura","bulge","točna duljina","točna površina","odabir","prozor","ocrtavanje","iz CAD-a","linearno","površina"],"headings":[{"id":"uzmite-objekte-kao-linearnu-ili-povr-insku-stavku","text":"Uzmite objekte kao linearnu ili površinsku stavku","level":2},{"id":"to-uzima-svaka-vrsta-stavke","text":"Što uzima svaka vrsta stavke","level":2},{"id":"to-no-i-gotovo-to-no","text":"Točno i gotovo točno","level":2},{"id":"odakle-to-uzima","text":"Odakle što uzima","level":2}],"html":"\u003Cp\u003E\u003Cspan class=\"hui\"\u003EMjeri crtež\u003C/span\u003E na traci lista DWG ili DXF lista uzima objekte samog crteža kao oznake, pa ih ne morate ocrtavati klikovima. Duljina polilinije, duljina luka, površina kružnice i površina šrafure s rupama dolaze točno, iz iste aritmetike koju predmjer koristi za svaku oznaku.\u003C/p\u003E\n\u003Ch2 id=\"uzmite-objekte-kao-linearnu-ili-povr-insku-stavku\"\u003EUzmite objekte kao linearnu ili površinsku stavku\u003C/h2\u003E\n\u003Col\u003E\u003Cli\u003ENapravite ili kliknite \u003Cstrong\u003Elinearnu\u003C/strong\u003E ili \u003Cstrong\u003Epovršinsku\u003C/strong\u003E stavku pod \u003Cspan class=\"hui\"\u003EStavke\u003C/span\u003E. List treba mjerilo.\u003C/li\u003E\u003Cli\u003EOdaberite \u003Cspan class=\"hui\"\u003EMjeri crtež\u003C/span\u003E.\u003C/li\u003E\u003Cli\u003EKliknite objekte na listu da ih odaberete ili povucite prozor oko njih: sve što je potpuno unutra bit će odabrano. \u003Ckbd class=\"hk\"\u003E\u003Cspan class=\"k-mac\" title=\"Shift\"\u003E⇧\u003C/span\u003E\u003Cspan class=\"k-pc\"\u003EShift\u003C/span\u003E\u003C/kbd\u003E dodaje prozor odabiru; kliknite ponovno odabrani objekt da ga uklonite. Traka prikazuje ukupno: „Dionica: 6, ukupno 108&#039;-9 1/8&quot;.“\u003C/li\u003E\u003Cli\u003EOdaberite gumb za dodavanje koji navodi broj i stavku, npr. \u003Cspan class=\"hui\"\u003EDodaj 6 u Edge\u003C/span\u003E (ili pritisnite \u003Ckbd class=\"hk\"\u003E\u003Cspan class=\"k-mac\" title=\"Return\"\u003EReturn\u003C/span\u003E\u003Cspan class=\"k-pc\"\u003EEnter\u003C/span\u003E\u003C/kbd\u003E). Svaki objekt postaje jedna oznaka stavke, u jednom koraku poništavanja. \u003Ckbd class=\"hk\"\u003E\u003Cspan class=\"k-mac\" title=\"Esc\"\u003EEsc\u003C/span\u003E\u003Cspan class=\"k-pc\"\u003EEsc\u003C/span\u003E\u003C/kbd\u003E briše ono što ste odabrali.\u003C/li\u003E\u003C/ol\u003E\n\u003Ch2 id=\"to-uzima-svaka-vrsta-stavke\"\u003EŠto uzima svaka vrsta stavke\u003C/h2\u003E\n\u003Cul\u003E\u003Cli\u003E\u003Cstrong\u003ELinearna\u003C/strong\u003E stavka uzima linije, lukove, polilinije, kružnice i krivulje po duljini. Zatvoreni oblik broji se po opsegu. Šrafura je izostavljena: ima površinu, a ne duljinu, pa traka to kaže.\u003C/li\u003E\u003Cli\u003E\u003Cstrong\u003EPovršinska\u003C/strong\u003E stavka uzima zatvorene oblike: zatvorene polilinije, kružnice, 2D tijela i šrafure s rupama. Otvoreni nizovi su izostavljeni, i traka to kaže.\u003C/li\u003E\u003C/ul\u003E\n\u003Ch2 id=\"to-no-i-gotovo-to-no\"\u003ETočno i gotovo točno\u003C/h2\u003E\n\u003Cp\u003ELinije, lukovi (bilo koji bulge), polilinije s bulgeom i kružnice su točne: duljine i površine koriste polumjer i raspon luka, a ne sliku. Elipse, spline i šrafure čija se granica sastoji od rubova mjere se u tetivama od jednog stupnja ili finijim, što je unutar stotinke postotka za elipse i desetinke za ostalo; traka kaže koliko odabranih objekata su krivulje te vrste.\u003C/p\u003E\n\u003Ch2 id=\"odakle-to-uzima\"\u003EOdakle što uzima\u003C/h2\u003E\n\u003Cul\u003E\u003Cli\u003E\u003Cstrong\u003EModel\u003C/strong\u003E: objekti u prostoru modela. \u003Cstrong\u003ELayout\u003C/strong\u003E: vlastite linije i objekti modela unutar prikaza (viewporta), skalirani kroz njega. Objekt koji prelazi rub prikaza se ne nudi (ispisao bi se odrezan); objekt koji oba prikaza prikazuju uzima se jednom.\u003C/li\u003E\u003Cli\u003ESamo slojevi koje list prikazuje. Blokovi se broje, ne mjere: pogledajte \u003Ca href=\"/tutorials/takeoffcraft/count-from-a-drawing\" data-topic=\"takeoffcraft/count-from-a-drawing\"\u003EBrojanje iz crteža\u003C/a\u003E. 3D polilinije, mreže, tijela i regije se ne nude.\u003C/li\u003E\u003C/ul\u003E","text":"Mjeri crtež na traci lista DWG ili DXF lista uzima objekte samog crteža kao oznake, pa ih ne morate ocrtavati klikovima. Duljina polilinije, duljina luka, površina kružnice i površina šrafure s rupama dolaze točno, iz iste aritmetike koju predmjer koristi za svaku oznaku. Uzmite objekte kao linearnu ili površinsku stavku Napravite ili kliknite linearnu ili površinsku stavku pod Stavke. List treba mjerilo. Odaberite Mjeri crtež. Kliknite objekte na listu da ih odaberete ili povucite prozor oko njih: sve što je potpuno unutra bit će odabrano. Shift dodaje prozor odabiru; kliknite ponovno odabrani objekt da ga uklonite. Traka prikazuje ukupno: „Dionica: 6, ukupno 108'-9 1/8\".“ Odaberite gumb za dodavanje koji navodi broj i stavku, npr. Dodaj 6 u Edge (ili pritisnite Enter). Svaki objekt postaje jedna oznaka stavke, u jednom koraku poništavanja. Esc briše ono što ste odabrali. Što uzima svaka vrsta stavke Linearna stavka uzima linije, lukove, polilinije, kružnice i krivulje po duljini. Zatvoreni oblik broji se po opsegu. Šrafura je izostavljena: ima površinu, a ne duljinu, pa traka to kaže. Površinska stavka uzima zatvorene oblike: zatvorene polilinije, kružnice, 2D tijela i šrafure s rupama. Otvoreni nizovi su izostavljeni, i traka to kaže. Točno i gotovo točno Linije, lukovi (bilo koji bulge), polilinije s bulgeom i kružnice su točne: duljine i površine koriste polumjer i raspon luka, a ne sliku. Elipse, spline i šrafure čija se granica sastoji od rubova mjere se u tetivama od jednog stupnja ili finijim, što je unutar stotinke postotka za elipse i desetinke za ostalo; traka kaže koliko odabranih objekata su krivulje te vrste. Odakle što uzima Model: objekti u prostoru modela. Layout: vlastite linije i objekti modela unutar prikaza (viewporta), skalirani kroz njega. Objekt koji prelazi rub prikaza se ne nudi (ispisao bi se odrezan); objekt koji oba prikaza prikazuju uzima se jednom. Samo slojevi koje list prikazuje. Blokovi se broje, ne mjere: pogledajte Brojanje iz crteža. 3D polilinije, mreže, tijela i regije se ne nude.","lang":"hr"},{"slug":"snap-to-the-drawing","scope":"takeoffcraft","title":"Hvatanje na linije crteža","summary":"Točke pri mjerenju ili kalibraciji skaču na vlastite linije PDF-a: krajeve, polovišta, sjecišta ili bilo koju točku na liniji, uz oznaku koja pokazuje o čemu se radi.","section":"tasks","order":35,"keywords":["hvatanje","osnap","hvatanje objekata","krajnja točka","polovište","sjecište","najbliže","vektor","linije crteža","linije","precizno","točno","f3","magnet","kut"],"headings":[{"id":"na-to-hvata","text":"Na što hvata","level":2},{"id":"gdje-radi","text":"Gdje radi","level":2},{"id":"listovi-na-kojima-hvatanje-ne-radi","text":"Listovi na kojima hvatanje ne radi","level":2}],"html":"\u003Cp\u003EVećina skupova planova su vektorski PDF-ovi: njihovi zidovi i rubovi su stvarne linije, a ne pikseli. Dok mjerite, TakeoffDesk hvata vaše klikove na te linije, pa trasa počinje točno u kutu zida, a kalibracija očitava kotu koju je projektant nacrtao, a ne piksel na koji ste kliknuli.\u003C/p\u003E\n\u003Cp\u003EHvatanje je uključeno kad počnete. Uključite ga i isključite pomoću \u003Cspan class=\"hui\"\u003EHvatanje\u003C/span\u003E u statusnoj traci ili pomoću \u003Ckbd class=\"hk\"\u003E\u003Cspan class=\"k-mac\" title=\"F3\"\u003EF3\u003C/span\u003E\u003Cspan class=\"k-pc\"\u003EF3\u003C/span\u003E\u003C/kbd\u003E; postavka se čuva u ovom pregledniku (nalazi se i pod \u003Ca href=\"/tutorials/takeoffcraft/settings\" data-topic=\"takeoffcraft/settings\"\u003EPostavke\u003C/a\u003E).\u003C/p\u003E\n\u003Ch2 id=\"na-to-hvata\"\u003ENa što hvata\u003C/h2\u003E\n\u003Cp\u003EKad se pokazivač nađe unutar otprilike 10 piksela na zaslonu od linije, prikazuje se oznaka koja pokazuje gdje će klik pasti, s njezinim nazivom:\u003C/p\u003E\n\u003Cdiv class=\"ht-wrap\"\u003E\u003Ctable class=\"ht\"\u003E\u003Cthead\u003E\u003Ctr\u003E\u003Cth scope=\"col\"\u003EOznaka\u003C/th\u003E\u003Cth scope=\"col\"\u003ENaziv\u003C/th\u003E\u003Cth scope=\"col\"\u003EGdje\u003C/th\u003E\u003C/tr\u003E\u003C/thead\u003E\u003Ctbody\u003E\u003Ctr\u003E\u003Ctd\u003EKvadrat\u003C/td\u003E\u003Ctd\u003E\u003Cstrong\u003EKraj\u003C/strong\u003E\u003C/td\u003E\u003Ctd\u003EKraj linije ili kut na kojem se linije spajaju. Oba kraja krivulje se broje; točke duž nje ne.\u003C/td\u003E\u003C/tr\u003E\u003Ctr\u003E\u003Ctd\u003ETrokut\u003C/td\u003E\u003Ctd\u003E\u003Cstrong\u003EPolovište\u003C/strong\u003E\u003C/td\u003E\u003Ctd\u003ESredina ravne linije.\u003C/td\u003E\u003C/tr\u003E\u003Ctr\u003E\u003Ctd\u003EKriž\u003C/td\u003E\u003Ctd\u003E\u003Cstrong\u003ESjecište\u003C/strong\u003E\u003C/td\u003E\u003Ctd\u003EMjesto gdje se dvije linije sijeku ili gdje jedna završava na drugoj.\u003C/td\u003E\u003C/tr\u003E\u003Ctr\u003E\u003Ctd\u003EPješčani sat\u003C/td\u003E\u003Ctd\u003E\u003Cstrong\u003ENa liniji\u003C/strong\u003E\u003C/td\u003E\u003Ctd\u003ENajbliža točka na liniji, kad nijedan kraj, polovište ni sjecište nisu blizu.\u003C/td\u003E\u003C/tr\u003E\u003C/tbody\u003E\u003C/table\u003E\u003C/div\u003E\n\u003Cp\u003ENajbliži kraj, polovište ili sjecište ima prednost. Tek kad nijedan nije blizu, točka se postavlja na samu liniju. Povećajte prikaz da biste odabrali između točaka koje su blizu jedna drugoj: 10 piksela su pikseli na zaslonu, pa pri većem povećanju pokrivaju manji dio lista.\u003C/p\u003E\n\u003Ch2 id=\"gdje-radi\"\u003EGdje radi\u003C/h2\u003E\n\u003Cp\u003EHvatanje radi u \u003Cspan class=\"hui\"\u003ELinearno\u003C/span\u003E, \u003Cspan class=\"hui\"\u003EPovršina\u003C/span\u003E, \u003Cspan class=\"hui\"\u003EKružnica\u003C/span\u003E, \u003Cspan class=\"hui\"\u003EOtvor\u003C/span\u003E, \u003Cspan class=\"hui\"\u003EKalibriraj\u003C/span\u003E i \u003Cspan class=\"hui\"\u003EProvjeri\u003C/span\u003E, te kad povlačite kut odabrane oznake. Također postavlja točke lukova. \u003Cspan class=\"hui\"\u003EBroji\u003C/span\u003E, \u003Cspan class=\"hui\"\u003EAutobrojanje\u003C/span\u003E i lijepljenje se ne hvataju.\u003C/p\u003E\n\u003Cp\u003ETočka uhvaćena na liniji ima prednost pred hvatanjem na 45° pomoću \u003Ckbd class=\"hk\"\u003E\u003Cspan class=\"k-mac\" title=\"Shift\"\u003E⇧\u003C/span\u003E\u003Cspan class=\"k-pc\"\u003EShift\u003C/span\u003E\u003C/kbd\u003E: da biste crtali pod 45° izvan linija, prvo isključite hvatanje pomoću \u003Ckbd class=\"hk\"\u003E\u003Cspan class=\"k-mac\" title=\"F3\"\u003EF3\u003C/span\u003E\u003Cspan class=\"k-pc\"\u003EF3\u003C/span\u003E\u003C/kbd\u003E.\u003C/p\u003E\n\u003Caside class=\"hc hc-tip\"\u003E\u003Cp class=\"hc-label\"\u003ETip\u003C/p\u003E\n\u003Cp\u003EKalibrirajte s uključenim hvatanjem. Kliknite blizu dvaju krajeva kote ili zida čiju duljinu znate: obje točke upadaju točno na crtež, a mjerilo ispada točno (statusna traka tada navodi predložak na koji odgovara).\u003C/p\u003E\n\u003C/aside\u003E\n\u003Ch2 id=\"listovi-na-kojima-hvatanje-ne-radi\"\u003EListovi na kojima hvatanje ne radi\u003C/h2\u003E\n\u003Cul\u003E\u003Cli\u003E\u003Cstrong\u003ESkenirani listovi\u003C/strong\u003E su slike bez linija za hvatanje. Statusna traka kaže: „Ovaj list nema linija za hvatanje (skenirana stranica je slika).“ i točke idu tamo gdje kliknete.\u003C/li\u003E\u003Cli\u003E\u003Cstrong\u003EVrlo veliki crteži\u003C/strong\u003E: hvatanje čita do 400,000 segmenata linija po listu. Na listu s više od toga to se kaže i hvata se samo na prve.\u003C/li\u003E\u003Cli\u003E\u003Cstrong\u003ETekst\u003C/strong\u003E se ne hvata, osim ako PDF crta slova kao linije (neki plotteri to rade).\u003C/li\u003E\u003C/ul\u003E\n\u003Cp\u003ELinije lista čitaju se prvi put kad ga otvorite, u pozadini; veliki list može potrajati sekundu prije nego se oznake pojave.\u003C/p\u003E","text":"Većina skupova planova su vektorski PDF-ovi: njihovi zidovi i rubovi su stvarne linije, a ne pikseli. Dok mjerite, TakeoffDesk hvata vaše klikove na te linije, pa trasa počinje točno u kutu zida, a kalibracija očitava kotu koju je projektant nacrtao, a ne piksel na koji ste kliknuli. Hvatanje je uključeno kad počnete. Uključite ga i isključite pomoću Hvatanje u statusnoj traci ili pomoću F3; postavka se čuva u ovom pregledniku (nalazi se i pod Postavke). Na što hvata Kad se pokazivač nađe unutar otprilike 10 piksela na zaslonu od linije, prikazuje se oznaka koja pokazuje gdje će klik pasti, s njezinim nazivom: Oznaka Naziv Gdje Kvadrat Kraj Kraj linije ili kut na kojem se linije spajaju. Oba kraja krivulje se broje; točke duž nje ne. Trokut Polovište Sredina ravne linije. Križ Sjecište Mjesto gdje se dvije linije sijeku ili gdje jedna završava na drugoj. Pješčani sat Na liniji Najbliža točka na liniji, kad nijedan kraj, polovište ni sjecište nisu blizu. Najbliži kraj, polovište ili sjecište ima prednost. Tek kad nijedan nije blizu, točka se postavlja na samu liniju. Povećajte prikaz da biste odabrali između točaka koje su blizu jedna drugoj: 10 piksela su pikseli na zaslonu, pa pri većem povećanju pokrivaju manji dio lista. Gdje radi Hvatanje radi u Linearno, Površina, Kružnica, Otvor, Kalibriraj i Provjeri, te kad povlačite kut odabrane oznake. Također postavlja točke lukova. Broji, Autobrojanje i lijepljenje se ne hvataju. Točka uhvaćena na liniji ima prednost pred hvatanjem na 45° pomoću Shift: da biste crtali pod 45° izvan linija, prvo isključite hvatanje pomoću F3. Kalibrirajte s uključenim hvatanjem. Kliknite blizu dvaju krajeva kote ili zida čiju duljinu znate: obje točke upadaju točno na crtež, a mjerilo ispada točno (statusna traka tada navodi predložak na koji odgovara). Listovi na kojima hvatanje ne radi Skenirani listovi su slike bez linija za hvatanje. Statusna traka kaže: „Ovaj list nema linija za hvatanje (skenirana stranica je slika).“ i točke idu tamo gdje kliknete. Vrlo veliki crteži: hvatanje čita do 400,000 segmenata linija po listu. Na listu s više od toga to se kaže i hvata se samo na prve. Tekst se ne hvata, osim ako PDF crta slova kao linije (neki plotteri to rade). Linije lista čitaju se prvi put kad ga otvorite, u pozadini; veliki list može potrajati sekundu prije nego se oznake pojave.","lang":"hr"},{"slug":"pick-the-lines","scope":"takeoffcraft","title":"\"Odaberite linije PDF-a\"","summary":"\"Kliknite liniju vektorskog PDF-a da izmjerite cijeli spojeni put ili kliknite unutar zatvorenog obrisa za njegovu površinu, uz prikazanu toleranciju razmaka i jedan poništaj po segmentu.\"","section":"tasks","order":36,"keywords":["\"putanja","odabir","linije","cijela dionica","spojeno","prati","obris","opseg","razmak","tolerancija","premošćivanje","segmenti","tab","vektor","površina iz linija","p\""],"headings":[{"id":"odaberite-putanju-ili-obris","text":"Odaberite putanju ili obris","level":2},{"id":"tolerancija-razmaka","text":"Tolerancija razmaka","level":2},{"id":"tipke","text":"Tipke","level":2},{"id":"dobro-je-znati","text":"Dobro je znati","level":2}],"html":"\u003Cp\u003ENa vektorskom PDF-u zidovi i rubovi su prave linije. \u003Cspan class=\"hui\"\u003EPutanja\u003C/span\u003E (\u003Ckbd class=\"hk\"\u003E\u003Cspan class=\"k-mac\" title=\"P\"\u003EP\u003C/span\u003E\u003Cspan class=\"k-pc\"\u003EP\u003C/span\u003E\u003C/kbd\u003E) ih uzima onakvima kakve su nacrtane: jedan klik na liniju mjeri sve spojeno s njom, od kraja do kraja, pa zid ne morate pratiti klikanjem po kutovima. List treba mjerilo. Skenirana stranica nema linija za odabir; tamo upotrijebite \u003Ca href=\"/tutorials/takeoffcraft/measure-linear\" data-topic=\"takeoffcraft/measure-linear\"\u003ELinearno\u003C/a\u003E ili \u003Ca href=\"/tutorials/takeoffcraft/measure-areas\" data-topic=\"takeoffcraft/measure-areas\"\u003EPovršina\u003C/a\u003E.\u003C/p\u003E\n\u003Ch2 id=\"odaberite-putanju-ili-obris\"\u003EOdaberite putanju ili obris\u003C/h2\u003E\n\u003Col\u003E\u003Cli\u003EOdaberite \u003Cspan class=\"hui\"\u003EPutanja\u003C/span\u003E. Linija ispod pokazivača je ocrtana, a druge putanje koje bi mogla biti prikazane su tanko.\u003C/li\u003E\u003Cli\u003EKliknite liniju: odabire se cijeli spojeni put. Traka ispod alatne trake daje njegove segmente, duljinu, toleranciju razmaka i koliko je razmaka premošteno. Put koji se vraća na početak je zatvoren i prijavljuje i svoj opseg.\u003C/li\u003E\u003Cli\u003EIli kliknite unutar zatvorenog obrisa, podalje od bilo koje linije: obris oko te točke odabire se kao površina. Najmanji dolazi prvi; \u003Ckbd class=\"hk\"\u003E\u003Cspan class=\"k-mac\" title=\"Tab\"\u003ETab\u003C/span\u003E\u003Cspan class=\"k-pc\"\u003ETab\u003C/span\u003E\u003C/kbd\u003E isprobava sljedeći veći.\u003C/li\u003E\u003Cli\u003EPritisnite \u003Ckbd class=\"hk\"\u003E\u003Cspan class=\"k-mac\" title=\"Return\"\u003EReturn\u003C/span\u003E\u003Cspan class=\"k-pc\"\u003EEnter\u003C/span\u003E\u003C/kbd\u003E (ili desni klik, ili dvostruki klik) za dodavanje oznaka. Odabrani put postaje oznaka \u003Cstrong\u003Elinearne\u003C/strong\u003E stavke, a obris oznaka \u003Cstrong\u003Epovršinske\u003C/strong\u003E stavke: aktivna stavka ako je te vrste, inače najnovija te vrste. Ako nema nijedne, otvara se obrazac za novu stavku i ništa se ne dodaje dok ponovno ne pritisnete \u003Ckbd class=\"hk\"\u003E\u003Cspan class=\"k-mac\" title=\"Return\"\u003EReturn\u003C/span\u003E\u003Cspan class=\"k-pc\"\u003EEnter\u003C/span\u003E\u003C/kbd\u003E. Sve odabrano dodaje se u jednom koraku poništavanja.\u003C/li\u003E\u003C/ol\u003E\n\u003Ch2 id=\"tolerancija-razmaka\"\u003ETolerancija razmaka\u003C/h2\u003E\n\u003Cp\u003ECrtači ostavljaju male rupe tamo gdje se linije trebaju spojiti. Dvije linije se spajaju kad su im krajevi bliži od \u003Cstrong\u003Etolerancije razmaka\u003C/strong\u003E. Ona počinje od 1.5 točke na listu (prikazano u stopama i inčima pri mjerilu lista), a iscrtkani krug te širine prati pokazivač i stoji na svakom kraju putanje pod njim. Svaka premošćena rupa obilježena je narančasto na odabranoj putanji, a traka ih broji.\u003C/p\u003E\n\u003Cp\u003E\u003Ckbd class=\"hk\"\u003E\u003Cspan class=\"k-mac\" title=\"]\"\u003E]\u003C/span\u003E\u003Cspan class=\"k-pc\"\u003E]\u003C/span\u003E\u003C/kbd\u003E čini toleranciju širom, \u003Ckbd class=\"hk\"\u003E\u003Cspan class=\"k-mac\" title=\"[\"\u003E[\u003C/span\u003E\u003Cspan class=\"k-pc\"\u003E[\u003C/span\u003E\u003C/kbd\u003E užom. Odabrana putanja se odmah ponovno spaja pri novoj toleranciji. Na spoju putanja nastavlja ravno, najmanje zakrivljenim putem, a ogranak ostavlja.\u003C/p\u003E\n\u003Ch2 id=\"tipke\"\u003ETipke\u003C/h2\u003E\n\u003Cdiv class=\"ht-wrap\"\u003E\u003Ctable class=\"ht\"\u003E\u003Cthead\u003E\u003Ctr\u003E\u003Cth scope=\"col\"\u003ETipka ili radnja\u003C/th\u003E\u003Cth scope=\"col\"\u003EŠto radi\u003C/th\u003E\u003C/tr\u003E\u003C/thead\u003E\u003Ctbody\u003E\u003Ctr\u003E\u003Ctd\u003EKlik\u003C/td\u003E\u003Ctd\u003EOdabire putanju ispod pokazivača ili obris oko nje.\u003C/td\u003E\u003C/tr\u003E\u003Ctr\u003E\u003Ctd\u003E\u003Ckbd class=\"hk\"\u003E\u003Cspan class=\"k-mac\" title=\"Shift\"\u003E⇧\u003C/span\u003E\u003Cspan class=\"k-pc\"\u003EShift\u003C/span\u003E\u003C/kbd\u003E + klik\u003C/td\u003E\u003Ctd\u003EDodaje još jednu putanju ili obris odabiru.\u003C/td\u003E\u003C/tr\u003E\u003Ctr\u003E\u003Ctd\u003E\u003Ckbd class=\"hk\"\u003E\u003Cspan class=\"k-mac\" title=\"Tab\"\u003ETab\u003C/span\u003E\u003Cspan class=\"k-pc\"\u003ETab\u003C/span\u003E\u003C/kbd\u003E\u003C/td\u003E\u003Ctd\u003EIsprobava sljedeću putanju ispod pokazivača ili sljedeći veći obris.\u003C/td\u003E\u003C/tr\u003E\u003Ctr\u003E\u003Ctd\u003E\u003Ckbd class=\"hk\"\u003E\u003Cspan class=\"k-mac\" title=\"Delete\"\u003EDelete\u003C/span\u003E\u003Cspan class=\"k-pc\"\u003EBackspace\u003C/span\u003E\u003C/kbd\u003E ili \u003Ckbd class=\"hk\"\u003E\u003Cspan class=\"k-mac\" title=\"Command Z\"\u003E⌘Z\u003C/span\u003E\u003Cspan class=\"k-pc\"\u003ECtrl+Z\u003C/span\u003E\u003C/kbd\u003E\u003C/td\u003E\u003Ctd\u003EUklanja zadnji segment sa zadnje odabrane putanje, jedan po jedan segment. Putanja bez segmenata nestaje. Bez odabira, \u003Ckbd class=\"hk\"\u003E\u003Cspan class=\"k-mac\" title=\"Command Z\"\u003E⌘Z\u003C/span\u003E\u003Cspan class=\"k-pc\"\u003ECtrl+Z\u003C/span\u003E\u003C/kbd\u003E je obično poništavanje.\u003C/td\u003E\u003C/tr\u003E\u003Ctr\u003E\u003Ctd\u003E\u003Ckbd class=\"hk\"\u003E\u003Cspan class=\"k-mac\" title=\"[\"\u003E[\u003C/span\u003E\u003Cspan class=\"k-pc\"\u003E[\u003C/span\u003E\u003C/kbd\u003E i \u003Ckbd class=\"hk\"\u003E\u003Cspan class=\"k-mac\" title=\"]\"\u003E]\u003C/span\u003E\u003Cspan class=\"k-pc\"\u003E]\u003C/span\u003E\u003C/kbd\u003E\u003C/td\u003E\u003Ctd\u003EUža i šira tolerancija razmaka.\u003C/td\u003E\u003C/tr\u003E\u003Ctr\u003E\u003Ctd\u003E\u003Ckbd class=\"hk\"\u003E\u003Cspan class=\"k-mac\" title=\"Return\"\u003EReturn\u003C/span\u003E\u003Cspan class=\"k-pc\"\u003EEnter\u003C/span\u003E\u003C/kbd\u003E\u003C/td\u003E\u003Ctd\u003EDodaje oznake.\u003C/td\u003E\u003C/tr\u003E\u003Ctr\u003E\u003Ctd\u003E\u003Ckbd class=\"hk\"\u003E\u003Cspan class=\"k-mac\" title=\"Esc\"\u003EEsc\u003C/span\u003E\u003Cspan class=\"k-pc\"\u003EEsc\u003C/span\u003E\u003C/kbd\u003E\u003C/td\u003E\u003Ctd\u003EBriše odabir.\u003C/td\u003E\u003C/tr\u003E\u003C/tbody\u003E\u003C/table\u003E\u003C/div\u003E\n\u003Ch2 id=\"dobro-je-znati\"\u003EDobro je znati\u003C/h2\u003E\n\u003Cul\u003E\u003Cli\u003EKrivulja u crtežu je niz kratkih ravnih dijelova, pa je njezina duljina neznatno manja od prave duljine luka. Za točan luk izmjerite iz same datoteke crteža (\u003Ca href=\"/tutorials/takeoffcraft/measure-from-a-drawing\" data-topic=\"takeoffcraft/measure-from-a-drawing\"\u003EMjerenje iz crteža\u003C/a\u003E).\u003C/li\u003E\u003Cli\u003EPremošteni razmak broji se kao ravan skok preko njega, pa opseg zatvorenog obrisa uključuje i njega.\u003C/li\u003E\u003Cli\u003ELinije su samo potezi i ispune u vlastitim putanjama stranice. Tekst nacrtan kao slova i slike nisu linije.\u003C/li\u003E\u003C/ul\u003E","text":"Na vektorskom PDF-u zidovi i rubovi su prave linije. Putanja (P) ih uzima onakvima kakve su nacrtane: jedan klik na liniju mjeri sve spojeno s njom, od kraja do kraja, pa zid ne morate pratiti klikanjem po kutovima. List treba mjerilo. Skenirana stranica nema linija za odabir; tamo upotrijebite Linearno ili Površina. Odaberite putanju ili obris Odaberite Putanja. Linija ispod pokazivača je ocrtana, a druge putanje koje bi mogla biti prikazane su tanko. Kliknite liniju: odabire se cijeli spojeni put. Traka ispod alatne trake daje njegove segmente, duljinu, toleranciju razmaka i koliko je razmaka premošteno. Put koji se vraća na početak je zatvoren i prijavljuje i svoj opseg. Ili kliknite unutar zatvorenog obrisa, podalje od bilo koje linije: obris oko te točke odabire se kao površina. Najmanji dolazi prvi; Tab isprobava sljedeći veći. Pritisnite Enter (ili desni klik, ili dvostruki klik) za dodavanje oznaka. Odabrani put postaje oznaka linearne stavke, a obris oznaka površinske stavke: aktivna stavka ako je te vrste, inače najnovija te vrste. Ako nema nijedne, otvara se obrazac za novu stavku i ništa se ne dodaje dok ponovno ne pritisnete Enter. Sve odabrano dodaje se u jednom koraku poništavanja. Tolerancija razmaka Crtači ostavljaju male rupe tamo gdje se linije trebaju spojiti. Dvije linije se spajaju kad su im krajevi bliži od tolerancije razmaka. Ona počinje od 1.5 točke na listu (prikazano u stopama i inčima pri mjerilu lista), a iscrtkani krug te širine prati pokazivač i stoji na svakom kraju putanje pod njim. Svaka premošćena rupa obilježena je narančasto na odabranoj putanji, a traka ih broji. ] čini toleranciju širom, [ užom. Odabrana putanja se odmah ponovno spaja pri novoj toleranciji. Na spoju putanja nastavlja ravno, najmanje zakrivljenim putem, a ogranak ostavlja. Tipke Tipka ili radnja Što radi Klik Odabire putanju ispod pokazivača ili obris oko nje. Shift + klik Dodaje još jednu putanju ili obris odabiru. Tab Isprobava sljedeću putanju ispod pokazivača ili sljedeći veći obris. Backspace ili Ctrl+Z Uklanja zadnji segment sa zadnje odabrane putanje, jedan po jedan segment. Putanja bez segmenata nestaje. Bez odabira, Ctrl+Z je obično poništavanje. [ i ] Uža i šira tolerancija razmaka. Enter Dodaje oznake. Esc Briše odabir. Dobro je znati Krivulja u crtežu je niz kratkih ravnih dijelova, pa je njezina duljina neznatno manja od prave duljine luka. Za točan luk izmjerite iz same datoteke crteža (Mjerenje iz crteža). Premošteni razmak broji se kao ravan skok preko njega, pa opseg zatvorenog obrisa uključuje i njega. Linije su samo potezi i ispune u vlastitim putanjama stranice. Tekst nacrtan kao slova i slike nisu linije.","lang":"hr"},{"slug":"measure-linear","scope":"takeoffcraft","title":"Mjerenje linearnih dionica","summary":"Uzmite zidove, cjevovode, obloge i druge duljine kao dionice, s ravnim segmentima, lukovima i hvatanjem pod 45 stupnjeva uz Shift.","section":"tasks","order":40,"keywords":["linearno","duljina","dionica","polilinija","zidovi","lf","linearne stope","luk","krivulja","45 stupnjeva","ortogonalno","hvatanje","segmenti","duljina polilinije","odbitak","otvor","vrata","razmak","upis","upisan","koordinate","udaljenost","izravna udaljenost","polarno"],"headings":[{"id":"nacrtajte-dionicu","text":"Nacrtajte dionicu","level":2},{"id":"ravne-linije-u-koracima-od-45","text":"Ravne linije u koracima od 45°","level":2},{"id":"lukovi-i-zakrivljeni-zidovi","text":"Lukovi i zakrivljeni zidovi","level":2},{"id":"upis-duljina-i-koordinata","text":"Upis duljina i koordinata","level":2},{"id":"odbitak-dijela-dionice","text":"Odbitak dijela dionice","level":2},{"id":"pogledajte-pojedinosti-dionice","text":"Pogledajte pojedinosti dionice","level":2},{"id":"popravak-dionice","text":"Popravak dionice","level":2},{"id":"povr-ina-zida","text":"Površina zida","level":2}],"html":"\u003Cp\u003ELinearna stavka mjeri duljinu. Svaka dionica je lanac točaka: ravni segmenti i lukovi kad uključite način luka. Stavka može imati bilo koliko dionica na bilo kojem broju listova.\u003C/p\u003E\n\u003Cp\u003EPrije početka: list treba mjerilo (\u003Ca href=\"/tutorials/takeoffcraft/set-the-scale\" data-topic=\"takeoffcraft/set-the-scale\"\u003EPostavljanje mjerila\u003C/a\u003E), a potrebna vam je linearna stavka (\u003Ca href=\"/tutorials/takeoffcraft/create-items\" data-topic=\"takeoffcraft/create-items\"\u003EStvaranje stavki predmjera\u003C/a\u003E).\u003C/p\u003E\n\u003Cp\u003ENa vektorskom PDF-u vaši klikovi se hvataju na linije samog crteža: krajeve, polovišta i sjecišta (\u003Ca href=\"/tutorials/takeoffcraft/snap-to-the-drawing\" data-topic=\"takeoffcraft/snap-to-the-drawing\"\u003EHvatanje na linije crteža\u003C/a\u003E; \u003Ckbd class=\"hk\"\u003E\u003Cspan class=\"k-mac\" title=\"F3\"\u003EF3\u003C/span\u003E\u003Cspan class=\"k-pc\"\u003EF3\u003C/span\u003E\u003C/kbd\u003E ga isključuje).\u003C/p\u003E\n\u003Ch2 id=\"nacrtajte-dionicu\"\u003ENacrtajte dionicu\u003C/h2\u003E\n\u003Col\u003E\u003Cli\u003EKliknite linearnu stavku pod \u003Cspan class=\"hui\"\u003EStavke\u003C/span\u003E.\u003C/li\u003E\u003Cli\u003EOdaberite \u003Cspan class=\"hui\"\u003ELinearno\u003C/span\u003E na traci alata ili pritisnite \u003Ckbd class=\"hk\"\u003E\u003Cspan class=\"k-mac\" title=\"L\"\u003EL\u003C/span\u003E\u003Cspan class=\"k-pc\"\u003EL\u003C/span\u003E\u003C/kbd\u003E.\u003C/li\u003E\u003Cli\u003EKliknite početak dionice.\u003C/li\u003E\u003Cli\u003EKliknite svaki kut duž nje. Statusna traka prikazuje „Duljina“ (dionica do pokazivača) i „segment“ (segment koji crtate), u stopama i inčima.\u003C/li\u003E\u003Cli\u003EZavršite dionicu: dvaput kliknite zadnju točku, pritisnite \u003Ckbd class=\"hk\"\u003E\u003Cspan class=\"k-mac\" title=\"Return\"\u003EReturn\u003C/span\u003E\u003Cspan class=\"k-pc\"\u003EEnter\u003C/span\u003E\u003C/kbd\u003E ili desno kliknite. Dionica se crta bojom stavke i postaje odabrana oznaka. Duljina stavke na popisu \u003Cspan class=\"hui\"\u003EStavke\u003C/span\u003E i u tablici \u003Cspan class=\"hui\"\u003EKoličine\u003C/span\u003E se povećava.\u003C/li\u003E\u003C/ol\u003E\n\u003Cp\u003EAlat ostaje na \u003Cspan class=\"hui\"\u003ELinearno\u003C/span\u003E, pa možete odmah započeti sljedeću dionicu. Pritisnite \u003Ckbd class=\"hk\"\u003E\u003Cspan class=\"k-mac\" title=\"Esc\"\u003EEsc\u003C/span\u003E\u003Cspan class=\"k-pc\"\u003EEsc\u003C/span\u003E\u003C/kbd\u003E za povratak na \u003Cspan class=\"hui\"\u003EOdaberi\u003C/span\u003E.\u003C/p\u003E\n\u003Cp\u003EDok crtate:\u003C/p\u003E\n\u003Cul\u003E\u003Cli\u003E\u003Ckbd class=\"hk\"\u003E\u003Cspan class=\"k-mac\" title=\"Delete\"\u003EDelete\u003C/span\u003E\u003Cspan class=\"k-pc\"\u003EBackspace\u003C/span\u003E\u003C/kbd\u003E (ili \u003Ckbd class=\"hk\"\u003E\u003Cspan class=\"k-mac\" title=\"fn Delete\"\u003Efn Delete\u003C/span\u003E\u003Cspan class=\"k-pc\"\u003EDelete\u003C/span\u003E\u003C/kbd\u003E) uklanja zadnju točku.\u003C/li\u003E\u003Cli\u003E\u003Ckbd class=\"hk\"\u003E\u003Cspan class=\"k-mac\" title=\"Esc\"\u003EEsc\u003C/span\u003E\u003Cspan class=\"k-pc\"\u003EEsc\u003C/span\u003E\u003C/kbd\u003E odbacuje nedovršenu dionicu.\u003C/li\u003E\u003Cli\u003EPovlačenje pomiče list, a kotačić zumira, bez dodavanja točaka.\u003C/li\u003E\u003C/ul\u003E\n\u003Cdiv class=\"hv\" data-v=\"os:mac\"\u003E\u003Cp class=\"hv-label\"\u003EMac\u003C/p\u003E\n\u003Cp\u003ENa Mac trackpadu desni klik je klik dvama prstima (uključite sekundarni klik u Postavkama sustava, pod Trackpad). TakeoffDesk čita samo sekundarnu tipku, pa se Control-klik može uzeti kao običan klik i dodati točku. Dvostruki klik ili \u003Ckbd class=\"hk\"\u003E\u003Cspan class=\"k-mac\" title=\"Return\"\u003EReturn\u003C/span\u003E\u003Cspan class=\"k-pc\"\u003EEnter\u003C/span\u003E\u003C/kbd\u003E uvijek završavaju.\u003C/p\u003E\n\u003C/div\u003E\n\u003Cdiv class=\"hv\" data-v=\"input:touch\"\u003E\u003Cp class=\"hv-label\"\u003ETouch\u003C/p\u003E\n\u003Cp\u003ENa zaslonu osjetljivom na dodir dodirnite za postavljanje točaka, povucite jednim prstom za pomicanje i stisnite dvama prstima za zumiranje. Završite dugim pritiskom, dvostrukim dodirom ili \u003Cspan class=\"hui\"\u003EZavrši\u003C/span\u003E u traci ispod lista (\u003Cspan class=\"hui\"\u003EStraga\u003C/span\u003E vraća zadnju točku). Pogledajte \u003Ca href=\"/tutorials/takeoffcraft/troubleshooting#touch-screens\" data-topic=\"takeoffcraft/troubleshooting\" data-hash=\"touch-screens\"\u003ERješavanje problema\u003C/a\u003E.\u003C/p\u003E\n\u003C/div\u003E\n\u003Ch2 id=\"ravne-linije-u-koracima-od-45\"\u003ERavne linije u koracima od 45°\u003C/h2\u003E\n\u003Cp\u003EDržite \u003Ckbd class=\"hk\"\u003E\u003Cspan class=\"k-mac\" title=\"Shift\"\u003E⇧\u003C/span\u003E\u003Cspan class=\"k-pc\"\u003EShift\u003C/span\u003E\u003C/kbd\u003E dok postavljate točku. Segment od zadnje točke hvata se na najbliži smjer 0°, 45°, 90° ili 135°, zadržavajući duljinu koju ste povukli. Statusna traka podsjeća: „Shift hvata na 45°“.\u003C/p\u003E\n\u003Cp\u003EU načinu luka to vrijedi za kraj luka: tetiva luka ide u koracima od 45° od mjesta gdje počinje. Točka koju kliknete na krivulji nikad se ne hvata.\u003C/p\u003E\n\u003Ch2 id=\"lukovi-i-zakrivljeni-zidovi\"\u003ELukovi i zakrivljeni zidovi\u003C/h2\u003E\n\u003Col\u003E\u003Cli\u003EDok crtate dionicu, postavite točku na kojoj krivulja počinje.\u003C/li\u003E\u003Cli\u003EUključite način luka: odaberite \u003Cspan class=\"hui\"\u003ELuk\u003C/span\u003E na traci alata ili pritisnite \u003Ckbd class=\"hk\"\u003E\u003Cspan class=\"k-mac\" title=\"R\"\u003ER\u003C/span\u003E\u003Cspan class=\"k-pc\"\u003ER\u003C/span\u003E\u003C/kbd\u003E. Gumb ostaje pritisnut.\u003C/li\u003E\u003Cli\u003EKliknite bilo koju točku na krivulji, negdje u sredini. Statusna traka dodaje „(luk: kliknite gdje završava)“, a pregled se savija kroz vašu točku.\u003C/li\u003E\u003Cli\u003EKliknite mjesto gdje krivulja završava. Luk je dodan. Njegova duljina je točna duljina luka, a ne niz kratkih tetiva.\u003C/li\u003E\u003Cli\u003EKliknite sljedeću točku na sljedećoj krivulji i njezin kraj da nastavite crtati lukove, ili ponovno pritisnite \u003Ckbd class=\"hk\"\u003E\u003Cspan class=\"k-mac\" title=\"R\"\u003ER\u003C/span\u003E\u003Cspan class=\"k-pc\"\u003ER\u003C/span\u003E\u003C/kbd\u003E za povratak na ravne segmente.\u003C/li\u003E\u003C/ol\u003E\n\u003Cp\u003E\u003Ckbd class=\"hk\"\u003E\u003Cspan class=\"k-mac\" title=\"Delete\"\u003EDelete\u003C/span\u003E\u003Cspan class=\"k-pc\"\u003EBackspace\u003C/span\u003E\u003C/kbd\u003E ili \u003Ckbd class=\"hk\"\u003E\u003Cspan class=\"k-mac\" title=\"Esc\"\u003EEsc\u003C/span\u003E\u003Cspan class=\"k-pc\"\u003EEsc\u003C/span\u003E\u003C/kbd\u003E prvo odbacuju točku na krivulji na čekanju; pritisnite ponovno za uklanjanje točaka kao obično.\u003C/p\u003E\n\u003Ch2 id=\"upis-duljina-i-koordinata\"\u003EUpis duljina i koordinata\u003C/h2\u003E\n\u003Cp\u003ENakon prve točke možete upisati gdje ide sljedeća, umjesto da kliknete. Upišite znamenku, \u003Ccode\u003E@\u003C/code\u003E ili \u003Ccode\u003E#\u003C/code\u003E: u statusnoj traci otvara se okvir \u003Cspan class=\"hui\"\u003EUpis\u003C/span\u003E s onim što ste upisali. Pritisnite \u003Ckbd class=\"hk\"\u003E\u003Cspan class=\"k-mac\" title=\"Return\"\u003EReturn\u003C/span\u003E\u003Cspan class=\"k-pc\"\u003EEnter\u003C/span\u003E\u003C/kbd\u003E za postavljanje točke; okvir ostaje otvoren za sljedeću.\u003C/p\u003E\n\u003Cdiv class=\"ht-wrap\"\u003E\u003Ctable class=\"ht\"\u003E\u003Cthead\u003E\u003Ctr\u003E\u003Cth scope=\"col\"\u003EUpis\u003C/th\u003E\u003Cth scope=\"col\"\u003ESljedeća točka ide\u003C/th\u003E\u003C/tr\u003E\u003C/thead\u003E\u003Ctbody\u003E\u003Ctr\u003E\u003Ctd\u003E\u003Ccode\u003E12&#039;6&quot;\u003C/code\u003E\u003C/td\u003E\u003Ctd\u003E12&#039;-6&quot; od zadnje točke, prema pokazivaču (pokažite smjer, pa upišite duljinu)\u003C/td\u003E\u003C/tr\u003E\u003Ctr\u003E\u003Ctd\u003E\u003Ccode\u003E12&#039;6&quot;&lt;45\u003C/code\u003E\u003C/td\u003E\u003Ctd\u003E12&#039;-6&quot; pod 45°, brojano suprotno kazaljci na satu od desne strane zaslona (\u003Ccode\u003E&lt;90\u003C/code\u003E je gore, \u003Ccode\u003E&lt;-90\u003C/code\u003E dolje)\u003C/td\u003E\u003C/tr\u003E\u003Ctr\u003E\u003Ctd\u003E\u003Ccode\u003E@6&#039;,-4&#039;\u003C/code\u003E\u003C/td\u003E\u003Ctd\u003E6&#039; desno i 4&#039; dolje od zadnje točke\u003C/td\u003E\u003C/tr\u003E\u003Ctr\u003E\u003Ctd\u003E\u003Ccode\u003E6&#039;,4&#039;\u003C/code\u003E (ili \u003Ccode\u003E#6&#039;,4&#039;\u003C/code\u003E)\u003C/td\u003E\u003Ctd\u003E6&#039; desno i 4&#039; gore od prve točke ove dionice\u003C/td\u003E\u003C/tr\u003E\u003C/tbody\u003E\u003C/table\u003E\u003C/div\u003E\n\u003Cp\u003EDuljine se upisuju kao i u ostatku programa TakeoffDesk (\u003Ca href=\"/tutorials/takeoffcraft/entry-formats\" data-topic=\"takeoffcraft/entry-formats\"\u003EFormati unosa\u003C/a\u003E): \u003Ccode\u003E12&#039;-6 1/2&quot;\u003C/code\u003E, \u003Ccode\u003E12.5\u003C/code\u003E (stope), \u003Ccode\u003E30&quot;\u003C/code\u003E, \u003Ccode\u003E3.2 m\u003C/code\u003E. „Desno“ i „gore“ su kako vidite list, i kad je stranica PDF-a okrenuta.\u003C/p\u003E\n\u003Cp\u003E\u003Ckbd class=\"hk\"\u003E\u003Cspan class=\"k-mac\" title=\"Return\"\u003EReturn\u003C/span\u003E\u003Cspan class=\"k-pc\"\u003EEnter\u003C/span\u003E\u003C/kbd\u003E na praznom okviru završava dionicu, kao i \u003Ckbd class=\"hk\"\u003E\u003Cspan class=\"k-mac\" title=\"Return\"\u003EReturn\u003C/span\u003E\u003Cspan class=\"k-pc\"\u003EEnter\u003C/span\u003E\u003C/kbd\u003E na listu; \u003Ckbd class=\"hk\"\u003E\u003Cspan class=\"k-mac\" title=\"Esc\"\u003EEsc\u003C/span\u003E\u003Cspan class=\"k-pc\"\u003EEsc\u003C/span\u003E\u003C/kbd\u003E zatvara okvir i dionica se nastavlja. Upisane točke prolaze ista pravila kao i klikovi: odbici, lukovi i zatvaranje površine rade. Isti okvir radi i u \u003Cspan class=\"hui\"\u003EPovršina\u003C/span\u003E i u \u003Cspan class=\"hui\"\u003EOtvor\u003C/span\u003E; nakon središta kružnice uzima polumjer.\u003C/p\u003E\n\u003Ch2 id=\"odbitak-dijela-dionice\"\u003EOdbitak dijela dionice\u003C/h2\u003E\n\u003Cp\u003EDionica zida koja prolazi pored vrata ili izloga može se nacrtati ravno kroz otvor, a brojati se samo zid: segmenti preko otvora su \u003Cstrong\u003Eodbici\u003C/strong\u003E. Crtaju se isprekidano i tanko te se ne broje.\u003C/p\u003E\n\u003Cp\u003EDok crtate:\u003C/p\u003E\n\u003Col\u003E\u003Cli\u003EPostavite točku na mjestu gdje otvor počinje.\u003C/li\u003E\u003Cli\u003EOdaberite \u003Cspan class=\"hui\"\u003EOdbitak\u003C/span\u003E na traci alata ili pritisnite \u003Ckbd class=\"hk\"\u003E\u003Cspan class=\"k-mac\" title=\"E\"\u003EE\u003C/span\u003E\u003Cspan class=\"k-pc\"\u003EE\u003C/span\u003E\u003C/kbd\u003E. Gumb ostaje pritisnut, a statusna traka kaže da su sljedeći segmenti odbici.\u003C/li\u003E\u003Cli\u003EKliknite mjesto gdje otvor završava. Segment se crta isprekidano; „Duljina“ u statusnoj traci ga izostavlja.\u003C/li\u003E\u003Cli\u003EPritisnite \u003Ckbd class=\"hk\"\u003E\u003Cspan class=\"k-mac\" title=\"E\"\u003EE\u003C/span\u003E\u003Cspan class=\"k-pc\"\u003EE\u003C/span\u003E\u003C/kbd\u003E ponovno i nastavite duž zida.\u003C/li\u003E\u003C/ol\u003E\n\u003Cp\u003ENakon crtanja: odaberite dionicu. Pod \u003Cstrong\u003EOdabrana oznaka\u003C/strong\u003E, svaki segment ima okvir \u003Cspan class=\"hui\"\u003EOdbitak\u003C/span\u003E: označite ga da odbijete taj segment, odnosno odznačite da ga ponovno brojite. Svaka promjena je jedan korak poništavanja.\u003C/p\u003E\n\u003Cp\u003EDionica uvijek zadržava barem jedan segment koji se broji. Ploča tada prikazuje \u003Cstrong\u003EOdbici\u003C/strong\u003E (odbijena duljina) i \u003Cstrong\u003ENacrtano\u003C/strong\u003E (cijela dionica); \u003Cstrong\u003EDuljina\u003C/strong\u003E, količina stavke, površina zida i troškovi koriste duljinu bez odbitaka. 3D pregled provjere ostavlja prazninu u zidu, označeni PDF crta odbitke isprekidano, a izvezeni list \u003Cstrong\u003EOznake\u003C/strong\u003E ih navodi.\u003C/p\u003E\n\u003Cp\u003EPomicanje kuta čuva odbitke. Dodavanje ili uklanjanje točaka (ponovnim crtanjem dionice) počinje bez njih.\u003C/p\u003E\n\u003Ch2 id=\"pogledajte-pojedinosti-dionice\"\u003EPogledajte pojedinosti dionice\u003C/h2\u003E\n\u003Cp\u003EOdaberite \u003Cspan class=\"hui\"\u003EOdaberi\u003C/span\u003E (\u003Ckbd class=\"hk\"\u003E\u003Cspan class=\"k-mac\" title=\"V\"\u003EV\u003C/span\u003E\u003Cspan class=\"k-pc\"\u003EV\u003C/span\u003E\u003C/kbd\u003E) i kliknite dionicu. \u003Cstrong\u003EOdabrana oznaka\u003C/strong\u003E s desne strane prikazuje:\u003C/p\u003E\n\u003Cul\u003E\u003Cli\u003Estavku kojoj pripada (drugu linearnu stavku s popisa odaberite da dionicu premjestite tamo),\u003C/li\u003E\u003Cli\u003Elist,\u003C/li\u003E\u003Cli\u003E\u003Cstrong\u003EDuljinu\u003C/strong\u003E u stopama i inčima te u LF,\u003C/li\u003E\u003Cli\u003Ebroj \u003Cstrong\u003ESegmenata\u003C/strong\u003E, i \u003Cstrong\u003EPovršinu zida\u003C/strong\u003E kad stavka ima visinu,\u003C/li\u003E\u003Cli\u003Eduljinu svakog segmenta, uz „(luk)“ nakon lukova, i njegov okvir \u003Cspan class=\"hui\"\u003EOdbitak\u003C/span\u003E.\u003C/li\u003E\u003C/ul\u003E\n\u003Cp\u003ENa listu je svaki segment odabrane dionice označen svojom duljinom.\u003C/p\u003E\n\u003Ch2 id=\"popravak-dionice\"\u003EPopravak dionice\u003C/h2\u003E\n\u003Cul\u003E\u003Cli\u003E\u003Cstrong\u003EPomaknite točku\u003C/strong\u003E: odaberite dionicu, zatim povucite jednu od njezinih kvadratnih ručki kuta. Držite \u003Ckbd class=\"hk\"\u003E\u003Cspan class=\"k-mac\" title=\"Shift\"\u003E⇧\u003C/span\u003E\u003Cspan class=\"k-pc\"\u003EShift\u003C/span\u003E\u003C/kbd\u003E da se pomaknuti segment hvata na korake od 45°. Luk zadržava svoje savijanje.\u003C/li\u003E\u003Cli\u003E\u003Cstrong\u003ESavijte luk\u003C/strong\u003E: odabrana dionica prikazuje okruglu ručku u sredini svakog luka. Povucite je: luk prolazi kroz mjesto gdje ispustite miš, pa se više ili manje savija ili savija na drugu stranu. Povučen na ravnu liniju između svojih krajeva postaje ravni segment. \u003Ckbd class=\"hk\"\u003E\u003Cspan class=\"k-mac\" title=\"Command Z\"\u003E⌘Z\u003C/span\u003E\u003Cspan class=\"k-pc\"\u003ECtrl+Z\u003C/span\u003E\u003C/kbd\u003E to poništava („Savijanje luka“).\u003C/li\u003E\u003Cli\u003E\u003Cstrong\u003EIzbrišite dionicu\u003C/strong\u003E: odaberite je i pritisnite \u003Ckbd class=\"hk\"\u003E\u003Cspan class=\"k-mac\" title=\"fn Delete\"\u003Efn Delete\u003C/span\u003E\u003Cspan class=\"k-pc\"\u003EDelete\u003C/span\u003E\u003C/kbd\u003E, odaberite \u003Cspan class=\"hui\"\u003EDelete\u003C/span\u003E u izborniku \u003Cspan class=\"hui\"\u003EViše\u003C/span\u003E na traci alata ili \u003Cspan class=\"hui\"\u003EIzbriši oznaku\u003C/span\u003E na ploči.\u003C/li\u003E\u003Cli\u003E\u003Cstrong\u003EPoništi\u003C/strong\u003E: \u003Ckbd class=\"hk\"\u003E\u003Cspan class=\"k-mac\" title=\"Command Z\"\u003E⌘Z\u003C/span\u003E\u003Cspan class=\"k-pc\"\u003ECtrl+Z\u003C/span\u003E\u003C/kbd\u003E; ponovi s \u003Ckbd class=\"hk\"\u003E\u003Cspan class=\"k-mac\" title=\"Command Y\"\u003E⌘Y\u003C/span\u003E\u003Cspan class=\"k-pc\"\u003ECtrl+Y\u003C/span\u003E\u003C/kbd\u003E.\u003C/li\u003E\u003C/ul\u003E\n\u003Cp\u003ETočku u sredinu dionice još ne možete umetnuti. Izbrišite dionicu i ponovno je nacrtajte.\u003C/p\u003E\n\u003Ch2 id=\"povr-ina-zida\"\u003EPovršina zida\u003C/h2\u003E\n\u003Cp\u003EDajte linearnoj stavki \u003Cspan class=\"hui\"\u003EVisina\u003C/span\u003E (npr. \u003Ccode\u003E9&#039;-0&quot;\u003C/code\u003E). Tada prikazuje \u003Cstrong\u003EPovršinu zida (A)\u003C/strong\u003E = duljina × visina, u SF (ili m² za metričku stavku), a površina zida ide u stupac bilješki izvezene tablice. Koristite je u sklopovima za ploče, boju ili izolaciju: pogledajte \u003Ca href=\"/tutorials/takeoffcraft/assemblies\" data-topic=\"takeoffcraft/assemblies\"\u003ESklopovi i formule\u003C/a\u003E.\u003C/p\u003E","text":"Linearna stavka mjeri duljinu. Svaka dionica je lanac točaka: ravni segmenti i lukovi kad uključite način luka. Stavka može imati bilo koliko dionica na bilo kojem broju listova. Prije početka: list treba mjerilo (Postavljanje mjerila), a potrebna vam je linearna stavka (Stvaranje stavki predmjera). Na vektorskom PDF-u vaši klikovi se hvataju na linije samog crteža: krajeve, polovišta i sjecišta (Hvatanje na linije crteža; F3 ga isključuje). Nacrtajte dionicu Kliknite linearnu stavku pod Stavke. Odaberite Linearno na traci alata ili pritisnite L. Kliknite početak dionice. Kliknite svaki kut duž nje. Statusna traka prikazuje „Duljina“ (dionica do pokazivača) i „segment“ (segment koji crtate), u stopama i inčima. Završite dionicu: dvaput kliknite zadnju točku, pritisnite Enter ili desno kliknite. Dionica se crta bojom stavke i postaje odabrana oznaka. Duljina stavke na popisu Stavke i u tablici Količine se povećava. Alat ostaje na Linearno, pa možete odmah započeti sljedeću dionicu. Pritisnite Esc za povratak na Odaberi. Dok crtate: Backspace (ili Delete) uklanja zadnju točku. Esc odbacuje nedovršenu dionicu. Povlačenje pomiče list, a kotačić zumira, bez dodavanja točaka. Na Mac trackpadu desni klik je klik dvama prstima (uključite sekundarni klik u Postavkama sustava, pod Trackpad). TakeoffDesk čita samo sekundarnu tipku, pa se Control-klik može uzeti kao običan klik i dodati točku. Dvostruki klik ili Enter uvijek završavaju. Na zaslonu osjetljivom na dodir dodirnite za postavljanje točaka, povucite jednim prstom za pomicanje i stisnite dvama prstima za zumiranje. Završite dugim pritiskom, dvostrukim dodirom ili Završi u traci ispod lista (Straga vraća zadnju točku). Pogledajte Rješavanje problema. Ravne linije u koracima od 45° Držite Shift dok postavljate točku. Segment od zadnje točke hvata se na najbliži smjer 0°, 45°, 90° ili 135°, zadržavajući duljinu koju ste povukli. Statusna traka podsjeća: „Shift hvata na 45°“. U načinu luka to vrijedi za kraj luka: tetiva luka ide u koracima od 45° od mjesta gdje počinje. Točka koju kliknete na krivulji nikad se ne hvata. Lukovi i zakrivljeni zidovi Dok crtate dionicu, postavite točku na kojoj krivulja počinje. Uključite način luka: odaberite Luk na traci alata ili pritisnite R. Gumb ostaje pritisnut. Kliknite bilo koju točku na krivulji, negdje u sredini. Statusna traka dodaje „(luk: kliknite gdje završava)“, a pregled se savija kroz vašu točku. Kliknite mjesto gdje krivulja završava. Luk je dodan. Njegova duljina je točna duljina luka, a ne niz kratkih tetiva. Kliknite sljedeću točku na sljedećoj krivulji i njezin kraj da nastavite crtati lukove, ili ponovno pritisnite R za povratak na ravne segmente. Backspace ili Esc prvo odbacuju točku na krivulji na čekanju; pritisnite ponovno za uklanjanje točaka kao obično. Upis duljina i koordinata Nakon prve točke možete upisati gdje ide sljedeća, umjesto da kliknete. Upišite znamenku, @ ili #: u statusnoj traci otvara se okvir Upis s onim što ste upisali. Pritisnite Enter za postavljanje točke; okvir ostaje otvoren za sljedeću. Upis Sljedeća točka ide 12'6\" 12'-6\" od zadnje točke, prema pokazivaču (pokažite smjer, pa upišite duljinu) 12'6\"\u003C45 12'-6\" pod 45°, brojano suprotno kazaljci na satu od desne strane zaslona (\u003C90 je gore, \u003C-90 dolje) @6',-4' 6' desno i 4' dolje od zadnje točke 6',4' (ili #6',4') 6' desno i 4' gore od prve točke ove dionice Duljine se upisuju kao i u ostatku programa TakeoffDesk (Formati unosa): 12'-6 1/2\", 12.5 (stope), 30\", 3.2 m. „Desno“ i „gore“ su kako vidite list, i kad je stranica PDF-a okrenuta. Enter na praznom okviru završava dionicu, kao i Enter na listu; Esc zatvara okvir i dionica se nastavlja. Upisane točke prolaze ista pravila kao i klikovi: odbici, lukovi i zatvaranje površine rade. Isti okvir radi i u Površina i u Otvor; nakon središta kružnice uzima polumjer. Odbitak dijela dionice Dionica zida koja prolazi pored vrata ili izloga može se nacrtati ravno kroz otvor, a brojati se samo zid: segmenti preko otvora su odbici. Crtaju se isprekidano i tanko te se ne broje. Dok crtate: Postavite točku na mjestu gdje otvor počinje. Odaberite Odbitak na traci alata ili pritisnite E. Gumb ostaje pritisnut, a statusna traka kaže da su sljedeći segmenti odbici. Kliknite mjesto gdje otvor završava. Segment se crta isprekidano; „Duljina“ u statusnoj traci ga izostavlja. Pritisnite E ponovno i nastavite duž zida. Nakon crtanja: odaberite dionicu. Pod Odabrana oznaka, svaki segment ima okvir Odbitak: označite ga da odbijete taj segment, odnosno odznačite da ga ponovno brojite. Svaka promjena je jedan korak poništavanja. Dionica uvijek zadržava barem jedan segment koji se broji. Ploča tada prikazuje Odbici (odbijena duljina) i Nacrtano (cijela dionica); Duljina, količina stavke, površina zida i troškovi koriste duljinu bez odbitaka. 3D pregled provjere ostavlja prazninu u zidu, označeni PDF crta odbitke isprekidano, a izvezeni list Oznake ih navodi. Pomicanje kuta čuva odbitke. Dodavanje ili uklanjanje točaka (ponovnim crtanjem dionice) počinje bez njih. Pogledajte pojedinosti dionice Odaberite Odaberi (V) i kliknite dionicu. Odabrana oznaka s desne strane prikazuje: stavku kojoj pripada (drugu linearnu stavku s popisa odaberite da dionicu premjestite tamo), list, Duljinu u stopama i inčima te u LF, broj Segmenata, i Površinu zida kad stavka ima visinu, duljinu svakog segmenta, uz „(luk)“ nakon lukova, i njegov okvir Odbitak. Na listu je svaki segment odabrane dionice označen svojom duljinom. Popravak dionice Pomaknite točku: odaberite dionicu, zatim povucite jednu od njezinih kvadratnih ručki kuta. Držite Shift da se pomaknuti segment hvata na korake od 45°. Luk zadržava svoje savijanje. Savijte luk: odabrana dionica prikazuje okruglu ručku u sredini svakog luka. Povucite je: luk prolazi kroz mjesto gdje ispustite miš, pa se više ili manje savija ili savija na drugu stranu. Povučen na ravnu liniju između svojih krajeva postaje ravni segment. Ctrl+Z to poništava („Savijanje luka“). Izbrišite dionicu: odaberite je i pritisnite Delete, odaberite Delete u izborniku Više na traci alata ili Izbriši oznaku na ploči. Poništi: Ctrl+Z; ponovi s Ctrl+Y. Točku u sredinu dionice još ne možete umetnuti. Izbrišite dionicu i ponovno je nacrtajte. Površina zida Dajte linearnoj stavki Visina (npr. 9'-0\"). Tada prikazuje Površinu zida (A) = duljina × visina, u SF (ili m² za metričku stavku), a površina zida ide u stupac bilješki izvezene tablice. Koristite je u sklopovima za ploče, boju ili izolaciju: pogledajte Sklopovi i formule.","lang":"hr"},{"slug":"show-lengths-in-meters","scope":"takeoffcraft","title":"Prikaz duljina u metrima","summary":"Čitajte duljine u metrima, centimetrima ili milimetrima umjesto u stopama i palcima te vidite površine u m2.","section":"tasks","order":45,"keywords":["metri","centimetri","milimetri","metrički","prikaz duljina kao","prati globalne postavke","jedinice","prikaz","m2","kvadratni metri","površina zida","stope i palci","temperatura","Celzijus"],"headings":[{"id":"to-ete-u-initi","text":"Što ćete učiniti","level":2},{"id":"koraci","text":"Koraci","level":2},{"id":"napomene","text":"Napomene","level":2}],"html":"\u003Ch2 id=\"to-ete-u-initi\"\u003EŠto ćete učiniti\u003C/h2\u003E\n\u003Cp\u003EPromijenite kako TakeoffDesk prikazuje duljine, pa metrički posao čita se u metrima, centimetrima ili milimetrima na listu, na statusnoj traci i u pločama.\u003C/p\u003E\n\u003Ch2 id=\"koraci\"\u003EKoraci\u003C/h2\u003E\n\u003Col\u003E\u003Cli\u003EOtvorite \u003Cspan class=\"hui\"\u003EPostavke\u003C/span\u003E zupčanikom u traci aplikacije ili pritiskom na \u003Ckbd class=\"hk\"\u003E\u003Cspan class=\"k-mac\" title=\"Command ,\"\u003E⌘,\u003C/span\u003E\u003Cspan class=\"k-pc\"\u003ECtrl+,\u003C/span\u003E\u003C/kbd\u003E i ostanite na kartici \u003Cspan class=\"hui\"\u003ETakeoffDesk\u003C/span\u003E.\u003C/li\u003E\u003Cli\u003EPronađite \u003Cspan class=\"hui\"\u003EPrikaz duljina kao\u003C/span\u003E i odaberite \u003Cspan class=\"hui\"\u003EStope i palci\u003C/span\u003E, m, cm ili mm. \u003Cspan class=\"hui\"\u003EPrati globalne postavke\u003C/span\u003E koristi metričku jedinicu duljine označenu zvjezdicom u \u003Cspan class=\"hui\"\u003EPostavke\u003C/span\u003E › \u003Cspan class=\"hui\"\u003EGlobalne\u003C/span\u003E › \u003Cspan class=\"hui\"\u003EJedinice\u003C/span\u003E, a stope i palce kada nijedna nije označena.\u003C/li\u003E\u003Cli\u003EPogledajte list: duljine na statusnoj traci, na popisu \u003Cspan class=\"hui\"\u003EStavke\u003C/span\u003E i u pločama sada se čitaju u jedinici koju ste odabrali. Visine, dubina, debljina i razine također.\u003C/li\u003E\u003Cli\u003EDa čitate temperature stavki u °C ili °F, odaberite \u003Cspan class=\"hui\"\u003EPrikaži temperature kao\u003C/span\u003E na istoj kartici.\u003C/li\u003E\u003C/ol\u003E\n\u003Ch2 id=\"napomene\"\u003ENapomene\u003C/h2\u003E\n\u003Cul\u003E\u003Cli\u003EMijenja se samo prikaz. Količine, cijene i izvozi računaju se iz točnih duljina.\u003C/li\u003E\u003Cli\u003EGoli broj upisan u polje visine čita se u prikazanoj jedinici.\u003C/li\u003E\u003Cli\u003EIzbor 1/16, 1/8 i 1/4 palca pojavljuje se samo za stope i palce.\u003C/li\u003E\u003Cli\u003EPovršina izmjerena metričkom stavkom na crtežu, u ploči oznake i u tablici piše m2. Linijska stavka s visinom također prikazuje svoju površinu zida. Vidi \u003Ca href=\"/tutorials/takeoffcraft/units\" data-topic=\"takeoffcraft/units\"\u003EJedinice\u003C/a\u003E.\u003C/li\u003E\u003C/ul\u003E","text":"Što ćete učiniti Promijenite kako TakeoffDesk prikazuje duljine, pa metrički posao čita se u metrima, centimetrima ili milimetrima na listu, na statusnoj traci i u pločama. Koraci Otvorite Postavke zupčanikom u traci aplikacije ili pritiskom na Ctrl+, i ostanite na kartici TakeoffDesk. Pronađite Prikaz duljina kao i odaberite Stope i palci, m, cm ili mm. Prati globalne postavke koristi metričku jedinicu duljine označenu zvjezdicom u Postavke › Globalne › Jedinice, a stope i palce kada nijedna nije označena. Pogledajte list: duljine na statusnoj traci, na popisu Stavke i u pločama sada se čitaju u jedinici koju ste odabrali. Visine, dubina, debljina i razine također. Da čitate temperature stavki u °C ili °F, odaberite Prikaži temperature kao na istoj kartici. Napomene Mijenja se samo prikaz. Količine, cijene i izvozi računaju se iz točnih duljina. Goli broj upisan u polje visine čita se u prikazanoj jedinici. Izbor 1/16, 1/8 i 1/4 palca pojavljuje se samo za stope i palce. Površina izmjerena metričkom stavkom na crtežu, u ploči oznake i u tablici piše m2. Linijska stavka s visinom također prikazuje svoju površinu zida. Vidi Jedinice.","lang":"hr"},{"slug":"draw-arcs-ten-methods","scope":"takeoffcraft","title":"Crtanje lukova na deset načina","summary":"Odaberite kako se luk crta, tri točke ili početak, središte, kraj, kut, duljina, smjer ili polumjer.","section":"tasks","order":46,"keywords":["luk","lukovi","krivulja","zakrivljeni zid","3 točke","polumjer","kut","duljina tetive","smjer","središte","početak","kraj","način luka"],"headings":[{"id":"to-ete-napraviti","text":"Što ćete napraviti","level":2},{"id":"koraci","text":"Koraci","level":2},{"id":"napomene","text":"Napomene","level":2}],"html":"\u003Ch2 id=\"to-ete-napraviti\"\u003EŠto ćete napraviti\u003C/h2\u003E\n\u003Cp\u003ENacrtajte zakrivljeni rub u linearnoj dionici, površini ili otvoru, koristeći način luka koji odgovara dimenzijama koje imate.\u003C/p\u003E\n\u003Ch2 id=\"koraci\"\u003EKoraci\u003C/h2\u003E\n\u003Col\u003E\u003Cli\u003EZapočnite dionicu, konturu ili otvor i postavite točku na kojoj krivulja počinje.\u003C/li\u003E\u003Cli\u003EUključite \u003Cspan class=\"hui\"\u003ELuk\u003C/span\u003E na alatnoj traci ili pritisnite \u003Ckbd class=\"hk\"\u003E\u003Cspan class=\"k-mac\" title=\"R\"\u003ER\u003C/span\u003E\u003Cspan class=\"k-pc\"\u003ER\u003C/span\u003E\u003C/kbd\u003E.\u003C/li\u003E\u003Cli\u003EOtvorite \u003Cspan class=\"hui\"\u003ENačin luka\u003C/span\u003E na traci lista. Pokazuje se samo dok je Luk uključen. Odaberite 3 točke, Početak, Središte, Kraj, Početak, Središte, Kut, Početak, Središte, Duljina, Početak, Kraj, Kut, Početak, Kraj, Smjer, Početak, Kraj, Polumjer, Središte, Početak, Kraj, Središte, Početak, Kut ili Središte, Početak, Duljina.\u003C/li\u003E\u003Cli\u003EPratite statusnu traku. Ona kaže što luk čeka: njegovo središte, krajnju točku, kut, duljinu, smjer ili polumjer. Kliknite točku ili upišite broj (kut, duljina, polumjer i smjer).\u003C/li\u003E\u003Cli\u003EKad se unese posljednji podatak, luk se dodaje dionici. \u003Ckbd class=\"hk\"\u003E\u003Cspan class=\"k-mac\" title=\"Esc\"\u003EEsc\u003C/span\u003E\u003Cspan class=\"k-pc\"\u003EEsc\u003C/span\u003E\u003C/kbd\u003E odustaje od luka, \u003Ckbd class=\"hk\"\u003E\u003Cspan class=\"k-mac\" title=\"Delete\"\u003EDelete\u003C/span\u003E\u003Cspan class=\"k-pc\"\u003EBackspace\u003C/span\u003E\u003C/kbd\u003E vraća njegov zadnji korak, a \u003Ckbd class=\"hk\"\u003E\u003Cspan class=\"k-mac\" title=\"R\"\u003ER\u003C/span\u003E\u003Cspan class=\"k-pc\"\u003ER\u003C/span\u003E\u003C/kbd\u003E isključuje Luk.\u003C/li\u003E\u003C/ol\u003E\n\u003Ch2 id=\"napomene\"\u003ENapomene\u003C/h2\u003E\n\u003Cul\u003E\u003Cli\u003ELuk se odbija, uz poruku u statusnoj traci, kad se njegove točke poklapaju ili leže na pravcu, ili kad polumjer ne može doseći krajnju točku.\u003C/li\u003E\u003Cli\u003ENjegova duljina je točna duljina luka, a stare datoteke se otvaraju jednako. Više: \u003Ca href=\"/tutorials/takeoffcraft/measure-linear#arcs-and-curved-walls\" data-topic=\"takeoffcraft/measure-linear\" data-hash=\"arcs-and-curved-walls\"\u003EMjerenje linearnih dionica\u003C/a\u003E.\u003C/li\u003E\u003C/ul\u003E","text":"Što ćete napraviti Nacrtajte zakrivljeni rub u linearnoj dionici, površini ili otvoru, koristeći način luka koji odgovara dimenzijama koje imate. Koraci Započnite dionicu, konturu ili otvor i postavite točku na kojoj krivulja počinje. Uključite Luk na alatnoj traci ili pritisnite R. Otvorite Način luka na traci lista. Pokazuje se samo dok je Luk uključen. Odaberite 3 točke, Početak, Središte, Kraj, Početak, Središte, Kut, Početak, Središte, Duljina, Početak, Kraj, Kut, Početak, Kraj, Smjer, Početak, Kraj, Polumjer, Središte, Početak, Kraj, Središte, Početak, Kut ili Središte, Početak, Duljina. Pratite statusnu traku. Ona kaže što luk čeka: njegovo središte, krajnju točku, kut, duljinu, smjer ili polumjer. Kliknite točku ili upišite broj (kut, duljina, polumjer i smjer). Kad se unese posljednji podatak, luk se dodaje dionici. Esc odustaje od luka, Backspace vraća njegov zadnji korak, a R isključuje Luk. Napomene Luk se odbija, uz poruku u statusnoj traci, kad se njegove točke poklapaju ili leže na pravcu, ili kad polumjer ne može doseći krajnju točku. Njegova duljina je točna duljina luka, a stare datoteke se otvaraju jednako. Više: Mjerenje linearnih dionica.","lang":"hr"},{"slug":"sign-off-the-estimate","scope":"takeoffcraft","title":"Nedostajuće cijene i potpisivanje predračuna","summary":"Pogledajte koje retke predračuna imaju količinu, a nemaju cijenu, potpišite predračun svojim imenom da datoteka bilježi tko, kada i koji ukupni iznos, te kliknite brojku da odaberete oznake iz kojih je nastala.","section":"tasks","order":46,"keywords":["predračun","potpis","potpisivanje","potpisano","odobrenje","odobravanje","nedostajuća cijena","bez cijene","necijenjeno","cijena","ukupno","građevinski troškovničar","zapis","revizija","odabir oznaka","brojka","praćenje"],"headings":[{"id":"to-ete-u-initi","text":"Što ćete učiniti","level":2},{"id":"retci-bez-cijene","text":"Retci bez cijene","level":2},{"id":"potpisivanje-predra-una","text":"Potpisivanje predračuna","level":2},{"id":"kliknite-brojku-da-vidite-odakle-je-do-la","text":"Kliknite brojku da vidite odakle je došla","level":2},{"id":"dobro-je-znati","text":"Dobro je znati","level":2}],"html":"\u003Ch2 id=\"to-ete-u-initi\"\u003EŠto ćete učiniti\u003C/h2\u003E\n\u003Cp\u003EProvjerite je li svaki redak predračuna cijenjen, pa ga potpišite svojim imenom. Datoteka predmjera bilježi tko je potpisao, kada i za koji ukupni iznos.\u003C/p\u003E\n\u003Ch2 id=\"retci-bez-cijene\"\u003ERetci bez cijene\u003C/h2\u003E\n\u003Cp\u003EU \u003Cstrong\u003EKoličine › Po stavci\u003C/strong\u003E redak koji ima količinu, a nema materijalnu ili radnu cijenu, nosi oznaku \u003Cstrong\u003Ebez cijene\u003C/strong\u003E, a traka iznad tablice kaže koliko ih ima. Takav redak ne dodaje ništa ukupnom iznosu. Stavka bez vlastite cijene nije označena kada je jedna od njezinih komponenti cijenjena: sklop se cijeni kroz svoje dijelove. Izvezeni predračun u stupcu Bilješke svakog takvog retka piše \u003Cstrong\u003EBez cijene\u003C/strong\u003E i broji ih.\u003C/p\u003E\n\u003Ch2 id=\"potpisivanje-predra-una\"\u003EPotpisivanje predračuna\u003C/h2\u003E\n\u003Col\u003E\u003Cli\u003EKliknite \u003Cstrong\u003EPotpiši predračun\u003C/strong\u003E iznad tablice Količine.\u003C/li\u003E\u003Cli\u003EDijaloški okvir navodi ukupni iznos koji potpisujete i popisuje retke bez cijene. Upišite svoje ime i, ako želite, svoju ulogu.\u003C/li\u003E\u003Cli\u003EKliknite \u003Cstrong\u003EPotpiši\u003C/strong\u003E. Traka sada kaže „Potpisano od strane … dana …“ s ukupnim iznosom. Spremite predmjer da to zadržite u datoteci.\u003C/li\u003E\u003C/ol\u003E\n\u003Cp\u003EPotpis se odnosi na brojke koje ste potpisali. Svaka kasnija promjena količine, cijene ili retka briše ga, a TakeoffDesk vas o tome obavještava. Poništi vraća predračun koji ste potpisali, a s njim i potpis. Preimenovanje retka nije promjena brojke. \u003Cstrong\u003EUkloni potpis\u003C/strong\u003E ga uklanja.\u003C/p\u003E\n\u003Cp\u003EDatoteka predmjera koja je uređena izvan TakeoffDesk nakon potpisivanja otvara se bez potpisa, uz napomenu o tome. Izvezeni predračun (CSV i XLSX) navodi potpis ispod ukupnih iznosa.\u003C/p\u003E\n\u003Cp\u003ESamo osoba može potpisati. AI pomoćnik može pročitati je li predračun potpisan i koje cijene nedostaju; nema način da potpiše.\u003C/p\u003E\n\u003Ch2 id=\"kliknite-brojku-da-vidite-odakle-je-do-la\"\u003EKliknite brojku da vidite odakle je došla\u003C/h2\u003E\n\u003Cp\u003EKliknite količinu ili iznos retka da odaberete oznake iz kojih je izmjeren. Kada su na drugom listu, taj list se otvara. Kliknite brojku retka \u003Cstrong\u003EUkupno za posao\u003C/strong\u003E da odaberete svaku oznaku na listu. Upisana količina nema oznake.\u003C/p\u003E\n\u003Ch2 id=\"dobro-je-znati\"\u003EDobro je znati\u003C/h2\u003E\n\u003Cul\u003E\u003Cli\u003EPotpis bilježi ime onako kako je upisano. To je zapis u datoteci, a ne elektronski potpis.\u003C/li\u003E\u003Cli\u003EKada su u predmjeru paketi ponude dodijeljeni podizvođačima ili alternative, potpisani ukupni iznos je osnovna ponuda prikazana kao \u003Cstrong\u003EUkupno za posao\u003C/strong\u003E.\u003C/li\u003E\u003C/ul\u003E","text":"Što ćete učiniti Provjerite je li svaki redak predračuna cijenjen, pa ga potpišite svojim imenom. Datoteka predmjera bilježi tko je potpisao, kada i za koji ukupni iznos. Retci bez cijene U Količine › Po stavci redak koji ima količinu, a nema materijalnu ili radnu cijenu, nosi oznaku bez cijene, a traka iznad tablice kaže koliko ih ima. Takav redak ne dodaje ništa ukupnom iznosu. Stavka bez vlastite cijene nije označena kada je jedna od njezinih komponenti cijenjena: sklop se cijeni kroz svoje dijelove. Izvezeni predračun u stupcu Bilješke svakog takvog retka piše Bez cijene i broji ih. Potpisivanje predračuna Kliknite Potpiši predračun iznad tablice Količine. Dijaloški okvir navodi ukupni iznos koji potpisujete i popisuje retke bez cijene. Upišite svoje ime i, ako želite, svoju ulogu. Kliknite Potpiši. Traka sada kaže „Potpisano od strane … dana …“ s ukupnim iznosom. Spremite predmjer da to zadržite u datoteci. Potpis se odnosi na brojke koje ste potpisali. Svaka kasnija promjena količine, cijene ili retka briše ga, a TakeoffDesk vas o tome obavještava. Poništi vraća predračun koji ste potpisali, a s njim i potpis. Preimenovanje retka nije promjena brojke. Ukloni potpis ga uklanja. Datoteka predmjera koja je uređena izvan TakeoffDesk nakon potpisivanja otvara se bez potpisa, uz napomenu o tome. Izvezeni predračun (CSV i XLSX) navodi potpis ispod ukupnih iznosa. Samo osoba može potpisati. AI pomoćnik može pročitati je li predračun potpisan i koje cijene nedostaju; nema način da potpiše. Kliknite brojku da vidite odakle je došla Kliknite količinu ili iznos retka da odaberete oznake iz kojih je izmjeren. Kada su na drugom listu, taj list se otvara. Kliknite brojku retka Ukupno za posao da odaberete svaku oznaku na listu. Upisana količina nema oznake. Dobro je znati Potpis bilježi ime onako kako je upisano. To je zapis u datoteci, a ne elektronski potpis. Kada su u predmjeru paketi ponude dodijeljeni podizvođačima ili alternative, potpisani ukupni iznos je osnovna ponuda prikazana kao Ukupno za posao.","lang":"hr"},{"slug":"office-layout","scope":"takeoffcraft","title":"\"The office layout: grouping, subtotals, title and headings from your Default Policies\"","summary":"Switch on the Default Policies add-on and the estimate, the quantities by sheet, the exports and what an assistant reads take your office's schedule layout, the same one BimCraft's schedules take.","section":"tasks","order":47,"keywords":["office standard","office layout","default policies","add-on","schedule layout","group by type","group by sheet","subtotal","totals","title","headings","capitals","estimate layout","export layout","settings"],"headings":[{"id":"what-you-ll-do","text":"What you'll do","level":2},{"id":"steps","text":"Steps","level":2},{"id":"what-takes-the-layout","text":"What takes the layout","level":2},{"id":"what-keeps-its-own","text":"What keeps its own","level":2},{"id":"good-to-know","text":"Good to know","level":2}],"html":"\u003Ch2 id=\"what-you-ll-do\"\u003EWhat you&#039;ll do\u003C/h2\u003E\n\u003Cp\u003EHave TakeoffDesk lay its tables out the way your office issues them, without setting it up in each takeoff. The layout is set once, in Default Policies, and holds for every takeoff on this computer, and the other way round.\u003C/p\u003E\n\u003Ch2 id=\"steps\"\u003ESteps\u003C/h2\u003E\n\u003Col\u003E\u003Cli\u003EOpen \u003Cstrong\u003ESettings › Add-ons\u003C/strong\u003E and switch on \u003Cstrong\u003EDefault Policies\u003C/strong\u003E. It is off until you do; with it off, or with nothing set, TakeoffDesk is exactly as it was.\u003C/li\u003E\u003Cli\u003EOpen \u003Cstrong\u003ESettings › Global › Default Policies\u003C/strong\u003E and find \u003Cstrong\u003ESchedule layout (the office standard)\u003C/strong\u003E:\u003C/li\u003E\u003C/ol\u003E\n\u003Cdiv class=\"ht-wrap\"\u003E\u003Ctable class=\"ht\"\u003E\u003Cthead\u003E\u003Ctr\u003E\u003Cth scope=\"col\"\u003EPolicy\u003C/th\u003E\u003Cth scope=\"col\"\u003EWhat it does in TakeoffDesk\u003C/th\u003E\u003C/tr\u003E\u003C/thead\u003E\u003Ctbody\u003E\u003Ctr\u003E\u003Ctd\u003EGroup schedules by\u003C/td\u003E\u003Ctd\u003E\u003Cstrong\u003EType\u003C/strong\u003E groups the estimate by item type (Linear, Area, Count, Typed quantity). \u003Cstrong\u003ELevel\u003C/strong\u003E groups the quantities by sheet by their sheet. \u003Cstrong\u003ERoom\u003C/strong\u003E and \u003Cstrong\u003ENo grouping\u003C/strong\u003E leave both ungrouped\u003C/td\u003E\u003C/tr\u003E\u003Ctr\u003E\u003Ctd\u003ETotals in schedules\u003C/td\u003E\u003Ctd\u003E\u003Cstrong\u003EA subtotal under each group and a total\u003C/strong\u003E adds a subtotal under each group. The job total always stays\u003C/td\u003E\u003C/tr\u003E\u003Ctr\u003E\u003Ctd\u003ESchedule title\u003C/td\u003E\u003Ctd\u003EA line over the table, for example \u003Ccode\u003E{schedule}: office layout\u003C/code\u003E\u003C/td\u003E\u003C/tr\u003E\u003Ctr\u003E\u003Ctd\u003EColumn headings\u003C/td\u003E\u003Ctd\u003EAs written, IN CAPITALS or With Capitals\u003C/td\u003E\u003C/tr\u003E\u003C/tbody\u003E\u003C/table\u003E\u003C/div\u003E\n\u003Col\u003E\u003Cli\u003EClose Settings. The tables follow at once.\u003C/li\u003E\u003C/ol\u003E\n\u003Ch2 id=\"what-takes-the-layout\"\u003EWhat takes the layout\u003C/h2\u003E\n\u003Cul\u003E\u003Cli\u003E\u003Cstrong\u003EQuantities › By item\u003C/strong\u003E and \u003Cstrong\u003EBy sheet\u003C/strong\u003E: group headings, a subtotal under each group, the title and the heading case. A line under the title says which parts your office standard set. The rows are the same rows: you still type rates and waste in them and click figures to select their marks. A component or a second condition stays under its item.\u003C/li\u003E\u003Cli\u003E\u003Cstrong\u003EThe exported estimate\u003C/strong\u003E (CSV and XLSX): the same groups and subtotals. In the workbook a subtotal is a \u003Ccode\u003ESUBTOTAL\u003C/code\u003E formula over its group, and the job total is one too, so nothing is counted twice.\u003C/li\u003E\u003Cli\u003E\u003Cstrong\u003EWhat an assistant reads\u003C/strong\u003E: \u003Ccode\u003Etakeoff_estimate\u003C/code\u003E and \u003Ccode\u003Etakeoff_quantities\u003C/code\u003E (by sheet) add a \u003Ccode\u003Elayout\u003C/code\u003E block with the groups, the rows and the subtotals, and say which parts the office set.\u003C/li\u003E\u003C/ul\u003E\n\u003Ch2 id=\"what-keeps-its-own\"\u003EWhat keeps its own\u003C/h2\u003E\n\u003Cul\u003E\u003Cli\u003E\u003Cstrong\u003EQuantities › By area\u003C/strong\u003E states its own grouping (by bid area) and keeps it.\u003C/li\u003E\u003Cli\u003EThe \u003Cstrong\u003Ejob total\u003C/strong\u003E, the markups of the bid summary and the alternates are not regrouped.\u003C/li\u003E\u003Cli\u003EA grouping the table has no column for is left out: the estimate has no level, the quantities by sheet have no type.\u003C/li\u003E\u003C/ul\u003E\n\u003Ch2 id=\"good-to-know\"\u003EGood to know\u003C/h2\u003E\n\u003Cul\u003E\u003Cli\u003EThe policies are kept in this browser and travel in the Default Policies file (\u003Cstrong\u003ESave to a file\u003C/strong\u003E / \u003Cstrong\u003ELoad from a file\u003C/strong\u003E in the same place), so an office shares one file.\u003C/li\u003E\u003Cli\u003EAn estimate exported as CSV with groups in it is for reading. To bring an estimate back in as a price library, export it with no grouping set.\u003C/li\u003E\u003Cli\u003EBimCraft&#039;s side of the same standard: schedules, set-ups and exports. TakeoffDesk has no policies of its own yet, so there is no Default Policies section under Settings › TakeoffDesk.\u003C/li\u003E\u003C/ul\u003E","text":"What you'll do Have TakeoffDesk lay its tables out the way your office issues them, without setting it up in each takeoff. The layout is set once, in Default Policies, and holds for every takeoff on this computer, and the other way round. Steps Open Settings › Add-ons and switch on Default Policies. It is off until you do; with it off, or with nothing set, TakeoffDesk is exactly as it was. Open Settings › Global › Default Policies and find Schedule layout (the office standard): Policy What it does in TakeoffDesk Group schedules by Type groups the estimate by item type (Linear, Area, Count, Typed quantity). Level groups the quantities by sheet by their sheet. Room and No grouping leave both ungrouped Totals in schedules A subtotal under each group and a total adds a subtotal under each group. The job total always stays Schedule title A line over the table, for example {schedule}: office layout Column headings As written, IN CAPITALS or With Capitals Close Settings. The tables follow at once. What takes the layout Quantities › By item and By sheet: group headings, a subtotal under each group, the title and the heading case. A line under the title says which parts your office standard set. The rows are the same rows: you still type rates and waste in them and click figures to select their marks. A component or a second condition stays under its item. The exported estimate (CSV and XLSX): the same groups and subtotals. In the workbook a subtotal is a SUBTOTAL formula over its group, and the job total is one too, so nothing is counted twice. What an assistant reads: takeoff_estimate and takeoff_quantities (by sheet) add a layout block with the groups, the rows and the subtotals, and say which parts the office set. What keeps its own Quantities › By area states its own grouping (by bid area) and keeps it. The job total, the markups of the bid summary and the alternates are not regrouped. A grouping the table has no column for is left out: the estimate has no level, the quantities by sheet have no type. Good to know The policies are kept in this browser and travel in the Default Policies file (Save to a file / Load from a file in the same place), so an office shares one file. An estimate exported as CSV with groups in it is for reading. To bring an estimate back in as a price library, export it with no grouping set. BimCraft's side of the same standard: schedules, set-ups and exports. TakeoffDesk has no policies of its own yet, so there is no Default Policies section under Settings › TakeoffDesk.","lang":"en"},{"slug":"measure-areas","scope":"takeoffcraft","title":"Mjerenje površina s otvorima","summary":"Ocrtajte podove, stropove i ploče, izrežite iz njih rupe, dodajte zakrivljene rubove, kružnice i okrugle otvore te očitajte površinu i opseg.","section":"tasks","order":50,"keywords":["ispuna prostorije","ispuna poplavom","kanta s bojom","klik unutar prostorije","automatska površina","povratni odbitak","stup","šaht","odbitak iz više stavki","površina","poligon","obris","kvadratne stope","sf","otvor","rupa","odbitak","kružnica","okruglo","luk","opseg","pod","strop","ploča"],"headings":[{"id":"ocrtajte-povr-inu","text":"Ocrtajte površinu","level":2},{"id":"zakrivljeni-rubovi","text":"Zakrivljeni rubovi","level":2},{"id":"kru-nica","text":"Kružnica","level":2},{"id":"ispunite-prostoriju-jednim-klikom","text":"Ispunite prostoriju jednim klikom","level":2},{"id":"izre-ite-rupu-iz-povr-ine","text":"Izrežite rupu iz površine","level":2},{"id":"povratni-odbici-stupovi-ahtovi-i-otvori-oduzeti-od-vi-e-stavki","text":"Povratni odbici: stupovi, šahtovi i otvori oduzeti od više stavki","level":2},{"id":"itanje-povr-ine","text":"Čitanje površine","level":2},{"id":"popravak-povr-ine","text":"Popravak površine","level":2},{"id":"dubina-za-volumene","text":"Dubina za volumene","level":2}],"html":"\u003Cp\u003EStavka površine mjeri zatvorenu površinu. Svaki obris može imati izrezane rupe (šaht, stup, gredicu), a rubovi mogu biti ravni ili zakrivljeni.\u003C/p\u003E\n\u003Cp\u003EPrije početka: list treba mjerilo (\u003Ca href=\"/tutorials/takeoffcraft/set-the-scale\" data-topic=\"takeoffcraft/set-the-scale\"\u003EPostavljanje mjerila\u003C/a\u003E), a potrebna vam je stavka površine (\u003Ca href=\"/tutorials/takeoffcraft/create-items\" data-topic=\"takeoffcraft/create-items\"\u003EStvaranje stavki predmjera\u003C/a\u003E).\u003C/p\u003E\n\u003Ch2 id=\"ocrtajte-povr-inu\"\u003EOcrtajte površinu\u003C/h2\u003E\n\u003Col\u003E\u003Cli\u003EKliknite stavku površine pod \u003Cspan class=\"hui\"\u003EStavke\u003C/span\u003E.\u003C/li\u003E\u003Cli\u003EOdaberite \u003Cspan class=\"hui\"\u003EPovršina\u003C/span\u003E na traci alata ili pritisnite \u003Ckbd class=\"hk\"\u003E\u003Cspan class=\"k-mac\" title=\"A\"\u003EA\u003C/span\u003E\u003Cspan class=\"k-pc\"\u003EA\u003C/span\u003E\u003C/kbd\u003E.\u003C/li\u003E\u003Cli\u003EKliknite svaki kut prostorije ili ploče redom. Držite \u003Ckbd class=\"hk\"\u003E\u003Cspan class=\"k-mac\" title=\"Shift\"\u003E⇧\u003C/span\u003E\u003Cspan class=\"k-pc\"\u003EShift\u003C/span\u003E\u003C/kbd\u003E za rubove od 0°, 45° i 90°. Od treće točke nadalje obris se popunjava, a statusna traka prikazuje „Površina“ i „opseg“. Oko prve točke pojavljuje se mali prsten.\u003C/li\u003E\u003Cli\u003EZatvorite obris: kliknite prvu točku (unutar njezina prstena), pritisnite \u003Ckbd class=\"hk\"\u003E\u003Cspan class=\"k-mac\" title=\"Return\"\u003EReturn\u003C/span\u003E\u003Cspan class=\"k-pc\"\u003EEnter\u003C/span\u003E\u003C/kbd\u003E, dvaput kliknite ili desno kliknite. Površina se lagano ispuni bojom stavke, označi se kvadratnim stopama i postaje odabrana oznaka.\u003C/li\u003E\u003C/ol\u003E\n\u003Cp\u003E\u003Ckbd class=\"hk\"\u003E\u003Cspan class=\"k-mac\" title=\"Delete\"\u003EDelete\u003C/span\u003E\u003Cspan class=\"k-pc\"\u003EBackspace\u003C/span\u003E\u003C/kbd\u003E uklanja zadnji kut; \u003Ckbd class=\"hk\"\u003E\u003Cspan class=\"k-mac\" title=\"Esc\"\u003EEsc\u003C/span\u003E\u003Cspan class=\"k-pc\"\u003EEsc\u003C/span\u003E\u003C/kbd\u003E odbacuje obris.\u003C/p\u003E\n\u003Cp\u003EObris koji se sam sječe se odbija: „Obris se sam siječe, pa bi njegova površina bila netočna. Nacrtajte ga ponovno bez presijecanja.“ Lik u obliku osmice nacrtajte kao dvije površine.\u003C/p\u003E\n\u003Ch2 id=\"zakrivljeni-rubovi\"\u003EZakrivljeni rubovi\u003C/h2\u003E\n\u003Cp\u003EDok ocrtavate, uključite način luka (\u003Cspan class=\"hui\"\u003ELuk\u003C/span\u003E ili \u003Ckbd class=\"hk\"\u003E\u003Cspan class=\"k-mac\" title=\"R\"\u003ER\u003C/span\u003E\u003Cspan class=\"k-pc\"\u003ER\u003C/span\u003E\u003C/kbd\u003E). Nakon kuta kliknite točku duž krivulje, pa zatim mjesto gdje krivulja završava. Za zatvaranje obrisa krivuljom, zadnji klik neka bude na prvoj točki. Površina i opseg koriste točnu krivulju. Ponovno pritisnite \u003Ckbd class=\"hk\"\u003E\u003Cspan class=\"k-mac\" title=\"R\"\u003ER\u003C/span\u003E\u003Cspan class=\"k-pc\"\u003ER\u003C/span\u003E\u003C/kbd\u003E za ravne rubove. Za promjenu krivulje kasnije odaberite površinu i povucite okruglu ručku u sredini luka. Pogledajte \u003Ca href=\"/tutorials/takeoffcraft/measure-linear#arcs-and-curved-walls\" data-topic=\"takeoffcraft/measure-linear\" data-hash=\"arcs-and-curved-walls\"\u003EMjerenje linearnih dionica\u003C/a\u003E.\u003C/p\u003E\n\u003Ch2 id=\"kru-nica\"\u003EKružnica\u003C/h2\u003E\n\u003Col\u003E\u003Cli\u003EUz stavku površine odaberite \u003Cspan class=\"hui\"\u003EKružnica\u003C/span\u003E ili pritisnite \u003Ckbd class=\"hk\"\u003E\u003Cspan class=\"k-mac\" title=\"O\"\u003EO\u003C/span\u003E\u003Cspan class=\"k-pc\"\u003EO\u003C/span\u003E\u003C/kbd\u003E.\u003C/li\u003E\u003Cli\u003EKliknite središte.\u003C/li\u003E\u003Cli\u003EKliknite bilo koju točku na rubu.\u003C/li\u003E\u003C/ol\u003E\n\u003Cp\u003EDok pomičete, statusna traka prikazuje polumjer i površinu. Kružnica se dodaje kao oznaka površine s točnom površinom i opsegom.\u003C/p\u003E\n\u003Ch2 id=\"ispunite-prostoriju-jednim-klikom\"\u003EIspunite prostoriju jednim klikom\u003C/h2\u003E\n\u003Cp\u003EKad su prostorije nacrtane kao zatvoreni zidovi, \u003Cspan class=\"hui\"\u003EProstorija\u003C/span\u003E (\u003Ckbd class=\"hk\"\u003E\u003Cspan class=\"k-mac\" title=\"B\"\u003EB\u003C/span\u003E\u003Cspan class=\"k-pc\"\u003EB\u003C/span\u003E\u003C/kbd\u003E) uzima pod jednim klikom:\u003C/p\u003E\n\u003Col\u003E\u003Cli\u003EOdaberite stavku površine (npr. završnu obradu poda) i dajte listu mjerilo.\u003C/li\u003E\u003Cli\u003EOdaberite \u003Cspan class=\"hui\"\u003EProstorija\u003C/span\u003E u grupi \u003Cspan class=\"hui\"\u003EPredmjer\u003C/span\u003E ili pritisnite \u003Ckbd class=\"hk\"\u003E\u003Cspan class=\"k-mac\" title=\"B\"\u003EB\u003C/span\u003E\u003Cspan class=\"k-pc\"\u003EB\u003C/span\u003E\u003C/kbd\u003E.\u003C/li\u003E\u003Cli\u003EKliknite unutar prostorije, u otvorenom podu (ne na liniji ni na oznaci).\u003C/li\u003E\u003C/ol\u003E\n\u003Cp\u003ETakeoffDesk čita linije lista, pronalazi prostor oko klika i ocrtava ga uz unutarnja lica zidova, kao površinu trenutne stavke. Otvori vrata do \u003Cstrong\u003E4&#039;-0&quot;\u003C/strong\u003E smatraju se zatvorenima, pa obris ide ravno preko otvora; \u003Cstrong\u003EPostavke › TakeoffDesk › Ispuna prostorije zatvara otvore do\u003C/strong\u003E mijenja tu širinu (3&#039;-0&quot; do 8&#039;-0&quot;). Nazivi prostorija, namještaj i oprema unutar prostorije ne čine rupe.\u003C/p\u003E\n\u003Cp\u003EOdbija se, uz objašnjenje, kad:\u003C/p\u003E\n\u003Cul\u003E\u003Cli\u003Eje klik na liniji („To je na liniji“);\u003C/li\u003E\u003Cli\u003Eprostor nije zatvoren: otvor širi od postavke pušta ispunu do ruba lista. Povećajte postavku ili ocrtajte tu prostoriju ručno alatom \u003Cspan class=\"hui\"\u003EPovršina\u003C/span\u003E;\u003C/li\u003E\u003Cli\u003Eje prostor premalen (simbol, a ne prostorija).\u003C/li\u003E\u003C/ul\u003E\n\u003Cp\u003EKad je vrata šira od postavke, ispuna prelazi u sljedeću prostoriju i ocrtava obje zajedno: poništite (\u003Ckbd class=\"hk\"\u003E\u003Cspan class=\"k-mac\" title=\"Command Z\"\u003E⌘Z\u003C/span\u003E\u003Cspan class=\"k-pc\"\u003ECtrl+Z\u003C/span\u003E\u003C/kbd\u003E), povećajte postavku i kliknite ponovno. Provjerite obris kao i svaku površinu: povucite njegove kutove da ga popravite. Skenirani list radi isto, ali njegove linije moraju biti dovoljno tamne; svijetlosiva linija možda neće zaustaviti ispunu.\u003C/p\u003E\n\u003Ch2 id=\"izre-ite-rupu-iz-povr-ine\"\u003EIzrežite rupu iz površine\u003C/h2\u003E\n\u003Col\u003E\u003Cli\u003EOdaberite \u003Cspan class=\"hui\"\u003EOdaberi\u003C/span\u003E (\u003Ckbd class=\"hk\"\u003E\u003Cspan class=\"k-mac\" title=\"V\"\u003EV\u003C/span\u003E\u003Cspan class=\"k-pc\"\u003EV\u003C/span\u003E\u003C/kbd\u003E) i kliknite površinu. Ona pokazuje kvadratne ručke na kutovima.\u003C/li\u003E\u003Cli\u003EOdaberite \u003Cspan class=\"hui\"\u003EOtvor\u003C/span\u003E na traci alata (ili pritisnite \u003Ckbd class=\"hk\"\u003E\u003Cspan class=\"k-mac\" title=\"X\"\u003EX\u003C/span\u003E\u003Cspan class=\"k-pc\"\u003EX\u003C/span\u003E\u003C/kbd\u003E), ili \u003Cspan class=\"hui\"\u003EDodaj otvor\u003C/span\u003E pod \u003Cstrong\u003EOdabrana oznaka\u003C/strong\u003E.\u003C/li\u003E\u003Cli\u003EKliknite kutove rupe, unutar površine. Način luka radi i ovdje.\u003C/li\u003E\u003Cli\u003EZatvorite je kao površinu: kliknite njezinu prvu točku, pritisnite \u003Ckbd class=\"hk\"\u003E\u003Cspan class=\"k-mac\" title=\"Return\"\u003EReturn\u003C/span\u003E\u003Cspan class=\"k-pc\"\u003EEnter\u003C/span\u003E\u003C/kbd\u003E, dvaput kliknite ili desno kliknite. Rupa ostaje nepopunjena, a statusna traka kaže „Otvor je dodan. Nacrtajte još jedan ili pritisnite Esc.“\u003C/li\u003E\u003Cli\u003ENacrtajte još rupa u istoj površini ili pritisnite \u003Ckbd class=\"hk\"\u003E\u003Cspan class=\"k-mac\" title=\"Esc\"\u003EEsc\u003C/span\u003E\u003Cspan class=\"k-pc\"\u003EEsc\u003C/span\u003E\u003C/kbd\u003E.\u003C/li\u003E\u003C/ol\u003E\n\u003Cp\u003EZa okruglu rupu odaberite \u003Cspan class=\"hui\"\u003EDodaj okrugli otvor\u003C/span\u003E pod \u003Cstrong\u003EOdabrana oznaka\u003C/strong\u003E, kliknite njezino središte, pa točku na njezinu rubu.\u003C/p\u003E\n\u003Cp\u003EOtvor mora u potpunosti ležati unutar površine i ne smije se preklapati s drugim otvorom. Inače ga TakeoffDesk odbija: „Otvor mora u potpunosti ležati unutar površine.“ ili „Otvori se ne mogu preklapati.“\u003C/p\u003E\n\u003Cp\u003EZa uklanjanje zadnje rupe odaberite \u003Cspan class=\"hui\"\u003EUkloni zadnji otvor\u003C/span\u003E.\u003C/p\u003E\n\u003Ch2 id=\"povratni-odbici-stupovi-ahtovi-i-otvori-oduzeti-od-vi-e-stavki\"\u003EPovratni odbici: stupovi, šahtovi i otvori oduzeti od više stavki\u003C/h2\u003E\n\u003Cp\u003EOtvor pripada jednoj oznaci površine. \u003Cstrong\u003EPovratni odbitak\u003C/strong\u003E se crta jednom i izlazi iz svake površine koju preklapa, za stavke koje odaberete: nacrtajte stupove jednom, i oni se skidaju s završne obrade poda, stropa i ploče zajedno.\u003C/p\u003E\n\u003Col\u003E\u003Cli\u003ENapravite stavku površine za njih, npr. „Stupovi“.\u003C/li\u003E\u003Cli\u003EU postavkama stavke označite \u003Cstrong\u003EPovratni odbitak: njegove oznake uzimaju svoju površinu iz drugih stavki\u003C/strong\u003E. Pojavljuje se popis vaših drugih stavki površine, sve označene: odznačite one koje povratni odbici ne bi trebali dirati (npr. boju na zidovima).\u003C/li\u003E\u003Cli\u003EPredmjerite stupove alatom \u003Cspan class=\"hui\"\u003EPovršina\u003C/span\u003E ili \u003Cspan class=\"hui\"\u003EKružnica\u003C/span\u003E, kao i obično. Svaki je nacrtan crtkano.\u003C/li\u003E\u003C/ol\u003E\n\u003Cp\u003ESvaka oznaka površine označene stavke na istom listu gubi dio koji pokriva povratni odbitak: cijeli odbitak kad je unutra, samo preklapajući dio kad prelazi rub, i ništa unutar otvora. Ploča odabrane površine prikazuje \u003Cstrong\u003EPovratni odbici\u003C/strong\u003E i preostalu površinu. Količina stavke, njezine formule sklopa, troškovi, 3D pregled provjere i izvoz koriste preostalu površinu; bilješke predračuna kažu koliko su povratni odbici oduzeli. Sama stavka povratnog odbitka broji vlastitu površinu (ostavite njezine troškove na nuli ako je ne cijenite).\u003C/p\u003E\n\u003Cp\u003EPovratni odbitak mora biti \u003Cstrong\u003Ekonveksan\u003C/strong\u003E: pravokutnik, kružnica ili bilo koji obris bez unutarnjeg kuta. TakeoffDesk odbija crtanje onoga što nije; L-oblik šahta nacrtajte kao dva povratna odbitka. Povratni odbici ne mogu imati otvore, a dva povratna odbitka koja se preklapaju broje se oba.\u003C/p\u003E\n\u003Cp\u003EOpseg (\u003Ccode\u003EP\u003C/code\u003E) se ne mijenja: povratni odbici oduzimaju samo površinu.\u003C/p\u003E\n\u003Ch2 id=\"itanje-povr-ine\"\u003EČitanje površine\u003C/h2\u003E\n\u003Cp\u003EOdaberite površinu. \u003Cstrong\u003EOdabrana oznaka\u003C/strong\u003E prikazuje:\u003C/p\u003E\n\u003Cdiv class=\"ht-wrap\"\u003E\u003Ctable class=\"ht\"\u003E\u003Cthead\u003E\u003Ctr\u003E\u003Cth scope=\"col\"\u003ERedak\u003C/th\u003E\u003Cth scope=\"col\"\u003EZnačenje\u003C/th\u003E\u003C/tr\u003E\u003C/thead\u003E\u003Ctbody\u003E\u003Ctr\u003E\u003Ctd\u003EPovršina\u003C/td\u003E\u003Ctd\u003ENeto površina: obris minus otvori. To broji stavka.\u003C/td\u003E\u003C/tr\u003E\u003Ctr\u003E\u003Ctd\u003EObris\u003C/td\u003E\u003Ctd\u003EBruto površina unutar obrisa (prikazuje se kad ima otvora).\u003C/td\u003E\u003C/tr\u003E\u003Ctr\u003E\u003Ctd\u003EOtvori\u003C/td\u003E\u003Ctd\u003EKoliko je rupa i njihova ukupna površina.\u003C/td\u003E\u003C/tr\u003E\u003Ctr\u003E\u003Ctd\u003EOpseg\u003C/td\u003E\u003Ctd\u003EDuljina ruba obrisa, \u003Cstrong\u003Eplus\u003C/strong\u003E rubovi svakog otvora („s otvorima“).\u003C/td\u003E\u003C/tr\u003E\u003C/tbody\u003E\u003C/table\u003E\u003C/div\u003E\n\u003Cp\u003EOpseg uključuje rubove otvora namjerno, za stvari poput oplate ili podloge koja ide i oko rupe. Ako vam treba samo vanjski rub, držite rupe izvan te stavke ili izmjerite vanjski rub kao linearnu dionicu.\u003C/p\u003E\n\u003Cp\u003E\u003Cspan class=\"hui\"\u003EJedinica\u003C/span\u003E stavke određuje kako se ukupno prijavljuje: SF, SY ili m². Ploča \u003Cstrong\u003EOdabrana oznaka\u003C/strong\u003E i statusna traka uvijek prikazuju kvadratne stope.\u003C/p\u003E\n\u003Ch2 id=\"popravak-povr-ine\"\u003EPopravak površine\u003C/h2\u003E\n\u003Cul\u003E\u003Cli\u003E\u003Cstrong\u003EPomaknite kut\u003C/strong\u003E: odaberite površinu i povucite ručku kuta (rupe također imaju ručke). Ako bi novi oblik presjekao sam sebe ili gurnuo rupu van, kut se vraća: „Točka je vraćena na mjesto.“\u003C/li\u003E\u003Cli\u003E\u003Cstrong\u003EPremjestite u drugu stavku\u003C/strong\u003E: odaberite drugu stavku površine u popisu \u003Cstrong\u003EStavka\u003C/strong\u003E pod \u003Cstrong\u003EOdabrana oznaka\u003C/strong\u003E.\u003C/li\u003E\u003Cli\u003E\u003Cstrong\u003EIzbrišite\u003C/strong\u003E: \u003Ckbd class=\"hk\"\u003E\u003Cspan class=\"k-mac\" title=\"fn Delete\"\u003Efn Delete\u003C/span\u003E\u003Cspan class=\"k-pc\"\u003EDelete\u003C/span\u003E\u003C/kbd\u003E, \u003Cspan class=\"hui\"\u003EDelete\u003C/span\u003E u izborniku \u003Cspan class=\"hui\"\u003EViše\u003C/span\u003E na traci alata ili \u003Cspan class=\"hui\"\u003EIzbriši oznaku\u003C/span\u003E.\u003C/li\u003E\u003C/ul\u003E\n\u003Ch2 id=\"dubina-za-volumene\"\u003EDubina za volumene\u003C/h2\u003E\n\u003Cp\u003EDajte stavci površine \u003Cspan class=\"hui\"\u003EDubina\u003C/span\u003E (npr. \u003Ccode\u003E0&#039;-4&quot;\u003C/code\u003E za ploču) i u komponenti sklopa upotrijebite \u003Ccode\u003EA * H / 27\u003C/code\u003E za kubične jarde. Pogledajte \u003Ca href=\"/tutorials/takeoffcraft/assemblies\" data-topic=\"takeoffcraft/assemblies\"\u003ESklopovi i formule\u003C/a\u003E.\u003C/p\u003E","text":"Stavka površine mjeri zatvorenu površinu. Svaki obris može imati izrezane rupe (šaht, stup, gredicu), a rubovi mogu biti ravni ili zakrivljeni. Prije početka: list treba mjerilo (Postavljanje mjerila), a potrebna vam je stavka površine (Stvaranje stavki predmjera). Ocrtajte površinu Kliknite stavku površine pod Stavke. Odaberite Površina na traci alata ili pritisnite A. Kliknite svaki kut prostorije ili ploče redom. Držite Shift za rubove od 0°, 45° i 90°. Od treće točke nadalje obris se popunjava, a statusna traka prikazuje „Površina“ i „opseg“. Oko prve točke pojavljuje se mali prsten. Zatvorite obris: kliknite prvu točku (unutar njezina prstena), pritisnite Enter, dvaput kliknite ili desno kliknite. Površina se lagano ispuni bojom stavke, označi se kvadratnim stopama i postaje odabrana oznaka. Backspace uklanja zadnji kut; Esc odbacuje obris. Obris koji se sam sječe se odbija: „Obris se sam siječe, pa bi njegova površina bila netočna. Nacrtajte ga ponovno bez presijecanja.“ Lik u obliku osmice nacrtajte kao dvije površine. Zakrivljeni rubovi Dok ocrtavate, uključite način luka (Luk ili R). Nakon kuta kliknite točku duž krivulje, pa zatim mjesto gdje krivulja završava. Za zatvaranje obrisa krivuljom, zadnji klik neka bude na prvoj točki. Površina i opseg koriste točnu krivulju. Ponovno pritisnite R za ravne rubove. Za promjenu krivulje kasnije odaberite površinu i povucite okruglu ručku u sredini luka. Pogledajte Mjerenje linearnih dionica. Kružnica Uz stavku površine odaberite Kružnica ili pritisnite O. Kliknite središte. Kliknite bilo koju točku na rubu. Dok pomičete, statusna traka prikazuje polumjer i površinu. Kružnica se dodaje kao oznaka površine s točnom površinom i opsegom. Ispunite prostoriju jednim klikom Kad su prostorije nacrtane kao zatvoreni zidovi, Prostorija (B) uzima pod jednim klikom: Odaberite stavku površine (npr. završnu obradu poda) i dajte listu mjerilo. Odaberite Prostorija u grupi Predmjer ili pritisnite B. Kliknite unutar prostorije, u otvorenom podu (ne na liniji ni na oznaci). TakeoffDesk čita linije lista, pronalazi prostor oko klika i ocrtava ga uz unutarnja lica zidova, kao površinu trenutne stavke. Otvori vrata do 4'-0\" smatraju se zatvorenima, pa obris ide ravno preko otvora; Postavke › TakeoffDesk › Ispuna prostorije zatvara otvore do mijenja tu širinu (3'-0\" do 8'-0\"). Nazivi prostorija, namještaj i oprema unutar prostorije ne čine rupe. Odbija se, uz objašnjenje, kad: je klik na liniji („To je na liniji“); prostor nije zatvoren: otvor širi od postavke pušta ispunu do ruba lista. Povećajte postavku ili ocrtajte tu prostoriju ručno alatom Površina; je prostor premalen (simbol, a ne prostorija). Kad je vrata šira od postavke, ispuna prelazi u sljedeću prostoriju i ocrtava obje zajedno: poništite (Ctrl+Z), povećajte postavku i kliknite ponovno. Provjerite obris kao i svaku površinu: povucite njegove kutove da ga popravite. Skenirani list radi isto, ali njegove linije moraju biti dovoljno tamne; svijetlosiva linija možda neće zaustaviti ispunu. Izrežite rupu iz površine Odaberite Odaberi (V) i kliknite površinu. Ona pokazuje kvadratne ručke na kutovima. Odaberite Otvor na traci alata (ili pritisnite X), ili Dodaj otvor pod Odabrana oznaka. Kliknite kutove rupe, unutar površine. Način luka radi i ovdje. Zatvorite je kao površinu: kliknite njezinu prvu točku, pritisnite Enter, dvaput kliknite ili desno kliknite. Rupa ostaje nepopunjena, a statusna traka kaže „Otvor je dodan. Nacrtajte još jedan ili pritisnite Esc.“ Nacrtajte još rupa u istoj površini ili pritisnite Esc. Za okruglu rupu odaberite Dodaj okrugli otvor pod Odabrana oznaka, kliknite njezino središte, pa točku na njezinu rubu. Otvor mora u potpunosti ležati unutar površine i ne smije se preklapati s drugim otvorom. Inače ga TakeoffDesk odbija: „Otvor mora u potpunosti ležati unutar površine.“ ili „Otvori se ne mogu preklapati.“ Za uklanjanje zadnje rupe odaberite Ukloni zadnji otvor. Povratni odbici: stupovi, šahtovi i otvori oduzeti od više stavki Otvor pripada jednoj oznaci površine. Povratni odbitak se crta jednom i izlazi iz svake površine koju preklapa, za stavke koje odaberete: nacrtajte stupove jednom, i oni se skidaju s završne obrade poda, stropa i ploče zajedno. Napravite stavku površine za njih, npr. „Stupovi“. U postavkama stavke označite Povratni odbitak: njegove oznake uzimaju svoju površinu iz drugih stavki. Pojavljuje se popis vaših drugih stavki površine, sve označene: odznačite one koje povratni odbici ne bi trebali dirati (npr. boju na zidovima). Predmjerite stupove alatom Površina ili Kružnica, kao i obično. Svaki je nacrtan crtkano. Svaka oznaka površine označene stavke na istom listu gubi dio koji pokriva povratni odbitak: cijeli odbitak kad je unutra, samo preklapajući dio kad prelazi rub, i ništa unutar otvora. Ploča odabrane površine prikazuje Povratni odbici i preostalu površinu. Količina stavke, njezine formule sklopa, troškovi, 3D pregled provjere i izvoz koriste preostalu površinu; bilješke predračuna kažu koliko su povratni odbici oduzeli. Sama stavka povratnog odbitka broji vlastitu površinu (ostavite njezine troškove na nuli ako je ne cijenite). Povratni odbitak mora biti konveksan: pravokutnik, kružnica ili bilo koji obris bez unutarnjeg kuta. TakeoffDesk odbija crtanje onoga što nije; L-oblik šahta nacrtajte kao dva povratna odbitka. Povratni odbici ne mogu imati otvore, a dva povratna odbitka koja se preklapaju broje se oba. Opseg (P) se ne mijenja: povratni odbici oduzimaju samo površinu. Čitanje površine Odaberite površinu. Odabrana oznaka prikazuje: Redak Značenje Površina Neto površina: obris minus otvori. To broji stavka. Obris Bruto površina unutar obrisa (prikazuje se kad ima otvora). Otvori Koliko je rupa i njihova ukupna površina. Opseg Duljina ruba obrisa, plus rubovi svakog otvora („s otvorima“). Opseg uključuje rubove otvora namjerno, za stvari poput oplate ili podloge koja ide i oko rupe. Ako vam treba samo vanjski rub, držite rupe izvan te stavke ili izmjerite vanjski rub kao linearnu dionicu. Jedinica stavke određuje kako se ukupno prijavljuje: SF, SY ili m². Ploča Odabrana oznaka i statusna traka uvijek prikazuju kvadratne stope. Popravak površine Pomaknite kut: odaberite površinu i povucite ručku kuta (rupe također imaju ručke). Ako bi novi oblik presjekao sam sebe ili gurnuo rupu van, kut se vraća: „Točka je vraćena na mjesto.“ Premjestite u drugu stavku: odaberite drugu stavku površine u popisu Stavka pod Odabrana oznaka. Izbrišite: Delete, Delete u izborniku Više na traci alata ili Izbriši oznaku. Dubina za volumene Dajte stavci površine Dubina (npr. 0'-4\" za ploču) i u komponenti sklopa upotrijebite A * H / 27 za kubične jarde. Pogledajte Sklopovi i formule.","lang":"hr"},{"slug":"roofs-and-slopes","scope":"takeoffcraft","title":"Krovovi i nagibi","summary":"Dodijelite području nagib da izmjerite površinu krova iz nacrta, a zabatne rubove, kosnice i uvale mjerite duž njihova nagiba.","section":"tasks","order":55,"keywords":["krov","nagib","pad","faktor nagiba","uspon","omjer pomaka","6:12","zabatni rub","kosnica","uvala","zabat","pokrivanje krova","kvadrati","nagnuta površina","stvarna duljina","površina tlocrta"],"headings":[{"id":"upisivanje-nagiba","text":"Upisivanje nagiba","level":2},{"id":"povr-ine-krova","text":"Površine krova","level":2},{"id":"zabatni-rubovi-kosnice-i-uvale","text":"Zabatni rubovi, kosnice i uvale","level":2}],"html":"\u003Cp\u003ENacrt krova prikazuje svaku ravninu krova ravno, gledano odozgo. Sam krov je veći: ravnina pod 6:12 ima oko 12% više površine od svog tlocrta, a njezini nagnuti rubovi duži su nego što izgledaju. Dodijelite stavci njezin nagib i TakeoffDesk mjeri duž nagiba.\u003C/p\u003E\n\u003Ch2 id=\"upisivanje-nagiba\"\u003EUpisivanje nagiba\u003C/h2\u003E\n\u003Cp\u003ENagib je uspon na 12 jedinica pomaka, kao na simbolima nagiba na nacrtu krova. Upišite ga kao \u003Ccode\u003E6:12\u003C/code\u003E, \u003Ccode\u003E6/12\u003C/code\u003E ili samo \u003Ccode\u003E6\u003C/code\u003E; radi i drugi omjer (\u003Ccode\u003E4:10\u003C/code\u003E je 4.8:12). Kut radi sa znakom stupnja: \u003Ccode\u003E26.57°\u003C/code\u003E. Prazno ili \u003Ccode\u003E0\u003C/code\u003E znači ravno.\u003C/p\u003E\n\u003Ch2 id=\"povr-ine-krova\"\u003EPovršine krova\u003C/h2\u003E\n\u003Col\u003E\u003Cli\u003ENapravite stavku površine za pokrov ili otvorite postojeću.\u003C/li\u003E\u003Cli\u003EU njezinim postavkama upišite \u003Cstrong\u003ENagib\u003C/strong\u003E, na primjer \u003Ccode\u003E6:12\u003C/code\u003E.\u003C/li\u003E\u003Cli\u003EObrubite svaku ravninu krova na nacrtu alatom \u003Cspan class=\"hui\"\u003EPovršina\u003C/span\u003E, kao i obično.\u003C/li\u003E\u003C/ol\u003E\n\u003Cp\u003ESvaka ravnina broji svoju površinu tlocrta puta faktor nagiba: √(1 + (uspon ÷ 12)²), 1.118 za 6:12 i 1.414 za 12:12. Odaberite ravninu da vidite njezinu \u003Cstrong\u003EPovršinu\u003C/strong\u003E (na nagibu), \u003Cstrong\u003EPovršinu tlocrta\u003C/strong\u003E i \u003Cstrong\u003EFaktor nagiba\u003C/strong\u003E.\u003C/p\u003E\n\u003Cp\u003ERavnine s drugim nagibom: odaberite ravninu i upišite njezin vlastiti \u003Cstrong\u003ENagib\u003C/strong\u003E u njezinoj ploči. Ostavite prazno da koristi nagib stavke. Pregled 3D provjere, sklopovi (\u003Ccode\u003EA\u003C/code\u003E je nagnuta površina), troškovi i izvoz svi koriste nagnutu površinu. Umanjenja na nagnutoj ravnini, poput krovnih prozora, oduzimaju se pod istim nagibom.\u003C/p\u003E\n\u003Cp\u003EOpseg (\u003Ccode\u003EP\u003C/code\u003E) ostaje opseg tlocrta. Strehe, zabatne rubove, kosnice i uvale mjerite kao dionice (u nastavku).\u003C/p\u003E\n\u003Ch2 id=\"zabatni-rubovi-kosnice-i-uvale\"\u003EZabatni rubovi, kosnice i uvale\u003C/h2\u003E\n\u003Col\u003E\u003Cli\u003ENapravite linearnu stavku, poput „Zabatni rub“ ili „Kosnice“.\u003C/li\u003E\u003Cli\u003EPostavite njezinu \u003Cstrong\u003EVrstu nagiba\u003C/strong\u003E na \u003Cstrong\u003EZabatni rub\u003C/strong\u003E (nagnuti rub, kao kod zabata) ili na \u003Cstrong\u003EKosnica ili uvala\u003C/strong\u003E (linija na kojoj se susreću dvije ravnine), i upišite \u003Cstrong\u003ENagib\u003C/strong\u003E ravnina krova.\u003C/li\u003E\u003Cli\u003ENacrtajte dionice na nacrtu alatom \u003Cspan class=\"hui\"\u003ELinearno\u003C/span\u003E.\u003C/li\u003E\u003C/ol\u003E\n\u003Cp\u003EZabatni rub broji svoju duljinu na tlocrtu puta faktor nagiba. Kosnica ili uvala ide pod kutom od 45° preko tlocrta između dviju ravnina istog nagiba, pa je njezina stvarna duljina duljina na tlocrtu puta √(1 + (uspon ÷ 12)² ÷ 2): 1.061 za 6:12, 1.225 za 12:12.\u003C/p\u003E\n\u003Cp\u003EJedna dionica može miješati oboje. Odaberite je: svaki segment u svojoj ploči ima popis vrste nagiba — \u003Cstrong\u003EPostavka stavke\u003C/strong\u003E, \u003Cstrong\u003ERazina\u003C/strong\u003E, \u003Cstrong\u003EZabatni rub\u003C/strong\u003E ili \u003Cstrong\u003EKosnica ili uvala\u003C/strong\u003E — i njegovu duljinu duž nagiba. \u003Cstrong\u003ENagib\u003C/strong\u003E same dionice u ploči zamjenjuje nagib stavke za sve njezine segmente. Ploča također prikazuje \u003Cstrong\u003EDuljinu na tlocrtu\u003C/strong\u003E, a oznake na listu prikazuju duljine duž nagiba.\u003C/p\u003E\n\u003Cp\u003EOdbici i dalje rade: odbijeni segment ne broji ništa, nagnut ili ne.\u003C/p\u003E\n\u003Caside class=\"hc hc-note\"\u003E\u003Cp class=\"hc-label\"\u003ENote\u003C/p\u003E\n\u003Cp\u003EKosnice i uvale pretpostavljaju da obje ravnine imaju isti nagib. Za ravnine različitih nagiba izmjerite kosnicu po njezinoj stvarnoj duljini drugdje ili je nacrtajte kao zabatni rub s ekvivalentnim nagibom.\u003C/p\u003E\n\u003C/aside\u003E","text":"Nacrt krova prikazuje svaku ravninu krova ravno, gledano odozgo. Sam krov je veći: ravnina pod 6:12 ima oko 12% više površine od svog tlocrta, a njezini nagnuti rubovi duži su nego što izgledaju. Dodijelite stavci njezin nagib i TakeoffDesk mjeri duž nagiba. Upisivanje nagiba Nagib je uspon na 12 jedinica pomaka, kao na simbolima nagiba na nacrtu krova. Upišite ga kao 6:12, 6/12 ili samo 6; radi i drugi omjer (4:10 je 4.8:12). Kut radi sa znakom stupnja: 26.57°. Prazno ili 0 znači ravno. Površine krova Napravite stavku površine za pokrov ili otvorite postojeću. U njezinim postavkama upišite Nagib, na primjer 6:12. Obrubite svaku ravninu krova na nacrtu alatom Površina, kao i obično. Svaka ravnina broji svoju površinu tlocrta puta faktor nagiba: √(1 + (uspon ÷ 12)²), 1.118 za 6:12 i 1.414 za 12:12. Odaberite ravninu da vidite njezinu Površinu (na nagibu), Površinu tlocrta i Faktor nagiba. Ravnine s drugim nagibom: odaberite ravninu i upišite njezin vlastiti Nagib u njezinoj ploči. Ostavite prazno da koristi nagib stavke. Pregled 3D provjere, sklopovi (A je nagnuta površina), troškovi i izvoz svi koriste nagnutu površinu. Umanjenja na nagnutoj ravnini, poput krovnih prozora, oduzimaju se pod istim nagibom. Opseg (P) ostaje opseg tlocrta. Strehe, zabatne rubove, kosnice i uvale mjerite kao dionice (u nastavku). Zabatni rubovi, kosnice i uvale Napravite linearnu stavku, poput „Zabatni rub“ ili „Kosnice“. Postavite njezinu Vrstu nagiba na Zabatni rub (nagnuti rub, kao kod zabata) ili na Kosnica ili uvala (linija na kojoj se susreću dvije ravnine), i upišite Nagib ravnina krova. Nacrtajte dionice na nacrtu alatom Linearno. Zabatni rub broji svoju duljinu na tlocrtu puta faktor nagiba. Kosnica ili uvala ide pod kutom od 45° preko tlocrta između dviju ravnina istog nagiba, pa je njezina stvarna duljina duljina na tlocrtu puta √(1 + (uspon ÷ 12)² ÷ 2): 1.061 za 6:12, 1.225 za 12:12. Jedna dionica može miješati oboje. Odaberite je: svaki segment u svojoj ploči ima popis vrste nagiba — Postavka stavke, Razina, Zabatni rub ili Kosnica ili uvala — i njegovu duljinu duž nagiba. Nagib same dionice u ploči zamjenjuje nagib stavke za sve njezine segmente. Ploča također prikazuje Duljinu na tlocrtu, a oznake na listu prikazuju duljine duž nagiba. Odbici i dalje rade: odbijeni segment ne broji ništa, nagnut ili ne. Kosnice i uvale pretpostavljaju da obje ravnine imaju isti nagib. Za ravnine različitih nagiba izmjerite kosnicu po njezinoj stvarnoj duljini drugdje ili je nacrtajte kao zabatni rub s ekvivalentnim nagibom.","lang":"hr"},{"slug":"count-by-hand","scope":"takeoffcraft","title":"Ručno brojanje","summary":"Kliknite svaka vrata, uređaj ili instalaciju da ih prebrojite, provjerite brojanje i ispravite pogreške.","section":"tasks","order":60,"keywords":["brojanje","svaki","ea","instalacije","vrata","uređaji","simboli","zbrajanje","brojanje klikom","ručno brojanje"],"headings":[{"id":"brojanje","text":"Brojanje","level":2},{"id":"ispravak-brojanja","text":"Ispravak brojanja","level":2},{"id":"veli-ina-to-ke-na-zaslonu-i-u-pdf-u","text":"Veličina točke, na zaslonu i u PDF-u","level":2},{"id":"mnogo-jednakih-simbola","text":"Mnogo jednakih simbola","level":2},{"id":"kori-tenje-brojanja-u-formulama","text":"Korištenje brojanja u formulama","level":2}],"html":"\u003Cp\u003EStavka za brojanje broji stvari: vrata, svjetiljke, utičnice, sanitarne instalacije. Svaki klik na listu dodaje jednu oznaku za brojanje. Brojanje ne treba mjerilo.\u003C/p\u003E\n\u003Ch2 id=\"brojanje\"\u003EBrojanje\u003C/h2\u003E\n\u003Col\u003E\u003Cli\u003ENapravite ili kliknite stavku za brojanje pod \u003Cspan class=\"hui\"\u003EStavke\u003C/span\u003E (vrsta \u003Cspan class=\"hui\"\u003EBroji\u003C/span\u003E).\u003C/li\u003E\u003Cli\u003EOdaberite \u003Cspan class=\"hui\"\u003EBroji\u003C/span\u003E na alatnoj traci ili pritisnite \u003Ckbd class=\"hk\"\u003E\u003Cspan class=\"k-mac\" title=\"C\"\u003EC\u003C/span\u003E\u003Cspan class=\"k-pc\"\u003EC\u003C/span\u003E\u003C/kbd\u003E.\u003C/li\u003E\u003Cli\u003EKliknite svaki na listu. Svaki klik stavlja točku u boji stavke, a brojanje stavke povećava se za jedan.\u003C/li\u003E\u003Cli\u003EPređite na sljedeći list (\u003Ckbd class=\"hk\"\u003E\u003Cspan class=\"k-mac\" title=\"fn ↓\"\u003Efn ↓\u003C/span\u003E\u003Cspan class=\"k-pc\"\u003EPage Down\u003C/span\u003E\u003C/kbd\u003E) i nastavite brojati. Alat ostaje na \u003Cspan class=\"hui\"\u003EBroji\u003C/span\u003E.\u003C/li\u003E\u003Cli\u003EPritisnite \u003Ckbd class=\"hk\"\u003E\u003Cspan class=\"k-mac\" title=\"Esc\"\u003EEsc\u003C/span\u003E\u003Cspan class=\"k-pc\"\u003EEsc\u003C/span\u003E\u003C/kbd\u003E kad završite. TakeoffDesk se vraća na \u003Cspan class=\"hui\"\u003EOdaberi\u003C/span\u003E.\u003C/li\u003E\u003C/ol\u003E\n\u003Cp\u003EI dalje povlačenjem pomičete prikaz, a kotačićem zumirate dok brojite, pa se možete kretati po listu bez dodavanja točaka.\u003C/p\u003E\n\u003Caside class=\"hc hc-tip\"\u003E\u003Cp class=\"hc-label\"\u003ETip\u003C/p\u003E\n\u003Cp\u003EKliknite stavku za brojanje da istaknete njezine točke na svakom listu. Popis listova tada pokazuje koliko ih je na svakom listu, što pomaže pronaći listove koje još niste prebrojili.\u003C/p\u003E\n\u003C/aside\u003E\n\u003Ch2 id=\"ispravak-brojanja\"\u003EIspravak brojanja\u003C/h2\u003E\n\u003Cul\u003E\u003Cli\u003E\u003Cstrong\u003EUklanjanje točke\u003C/strong\u003E: odaberite \u003Cspan class=\"hui\"\u003EOdaberi\u003C/span\u003E (\u003Ckbd class=\"hk\"\u003E\u003Cspan class=\"k-mac\" title=\"V\"\u003EV\u003C/span\u003E\u003Cspan class=\"k-pc\"\u003EV\u003C/span\u003E\u003C/kbd\u003E), kliknite točku i pritisnite \u003Ckbd class=\"hk\"\u003E\u003Cspan class=\"k-mac\" title=\"fn Delete\"\u003Efn Delete\u003C/span\u003E\u003Cspan class=\"k-pc\"\u003EDelete\u003C/span\u003E\u003C/kbd\u003E ili odaberite \u003Cspan class=\"hui\"\u003EIzbriši oznaku\u003C/span\u003E. Ili pritisnite \u003Ckbd class=\"hk\"\u003E\u003Cspan class=\"k-mac\" title=\"Command Z\"\u003E⌘Z\u003C/span\u003E\u003Cspan class=\"k-pc\"\u003ECtrl+Z\u003C/span\u003E\u003C/kbd\u003E odmah nakon pogrešnog klika.\u003C/li\u003E\u003Cli\u003E\u003Cstrong\u003EPomicanje točke\u003C/strong\u003E: odaberite je, pa je povucite.\u003C/li\u003E\u003Cli\u003E\u003Cstrong\u003EBrojano pod pogrešnom stavkom\u003C/strong\u003E: odaberite točku i u popisu \u003Cstrong\u003EStavka\u003C/strong\u003E pod \u003Cstrong\u003EOdabrana oznaka\u003C/strong\u003E odaberite ispravnu stavku za brojanje.\u003C/li\u003E\u003C/ul\u003E\n\u003Ch2 id=\"veli-ina-to-ke-na-zaslonu-i-u-pdf-u\"\u003EVeličina točke, na zaslonu i u PDF-u\u003C/h2\u003E\n\u003Cp\u003ETočke zadržavaju jednu veličinu na zaslonu bez obzira koliko zumirali. Da je promijenite, otvorite \u003Cspan class=\"hui\"\u003EPostavke\u003C/span\u003E, karticu TakeoffDesk, i odaberite \u003Cstrong\u003EVeličina oznake brojanja\u003C/strong\u003E: Vrlo mala, Mala, Srednja (zadano) ili Velika.\u003C/p\u003E\n\u003Cp\u003EIzvoz u PDF (\u003Cspan class=\"hui\"\u003EIzvoz\u003C/span\u003E › označeni PDF) crta svaku točku na papiru jednake veličine, bez obzira na veličinu lista: preglednik koji prikazuje PDF na 100 % prikazuje točke jednako velike kao na zaslonu. Ako bi se točke na listu i dalje dodirivale, izvoz smanjuje točke tog lista da se svaka može pročitati.\u003C/p\u003E\n\u003Ch2 id=\"mnogo-jednakih-simbola\"\u003EMnogo jednakih simbola\u003C/h2\u003E\n\u003Cp\u003EZa simbol koji se na listu ponavlja mnogo puta, probajte \u003Ca href=\"/tutorials/takeoffcraft/auto-count\" data-topic=\"takeoffcraft/auto-count\"\u003EAutobrojanje\u003C/a\u003E: označite jedan, pregledajte što je pronašao i dodajte ih sve u jednom koraku.\u003C/p\u003E\n\u003Ch2 id=\"kori-tenje-brojanja-u-formulama\"\u003EKorištenje brojanja u formulama\u003C/h2\u003E\n\u003Cp\u003EKoličina stavke za brojanje je \u003Cstrong\u003EN\u003C/strong\u003E. Komponente sklopa je mogu koristiti, primjerice šarke \u003Ccode\u003EN * 3\u003C/code\u003E za vrata. Pogledajte \u003Ca href=\"/tutorials/takeoffcraft/assemblies\" data-topic=\"takeoffcraft/assemblies\"\u003ESklopovi i formule\u003C/a\u003E.\u003C/p\u003E","text":"Stavka za brojanje broji stvari: vrata, svjetiljke, utičnice, sanitarne instalacije. Svaki klik na listu dodaje jednu oznaku za brojanje. Brojanje ne treba mjerilo. Brojanje Napravite ili kliknite stavku za brojanje pod Stavke (vrsta Broji). Odaberite Broji na alatnoj traci ili pritisnite C. Kliknite svaki na listu. Svaki klik stavlja točku u boji stavke, a brojanje stavke povećava se za jedan. Pređite na sljedeći list (Page Down) i nastavite brojati. Alat ostaje na Broji. Pritisnite Esc kad završite. TakeoffDesk se vraća na Odaberi. I dalje povlačenjem pomičete prikaz, a kotačićem zumirate dok brojite, pa se možete kretati po listu bez dodavanja točaka. Kliknite stavku za brojanje da istaknete njezine točke na svakom listu. Popis listova tada pokazuje koliko ih je na svakom listu, što pomaže pronaći listove koje još niste prebrojili. Ispravak brojanja Uklanjanje točke: odaberite Odaberi (V), kliknite točku i pritisnite Delete ili odaberite Izbriši oznaku. Ili pritisnite Ctrl+Z odmah nakon pogrešnog klika. Pomicanje točke: odaberite je, pa je povucite. Brojano pod pogrešnom stavkom: odaberite točku i u popisu Stavka pod Odabrana oznaka odaberite ispravnu stavku za brojanje. Veličina točke, na zaslonu i u PDF-u Točke zadržavaju jednu veličinu na zaslonu bez obzira koliko zumirali. Da je promijenite, otvorite Postavke, karticu TakeoffDesk, i odaberite Veličina oznake brojanja: Vrlo mala, Mala, Srednja (zadano) ili Velika. Izvoz u PDF (Izvoz › označeni PDF) crta svaku točku na papiru jednake veličine, bez obzira na veličinu lista: preglednik koji prikazuje PDF na 100 % prikazuje točke jednako velike kao na zaslonu. Ako bi se točke na listu i dalje dodirivale, izvoz smanjuje točke tog lista da se svaka može pročitati. Mnogo jednakih simbola Za simbol koji se na listu ponavlja mnogo puta, probajte Autobrojanje: označite jedan, pregledajte što je pronašao i dodajte ih sve u jednom koraku. Korištenje brojanja u formulama Količina stavke za brojanje je N. Komponente sklopa je mogu koristiti, primjerice šarke N * 3 za vrata. Pogledajte Sklopovi i formule.","lang":"hr"},{"slug":"auto-count","scope":"takeoffcraft","title":"Autobrojanje simbola","summary":"Obuhvatite jedan simbol, neka TakeoffDesk pronađe ostale na ovom listu ili na svim otvorenim listovima, provjerite podudaranja kliznikom i dodajte ih u jednom koraku.","section":"tasks","order":70,"keywords":["bilo koji kut","zakrenut","okrenut","drugo mjerilo","različito mjerilo","autobrojanje","automatsko brojanje","pretraživanje simbola","pronađi simbole","uzorak","predložak","podudaranje","detekcija","alat za brojanje"],"headings":[{"id":"prona-i-simbole","text":"Pronađi simbole","level":2},{"id":"pregledajte-podudaranja","text":"Pregledajte podudaranja","level":2},{"id":"dodajte-ih","text":"Dodajte ih","level":2},{"id":"to-pronalazi-a-to-ne","text":"Što pronalazi, a što ne","level":2},{"id":"brzina-i-preglednici","text":"Brzina i preglednici","level":2}],"html":"\u003Cp\u003E\u003Cspan class=\"hui\"\u003EAutobrojanje\u003C/span\u003E pronalazi svaki primjerak simbola nakon što obuhvatite jedan. Zatim pregledate podudaranja na listu i dodajete ona koja prihvaćate kao oznake brojanja. Riječ je o pomoćnom alatu, a ne o jamstvu: uvijek pregledajte prije dodavanja.\u003C/p\u003E\n\u003Ch2 id=\"prona-i-simbole\"\u003EPronađi simbole\u003C/h2\u003E\n\u003Col\u003E\u003Cli\u003ENapravite ili kliknite stavku za brojanje pod \u003Cspan class=\"hui\"\u003EStavke\u003C/span\u003E.\u003C/li\u003E\u003Cli\u003EOtvorite list na kojem se simbol pojavljuje.\u003C/li\u003E\u003Cli\u003EOdaberite \u003Cspan class=\"hui\"\u003EAutobrojanje\u003C/span\u003E na alatnoj traci ili pritisnite \u003Ckbd class=\"hk\"\u003E\u003Cspan class=\"k-mac\" title=\"S\"\u003ES\u003C/span\u003E\u003Cspan class=\"k-pc\"\u003ES\u003C/span\u003E\u003C/kbd\u003E. Pri vrhu lista pojavljuje se traka: „Povucite okvir oko jednog simbola na ovom listu.“\u003C/li\u003E\u003Cli\u003EDa pretražite sve otvorene listove, a ne samo ovaj, označite \u003Cspan class=\"hui\"\u003EPretraži sve otvorene listove\u003C/span\u003E.\u003C/li\u003E\u003Cli\u003EUvećajte prikaz da simbol bude lako vidljiv, zatim povucite okvir čvrsto oko jednog njegovog primjerka. Obuhvatite cijeli simbol; prazni papir oko njega bit će odrezan. Traka prikazuje „Pretraživanje…“ s trakom napretka i gumbom \u003Cspan class=\"hui\"\u003EOdustani\u003C/span\u003E. Stranica ostaje odzivna: možete uvećavati, pomicati prikaz i prelaziti između listova. Odabir drugog alata ili \u003Ckbd class=\"hk\"\u003E\u003Cspan class=\"k-mac\" title=\"Esc\"\u003EEsc\u003C/span\u003E\u003Cspan class=\"k-pc\"\u003EEsc\u003C/span\u003E\u003C/kbd\u003E prekida pretraživanje.\u003C/li\u003E\u003Cli\u003EKad završi, podudaranja se pojavljuju na listu kao okviri u boji stavke, a traka prikazuje sažetak, npr. „22 podudaranja, 19 za dodavanje (3 već brojano). Kliknite okvir da ga odbacite ili vratite.“\u003C/li\u003E\u003C/ol\u003E\n\u003Cp\u003EU \u003Cspan class=\"hui\"\u003EAutobrojanju\u003C/span\u003E povlačenje po listu crta okvir umjesto pomicanja prikaza. Za pomicanje držite \u003Ckbd class=\"hk\"\u003E\u003Cspan class=\"k-mac\" title=\"Space\"\u003ESpace\u003C/span\u003E\u003Cspan class=\"k-pc\"\u003ESpace\u003C/span\u003E\u003C/kbd\u003E i povucite ili povucite srednjim gumbom miša.\u003C/p\u003E\n\u003Ch2 id=\"pregledajte-podudaranja\"\u003EPregledajte podudaranja\u003C/h2\u003E\n\u003Cul\u003E\u003Cli\u003E\u003Cstrong\u003EKliknite okvir\u003C/strong\u003E da ga odbijete. Odbijeni okvir je isprekidan i precrtan. Kliknite ga ponovo da ga vratite.\u003C/li\u003E\u003Cli\u003E\u003Cstrong\u003EPomaknite klizač \u003Cspan class=\"hui\"\u003EPodudaranje\u003C/span\u003E\u003C/strong\u003E (od 50 % do 95 %, početno 75 %). Veća vrijednost prikazuje samo bliska podudaranja; manja prikazuje labavija. Klizač samo filtrira ono što je pronađeno; ne pretražuje ponovo.\u003C/li\u003E\u003Cli\u003E\u003Cstrong\u003EVeć brojano\u003C/strong\u003E: podudaranja na mjestu koje već ima oznaku brojanja ove stavke na početku su odbijena, pa ništa ne brojite dvaput.\u003C/li\u003E\u003Cli\u003E\u003Cstrong\u003EDrugi listovi\u003C/strong\u003E: kad ste pretraživali sve otvorene listove, prelazite između listova pomoću popisa listova ili \u003Ckbd class=\"hk\"\u003E\u003Cspan class=\"k-mac\" title=\"fn ↓\"\u003Efn ↓\u003C/span\u003E\u003Cspan class=\"k-pc\"\u003EPage Down\u003C/span\u003E\u003C/kbd\u003E i pregledajte svaki. Sažetak navodi na koliko listova ima podudaranja.\u003C/li\u003E\u003C/ul\u003E\n\u003Ch2 id=\"dodajte-ih\"\u003EDodajte ih\u003C/h2\u003E\n\u003Cp\u003EOdaberite \u003Cspan class=\"hui\"\u003EDodaj\u003C/span\u003E. Gumb kaže koliko će ih biti, npr. „Dodaj 19 oznaka“. Oznake brojanja dodaju se u središte svakog prihvaćenog okvira: „Dodano je 19 oznaka brojanja u ‚Duplex receptacle‘. Ctrl+Z ih uklanja sve.“\u003C/p\u003E\n\u003Cp\u003ECijela serija je jedan korak poništavanja, pa jedan \u003Ckbd class=\"hk\"\u003E\u003Cspan class=\"k-mac\" title=\"Command Z\"\u003E⌘Z\u003C/span\u003E\u003Cspan class=\"k-pc\"\u003ECtrl+Z\u003C/span\u003E\u003C/kbd\u003E uklanja sve.\u003C/p\u003E\n\u003Cp\u003EDa odbacite pregled bez dodavanja ičega, odaberite \u003Cspan class=\"hui\"\u003EOdbaci\u003C/span\u003E ili pritisnite \u003Ckbd class=\"hk\"\u003E\u003Cspan class=\"k-mac\" title=\"Esc\"\u003EEsc\u003C/span\u003E\u003Cspan class=\"k-pc\"\u003EEsc\u003C/span\u003E\u003C/kbd\u003E. Odabir drugog alata također ga odbacuje.\u003C/p\u003E\n\u003Ch2 id=\"to-pronalazi-a-to-ne\"\u003EŠto pronalazi, a što ne\u003C/h2\u003E\n\u003Cp\u003ETakeoffDesk uspoređuje crtež, piksel po piksel, sa simbolom koji ste obuhvatili.\u003C/p\u003E\n\u003Cul\u003E\u003Cli\u003EPronalazi simbol okrenut za 0°, 90°, 180° i 270°. Označite \u003Cspan class=\"hui\"\u003EBilo koji kut (sporije)\u003C/span\u003E na traci autobrojanja prije nego što nacrtate okvir da ga pronađe i pod bilo kojim kutom: pretražuje svakih 15°, zatim svaki pronalazak dotjeruje na stupanj i pol. To traje otprilike šest puta dulje. Ne pronalazi zrcaljeni simbol (osim ako simbol zrcaljen izgleda isto).\u003C/li\u003E\u003Cli\u003EUz označeno \u003Cspan class=\"hui\"\u003EPretraži sve otvorene listove\u003C/span\u003E, list drugog mjerila pretražuje se u veličini koju simbol ima na tom listu: svjetiljka nacrtana u mjerilu na tlocrtu 1/8&quot; dvostruko je manja nego na tlocrtu 1/4&quot; i dalje se pronalazi. Takav list pretražuje se i u veličini samog okvira, za oznake i simbole otisnute jednakom veličinom na svim listovima. Ovo zahtijeva mjerilo na oba lista; list bez mjerila pretražuje se samo u veličini okvira.\u003C/li\u003E\u003Cli\u003EVrlo slični simboli mogu se međusobno podudarati: duplex utičnica i četverostruka utičnica ili dvije oznake svjetiljki koje se razlikuju za jedno slovo. Podignite klizač dok ne ostanu samo pravi, a ostale odbijte ručno.\u003C/li\u003E\u003Cli\u003ESimbol koji presijecaju druge linije, šrafure ili tekst dobiva nižu ocjenu i možda treba nižu postavku klizača.\u003C/li\u003E\u003Cli\u003EVrlo mali okviri se odbijaju: „Taj okvir je premali. Nacrtajte ga oko cijelog simbola.“ Prazan okvir također se odbija: „Taj okvir je gotovo prazan. Nacrtajte ga oko simbola.“\u003C/li\u003E\u003Cli\u003EList koji bi bio vrlo velik u veličini potrebnoj za ovaj simbol preskače se, a sažetak kaže „1 list je prevelik za pretraživanje ove veličine simbola.“ Obuhvatite veći simbol ili taj list brojite ručno.\u003C/li\u003E\u003C/ul\u003E\n\u003Cp\u003EAko ništa nije pronađeno, statusna traka kaže: „Nema podudaranja. Snizite klizač podudaranja ili obuhvatite simbol tješnje.“\u003C/p\u003E\n\u003Ch2 id=\"brzina-i-preglednici\"\u003EBrzina i preglednici\u003C/h2\u003E\n\u003Cp\u003EPretraživanje se izvodi u pozadinskom procesu, pa stranica ostaje odzivna i pretraživanje možete prekinuti u bilo kojem trenutku. Svaki list najprije se crta u radnoj veličini na samoj stranici, što može na vrlo velikom listu uzrokovati kratki zastoj. Radi u aktualnim verzijama preglednika Chrome, Edge, Firefox i Safari. Pretraživanje mnogo listova traje dulje; traka napretka pomiče se list po list. Izvan mreže autobrojanje radi kad traka aplikacije prikazuje \u003Cspan class=\"hui\"\u003ESpremno za offline\u003C/span\u003E: \u003Cspan class=\"hui\"\u003ESpremi za offline\u003C/span\u003E zadržava i pozadinski proces. Pogledajte \u003Ca href=\"/tutorials/basics/offline\" data-topic=\"basics/offline\"\u003ERad offline\u003C/a\u003E.\u003C/p\u003E","text":"Autobrojanje pronalazi svaki primjerak simbola nakon što obuhvatite jedan. Zatim pregledate podudaranja na listu i dodajete ona koja prihvaćate kao oznake brojanja. Riječ je o pomoćnom alatu, a ne o jamstvu: uvijek pregledajte prije dodavanja. Pronađi simbole Napravite ili kliknite stavku za brojanje pod Stavke. Otvorite list na kojem se simbol pojavljuje. Odaberite Autobrojanje na alatnoj traci ili pritisnite S. Pri vrhu lista pojavljuje se traka: „Povucite okvir oko jednog simbola na ovom listu.“ Da pretražite sve otvorene listove, a ne samo ovaj, označite Pretraži sve otvorene listove. Uvećajte prikaz da simbol bude lako vidljiv, zatim povucite okvir čvrsto oko jednog njegovog primjerka. Obuhvatite cijeli simbol; prazni papir oko njega bit će odrezan. Traka prikazuje „Pretraživanje…“ s trakom napretka i gumbom Odustani. Stranica ostaje odzivna: možete uvećavati, pomicati prikaz i prelaziti između listova. Odabir drugog alata ili Esc prekida pretraživanje. Kad završi, podudaranja se pojavljuju na listu kao okviri u boji stavke, a traka prikazuje sažetak, npr. „22 podudaranja, 19 za dodavanje (3 već brojano). Kliknite okvir da ga odbacite ili vratite.“ U Autobrojanju povlačenje po listu crta okvir umjesto pomicanja prikaza. Za pomicanje držite Space i povucite ili povucite srednjim gumbom miša. Pregledajte podudaranja Kliknite okvir da ga odbijete. Odbijeni okvir je isprekidan i precrtan. Kliknite ga ponovo da ga vratite. Pomaknite klizač Podudaranje (od 50 % do 95 %, početno 75 %). Veća vrijednost prikazuje samo bliska podudaranja; manja prikazuje labavija. Klizač samo filtrira ono što je pronađeno; ne pretražuje ponovo. Već brojano: podudaranja na mjestu koje već ima oznaku brojanja ove stavke na početku su odbijena, pa ništa ne brojite dvaput. Drugi listovi: kad ste pretraživali sve otvorene listove, prelazite između listova pomoću popisa listova ili Page Down i pregledajte svaki. Sažetak navodi na koliko listova ima podudaranja. Dodajte ih Odaberite Dodaj. Gumb kaže koliko će ih biti, npr. „Dodaj 19 oznaka“. Oznake brojanja dodaju se u središte svakog prihvaćenog okvira: „Dodano je 19 oznaka brojanja u ‚Duplex receptacle‘. Ctrl+Z ih uklanja sve.“ Cijela serija je jedan korak poništavanja, pa jedan Ctrl+Z uklanja sve. Da odbacite pregled bez dodavanja ičega, odaberite Odbaci ili pritisnite Esc. Odabir drugog alata također ga odbacuje. Što pronalazi, a što ne TakeoffDesk uspoređuje crtež, piksel po piksel, sa simbolom koji ste obuhvatili. Pronalazi simbol okrenut za 0°, 90°, 180° i 270°. Označite Bilo koji kut (sporije) na traci autobrojanja prije nego što nacrtate okvir da ga pronađe i pod bilo kojim kutom: pretražuje svakih 15°, zatim svaki pronalazak dotjeruje na stupanj i pol. To traje otprilike šest puta dulje. Ne pronalazi zrcaljeni simbol (osim ako simbol zrcaljen izgleda isto). Uz označeno Pretraži sve otvorene listove, list drugog mjerila pretražuje se u veličini koju simbol ima na tom listu: svjetiljka nacrtana u mjerilu na tlocrtu 1/8\" dvostruko je manja nego na tlocrtu 1/4\" i dalje se pronalazi. Takav list pretražuje se i u veličini samog okvira, za oznake i simbole otisnute jednakom veličinom na svim listovima. Ovo zahtijeva mjerilo na oba lista; list bez mjerila pretražuje se samo u veličini okvira. Vrlo slični simboli mogu se međusobno podudarati: duplex utičnica i četverostruka utičnica ili dvije oznake svjetiljki koje se razlikuju za jedno slovo. Podignite klizač dok ne ostanu samo pravi, a ostale odbijte ručno. Simbol koji presijecaju druge linije, šrafure ili tekst dobiva nižu ocjenu i možda treba nižu postavku klizača. Vrlo mali okviri se odbijaju: „Taj okvir je premali. Nacrtajte ga oko cijelog simbola.“ Prazan okvir također se odbija: „Taj okvir je gotovo prazan. Nacrtajte ga oko simbola.“ List koji bi bio vrlo velik u veličini potrebnoj za ovaj simbol preskače se, a sažetak kaže „1 list je prevelik za pretraživanje ove veličine simbola.“ Obuhvatite veći simbol ili taj list brojite ručno. Ako ništa nije pronađeno, statusna traka kaže: „Nema podudaranja. Snizite klizač podudaranja ili obuhvatite simbol tješnje.“ Brzina i preglednici Pretraživanje se izvodi u pozadinskom procesu, pa stranica ostaje odzivna i pretraživanje možete prekinuti u bilo kojem trenutku. Svaki list najprije se crta u radnoj veličini na samoj stranici, što može na vrlo velikom listu uzrokovati kratki zastoj. Radi u aktualnim verzijama preglednika Chrome, Edge, Firefox i Safari. Pretraživanje mnogo listova traje dulje; traka napretka pomiče se list po list. Izvan mreže autobrojanje radi kad traka aplikacije prikazuje Spremno za offline: Spremi za offline zadržava i pozadinski proces. Pogledajte Rad offline.","lang":"hr"},{"slug":"count-from-a-drawing","scope":"takeoffcraft","title":"Brojanje iz crteža","summary":"Brojite blokove, objekte na sloju ili tekst izravno iz DWG-a ili DXF-a: točno, s ugniježđenim blokovima, varijantama dinamičkih blokova i nizovima blokova, u jednom koraku poništavanja.","section":"tasks","order":71,"keywords":["brojanje iz crteža","cad brojanje","brojanje blokova","broji blokove","umetanje","naziv bloka","ugniježđeni blokovi","dinamički blok","varijanta","minsert","niz","sloj","vrsta objekta","kružnice","tekst","atribut","oznaka","skriveni slojevi","točno brojanje","kako","vrata","instalacije"],"headings":[{"id":"brojanje-bloka","text":"Brojanje bloka","level":2},{"id":"to-se-broji","text":"Što se broji","level":3},{"id":"to-se-ne-broji","text":"Što se ne broji","level":3},{"id":"to-prikazuje-ovaj-list-ili-cijeli-crte","text":"Što prikazuje ovaj list ili cijeli crtež","level":2},{"id":"ponovno-brojanje","text":"Ponovno brojanje","level":2},{"id":"po-sloju-i-tipu","text":"Po sloju i tipu","level":2},{"id":"po-tekstu","text":"Po tekstu","level":2},{"id":"kada-umjesto-toga-koristiti-autobrojanje","text":"Kada umjesto toga koristiti Autobrojanje","level":2}],"html":"\u003Cp\u003E\u003Cspan class=\"hui\"\u003ECAD brojanje\u003C/span\u003E na traci lista (naredba \u003Cstrong\u003EBroji iz crteža\u003C/strong\u003E u drugim stilovima izbornika) broji ono što DWG ili DXF kaže da postoji. Gdje \u003Cspan class=\"hui\"\u003EAutobrojanje\u003C/span\u003E traži sliku simbola i može propustiti jedan ili pronaći lažan, ovo broji objekte: svako umetanje bloka nazvanog \u003Ccode\u003EDOOR-36\u003C/code\u003E jedna su vrata. Najprije otvorite crtež: \u003Ca href=\"/tutorials/takeoffcraft/open-a-drawing\" data-topic=\"takeoffcraft/open-a-drawing\"\u003EOtvaranje DWG ili DXF crteža\u003C/a\u003E.\u003C/p\u003E\n\u003Ch2 id=\"brojanje-bloka\"\u003EBrojanje bloka\u003C/h2\u003E\n\u003Col\u003E\u003Cli\u003EOtvorite list crteža. \u003Cspan class=\"hui\"\u003ECAD brojanje\u003C/span\u003E nalazi se na traci lista.\u003C/li\u003E\u003Cli\u003EOdaberite ga. Prozor navodi blokove i koliko ih ima svakoga. Pretražite po nazivu, pa odaberite jedan.\u003C/li\u003E\u003Cli\u003EProvjerite redak ispod popisa: „Pronađeno 22, za dodavanje 22.“\u003C/li\u003E\u003Cli\u003EPod \u003Cspan class=\"hui\"\u003EDodaj u\u003C/span\u003E odaberite stavku za brojanje ili ostavite \u003Cspan class=\"hui\"\u003ENova stavka za brojanje\u003C/span\u003E i dajte joj naziv.\u003C/li\u003E\u003Cli\u003EOdaberite gumb za dodavanje, koji navodi broj: \u003Cspan class=\"hui\"\u003EDodaj 22 oznake\u003C/span\u003E. Oznake se pojavljuju na točkama umetanja bloka, a količina stavke je broj brojanja.\u003C/li\u003E\u003C/ol\u003E\n\u003Cp\u003ETo je jedan korak poništavanja: \u003Ckbd class=\"hk\"\u003E\u003Cspan class=\"k-mac\" title=\"Command Z\"\u003E⌘Z\u003C/span\u003E\u003Cspan class=\"k-pc\"\u003ECtrl+Z\u003C/span\u003E\u003C/kbd\u003E uklanja oznake (i novu stavku) zajedno. Predračun, proračunska tablica i označeni PDF stavku tretiraju kao svaku drugu stavku za brojanje.\u003C/p\u003E\n\u003Ch3 id=\"to-se-broji\"\u003EŠto se broji\u003C/h3\u003E\n\u003Cul\u003E\u003Cli\u003E\u003Cstrong\u003ESvako umetanje naziva bloka\u003C/strong\u003E, bez obzira na mjerilo i kut, u prostoru modela ili papirnom prostoru. Nazivi blokova ne razlikuju velika i mala slova.\u003C/li\u003E\u003Cli\u003E\u003Cstrong\u003ENizovi blokova\u003C/strong\u003E (MINSERT): svaka kopija u nizu je jedna.\u003C/li\u003E\u003Cli\u003E\u003Cstrong\u003EUgniježđeni blokovi.\u003C/strong\u003E Blok postavljen unutar drugog bloka broji se na svakoj razini. Popis kaže „6 unutar drugih blokova“; uklonite oznaku s \u003Cspan class=\"hui\"\u003EBroji i blokove unutar drugih blokova\u003C/span\u003E da brojite samo umetanja postavljena izravno u crtež.\u003C/li\u003E\u003Cli\u003E\u003Cstrong\u003EDinamički blokovi.\u003C/strong\u003E Dinamički blok broji se pod svojim nazivom, a ne pod anonimnim kopijama (\u003Ccode\u003E*U12\u003C/code\u003E) koje datoteka čuva. Njegova stanja navedena su zasebno („Single 12, Double 4“): odaberite stanje da brojite samo njih ili \u003Cspan class=\"hui\"\u003ESvaka varijanta\u003C/span\u003E. Kad datoteka ne kaže koje stanje kopija prikazuje, one se navode kao „(stanje nepoznato)“.\u003C/li\u003E\u003Cli\u003E\u003Cstrong\u003EFiltar sloja.\u003C/strong\u003E Blok na više slojeva: odaberite jedan pod \u003Cspan class=\"hui\"\u003ENa sloju\u003C/span\u003E.\u003C/li\u003E\u003C/ul\u003E\n\u003Ch3 id=\"to-se-ne-broji\"\u003EŠto se ne broji\u003C/h3\u003E\n\u003Cul\u003E\u003Cli\u003E\u003Cstrong\u003ESkriveni slojevi.\u003C/strong\u003E Objekt na sloju koji je u datoteci isključen ili zamrznut (ili ste ga sakrili u \u003Cspan class=\"hui\"\u003ESlojevi\u003C/span\u003E) izostavlja se, a redak kaže koliko: „3 na skrivenim slojevima izostavljeno“. Označite \u003Cspan class=\"hui\"\u003EBroji i njih\u003C/span\u003E da ih uključite.\u003C/li\u003E\u003Cli\u003E\u003Cstrong\u003EVanjske reference (Xref) koje nisu otvorene\u003C/strong\u003E ne broje se; prozor to kaže.\u003C/li\u003E\u003Cli\u003E\u003Cstrong\u003EObjekti složeni točno jedan na drugi iste vrste\u003C/strong\u003E broje se kao dva (to su dva objekta) i prozor to kaže: obično je riječ o crtačkoj pogrešci koju vrijedi pogledati.\u003C/li\u003E\u003C/ul\u003E\n\u003Ch2 id=\"to-prikazuje-ovaj-list-ili-cijeli-crte\"\u003EŠto prikazuje ovaj list ili cijeli crtež\u003C/h2\u003E\n\u003Cul\u003E\u003Cli\u003E\u003Cstrong\u003EŠto prikazuje ovaj list\u003C/strong\u003E broji objekte koje list prikazuje: na layoutu, objekte modela unutar njegovih viewporta (sloj zamrznut u viewportu se tamo ne broji) plus vlastite objekte layouta.\u003C/li\u003E\u003Cli\u003E\u003Cstrong\u003ECijeli crtež, svaki objekt jednom\u003C/strong\u003E broji prostor modela jednom, s oznakama na kartici Model, i ne broji ponovno ono što više layouta prikazuje.\u003C/li\u003E\u003C/ul\u003E\n\u003Cp\u003EBrojanje onoga što layout prikazuje i brojanje onoga što prikazuje Model daju isti broj za iste objekte; ne zbrajajte oboje u jednu stavku.\u003C/p\u003E\n\u003Ch2 id=\"ponovno-brojanje\"\u003EPonovno brojanje\u003C/h2\u003E\n\u003Cp\u003EPonovno brojanje istog bloka istom stavkom dodaje samo ono što je novo: „22 već prebrojeno.“ Svaka oznaka predstavlja jedan objekt.\u003C/p\u003E\n\u003Ch2 id=\"po-sloju-i-tipu\"\u003EPo sloju i tipu\u003C/h2\u003E\n\u003Cp\u003EPod \u003Cspan class=\"hui\"\u003EPo sloju i tipu\u003C/span\u003E odaberite sloj i vrstu objekta (kružnice, polilinije, šrafure…): „sve kružnice na E-LITE“. Označite \u003Cspan class=\"hui\"\u003EBroji i objekte unutar blokova\u003C/span\u003E da uključite one unutar definicija blokova, na svakom mjestu gdje je blok umetnut.\u003C/p\u003E\n\u003Ch2 id=\"po-tekstu\"\u003EPo tekstu\u003C/h2\u003E\n\u003Cp\u003EPod \u003Cspan class=\"hui\"\u003EPo tekstu\u003C/span\u003E upišite tekst, primjerice \u003Ccode\u003EA3\u003C/code\u003E, i odredite je li to točno taj tekst, sadrži li ga ili ga ima kao cijelu riječ. Tekstualni objekti, višestruki tekst s vodilicom i \u003Cstrong\u003Evrijednosti atributa\u003C/strong\u003E bloka broje se svi (atribut oznake \u003Ccode\u003EITEM = A3\u003C/code\u003E se pronalazi); odaberite \u003Cspan class=\"hui\"\u003EU atributu\u003C/span\u003E da brojite samo jedan atribut. Najčešći tekstovi navedeni su za klik.\u003C/p\u003E\n\u003Ch2 id=\"kada-umjesto-toga-koristiti-autobrojanje\"\u003EKada umjesto toga koristiti Autobrojanje\u003C/h2\u003E\n\u003Cp\u003EKoristite \u003Cspan class=\"hui\"\u003EAutobrojanje\u003C/span\u003E za PDF-ove i za simbole u crtežu koji nisu blokovi (nacrtani slobodno ili rastavljeni). Nacrtane kao blokovi, brojite ih ovdje.\u003C/p\u003E","text":"CAD brojanje na traci lista (naredba Broji iz crteža u drugim stilovima izbornika) broji ono što DWG ili DXF kaže da postoji. Gdje Autobrojanje traži sliku simbola i može propustiti jedan ili pronaći lažan, ovo broji objekte: svako umetanje bloka nazvanog DOOR-36 jedna su vrata. Najprije otvorite crtež: Otvaranje DWG ili DXF crteža. Brojanje bloka Otvorite list crteža. CAD brojanje nalazi se na traci lista. Odaberite ga. Prozor navodi blokove i koliko ih ima svakoga. Pretražite po nazivu, pa odaberite jedan. Provjerite redak ispod popisa: „Pronađeno 22, za dodavanje 22.“ Pod Dodaj u odaberite stavku za brojanje ili ostavite Nova stavka za brojanje i dajte joj naziv. Odaberite gumb za dodavanje, koji navodi broj: Dodaj 22 oznake. Oznake se pojavljuju na točkama umetanja bloka, a količina stavke je broj brojanja. To je jedan korak poništavanja: Ctrl+Z uklanja oznake (i novu stavku) zajedno. Predračun, proračunska tablica i označeni PDF stavku tretiraju kao svaku drugu stavku za brojanje. Što se broji Svako umetanje naziva bloka, bez obzira na mjerilo i kut, u prostoru modela ili papirnom prostoru. Nazivi blokova ne razlikuju velika i mala slova. Nizovi blokova (MINSERT): svaka kopija u nizu je jedna. Ugniježđeni blokovi. Blok postavljen unutar drugog bloka broji se na svakoj razini. Popis kaže „6 unutar drugih blokova“; uklonite oznaku s Broji i blokove unutar drugih blokova da brojite samo umetanja postavljena izravno u crtež. Dinamički blokovi. Dinamički blok broji se pod svojim nazivom, a ne pod anonimnim kopijama (*U12) koje datoteka čuva. Njegova stanja navedena su zasebno („Single 12, Double 4“): odaberite stanje da brojite samo njih ili Svaka varijanta. Kad datoteka ne kaže koje stanje kopija prikazuje, one se navode kao „(stanje nepoznato)“. Filtar sloja. Blok na više slojeva: odaberite jedan pod Na sloju. Što se ne broji Skriveni slojevi. Objekt na sloju koji je u datoteci isključen ili zamrznut (ili ste ga sakrili u Slojevi) izostavlja se, a redak kaže koliko: „3 na skrivenim slojevima izostavljeno“. Označite Broji i njih da ih uključite. Vanjske reference (Xref) koje nisu otvorene ne broje se; prozor to kaže. Objekti složeni točno jedan na drugi iste vrste broje se kao dva (to su dva objekta) i prozor to kaže: obično je riječ o crtačkoj pogrešci koju vrijedi pogledati. Što prikazuje ovaj list ili cijeli crtež Što prikazuje ovaj list broji objekte koje list prikazuje: na layoutu, objekte modela unutar njegovih viewporta (sloj zamrznut u viewportu se tamo ne broji) plus vlastite objekte layouta. Cijeli crtež, svaki objekt jednom broji prostor modela jednom, s oznakama na kartici Model, i ne broji ponovno ono što više layouta prikazuje. Brojanje onoga što layout prikazuje i brojanje onoga što prikazuje Model daju isti broj za iste objekte; ne zbrajajte oboje u jednu stavku. Ponovno brojanje Ponovno brojanje istog bloka istom stavkom dodaje samo ono što je novo: „22 već prebrojeno.“ Svaka oznaka predstavlja jedan objekt. Po sloju i tipu Pod Po sloju i tipu odaberite sloj i vrstu objekta (kružnice, polilinije, šrafure…): „sve kružnice na E-LITE“. Označite Broji i objekte unutar blokova da uključite one unutar definicija blokova, na svakom mjestu gdje je blok umetnut. Po tekstu Pod Po tekstu upišite tekst, primjerice A3, i odredite je li to točno taj tekst, sadrži li ga ili ga ima kao cijelu riječ. Tekstualni objekti, višestruki tekst s vodilicom i vrijednosti atributa bloka broje se svi (atribut oznake ITEM = A3 se pronalazi); odaberite U atributu da brojite samo jedan atribut. Najčešći tekstovi navedeni su za klik. Kada umjesto toga koristiti Autobrojanje Koristite Autobrojanje za PDF-ove i za simbole u crtežu koji nisu blokovi (nacrtani slobodno ili rastavljeni). Nacrtane kao blokovi, brojite ih ovdje.","lang":"hr"},{"slug":"count-everything","scope":"takeoffcraft","title":"Brojanje svega u skupu nacrta","summary":"Označite jednom legendu simbola i TakeoffDesk broji svaki simbol iz nje na svakom otvorenom listu u jednom prolazu. Svako brojanje je poveznica na svoj list, a pregledavate prije dodavanja.","section":"tasks","order":71,"keywords":["broji sve","legenda","legenda simbola","cijeli skup","svaki list","svi listovi","svaka vrata","svaka instalacija","uređaji","popis","simboli","autobrojanje","skup nacrta","200 listova","razina podudaranja","sličan izgled"],"headings":[{"id":"brojanje-legende","text":"Brojanje legende","level":2},{"id":"pregled-brojanja","text":"Pregled brojanja","level":2},{"id":"dodavanje","text":"Dodavanje","level":2},{"id":"s-va-im-pomo-nikom","text":"S vašim pomoćnikom","level":2},{"id":"simboli-pod-bilo-kojim-kutom","text":"Simboli pod bilo kojim kutom","level":2},{"id":"dobro-je-znati","text":"Dobro je znati","level":2}],"html":"\u003Cp\u003E\u003Cspan class=\"hui\"\u003EBroji sve\u003C/span\u003E čita legendu simbola, a zatim broji svaki simbol iz nje na svakom otvorenom listu. To je \u003Cspan class=\"hui\"\u003EAutobrojanje\u003C/span\u003E za cijelu legendu odjednom. Riječ je o jednostavnom podudaranju simbola na vašim listovima, a ne o treniranom modelu, i ništa ne napušta vaše računalo. Pregledajte brojanja prije dodavanja: to je pomoćno sredstvo, a ne jamstvo.\u003C/p\u003E\n\u003Ch2 id=\"brojanje-legende\"\u003EBrojanje legende\u003C/h2\u003E\n\u003Col\u003E\u003Cli\u003EOtvorite nacrte. Legenda na bilo kojem listu je dovoljna: simboli s nazivima uz njih.\u003C/li\u003E\u003Cli\u003EOdaberite \u003Cspan class=\"hui\"\u003EBroji sve\u003C/span\u003E na alatnoj traci.\u003C/li\u003E\u003Cli\u003EPovucite okvir oko legende, simbola i naziva. Naslov bez simbola uz sebe (SYMBOL LEGEND) izostavlja se sam od sebe. Panel navodi svaki simbol sa slikom i nazivom ispisanim uz njega. Naziv postaje naziv stavke, pa ga ovdje po želji preimenujte.\u003C/li\u003E\u003Cli\u003EUklonite oznaku sa svakog simbola koji ne želite brojati. Simbol koji se ne može pretraživati (premalen ili prazan) kaže zašto.\u003C/li\u003E\u003Cli\u003EOdaberite \u003Cspan class=\"hui\"\u003EBroji na N listova\u003C/span\u003E. Traka prikazuje list koji se pretražuje; \u003Cspan class=\"hui\"\u003EOdustani\u003C/span\u003E zaustavlja pokretanje. Stranica ostaje upotrebljiva.\u003C/li\u003E\u003C/ol\u003E\n\u003Cp\u003ESimboli same legende ne broje se na njezinu listu. List nacrtan u drugom mjerilu pretražuje se u tom mjerilu, a simboli se pronalaze zakrenuti pod bilo kojim pravim kutom.\u003C/p\u003E\n\u003Ch2 id=\"pregled-brojanja\"\u003EPregled brojanja\u003C/h2\u003E\n\u003Cul\u003E\u003Cli\u003ESvaki simbol prikazuje svoj ukupan broj, a ispod njega poveznicu za svaki list koji ih ima („E-103: 4“). Kliknite jednu za odlazak na taj list. Pronalasci su uokvireni bojom stavke.\u003C/li\u003E\u003Cli\u003E\u003Cstrong\u003EKliknite okvir\u003C/strong\u003E da taj pronalazak izostavite. Okvir je isprekidan i precrtan; kliknite ga ponovno da ga vratite.\u003C/li\u003E\u003Cli\u003E\u003Cstrong\u003EPomaknite razinu podudaranja\u003C/strong\u003E (od 50 % do 100 %, počevši od razine u vašim postavkama). Viša razina zadržava samo bliska podudaranja. Klizač samo filtrira ono što je pronađeno; ništa se ne pretražuje ponovno.\u003C/li\u003E\u003Cli\u003EDva simbola koja izgledaju slično (dvostruka i četverostruka utičnica) mogu se podudarati na istom mjestu. Bolje podudaranje ga zadržava, a panel kaže na koliko se takvih mjesta to dogodilo, pa ih možete provjeriti.\u003C/li\u003E\u003Cli\u003EList prevelik za pretraživanje pri veličini simbola preskače se, a panel to kaže.\u003C/li\u003E\u003C/ul\u003E\n\u003Ch2 id=\"dodavanje\"\u003EDodavanje\u003C/h2\u003E\n\u003Cp\u003EOdaberite \u003Cspan class=\"hui\"\u003EDodaj N oznaka\u003C/span\u003E. Svaki simbol postaje stavka za brojanje s oznakom na svakom pronalasku. Naziv koji je već vaša stavka za brojanje se ponovno koristi (ništa se ne udvostručuje tamo gdje ste već ručno označili). Cijeli prolaz je jedan korak: \u003Ckbd class=\"hk\"\u003E\u003Cspan class=\"k-mac\" title=\"Control Z\"\u003E⌃Z\u003C/span\u003E\u003Cspan class=\"k-pc\"\u003ECtrl+Z\u003C/span\u003E\u003C/kbd\u003E vraća sve stavke i oznake.\u003C/p\u003E\n\u003Cp\u003EOno što prihvatite također ide u \u003Cspan class=\"hui\"\u003ENaučeno\u003C/span\u003E: simboli se pamte u datoteci predmjera za sljedeći put.\u003C/p\u003E\n\u003Ch2 id=\"s-va-im-pomo-nikom\"\u003ES vašim pomoćnikom\u003C/h2\u003E\n\u003Cp\u003EAko u Postavkama dopuštate pomoćnike, mogu čitati legendu (legend_open), pokrenuti brojanje u pozadini (legend_count_start, zatim legend_count_status), pročitati brojanja (legend_count_result) i dodati ih (legend_count_add, koji prvo može prikazati pregled onoga što bi dodao). To je isti prolaz koji vidite u panelu.\u003C/p\u003E\n\u003Ch2 id=\"simboli-pod-bilo-kojim-kutom\"\u003ESimboli pod bilo kojim kutom\u003C/h2\u003E\n\u003Cp\u003EOznačite \u003Cspan class=\"hui\"\u003ESimboli pod bilo kojim kutom\u003C/span\u003E prije brojanja da pronađete i simbole nacrtane pod kutom koji nije pravi kut (kosa zidna utičnica, svjetiljka okrenuta da prati krov). Pretraga tada zakreće svaki simbol svakih 15°; okrugli simbol i dalje treba jedno pretraživanje, a simbol koji nije okrugao može trajati do šest puta dulje. Ostavite isključeno za nacrte nacrtane pravokutno.\u003C/p\u003E\n\u003Ch2 id=\"dobro-je-znati\"\u003EDobro je znati\u003C/h2\u003E\n\u003Cul\u003E\u003Cli\u003EPotrebni su simboli nacrtani na isti način kao u legendi. Legenda nacrtana u drugoj veličini od listova je u redu kad su mjerila listova postavljena; bez mjerila simboli se pretražuju u veličini legende.\u003C/li\u003E\u003Cli\u003ESimbol kroz koji prolazi zid ili duga linija može se previdjeti, jer više ne izgleda kao slika u legendi. Provjerite pronalaske na prvom listu prije nego što vjerujete ostalima.\u003C/li\u003E\u003Cli\u003ESken bez teksta i dalje radi: simboli se pronalaze po redovima u kojima stoje, a nazive upisujete sami.\u003C/li\u003E\u003C/ul\u003E","text":"Broji sve čita legendu simbola, a zatim broji svaki simbol iz nje na svakom otvorenom listu. To je Autobrojanje za cijelu legendu odjednom. Riječ je o jednostavnom podudaranju simbola na vašim listovima, a ne o treniranom modelu, i ništa ne napušta vaše računalo. Pregledajte brojanja prije dodavanja: to je pomoćno sredstvo, a ne jamstvo. Brojanje legende Otvorite nacrte. Legenda na bilo kojem listu je dovoljna: simboli s nazivima uz njih. Odaberite Broji sve na alatnoj traci. Povucite okvir oko legende, simbola i naziva. Naslov bez simbola uz sebe (SYMBOL LEGEND) izostavlja se sam od sebe. Panel navodi svaki simbol sa slikom i nazivom ispisanim uz njega. Naziv postaje naziv stavke, pa ga ovdje po želji preimenujte. Uklonite oznaku sa svakog simbola koji ne želite brojati. Simbol koji se ne može pretraživati (premalen ili prazan) kaže zašto. Odaberite Broji na N listova. Traka prikazuje list koji se pretražuje; Odustani zaustavlja pokretanje. Stranica ostaje upotrebljiva. Simboli same legende ne broje se na njezinu listu. List nacrtan u drugom mjerilu pretražuje se u tom mjerilu, a simboli se pronalaze zakrenuti pod bilo kojim pravim kutom. Pregled brojanja Svaki simbol prikazuje svoj ukupan broj, a ispod njega poveznicu za svaki list koji ih ima („E-103: 4“). Kliknite jednu za odlazak na taj list. Pronalasci su uokvireni bojom stavke. Kliknite okvir da taj pronalazak izostavite. Okvir je isprekidan i precrtan; kliknite ga ponovno da ga vratite. Pomaknite razinu podudaranja (od 50 % do 100 %, počevši od razine u vašim postavkama). Viša razina zadržava samo bliska podudaranja. Klizač samo filtrira ono što je pronađeno; ništa se ne pretražuje ponovno. Dva simbola koja izgledaju slično (dvostruka i četverostruka utičnica) mogu se podudarati na istom mjestu. Bolje podudaranje ga zadržava, a panel kaže na koliko se takvih mjesta to dogodilo, pa ih možete provjeriti. List prevelik za pretraživanje pri veličini simbola preskače se, a panel to kaže. Dodavanje Odaberite Dodaj N oznaka. Svaki simbol postaje stavka za brojanje s oznakom na svakom pronalasku. Naziv koji je već vaša stavka za brojanje se ponovno koristi (ništa se ne udvostručuje tamo gdje ste već ručno označili). Cijeli prolaz je jedan korak: Ctrl+Z vraća sve stavke i oznake. Ono što prihvatite također ide u Naučeno: simboli se pamte u datoteci predmjera za sljedeći put. S vašim pomoćnikom Ako u Postavkama dopuštate pomoćnike, mogu čitati legendu (legend_open), pokrenuti brojanje u pozadini (legend_count_start, zatim legend_count_status), pročitati brojanja (legend_count_result) i dodati ih (legend_count_add, koji prvo može prikazati pregled onoga što bi dodao). To je isti prolaz koji vidite u panelu. Simboli pod bilo kojim kutom Označite Simboli pod bilo kojim kutom prije brojanja da pronađete i simbole nacrtane pod kutom koji nije pravi kut (kosa zidna utičnica, svjetiljka okrenuta da prati krov). Pretraga tada zakreće svaki simbol svakih 15°; okrugli simbol i dalje treba jedno pretraživanje, a simbol koji nije okrugao može trajati do šest puta dulje. Ostavite isključeno za nacrte nacrtane pravokutno. Dobro je znati Potrebni su simboli nacrtani na isti način kao u legendi. Legenda nacrtana u drugoj veličini od listova je u redu kad su mjerila listova postavljena; bez mjerila simboli se pretražuju u veličini legende. Simbol kroz koji prolazi zid ili duga linija može se previdjeti, jer više ne izgleda kao slika u legendi. Provjerite pronalaske na prvom listu prije nego što vjerujete ostalima. Sken bez teksta i dalje radi: simboli se pronalaze po redovima u kojima stoje, a nazive upisujete sami.","lang":"hr"},{"slug":"what-it-learned","scope":"takeoffcraft","title":"Što je naučeno iz vaših predmjera","summary":"TakeoffDesk čuva simbole koje ste potvrdili pomoću Autobrojanja, vaše skupove uvjeta, sklopove koje najčešće koristite i uzorke koje ponavljate na svakoj stranici, sve unutar vlastite datoteke predmjera. Pogledajte ih, upotrijebite ih, izbrišite.","section":"tasks","order":72,"keywords":["naučeno","učenje","učiti","pomoćnik","zapamti","simboli","predlošci","isto kao prošli posao","prošli posao","skup uvjeta","uvjeti","ponovna upotreba","sklopovi","najčešće korišteno","prijedlozi","ponovi na svakoj stranici","svaka stranica","zaglavlje crteža","uzorak","očisti sve","zaboravi","privatnost"],"headings":[{"id":"simboli","text":"Simboli","level":2},{"id":"skupovi-uvjeta","text":"Skupovi uvjeta","level":2},{"id":"isto-kao-pro-li-posao","text":"Isto kao prošli posao","level":2},{"id":"sklopovi-koje-naj-e-e-koristite","text":"Sklopovi koje najčešće koristite","level":2},{"id":"ponovi-na-svakoj-stranici","text":"Ponovi na svakoj stranici","level":2},{"id":"pogledajte-izbri-ite","text":"Pogledajte, izbrišite","level":2},{"id":"dobro-je-znati","text":"Dobro je znati","level":2}],"html":"\u003Cp\u003ETakeoffDesk postaje brži što više predmjera radite s njim. Uči \u003Cstrong\u003Esamo iz onoga što prihvatite\u003C/strong\u003E:\u003C/p\u003E\n\u003Cul\u003E\u003Cli\u003Esimbole koje ste označili pomoću \u003Ca href=\"/tutorials/takeoffcraft/auto-count\" data-topic=\"takeoffcraft/auto-count\"\u003EAutobrojanje\u003C/a\u003E i zatim dodali,\u003C/li\u003E\u003Cli\u003Eskupove uvjeta koje spremite,\u003C/li\u003E\u003Cli\u003Esklopove koje koristite (jednom po poslu),\u003C/li\u003E\u003Cli\u003Euzorke oznaka koje ponavljate na svakoj stranici.\u003C/li\u003E\u003C/ul\u003E\n\u003Cp\u003ERiječ je o običnom uspoređivanju na vlastitim listovima, istom pretraživanju koje pokreće Autobrojanje. Nije riječ o treniranom modelu. Sve što nauči čuva se \u003Cstrong\u003Eu datoteci ovog predmjera\u003C/strong\u003E (\u003Ccode\u003E.takeoff.json\u003C/code\u003E) i ništa se nigdje ne šalje. Da to prenesete na sljedeći posao, upotrijebite \u003Ca href=\"/tutorials/takeoffcraft/what-it-learned#same-as-last-job\" data-topic=\"takeoffcraft/what-it-learned\" data-hash=\"same-as-last-job\"\u003EIsto kao prošli posao\u003C/a\u003E.\u003C/p\u003E\n\u003Cp\u003EOdaberite \u003Cspan class=\"hui\"\u003ENaučeno\u003C/span\u003E na alatnoj traci (žarulja, pored \u003Cspan class=\"hui\"\u003EAutobrojanje\u003C/span\u003E) da vidite sve.\u003C/p\u003E\n\u003Ch2 id=\"simboli\"\u003ESimboli\u003C/h2\u003E\n\u003Cp\u003EKad označite simbol pomoću \u003Cspan class=\"hui\"\u003EAutobrojanje\u003C/span\u003E i odaberete \u003Cspan class=\"hui\"\u003EDodaj\u003C/span\u003E, označeni simbol se čuva, s razinom podudaranja koju ste prihvatili.\u003C/p\u003E\n\u003Cul\u003E\u003Cli\u003EU \u003Cspan class=\"hui\"\u003ENaučeno\u003C/span\u003E odaberite \u003Cspan class=\"hui\"\u003EPronađi na ovom listu\u003C/span\u003E ili \u003Cspan class=\"hui\"\u003EPronađi na svakom listu\u003C/span\u003E. Otvara se uobičajeni pregled Autobrojanja: kliknite okvir da ga izuzmete, pomaknite klizač, zatim ih dodajte. Ništa se ne dodaje dok to ne učinite.\u003C/li\u003E\u003Cli\u003EKad otvorite list na kojem još nema naučenog simbola, traka na vrhu nudi \u003Cspan class=\"hui\"\u003EPronađi …\u003C/span\u003E za njega. \u003Cspan class=\"hui\"\u003ENe sada\u003C/span\u003E to skriva za taj list.\u003C/li\u003E\u003Cli\u003EAko predmjer nema stavku tog naziva, dodavanje oznaka dodaje i stavku (jedan korak poništavanja).\u003C/li\u003E\u003Cli\u003EPonovno dodavanje simbola iste stavke računa se prema onome koji već poznaje; simbol koji drukčije izgleda čuva se kao drugi.\u003C/li\u003E\u003Cli\u003EKao i Autobrojanje, pronalazi simbol pod pravim kutovima i na listovima u drugom mjerilu.\u003C/li\u003E\u003C/ul\u003E\n\u003Ch2 id=\"skupovi-uvjeta\"\u003ESkupovi uvjeta\u003C/h2\u003E\n\u003Cp\u003ESkup čuva uvjete predmjera (stavke s njihovim jedinicama, cijenama, gubitkom i sklopovima), bez oznaka.\u003C/p\u003E\n\u003Col\u003E\u003Cli\u003EU \u003Cspan class=\"hui\"\u003ENaučeno\u003C/span\u003E odaberite \u003Cspan class=\"hui\"\u003ESpremi uvjete ovog predmjera kao skup…\u003C/span\u003E i dajte mu ime. Skup s istim imenom se zamjenjuje.\u003C/li\u003E\u003Cli\u003EU predmjeru koji ima skup, \u003Cspan class=\"hui\"\u003EDodaj\u003C/span\u003E stavlja uvjete koje još nema. Uvjeti s istim imenom i vrstom ostaju netaknuti. To je jedan korak poništavanja.\u003C/li\u003E\u003C/ol\u003E\n\u003Ch2 id=\"isto-kao-pro-li-posao\"\u003EIsto kao prošli posao\u003C/h2\u003E\n\u003Cp\u003EDatoteka vašeg prošlog posla čuva ono što je naučio. Da započnete novi posao iz nje:\u003C/p\u003E\n\u003Col\u003E\u003Cli\u003EOtvorite nove nacrte, zatim odaberite \u003Cspan class=\"hui\"\u003ENaučeno\u003C/span\u003E › \u003Cspan class=\"hui\"\u003EIsto kao prošli posao…\u003C/span\u003E.\u003C/li\u003E\u003Cli\u003EOdaberite \u003Ccode\u003E.takeoff.json\u003C/code\u003E prošlog posla.\u003C/li\u003E\u003Cli\u003EOznačite što uvesti: njegove uvjete (samo one koje ovaj predmjer nema) i što je naučio (simbole, skupove, sklopove, uzorke). Zatim \u003Cspan class=\"hui\"\u003EUvezi ih\u003C/span\u003E.\u003C/li\u003E\u003C/ol\u003E\n\u003Cp\u003ENjegovi uvjeti se također čuvaju kao skup s imenom tog posla. Njegove oznake i količine ostaju u njegovoj datoteci. Sve je jedan korak poništavanja.\u003C/p\u003E\n\u003Ch2 id=\"sklopovi-koje-naj-e-e-koristite\"\u003ESklopovi koje najčešće koristite\u003C/h2\u003E\n\u003Cp\u003EStavka koja ima sklop računa se kao upotrijebljena jednom po poslu kad ima količinu i kad spremite predmjer. Posao je skup nacrta iz kojih je predmjer izrađen, pa ponovno spremanje istog predmjera ne računa se dvaput. Popis pod \u003Cspan class=\"hui\"\u003ESklopovi koje najčešće koristite\u003C/span\u003E stavlja na vrh one koje najviše koristite. Izostavlja one koje ovaj predmjer već ima. \u003Cspan class=\"hui\"\u003EDodaj\u003C/span\u003E stavlja jedan onako kako ste ga zadnji put koristili, sa svim dijelovima.\u003C/p\u003E\n\u003Ch2 id=\"ponovi-na-svakoj-stranici\"\u003EPonovi na svakoj stranici\u003C/h2\u003E\n\u003Cp\u003EZa oznake koje su iste na svakoj stranici skupa, poput brojanja zaglavlja crteža ili uobičajenog detalja:\u003C/p\u003E\n\u003Col\u003E\u003Cli\u003EOdaberite oznake na jednom listu (\u003Ca href=\"/tutorials/takeoffcraft/copy-paste#select-the-marks\" data-topic=\"takeoffcraft/copy-paste\" data-hash=\"select-the-marks\"\u003EOdabir oznaka\u003C/a\u003E).\u003C/li\u003E\u003Cli\u003EU \u003Cspan class=\"hui\"\u003ENaučeno\u003C/span\u003E odaberite \u003Cspan class=\"hui\"\u003EPonovi odabrane oznake na svakoj stranici…\u003C/span\u003E, dajte uzorku ime i potvrdite.\u003C/li\u003E\u003C/ol\u003E\n\u003Cp\u003EStavljaju se na svaku drugu otvorenu stranicu \u003Cstrong\u003Eiste veličine\u003C/strong\u003E, na istom mjestu, u jednom koraku poništavanja. Duljine i površine samo na stranicama s istim mjerilom; brojanja na bilo kojoj stranici te veličine. Stranica koja ih već ima se preskače. Uzorak se čuva, pa stranice koje kasnije otvorite dobivaju ponudu u traci, ili možete koristiti \u003Cspan class=\"hui\"\u003EPonovi na svakoj stranici\u003C/span\u003E s popisa.\u003C/p\u003E\n\u003Ch2 id=\"pogledajte-izbri-ite\"\u003EPogledajte, izbrišite\u003C/h2\u003E\n\u003Cp\u003ESve što je naučeno navedeno je u \u003Cspan class=\"hui\"\u003ENaučeno\u003C/span\u003E. Gumb za brisanje briše jednu stavku. \u003Cspan class=\"hui\"\u003EOčisti sve\u003C/span\u003E briše sve što je naučeno i ostavlja vaše stavke i oznake netaknutima. Oboje se može poništiti dok ne zatvorite predmjer, a oboje se sprema s predmjerom.\u003C/p\u003E\n\u003Cp\u003EDa prestanete učiti u jednom predmjeru, isključite \u003Cspan class=\"hui\"\u003EUči iz ovog predmjera\u003C/span\u003E. Ništa novo se ne uči, a ono što je navedeno ostaje dok ga ne izbrišete.\u003C/p\u003E\n\u003Ch2 id=\"dobro-je-znati\"\u003EDobro je znati\u003C/h2\u003E\n\u003Cul\u003E\u003Cli\u003EStarije verzije aplikacije TakeoffDesk otvaraju datoteku s naučenim stvarima normalno. Ignoriraju taj dio i odbacuju ga ako datoteku ponovno spreme.\u003C/li\u003E\u003Cli\u003ENaučeni simbol je mala slika onoga što ste označili, čuva se u datoteci (nekoliko kilobajta svaki).\u003C/li\u003E\u003Cli\u003ENaučeni simboli pretražuju se kao što pretražuje Autobrojanje, pa vrijede ista ograničenja: \u003Ca href=\"/tutorials/takeoffcraft/auto-count\" data-topic=\"takeoffcraft/auto-count\"\u003EAutobrojanje simbola\u003C/a\u003E.\u003C/li\u003E\u003C/ul\u003E","text":"TakeoffDesk postaje brži što više predmjera radite s njim. Uči samo iz onoga što prihvatite: simbole koje ste označili pomoću Autobrojanje i zatim dodali, skupove uvjeta koje spremite, sklopove koje koristite (jednom po poslu), uzorke oznaka koje ponavljate na svakoj stranici. Riječ je o običnom uspoređivanju na vlastitim listovima, istom pretraživanju koje pokreće Autobrojanje. Nije riječ o treniranom modelu. Sve što nauči čuva se u datoteci ovog predmjera (.takeoff.json) i ništa se nigdje ne šalje. Da to prenesete na sljedeći posao, upotrijebite Isto kao prošli posao. Odaberite Naučeno na alatnoj traci (žarulja, pored Autobrojanje) da vidite sve. Simboli Kad označite simbol pomoću Autobrojanje i odaberete Dodaj, označeni simbol se čuva, s razinom podudaranja koju ste prihvatili. U Naučeno odaberite Pronađi na ovom listu ili Pronađi na svakom listu. Otvara se uobičajeni pregled Autobrojanja: kliknite okvir da ga izuzmete, pomaknite klizač, zatim ih dodajte. Ništa se ne dodaje dok to ne učinite. Kad otvorite list na kojem još nema naučenog simbola, traka na vrhu nudi Pronađi … za njega. Ne sada to skriva za taj list. Ako predmjer nema stavku tog naziva, dodavanje oznaka dodaje i stavku (jedan korak poništavanja). Ponovno dodavanje simbola iste stavke računa se prema onome koji već poznaje; simbol koji drukčije izgleda čuva se kao drugi. Kao i Autobrojanje, pronalazi simbol pod pravim kutovima i na listovima u drugom mjerilu. Skupovi uvjeta Skup čuva uvjete predmjera (stavke s njihovim jedinicama, cijenama, gubitkom i sklopovima), bez oznaka. U Naučeno odaberite Spremi uvjete ovog predmjera kao skup… i dajte mu ime. Skup s istim imenom se zamjenjuje. U predmjeru koji ima skup, Dodaj stavlja uvjete koje još nema. Uvjeti s istim imenom i vrstom ostaju netaknuti. To je jedan korak poništavanja. Isto kao prošli posao Datoteka vašeg prošlog posla čuva ono što je naučio. Da započnete novi posao iz nje: Otvorite nove nacrte, zatim odaberite Naučeno › Isto kao prošli posao…. Odaberite .takeoff.json prošlog posla. Označite što uvesti: njegove uvjete (samo one koje ovaj predmjer nema) i što je naučio (simbole, skupove, sklopove, uzorke). Zatim Uvezi ih. Njegovi uvjeti se također čuvaju kao skup s imenom tog posla. Njegove oznake i količine ostaju u njegovoj datoteci. Sve je jedan korak poništavanja. Sklopovi koje najčešće koristite Stavka koja ima sklop računa se kao upotrijebljena jednom po poslu kad ima količinu i kad spremite predmjer. Posao je skup nacrta iz kojih je predmjer izrađen, pa ponovno spremanje istog predmjera ne računa se dvaput. Popis pod Sklopovi koje najčešće koristite stavlja na vrh one koje najviše koristite. Izostavlja one koje ovaj predmjer već ima. Dodaj stavlja jedan onako kako ste ga zadnji put koristili, sa svim dijelovima. Ponovi na svakoj stranici Za oznake koje su iste na svakoj stranici skupa, poput brojanja zaglavlja crteža ili uobičajenog detalja: Odaberite oznake na jednom listu (Odabir oznaka). U Naučeno odaberite Ponovi odabrane oznake na svakoj stranici…, dajte uzorku ime i potvrdite. Stavljaju se na svaku drugu otvorenu stranicu iste veličine, na istom mjestu, u jednom koraku poništavanja. Duljine i površine samo na stranicama s istim mjerilom; brojanja na bilo kojoj stranici te veličine. Stranica koja ih već ima se preskače. Uzorak se čuva, pa stranice koje kasnije otvorite dobivaju ponudu u traci, ili možete koristiti Ponovi na svakoj stranici s popisa. Pogledajte, izbrišite Sve što je naučeno navedeno je u Naučeno. Gumb za brisanje briše jednu stavku. Očisti sve briše sve što je naučeno i ostavlja vaše stavke i oznake netaknutima. Oboje se može poništiti dok ne zatvorite predmjer, a oboje se sprema s predmjerom. Da prestanete učiti u jednom predmjeru, isključite Uči iz ovog predmjera. Ništa novo se ne uči, a ono što je navedeno ostaje dok ga ne izbrišete. Dobro je znati Starije verzije aplikacije TakeoffDesk otvaraju datoteku s naučenim stvarima normalno. Ignoriraju taj dio i odbacuju ga ako datoteku ponovno spreme. Naučeni simbol je mala slika onoga što ste označili, čuva se u datoteci (nekoliko kilobajta svaki). Naučeni simboli pretražuju se kao što pretražuje Autobrojanje, pa vrijede ista ograničenja: Autobrojanje simbola.","lang":"hr"},{"slug":"price-memory","scope":"takeoffcraft","title":"Price memory from your past jobs","summary":"TakeoffDesk remembers the rates you used on past takeoffs, on this computer only, so a new takeoff can start from what you paid last time. See it, use it, forget it.","section":"tasks","order":73,"keywords":["price memory","prices","remember prices","last job","past jobs","typical price","median","rates","unpriced","reprice","learn from a past takeoff","forget","library"],"headings":[{"id":"what-gets-remembered","text":"What gets remembered","level":2},{"id":"use-it-on-a-new-takeoff","text":"Use it on a new takeoff","level":2},{"id":"see-it-change-it-forget-it","text":"See it, change it, forget it","level":2},{"id":"with-your-assistant","text":"With your assistant","level":2}],"html":"\u003Cp\u003E\u003Cspan class=\"hui\"\u003EPrices\u003C/span\u003E on the toolbar (the dollar sign) opens what TakeoffDesk remembers about the prices you used. It is a plain list: for each item name, the rates from your last jobs. It is kept in this browser beside the price Library, never inside a takeoff file, and nothing is sent anywhere. It is not a trained model.\u003C/p\u003E\n\u003Ch2 id=\"what-gets-remembered\"\u003EWhat gets remembered\u003C/h2\u003E\n\u003Cp\u003EWhen you save a takeoff, each item that has a price and is used (it has a mark, or a typed quantity above zero) is remembered under its name and type: material rate, labor rate, waste and unit. A job is the plan files it is taken off, so saving the same takeoff again replaces its own prices instead of adding another job. The last 12 jobs are kept for each name.\u003C/p\u003E\n\u003Cp\u003ETo start with your older work, choose \u003Cspan class=\"hui\"\u003ELearn from a past takeoff…\u003C/span\u003E and pick a saved takeoff (.json). Its priced, used items are remembered the same way.\u003C/p\u003E\n\u003Cp\u003ENames match when their words match, whatever the case or punctuation (&quot;2x4 Stud, 8 ft&quot; and &quot;2x4 stud 8 FT&quot; are the same). The same words for another kind of item (a linear item and a count item) are not the same price.\u003C/p\u003E\n\u003Ch2 id=\"use-it-on-a-new-takeoff\"\u003EUse it on a new takeoff\u003C/h2\u003E\n\u003Col\u003E\u003Cli\u003EMake the items of the new takeoff.\u003C/li\u003E\u003Cli\u003EChoose \u003Cspan class=\"hui\"\u003EPrices\u003C/span\u003E. Under \u003Cspan class=\"hui\"\u003EThis takeoff\u003C/span\u003E you see every item that has a remembered price, what you have on it now, the last job&#039;s rates, the typical rates (the middle of the remembered jobs) and the range.\u003C/li\u003E\u003Cli\u003EChoose \u003Cspan class=\"hui\"\u003EUse last\u003C/span\u003E or \u003Cspan class=\"hui\"\u003EUse typical\u003C/span\u003E on one item, or \u003Cspan class=\"hui\"\u003EPrice N unpriced items from memory\u003C/span\u003E to fill every item that has no price yet from the last job.\u003C/li\u003E\u003C/ol\u003E\n\u003Cp\u003EEach use is one step: \u003Ckbd class=\"hk\"\u003E\u003Cspan class=\"k-mac\" title=\"Control Z\"\u003E⌃Z\u003C/span\u003E\u003Cspan class=\"k-pc\"\u003ECtrl+Z\u003C/span\u003E\u003C/kbd\u003E takes it back. An item that only has a similar name (one name inside the other) says so, and the buttons use the similar name&#039;s rates. A price remembered per each is never put on an item per foot: the dialog says the units differ and leaves it alone.\u003C/p\u003E\n\u003Ch2 id=\"see-it-change-it-forget-it\"\u003ESee it, change it, forget it\u003C/h2\u003E\n\u003Cp\u003E\u003Cspan class=\"hui\"\u003EEverything remembered\u003C/span\u003E lists every name with its rates and the number of jobs. The trash button forgets one name; \u003Cspan class=\"hui\"\u003EClear all prices\u003C/span\u003E forgets them all. Turn off \u003Cspan class=\"hui\"\u003ERemember my prices when I save a takeoff\u003C/span\u003E to stop remembering; what is already there stays until you forget it. Your takeoffs and the price Library are never touched.\u003C/p\u003E\n\u003Ch2 id=\"with-your-assistant\"\u003EWith your assistant\u003C/h2\u003E\n\u003Cp\u003EIf you allow assistants in Settings, they can read what is remembered for the takeoff&#039;s items (prices_list) and price items from it (prices_apply, which can preview first). It is the same list as the dialog.\u003C/p\u003E","text":"Prices on the toolbar (the dollar sign) opens what TakeoffDesk remembers about the prices you used. It is a plain list: for each item name, the rates from your last jobs. It is kept in this browser beside the price Library, never inside a takeoff file, and nothing is sent anywhere. It is not a trained model. What gets remembered When you save a takeoff, each item that has a price and is used (it has a mark, or a typed quantity above zero) is remembered under its name and type: material rate, labor rate, waste and unit. A job is the plan files it is taken off, so saving the same takeoff again replaces its own prices instead of adding another job. The last 12 jobs are kept for each name. To start with your older work, choose Learn from a past takeoff… and pick a saved takeoff (.json). Its priced, used items are remembered the same way. Names match when their words match, whatever the case or punctuation (\"2x4 Stud, 8 ft\" and \"2x4 stud 8 FT\" are the same). The same words for another kind of item (a linear item and a count item) are not the same price. Use it on a new takeoff Make the items of the new takeoff. Choose Prices. Under This takeoff you see every item that has a remembered price, what you have on it now, the last job's rates, the typical rates (the middle of the remembered jobs) and the range. Choose Use last or Use typical on one item, or Price N unpriced items from memory to fill every item that has no price yet from the last job. Each use is one step: Ctrl+Z takes it back. An item that only has a similar name (one name inside the other) says so, and the buttons use the similar name's rates. A price remembered per each is never put on an item per foot: the dialog says the units differ and leaves it alone. See it, change it, forget it Everything remembered lists every name with its rates and the number of jobs. The trash button forgets one name; Clear all prices forgets them all. Turn off Remember my prices when I save a takeoff to stop remembering; what is already there stays until you forget it. Your takeoffs and the price Library are never touched. With your assistant If you allow assistants in Settings, they can read what is remembered for the takeoff's items (prices_list) and price items from it (prices_apply, which can preview first). It is the same list as the dialog.","lang":"en"},{"slug":"supplier-stock","scope":"takeoffcraft","title":"Provjera zaliha dobavljača i rokova isporuke","summary":"Dodajte popis zaliha dobavljača (CSV ili proračunska tablica), a TakeoffDesk provjerava što predmjer treba, uključujući gubitak, u odnosu na njega: ima li dovoljno na zalihi i koliko traje čekanje. Manjkovi i dugi rokovi prikazuju se na ploči Problemi.","section":"tasks","order":74,"keywords":["dobavljač","zaliha","na zalihi","rok isporuke","dostupnost","manjak","naručeno unaprijed","popis za narudžbu","csv","sku","prodavatelj","materijali","nabava","problemi"],"headings":[{"id":"datoteka","text":"Datoteka","level":2},{"id":"provjera-predmjera","text":"Provjera predmjera","level":2},{"id":"prora-unske-tablice-i-cijene-u-knji-nici","text":"Proračunske tablice i cijene u Knjižnici","level":2},{"id":"u-plo-i-problemi","text":"U ploči Problemi","level":2},{"id":"s-va-im-pomo-nikom","text":"S vašim pomoćnikom","level":2},{"id":"dobro-je-znati","text":"Dobro je znati","level":2}],"html":"\u003Cp\u003E\u003Cspan class=\"hui\"\u003ENabava\u003C/span\u003E na alatnoj traci (kamion) provjerava što vaš predmjer treba u odnosu na popis zaliha dobavljača. Redci dobavljača koji su bitni čuvaju se u vlastitoj datoteci predmjera. Ništa se ne šalje nikamo i ništa se ne traži od dobavljača: vi donosite datoteku.\u003C/p\u003E\n\u003Ch2 id=\"datoteka\"\u003EDatoteka\u003C/h2\u003E\n\u003Cp\u003ECSV datoteka sa zaglavljem u prvom retku. Potreban je stupac s nazivom ili SKU i stupac sa zalihom ili rokom isporuke. Prepoznaju se ova zaglavlja (bilo kojim redoslijedom, bez obzira na velika i mala slova): Item, Name, Description ili Product; SKU, Part ili Item #; In stock, On hand, Available ili Quantity; Lead time ili Delivery days; Unit ili UOM; Price ili Cost; Supplier ili Vendor.\u003C/p\u003E\n\u003Cul\u003E\u003Cli\u003EZaliha može biti broj (1,200), „In stock“ ili „Out of stock“.\u003C/li\u003E\u003Cli\u003ERok isporuke može biti „5 days“, „2 weeks“, „2-3 weeks“ (uzima se duži), „3 months“, „same day“ ili „backorder“. Običan broj je u jedinici zaglavlja (dani, osim ako zaglavlje ne kaže tjedni ili mjeseci).\u003C/li\u003E\u003Cli\u003EExcel datoteke se ne čitaju: prvo spremite list kao CSV.\u003C/li\u003E\u003C/ul\u003E\n\u003Ch2 id=\"provjera-predmjera\"\u003EProvjera predmjera\u003C/h2\u003E\n\u003Col\u003E\u003Cli\u003EOdaberite \u003Cspan class=\"hui\"\u003ENabava\u003C/span\u003E, zatim \u003Cspan class=\"hui\"\u003EDodaj datoteku dobavljača…\u003C/span\u003E i izaberite CSV. Dodajte više datoteka: do pet datoteka, ukupno najviše 2.000 redaka, pri čemu se najprije zadržavaju oni koji odgovaraju vašim stavkama.\u003C/li\u003E\u003Cli\u003ESvaka stavka, drugi uvjet i dio sklopa s količinom povezuju se s retkom prema nazivu ili prema SKU u njihovom nazivu. Sličan naziv (jedan sadrži drugi) koristi se kad točnog nema i to se navodi.\u003C/li\u003E\u003Cli\u003EPod \u003Cspan class=\"hui\"\u003EŠto predmjer treba\u003C/span\u003E najprije se prikazuju manjkovi: „Short by 120 EA“, „Lead time 21 days“, „On backorder“, „Unit differs“, „No stock figure“ ili „In stock“. Potreba uključuje gubitak. Jedinica dobavljača koja nije jedinica procjene (tona umjesto stope) prijavljuje se i nikad se ne uspoređuje. Svaki redak ima \u003Cspan class=\"hui\"\u003EOdaberi stavku\u003C/span\u003E, koji skače na stavku.\u003C/li\u003E\u003Cli\u003EPostavite \u003Cspan class=\"hui\"\u003ENajduže prihvatljivo čekanje (dana)\u003C/span\u003E (zadano 14). Stavka koja nije na zalihi i čeka duže od toga označava se, a sažetak navodi najdulje čekanje koje je bitno.\u003C/li\u003E\u003Cli\u003E\u003Cspan class=\"hui\"\u003EPopis za narudžbu (CSV)\u003C/span\u003E preuzima manjkajuće stavke s iznosom manjka, dobavljačem i rokom isporuke. \u003Cspan class=\"hui\"\u003EIzostavi\u003C/span\u003E uklanja potrebu iz provjere (to je korak poništavanja).\u003C/li\u003E\u003C/ol\u003E\n\u003Ch2 id=\"prora-unske-tablice-i-cijene-u-knji-nici\"\u003EProračunske tablice i cijene u Knjižnici\u003C/h2\u003E\n\u003Cp\u003EPopis dobavljača može biti Excel radna knjiga (.xlsx) kao i CSV: čita se prvi list, s istim nazivima stupaca. Formule se nikad ne izvršavaju; čita se vrijednost koju datoteka sadrži.\u003C/p\u003E\n\u003Cp\u003EKad se doda datoteka s cijenama, \u003Cspan class=\"hui\"\u003ECijene u Knjižnicu\u003C/span\u003E u dijaloškom okviru postavlja cijenu materijala za svaki unos \u003Ca href=\"/tutorials/takeoffcraft/price-library\" data-topic=\"takeoffcraft/price-library\"\u003EKnjižnice\u003C/a\u003E koji datoteka cijeni: isti naziv i jedinica koja je ista (ili nije navedena). Rad, gubitak, visina i sklopovi ostaju kakvi jesu, a bilješka unosa kaže iz koje je datoteke došla cijena. Unos u metrima ne cijeni se iz popisa u stopama, a unos bez podudarnog naziva ostaje netaknut; statusni redak kaže koliko je preskočeno zbog jedinice. Ponovno odredite cijene iz Knjižnice da biste nove cijene prenijeli u ovaj predmjer.\u003C/p\u003E\n\u003Ch2 id=\"u-plo-i-problemi\"\u003EU ploči Problemi\u003C/h2\u003E\n\u003Cp\u003EManjak je upozorenje, a dugo čekanje napomena, u zajedničkoj ploči Problemi („Zaliha dobavljača“), pa stoje uz svaku drugu provjeru. Možete prihvatiti jedno uz navođenje razloga, a prihvaćanje se sprema u predmjer.\u003C/p\u003E\n\u003Ch2 id=\"s-va-im-pomo-nikom\"\u003ES vašim pomoćnikom\u003C/h2\u003E\n\u003Cp\u003EAko u Postavkama dopustite pomoćnike, mogu čitati provjeru (supply_check). Dodavanje datoteke dobavljača je vaš posao.\u003C/p\u003E\n\u003Ch2 id=\"dobro-je-znati\"\u003EDobro je znati\u003C/h2\u003E\n\u003Cp\u003EPodaci o zalihama aktualni su onoliko koliko i datoteka koju dodate. Ponovno dodajte datoteku da je osvježite: datoteka s istim nazivom zamjenjuje raniju.\u003C/p\u003E","text":"Nabava na alatnoj traci (kamion) provjerava što vaš predmjer treba u odnosu na popis zaliha dobavljača. Redci dobavljača koji su bitni čuvaju se u vlastitoj datoteci predmjera. Ništa se ne šalje nikamo i ništa se ne traži od dobavljača: vi donosite datoteku. Datoteka CSV datoteka sa zaglavljem u prvom retku. Potreban je stupac s nazivom ili SKU i stupac sa zalihom ili rokom isporuke. Prepoznaju se ova zaglavlja (bilo kojim redoslijedom, bez obzira na velika i mala slova): Item, Name, Description ili Product; SKU, Part ili Item #; In stock, On hand, Available ili Quantity; Lead time ili Delivery days; Unit ili UOM; Price ili Cost; Supplier ili Vendor. Zaliha može biti broj (1,200), „In stock“ ili „Out of stock“. Rok isporuke može biti „5 days“, „2 weeks“, „2-3 weeks“ (uzima se duži), „3 months“, „same day“ ili „backorder“. Običan broj je u jedinici zaglavlja (dani, osim ako zaglavlje ne kaže tjedni ili mjeseci). Excel datoteke se ne čitaju: prvo spremite list kao CSV. Provjera predmjera Odaberite Nabava, zatim Dodaj datoteku dobavljača… i izaberite CSV. Dodajte više datoteka: do pet datoteka, ukupno najviše 2.000 redaka, pri čemu se najprije zadržavaju oni koji odgovaraju vašim stavkama. Svaka stavka, drugi uvjet i dio sklopa s količinom povezuju se s retkom prema nazivu ili prema SKU u njihovom nazivu. Sličan naziv (jedan sadrži drugi) koristi se kad točnog nema i to se navodi. Pod Što predmjer treba najprije se prikazuju manjkovi: „Short by 120 EA“, „Lead time 21 days“, „On backorder“, „Unit differs“, „No stock figure“ ili „In stock“. Potreba uključuje gubitak. Jedinica dobavljača koja nije jedinica procjene (tona umjesto stope) prijavljuje se i nikad se ne uspoređuje. Svaki redak ima Odaberi stavku, koji skače na stavku. Postavite Najduže prihvatljivo čekanje (dana) (zadano 14). Stavka koja nije na zalihi i čeka duže od toga označava se, a sažetak navodi najdulje čekanje koje je bitno. Popis za narudžbu (CSV) preuzima manjkajuće stavke s iznosom manjka, dobavljačem i rokom isporuke. Izostavi uklanja potrebu iz provjere (to je korak poništavanja). Proračunske tablice i cijene u Knjižnici Popis dobavljača može biti Excel radna knjiga (.xlsx) kao i CSV: čita se prvi list, s istim nazivima stupaca. Formule se nikad ne izvršavaju; čita se vrijednost koju datoteka sadrži. Kad se doda datoteka s cijenama, Cijene u Knjižnicu u dijaloškom okviru postavlja cijenu materijala za svaki unos Knjižnice koji datoteka cijeni: isti naziv i jedinica koja je ista (ili nije navedena). Rad, gubitak, visina i sklopovi ostaju kakvi jesu, a bilješka unosa kaže iz koje je datoteke došla cijena. Unos u metrima ne cijeni se iz popisa u stopama, a unos bez podudarnog naziva ostaje netaknut; statusni redak kaže koliko je preskočeno zbog jedinice. Ponovno odredite cijene iz Knjižnice da biste nove cijene prenijeli u ovaj predmjer. U ploči Problemi Manjak je upozorenje, a dugo čekanje napomena, u zajedničkoj ploči Problemi („Zaliha dobavljača“), pa stoje uz svaku drugu provjeru. Možete prihvatiti jedno uz navođenje razloga, a prihvaćanje se sprema u predmjer. S vašim pomoćnikom Ako u Postavkama dopustite pomoćnike, mogu čitati provjeru (supply_check). Dodavanje datoteke dobavljača je vaš posao. Dobro je znati Podaci o zalihama aktualni su onoliko koliko i datoteka koju dodate. Ponovno dodajte datoteku da je osvježite: datoteka s istim nazivom zamjenjuje raniju.","lang":"hr"},{"slug":"copy-paste","scope":"takeoffcraft","title":"Kopiranje, lijepljenje i dupliciranje oznaka","summary":"Kopirajte oznake sa stavkama, zalijepite ih tamo gdje kliknete ili na isto mjesto na drugom listu, dupliciraj ih, izrežite, izbrišite i odaberite sve, svaki korak se može poništiti.","section":"tasks","order":75,"keywords":["kopiraj","zalijepi","izreži","dupliciraj","zalijepi na isto mjesto","međuspremnik","odaberi sve","poništi odabir","više oznaka","tipična etaža","ponavljanje","isti nacrt","drugi list","kopiraj stavku","dupliciraj stavku"],"headings":[{"id":"odabir-oznaka","text":"Odabir oznaka","level":2},{"id":"kopiranje-i-lijepljenje-na-mjestu-klika","text":"Kopiranje i lijepljenje na mjestu klika","level":2},{"id":"lijepljenje-na-isto-mjesto","text":"Lijepljenje na isto mjesto","level":2},{"id":"mjerilo-mora-odgovarati","text":"Mjerilo mora odgovarati","level":2},{"id":"dupliciranje","text":"Dupliciranje","level":2},{"id":"izrezivanje-i-brisanje","text":"Izrezivanje i brisanje","level":2},{"id":"kopiranje-stavke","text":"Kopiranje stavke","level":2}],"html":"\u003Cp\u003EGrupa \u003Cspan class=\"hui\"\u003EUređivanje\u003C/span\u003E na alatnoj traci sadrži \u003Cspan class=\"hui\"\u003EPoništi\u003C/span\u003E, \u003Cspan class=\"hui\"\u003EPonovi\u003C/span\u003E, \u003Cspan class=\"hui\"\u003EKopiraj\u003C/span\u003E i \u003Cspan class=\"hui\"\u003EZalijepi\u003C/span\u003E. Njezin izbornik \u003Cspan class=\"hui\"\u003EViše\u003C/span\u003E ima ostalo, svaki sa svojom tipkom: \u003Cspan class=\"hui\"\u003EIzreži\u003C/span\u003E, \u003Cspan class=\"hui\"\u003EKopiraj\u003C/span\u003E, \u003Cspan class=\"hui\"\u003EZalijepi\u003C/span\u003E, \u003Cspan class=\"hui\"\u003EZalijepi na isto mjesto\u003C/span\u003E, \u003Cspan class=\"hui\"\u003EDupliciraj\u003C/span\u003E, \u003Cspan class=\"hui\"\u003EIzbriši\u003C/span\u003E, \u003Cspan class=\"hui\"\u003EOdaberi sve\u003C/span\u003E i \u003Cspan class=\"hui\"\u003EPoništi odabir\u003C/span\u003E. Svaka od njih je jedan korak za poništavanje s \u003Ckbd class=\"hk\"\u003E\u003Cspan class=\"k-mac\" title=\"Command Z\"\u003E⌘Z\u003C/span\u003E\u003Cspan class=\"k-pc\"\u003ECtrl+Z\u003C/span\u003E\u003C/kbd\u003E.\u003C/p\u003E\n\u003Ch2 id=\"odabir-oznaka\"\u003EOdabir oznaka\u003C/h2\u003E\n\u003Col\u003E\u003Cli\u003EOdaberite \u003Cspan class=\"hui\"\u003EOdaberi\u003C/span\u003E (\u003Ckbd class=\"hk\"\u003E\u003Cspan class=\"k-mac\" title=\"V\"\u003EV\u003C/span\u003E\u003Cspan class=\"k-pc\"\u003EV\u003C/span\u003E\u003C/kbd\u003E) i kliknite oznaku.\u003C/li\u003E\u003Cli\u003EDržite \u003Ckbd class=\"hk\"\u003E\u003Cspan class=\"k-mac\" title=\"Shift\"\u003E⇧\u003C/span\u003E\u003Cspan class=\"k-pc\"\u003EShift\u003C/span\u003E\u003C/kbd\u003E i kliknite još oznaka da ih dodate. \u003Ckbd class=\"hk\"\u003E\u003Cspan class=\"k-mac\" title=\"Shift\"\u003E⇧\u003C/span\u003E\u003Cspan class=\"k-pc\"\u003EShift\u003C/span\u003E\u003C/kbd\u003E + klik na odabranu oznaku uklanja je iz odabira.\u003C/li\u003E\u003Cli\u003EIli pritisnite \u003Ckbd class=\"hk\"\u003E\u003Cspan class=\"k-mac\" title=\"Command A\"\u003E⌘A\u003C/span\u003E\u003Cspan class=\"k-pc\"\u003ECtrl+A\u003C/span\u003E\u003C/kbd\u003E (\u003Cspan class=\"hui\"\u003EOdaberi sve\u003C/span\u003E) za odabir svih oznaka na otvorenom listu.\u003C/li\u003E\u003C/ol\u003E\n\u003Cp\u003EKad je odabrano više oznaka, desni panel prikazuje \u003Cstrong\u003EOdabrane oznake\u003C/strong\u003E: koliko je čega po stavki, s \u003Cspan class=\"hui\"\u003EKopiraj\u003C/span\u003E, \u003Cspan class=\"hui\"\u003EDupliciraj\u003C/span\u003E, \u003Cspan class=\"hui\"\u003EIzreži\u003C/span\u003E i \u003Cspan class=\"hui\"\u003EIzbriši oznake\u003C/span\u003E. Ručke na kutovima pokazuju se samo kad je odabrana jedna oznaka. \u003Ckbd class=\"hk\"\u003E\u003Cspan class=\"k-mac\" title=\"Esc\"\u003EEsc\u003C/span\u003E\u003Cspan class=\"k-pc\"\u003EEsc\u003C/span\u003E\u003C/kbd\u003E (\u003Cspan class=\"hui\"\u003EPoništi odabir\u003C/span\u003E) briše odabir.\u003C/p\u003E\n\u003Ch2 id=\"kopiranje-i-lijepljenje-na-mjestu-klika\"\u003EKopiranje i lijepljenje na mjestu klika\u003C/h2\u003E\n\u003Col\u003E\u003Cli\u003EOdaberite oznake i pritisnite \u003Ckbd class=\"hk\"\u003E\u003Cspan class=\"k-mac\" title=\"Command C\"\u003E⌘C\u003C/span\u003E\u003Cspan class=\"k-pc\"\u003ECtrl+C\u003C/span\u003E\u003C/kbd\u003E (\u003Cspan class=\"hui\"\u003EKopiraj\u003C/span\u003E). Oznake se kopiraju sa svojim stavkama, uključujući sklop, gubitak i troškove svake stavke.\u003C/li\u003E\u003Cli\u003EIdite na list na koji ih želite (može biti i isti list).\u003C/li\u003E\u003Cli\u003EPritisnite \u003Ckbd class=\"hk\"\u003E\u003Cspan class=\"k-mac\" title=\"Command V\"\u003E⌘V\u003C/span\u003E\u003Cspan class=\"k-pc\"\u003ECtrl+V\u003C/span\u003E\u003C/kbd\u003E (\u003Cspan class=\"hui\"\u003EZalijepi\u003C/span\u003E). Isprekidana kopija prati pokazivač.\u003C/li\u003E\u003Cli\u003EKliknite gdje treba ići. Središte kopiranih oznaka dolazi na pokazivač.\u003C/li\u003E\u003C/ol\u003E\n\u003Cp\u003E\u003Ckbd class=\"hk\"\u003E\u003Cspan class=\"k-mac\" title=\"Esc\"\u003EEsc\u003C/span\u003E\u003Cspan class=\"k-pc\"\u003EEsc\u003C/span\u003E\u003C/kbd\u003E odustaje i ne dodaje ništa. Zalijepljene oznake se nakon toga odabiru, pa ih \u003Ckbd class=\"hk\"\u003E\u003Cspan class=\"k-mac\" title=\"fn Delete\"\u003Efn Delete\u003C/span\u003E\u003Cspan class=\"k-pc\"\u003EDelete\u003C/span\u003E\u003C/kbd\u003E ili \u003Ckbd class=\"hk\"\u003E\u003Cspan class=\"k-mac\" title=\"Command Z\"\u003E⌘Z\u003C/span\u003E\u003Cspan class=\"k-pc\"\u003ECtrl+Z\u003C/span\u003E\u003C/kbd\u003E ponovno uklanjaju.\u003C/p\u003E\n\u003Cp\u003EU istom predmjeru zalijepljene oznake idu na \u003Cstrong\u003Eiste stavke\u003C/strong\u003E, pa se njihove količine zbrajaju s tim stavkama. U drugom predmjeru (druga kartica ili nakon \u003Cspan class=\"hui\"\u003ENovo\u003C/span\u003E) koristi se stavka istog naziva i tipa; inače se stavka dodaje sa svojim sklopom. Ako je naziv zauzet stavkom druge vrste, dodana stavka zove se „(naziv) (kopija)“.\u003C/p\u003E\n\u003Cp\u003EZalijepljene oznake idu u područje ponude odabrano na vrhu panela \u003Cspan class=\"hui\"\u003EStavke\u003C/span\u003E (ili ni u jedno). Pogledajte \u003Ca href=\"/tutorials/takeoffcraft/bid-areas\" data-topic=\"takeoffcraft/bid-areas\"\u003EPodručja ponude\u003C/a\u003E.\u003C/p\u003E\n\u003Ch2 id=\"lijepljenje-na-isto-mjesto\"\u003ELijepljenje na isto mjesto\u003C/h2\u003E\n\u003Cp\u003E\u003Ckbd class=\"hk\"\u003E\u003Cspan class=\"k-mac\" title=\"Shift Command V\"\u003E⇧⌘V\u003C/span\u003E\u003Cspan class=\"k-pc\"\u003ECtrl+Shift+V\u003C/span\u003E\u003C/kbd\u003E (\u003Cspan class=\"hui\"\u003EZalijepi na isto mjesto\u003C/span\u003E) stavlja kopiju na potpuno isto mjesto na otvorenom listu, prema njezinu položaju na stranici. Koristite to za tipičnu etažu: predmjerite 2. etažu, kopirajte, otvorite 3. etažu, zalijepite na isto mjesto.\u003C/p\u003E\n\u003Cp\u003ELijepljenje na isto mjesto zahtijeva list \u003Cstrong\u003Eiste veličine\u003C/strong\u003E kao onaj s kojeg ste kopirali. Na listu druge veličine TakeoffDesk to kaže i ništa ne zalijepi; umjesto toga koristite \u003Cspan class=\"hui\"\u003EZalijepi\u003C/span\u003E i kliknite. Na listu s kojeg ste kopirali, kopija se postavlja preko izvornika.\u003C/p\u003E\n\u003Ch2 id=\"mjerilo-mora-odgovarati\"\u003EMjerilo mora odgovarati\u003C/h2\u003E\n\u003Cp\u003EDuljine i površine ovise o mjerilu lista. Dionica koja mjeri 10&#039; pri 1/4&quot; = 1&#039;-0&quot; na listu pri 1/8&quot; = 1&#039;-0&quot; mjerila bi 20&#039;. Zato TakeoffDesk lijepi dionice i površine samo na list s \u003Cstrong\u003Eistim mjerilom\u003C/strong\u003E kao list s kojeg dolaze i jasno kaže kad to nije slučaj:\u003C/p\u003E\n\u003Cul\u003E\u003Cli\u003EOtvoreni list još nema mjerilo: prvo mu ga dodijelite (\u003Ca href=\"/tutorials/takeoffcraft/set-the-scale\" data-topic=\"takeoffcraft/set-the-scale\"\u003EPostavljanje mjerila\u003C/a\u003E), pa zalijepite.\u003C/li\u003E\u003Cli\u003EOtvoreni list ima drugo mjerilo: poruka navodi oba mjerila. Lijepite na list istoga mjerila.\u003C/li\u003E\u003Cli\u003EBrojanje ne treba mjerilo: kopirane brojane oznake lijepe se bilo gdje.\u003C/li\u003E\u003C/ul\u003E\n\u003Ch2 id=\"dupliciranje\"\u003EDupliciranje\u003C/h2\u003E\n\u003Cp\u003E\u003Ckbd class=\"hk\"\u003E\u003Cspan class=\"k-mac\" title=\"Command D\"\u003E⌘D\u003C/span\u003E\u003Cspan class=\"k-pc\"\u003ECtrl+D\u003C/span\u003E\u003C/kbd\u003E (\u003Cspan class=\"hui\"\u003EDupliciraj\u003C/span\u003E) kopira odabrane oznake i odmah stavlja kopiju na pokazivač; kliknite gdje treba ići. Ništa se ne dodaje dok ne kliknete, a \u003Ckbd class=\"hk\"\u003E\u003Cspan class=\"k-mac\" title=\"Esc\"\u003EEsc\u003C/span\u003E\u003Cspan class=\"k-pc\"\u003EEsc\u003C/span\u003E\u003C/kbd\u003E ne ostavlja ništa. Dupliciranje ne mijenja što \u003Cspan class=\"hui\"\u003EZalijepi\u003C/span\u003E lijepi.\u003C/p\u003E\n\u003Ch2 id=\"izrezivanje-i-brisanje\"\u003EIzrezivanje i brisanje\u003C/h2\u003E\n\u003Cul\u003E\u003Cli\u003E\u003Ckbd class=\"hk\"\u003E\u003Cspan class=\"k-mac\" title=\"Command X\"\u003E⌘X\u003C/span\u003E\u003Cspan class=\"k-pc\"\u003ECtrl+X\u003C/span\u003E\u003C/kbd\u003E (\u003Cspan class=\"hui\"\u003EIzreži\u003C/span\u003E) kopira odabrane oznake i briše ih. Zalijepite ih tamo gdje pripadaju ili poništite izrezivanje.\u003C/li\u003E\u003Cli\u003E\u003Ckbd class=\"hk\"\u003E\u003Cspan class=\"k-mac\" title=\"fn Delete\"\u003Efn Delete\u003C/span\u003E\u003Cspan class=\"k-pc\"\u003EDelete\u003C/span\u003E\u003C/kbd\u003E ili \u003Ckbd class=\"hk\"\u003E\u003Cspan class=\"k-mac\" title=\"Delete\"\u003EDelete\u003C/span\u003E\u003Cspan class=\"k-pc\"\u003EBackspace\u003C/span\u003E\u003C/kbd\u003E (\u003Cspan class=\"hui\"\u003EIzbriši\u003C/span\u003E) briše odabrane oznake bez kopiranja.\u003C/li\u003E\u003C/ul\u003E\n\u003Ch2 id=\"kopiranje-stavke\"\u003EKopiranje stavke\u003C/h2\u003E\n\u003Cp\u003EUređivač stavke (pod \u003Cstrong\u003EStavke\u003C/strong\u003E) završava s:\u003C/p\u003E\n\u003Cul\u003E\u003Cli\u003E\u003Cspan class=\"hui\"\u003EKopiraj stavku\u003C/span\u003E: kopira stavku sa sklopom, gubitkom i troškovima, bez oznaka. \u003Cspan class=\"hui\"\u003EZalijepi\u003C/span\u003E zatim dodaje njezinu kopiju u ovaj predmjer ili u drugi.\u003C/li\u003E\u003Cli\u003E\u003Cspan class=\"hui\"\u003EDupliciraj stavku\u003C/span\u003E: odmah dodaje kopiju, nazvanu „(naziv) (kopija)“.\u003C/li\u003E\u003C/ul\u003E\n\u003Caside class=\"hc hc-tip\"\u003E\u003Cp class=\"hc-label\"\u003ETip\u003C/p\u003E\n\u003Cp\u003EKopija ostaje na ovom računalu: čuva se u ovoj kartici i u pohrani preglednika, pa je druga kartica TakeoffDeska može zalijepiti. Ništa se ne učitava, a sistemski međuspremnik se ne koristi, pa oznake ne možete lijepiti u druge programe.\u003C/p\u003E\n\u003C/aside\u003E\n\u003Caside class=\"hc hc-note\"\u003E\u003Cp class=\"hc-label\"\u003ENote\u003C/p\u003E\n\u003Cp\u003EKopija dolazi s jednog lista u isto vrijeme. Oznake se lijepe kakve jesu: kopiju još nije moguće zakretati ni zrcaliti.\u003C/p\u003E\n\u003C/aside\u003E","text":"Grupa Uređivanje na alatnoj traci sadrži Poništi, Ponovi, Kopiraj i Zalijepi. Njezin izbornik Više ima ostalo, svaki sa svojom tipkom: Izreži, Kopiraj, Zalijepi, Zalijepi na isto mjesto, Dupliciraj, Izbriši, Odaberi sve i Poništi odabir. Svaka od njih je jedan korak za poništavanje s Ctrl+Z. Odabir oznaka Odaberite Odaberi (V) i kliknite oznaku. Držite Shift i kliknite još oznaka da ih dodate. Shift + klik na odabranu oznaku uklanja je iz odabira. Ili pritisnite Ctrl+A (Odaberi sve) za odabir svih oznaka na otvorenom listu. Kad je odabrano više oznaka, desni panel prikazuje Odabrane oznake: koliko je čega po stavki, s Kopiraj, Dupliciraj, Izreži i Izbriši oznake. Ručke na kutovima pokazuju se samo kad je odabrana jedna oznaka. Esc (Poništi odabir) briše odabir. Kopiranje i lijepljenje na mjestu klika Odaberite oznake i pritisnite Ctrl+C (Kopiraj). Oznake se kopiraju sa svojim stavkama, uključujući sklop, gubitak i troškove svake stavke. Idite na list na koji ih želite (može biti i isti list). Pritisnite Ctrl+V (Zalijepi). Isprekidana kopija prati pokazivač. Kliknite gdje treba ići. Središte kopiranih oznaka dolazi na pokazivač. Esc odustaje i ne dodaje ništa. Zalijepljene oznake se nakon toga odabiru, pa ih Delete ili Ctrl+Z ponovno uklanjaju. U istom predmjeru zalijepljene oznake idu na iste stavke, pa se njihove količine zbrajaju s tim stavkama. U drugom predmjeru (druga kartica ili nakon Novo) koristi se stavka istog naziva i tipa; inače se stavka dodaje sa svojim sklopom. Ako je naziv zauzet stavkom druge vrste, dodana stavka zove se „(naziv) (kopija)“. Zalijepljene oznake idu u područje ponude odabrano na vrhu panela Stavke (ili ni u jedno). Pogledajte Područja ponude. Lijepljenje na isto mjesto Ctrl+Shift+V (Zalijepi na isto mjesto) stavlja kopiju na potpuno isto mjesto na otvorenom listu, prema njezinu položaju na stranici. Koristite to za tipičnu etažu: predmjerite 2. etažu, kopirajte, otvorite 3. etažu, zalijepite na isto mjesto. Lijepljenje na isto mjesto zahtijeva list iste veličine kao onaj s kojeg ste kopirali. Na listu druge veličine TakeoffDesk to kaže i ništa ne zalijepi; umjesto toga koristite Zalijepi i kliknite. Na listu s kojeg ste kopirali, kopija se postavlja preko izvornika. Mjerilo mora odgovarati Duljine i površine ovise o mjerilu lista. Dionica koja mjeri 10' pri 1/4\" = 1'-0\" na listu pri 1/8\" = 1'-0\" mjerila bi 20'. Zato TakeoffDesk lijepi dionice i površine samo na list s istim mjerilom kao list s kojeg dolaze i jasno kaže kad to nije slučaj: Otvoreni list još nema mjerilo: prvo mu ga dodijelite (Postavljanje mjerila), pa zalijepite. Otvoreni list ima drugo mjerilo: poruka navodi oba mjerila. Lijepite na list istoga mjerila. Brojanje ne treba mjerilo: kopirane brojane oznake lijepe se bilo gdje. Dupliciranje Ctrl+D (Dupliciraj) kopira odabrane oznake i odmah stavlja kopiju na pokazivač; kliknite gdje treba ići. Ništa se ne dodaje dok ne kliknete, a Esc ne ostavlja ništa. Dupliciranje ne mijenja što Zalijepi lijepi. Izrezivanje i brisanje Ctrl+X (Izreži) kopira odabrane oznake i briše ih. Zalijepite ih tamo gdje pripadaju ili poništite izrezivanje. Delete ili Backspace (Izbriši) briše odabrane oznake bez kopiranja. Kopiranje stavke Uređivač stavke (pod Stavke) završava s: Kopiraj stavku: kopira stavku sa sklopom, gubitkom i troškovima, bez oznaka. Zalijepi zatim dodaje njezinu kopiju u ovaj predmjer ili u drugi. Dupliciraj stavku: odmah dodaje kopiju, nazvanu „(naziv) (kopija)“. Kopija ostaje na ovom računalu: čuva se u ovoj kartici i u pohrani preglednika, pa je druga kartica TakeoffDeska može zalijepiti. Ništa se ne učitava, a sistemski međuspremnik se ne koristi, pa oznake ne možete lijepiti u druge programe. Kopija dolazi s jednog lista u isto vrijeme. Oznake se lijepe kakve jesu: kopiju još nije moguće zakretati ni zrcaliti.","lang":"hr"},{"slug":"carbon-and-5d-prices","scope":"takeoffcraft","title":"Ugljični otisak i tablica cijena za 5D","summary":"Ugljik zbraja ugrađeni ugljični otisak izvedbe iz količine svake stavke i otvorene tablice faktora te šalje stope izvedbe u BimCraft kao tablicu cijena za 5D troškove.","section":"tasks","order":76,"keywords":["ugljik","ugrađeni ugljik","kgCO2e","CO2","faktori","A1-A3","prijevoz","gubitak","5D","tablica cijena","trošak","BimCraft","EPD"],"headings":[{"id":"ugra-eni-ugljik","text":"Ugrađeni ugljik","level":2},{"id":"tablica-cijena-za-5d-tro-kove","text":"Tablica cijena za 5D troškove","level":2},{"id":"s-va-im-pomo-nikom","text":"S vašim pomoćnikom","level":2},{"id":"dobro-je-znati","text":"Dobro je znati","level":2}],"html":"\u003Cp\u003E\u003Cspan class=\"hui\"\u003EUgljik\u003C/span\u003E na alatnoj traci zbraja ugrađeni ugljik onoga što ste izmjerili i pretvara vaše stope u tablicu cijena koju model zgrade može koristiti. To je procjena, a ne ocjena.\u003C/p\u003E\n\u003Ch2 id=\"ugra-eni-ugljik\"\u003EUgrađeni ugljik\u003C/h2\u003E\n\u003Cp\u003EKoličina svake stavke, s gubitkom, množi se s retkom tablice faktora. Redak se podudara s riječima naziva stavke („betonska ploča“ pronalazi redak s ključnom riječi „beton“). Tablica je ista otvorena tablica koju koristi BimCraft, pa datoteka koju ovdje učitate radi i tamo. \u003Cstrong\u003ERetci koji dolaze uz program su početne vrijednosti: generički, neprovjereni i nisu iz nikakve baze podataka.\u003C/strong\u003E Dijalog to kaže uz brojke; zamijenite ih vlastitim izvorom prije nego se oslonite na broj.\u003C/p\u003E\n\u003Col\u003E\u003Cli\u003EOdaberite \u003Cspan class=\"hui\"\u003EUgljik\u003C/span\u003E. Brojane stavke navedene su s kilogramima CO2e; ukupno je iznad.\u003C/li\u003E\u003Cli\u003EOznačite \u003Cspan class=\"hui\"\u003EA4 prijevoz\u003C/span\u003E ili \u003Cspan class=\"hui\"\u003EA5 otpad na gradilištu\u003C/span\u003E da brojite i te faze, za retke koji za njih daju vrijednost. Faza proizvodnje uvijek se broji.\u003C/li\u003E\u003Cli\u003EZa drugi redak za stavku, ili nijedan, koristite popis u njezinom retku.\u003C/li\u003E\u003Cli\u003E\u003Cspan class=\"hui\"\u003EFaktori iz datoteke…\u003C/span\u003E učitava tablicu faktora (JSON ili CSV) izrađenu iz vašeg izvora; njezini retci zamjenjuju početne retke s istim id-om. \u003Cspan class=\"hui\"\u003EFaktori (JSON)\u003C/span\u003E sprema vaše.\u003C/li\u003E\u003C/ol\u003E\n\u003Cp\u003EFaktor je po metru, kvadratnom metru, kubnom metru, komadu ili kilogramu. Redak izmjeren u stopama ili kvadratnim stopama pretvara se. Faktor po kilogramu treba volumen (kubni jardi ili metri) i gustoću retka. Stavka čiji faktor treba količinu koju ne mjeri navodi se pod \u003Cspan class=\"hui\"\u003EIzostavljeno\u003C/span\u003E s razlogom i nikad se ne pogađa. Tekući zbroj u statusnoj traci pokazuje istu brojku.\u003C/p\u003E\n\u003Cp\u003EVaši retci faktora, vaši izbori i faze koje brojite spremaju se u datoteku izvedbe.\u003C/p\u003E\n\u003Ch2 id=\"tablica-cijena-za-5d-tro-kove\"\u003ETablica cijena za 5D troškove\u003C/h2\u003E\n\u003Cp\u003E\u003Cspan class=\"hui\"\u003E5D cijene (JSON)\u003C/span\u003E i \u003Cspan class=\"hui\"\u003E5D cijene (CSV)\u003C/span\u003E spremaju stope izvedbe kao tablicu cijena: jedan redak po stavci s cijenom, s njezinom stopom materijala i rada po jedinici te gubitkom. Učitajte je u panel troškova BimCraft-a (Ugljični otisak i 5D troškovi) da određujete cijene zadataka modela zgrade istim stopama koje su stvorile ponudu. Stavke izmjerene u jedinici koju tablica nema i stavke bez stope izostavljaju se.\u003C/p\u003E\n\u003Ch2 id=\"s-va-im-pomo-nikom\"\u003ES vašim pomoćnikom\u003C/h2\u003E\n\u003Cp\u003EAko dopuštate pomoćnike u Postavkama, mogu čitati ugljik (carbon_check). Učitavanje faktora je vaš posao.\u003C/p\u003E\n\u003Ch2 id=\"dobro-je-znati\"\u003EDobro je znati\u003C/h2\u003E\n\u003Cp\u003ENišta se nikamo ne šalje. Brojke su dobre koliko i faktori koje učitate.\u003C/p\u003E","text":"Ugljik na alatnoj traci zbraja ugrađeni ugljik onoga što ste izmjerili i pretvara vaše stope u tablicu cijena koju model zgrade može koristiti. To je procjena, a ne ocjena. Ugrađeni ugljik Količina svake stavke, s gubitkom, množi se s retkom tablice faktora. Redak se podudara s riječima naziva stavke („betonska ploča“ pronalazi redak s ključnom riječi „beton“). Tablica je ista otvorena tablica koju koristi BimCraft, pa datoteka koju ovdje učitate radi i tamo. Retci koji dolaze uz program su početne vrijednosti: generički, neprovjereni i nisu iz nikakve baze podataka. Dijalog to kaže uz brojke; zamijenite ih vlastitim izvorom prije nego se oslonite na broj. Odaberite Ugljik. Brojane stavke navedene su s kilogramima CO2e; ukupno je iznad. Označite A4 prijevoz ili A5 otpad na gradilištu da brojite i te faze, za retke koji za njih daju vrijednost. Faza proizvodnje uvijek se broji. Za drugi redak za stavku, ili nijedan, koristite popis u njezinom retku. Faktori iz datoteke… učitava tablicu faktora (JSON ili CSV) izrađenu iz vašeg izvora; njezini retci zamjenjuju početne retke s istim id-om. Faktori (JSON) sprema vaše. Faktor je po metru, kvadratnom metru, kubnom metru, komadu ili kilogramu. Redak izmjeren u stopama ili kvadratnim stopama pretvara se. Faktor po kilogramu treba volumen (kubni jardi ili metri) i gustoću retka. Stavka čiji faktor treba količinu koju ne mjeri navodi se pod Izostavljeno s razlogom i nikad se ne pogađa. Tekući zbroj u statusnoj traci pokazuje istu brojku. Vaši retci faktora, vaši izbori i faze koje brojite spremaju se u datoteku izvedbe. Tablica cijena za 5D troškove 5D cijene (JSON) i 5D cijene (CSV) spremaju stope izvedbe kao tablicu cijena: jedan redak po stavci s cijenom, s njezinom stopom materijala i rada po jedinici te gubitkom. Učitajte je u panel troškova BimCraft-a (Ugljični otisak i 5D troškovi) da određujete cijene zadataka modela zgrade istim stopama koje su stvorile ponudu. Stavke izmjerene u jedinici koju tablica nema i stavke bez stope izostavljaju se. S vašim pomoćnikom Ako dopuštate pomoćnike u Postavkama, mogu čitati ugljik (carbon_check). Učitavanje faktora je vaš posao. Dobro je znati Ništa se nikamo ne šalje. Brojke su dobre koliko i faktori koje učitate.","lang":"hr"},{"slug":"tag-schedule","scope":"takeoffcraft","title":"Uvoz popisa oznaka kao količina","summary":"Popis oznaka izvezen iz modela zgrade (CSV) postaje tipizirane količine u predmjeru, jedna po oznaci, pa se brojevi i površine modela nalaze uz ono što ste izmjerili.","section":"tasks","order":77,"keywords":["oznake","popis oznaka","model zgrade","bimcraft","ifc","količine","csv","popis","uvoz","tipizirana količina"],"headings":[{"id":"dobro-je-znati","text":"Dobro je znati","level":2}],"html":"\u003Cp\u003E\u003Cspan class=\"hui\"\u003EOznake\u003C/span\u003E na alatnoj traci uvozi popis oznaka koji je BimCraft spremio kao CSV datoteku. Svaka različita oznaka postaje tipizirana količina, iste vrste kakve postaju iskop i nasip u CivilCraftu.\u003C/p\u003E\n\u003Col\u003E\u003Cli\u003EU BimCraftu izradite željeni popis oznaka i spremite ga kao CSV.\u003C/li\u003E\u003Cli\u003EOdaberite \u003Cspan class=\"hui\"\u003EOznake\u003C/span\u003E i izaberite datoteku.\u003C/li\u003E\u003Cli\u003ERecite koji stupac imenuje liniju (\u003Cspan class=\"hui\"\u003EImenuj liniju prema\u003C/span\u003E, obično oznaka) i koji sadrži broj (\u003Cspan class=\"hui\"\u003EKoličina iz\u003C/span\u003E). S \u003Cspan class=\"hui\"\u003EBroji retke\u003C/span\u003E svaki redak se broji kao jedan.\u003C/li\u003E\u003Cli\u003EOdaberite jedinicu. Duljina u milimetrima postaje metre uz \u003Cspan class=\"hui\"\u003EPomnoži s\u003C/span\u003E 0.001.\u003C/li\u003E\u003Cli\u003E\u003Cspan class=\"hui\"\u003EDodaj količine\u003C/span\u003E.\u003C/li\u003E\u003C/ol\u003E\n\u003Cp\u003ERetci s istom oznakom zbrajaju se. Ćelija koja nije broj ispušta se i broji se u sažetku. Ponovni uvoz istog popisa ažurira količine koje već imate, umjesto da dodaje nove; njihovi nazivi, cijene i gubitak ostaju vaši.\u003C/p\u003E\n\u003Ch2 id=\"dobro-je-znati\"\u003EDobro je znati\u003C/h2\u003E\n\u003Cp\u003ETipizirana količina ne mjeri se na listu, pa nema oznaka. Ništa se ne šalje nikamo; datoteka se čita ovdje.\u003C/p\u003E","text":"Oznake na alatnoj traci uvozi popis oznaka koji je BimCraft spremio kao CSV datoteku. Svaka različita oznaka postaje tipizirana količina, iste vrste kakve postaju iskop i nasip u CivilCraftu. U BimCraftu izradite željeni popis oznaka i spremite ga kao CSV. Odaberite Oznake i izaberite datoteku. Recite koji stupac imenuje liniju (Imenuj liniju prema, obično oznaka) i koji sadrži broj (Količina iz). S Broji retke svaki redak se broji kao jedan. Odaberite jedinicu. Duljina u milimetrima postaje metre uz Pomnoži s 0.001. Dodaj količine. Retci s istom oznakom zbrajaju se. Ćelija koja nije broj ispušta se i broji se u sažetku. Ponovni uvoz istog popisa ažurira količine koje već imate, umjesto da dodaje nove; njihovi nazivi, cijene i gubitak ostaju vaši. Dobro je znati Tipizirana količina ne mjeri se na listu, pa nema oznaka. Ništa se ne šalje nikamo; datoteka se čita ovdje.","lang":"hr"},{"slug":"assemblies","scope":"takeoffcraft","title":"Sklopovi i formule","summary":"Dodajte komponente stavci i neka formule pretvore njezinu duljinu, površinu ili broj u stupove, pragove, listove ploča, beton i okov, uz primjer zida.","section":"tasks","order":80,"keywords":["sklop","komponente","formula","stupovi","gipskarton","listovi","pragovi","beton","kubni jardi","okov","recept","tipično","dijelovi stavke"],"headings":[{"id":"varijable-koje-mo-ete-koristiti","text":"Varijable koje možete koristiti","level":2},{"id":"primjer-unutarnji-zid","text":"Primjer: unutarnji zid","level":2},{"id":"jo-formula","text":"Još formula","level":2},{"id":"kada-je-formula-pogre-na","text":"Kada je formula pogrešna","level":2},{"id":"ograni-enja","text":"Ograničenja","level":2},{"id":"uklanjanje-komponente","text":"Uklanjanje komponente","level":2}],"html":"\u003Cp\u003ESklop stavke \u003Cstrong\u003Esklop\u003C/strong\u003E je popis komponenti, a svaka ima formulu količine te vlastiti gubitak i jedinične cijene. Formula koristi izmjerene ukupne vrijednosti stavke, pa jedno mjerenje zida daje stupove, pragove i ploče odjednom, a sve se ažurira kako mjerite.\u003C/p\u003E\n\u003Ch2 id=\"varijable-koje-mo-ete-koristiti\"\u003EVarijable koje možete koristiti\u003C/h2\u003E\n\u003Cdiv class=\"ht-wrap\"\u003E\u003Ctable class=\"ht\"\u003E\u003Cthead\u003E\u003Ctr\u003E\u003Cth scope=\"col\"\u003EVrsta stavke\u003C/th\u003E\u003Cth scope=\"col\"\u003EVarijable\u003C/th\u003E\u003C/tr\u003E\u003C/thead\u003E\u003Ctbody\u003E\u003Ctr\u003E\u003Ctd\u003ELinearna\u003C/td\u003E\u003Ctd\u003E\u003Ccode\u003EL\u003C/code\u003E duljina, \u003Ccode\u003EH\u003C/code\u003E visina, \u003Ccode\u003EA\u003C/code\u003E površina zida (L × H), \u003Ccode\u003EN\u003C/code\u003E broj dionica\u003C/td\u003E\u003C/tr\u003E\u003Ctr\u003E\u003Ctd\u003EPovršina\u003C/td\u003E\u003Ctd\u003E\u003Ccode\u003EA\u003C/code\u003E površina, \u003Ccode\u003EP\u003C/code\u003E opseg (obris + izrezi), \u003Ccode\u003EH\u003C/code\u003E dubina ili debljina, \u003Ccode\u003EN\u003C/code\u003E broj površina\u003C/td\u003E\u003C/tr\u003E\u003Ctr\u003E\u003Ctd\u003EBrojanje\u003C/td\u003E\u003Ctd\u003E\u003Ccode\u003EN\u003C/code\u003E broj\u003C/td\u003E\u003C/tr\u003E\u003C/tbody\u003E\u003C/table\u003E\u003C/div\u003E\n\u003Cp\u003EVrijednosti su u vlastitim jedinicama stavke: stope i kvadratne stope za stavke u LF i SF, metri i kvadratni metri za stavke u m i m². Za stavku u SY, \u003Ccode\u003EA\u003C/code\u003E je u kvadratnim jardima, dok \u003Ccode\u003EP\u003C/code\u003E i \u003Ccode\u003EH\u003C/code\u003E ostaju u stopama.\u003C/p\u003E\n\u003Cp\u003EFormule koriste \u003Ccode\u003E+ - * /\u003C/code\u003E (ili × ÷), zagrade, brojeve i funkcije \u003Ccode\u003Eceil\u003C/code\u003E, \u003Ccode\u003Efloor\u003C/code\u003E, \u003Ccode\u003Eround\u003C/code\u003E, \u003Ccode\u003Emin\u003C/code\u003E, \u003Ccode\u003Emax\u003C/code\u003E i \u003Ccode\u003Eabs\u003C/code\u003E. Potpuna pravila nalaze se u \u003Ca href=\"/tutorials/takeoffcraft/formulas\" data-topic=\"takeoffcraft/formulas\"\u003EJezik formula\u003C/a\u003E.\u003C/p\u003E\n\u003Ch2 id=\"primjer-unutarnji-zid\"\u003EPrimjer: unutarnji zid\u003C/h2\u003E\n\u003Cp\u003EPretpostavimo da ste izmjerili \u003Cstrong\u003EUnutarnji zid tip A\u003C/strong\u003E kao linearnu stavku: 4 dionice ukupno 120 LF, s \u003Cspan class=\"hui\"\u003EVisina\u003C/span\u003E postavljenom na \u003Ccode\u003E9&#039;-0&quot;\u003C/code\u003E. Njegove \u003Cstrong\u003Eizmjerene\u003C/strong\u003E vrijednosti glase L = 120, N = 4, A = 1,080 (SF zida, jedna strana).\u003C/p\u003E\n\u003Col\u003E\u003Cli\u003EOdaberite stavku pod \u003Cspan class=\"hui\"\u003EStavke\u003C/span\u003E.\u003C/li\u003E\u003Cli\u003EU \u003Cspan class=\"hui\"\u003ESklop\u003C/span\u003E odaberite \u003Cspan class=\"hui\"\u003EDodaj komponentu\u003C/span\u003E. Pojavljuje se komponenta pod nazivom „Komponenta“, s formulom \u003Ccode\u003EL\u003C/code\u003E i rezultatom ispod nje.\u003C/li\u003E\u003Cli\u003EUpišite \u003Ccode\u003EStupovi 16 in o.c.\u003C/code\u003E u \u003Cspan class=\"hui\"\u003ENaziv\u003C/span\u003E i \u003Ccode\u003EEA\u003C/code\u003E u \u003Cspan class=\"hui\"\u003EJedinica\u003C/span\u003E.\u003C/li\u003E\u003Cli\u003EU \u003Cspan class=\"hui\"\u003EFormula količine\u003C/span\u003E upišite \u003Ccode\u003Eceil(L * 12 / 16) + N\u003C/code\u003E. Rezultat se mijenja dok tipkate: „= 94 EA“. To je jedan stup svakih 16 inča duž 120 stopa (90), plus jedan dodatni za zatvaranje svake od 4 dionice.\u003C/li\u003E\u003Cli\u003EPonovno odaberite \u003Cspan class=\"hui\"\u003EDodaj komponentu\u003C/span\u003E za pragove: naziv \u003Ccode\u003EPragovi, gore i dolje\u003C/code\u003E, jedinica \u003Ccode\u003ELF\u003C/code\u003E, formula \u003Ccode\u003EL * 2\u003C/code\u003E. Rezultat: 240 LF.\u003C/li\u003E\u003Cli\u003EDodajte ploče: naziv \u003Ccode\u003EGipskartonska ploča 4x8, obje strane\u003C/code\u003E, jedinica \u003Ccode\u003Elistovi\u003C/code\u003E, formula \u003Ccode\u003Eceil(A * 2 / 32)\u003C/code\u003E. Rezultat: 68 listova (2,160 SF ploča ÷ 32 SF po listu = 67.5, zaokruženo naviše).\u003C/li\u003E\u003Cli\u003EIspunite \u003Cspan class=\"hui\"\u003EGubitak %\u003C/span\u003E, \u003Cspan class=\"hui\"\u003EMaterijal $\u003C/span\u003E i \u003Cspan class=\"hui\"\u003ERad $\u003C/span\u003E za svaku komponentu. Svaka komponenta dobiva vlastiti redak ispod stavke u \u003Cspan class=\"hui\"\u003EKoličine\u003C/span\u003E, cijenjen kao stavka, a \u003Cspan class=\"hui\"\u003EUkupno za posao\u003C/span\u003E je uključuje.\u003C/li\u003E\u003C/ol\u003E\n\u003Cp\u003EAko je trošak zida u potpunosti u komponentama, ostavite vlastite stope materijala i rada stavke na 0, inače će se brojati dvaput.\u003C/p\u003E\n\u003Caside class=\"hc hc-tip\"\u003E\u003Cp class=\"hc-label\"\u003ETip\u003C/p\u003E\n\u003Cp\u003EGubitak se primjenjuje nakon formule i ne zaokružuje se: 68 listova uz 10 % gubitka iznosi 74.8 listova. Da naručite cijele listove, stavite gubitak unutar formule, npr. \u003Ccode\u003Eceil(A * 2 / 32 * 1.1)\u003C/code\u003E, a gubitak komponente ostavite na 0.\u003C/p\u003E\n\u003C/aside\u003E\n\u003Ch2 id=\"jo-formula\"\u003EJoš formula\u003C/h2\u003E\n\u003Cdiv class=\"ht-wrap\"\u003E\u003Ctable class=\"ht\"\u003E\u003Cthead\u003E\u003Ctr\u003E\u003Cth scope=\"col\"\u003EŠto\u003C/th\u003E\u003Cth scope=\"col\"\u003EStavka\u003C/th\u003E\u003Cth scope=\"col\"\u003EFormula\u003C/th\u003E\u003C/tr\u003E\u003C/thead\u003E\u003Ctbody\u003E\u003Ctr\u003E\u003Ctd\u003EStupovi na razmaku 24 in (o.c.)\u003C/td\u003E\u003Ctd\u003ELinearna\u003C/td\u003E\u003Ctd\u003E\u003Ccode\u003Eceil(L / 2) + N\u003C/code\u003E\u003C/td\u003E\u003C/tr\u003E\u003Ctr\u003E\u003Ctd\u003EIzolacijski paneli, SF\u003C/td\u003E\u003Ctd\u003ELinearna s visinom\u003C/td\u003E\u003Ctd\u003E\u003Ccode\u003EA\u003C/code\u003E\u003C/td\u003E\u003C/tr\u003E\u003Ctr\u003E\u003Ctd\u003EBoja, obje strane, galoni na 350 SF\u003C/td\u003E\u003Ctd\u003ELinearna s visinom\u003C/td\u003E\u003Ctd\u003E\u003Ccode\u003Eceil(A * 2 / 350)\u003C/code\u003E\u003C/td\u003E\u003C/tr\u003E\u003Ctr\u003E\u003Ctd\u003EKutije pločica po 15 SF, 10 % viška\u003C/td\u003E\u003Ctd\u003EPovršina\u003C/td\u003E\u003Ctd\u003E\u003Ccode\u003Eceil(A * 1.1 / 15)\u003C/code\u003E\u003C/td\u003E\u003C/tr\u003E\u003Ctr\u003E\u003Ctd\u003EPodna ili rubna lajsna, LF\u003C/td\u003E\u003Ctd\u003EPovršina\u003C/td\u003E\u003Ctd\u003E\u003Ccode\u003EP\u003C/code\u003E\u003C/td\u003E\u003C/tr\u003E\u003Ctr\u003E\u003Ctd\u003EBeton, kubni jardi\u003C/td\u003E\u003Ctd\u003EPovršina s dubinom\u003C/td\u003E\u003Ctd\u003E\u003Ccode\u003EA * H / 27\u003C/code\u003E\u003C/td\u003E\u003C/tr\u003E\u003Ctr\u003E\u003Ctd\u003EBeton zaokružen naviše na četvrtinu jarda\u003C/td\u003E\u003Ctd\u003EPovršina s dubinom\u003C/td\u003E\u003Ctd\u003E\u003Ccode\u003Eceil(A * H / 27 * 4) / 4\u003C/code\u003E\u003C/td\u003E\u003C/tr\u003E\u003Ctr\u003E\u003Ctd\u003EŠarke, tri po vratima\u003C/td\u003E\u003Ctd\u003EBrojanje\u003C/td\u003E\u003Ctd\u003E\u003Ccode\u003EN * 3\u003C/code\u003E\u003C/td\u003E\u003C/tr\u003E\u003Ctr\u003E\u003Ctd\u003ENajmanje jedna kutija, jedna na 12\u003C/td\u003E\u003Ctd\u003EBrojanje\u003C/td\u003E\u003Ctd\u003E\u003Ccode\u003Emax(1, ceil(N / 12))\u003C/code\u003E\u003C/td\u003E\u003C/tr\u003E\u003C/tbody\u003E\u003C/table\u003E\u003C/div\u003E\n\u003Ch2 id=\"kada-je-formula-pogre-na\"\u003EKada je formula pogrešna\u003C/h2\u003E\n\u003Cp\u003ERedak ispod formule pretvara se u poruku o pogrešci, na primjer \u003Ccode\u003E„X“ nije izmjerena vrijednost ovdje. Koristite L, H, A, N.\u003C/code\u003E ili \u003Ccode\u003ENedostaje „)“.\u003C/code\u003E Komponenta tada nema iznose, njezin redak u \u003Cspan class=\"hui\"\u003EKoličine\u003C/span\u003E prikazuje „Pogreška u formuli: …“, a zaglavlje glasi „Nepotpuno: 1 pogreška u formuli (nije u ukupnima)“. Ispravite formulu i ukupni iznosi se ažuriraju.\u003C/p\u003E\n\u003Cp\u003EFormula koja dijeli s nulom također je pogreška („Formula dijeli s nulom.“), na primjer \u003Ccode\u003EA / H\u003C/code\u003E na stavci bez dubine.\u003C/p\u003E\n\u003Ch2 id=\"ograni-enja\"\u003EOgraničenja\u003C/h2\u003E\n\u003Cul\u003E\u003Cli\u003EFormule se računaju na \u003Cstrong\u003Eukupnim\u003C/strong\u003E vrijednostima stavke, a ne dionicu po dionicu. \u003Ccode\u003Eceil(L * 12 / 16) + N\u003C/code\u003E dodaje jedan stup po dionici; zaokruživanje po dionici zasad ne postoji.\u003C/li\u003E\u003Cli\u003EFormula može koristiti samo varijable vlastite stavke, a ne varijable druge stavke.\u003C/li\u003E\u003Cli\u003EDo 50 komponenti po stavci, 500 znakova po formuli.\u003C/li\u003E\u003C/ul\u003E\n\u003Ch2 id=\"uklanjanje-komponente\"\u003EUklanjanje komponente\u003C/h2\u003E\n\u003Cp\u003EOdaberite \u003Cspan class=\"hui\"\u003EUkloni komponentu\u003C/span\u003E ispod nje. Možete je vratiti s \u003Ckbd class=\"hk\"\u003E\u003Cspan class=\"k-mac\" title=\"Command Z\"\u003E⌘Z\u003C/span\u003E\u003Cspan class=\"k-pc\"\u003ECtrl+Z\u003C/span\u003E\u003C/kbd\u003E.\u003C/p\u003E","text":"Sklop stavke sklop je popis komponenti, a svaka ima formulu količine te vlastiti gubitak i jedinične cijene. Formula koristi izmjerene ukupne vrijednosti stavke, pa jedno mjerenje zida daje stupove, pragove i ploče odjednom, a sve se ažurira kako mjerite. Varijable koje možete koristiti Vrsta stavke Varijable Linearna L duljina, H visina, A površina zida (L × H), N broj dionica Površina A površina, P opseg (obris + izrezi), H dubina ili debljina, N broj površina Brojanje N broj Vrijednosti su u vlastitim jedinicama stavke: stope i kvadratne stope za stavke u LF i SF, metri i kvadratni metri za stavke u m i m². Za stavku u SY, A je u kvadratnim jardima, dok P i H ostaju u stopama. Formule koriste + - * / (ili × ÷), zagrade, brojeve i funkcije ceil, floor, round, min, max i abs. Potpuna pravila nalaze se u Jezik formula. Primjer: unutarnji zid Pretpostavimo da ste izmjerili Unutarnji zid tip A kao linearnu stavku: 4 dionice ukupno 120 LF, s Visina postavljenom na 9'-0\". Njegove izmjerene vrijednosti glase L = 120, N = 4, A = 1,080 (SF zida, jedna strana). Odaberite stavku pod Stavke. U Sklop odaberite Dodaj komponentu. Pojavljuje se komponenta pod nazivom „Komponenta“, s formulom L i rezultatom ispod nje. Upišite Stupovi 16 in o.c. u Naziv i EA u Jedinica. U Formula količine upišite ceil(L * 12 / 16) + N. Rezultat se mijenja dok tipkate: „= 94 EA“. To je jedan stup svakih 16 inča duž 120 stopa (90), plus jedan dodatni za zatvaranje svake od 4 dionice. Ponovno odaberite Dodaj komponentu za pragove: naziv Pragovi, gore i dolje, jedinica LF, formula L * 2. Rezultat: 240 LF. Dodajte ploče: naziv Gipskartonska ploča 4x8, obje strane, jedinica listovi, formula ceil(A * 2 / 32). Rezultat: 68 listova (2,160 SF ploča ÷ 32 SF po listu = 67.5, zaokruženo naviše). Ispunite Gubitak %, Materijal $ i Rad $ za svaku komponentu. Svaka komponenta dobiva vlastiti redak ispod stavke u Količine, cijenjen kao stavka, a Ukupno za posao je uključuje. Ako je trošak zida u potpunosti u komponentama, ostavite vlastite stope materijala i rada stavke na 0, inače će se brojati dvaput. Gubitak se primjenjuje nakon formule i ne zaokružuje se: 68 listova uz 10 % gubitka iznosi 74.8 listova. Da naručite cijele listove, stavite gubitak unutar formule, npr. ceil(A * 2 / 32 * 1.1), a gubitak komponente ostavite na 0. Još formula Što Stavka Formula Stupovi na razmaku 24 in (o.c.) Linearna ceil(L / 2) + N Izolacijski paneli, SF Linearna s visinom A Boja, obje strane, galoni na 350 SF Linearna s visinom ceil(A * 2 / 350) Kutije pločica po 15 SF, 10 % viška Površina ceil(A * 1.1 / 15) Podna ili rubna lajsna, LF Površina P Beton, kubni jardi Površina s dubinom A * H / 27 Beton zaokružen naviše na četvrtinu jarda Površina s dubinom ceil(A * H / 27 * 4) / 4 Šarke, tri po vratima Brojanje N * 3 Najmanje jedna kutija, jedna na 12 Brojanje max(1, ceil(N / 12)) Kada je formula pogrešna Redak ispod formule pretvara se u poruku o pogrešci, na primjer „X“ nije izmjerena vrijednost ovdje. Koristite L, H, A, N. ili Nedostaje „)“. Komponenta tada nema iznose, njezin redak u Količine prikazuje „Pogreška u formuli: …“, a zaglavlje glasi „Nepotpuno: 1 pogreška u formuli (nije u ukupnima)“. Ispravite formulu i ukupni iznosi se ažuriraju. Formula koja dijeli s nulom također je pogreška („Formula dijeli s nulom.“), na primjer A / H na stavci bez dubine. Ograničenja Formule se računaju na ukupnim vrijednostima stavke, a ne dionicu po dionicu. ceil(L * 12 / 16) + N dodaje jedan stup po dionici; zaokruživanje po dionici zasad ne postoji. Formula može koristiti samo varijable vlastite stavke, a ne varijable druge stavke. Do 50 komponenti po stavci, 500 znakova po formuli. Uklanjanje komponente Odaberite Ukloni komponentu ispod nje. Možete je vratiti s Ctrl+Z.","lang":"hr"},{"slug":"price-library","scope":"takeoffcraft","title":"\"Knjižnica cijena\"","summary":"\"Čuvajte stavke, stope i sklopove u knjižnici, uvezite je iz CSV-a ili prošle procjene, dodajte stavke iz nje u bilo koji predmjer i ažurirajte cijene predmjera iz nje.\"","section":"tasks","order":82,"keywords":["\"knjižnica","paketi struke","cjenik","baza troškova","uvoz csv","stope","sklopovi","ponovna uporaba","predlošci stavki","ažuriraj cijene","ponovno cijenjenje\""],"headings":[{"id":"punjenje-knji-nice","text":"Punjenje knjižnice","level":2},{"id":"koristite-je-u-predmjeru","text":"Koristite je u predmjeru","level":2},{"id":"stupci-csv-a","text":"Stupci CSV-a","level":2}],"html":"\u003Cp\u003E\u003Cstrong\u003EKnjižnica cijena\u003C/strong\u003E čuva stavke koje koristite iz posla u posao: njihovu vrstu, jedinicu, visinu, gubitak, stope za materijal i rad te njihov sklop. Čuva se u ovom pregledniku, odvojeno od svakog predmjera, pa je može koristiti svaki predmjer koji ovdje otvorite.\u003C/p\u003E\n\u003Cp\u003EOtvorite je s \u003Cspan class=\"hui\"\u003EKnjižnica\u003C/span\u003E na vrhu ploče \u003Cspan class=\"hui\"\u003EStavke\u003C/span\u003E.\u003C/p\u003E\n\u003Ch2 id=\"punjenje-knji-nice\"\u003EPunjenje knjižnice\u003C/h2\u003E\n\u003Cul\u003E\u003Cli\u003E\u003Cspan class=\"hui\"\u003EUvezi CSV…\u003C/span\u003E čita proračunsku tablicu spremljenu kao CSV (vidi stupce u nastavku). Stavke čiji su naziv i vrsta već u knjižnici se zamjenjuju; ostale se dodaju. Redci koje ne može pročitati se preskaču, a kaže koji su i zašto.\u003C/li\u003E\u003Cli\u003E\u003Cspan class=\"hui\"\u003EDodaj stavke ovog predmjera\u003C/span\u003E kopira svaku stavku otvorenog predmjera u knjižnicu, sa stopama i sklopom (ne s oznakama).\u003C/li\u003E\u003Cli\u003EProcjena u CSV-u koju TakeoffDesk izvozi (\u003Ca href=\"/tutorials/takeoffcraft/export-estimate\" data-topic=\"takeoffcraft/export-estimate\"\u003EIzvoz procjene\u003C/a\u003E) uvozi se kakva jest: cijene prošlog posla služe kao početak sljedećeg.\u003C/li\u003E\u003C/ul\u003E\n\u003Cul\u003E\u003Cli\u003E\u003Cspan class=\"hui\"\u003EPaketi struke…\u003C/span\u003E dodaje besplatne sklopove za struku, poput gipsanih radova, elektroinstalacija ili betona, bez cijena. Vidi \u003Ca href=\"/tutorials/takeoffcraft/trade-packs\" data-topic=\"takeoffcraft/trade-packs\"\u003EPaketi struke\u003C/a\u003E.\u003C/li\u003E\u003C/ul\u003E\n\u003Cp\u003E\u003Cspan class=\"hui\"\u003EIzvezi CSV\u003C/span\u003E sprema knjižnicu kao CSV, za čuvanje kopije, uređivanje u tabličnom programu ili za davanje kolegi. \u003Cspan class=\"hui\"\u003EOčisti\u003C/span\u003E je prazni (kliknite dvaput).\u003C/p\u003E\n\u003Caside class=\"hc hc-note\"\u003E\u003Cp class=\"hc-label\"\u003ENote\u003C/p\u003E\n\u003Cp\u003EKnjižnica živi u pohrani ovog preglednika. Drugi preglednik, drugo računalo ili privatni prozor imaju svoju (ili nikakvu). Izvezite je da je premjestite.\u003C/p\u003E\n\u003C/aside\u003E\n\u003Ch2 id=\"koristite-je-u-predmjeru\"\u003EKoristite je u predmjeru\u003C/h2\u003E\n\u003Cul\u003E\u003Cli\u003EOznačite stavke (upišite u \u003Cspan class=\"hui\"\u003EPronađi u knjižnici\u003C/span\u003E da suzite popis) i odaberite \u003Cspan class=\"hui\"\u003EDodaj u predmjer\u003C/span\u003E. Dodaju se sa svojim sklopovima u jednom koraku koji \u003Ckbd class=\"hk\"\u003E\u003Cspan class=\"k-mac\" title=\"Command Z\"\u003E⌘Z\u003C/span\u003E\u003Cspan class=\"k-pc\"\u003ECtrl+Z\u003C/span\u003E\u003C/kbd\u003E poništava. Naziv koji već postoji u predmjeru dobiva broj, poput \u003Ccode\u003ECarpet (2)\u003C/code\u003E.\u003C/li\u003E\u003Cli\u003E\u003Cspan class=\"hui\"\u003EAžuriraj cijene\u003C/span\u003E daje stavkama predmjera gubitak i stope iz knjižnice, za svaku stavku čiji se naziv i vrsta podudaraju sa stavkom knjižnice, a isto i za sastavne dijelove sklopa istog naziva. Visine, jedinice i formule ostaju kakve jesu. Jedan \u003Ckbd class=\"hk\"\u003E\u003Cspan class=\"k-mac\" title=\"Command Z\"\u003E⌘Z\u003C/span\u003E\u003Cspan class=\"k-pc\"\u003ECtrl+Z\u003C/span\u003E\u003C/kbd\u003E vraća sve stare cijene.\u003C/li\u003E\u003C/ul\u003E\n\u003Ch2 id=\"stupci-csv-a\"\u003EStupci CSV-a\u003C/h2\u003E\n\u003Cp\u003EPrvi redak imenuje stupce, bilo kojim redoslijedom; drugi stupci se zanemaruju. Nazivi stupaca i vrijednosti koje se upisuju ostaju kao u aplikaciji.\u003C/p\u003E\n\u003Cdiv class=\"ht-wrap\"\u003E\u003Ctable class=\"ht\"\u003E\u003Cthead\u003E\u003Ctr\u003E\u003Cth scope=\"col\"\u003EStupac\u003C/th\u003E\u003Cth scope=\"col\"\u003EŠto ide u njega\u003C/th\u003E\u003C/tr\u003E\u003C/thead\u003E\u003Ctbody\u003E\u003Ctr\u003E\u003Ctd\u003EItem (or Name)\u003C/td\u003E\u003Ctd\u003ENaziv stavke. Obavezno.\u003C/td\u003E\u003C/tr\u003E\u003Ctr\u003E\u003Ctd\u003EType\u003C/td\u003E\u003Ctd\u003ELinear, Area ili Count (LF, SF i EA također rade). Ako je prazno, odlučuje jedinica.\u003C/td\u003E\u003C/tr\u003E\u003Ctr\u003E\u003Ctd\u003EUnit\u003C/td\u003E\u003Ctd\u003ELF ili m; SF, SY ili m²; EA. Prazno: uobičajena jedinica vrste.\u003C/td\u003E\u003C/tr\u003E\u003Ctr\u003E\u003Ctd\u003EWaste %\u003C/td\u003E\u003Ctd\u003E\u003Ccode\u003E10\u003C/code\u003E ili \u003Ccode\u003E10%\u003C/code\u003E.\u003C/td\u003E\u003C/tr\u003E\u003Ctr\u003E\u003Ctd\u003EMaterial per unit, Labor per unit\u003C/td\u003E\u003Ctd\u003EStope poput \u003Ccode\u003E2.10\u003C/code\u003E ili \u003Ccode\u003E$1,250\u003C/code\u003E.\u003C/td\u003E\u003C/tr\u003E\u003Ctr\u003E\u003Ctd\u003EHeight (or Depth)\u003C/td\u003E\u003Ctd\u003E\u003Ccode\u003E9&#039;-0&quot;\u003C/code\u003E, \u003Ccode\u003E9\u003C/code\u003E ili \u003Ccode\u003E2.7\u003C/code\u003E za metričke jedinice.\u003C/td\u003E\u003C/tr\u003E\u003Ctr\u003E\u003Ctd\u003EComponent, Formula\u003C/td\u003E\u003Ctd\u003ERedak s nazivom sastavnog dijela (ili vrstom \u003Ccode\u003EComponent\u003C/code\u003E) je dio sklopa stavke iznad njega. Njegova jedinica, gubitak i stope su njegovi vlastiti; njegova formula koristi slova stavke, vidi \u003Ca href=\"/tutorials/takeoffcraft/assemblies\" data-topic=\"takeoffcraft/assemblies\"\u003ESklopovi i formule\u003C/a\u003E.\u003C/td\u003E\u003C/tr\u003E\u003C/tbody\u003E\u003C/table\u003E\u003C/div\u003E\n\u003Cpre class=\"hcode\"\u003E\u003Ccode\u003EItem,Type,Unit,Waste %,Material per unit,Labor per unit,Height,Component,Formula\nPartition type A,Linear,LF,10,2.10,3.33,9&#039;-0&quot;,,\n,Component,EA,,4.25,,,Studs 16 in. o.c.,ceil(L / 1.333) + N\nVCT flooring,Area,SF,5,1.85,1.10,,,\nDuplex outlets,Count,EA,,3.50,45,,,\u003C/code\u003E\u003C/pre\u003E\n\u003Cp\u003EZarezi, točka-zarezi ili tabulatori između stupaca svi rade.\u003C/p\u003E","text":"Knjižnica cijena čuva stavke koje koristite iz posla u posao: njihovu vrstu, jedinicu, visinu, gubitak, stope za materijal i rad te njihov sklop. Čuva se u ovom pregledniku, odvojeno od svakog predmjera, pa je može koristiti svaki predmjer koji ovdje otvorite. Otvorite je s Knjižnica na vrhu ploče Stavke. Punjenje knjižnice Uvezi CSV… čita proračunsku tablicu spremljenu kao CSV (vidi stupce u nastavku). Stavke čiji su naziv i vrsta već u knjižnici se zamjenjuju; ostale se dodaju. Redci koje ne može pročitati se preskaču, a kaže koji su i zašto. Dodaj stavke ovog predmjera kopira svaku stavku otvorenog predmjera u knjižnicu, sa stopama i sklopom (ne s oznakama). Procjena u CSV-u koju TakeoffDesk izvozi (Izvoz procjene) uvozi se kakva jest: cijene prošlog posla služe kao početak sljedećeg. Paketi struke… dodaje besplatne sklopove za struku, poput gipsanih radova, elektroinstalacija ili betona, bez cijena. Vidi Paketi struke. Izvezi CSV sprema knjižnicu kao CSV, za čuvanje kopije, uređivanje u tabličnom programu ili za davanje kolegi. Očisti je prazni (kliknite dvaput). Knjižnica živi u pohrani ovog preglednika. Drugi preglednik, drugo računalo ili privatni prozor imaju svoju (ili nikakvu). Izvezite je da je premjestite. Koristite je u predmjeru Označite stavke (upišite u Pronađi u knjižnici da suzite popis) i odaberite Dodaj u predmjer. Dodaju se sa svojim sklopovima u jednom koraku koji Ctrl+Z poništava. Naziv koji već postoji u predmjeru dobiva broj, poput Carpet (2). Ažuriraj cijene daje stavkama predmjera gubitak i stope iz knjižnice, za svaku stavku čiji se naziv i vrsta podudaraju sa stavkom knjižnice, a isto i za sastavne dijelove sklopa istog naziva. Visine, jedinice i formule ostaju kakve jesu. Jedan Ctrl+Z vraća sve stare cijene. Stupci CSV-a Prvi redak imenuje stupce, bilo kojim redoslijedom; drugi stupci se zanemaruju. Nazivi stupaca i vrijednosti koje se upisuju ostaju kao u aplikaciji. Stupac Što ide u njega Item (or Name) Naziv stavke. Obavezno. Type Linear, Area ili Count (LF, SF i EA također rade). Ako je prazno, odlučuje jedinica. Unit LF ili m; SF, SY ili m²; EA. Prazno: uobičajena jedinica vrste. Waste % 10 ili 10%. Material per unit, Labor per unit Stope poput 2.10 ili $1,250. Height (or Depth) 9'-0\", 9 ili 2.7 za metričke jedinice. Component, Formula Redak s nazivom sastavnog dijela (ili vrstom Component) je dio sklopa stavke iznad njega. Njegova jedinica, gubitak i stope su njegovi vlastiti; njegova formula koristi slova stavke, vidi Sklopovi i formule. Item,Type,Unit,Waste %,Material per unit,Labor per unit,Height,Component,Formula Partition type A,Linear,LF,10,2.10,3.33,9'-0\",, ,Component,EA,,4.25,,,Studs 16 in. o.c.,ceil(L / 1.333) + N VCT flooring,Area,SF,5,1.85,1.10,,, Duplex outlets,Count,EA,,3.50,45,,, Zarezi, točka-zarezi ili tabulatori između stupaca svi rade.","lang":"hr"},{"slug":"trade-packs","scope":"takeoffcraft","title":"Paketi struka","summary":"Dodajte besplatne sklopove za struku u svoju cjenovnu knjižnicu, uklonite ih u jednom koraku i podijelite vlastitu knjižnicu kao paket.","section":"tasks","order":83,"keywords":["paket struke","paket","sklopovi","predlošci","početne stavke","električni","suhomontaža","drvena konstrukcija","bojanje","beton","podovi","zidarski radovi","krovište","obloge","stolarija","vodoinstalacije","hvac","izolacija","krajobraz","terase","glavni izvođač","csi","masterformat","cc0","dodaj","ukloni","podijeli"],"headings":[{"id":"dodavanje-paketa","text":"Dodavanje paketa","level":2},{"id":"uklanjanje-paketa","text":"Uklanjanje paketa","level":2},{"id":"to-je-u-paketu","text":"Što je u paketu","level":2},{"id":"podijelite-svoju-knji-nicu-kao-paket","text":"Podijelite svoju knjižnicu kao paket","level":2}],"html":"\u003Cp\u003E\u003Cstrong\u003EPaket struke\u003C/strong\u003E je skup gotovih stavki za jednu struku: svaka s vlastitom jedinicom, visinom ili dubinom, gubitkom i svojim \u003Cstrong\u003Esklopom\u003C/strong\u003E, dijelovima i formulama koje izmjereni dio, površinu ili broj pretvaraju u materijale. Suhomontažna pregrada, na primjer, donosi svoje tračnice, stupove, ploče, vijke, traku i kit.\u003C/p\u003E\n\u003Cp\u003EPaketi se dodaju u vašu \u003Ca href=\"/tutorials/takeoffcraft/price-library\" data-topic=\"takeoffcraft/price-library\"\u003Ecjenovnu knjižnicu\u003C/a\u003E, a odatle dodajete njihove stavke u bilo koji predmjer.\u003C/p\u003E\n\u003Ch2 id=\"dodavanje-paketa\"\u003EDodavanje paketa\u003C/h2\u003E\n\u003Col\u003E\u003Cli\u003EOtvorite \u003Cspan class=\"hui\"\u003EKnjižnica\u003C/span\u003E na vrhu ploče \u003Cspan class=\"hui\"\u003EStavke\u003C/span\u003E, zatim \u003Cspan class=\"hui\"\u003EPaketi struke…\u003C/span\u003E.\u003C/li\u003E\u003Cli\u003EOdaberite \u003Cspan class=\"hui\"\u003EJedinice\u003C/span\u003E: imperijalne (LF, SF), metričke (m, m²) ili obje. Svaki sklop dolazi u oba sustava.\u003C/li\u003E\u003Cli\u003EOdaberite \u003Cspan class=\"hui\"\u003EDodaj\u003C/span\u003E pored paketa.\u003C/li\u003E\u003C/ol\u003E\n\u003Cp\u003EStavke paketa pojavljuju se u knjižnici, označene nazivom paketa. Da biste ih koristili, označite ih u knjižnici i odaberite \u003Cspan class=\"hui\"\u003EDodaj u predmjer\u003C/span\u003E.\u003C/p\u003E\n\u003Caside class=\"hc hc-note\"\u003E\u003Cp class=\"hc-label\"\u003ENote\u003C/p\u003E\n\u003Cp\u003E\u003Cstrong\u003EPaket ne donosi cijene.\u003C/strong\u003E Njegove stavke u knjižnici pokazuju „postavite svoju cijenu“. Cijene su vaše: upišite ih u knjižnicu ili u uređivač stavki, ili uvezite svoj cjenik kao CSV i upotrijebite \u003Cspan class=\"hui\"\u003EAžuriraj cijene\u003C/span\u003E.\u003C/p\u003E\n\u003C/aside\u003E\n\u003Cp\u003EAko već imate stavku istog naziva i vrste u knjižnici, paket vašu ostavlja kakva jest. Ponovno dodavanje paketa zamjenjuje njegove vlastite stavke novom verzijom.\u003C/p\u003E\n\u003Ch2 id=\"uklanjanje-paketa\"\u003EUklanjanje paketa\u003C/h2\u003E\n\u003Cp\u003EU \u003Cspan class=\"hui\"\u003EPaketi struke…\u003C/span\u003E odaberite \u003Cspan class=\"hui\"\u003EUkloni\u003C/span\u003E pored paketa koji ste dodali, pa još jednom za potvrdu. Svaka stavka koja je došla iz njega napušta knjižnicu u jednom koraku. Stavke koje ste već dodali u predmjer ostaju u tom predmjeru.\u003C/p\u003E\n\u003Ch2 id=\"to-je-u-paketu\"\u003EŠto je u paketu\u003C/h2\u003E\n\u003Cp\u003EOdaberite \u003Cspan class=\"hui\"\u003EIzvori i detalji\u003C/span\u003E pod paketom da vidite iz čega je svaki sklop napisan: građevinski propisi, norme i vodiči za ugradnju udruga iz struke. U knjižnici zadržite pokazivač nad stavkom da pročitate njezine izvore i pretpostavke, poput razmaka profila ili potrošnje boje. Provjerite ih prema svom poslu i tehničkim listovima vaših proizvoda te promijenite formule gdje se razlikuju (vidi \u003Ca href=\"/tutorials/takeoffcraft/assemblies\" data-topic=\"takeoffcraft/assemblies\"\u003ESklopovi i formule\u003C/a\u003E).\u003C/p\u003E\n\u003Cp\u003ESvaki paket je označen kao \u003Cstrong\u003EPočetni: još ga nije pregledao procjenitelj\u003C/strong\u003E dok ga radni procjenitelji ne pregledaju.\u003C/p\u003E\n\u003Cp\u003ESvaka stavka nosi i svoj broj CSI MasterFormat, poput \u003Ccode\u003E09 21 16\u003C/code\u003E.\u003C/p\u003E\n\u003Ch2 id=\"podijelite-svoju-knji-nicu-kao-paket\"\u003EPodijelite svoju knjižnicu kao paket\u003C/h2\u003E\n\u003Cp\u003E\u003Cspan class=\"hui\"\u003EIzvezi kao paket…\u003C/span\u003E u knjižnici sprema je kao datoteku paketa (\u003Ccode\u003E.ccpack.json\u003C/code\u003E) koju svatko može dodati pomoću \u003Cspan class=\"hui\"\u003EOtvori datoteku paketa…\u003C/span\u003E. Prema zadanom izostavlja stavke koje su došle iz paketa koje ste dodali i ne nosi cijene. Označite \u003Cspan class=\"hui\"\u003EUključi moje cijene kao primjere cijena\u003C/span\u003E da pošaljete i svoje cijene: idu označene regijom i datumom koje unesete, a onaj tko doda paket odlučuje hoće li ih koristiti.\u003C/p\u003E\n\u003Cp\u003EDatoteke paketa su obični podaci, nikad programi. TakeoffDesk provjerava svaki dio prije uporabe i izostavlja ono što ne može pročitati.\u003C/p\u003E","text":"Paket struke je skup gotovih stavki za jednu struku: svaka s vlastitom jedinicom, visinom ili dubinom, gubitkom i svojim sklopom, dijelovima i formulama koje izmjereni dio, površinu ili broj pretvaraju u materijale. Suhomontažna pregrada, na primjer, donosi svoje tračnice, stupove, ploče, vijke, traku i kit. Paketi se dodaju u vašu cjenovnu knjižnicu, a odatle dodajete njihove stavke u bilo koji predmjer. Dodavanje paketa Otvorite Knjižnica na vrhu ploče Stavke, zatim Paketi struke…. Odaberite Jedinice: imperijalne (LF, SF), metričke (m, m²) ili obje. Svaki sklop dolazi u oba sustava. Odaberite Dodaj pored paketa. Stavke paketa pojavljuju se u knjižnici, označene nazivom paketa. Da biste ih koristili, označite ih u knjižnici i odaberite Dodaj u predmjer. Paket ne donosi cijene. Njegove stavke u knjižnici pokazuju „postavite svoju cijenu“. Cijene su vaše: upišite ih u knjižnicu ili u uređivač stavki, ili uvezite svoj cjenik kao CSV i upotrijebite Ažuriraj cijene. Ako već imate stavku istog naziva i vrste u knjižnici, paket vašu ostavlja kakva jest. Ponovno dodavanje paketa zamjenjuje njegove vlastite stavke novom verzijom. Uklanjanje paketa U Paketi struke… odaberite Ukloni pored paketa koji ste dodali, pa još jednom za potvrdu. Svaka stavka koja je došla iz njega napušta knjižnicu u jednom koraku. Stavke koje ste već dodali u predmjer ostaju u tom predmjeru. Što je u paketu Odaberite Izvori i detalji pod paketom da vidite iz čega je svaki sklop napisan: građevinski propisi, norme i vodiči za ugradnju udruga iz struke. U knjižnici zadržite pokazivač nad stavkom da pročitate njezine izvore i pretpostavke, poput razmaka profila ili potrošnje boje. Provjerite ih prema svom poslu i tehničkim listovima vaših proizvoda te promijenite formule gdje se razlikuju (vidi Sklopovi i formule). Svaki paket je označen kao Početni: još ga nije pregledao procjenitelj dok ga radni procjenitelji ne pregledaju. Svaka stavka nosi i svoj broj CSI MasterFormat, poput 09 21 16. Podijelite svoju knjižnicu kao paket Izvezi kao paket… u knjižnici sprema je kao datoteku paketa (.ccpack.json) koju svatko može dodati pomoću Otvori datoteku paketa…. Prema zadanom izostavlja stavke koje su došle iz paketa koje ste dodali i ne nosi cijene. Označite Uključi moje cijene kao primjere cijena da pošaljete i svoje cijene: idu označene regijom i datumom koje unesete, a onaj tko doda paket odlučuje hoće li ih koristiti. Datoteke paketa su obični podaci, nikad programi. TakeoffDesk provjerava svaki dio prije uporabe i izostavlja ono što ne može pročitati.","lang":"hr"},{"slug":"earthwork","scope":"takeoffcraft","title":"Zemljani radovi i visinske kote","summary":"Označite visinske kote na situacijskom planu, predajte ih programu CivilCraft za površinu te iskop i nasip, a jednostavne količine iskopa obračunajte ovdje.","section":"tasks","order":84,"keywords":["zemljani radovi","iskop","nasip","iskop i nasip","planiranje terena","visinska kota","kote","topo","površina","triangulacija","civilcraft","točke","pnezd","rov"],"headings":[{"id":"jednostavan-iskop-ovdje","text":"Jednostavan iskop ovdje","level":2},{"id":"visinske-kote-za-civilcraft","text":"Visinske kote za CivilCraft","level":2},{"id":"iskop-i-nasip-iz-programa-civilcraft","text":"Iskop i nasip iz programa CivilCraft","level":2}],"html":"\u003Cp\u003ETakeoffDesk mjeri ono što je nacrtano na listu. Zemljani radovi zahtijevaju površinu terena, pa se dijele s programom CivilCraft, koji gradi površine iz točaka, planira ih i izračunava iskop, nasip i odvoz.\u003C/p\u003E\n\u003Ch2 id=\"jednostavan-iskop-ovdje\"\u003EJednostavan iskop ovdje\u003C/h2\u003E\n\u003Cp\u003EZa tlocrt iskopan do jedne dubine dovoljna je stavka površine s \u003Cstrong\u003Edubinom\u003C/strong\u003E: volumen je površina × dubina. \u003Ca href=\"/tutorials/takeoffcraft/trade-packs\" data-topic=\"takeoffcraft/trade-packs\"\u003EPaket po struci\u003C/a\u003E za izvođače ima stavku masovnog iskopa (volumen u sraslom stanju, volumen u rastresitom stanju i broj kamiona) i stavku rova za komunalne instalacije (iskop, posteljica i zatrpavanje po duljini i dubini).\u003C/p\u003E\n\u003Ch2 id=\"visinske-kote-za-civilcraft\"\u003EVisinske kote za CivilCraft\u003C/h2\u003E\n\u003Col\u003E\u003Cli\u003EPostavite mjerilo lista s terenom.\u003C/li\u003E\u003Cli\u003ENapravite stavku \u003Cstrong\u003EBroj\u003C/strong\u003E, npr. „Postojeći teren“, i kliknite svaku visinsku kotu na listu.\u003C/li\u003E\u003Cli\u003EOdaberite oznaku i u ploči Odabrana oznaka upišite njezinu \u003Cspan class=\"hui\"\u003EKota\u003C/span\u003E: \u003Ccode\u003E102.5\u003C/code\u003E, \u003Ccode\u003E102&#039;-6&quot;\u003C/code\u003E ili \u003Ccode\u003E31.24 m\u003C/code\u003E. Negativne i nulte kote su dopuštene.\u003C/li\u003E\u003Cli\u003EOtvorite izbornik \u003Cspan class=\"hui\"\u003EIzvoz\u003C/span\u003E i odaberite \u003Cspan class=\"hui\"\u003EVisinske kote\u003C/span\u003E. Dobit ćete datoteku s točkama (\u003Ccode\u003E.csv\u003C/code\u003E) sa stupcima Point, Northing, Easting, Elevation i Description, jedan redak za svaku označenu točku otvorenog lista.\u003C/li\u003E\u003Cli\u003EOtvorite tu datoteku u programu CivilCraft (vidi \u003Ca href=\"/tutorials/civilcraft/import-points\" data-topic=\"civilcraft/import-points\"\u003EUvoz točaka\u003C/a\u003E). Program iz točaka gradi površinu (\u003Ca href=\"/tutorials/civilcraft/build-surface\" data-topic=\"civilcraft/build-surface\"\u003EIzrada površine\u003C/a\u003E); odatle uspoređuje površine i daje iskop i nasip (\u003Ca href=\"/tutorials/civilcraft/volumes\" data-topic=\"civilcraft/volumes\"\u003EVolumeni\u003C/a\u003E).\u003C/li\u003E\u003C/ol\u003E\n\u003Cp\u003ENorthing i Easting su vlastite koordinate lista u stopama, mjerene od kuta stranice pri njezinom mjerilu: udaljenosti i volumeni između točaka su točni, ali nisu koordinate vaše geodetske izmjere lokacije. Premjestite ih na koordinate lokacije u programu CivilCraft kad to zatrebate.\u003C/p\u003E\n\u003Caside class=\"hc hc-note\"\u003E\u003Cp class=\"hc-label\"\u003ENote\u003C/p\u003E\n\u003Cp\u003ETočke s različitih listova nemaju zajedničke koordinate, pa izvoz uzima samo otvoreni list. Kote se spremaju s predmjerom i prenose se kopiranjem i lijepljenjem.\u003C/p\u003E\n\u003C/aside\u003E\n\u003Ch2 id=\"iskop-i-nasip-iz-programa-civilcraft\"\u003EIskop i nasip iz programa CivilCraft\u003C/h2\u003E\n\u003Cp\u003EZemljani radovi u programu CivilCraft vraćaju se kao dvije stavke koje možete odmah cijeniti:\u003C/p\u003E\n\u003Col\u003E\u003Cli\u003EU programu CivilCraft izradite platoe i koridore, zatim odaberite \u003Cspan class=\"hui\"\u003EPošalji u TakeoffDesk\u003C/span\u003E pod \u003Cstrong\u003EZemljani radovi\u003C/strong\u003E (\u003Ca href=\"/tutorials/civilcraft/volumes\" data-topic=\"civilcraft/volumes\"\u003EVolumeni zemljanih radova\u003C/a\u003E). Sprema se datoteka količina (\u003Ccode\u003E.quantities.json\u003C/code\u003E).\u003C/li\u003E\u003Cli\u003EU programu TakeoffDesk otvorite je s \u003Cspan class=\"hui\"\u003EOtvori predmjer\u003C/span\u003E ili je ispustite na aplikaciju. Vaš predmjer ostaje otvoren: datoteka dodaje stavke \u003Cstrong\u003EZemljani radovi: iskop\u003C/strong\u003E i \u003Cstrong\u003EZemljani radovi: nasip\u003C/strong\u003E kao \u003Ca href=\"/tutorials/takeoffcraft/create-items#typed-quantities-no-drawing\" data-topic=\"takeoffcraft/create-items\" data-hash=\"typed-quantities-no-drawing\"\u003Etipizirane količine\u003C/a\u003E u kubičnim jardima (CY) za projekt u stopama ili u kubnim metrima (m³) za projekt u metrima. Riječ je o jednom koraku: \u003Ckbd class=\"hk\"\u003E\u003Cspan class=\"k-mac\" title=\"Command Z\"\u003E⌘Z\u003C/span\u003E\u003Cspan class=\"k-pc\"\u003ECtrl+Z\u003C/span\u003E\u003C/kbd\u003E ga poništava.\u003C/li\u003E\u003Cli\u003EPreimenujte ih, zatim postavite gubitak, cijene i sklopove kako želite.\u003C/li\u003E\u003C/ol\u003E\n\u003Cp\u003EKad se projekt promijeni, ponovno pošaljite iz programa CivilCraft i otvorite novu datoteku: iste dvije stavke dobivaju nove količine. Njihovi nazivi, cijene, gubitak i sklopovi ostaju kako ste ih postavili. Ako se mjerna jedinica projekta promijenila, statusna traka to kaže: provjerite cijene. Datoteka iz drugog projekta programa CivilCraft dodaje vlastite dvije stavke.\u003C/p\u003E\n\u003Cp\u003EKoličine su volumeni u sraslom stanju, kako ih je CivilCraft izmjerio (metodom mreže): bez skupljanja ili nabreknuća. Dodajte to kao gubitak ili formulom poput \u003Ccode\u003EQ * 1.25\u003C/code\u003E za rastresiti volumen. Uređivač stavke pokazuje odakle je svaka došla i kada; stupac napomena u \u003Cspan class=\"hui\"\u003EPredračun\u003C/span\u003E to također navodi.\u003C/p\u003E\n\u003Caside class=\"hc hc-note\"\u003E\u003Cp class=\"hc-label\"\u003ENote\u003C/p\u003E\n\u003Cp\u003EDatoteka količina je obični JSON (\u003Ccode\u003E&quot;format&quot;: &quot;cadcraft-quantities&quot;\u003C/code\u003E), pa je može napisati i skripta ili drugi program: naziv aplikacije, projekt te stavke s ključem, nazivom, jedinicom i količinom.\u003C/p\u003E\n\u003C/aside\u003E","text":"TakeoffDesk mjeri ono što je nacrtano na listu. Zemljani radovi zahtijevaju površinu terena, pa se dijele s programom CivilCraft, koji gradi površine iz točaka, planira ih i izračunava iskop, nasip i odvoz. Jednostavan iskop ovdje Za tlocrt iskopan do jedne dubine dovoljna je stavka površine s dubinom: volumen je površina × dubina. Paket po struci za izvođače ima stavku masovnog iskopa (volumen u sraslom stanju, volumen u rastresitom stanju i broj kamiona) i stavku rova za komunalne instalacije (iskop, posteljica i zatrpavanje po duljini i dubini). Visinske kote za CivilCraft Postavite mjerilo lista s terenom. Napravite stavku Broj, npr. „Postojeći teren“, i kliknite svaku visinsku kotu na listu. Odaberite oznaku i u ploči Odabrana oznaka upišite njezinu Kota: 102.5, 102'-6\" ili 31.24 m. Negativne i nulte kote su dopuštene. Otvorite izbornik Izvoz i odaberite Visinske kote. Dobit ćete datoteku s točkama (.csv) sa stupcima Point, Northing, Easting, Elevation i Description, jedan redak za svaku označenu točku otvorenog lista. Otvorite tu datoteku u programu CivilCraft (vidi Uvoz točaka). Program iz točaka gradi površinu (Izrada površine); odatle uspoređuje površine i daje iskop i nasip (Volumeni). Northing i Easting su vlastite koordinate lista u stopama, mjerene od kuta stranice pri njezinom mjerilu: udaljenosti i volumeni između točaka su točni, ali nisu koordinate vaše geodetske izmjere lokacije. Premjestite ih na koordinate lokacije u programu CivilCraft kad to zatrebate. Točke s različitih listova nemaju zajedničke koordinate, pa izvoz uzima samo otvoreni list. Kote se spremaju s predmjerom i prenose se kopiranjem i lijepljenjem. Iskop i nasip iz programa CivilCraft Zemljani radovi u programu CivilCraft vraćaju se kao dvije stavke koje možete odmah cijeniti: U programu CivilCraft izradite platoe i koridore, zatim odaberite Pošalji u TakeoffDesk pod Zemljani radovi (Volumeni zemljanih radova). Sprema se datoteka količina (.quantities.json). U programu TakeoffDesk otvorite je s Otvori predmjer ili je ispustite na aplikaciju. Vaš predmjer ostaje otvoren: datoteka dodaje stavke Zemljani radovi: iskop i Zemljani radovi: nasip kao tipizirane količine u kubičnim jardima (CY) za projekt u stopama ili u kubnim metrima (m³) za projekt u metrima. Riječ je o jednom koraku: Ctrl+Z ga poništava. Preimenujte ih, zatim postavite gubitak, cijene i sklopove kako želite. Kad se projekt promijeni, ponovno pošaljite iz programa CivilCraft i otvorite novu datoteku: iste dvije stavke dobivaju nove količine. Njihovi nazivi, cijene, gubitak i sklopovi ostaju kako ste ih postavili. Ako se mjerna jedinica projekta promijenila, statusna traka to kaže: provjerite cijene. Datoteka iz drugog projekta programa CivilCraft dodaje vlastite dvije stavke. Količine su volumeni u sraslom stanju, kako ih je CivilCraft izmjerio (metodom mreže): bez skupljanja ili nabreknuća. Dodajte to kao gubitak ili formulom poput Q * 1.25 za rastresiti volumen. Uređivač stavke pokazuje odakle je svaka došla i kada; stupac napomena u Predračun to također navodi. Datoteka količina je obični JSON (\"format\": \"cadcraft-quantities\"), pa je može napisati i skripta ili drugi program: naziv aplikacije, projekt te stavke s ključem, nazivom, jedinicom i količinom.","lang":"hr"},{"slug":"bid-areas","scope":"takeoffcraft","title":"Područja ponude","summary":"Označite oznake prema zgradi, etaži ili fazi, izvodite količine u jedno područje istodobno i čitajte količine i troškove za svako područje.","section":"tasks","order":85,"keywords":["dodaj alternativu","odbij alternativu","osnovna ponuda","alternative","područje ponude","područje","zgrada","etaža","razina","faza","zona","alternativa","raščlamba","podjela","tipična etaža","međuzbroj","po području"],"headings":[{"id":"stvaranje-podru-ja-ponude","text":"Stvaranje područja ponude","level":2},{"id":"izvo-enje-u-podru-je","text":"Izvođenje u područje","level":2},{"id":"premje-tanje-oznaka-u-drugo-podru-je","text":"Premještanje oznaka u drugo područje","level":2},{"id":"preimenovanje-redoslijed-ili-brisanje","text":"Preimenovanje, redoslijed ili brisanje","level":2},{"id":"itanje-koli-ina-po-podru-ju","text":"Čitanje količina po području","level":2},{"id":"alternative-osnovna-ponuda-plus-dodaci-i-odbici","text":"Alternative: osnovna ponuda plus dodaci i odbici","level":2},{"id":"u-izvozu","text":"U izvozu","level":2}],"html":"\u003Cp\u003EPodručje ponude je dio posla koji se zasebno cijeni: zgrada, etaža, faza, krilo. Svaka oznaka može biti u jednom području ponude. Količine i procjena tada se mogu čitati za svako područje, s međuzbrojem za svaki, dok ukupni iznos posla ostaje zbroj svega.\u003C/p\u003E\n\u003Ch2 id=\"stvaranje-podru-ja-ponude\"\u003EStvaranje područja ponude\u003C/h2\u003E\n\u003Col\u003E\u003Cli\u003EPri vrhu panela \u003Cspan class=\"hui\"\u003EStavke\u003C/span\u003E otvorite popis \u003Cspan class=\"hui\"\u003EPodručje ponude\u003C/span\u003E.\u003C/li\u003E\u003Cli\u003EOdaberite \u003Cstrong\u003ENovo područje ponude…\u003C/strong\u003E, upišite naziv poput „Zgrada A“ ili „Razina 2“, i odaberite \u003Cstrong\u003ENapravi\u003C/strong\u003E. Novo područje postaje trenutačno. Statusna traka kaže „Nove oznake idu u (naziv). Oznake u drugim područjima ponude su zatamnjene.“\u003C/li\u003E\u003C/ol\u003E\n\u003Ch2 id=\"izvo-enje-u-podru-je\"\u003EIzvođenje u područje\u003C/h2\u003E\n\u003Cp\u003EDok je područje ponude odabrano na popisu, svaka nova oznaka ide u njega: dionice, površine, krugovi, brojanja, oznake koje dodaje \u003Cspan class=\"hui\"\u003EAutobrojanje\u003C/span\u003E i ono što zalijepite. Oznake u drugim područjima ponude i oznake ni u jednom prikazuju se zatamnjeno na listu, da vidite što pripada gdje.\u003C/p\u003E\n\u003Cp\u003EOdaberite \u003Cstrong\u003ENema područja ponude\u003C/strong\u003E na popisu da izvodite bez njega; tada se ništa ne zatamnjuje.\u003C/p\u003E\n\u003Caside class=\"hc hc-tip\"\u003E\u003Cp class=\"hc-label\"\u003ETip\u003C/p\u003E\n\u003Cp\u003ETipične etaže: izvedite Razinu 2, odaberite njezine oznake (\u003Ckbd class=\"hk\"\u003E\u003Cspan class=\"k-mac\" title=\"Command A\"\u003E⌘A\u003C/span\u003E\u003Cspan class=\"k-pc\"\u003ECtrl+A\u003C/span\u003E\u003C/kbd\u003E na listu), kopirajte ih, odaberite Razinu 3 na popisu i zalijepite. Kopije idu u Razinu 3. Kada su etaže iste i ne trebate ih razdvajati, \u003Ca href=\"/tutorials/takeoffcraft/typical-groups\" data-topic=\"takeoffcraft/typical-groups\"\u003Etipična grupa\u003C/a\u003E umjesto toga broji jednu etažu više puta.\u003C/p\u003E\n\u003C/aside\u003E\n\u003Ch2 id=\"premje-tanje-oznaka-u-drugo-podru-je\"\u003EPremještanje oznaka u drugo područje\u003C/h2\u003E\n\u003Cp\u003EOdaberite jednu oznaku ili više njih (\u003Ckbd class=\"hk\"\u003E\u003Cspan class=\"k-mac\" title=\"Shift\"\u003E⇧\u003C/span\u003E\u003Cspan class=\"k-pc\"\u003EShift\u003C/span\u003E\u003C/kbd\u003E + klik, ili \u003Ckbd class=\"hk\"\u003E\u003Cspan class=\"k-mac\" title=\"Command A\"\u003E⌘A\u003C/span\u003E\u003Cspan class=\"k-pc\"\u003ECtrl+A\u003C/span\u003E\u003C/kbd\u003E). Pod \u003Cstrong\u003EOdabrana oznaka\u003C/strong\u003E (ili \u003Cstrong\u003EOdabrane oznake\u003C/strong\u003E) odaberite područje u polju \u003Cspan class=\"hui\"\u003EPodručje ponude\u003C/span\u003E. Statusna traka kaže „Oznake premještene u Razinu 2: 3.“ Ovo je jedan korak poništavanja.\u003C/p\u003E\n\u003Ch2 id=\"preimenovanje-redoslijed-ili-brisanje\"\u003EPreimenovanje, redoslijed ili brisanje\u003C/h2\u003E\n\u003Cp\u003EOdaberite \u003Cstrong\u003EUpravljaj područjima ponude…\u003C/strong\u003E na popisu. Prepišite naziv da ga preimenujete, koristite strelice za promjenu redoslijeda (tablice i radna knjiga ga prate) ili obrišite jedno kantom za smeće. Brisanje područja ponude zadržava njegove oznake: one tada nisu ni u jednom području ponude. \u003Ckbd class=\"hk\"\u003E\u003Cspan class=\"k-mac\" title=\"Command Z\"\u003E⌘Z\u003C/span\u003E\u003Cspan class=\"k-pc\"\u003ECtrl+Z\u003C/span\u003E\u003C/kbd\u003E poništava svaku promjenu.\u003C/p\u003E\n\u003Ch2 id=\"itanje-koli-ina-po-podru-ju\"\u003EČitanje količina po području\u003C/h2\u003E\n\u003Cp\u003EU tablici \u003Cspan class=\"hui\"\u003EKoličine\u003C/span\u003E odaberite \u003Cspan class=\"hui\"\u003EPo području\u003C/span\u003E (prikazuje se kada izvedba ima područje ponude). Svako područje navodi stavke koje sadrži, s njihovom količinom, jedinicom i ukupnim iznosom, zatim redak međuzbroja. Oznake ni u jednom području dolaze na kraju, kao \u003Cstrong\u003ENema područja ponude\u003C/strong\u003E. Kliknite redak stavke da je istaknete i da to područje postane trenutačno.\u003C/p\u003E\n\u003Cp\u003ESklopovi se izračunavaju za svako područje iz vlastitih ukupnih vrijednosti tog područja. Formula koja zaokružuje naviše, poput \u003Ccode\u003Eceil(L / 4)\u003C/code\u003E, može tada dati nešto više zajedno u područjima nego za cijeli posao, kao što bi i na ponudi kalkuliranoj po područjima.\u003C/p\u003E\n\u003Ch2 id=\"alternative-osnovna-ponuda-plus-dodaci-i-odbici\"\u003EAlternative: osnovna ponuda plus dodaci i odbici\u003C/h2\u003E\n\u003Cp\u003EPodručje ponude može biti \u003Cstrong\u003Ealternativa\u003C/strong\u003E: radovi koje vlasnik može dodati ponudi ili izvaditi iz nje. U \u003Cstrong\u003EUpravljaj područjima ponude…\u003C/strong\u003E svako područje ima popis pored svog naziva:\u003C/p\u003E\n\u003Cdiv class=\"ht-wrap\"\u003E\u003Ctable class=\"ht\"\u003E\u003Cthead\u003E\u003Ctr\u003E\u003Cth scope=\"col\"\u003EIzbor\u003C/th\u003E\u003Cth scope=\"col\"\u003EŠto radi\u003C/th\u003E\u003C/tr\u003E\u003C/thead\u003E\u003Ctbody\u003E\u003Ctr\u003E\u003Ctd\u003E\u003Cspan class=\"hui\"\u003EOsnovna ponuda\u003C/span\u003E\u003C/td\u003E\u003Ctd\u003EU ponudi, kao i obično.\u003C/td\u003E\u003C/tr\u003E\u003Ctr\u003E\u003Ctd\u003E\u003Cspan class=\"hui\"\u003EAlternativa za dodatak\u003C/span\u003E\u003C/td\u003E\u003Ctd\u003ECijeni se zasebno i \u003Cstrong\u003Eizostavlja se iz osnovne ponude\u003C/strong\u003E: nadogradnja tepiha, dodatna nadstrešnica.\u003C/td\u003E\u003C/tr\u003E\u003Ctr\u003E\u003Ctd\u003E\u003Cspan class=\"hui\"\u003EAlternativa za odbitak\u003C/span\u003E\u003C/td\u003E\u003Ctd\u003EU osnovnoj ponudi, i nudi se kao odbitak: „obrišite nadstrešnicu“.\u003C/td\u003E\u003C/tr\u003E\u003C/tbody\u003E\u003C/table\u003E\u003C/div\u003E\n\u003Cp\u003EIzvedite radove alternative u njezino područje ponude kao i bilo koje drugo područje. Kada izvedba ima alternativu:\u003C/p\u003E\n\u003Cul\u003E\u003Cli\u003EZaglavlje tablice \u003Cspan class=\"hui\"\u003EKoličine\u003C/span\u003E kaže \u003Cstrong\u003EOsnovna ponuda\u003C/strong\u003E umjesto \u003Cspan class=\"hui\"\u003EUkupno za posao\u003C/span\u003E: cijela izvedba bez alternativa za dodatak.\u003C/li\u003E\u003Cli\u003E\u003Cspan class=\"hui\"\u003EPo području\u003C/span\u003E završava osnovnom ponudom i jednim retkom po alternativi: \u003Cstrong\u003E+$300.00\u003C/strong\u003E za dodatak, \u003Cstrong\u003E−$1,050.00\u003C/strong\u003E za odbitak.\u003C/li\u003E\u003Cli\u003EAlternativa cijeni samo stavke koje imaju oznake u njoj, s njihovim sklopovima, pa dio sklopa druge stavke ne ulazi nepozvan.\u003C/li\u003E\u003C/ul\u003E\n\u003Cp\u003EU izvozima CSV završava osnovnom ponudom i alternativama, a radna knjiga dobiva radni list \u003Cstrong\u003EAlternative\u003C/strong\u003E: osnovnu ponudu, stavke svake alternative i njezinu promjenu te osnovnu ponudu sa svim alternativama za dodatak uzetim u obzir.\u003C/p\u003E\n\u003Ch2 id=\"u-izvozu\"\u003EU izvozu\u003C/h2\u003E\n\u003Cp\u003E\u003Cspan class=\"hui\"\u003EXLSX\u003C/span\u003E dodaje radni list \u003Cstrong\u003EPo području ponude\u003C/strong\u003E: stavke i komponente svakog područja s količinom, količinom s gubitkom, materijalom, radom i ukupnim iznosom, međuzbroj po području (formula \u003Ccode\u003ESUM\u003C/code\u003E) i \u003Cstrong\u003ESva područja ponude\u003C/strong\u003E na kraju. Radni list \u003Cstrong\u003EOznake\u003C/strong\u003E dobiva stupac \u003Cstrong\u003EPodručje ponude\u003C/strong\u003E. Izvedba bez područja ponude izvozi se kao i prije. Vidi \u003Ca href=\"/tutorials/takeoffcraft/export-columns\" data-topic=\"takeoffcraft/export-columns\"\u003EStupci izvoza\u003C/a\u003E.\u003C/p\u003E\n\u003Cp\u003EPodručja ponude spremaju se u datoteku projekta zajedno s oznakama.\u003C/p\u003E","text":"Područje ponude je dio posla koji se zasebno cijeni: zgrada, etaža, faza, krilo. Svaka oznaka može biti u jednom području ponude. Količine i procjena tada se mogu čitati za svako područje, s međuzbrojem za svaki, dok ukupni iznos posla ostaje zbroj svega. Stvaranje područja ponude Pri vrhu panela Stavke otvorite popis Područje ponude. Odaberite Novo područje ponude…, upišite naziv poput „Zgrada A“ ili „Razina 2“, i odaberite Napravi. Novo područje postaje trenutačno. Statusna traka kaže „Nove oznake idu u (naziv). Oznake u drugim područjima ponude su zatamnjene.“ Izvođenje u područje Dok je područje ponude odabrano na popisu, svaka nova oznaka ide u njega: dionice, površine, krugovi, brojanja, oznake koje dodaje Autobrojanje i ono što zalijepite. Oznake u drugim područjima ponude i oznake ni u jednom prikazuju se zatamnjeno na listu, da vidite što pripada gdje. Odaberite Nema područja ponude na popisu da izvodite bez njega; tada se ništa ne zatamnjuje. Tipične etaže: izvedite Razinu 2, odaberite njezine oznake (Ctrl+A na listu), kopirajte ih, odaberite Razinu 3 na popisu i zalijepite. Kopije idu u Razinu 3. Kada su etaže iste i ne trebate ih razdvajati, tipična grupa umjesto toga broji jednu etažu više puta. Premještanje oznaka u drugo područje Odaberite jednu oznaku ili više njih (Shift + klik, ili Ctrl+A). Pod Odabrana oznaka (ili Odabrane oznake) odaberite područje u polju Područje ponude. Statusna traka kaže „Oznake premještene u Razinu 2: 3.“ Ovo je jedan korak poništavanja. Preimenovanje, redoslijed ili brisanje Odaberite Upravljaj područjima ponude… na popisu. Prepišite naziv da ga preimenujete, koristite strelice za promjenu redoslijeda (tablice i radna knjiga ga prate) ili obrišite jedno kantom za smeće. Brisanje područja ponude zadržava njegove oznake: one tada nisu ni u jednom području ponude. Ctrl+Z poništava svaku promjenu. Čitanje količina po području U tablici Količine odaberite Po području (prikazuje se kada izvedba ima područje ponude). Svako područje navodi stavke koje sadrži, s njihovom količinom, jedinicom i ukupnim iznosom, zatim redak međuzbroja. Oznake ni u jednom području dolaze na kraju, kao Nema područja ponude. Kliknite redak stavke da je istaknete i da to područje postane trenutačno. Sklopovi se izračunavaju za svako područje iz vlastitih ukupnih vrijednosti tog područja. Formula koja zaokružuje naviše, poput ceil(L / 4), može tada dati nešto više zajedno u područjima nego za cijeli posao, kao što bi i na ponudi kalkuliranoj po područjima. Alternative: osnovna ponuda plus dodaci i odbici Područje ponude može biti alternativa: radovi koje vlasnik može dodati ponudi ili izvaditi iz nje. U Upravljaj područjima ponude… svako područje ima popis pored svog naziva: Izbor Što radi Osnovna ponuda U ponudi, kao i obično. Alternativa za dodatak Cijeni se zasebno i izostavlja se iz osnovne ponude: nadogradnja tepiha, dodatna nadstrešnica. Alternativa za odbitak U osnovnoj ponudi, i nudi se kao odbitak: „obrišite nadstrešnicu“. Izvedite radove alternative u njezino područje ponude kao i bilo koje drugo područje. Kada izvedba ima alternativu: Zaglavlje tablice Količine kaže Osnovna ponuda umjesto Ukupno za posao: cijela izvedba bez alternativa za dodatak. Po području završava osnovnom ponudom i jednim retkom po alternativi: +$300.00 za dodatak, −$1,050.00 za odbitak. Alternativa cijeni samo stavke koje imaju oznake u njoj, s njihovim sklopovima, pa dio sklopa druge stavke ne ulazi nepozvan. U izvozima CSV završava osnovnom ponudom i alternativama, a radna knjiga dobiva radni list Alternative: osnovnu ponudu, stavke svake alternative i njezinu promjenu te osnovnu ponudu sa svim alternativama za dodatak uzetim u obzir. U izvozu XLSX dodaje radni list Po području ponude: stavke i komponente svakog područja s količinom, količinom s gubitkom, materijalom, radom i ukupnim iznosom, međuzbroj po području (formula SUM) i Sva područja ponude na kraju. Radni list Oznake dobiva stupac Područje ponude. Izvedba bez područja ponude izvozi se kao i prije. Vidi Stupci izvoza. Područja ponude spremaju se u datoteku projekta zajedno s oznakama.","lang":"hr"},{"slug":"issues-and-revisions","scope":"takeoffcraft","title":"Teme, revizije i popis promjena crteža","summary":"Vodite jednu povijest tema s modelom arhitekta: učitajte teme, zabilježite upute za gradilište, radioničke crteže i povezane modele uz temu te pročitajte popis promjena crteža.","section":"tasks","order":86,"keywords":["tema","revizija","revizije","popis promjena","popis promjena crteža","registar crteža","uputa za gradilište","radionički crtež","povezani model","natječaj","građenje","povijest tema","troškovnik","predmjer"],"headings":[{"id":"to-ete-raditi","text":"Što ćete raditi","level":2},{"id":"koraci","text":"Koraci","level":2},{"id":"dobro-je-znati","text":"Dobro je znati","level":2}],"html":"\u003Ch2 id=\"to-ete-raditi\"\u003EŠto ćete raditi\u003C/h2\u003E\n\u003Cp\u003ERadite iz iste povijesti tema kao i ostatak tima. Pogledajte koji su listovi izašli u kojoj reviziji i zabilježite što se događa na gradilištu uz temu kojoj pripada.\u003C/p\u003E\n\u003Ch2 id=\"koraci\"\u003EKoraci\u003C/h2\u003E\n\u003Col\u003E\u003Cli\u003EOtvorite \u003Cstrong\u003ETeme i revizije\u003C/strong\u003E.\u003C/li\u003E\u003Cli\u003EOdaberite \u003Cstrong\u003EUčitaj povijest tema\u003C/strong\u003E i odaberite datoteku \u003Ccode\u003E.issues.json\u003C/code\u003E spremljenu iz BimCraft ili druge aplikacije. Njezine teme i zapisi dodaju se vašima. Ništa se ne zamjenjuje.\u003C/li\u003E\u003Cli\u003EOdaberite \u003Cstrong\u003EDodaj zapis\u003C/strong\u003E za uputu za gradilište, radionički crtež, skup markupa, povezani model ili bilješku. Odaberite temu na koju se odnosi i njezin status. Odabrana datoteka bilježi se prema nazivu, veličini i SHA-256; datoteka ostaje na mjestu gdje jest.\u003C/li\u003E\u003Cli\u003E\u003Cstrong\u003EPopis promjena crteža\u003C/strong\u003E prikazuje jedan redak za svaki list i jedan stupac za svaku temu. Revizija u zagradama ponovno je izdana bez promjena.\u003C/li\u003E\u003Cli\u003E\u003Cstrong\u003EPreuzmite popis promjena (CSV)\u003C/strong\u003E sprema teme, tablicu listova i zapise. \u003Cstrong\u003ESpremite povijest tema\u003C/strong\u003E zapisuje datoteku koju čitaju ostale aplikacije.\u003C/li\u003E\u003C/ol\u003E\n\u003Ch2 id=\"dobro-je-znati\"\u003EDobro je znati\u003C/h2\u003E\n\u003Cul\u003E\u003Cli\u003E\u003Cstrong\u003EZabilježi temu\u003C/strong\u003E izdaje vaše izmjerene listove, primjerice s troškovnikom. \u003Cstrong\u003EPromjene od\u003C/strong\u003E pokazuje koji su listovi ponovno izmjereni nakon te teme.\u003C/li\u003E\u003Cli\u003EPovijest se sprema u datoteku predmjera. Svaka promjena je jedan korak poništavanja.\u003C/li\u003E\u003Cli\u003EPonovno učitavanje iste datoteke ništa ne dodaje dvaput. Kad dvije kopije sadrže isti zapis, zadržava se noviji.\u003C/li\u003E\u003C/ul\u003E","text":"Što ćete raditi Radite iz iste povijesti tema kao i ostatak tima. Pogledajte koji su listovi izašli u kojoj reviziji i zabilježite što se događa na gradilištu uz temu kojoj pripada. Koraci Otvorite Teme i revizije. Odaberite Učitaj povijest tema i odaberite datoteku .issues.json spremljenu iz BimCraft ili druge aplikacije. Njezine teme i zapisi dodaju se vašima. Ništa se ne zamjenjuje. Odaberite Dodaj zapis za uputu za gradilište, radionički crtež, skup markupa, povezani model ili bilješku. Odaberite temu na koju se odnosi i njezin status. Odabrana datoteka bilježi se prema nazivu, veličini i SHA-256; datoteka ostaje na mjestu gdje jest. Popis promjena crteža prikazuje jedan redak za svaki list i jedan stupac za svaku temu. Revizija u zagradama ponovno je izdana bez promjena. Preuzmite popis promjena (CSV) sprema teme, tablicu listova i zapise. Spremite povijest tema zapisuje datoteku koju čitaju ostale aplikacije. Dobro je znati Zabilježi temu izdaje vaše izmjerene listove, primjerice s troškovnikom. Promjene od pokazuje koji su listovi ponovno izmjereni nakon te teme. Povijest se sprema u datoteku predmjera. Svaka promjena je jedan korak poništavanja. Ponovno učitavanje iste datoteke ništa ne dodaje dvaput. Kad dvije kopije sadrže isti zapis, zadržava se noviji.","lang":"hr"},{"slug":"typical-groups","scope":"takeoffcraft","title":"Tipične skupine","summary":"Predmjerite jednu tipičnu jedinicu, sobu ili etažu jednom i brojite je onoliko puta koliko se ponavlja, kasnije promijenite broj i vidite koje su oznake tipične.","section":"tasks","order":86,"keywords":["tipično","tipična skupina","ponavljanje","broj ponavljanja","množenje","puta","jedinica","hotelska soba","stan","tipična etaža","x24","kopije"],"headings":[{"id":"izrada-tipi-ne-skupine","text":"Izrada tipične skupine","level":2},{"id":"kasnija-promjena","text":"Kasnija promjena","level":2},{"id":"dobro-je-znati","text":"Dobro je znati","level":2}],"html":"\u003Cp\u003EZgrada se često ponavlja: 24 identične hotelske sobe, 6 tipičnih etaža, 40 parkirnih mjesta s istom oznakom. \u003Cstrong\u003ETipična skupina\u003C/strong\u003E omogućuje da predmjerite jednu od njih i brojite je onoliko puta koliko se ponavlja, bez crtanja kopija.\u003C/p\u003E\n\u003Ch2 id=\"izrada-tipi-ne-skupine\"\u003EIzrada tipične skupine\u003C/h2\u003E\n\u003Col\u003E\u003Cli\u003EPredmjerite jednu jedinicu: njezine zidove, pod, njezine utičnice, bilo koje stavke.\u003C/li\u003E\u003Cli\u003EOdaberite njezine oznake alatom \u003Cspan class=\"hui\"\u003EOdaberi\u003C/span\u003E: kliknite jednu, zatim \u003Ckbd class=\"hk\"\u003E\u003Cspan class=\"k-mac\" title=\"Shift\"\u003E⇧\u003C/span\u003E\u003Cspan class=\"k-pc\"\u003EShift\u003C/span\u003E\u003C/kbd\u003E + klik na ostale (\u003Ca href=\"/tutorials/takeoffcraft/copy-paste#select-the-marks\" data-topic=\"takeoffcraft/copy-paste\" data-hash=\"select-the-marks\"\u003EOdabir oznaka\u003C/a\u003E).\u003C/li\u003E\u003Cli\u003EPod \u003Cstrong\u003EOdabrana oznaka\u003C/strong\u003E otvorite \u003Cspan class=\"hui\"\u003ETipično\u003C/span\u003E i odaberite \u003Cspan class=\"hui\"\u003ENova tipična skupina…\u003C/span\u003E.\u003C/li\u003E\u003Cli\u003EDajte joj naziv (\u003Ccode\u003EJedinica A\u003C/code\u003E) i koliko se puta ponavlja (\u003Ccode\u003E24\u003C/code\u003E), zatim odaberite \u003Cspan class=\"hui\"\u003EIzradi skupinu\u003C/span\u003E.\u003C/li\u003E\u003C/ol\u003E\n\u003Cp\u003ESvaka količina tih oznaka sada se broji 24 puta: zidna dionica od 10 ft daje 240 ft, pod od 80 SF daje 1,920 SF, dvije utičnice 48. Troškovi slijede, a formule sklopova vide ponovljene zbrojeve (\u003Ccode\u003EN\u003C/code\u003E također broji svaku dionicu 24 puta).\u003C/p\u003E\n\u003Cp\u003ENa listu, isprekidani okvir ide oko oznaka skupine s njezinim nazivom i brojem, poput \u003Cstrong\u003EJedinica A ×24\u003C/strong\u003E.\u003C/p\u003E\n\u003Ch2 id=\"kasnija-promjena\"\u003EKasnija promjena\u003C/h2\u003E\n\u003Cp\u003ESkupine su navedene pod \u003Cstrong\u003ETipične skupine\u003C/strong\u003E u desnoj ploči:\u003C/p\u003E\n\u003Cul\u003E\u003Cli\u003EPromijenite broj iza \u003Cstrong\u003E×\u003C/strong\u003E da promijenite koliko se puta broji (1 do 10,000). Sve količine se ažuriraju.\u003C/li\u003E\u003Cli\u003EPreimenujte je u njezinom polju za naziv.\u003C/li\u003E\u003Cli\u003EIkona kutije odabire njezine oznake (i pokazuje njihov list).\u003C/li\u003E\u003Cli\u003EKanta za smeće briše skupinu. Njezine oznake ostaju, brojene jednom.\u003C/li\u003E\u003C/ul\u003E\n\u003Cp\u003EDa dodate oznake u skupinu ili ih izvadite, odaberite ih i izaberite skupinu (ili \u003Cspan class=\"hui\"\u003ENije tipično (×1)\u003C/span\u003E) pod \u003Cspan class=\"hui\"\u003ETipično\u003C/span\u003E.\u003C/p\u003E\n\u003Ch2 id=\"dobro-je-znati\"\u003EDobro je znati\u003C/h2\u003E\n\u003Cul\u003E\u003Cli\u003EOznake skupine mogu biti na više listova i bilo kojih stavki. Svaka oznaka je najviše u jednoj skupini.\u003C/li\u003E\u003Cli\u003EKopije koje zalijepite nisu u skupini: zalijepljena kopija tipične jedinice inače bi se brojala još 24 puta. Koristite skupinu za „isto nešto N puta“, a kopiranje i lijepljenje za kopije koje crtate.\u003C/li\u003E\u003Cli\u003EOznake se crtaju jednom, pa 3D prikaz i označeni PDF pokazuju jednu jedinicu; količine, izvozi i tablica po listu broje je ×N. List \u003Cstrong\u003EOznake\u003C/strong\u003E Excel izvoza kaže koje su oznake tipične i koliko se puta broje.\u003C/li\u003E\u003Cli\u003EUz područja ponuda, oznake skupine broje se ×N u vlastitom području ponude.\u003C/li\u003E\u003C/ul\u003E","text":"Zgrada se često ponavlja: 24 identične hotelske sobe, 6 tipičnih etaža, 40 parkirnih mjesta s istom oznakom. Tipična skupina omogućuje da predmjerite jednu od njih i brojite je onoliko puta koliko se ponavlja, bez crtanja kopija. Izrada tipične skupine Predmjerite jednu jedinicu: njezine zidove, pod, njezine utičnice, bilo koje stavke. Odaberite njezine oznake alatom Odaberi: kliknite jednu, zatim Shift + klik na ostale (Odabir oznaka). Pod Odabrana oznaka otvorite Tipično i odaberite Nova tipična skupina…. Dajte joj naziv (Jedinica A) i koliko se puta ponavlja (24), zatim odaberite Izradi skupinu. Svaka količina tih oznaka sada se broji 24 puta: zidna dionica od 10 ft daje 240 ft, pod od 80 SF daje 1,920 SF, dvije utičnice 48. Troškovi slijede, a formule sklopova vide ponovljene zbrojeve (N također broji svaku dionicu 24 puta). Na listu, isprekidani okvir ide oko oznaka skupine s njezinim nazivom i brojem, poput Jedinica A ×24. Kasnija promjena Skupine su navedene pod Tipične skupine u desnoj ploči: Promijenite broj iza × da promijenite koliko se puta broji (1 do 10,000). Sve količine se ažuriraju. Preimenujte je u njezinom polju za naziv. Ikona kutije odabire njezine oznake (i pokazuje njihov list). Kanta za smeće briše skupinu. Njezine oznake ostaju, brojene jednom. Da dodate oznake u skupinu ili ih izvadite, odaberite ih i izaberite skupinu (ili Nije tipično (×1)) pod Tipično. Dobro je znati Oznake skupine mogu biti na više listova i bilo kojih stavki. Svaka oznaka je najviše u jednoj skupini. Kopije koje zalijepite nisu u skupini: zalijepljena kopija tipične jedinice inače bi se brojala još 24 puta. Koristite skupinu za „isto nešto N puta“, a kopiranje i lijepljenje za kopije koje crtate. Oznake se crtaju jednom, pa 3D prikaz i označeni PDF pokazuju jednu jedinicu; količine, izvozi i tablica po listu broje je ×N. List Oznake Excel izvoza kaže koje su oznake tipične i koliko se puta broje. Uz područja ponuda, oznake skupine broje se ×N u vlastitom području ponude.","lang":"hr"},{"slug":"read-quantities","scope":"takeoffcraft","title":"Read quantities and the estimate","summary":"Use the Quantities table by item and by sheet, the job total, highlighting, and the Incomplete warning.","section":"tasks","order":90,"keywords":["quantities","totals","by item","by sheet","job total","estimate","summary","report","highlight","incomplete","costs"],"headings":[{"id":"by-item","text":"By item","level":2},{"id":"by-sheet","text":"By sheet","level":2},{"id":"by-area","text":"By area","level":2},{"id":"the-incomplete-warning","text":"The Incomplete warning","level":2},{"id":"highlight-an-item","text":"Highlight an item","level":2},{"id":"item-totals-in-the-side-panel","text":"Item totals in the side panel","level":2},{"id":"marks-on-pdfs-that-are-not-open","text":"Marks on PDFs that are not open","level":2},{"id":"more-room","text":"More room","level":2}],"html":"\u003Cp\u003EThe \u003Cspan class=\"hui\"\u003EQuantities\u003C/span\u003E table at the bottom of the window is your live estimate. It changes the moment you draw, delete, rescale or edit a rate. Quantities are never stored; they are measured again from the marks every time, so they cannot drift out of date.\u003C/p\u003E\n\u003Ch2 id=\"by-item\"\u003EBy item\u003C/h2\u003E\n\u003Cp\u003EChoose \u003Cspan class=\"hui\"\u003EBy item\u003C/span\u003E (the default). Each item has a row, and each of its assembly components a row under it.\u003C/p\u003E\n\u003Cdiv class=\"ht-wrap\"\u003E\u003Ctable class=\"ht\"\u003E\u003Cthead\u003E\u003Ctr\u003E\u003Cth scope=\"col\"\u003EColumn\u003C/th\u003E\u003Cth scope=\"col\"\u003EMeaning\u003C/th\u003E\u003C/tr\u003E\u003C/thead\u003E\u003Ctbody\u003E\u003Ctr\u003E\u003Ctd\u003EItem\u003C/td\u003E\u003Ctd\u003EName, with the item&#039;s color. &quot;+(n) unscaled&quot; means some marks are on sheets with no scale.\u003C/td\u003E\u003C/tr\u003E\u003Ctr\u003E\u003Ctd\u003EQuantity\u003C/td\u003E\u003Ctd\u003EThe measured total in the item&#039;s unit (components: the formula result).\u003C/td\u003E\u003C/tr\u003E\u003Ctr\u003E\u003Ctd\u003EUnit\u003C/td\u003E\u003Ctd\u003ELF, m, SF, SY, m², EA, or the component&#039;s unit.\u003C/td\u003E\u003C/tr\u003E\u003Ctr\u003E\u003Ctd\u003EWaste %\u003C/td\u003E\u003Ctd\u003ETyped here or in the item editor.\u003C/td\u003E\u003C/tr\u003E\u003Ctr\u003E\u003Ctd\u003EWith waste\u003C/td\u003E\u003Ctd\u003EQuantity × (1 + waste).\u003C/td\u003E\u003C/tr\u003E\u003Ctr\u003E\u003Ctd\u003EMaterial/unit, Labor/unit\u003C/td\u003E\u003Ctd\u003ERates; you can type them here.\u003C/td\u003E\u003C/tr\u003E\u003Ctr\u003E\u003Ctd\u003EMaterial, Labor\u003C/td\u003E\u003Ctd\u003EWith waste × rate, rounded to the cent.\u003C/td\u003E\u003C/tr\u003E\u003Ctr\u003E\u003Ctd\u003ETotal\u003C/td\u003E\u003Ctd\u003EMaterial + labor.\u003C/td\u003E\u003C/tr\u003E\u003C/tbody\u003E\u003C/table\u003E\u003C/div\u003E\n\u003Cp\u003EThe last row, \u003Cstrong\u003EJob total\u003C/strong\u003E, adds the material, labor and total columns. The same total shows at the right of the table&#039;s header.\u003C/p\u003E\n\u003Cp\u003EType into a waste or rate cell and press \u003Ckbd class=\"hk\"\u003E\u003Cspan class=\"k-mac\" title=\"Return\"\u003EReturn\u003C/span\u003E\u003Cspan class=\"k-pc\"\u003EEnter\u003C/span\u003E\u003C/kbd\u003E or click away to apply it. A value TakeoffDesk cannot read is outlined in red and the status bar says why, for example &quot;Type an amount like 12.50.&quot;\u003C/p\u003E\n\u003Cp\u003EClick an item&#039;s row to highlight its marks on every sheet without moving the view (the same as clicking it under \u003Cspan class=\"hui\"\u003EItems\u003C/span\u003E).\u003C/p\u003E\n\u003Ch2 id=\"by-sheet\"\u003EBy sheet\u003C/h2\u003E\n\u003Cp\u003EChoose \u003Cspan class=\"hui\"\u003EBy sheet\u003C/span\u003E to see each item&#039;s quantity on each sheet, with the number of marks. Click a row to open that sheet with the item highlighted. Use it to check that every sheet was taken off, or to split quantities by floor or area of work.\u003C/p\u003E\n\u003Ch2 id=\"by-area\"\u003EBy area\u003C/h2\u003E\n\u003Cp\u003EWhen the takeoff has bid areas, \u003Cspan class=\"hui\"\u003EBy area\u003C/span\u003E lists each area&#039;s items and a subtotal. See \u003Ca href=\"/tutorials/takeoffcraft/bid-areas\" data-topic=\"takeoffcraft/bid-areas\"\u003EBid areas\u003C/a\u003E.\u003C/p\u003E\n\u003Ch2 id=\"the-incomplete-warning\"\u003EThe Incomplete warning\u003C/h2\u003E\n\u003Cp\u003EWhen something is left out of the totals, the header shows a warning, for example:\u003C/p\u003E\n\u003Cp\u003E&quot;Incomplete: 1 formula error, 6 marks on sheets with no scale (not in the totals)&quot;\u003C/p\u003E\n\u003Cul\u003E\u003Cli\u003E\u003Cstrong\u003EFormula errors\u003C/strong\u003E: an assembly component&#039;s formula cannot be worked out. Its row says &quot;Formula error: …&quot;. See \u003Ca href=\"/tutorials/takeoffcraft/assemblies#when-a-formula-is-wrong\" data-topic=\"takeoffcraft/assemblies\" data-hash=\"when-a-formula-is-wrong\"\u003EAssemblies and formulas\u003C/a\u003E.\u003C/li\u003E\u003Cli\u003E\u003Cstrong\u003EMarks on sheets with no scale\u003C/strong\u003E: give those sheets a scale. See \u003Ca href=\"/tutorials/takeoffcraft/set-the-scale#why-unscaled-sheets-are-not-counted-as-zero\" data-topic=\"takeoffcraft/set-the-scale\" data-hash=\"why-unscaled-sheets-are-not-counted-as-zero\"\u003ESet the scale\u003C/a\u003E.\u003C/li\u003E\u003C/ul\u003E\n\u003Cp\u003EThe same notes go into the exported spreadsheet, so an incomplete estimate never looks complete.\u003C/p\u003E\n\u003Ch2 id=\"highlight-an-item\"\u003EHighlight an item\u003C/h2\u003E\n\u003Cp\u003EClick an item under \u003Cspan class=\"hui\"\u003EItems\u003C/span\u003E or in the table. Its marks stay at full strength on every sheet and the rest fade. The sheets list shows &quot;(n) highlighted&quot; on each sheet with its marks. Click the item again to stop highlighting.\u003C/p\u003E\n\u003Ch2 id=\"item-totals-in-the-side-panel\"\u003EItem totals in the side panel\u003C/h2\u003E\n\u003Cp\u003EEach item in the \u003Cspan class=\"hui\"\u003EItems\u003C/span\u003E list shows its quantity too. The item editor&#039;s \u003Cstrong\u003EMeasured\u003C/strong\u003E block shows the values its formulas use: length, runs and wall area; area, perimeter and number of areas; or count.\u003C/p\u003E\n\u003Ch2 id=\"marks-on-pdfs-that-are-not-open\"\u003EMarks on PDFs that are not open\u003C/h2\u003E\n\u003Cp\u003EA takeoff can include marks on PDFs you have not opened this time. They still count in every total; the sheets list names those PDFs. See \u003Ca href=\"/tutorials/takeoffcraft/save-and-reopen\" data-topic=\"takeoffcraft/save-and-reopen\"\u003ESave and reopen a takeoff\u003C/a\u003E.\u003C/p\u003E\n\u003Ch2 id=\"more-room\"\u003EMore room\u003C/h2\u003E\n\u003Cp\u003EThe arrow button at the right of the \u003Cspan class=\"hui\"\u003EQuantities\u003C/span\u003E header hides the table so the sheet gets more room. Choose it again to bring the table back.\u003C/p\u003E","text":"The Quantities table at the bottom of the window is your live estimate. It changes the moment you draw, delete, rescale or edit a rate. Quantities are never stored; they are measured again from the marks every time, so they cannot drift out of date. By item Choose By item (the default). Each item has a row, and each of its assembly components a row under it. Column Meaning Item Name, with the item's color. \"+(n) unscaled\" means some marks are on sheets with no scale. Quantity The measured total in the item's unit (components: the formula result). Unit LF, m, SF, SY, m², EA, or the component's unit. Waste % Typed here or in the item editor. With waste Quantity × (1 + waste). Material/unit, Labor/unit Rates; you can type them here. Material, Labor With waste × rate, rounded to the cent. Total Material + labor. The last row, Job total, adds the material, labor and total columns. The same total shows at the right of the table's header. Type into a waste or rate cell and press Enter or click away to apply it. A value TakeoffDesk cannot read is outlined in red and the status bar says why, for example \"Type an amount like 12.50.\" Click an item's row to highlight its marks on every sheet without moving the view (the same as clicking it under Items). By sheet Choose By sheet to see each item's quantity on each sheet, with the number of marks. Click a row to open that sheet with the item highlighted. Use it to check that every sheet was taken off, or to split quantities by floor or area of work. By area When the takeoff has bid areas, By area lists each area's items and a subtotal. See Bid areas. The Incomplete warning When something is left out of the totals, the header shows a warning, for example: \"Incomplete: 1 formula error, 6 marks on sheets with no scale (not in the totals)\" Formula errors: an assembly component's formula cannot be worked out. Its row says \"Formula error: …\". See Assemblies and formulas. Marks on sheets with no scale: give those sheets a scale. See Set the scale. The same notes go into the exported spreadsheet, so an incomplete estimate never looks complete. Highlight an item Click an item under Items or in the table. Its marks stay at full strength on every sheet and the rest fade. The sheets list shows \"(n) highlighted\" on each sheet with its marks. Click the item again to stop highlighting. Item totals in the side panel Each item in the Items list shows its quantity too. The item editor's Measured block shows the values its formulas use: length, runs and wall area; area, perimeter and number of areas; or count. Marks on PDFs that are not open A takeoff can include marks on PDFs you have not opened this time. They still count in every total; the sheets list names those PDFs. See Save and reopen a takeoff. More room The arrow button at the right of the Quantities header hides the table so the sheet gets more room. Choose it again to bring the table back.","lang":"en"},{"slug":"markups","scope":"takeoffcraft","title":"Bilješke, oblaci i isticanja","summary":"Označite pitanja i izmjene na listovima bilješkama, revizijskim oblacima i isticanjima, pratite svaku kao otvorenu, odgovorenu ili zatvorenu te ih pošaljite u označenom PDF-u.","section":"tasks","order":95,"keywords":["markup","oznake","bilješka","komentar","pitanje","rfi","oblak","revizijski oblak","isticanje","status","otvoreno","odgovoreno","zatvoreno","pregled","popis oznaka"],"headings":[{"id":"dodajte-jedan","text":"Dodajte jedan","level":2},{"id":"status-i-ure-ivanje","text":"Status i uređivanje","level":2},{"id":"popis","text":"Popis","level":2},{"id":"podijelite-ih","text":"Podijelite ih","level":2}],"html":"\u003Cp\u003EMarkupi služe za ono što trebate zapamtiti ili pitati dok predmjerite: „potvrdite vrstu baze“, revizijski oblak oko promijenjenog zida, istaknuta bilješka na nacrtu. Oni stoje na listu sa statusom, popisani su na jednom mjestu i ispisuju se u označenom PDF-u. Nikad se ne broje: nema količine, nema troška.\u003C/p\u003E\n\u003Ch2 id=\"dodajte-jedan\"\u003EDodajte jedan\u003C/h2\u003E\n\u003Cp\u003EOtvorite \u003Cspan class=\"hui\"\u003EMarkup\u003C/span\u003E na traci iznad lista i odaberite:\u003C/p\u003E\n\u003Cdiv class=\"ht-wrap\"\u003E\u003Ctable class=\"ht\"\u003E\u003Cthead\u003E\u003Ctr\u003E\u003Cth scope=\"col\"\u003EMarkup\u003C/th\u003E\u003Cth scope=\"col\"\u003EKako\u003C/th\u003E\u003C/tr\u003E\u003C/thead\u003E\u003Ctbody\u003E\u003Ctr\u003E\u003Ctd\u003E\u003Cspan class=\"hui\"\u003EBilješka\u003C/span\u003E\u003C/td\u003E\u003Ctd\u003EKliknite gdje ide, upišite bilješku i odaberite \u003Cspan class=\"hui\"\u003EDodaj\u003C/span\u003E. Prikazuje se kao okrugla igla s prvim retkom uz nju.\u003C/td\u003E\u003C/tr\u003E\u003Ctr\u003E\u003Ctd\u003E\u003Cspan class=\"hui\"\u003EOblak\u003C/span\u003E\u003C/td\u003E\u003Ctd\u003EKliknite jedan kut, zatim suprotni, i upišite bilješku (ili ostavite praznu). Oko okvira ide nazubljeni revizijski oblak.\u003C/td\u003E\u003C/tr\u003E\u003Ctr\u003E\u003Ctd\u003E\u003Cspan class=\"hui\"\u003EIsticanje\u003C/span\u003E\u003C/td\u003E\u003Ctd\u003EKliknite dva kuta: prozirni žuti okvir, s bilješkom ako želite.\u003C/td\u003E\u003C/tr\u003E\u003C/tbody\u003E\u003C/table\u003E\u003C/div\u003E\n\u003Cp\u003E\u003Ckbd class=\"hk\"\u003E\u003Cspan class=\"k-mac\" title=\"Esc\"\u003EEsc\u003C/span\u003E\u003Cspan class=\"k-pc\"\u003EEsc\u003C/span\u003E\u003C/kbd\u003E nakon prvog kuta odustaje. Alat ostaje uključen za sljedeći; \u003Ckbd class=\"hk\"\u003E\u003Cspan class=\"k-mac\" title=\"V\"\u003EV\u003C/span\u003E\u003Cspan class=\"k-pc\"\u003EV\u003C/span\u003E\u003C/kbd\u003E vraća na \u003Cspan class=\"hui\"\u003EOdaberi\u003C/span\u003E.\u003C/p\u003E\n\u003Ch2 id=\"status-i-ure-ivanje\"\u003EStatus i uređivanje\u003C/h2\u003E\n\u003Cp\u003EKliknite markup alatom \u003Cspan class=\"hui\"\u003EOdaberi\u003C/span\u003E da ga odaberete. Desna ploča prikazuje \u003Cstrong\u003EMarkup\u003C/strong\u003E: njegovu vrstu i list, njegov \u003Cstrong\u003EStatus\u003C/strong\u003E — Otvoreno, Odgovoreno ili Zatvoreno — i njegov tekst, koji možete promijeniti. \u003Ckbd class=\"hk\"\u003E\u003Cspan class=\"k-mac\" title=\"fn Delete\"\u003Efn Delete\u003C/span\u003E\u003Cspan class=\"k-pc\"\u003EDelete\u003C/span\u003E\u003C/kbd\u003E (ili \u003Cspan class=\"hui\"\u003EIzbriši\u003C/span\u003E) ga uklanja; \u003Ckbd class=\"hk\"\u003E\u003Cspan class=\"k-mac\" title=\"Command Z\"\u003E⌘Z\u003C/span\u003E\u003Cspan class=\"k-pc\"\u003ECtrl+Z\u003C/span\u003E\u003C/kbd\u003E ga vraća.\u003C/p\u003E\n\u003Cp\u003EIgla bilješke je narančasta dok je otvorena, plava kad je odgovoreno i siva kad je zatvorena; zatvoreni oblak postaje siv.\u003C/p\u003E\n\u003Ch2 id=\"popis\"\u003EPopis\u003C/h2\u003E\n\u003Cp\u003E\u003Cstrong\u003EOznake\u003C/strong\u003E na desnoj ploči popisuju svaki markup predmjera sa statusom i kažu koliko je još otvorenih. Označite \u003Cstrong\u003ESamo otvoreno\u003C/strong\u003E da vidite što još treba riješiti. Kliknite redak da odete na njegov list i odaberete ga.\u003C/p\u003E\n\u003Ch2 id=\"podijelite-ih\"\u003EPodijelite ih\u003C/h2\u003E\n\u003Cul\u003E\u003Cli\u003E\u003Cspan class=\"hui\"\u003EOznačeni PDF\u003C/span\u003E crta ih na stranicama: isticanja, oblake i igle, svaki s okvirom koji daje status velikim slovima (OTVORENO, ODGOVORENO, ZATVORENO) i njegov tekst. Uključena je i stranica s markupima bez oznaka predmjera.\u003C/li\u003E\u003Cli\u003E\u003Cspan class=\"hui\"\u003EXLSX\u003C/span\u003E dodaje radni list \u003Cstrong\u003EOznake\u003C/strong\u003E: list, vrsta, status i tekst, po jedan redak za svaki.\u003C/li\u003E\u003Cli\u003ESpremljeni su u \u003Ccode\u003E.takeoff.json\u003C/code\u003E i u \u003Ca href=\"/tutorials/takeoffcraft/save-and-reopen#keep-the-takeoff-inside-the-pdf\" data-topic=\"takeoffcraft/save-and-reopen\" data-hash=\"keep-the-takeoff-inside-the-pdf\"\u003EPDF-u s predmjerom unutra\u003C/a\u003E.\u003C/li\u003E\u003C/ul\u003E","text":"Markupi služe za ono što trebate zapamtiti ili pitati dok predmjerite: „potvrdite vrstu baze“, revizijski oblak oko promijenjenog zida, istaknuta bilješka na nacrtu. Oni stoje na listu sa statusom, popisani su na jednom mjestu i ispisuju se u označenom PDF-u. Nikad se ne broje: nema količine, nema troška. Dodajte jedan Otvorite Markup na traci iznad lista i odaberite: Markup Kako Bilješka Kliknite gdje ide, upišite bilješku i odaberite Dodaj. Prikazuje se kao okrugla igla s prvim retkom uz nju. Oblak Kliknite jedan kut, zatim suprotni, i upišite bilješku (ili ostavite praznu). Oko okvira ide nazubljeni revizijski oblak. Isticanje Kliknite dva kuta: prozirni žuti okvir, s bilješkom ako želite. Esc nakon prvog kuta odustaje. Alat ostaje uključen za sljedeći; V vraća na Odaberi. Status i uređivanje Kliknite markup alatom Odaberi da ga odaberete. Desna ploča prikazuje Markup: njegovu vrstu i list, njegov Status — Otvoreno, Odgovoreno ili Zatvoreno — i njegov tekst, koji možete promijeniti. Delete (ili Izbriši) ga uklanja; Ctrl+Z ga vraća. Igla bilješke je narančasta dok je otvorena, plava kad je odgovoreno i siva kad je zatvorena; zatvoreni oblak postaje siv. Popis Oznake na desnoj ploči popisuju svaki markup predmjera sa statusom i kažu koliko je još otvorenih. Označite Samo otvoreno da vidite što još treba riješiti. Kliknite redak da odete na njegov list i odaberete ga. Podijelite ih Označeni PDF crta ih na stranicama: isticanja, oblake i igle, svaki s okvirom koji daje status velikim slovima (OTVORENO, ODGOVORENO, ZATVORENO) i njegov tekst. Uključena je i stranica s markupima bez oznaka predmjera. XLSX dodaje radni list Oznake: list, vrsta, status i tekst, po jedan redak za svaki. Spremljeni su u .takeoff.json i u PDF-u s predmjerom unutra.","lang":"hr"},{"slug":"check-in-3d","scope":"takeoffcraft","title":"Provjera izvedbe u 3D","summary":"Pogledajte zidove, ploče i brojanja otvorenog lista kako stoje na crtežu, kružite oko njih i kliknite jedno da odaberete njegovu oznaku.","section":"tasks","order":95,"keywords":["png","slika","fotografija","snimka zaslona","složi","etaže","razine","kota","glb","gltf","izvoz 3D","debljina zida","visina podnožja","otvor","gornja kota vrata","3d","tri d","provjera","prikaz","zidovi","visina zida","ploča","dubina","volumen","kruženje","model","odabir","izometrija","perspektiva"],"headings":[{"id":"otvaranje-3d-prikaza","text":"Otvaranje 3D prikaza","level":2},{"id":"to-vidite","text":"Što vidite","level":2},{"id":"gledanje-oko","text":"Gledanje oko","level":2},{"id":"zidovi-s-debljinom-podno-jem-i-otvorima","text":"Zidovi s debljinom, podnožjem i otvorima","level":2},{"id":"slaganje-eta-a","text":"Slaganje etaža","level":2},{"id":"spremanje-3d-prikaza-kao-slike","text":"Spremanje 3D prikaza kao slike","level":2},{"id":"spremanje-3d-prikaza-kao-modela","text":"Spremanje 3D prikaza kao modela","level":2},{"id":"odabir-oznake-iz-3d-prikaza","text":"Odabir oznake iz 3D prikaza","level":2}],"html":"\u003Cp\u003E3D prikaz je provjera, a ne drugi crtež: postavlja izvedbu lista na ekran, uspravno na sam list, pa se nedostajući zid, udvostručena ploča ili lutajuće brojanje vide na prvi pogled.\u003C/p\u003E\n\u003Cp\u003EPrije početka: list treba mjerilo (\u003Ca href=\"/tutorials/takeoffcraft/set-the-scale\" data-topic=\"takeoffcraft/set-the-scale\"\u003EPostavljanje mjerila\u003C/a\u003E). Visine i dubine trebaju prave stope, pa na listu bez mjerila \u003Cspan class=\"hui\"\u003E3D\u003C/span\u003E to kaže i ostaje na ravnom listu.\u003C/p\u003E\n\u003Ch2 id=\"otvaranje-3d-prikaza\"\u003EOtvaranje 3D prikaza\u003C/h2\u003E\n\u003Col\u003E\u003Cli\u003EPrikažite list koji želite provjeriti.\u003C/li\u003E\u003Cli\u003EOdaberite \u003Cspan class=\"hui\"\u003E3D\u003C/span\u003E na traci koja prikazuje naziv lista i mjerilo, ili pritisnite \u003Ckbd class=\"hk\"\u003E\u003Cspan class=\"k-mac\" title=\"3\"\u003E3\u003C/span\u003E\u003Cspan class=\"k-pc\"\u003E3\u003C/span\u003E\u003C/kbd\u003E. Prvi put 3D prikaz treba trenutak da se učita. List je nacrtan na tlu, a izvedba stoji na njemu u boji svake stavke.\u003C/li\u003E\u003Cli\u003EZa povratak odaberite \u003Cspan class=\"hui\"\u003E3D\u003C/span\u003E ponovno, \u003Cspan class=\"hui\"\u003ENatrag na list\u003C/span\u003E ili pritisnite \u003Ckbd class=\"hk\"\u003E\u003Cspan class=\"k-mac\" title=\"3\"\u003E3\u003C/span\u003E\u003Cspan class=\"k-pc\"\u003E3\u003C/span\u003E\u003C/kbd\u003E. Odabir alata za crtanje (Linearno, Površina, Brojanje i tako dalje) također vraća, jer se oznake crtaju na ravnom listu.\u003C/li\u003E\u003C/ol\u003E\n\u003Cp\u003EPrikazuje list na ekranu. Mijenjajte listove na popisu listova ili pomoću \u003Ckbd class=\"hk\"\u003E\u003Cspan class=\"k-mac\" title=\"fn ↓\"\u003Efn ↓\u003C/span\u003E\u003Cspan class=\"k-pc\"\u003EPage Down\u003C/span\u003E\u003C/kbd\u003E i \u003Ckbd class=\"hk\"\u003E\u003Cspan class=\"k-mac\" title=\"fn ↑\"\u003Efn ↑\u003C/span\u003E\u003Cspan class=\"k-pc\"\u003EPage Up\u003C/span\u003E\u003C/kbd\u003E, a 3D prikaz slijedi. Da vidite više etaža odjednom, složite ih (u nastavku).\u003C/p\u003E\n\u003Ch2 id=\"to-vidite\"\u003EŠto vidite\u003C/h2\u003E\n\u003Cdiv class=\"ht-wrap\"\u003E\u003Ctable class=\"ht\"\u003E\u003Cthead\u003E\u003Ctr\u003E\u003Cth scope=\"col\"\u003EOznaka\u003C/th\u003E\u003Cth scope=\"col\"\u003EU 3D\u003C/th\u003E\u003C/tr\u003E\u003C/thead\u003E\u003Ctbody\u003E\u003Ctr\u003E\u003Ctd\u003ELinearna dionica, stavka s visinom\u003C/td\u003E\u003Ctd\u003EZid te visine duž dionice. Zakrivljene dionice slijede krivulju.\u003C/td\u003E\u003C/tr\u003E\u003Ctr\u003E\u003Ctd\u003ELinearna dionica, stavka bez visine\u003C/td\u003E\u003Ctd\u003ELinija na listu. Dajte stavki visinu pod \u003Cstrong\u003EStavka\u003C/strong\u003E da je uspravite.\u003C/td\u003E\u003C/tr\u003E\u003Ctr\u003E\u003Ctd\u003EPovršina, stavka s dubinom\u003C/td\u003E\u003Ctd\u003EPloča te dubine, s otvorenim izrezima.\u003C/td\u003E\u003C/tr\u003E\u003Ctr\u003E\u003Ctd\u003EPovršina, stavka bez dubine\u003C/td\u003E\u003Ctd\u003ETanka 2&quot; ploča, da se i dalje vidi.\u003C/td\u003E\u003C/tr\u003E\u003Ctr\u003E\u003Ctd\u003EBrojanje\u003C/td\u003E\u003Ctd\u003EMali stup na svakoj točki brojanja.\u003C/td\u003E\u003C/tr\u003E\u003C/tbody\u003E\u003C/table\u003E\u003C/div\u003E\n\u003Cp\u003EVisina je polje \u003Cspan class=\"hui\"\u003EVisina\u003C/span\u003E linearne stavke, a dubina polje \u003Cspan class=\"hui\"\u003EDubina\u003C/span\u003E stavke površine, pod \u003Cstrong\u003EStavka\u003C/strong\u003E (vidi \u003Ca href=\"/tutorials/takeoffcraft/create-items\" data-topic=\"takeoffcraft/create-items\"\u003EStvaranje stavki izvedbe\u003C/a\u003E). Promijenite je i 3D prikaz se odmah ažurira. Bilješka ispod naziva lista govori što list sadrži, npr. „Ovaj list u 3D: 2 zida, 1 ploča, 3 brojanja“, te koliko dionica ili površina nema visinu ili dubinu. Klikovi prolaze kroz nju do prikaza.\u003C/p\u003E\n\u003Cp\u003EBrojke se u 3D ne mijenjaju: površina zida je njegova točna duljina puta visina, a volumen ploče je njezina neto površina (obris minus izrezi, krivulje točno) puta dubina. Krivulje se na ekranu crtaju samo kao kratki ravni dijelovi.\u003C/p\u003E\n\u003Ch2 id=\"gledanje-oko\"\u003EGledanje oko\u003C/h2\u003E\n\u003Cdiv class=\"ht-wrap\"\u003E\u003Ctable class=\"ht\"\u003E\u003Cthead\u003E\u003Ctr\u003E\u003Cth scope=\"col\"\u003ERadnja\u003C/th\u003E\u003Cth scope=\"col\"\u003EŠto čini\u003C/th\u003E\u003C/tr\u003E\u003C/thead\u003E\u003Ctbody\u003E\u003Ctr\u003E\u003Ctd\u003EPovlačenje, ili povlačenje srednjom tipkom\u003C/td\u003E\u003Ctd\u003EKruži oko izvedbe.\u003C/td\u003E\u003C/tr\u003E\u003Ctr\u003E\u003Ctd\u003E\u003Ckbd class=\"hk\"\u003E\u003Cspan class=\"k-mac\" title=\"Shift\"\u003E⇧\u003C/span\u003E\u003Cspan class=\"k-pc\"\u003EShift\u003C/span\u003E\u003C/kbd\u003E + povlačenje, ili povlačenje desnom tipkom\u003C/td\u003E\u003Ctd\u003EPomicanje prikaza.\u003C/td\u003E\u003C/tr\u003E\u003Ctr\u003E\u003Ctd\u003EKotačić miša\u003C/td\u003E\u003Ctd\u003EUvećava i smanjuje na pokazivaču.\u003C/td\u003E\u003C/tr\u003E\u003Ctr\u003E\u003Ctd\u003EPomicanje dvama prstima na trackpadu\u003C/td\u003E\u003Ctd\u003EKruženje (\u003Ckbd class=\"hk\"\u003E\u003Cspan class=\"k-mac\" title=\"Shift\"\u003E⇧\u003C/span\u003E\u003Cspan class=\"k-pc\"\u003EShift\u003C/span\u003E\u003C/kbd\u003E pomiče). Stiskanje zumira.\u003C/td\u003E\u003C/tr\u003E\u003Ctr\u003E\u003Ctd\u003E\u003Cspan class=\"hui\"\u003EIzo\u003C/span\u003E, \u003Cspan class=\"hui\"\u003EGore\u003C/span\u003E, \u003Cspan class=\"hui\"\u003ENaprijed\u003C/span\u003E, \u003Cspan class=\"hui\"\u003EStraga\u003C/span\u003E, \u003Cspan class=\"hui\"\u003ELijevo\u003C/span\u003E, \u003Cspan class=\"hui\"\u003EDesno\u003C/span\u003E, \u003Cspan class=\"hui\"\u003EDolje\u003C/span\u003E\u003C/td\u003E\u003Ctd\u003EStandardni pogledi, uokvireni na izvedbu. 3D prikaz se otvara u \u003Cspan class=\"hui\"\u003EIzo\u003C/span\u003E.\u003C/td\u003E\u003C/tr\u003E\u003Ctr\u003E\u003Ctd\u003E\u003Cspan class=\"hui\"\u003EPerspektiva\u003C/span\u003E\u003C/td\u003E\u003Ctd\u003EPerspektiva uključena ili isključena (paralelna kad je isključena).\u003C/td\u003E\u003C/tr\u003E\u003Ctr\u003E\u003Ctd\u003E\u003Cspan class=\"hui\"\u003EZumiraj opseg\u003C/span\u003E ili \u003Ckbd class=\"hk\"\u003E\u003Cspan class=\"k-mac\" title=\"F\"\u003EF\u003C/span\u003E\u003Cspan class=\"k-pc\"\u003EF\u003C/span\u003E\u003C/kbd\u003E\u003C/td\u003E\u003Ctd\u003ECijeli list.\u003C/td\u003E\u003C/tr\u003E\u003Ctr\u003E\u003Ctd\u003E\u003Cspan class=\"hui\"\u003EList\u003C/span\u003E\u003C/td\u003E\u003Ctd\u003EPrikazuje ili skriva crtež na tlu.\u003C/td\u003E\u003C/tr\u003E\u003Ctr\u003E\u003Ctd\u003EKocka pogleda, gore desno\u003C/td\u003E\u003Ctd\u003EKliknite stranu, rub ili kut za gledanje odande; povucite je za kruženje; povucite njen prsten kompasa za okretanje; gumb kućice vraća na \u003Cspan class=\"hui\"\u003EIzo\u003C/span\u003E.\u003C/td\u003E\u003C/tr\u003E\u003C/tbody\u003E\u003C/table\u003E\u003C/div\u003E\n\u003Cp\u003EKut prikazuje kocku pogleda, malu ikonu osi X, Y, Z ili ništa: odaberite u \u003Cspan class=\"hui\"\u003EPostavke\u003C/span\u003E, na kartici TakeoffDesk, pod \u003Cstrong\u003EPokazivač kuta\u003C/strong\u003E (\u003Ca href=\"/tutorials/takeoffcraft/settings\" data-topic=\"takeoffcraft/settings\"\u003EPostavke TakeoffDesk-a\u003C/a\u003E). Ravni list nema pokazivač kuta.\u003C/p\u003E\n\u003Cdiv class=\"hv\" data-v=\"input:touch\"\u003E\u003Cp class=\"hv-label\"\u003ETouch\u003C/p\u003E\n\u003Cp\u003EJedan prst kruži; dva prsta stišću za zumiranje i pomiču za pomicanje prikaza. Dodir odabire.\u003C/p\u003E\n\u003C/div\u003E\n\u003Ch2 id=\"zidovi-s-debljinom-podno-jem-i-otvorima\"\u003EZidovi s debljinom, podnožjem i otvorima\u003C/h2\u003E\n\u003Cp\u003ELinearna stavka s visinom stoji kao tanka traka. Da je vidite kao pravi zid, dajte stavki njezin oblik pod \u003Cstrong\u003EU 3D\u003C/strong\u003E u njezinim postavkama:\u003C/p\u003E\n\u003Cul\u003E\u003Cli\u003E\u003Cstrong\u003EDebljina zida\u003C/strong\u003E (8&quot;, 0.2 m): zid postaje tijelo, centrirano na liniji koju ste nacrtali, s kosim spojevima kutova.\u003C/li\u003E\u003Cli\u003E\u003Cstrong\u003EVisina podnožja\u003C/strong\u003E: zid počinje toliko iznad poda (podhodnik, gornji ormarići). Stavke površine također je imaju: strop na 9&#039;-0&quot;.\u003C/li\u003E\u003Cli\u003E\u003Cstrong\u003EGornja kota otvora\u003C/strong\u003E: oduzeti segment (vrata, \u003Ca href=\"/tutorials/takeoffcraft/measure-linear#deduct-a-part-of-a-run\" data-topic=\"takeoffcraft/measure-linear\" data-hash=\"deduct-a-part-of-a-run\"\u003EOduzimanje dijela dionice\u003C/a\u003E) zadržava zid iznad te visine, pa se vrata vide kao vrata. Bez nje oduzeti segment ostavlja prazninu do vrha.\u003C/li\u003E\u003C/ul\u003E\n\u003Cp\u003EOvo samo oblikuje 3D prikaz: količine (duljina, površina zida, troškovi) ostaju kakve jesu.\u003C/p\u003E\n\u003Ch2 id=\"slaganje-eta-a\"\u003ESlaganje etaža\u003C/h2\u003E\n\u003Col\u003E\u003Cli\u003EOtvorite PDF-ove svake etaže.\u003C/li\u003E\u003Cli\u003EU 3D prikazu odaberite \u003Cspan class=\"hui\"\u003ERazine…\u003C/span\u003E i upišite kotu svake etaže, poput \u003Ccode\u003E0\u003C/code\u003E za prizemlje i \u003Ccode\u003E12&#039;\u003C/code\u003E za sljedeću. Prazno izostavlja list.\u003C/li\u003E\u003Cli\u003EOdaberite \u003Cspan class=\"hui\"\u003ESloži\u003C/span\u003E. Svaki list s razinom prikazuje svoju izvedbu na svojoj visini; list na ekranu leži pod svojom etažom, a ostali su obrubljeni. Bilješka kaže koliko je etaža složeno.\u003C/li\u003E\u003C/ol\u003E\n\u003Cp\u003EListovi se poravnavaju prema svom mjestu na stranici, pa to radi za tlocrte iscrtane jednako (ista veličina i položaj lista). List s razinom, ali bez mjerila, izostavlja se, a bilješka to kaže. Odaberite \u003Cspan class=\"hui\"\u003ESloži\u003C/span\u003E ponovno za jedan list u isto vrijeme. Razine se spremaju s izvedbom.\u003C/p\u003E\n\u003Ch2 id=\"spremanje-3d-prikaza-kao-slike\"\u003ESpremanje 3D prikaza kao slike\u003C/h2\u003E\n\u003Cp\u003EOdaberite \u003Cspan class=\"hui\"\u003EPNG\u003C/span\u003E na 3D traci za sliku prikaza kakav je na ekranu (\u003Ccode\u003E… 3D.png\u003C/code\u003E). \u003Ckbd class=\"hk\"\u003E\u003Cspan class=\"k-mac\" title=\"Shift\"\u003E⇧\u003C/span\u003E\u003Cspan class=\"k-pc\"\u003EShift\u003C/span\u003E\u003C/kbd\u003E + klik na \u003Cspan class=\"hui\"\u003EPNG\u003C/span\u003E čini je dvostruko većom (\u003Ccode\u003E… 3D@2x.png\u003C/code\u003E), za ispis.\u003C/p\u003E\n\u003Ch2 id=\"spremanje-3d-prikaza-kao-modela\"\u003ESpremanje 3D prikaza kao modela\u003C/h2\u003E\n\u003Cp\u003EOdaberite \u003Cspan class=\"hui\"\u003EGLB\u003C/span\u003E na 3D traci. Dobivate datoteku \u003Ccode\u003E.glb\u003C/code\u003E (glTF, binarna) onoga što prikaz prikazuje, bilo etažu na ekranu ili sve složene etaže, koju druge 3D aplikacije mogu otvoriti: jedan objekt po oznaci, nazvan po njezinoj stavki, u boji stavke, u metrima s Y osi prema gore. List sam i obrisi u njoj nisu.\u003C/p\u003E\n\u003Ch2 id=\"odabir-oznake-iz-3d-prikaza\"\u003EOdabir oznake iz 3D prikaza\u003C/h2\u003E\n\u003Cp\u003EKliknite zid, ploču, tanku ploču ili stup. Njegova oznaka postaje odabrana oznaka, točno kao da ste je kliknuli na listu: prikazuje se pod \u003Cstrong\u003EOdabrana oznaka\u003C/strong\u003E, njezina stavka postaje trenutačna, a statusna traka daje njezinu duljinu i visinu, ili površinu, dubinu i kubne jardi. \u003Ckbd class=\"hk\"\u003E\u003Cspan class=\"k-mac\" title=\"Shift\"\u003E⇧\u003C/span\u003E\u003Cspan class=\"k-pc\"\u003EShift\u003C/span\u003E\u003C/kbd\u003E + klik dodaje oznake odabiru ili ih uklanja. \u003Ckbd class=\"hk\"\u003E\u003Cspan class=\"k-mac\" title=\"fn Delete\"\u003Efn Delete\u003C/span\u003E\u003Cspan class=\"k-pc\"\u003EDelete\u003C/span\u003E\u003C/kbd\u003E briše odabrane oznake, a \u003Ckbd class=\"hk\"\u003E\u003Cspan class=\"k-mac\" title=\"Command Z\"\u003E⌘Z\u003C/span\u003E\u003Cspan class=\"k-pc\"\u003ECtrl+Z\u003C/span\u003E\u003C/kbd\u003E ih vraća; \u003Ckbd class=\"hk\"\u003E\u003Cspan class=\"k-mac\" title=\"Esc\"\u003EEsc\u003C/span\u003E\u003Cspan class=\"k-pc\"\u003EEsc\u003C/span\u003E\u003C/kbd\u003E ne odabire ništa. Natrag na listu iste oznake ostaju odabrane.\u003C/p\u003E\n\u003Caside class=\"hc hc-tip\"\u003E\u003Cp class=\"hc-label\"\u003ETip\u003C/p\u003E\n\u003Cp\u003ECrtež prati temu: u Modelu list na tlu potamni kao i ravni prikaz.\u003C/p\u003E\n\u003C/aside\u003E","text":"3D prikaz je provjera, a ne drugi crtež: postavlja izvedbu lista na ekran, uspravno na sam list, pa se nedostajući zid, udvostručena ploča ili lutajuće brojanje vide na prvi pogled. Prije početka: list treba mjerilo (Postavljanje mjerila). Visine i dubine trebaju prave stope, pa na listu bez mjerila 3D to kaže i ostaje na ravnom listu. Otvaranje 3D prikaza Prikažite list koji želite provjeriti. Odaberite 3D na traci koja prikazuje naziv lista i mjerilo, ili pritisnite 3. Prvi put 3D prikaz treba trenutak da se učita. List je nacrtan na tlu, a izvedba stoji na njemu u boji svake stavke. Za povratak odaberite 3D ponovno, Natrag na list ili pritisnite 3. Odabir alata za crtanje (Linearno, Površina, Brojanje i tako dalje) također vraća, jer se oznake crtaju na ravnom listu. Prikazuje list na ekranu. Mijenjajte listove na popisu listova ili pomoću Page Down i Page Up, a 3D prikaz slijedi. Da vidite više etaža odjednom, složite ih (u nastavku). Što vidite Oznaka U 3D Linearna dionica, stavka s visinom Zid te visine duž dionice. Zakrivljene dionice slijede krivulju. Linearna dionica, stavka bez visine Linija na listu. Dajte stavki visinu pod Stavka da je uspravite. Površina, stavka s dubinom Ploča te dubine, s otvorenim izrezima. Površina, stavka bez dubine Tanka 2\" ploča, da se i dalje vidi. Brojanje Mali stup na svakoj točki brojanja. Visina je polje Visina linearne stavke, a dubina polje Dubina stavke površine, pod Stavka (vidi Stvaranje stavki izvedbe). Promijenite je i 3D prikaz se odmah ažurira. Bilješka ispod naziva lista govori što list sadrži, npr. „Ovaj list u 3D: 2 zida, 1 ploča, 3 brojanja“, te koliko dionica ili površina nema visinu ili dubinu. Klikovi prolaze kroz nju do prikaza. Brojke se u 3D ne mijenjaju: površina zida je njegova točna duljina puta visina, a volumen ploče je njezina neto površina (obris minus izrezi, krivulje točno) puta dubina. Krivulje se na ekranu crtaju samo kao kratki ravni dijelovi. Gledanje oko Radnja Što čini Povlačenje, ili povlačenje srednjom tipkom Kruži oko izvedbe. Shift + povlačenje, ili povlačenje desnom tipkom Pomicanje prikaza. Kotačić miša Uvećava i smanjuje na pokazivaču. Pomicanje dvama prstima na trackpadu Kruženje (Shift pomiče). Stiskanje zumira. Izo, Gore, Naprijed, Straga, Lijevo, Desno, Dolje Standardni pogledi, uokvireni na izvedbu. 3D prikaz se otvara u Izo. Perspektiva Perspektiva uključena ili isključena (paralelna kad je isključena). Zumiraj opseg ili F Cijeli list. List Prikazuje ili skriva crtež na tlu. Kocka pogleda, gore desno Kliknite stranu, rub ili kut za gledanje odande; povucite je za kruženje; povucite njen prsten kompasa za okretanje; gumb kućice vraća na Izo. Kut prikazuje kocku pogleda, malu ikonu osi X, Y, Z ili ništa: odaberite u Postavke, na kartici TakeoffDesk, pod Pokazivač kuta (Postavke TakeoffDesk-a). Ravni list nema pokazivač kuta. Jedan prst kruži; dva prsta stišću za zumiranje i pomiču za pomicanje prikaza. Dodir odabire. Zidovi s debljinom, podnožjem i otvorima Linearna stavka s visinom stoji kao tanka traka. Da je vidite kao pravi zid, dajte stavki njezin oblik pod U 3D u njezinim postavkama: Debljina zida (8\", 0.2 m): zid postaje tijelo, centrirano na liniji koju ste nacrtali, s kosim spojevima kutova. Visina podnožja: zid počinje toliko iznad poda (podhodnik, gornji ormarići). Stavke površine također je imaju: strop na 9'-0\". Gornja kota otvora: oduzeti segment (vrata, Oduzimanje dijela dionice) zadržava zid iznad te visine, pa se vrata vide kao vrata. Bez nje oduzeti segment ostavlja prazninu do vrha. Ovo samo oblikuje 3D prikaz: količine (duljina, površina zida, troškovi) ostaju kakve jesu. Slaganje etaža Otvorite PDF-ove svake etaže. U 3D prikazu odaberite Razine… i upišite kotu svake etaže, poput 0 za prizemlje i 12' za sljedeću. Prazno izostavlja list. Odaberite Složi. Svaki list s razinom prikazuje svoju izvedbu na svojoj visini; list na ekranu leži pod svojom etažom, a ostali su obrubljeni. Bilješka kaže koliko je etaža složeno. Listovi se poravnavaju prema svom mjestu na stranici, pa to radi za tlocrte iscrtane jednako (ista veličina i položaj lista). List s razinom, ali bez mjerila, izostavlja se, a bilješka to kaže. Odaberite Složi ponovno za jedan list u isto vrijeme. Razine se spremaju s izvedbom. Spremanje 3D prikaza kao slike Odaberite PNG na 3D traci za sliku prikaza kakav je na ekranu (… 3D.png). Shift + klik na PNG čini je dvostruko većom (… 3D@2x.png), za ispis. Spremanje 3D prikaza kao modela Odaberite GLB na 3D traci. Dobivate datoteku .glb (glTF, binarna) onoga što prikaz prikazuje, bilo etažu na ekranu ili sve složene etaže, koju druge 3D aplikacije mogu otvoriti: jedan objekt po oznaci, nazvan po njezinoj stavki, u boji stavke, u metrima s Y osi prema gore. List sam i obrisi u njoj nisu. Odabir oznake iz 3D prikaza Kliknite zid, ploču, tanku ploču ili stup. Njegova oznaka postaje odabrana oznaka, točno kao da ste je kliknuli na listu: prikazuje se pod Odabrana oznaka, njezina stavka postaje trenutačna, a statusna traka daje njezinu duljinu i visinu, ili površinu, dubinu i kubne jardi. Shift + klik dodaje oznake odabiru ili ih uklanja. Delete briše odabrane oznake, a Ctrl+Z ih vraća; Esc ne odabire ništa. Natrag na listu iste oznake ostaju odabrane. Crtež prati temu: u Modelu list na tlu potamni kao i ravni prikaz.","lang":"hr"},{"slug":"export-estimate","scope":"takeoffcraft","title":"Izvoz predračuna i označenog PDF-a","summary":"Preuzmite predračun kao XLSX radnu knjigu s aktivnim formulama ili kao CSV te kopije svojih PDF-ova s nacrtanim predmjerom.","section":"tasks","order":100,"keywords":["ponuda","sažetak ponude","izvoz","xlsx","proračunska tablica","radna knjiga","csv","označeni pdf","ispis predmjera","izvještaj","dijeljenje","slanje","legenda"],"headings":[{"id":"predra-un-kao-prora-unska-tablica-xlsx","text":"Predračun kao proračunska tablica (XLSX)","level":2},{"id":"predra-un-kao-csv","text":"Predračun kao CSV","level":2},{"id":"predra-un-u-google-sheets","text":"Predračun u Google Sheets","level":2},{"id":"nedostaju-e-cijene-i-potpisivanje","text":"Nedostajuće cijene i potpisivanje","level":2},{"id":"ozna-eni-pdf","text":"Označeni PDF","level":2},{"id":"nema-to-izvesti","text":"Nema što izvesti?","level":2},{"id":"spremite-i-predmjer","text":"Spremite i predmjer","level":2}],"html":"\u003Cp\u003EIzvozi su preuzimanja. Izrađuju se na vašem računalu iz predmjera i otvorenih PDF-ova; ništa se nigdje ne šalje.\u003C/p\u003E\n\u003Ch2 id=\"predra-un-kao-prora-unska-tablica-xlsx\"\u003EPredračun kao proračunska tablica (XLSX)\u003C/h2\u003E\n\u003Col\u003E\u003Cli\u003EOtvorite izbornik \u003Cspan class=\"hui\"\u003EIzvoz\u003C/span\u003E na alatnoj traci i odaberite \u003Cspan class=\"hui\"\u003EXLSX\u003C/span\u003E. Vaš preglednik preuzima \u003Ccode\u003E(name).xlsx\u003C/code\u003E. Statusna traka piše „Izvezeno (name).xlsx (predračun s aktivnim formulama, po listu, oznakama, mjerilima).“ i dodaje upozorenje kad je predračun nepotpun.\u003C/li\u003E\u003Cli\u003EOtvorite je u svom programu za proračunske tablice.\u003C/li\u003E\u003C/ol\u003E\n\u003Cp\u003ERadna knjiga ima četiri radna lista, a izvještaji dolje kad se primjenjuju:\u003C/p\u003E\n\u003Cdiv class=\"ht-wrap\"\u003E\u003Ctable class=\"ht\"\u003E\u003Cthead\u003E\u003Ctr\u003E\u003Cth scope=\"col\"\u003ERadni list\u003C/th\u003E\u003Cth scope=\"col\"\u003ESadržaj\u003C/th\u003E\u003C/tr\u003E\u003C/thead\u003E\u003Ctbody\u003E\u003Ctr\u003E\u003Ctd\u003EPredračun\u003C/td\u003E\u003Ctd\u003ERedak po stavci i po komponenti: količina, gubitak, količina s gubitkom, cijene, materijal, rad, ukupno, napomene. Ukupni zbroj posla na dnu.\u003C/td\u003E\u003C/tr\u003E\u003Ctr\u003E\u003Ctd\u003EPo listu\u003C/td\u003E\u003Ctd\u003EKoličina svake stavke na svakom listu, s brojem oznaka.\u003C/td\u003E\u003C/tr\u003E\u003Ctr\u003E\u003Ctd\u003EOznake\u003C/td\u003E\u003Ctd\u003ESvaka oznaka: list, stavka, vrsta, količina i pojedinosti (duljine dionica, bruto i izrezane površine, opseg).\u003C/td\u003E\u003C/tr\u003E\u003Ctr\u003E\u003Ctd\u003EMjerila\u003C/td\u003E\u003Ctd\u003ESvaki list koji ima mjerilo ili oznake: njegovo mjerilo, kako je postavljeno (predložak ili kalibrirano prema udaljenosti koju ste upisali) i stope po jedinici PDF-a.\u003C/td\u003E\u003C/tr\u003E\u003Ctr\u003E\u003Ctd\u003ESažetak predmjera\u003C/td\u003E\u003Ctd\u003EKoličina svake stavke, CSI broj, oznake i listovi, bez cijena.\u003C/td\u003E\u003C/tr\u003E\u003Ctr\u003E\u003Ctd\u003EPopis materijala\u003C/td\u003E\u003Ctd\u003ESvaki dio sklopa zbrojen kroz cijeli predmjer (isti dio koji koristi više stavki jednak je jednom retku), s gubitkom i troškom materijala te stavkama koje ga koriste.\u003C/td\u003E\u003C/tr\u003E\u003Ctr\u003E\u003Ctd\u003EZahtjev za ponudu\u003C/td\u003E\u003Ctd\u003EPopis materijala za slanje dobavljaču: količine s gubitkom, prazan stupac jediničnih cijena, a iznosi i ukupno se popunjavaju kako upisujete cijene.\u003C/td\u003E\u003C/tr\u003E\u003Ctr\u003E\u003Ctd\u003EPo odjeljku\u003C/td\u003E\u003Ctd\u003EMaterijal, rad i ukupno po CSI MasterFormat odjeljku, kad stavke imaju \u003Cspan class=\"hui\"\u003ECSI broj\u003C/span\u003E.\u003C/td\u003E\u003C/tr\u003E\u003C/tbody\u003E\u003C/table\u003E\u003C/div\u003E\n\u003Cp\u003EUz \u003Ca href=\"/tutorials/takeoffcraft/bid-summary\" data-topic=\"takeoffcraft/bid-summary\"\u003Esažetak ponude\u003C/a\u003E, i radni list Predračun završava svojim maržama (trošak rada, porez na promet, opći troškovi, dobit, jamstvo i ponuda) kao aktivnim formulama.\u003C/p\u003E\n\u003Cp\u003ERadni list Predračun zadržava \u003Cstrong\u003Eaktivne formule\u003C/strong\u003E: količinu s gubitkom, zaokružene iznose materijala i rada, ukupno svakog retka i ukupni zbroj posla. Proračunske tablice ponovno izračunavaju te vrijednosti, pa možete promijeniti cijenu ili gubitak u tablici i zbrojevi slijede. Brojke koje je izračunao TakeoffDesk također su pohranjene u ćelijama i podudaraju se do centa.\u003C/p\u003E\n\u003Cp\u003EStupac napomena navodi formulu svake komponente, greške u formulama, oznake na listovima bez mjerila, površinu zida i opseg. Kad je nešto izostavljeno, redak ukupnog zbroja piše „Nepotpuno: vidi napomene iznad“.\u003C/p\u003E\n\u003Cp\u003ERadna knjiga je provjerena u LibreOffice Calc, koji je ponovno izračunao iste zbrojeve. U Excelu još nije otvorena. Podatke po stupcima potražite u \u003Ca href=\"/tutorials/takeoffcraft/export-columns\" data-topic=\"takeoffcraft/export-columns\"\u003EStupci izvoza\u003C/a\u003E.\u003C/p\u003E\n\u003Ch2 id=\"predra-un-kao-csv\"\u003EPredračun kao CSV\u003C/h2\u003E\n\u003Cp\u003EOtvorite izbornik \u003Cspan class=\"hui\"\u003EIzvoz\u003C/span\u003E i odaberite \u003Cspan class=\"hui\"\u003ECSV\u003C/span\u003E. Dobit ćete \u003Ccode\u003E(name).csv\u003C/code\u003E: iste retke i stupce kao radni list Predračun, kao obične vrijednosti (bez formula), i ukupni zbroj posla. Koristite ga za lijepljenje u drugi sustav za predračunavanje ili računovodstvo.\u003C/p\u003E\n\u003Cp\u003ECSV sadrži samo predračun; za količine po listu i popis oznaka koristite XLSX. \u003Cspan class=\"hui\"\u003EPopis materijala\u003C/span\u003E u istom izborniku sprema sam popis materijala kao CSV, za naručivanje.\u003C/p\u003E\n\u003Ch2 id=\"predra-un-u-google-sheets\"\u003EPredračun u Google Sheets\u003C/h2\u003E\n\u003Cp\u003EIznad tablice \u003Cspan class=\"hui\"\u003EKoličine\u003C/span\u003E, \u003Cstrong\u003EKopiraj za Google Sheets\u003C/strong\u003E stavlja predračun u međuspremnik kao tekst odvojen tabulatorima, s istim redovima kao CSV. U Google Sheets kliknite ćeliju A1 i zalijepite. TakeoffDesk se ne prijavljuje u Google i tamo ništa ne šalje.\u003C/p\u003E\n\u003Ch2 id=\"nedostaju-e-cijene-i-potpisivanje\"\u003ENedostajuće cijene i potpisivanje\u003C/h2\u003E\n\u003Cp\u003EStavka s količinom i bez cijene u svojim napomenama piše \u003Cstrong\u003ENema cijene\u003C/strong\u003E, a izvoz ih broji pod ukupnim zbrojevima. Kad je predračun potpisan, izvoz navodi tko ga je potpisao, kada i za koji ukupni iznos. Vidi \u003Ca href=\"/tutorials/takeoffcraft/sign-off-the-estimate\" data-topic=\"takeoffcraft/sign-off-the-estimate\"\u003ENedostajuće cijene i potpisivanje predračuna\u003C/a\u003E.\u003C/p\u003E\n\u003Ch2 id=\"ozna-eni-pdf\"\u003EOznačeni PDF\u003C/h2\u003E\n\u003Col\u003E\u003Cli\u003EOtvorite PDF-ove čije oznake želite nacrtati.\u003C/li\u003E\u003Cli\u003EOtvorite izbornik \u003Cspan class=\"hui\"\u003EIzvoz\u003C/span\u003E i odaberite \u003Cspan class=\"hui\"\u003EOznačeni PDF\u003C/span\u003E. Prikazuje se „Pisanje označenog PDF-a…“, zatim vaš preglednik preuzima jednu datoteku po označenom PDF-u, nazvanu \u003Ccode\u003E(PDF name) (takeoff).pdf\u003C/code\u003E.\u003C/li\u003E\u003C/ol\u003E\n\u003Cp\u003EU kopiji:\u003C/p\u003E\n\u003Cul\u003E\u003Cli\u003Edionice su nacrtane kao linije u boji svoje stavke,\u003C/li\u003E\u003Cli\u003Epovršine su lagano ispunjene s punim obrubom, a izrezi ostavljeni otvoreni,\u003C/li\u003E\u003Cli\u003Ebrojanja su točkice,\u003C/li\u003E\u003Cli\u003Esvaka stranica s oznakama dobiva malu legendu u donjem lijevom kutu: boju, naziv i količinu svake stavke na toj stranici.\u003C/li\u003E\u003C/ul\u003E\n\u003Cp\u003EIzvorni PDF-ovi se ne mijenjaju.\u003C/p\u003E\n\u003Cp\u003ENapomene:\u003C/p\u003E\n\u003Cul\u003E\u003Cli\u003EPišu se samo PDF-ovi koji su otvoreni. Oznake na PDF-ovima koji nisu otvoreni ostaju u zbrojevima, ali se ne crtaju; prvo otvorite te PDF-ove.\u003C/li\u003E\u003Cli\u003ENazivi u legendi koriste standardni PDF font. Slova koja ne može prikazati ispisuju se kao „?“.\u003C/li\u003E\u003Cli\u003EŠifriran PDF ne može se kopirati s oznakama: „Ovaj PDF je zaštićen lozinkom ili šifriran, pa označena kopija ne može biti napisana. Sam predmjer je u redu; izvezite umjesto toga proračunsku tablicu.“\u003C/li\u003E\u003Cli\u003EPrvi \u003Cspan class=\"hui\"\u003EOznačeni PDF\u003C/span\u003E u kartici učitava pisač PDF-a. Izvan mreže on je dostupan samo ako traka aplikacije prikazuje \u003Cspan class=\"hui\"\u003ESpremno za offline\u003C/span\u003E; vidi \u003Ca href=\"/tutorials/basics/offline\" data-topic=\"basics/offline\"\u003ERad izvan mreže\u003C/a\u003E.\u003C/li\u003E\u003C/ul\u003E\n\u003Cdiv class=\"hv\" data-v=\"browser:chromium\"\u003E\u003Cp class=\"hv-label\"\u003EChrome or Edge\u003C/p\u003E\n\u003Cp\u003EUz više označenih PDF-ova Chrome i Edge mogu jednom pitati smije li ova stranica preuzeti više datoteka. Odaberite Dopusti, inače dobijete samo prvu datoteku.\u003C/p\u003E\n\u003C/div\u003E\n\u003Ch2 id=\"nema-to-izvesti\"\u003ENema što izvesti?\u003C/h2\u003E\n\u003Cul\u003E\u003Cli\u003E\u003Cspan class=\"hui\"\u003EXLSX\u003C/span\u003E i \u003Cspan class=\"hui\"\u003ECSV\u003C/span\u003E trebaju barem jednu stavku: „Još nema što izvesti: napravite stavku i izmjerite je.“\u003C/li\u003E\u003Cli\u003E\u003Cspan class=\"hui\"\u003EOznačeni PDF\u003C/span\u003E treba oznake na otvorenom PDF-u: „Još nema oznaka na otvorenim PDF-ovima.“\u003C/li\u003E\u003C/ul\u003E\n\u003Ch2 id=\"spremite-i-predmjer\"\u003ESpremite i predmjer\u003C/h2\u003E\n\u003Cp\u003EIzvoz je izvještaj. Da kasnije nastavite raditi na predmjeru, odaberite i \u003Cspan class=\"hui\"\u003ESpremi predmjer\u003C/span\u003E: vidi \u003Ca href=\"/tutorials/takeoffcraft/save-and-reopen\" data-topic=\"takeoffcraft/save-and-reopen\"\u003ESpremanje i ponovno otvaranje predmjera\u003C/a\u003E.\u003C/p\u003E\n\u003Cp\u003EZa dodavanje općih troškova, dobiti, poreza i jamstva te slanje ponude vidi \u003Ca href=\"/tutorials/takeoffcraft/bid-summary\" data-topic=\"takeoffcraft/bid-summary\"\u003ESažetak ponude i ponuda\u003C/a\u003E.\u003C/p\u003E","text":"Izvozi su preuzimanja. Izrađuju se na vašem računalu iz predmjera i otvorenih PDF-ova; ništa se nigdje ne šalje. Predračun kao proračunska tablica (XLSX) Otvorite izbornik Izvoz na alatnoj traci i odaberite XLSX. Vaš preglednik preuzima (name).xlsx. Statusna traka piše „Izvezeno (name).xlsx (predračun s aktivnim formulama, po listu, oznakama, mjerilima).“ i dodaje upozorenje kad je predračun nepotpun. Otvorite je u svom programu za proračunske tablice. Radna knjiga ima četiri radna lista, a izvještaji dolje kad se primjenjuju: Radni list Sadržaj Predračun Redak po stavci i po komponenti: količina, gubitak, količina s gubitkom, cijene, materijal, rad, ukupno, napomene. Ukupni zbroj posla na dnu. Po listu Količina svake stavke na svakom listu, s brojem oznaka. Oznake Svaka oznaka: list, stavka, vrsta, količina i pojedinosti (duljine dionica, bruto i izrezane površine, opseg). Mjerila Svaki list koji ima mjerilo ili oznake: njegovo mjerilo, kako je postavljeno (predložak ili kalibrirano prema udaljenosti koju ste upisali) i stope po jedinici PDF-a. Sažetak predmjera Količina svake stavke, CSI broj, oznake i listovi, bez cijena. Popis materijala Svaki dio sklopa zbrojen kroz cijeli predmjer (isti dio koji koristi više stavki jednak je jednom retku), s gubitkom i troškom materijala te stavkama koje ga koriste. Zahtjev za ponudu Popis materijala za slanje dobavljaču: količine s gubitkom, prazan stupac jediničnih cijena, a iznosi i ukupno se popunjavaju kako upisujete cijene. Po odjeljku Materijal, rad i ukupno po CSI MasterFormat odjeljku, kad stavke imaju CSI broj. Uz sažetak ponude, i radni list Predračun završava svojim maržama (trošak rada, porez na promet, opći troškovi, dobit, jamstvo i ponuda) kao aktivnim formulama. Radni list Predračun zadržava aktivne formule: količinu s gubitkom, zaokružene iznose materijala i rada, ukupno svakog retka i ukupni zbroj posla. Proračunske tablice ponovno izračunavaju te vrijednosti, pa možete promijeniti cijenu ili gubitak u tablici i zbrojevi slijede. Brojke koje je izračunao TakeoffDesk također su pohranjene u ćelijama i podudaraju se do centa. Stupac napomena navodi formulu svake komponente, greške u formulama, oznake na listovima bez mjerila, površinu zida i opseg. Kad je nešto izostavljeno, redak ukupnog zbroja piše „Nepotpuno: vidi napomene iznad“. Radna knjiga je provjerena u LibreOffice Calc, koji je ponovno izračunao iste zbrojeve. U Excelu još nije otvorena. Podatke po stupcima potražite u Stupci izvoza. Predračun kao CSV Otvorite izbornik Izvoz i odaberite CSV. Dobit ćete (name).csv: iste retke i stupce kao radni list Predračun, kao obične vrijednosti (bez formula), i ukupni zbroj posla. Koristite ga za lijepljenje u drugi sustav za predračunavanje ili računovodstvo. CSV sadrži samo predračun; za količine po listu i popis oznaka koristite XLSX. Popis materijala u istom izborniku sprema sam popis materijala kao CSV, za naručivanje. Predračun u Google Sheets Iznad tablice Količine, Kopiraj za Google Sheets stavlja predračun u međuspremnik kao tekst odvojen tabulatorima, s istim redovima kao CSV. U Google Sheets kliknite ćeliju A1 i zalijepite. TakeoffDesk se ne prijavljuje u Google i tamo ništa ne šalje. Nedostajuće cijene i potpisivanje Stavka s količinom i bez cijene u svojim napomenama piše Nema cijene, a izvoz ih broji pod ukupnim zbrojevima. Kad je predračun potpisan, izvoz navodi tko ga je potpisao, kada i za koji ukupni iznos. Vidi Nedostajuće cijene i potpisivanje predračuna. Označeni PDF Otvorite PDF-ove čije oznake želite nacrtati. Otvorite izbornik Izvoz i odaberite Označeni PDF. Prikazuje se „Pisanje označenog PDF-a…“, zatim vaš preglednik preuzima jednu datoteku po označenom PDF-u, nazvanu (PDF name) (takeoff).pdf. U kopiji: dionice su nacrtane kao linije u boji svoje stavke, površine su lagano ispunjene s punim obrubom, a izrezi ostavljeni otvoreni, brojanja su točkice, svaka stranica s oznakama dobiva malu legendu u donjem lijevom kutu: boju, naziv i količinu svake stavke na toj stranici. Izvorni PDF-ovi se ne mijenjaju. Napomene: Pišu se samo PDF-ovi koji su otvoreni. Oznake na PDF-ovima koji nisu otvoreni ostaju u zbrojevima, ali se ne crtaju; prvo otvorite te PDF-ove. Nazivi u legendi koriste standardni PDF font. Slova koja ne može prikazati ispisuju se kao „?“. Šifriran PDF ne može se kopirati s oznakama: „Ovaj PDF je zaštićen lozinkom ili šifriran, pa označena kopija ne može biti napisana. Sam predmjer je u redu; izvezite umjesto toga proračunsku tablicu.“ Prvi Označeni PDF u kartici učitava pisač PDF-a. Izvan mreže on je dostupan samo ako traka aplikacije prikazuje Spremno za offline; vidi Rad izvan mreže. Uz više označenih PDF-ova Chrome i Edge mogu jednom pitati smije li ova stranica preuzeti više datoteka. Odaberite Dopusti, inače dobijete samo prvu datoteku. Nema što izvesti? XLSX i CSV trebaju barem jednu stavku: „Još nema što izvesti: napravite stavku i izmjerite je.“ Označeni PDF treba oznake na otvorenom PDF-u: „Još nema oznaka na otvorenim PDF-ovima.“ Spremite i predmjer Izvoz je izvještaj. Da kasnije nastavite raditi na predmjeru, odaberite i Spremi predmjer: vidi Spremanje i ponovno otvaranje predmjera. Za dodavanje općih troškova, dobiti, poreza i jamstva te slanje ponude vidi Sažetak ponude i ponuda.","lang":"hr"},{"slug":"bid-summary","scope":"takeoffcraft","title":"Sažetak ponude i prijedlog","summary":"Dodajte dodatne troškove rada, porez na promet, režijske troškove, dobit i jamstvo procjeni, napišite što je uključeno i isključeno te preuzmite PDF prijedloga za slanje.","section":"tasks","order":101,"keywords":["ponuda","dodatni troškovi rada","troškovi rada","plaće","prijedlog","ponuda","režijski troškovi","dobit","markup","marža","porez na promet","jamstvo","uključeno","isključeno","uvjeti","potpis","naručitelj","cijena"],"headings":[{"id":"markupi","text":"Markupi","level":2},{"id":"prijedlog","text":"Prijedlog","level":2},{"id":"u-izvozima","text":"U izvozima","level":2}],"html":"\u003Cp\u003EProcjena određuje što ste izmjerili. \u003Cstrong\u003ESažetak ponude\u003C/strong\u003E pretvara je u cijenu: dodaje porez na promet, režijske troškove, dobit i jamstvo te izrađuje \u003Cstrong\u003EPDF prijedloga\u003C/strong\u003E s vašim uključenim i isključenim stavkama.\u003C/p\u003E\n\u003Cp\u003EOtvorite ga iz \u003Cspan class=\"hui\"\u003EIzvoz\u003C/span\u003E › \u003Cspan class=\"hui\"\u003ESažetak ponude i prijedlog…\u003C/span\u003E. Sve u njemu sprema se s izvedbom, a svaka promjena se može poništiti.\u003C/p\u003E\n\u003Ch2 id=\"markupi\"\u003EMarkupi\u003C/h2\u003E\n\u003Cp\u003EUpišite postotak u bilo kojem od pet (ostale ostavite na 0). Izračunavaju se ovim redoslijedom, svaki na onome što je iznad:\u003C/p\u003E\n\u003Cdiv class=\"ht-wrap\"\u003E\u003Ctable class=\"ht\"\u003E\u003Cthead\u003E\u003Ctr\u003E\u003Cth scope=\"col\"\u003ERedak\u003C/th\u003E\u003Cth scope=\"col\"\u003EIzračunava se kao\u003C/th\u003E\u003C/tr\u003E\u003C/thead\u003E\u003Ctbody\u003E\u003Ctr\u003E\u003Ctd\u003EMaterijal, Rad\u003C/td\u003E\u003Ctd\u003EUkupni iznosi procjene (osnovna ponuda kada izvedba ima \u003Ca href=\"/tutorials/takeoffcraft/bid-areas#alternates-base-bid-plus-adds-and-deducts\" data-topic=\"takeoffcraft/bid-areas\" data-hash=\"alternates-base-bid-plus-adds-and-deducts\"\u003Ealternative\u003C/a\u003E).\u003C/td\u003E\u003C/tr\u003E\u003Ctr\u003E\u003Ctd\u003EDodatni troškovi rada\u003C/td\u003E\u003Ctd\u003EPostotak × rad: porezi na plaće, osiguranje i beneficije na plaće vaših ekipa.\u003C/td\u003E\u003C/tr\u003E\u003Ctr\u003E\u003Ctd\u003E\u003Cstrong\u003ETrošak\u003C/strong\u003E\u003C/td\u003E\u003Ctd\u003EMaterijal + rad + dodatni troškovi rada.\u003C/td\u003E\u003C/tr\u003E\u003Ctr\u003E\u003Ctd\u003EPorez na promet na materijal\u003C/td\u003E\u003Ctd\u003EPostotak poreza × materijal.\u003C/td\u003E\u003C/tr\u003E\u003Ctr\u003E\u003Ctd\u003ERežijski troškovi\u003C/td\u003E\u003Ctd\u003EPostotak × (trošak + porez).\u003C/td\u003E\u003C/tr\u003E\u003Ctr\u003E\u003Ctd\u003EDobit\u003C/td\u003E\u003Ctd\u003EPostotak × (trošak + porez + režijski troškovi).\u003C/td\u003E\u003C/tr\u003E\u003Ctr\u003E\u003Ctd\u003EJamstvo\u003C/td\u003E\u003Ctd\u003EPostotak × sve iznad.\u003C/td\u003E\u003C/tr\u003E\u003Ctr\u003E\u003Ctd\u003E\u003Cstrong\u003EPonuda\u003C/strong\u003E\u003C/td\u003E\u003Ctd\u003EZbroj redaka.\u003C/td\u003E\u003C/tr\u003E\u003C/tbody\u003E\u003C/table\u003E\u003C/div\u003E\n\u003Cp\u003ESvaki redak zaokružuje se na cent. Radna knjiga prikazuje iste retke ispod ukupnog iznosa radnog lista Procjena, s živim formulama. Sažetak se ažurira dok tipkate: \u003Ckbd class=\"hk\"\u003E\u003Cspan class=\"k-mac\" title=\"Return\"\u003EReturn\u003C/span\u003E\u003Cspan class=\"k-pc\"\u003EEnter\u003C/span\u003E\u003C/kbd\u003E prihvaća postotak. Svaka alternativa prikazuje se s istim markupima na vlastitom trošku, pa vlasnik vidi što ona stvarno mijenja.\u003C/p\u003E\n\u003Ch2 id=\"prijedlog\"\u003EPrijedlog\u003C/h2\u003E\n\u003Cp\u003EIspunite što prijedlog treba reći:\u003C/p\u003E\n\u003Cul\u003E\u003Cli\u003E\u003Cstrong\u003EProjekt\u003C/strong\u003E (naziv izvedbe kada je prazno), \u003Cstrong\u003EZa\u003C/strong\u003E (naručitelj) i \u003Cstrong\u003EOd\u003C/strong\u003E (vaša tvrtka).\u003C/li\u003E\u003Cli\u003E\u003Cstrong\u003EUključeno\u003C/strong\u003E i \u003Cstrong\u003EIsključeno\u003C/strong\u003E: jedno po retku; vodeća crtica ili oznaka s točkom je u redu.\u003C/li\u003E\u003Cli\u003E\u003Cstrong\u003EUvjeti\u003C/strong\u003E: slobodan tekst, npr. „Vrijedi 30 dana.“\u003C/li\u003E\u003Cli\u003E\u003Cstrong\u003EPopiši stavke i količine\u003C/strong\u003E: opseg, stavku po stavku, s količinama i bez cijena. Odznačite za prijedlog paušalne cijene.\u003C/li\u003E\u003C/ul\u003E\n\u003Cp\u003EOdaberite \u003Cspan class=\"hui\"\u003EPDF prijedloga\u003C/span\u003E. PDF (\u003Ccode\u003E&lt;izvedba&gt; - prijedlog.pdf\u003C/code\u003E) ima datum, blok cijene sa svakim markupom i ponudom, alternative, opseg, uključeno i isključeno, uvjete te crte za potpis i datum. Ako neke količine nisu mogle biti izmjerene (list bez mjerila), to se navodi ispod cijene.\u003C/p\u003E\n\u003Ch2 id=\"u-izvozima\"\u003EU izvozima\u003C/h2\u003E\n\u003Cp\u003EKada izvedba ima sažetak ponude, CSV završava njime, a radna knjiga dobiva radni list \u003Cstrong\u003ESažetak ponude\u003C/strong\u003E, sa svakim retkom, njegovim postotkom i iznosom. Vidi \u003Ca href=\"/tutorials/takeoffcraft/export-estimate\" data-topic=\"takeoffcraft/export-estimate\"\u003EIzvoz procjene\u003C/a\u003E.\u003C/p\u003E","text":"Procjena određuje što ste izmjerili. Sažetak ponude pretvara je u cijenu: dodaje porez na promet, režijske troškove, dobit i jamstvo te izrađuje PDF prijedloga s vašim uključenim i isključenim stavkama. Otvorite ga iz Izvoz › Sažetak ponude i prijedlog…. Sve u njemu sprema se s izvedbom, a svaka promjena se može poništiti. Markupi Upišite postotak u bilo kojem od pet (ostale ostavite na 0). Izračunavaju se ovim redoslijedom, svaki na onome što je iznad: Redak Izračunava se kao Materijal, Rad Ukupni iznosi procjene (osnovna ponuda kada izvedba ima alternative). Dodatni troškovi rada Postotak × rad: porezi na plaće, osiguranje i beneficije na plaće vaših ekipa. Trošak Materijal + rad + dodatni troškovi rada. Porez na promet na materijal Postotak poreza × materijal. Režijski troškovi Postotak × (trošak + porez). Dobit Postotak × (trošak + porez + režijski troškovi). Jamstvo Postotak × sve iznad. Ponuda Zbroj redaka. Svaki redak zaokružuje se na cent. Radna knjiga prikazuje iste retke ispod ukupnog iznosa radnog lista Procjena, s živim formulama. Sažetak se ažurira dok tipkate: Enter prihvaća postotak. Svaka alternativa prikazuje se s istim markupima na vlastitom trošku, pa vlasnik vidi što ona stvarno mijenja. Prijedlog Ispunite što prijedlog treba reći: Projekt (naziv izvedbe kada je prazno), Za (naručitelj) i Od (vaša tvrtka). Uključeno i Isključeno: jedno po retku; vodeća crtica ili oznaka s točkom je u redu. Uvjeti: slobodan tekst, npr. „Vrijedi 30 dana.“ Popiši stavke i količine: opseg, stavku po stavku, s količinama i bez cijena. Odznačite za prijedlog paušalne cijene. Odaberite PDF prijedloga. PDF (\u003Cizvedba\u003E - prijedlog.pdf) ima datum, blok cijene sa svakim markupom i ponudom, alternative, opseg, uključeno i isključeno, uvjete te crte za potpis i datum. Ako neke količine nisu mogle biti izmjerene (list bez mjerila), to se navodi ispod cijene. U izvozima Kada izvedba ima sažetak ponude, CSV završava njime, a radna knjiga dobiva radni list Sažetak ponude, sa svakim retkom, njegovim postotkom i iznosom. Vidi Izvoz procjene.","lang":"hr"},{"slug":"bid-leveling","scope":"takeoffcraft","title":"Bid packages and bid leveling","summary":"Split the estimate into packages by trade, send each package's scope to subcontractors, compare the bids that come back on the same scope, and use the chosen bid as the package's price.","section":"tasks","order":102,"keywords":["bid leveling","leveling","bid package","subcontractor","sub bid","scope","plug","trade","csi division","compare bids","low bid","bid tab","bidder","award","chosen bid","use a bid","subcontract price"],"headings":[{"id":"packages","text":"Packages","level":2},{"id":"enter-the-bids","text":"Enter the bids","level":2},{"id":"how-the-bids-are-leveled","text":"How the bids are leveled","level":2},{"id":"use-a-bid-as-the-package-s-price","text":"Use a bid as the package's price","level":2}],"html":"\u003Cp\u003EA general contractor sends each trade&#039;s scope to subcontractors and compares what comes back. TakeoffDesk does both from the takeoff: open \u003Cspan class=\"hui\"\u003EExport\u003C/span\u003E › \u003Cspan class=\"hui\"\u003EBid packages and leveling…\u003C/span\u003E.\u003C/p\u003E\n\u003Ch2 id=\"packages\"\u003EPackages\u003C/h2\u003E\n\u003Cp\u003EThere is one package for each CSI division your items use (the first two digits of an item&#039;s \u003Cspan class=\"hui\"\u003ECSI number\u003C/span\u003E, see \u003Ca href=\"/tutorials/takeoffcraft/create-items\" data-topic=\"takeoffcraft/create-items\"\u003ECreate takeoff items\u003C/a\u003E). Items without a number make a package of their own. Each package shows its items, how many sheets their marks are on, and our own cost of it (material and labor before markups, from the base bid).\u003C/p\u003E\n\u003Cp\u003EChoose \u003Cspan class=\"hui\"\u003EScope CSV\u003C/span\u003E to download what to send a subcontractor: each item with its CSI number, quantity, unit and the sheets it is on. It has no prices. For material suppliers, the workbook&#039;s quote request has the parts list (see \u003Ca href=\"/tutorials/takeoffcraft/export-estimate\" data-topic=\"takeoffcraft/export-estimate\"\u003EExport the estimate\u003C/a\u003E).\u003C/p\u003E\n\u003Ch2 id=\"enter-the-bids\"\u003EEnter the bids\u003C/h2\u003E\n\u003Col\u003E\u003Cli\u003EIn the empty row under the package, type the bidder&#039;s name and the amount of the bid, then choose \u003Cspan class=\"hui\"\u003EAdd the bid\u003C/span\u003E.\u003C/li\u003E\u003Cli\u003EIf a bid leaves part of the scope out, open its \u003Cspan class=\"hui\"\u003ELeft out\u003C/span\u003E list and tick those items.\u003C/li\u003E\u003Cli\u003ETo correct a name or an amount, type over it in the table; the × button removes a bid.\u003C/li\u003E\u003C/ol\u003E\n\u003Cp\u003EEach change is one step that \u003Ckbd class=\"hk\"\u003E\u003Cspan class=\"k-mac\" title=\"Command Z\"\u003E⌘Z\u003C/span\u003E\u003Cspan class=\"k-pc\"\u003ECtrl+Z\u003C/span\u003E\u003C/kbd\u003E takes back, and the bids are saved with the takeoff.\u003C/p\u003E\n\u003Ch2 id=\"how-the-bids-are-leveled\"\u003EHow the bids are leveled\u003C/h2\u003E\n\u003Cp\u003EBids rarely cover the same scope. Leveling fills each left-out item with a \u003Cstrong\u003Eplug\u003C/strong\u003E at our own cost of it, so every bid is compared on the whole package:\u003C/p\u003E\n\u003Cp\u003E\u003Cstrong\u003ELeveled = the bid + the plugs\u003C/strong\u003E\u003C/p\u003E\n\u003Cp\u003EThe lowest leveled bid is marked \u003Cstrong\u003ELow\u003C/strong\u003E; on a tie, the one entered first. \u003Cstrong\u003EAgainst our cost\u003C/strong\u003E is the leveled bid minus our own cost of the package: negative means under it. A bid that looks lowest can lose once its missing scope is counted.\u003C/p\u003E\n\u003Cp\u003EThe workbook gets a \u003Cstrong\u003EBid leveling\u003C/strong\u003E sheet with every package that has bids: our estimate, each bid, its plugs, the leveled total and the difference, as live formulas, and what each bid left out.\u003C/p\u003E\n\u003Ch2 id=\"use-a-bid-as-the-package-s-price\"\u003EUse a bid as the package&#039;s price\u003C/h2\u003E\n\u003Cp\u003EChoose \u003Cspan class=\"hui\"\u003EUse\u003C/span\u003E on a bid and it becomes the price of the whole package in your estimate: the package&#039;s own pricing (the items, their second conditions and assembly parts) drops out of the job total, the items stay as quantities with your own rates for reference, and one line, \u003Cstrong\u003EChosen bid\u003C/strong\u003E, carries the bid&#039;s amount. Items the bid leaves out stay at your own cost, which is what leveling already counted as the plug. Choose another bid, or choose the same one again to take it back; each is one step that \u003Ckbd class=\"hk\"\u003E\u003Cspan class=\"k-mac\" title=\"Command Z\"\u003E⌘Z\u003C/span\u003E\u003Cspan class=\"k-pc\"\u003ECtrl+Z\u003C/span\u003E\u003C/kbd\u003E undoes.\u003C/p\u003E\n\u003Cp\u003EIn the bid summary the sub bids are one line inside the cost: overhead, profit and bond are added on top of them like any other cost; sales tax (on material only) and labor burden (on labor) are not. The workbook&#039;s Estimate sheet carries the chosen bid as its own row and the markups block adds it, with live formulas. The material list leaves out an awarded package&#039;s material, because the subcontractor supplies it.\u003C/p\u003E\n\u003Cp\u003EA package inside an alternate&#039;s bid area is not repriced: alternates and bid-area subtotals still use your own prices.\u003C/p\u003E","text":"A general contractor sends each trade's scope to subcontractors and compares what comes back. TakeoffDesk does both from the takeoff: open Export › Bid packages and leveling…. Packages There is one package for each CSI division your items use (the first two digits of an item's CSI number, see Create takeoff items). Items without a number make a package of their own. Each package shows its items, how many sheets their marks are on, and our own cost of it (material and labor before markups, from the base bid). Choose Scope CSV to download what to send a subcontractor: each item with its CSI number, quantity, unit and the sheets it is on. It has no prices. For material suppliers, the workbook's quote request has the parts list (see Export the estimate). Enter the bids In the empty row under the package, type the bidder's name and the amount of the bid, then choose Add the bid. If a bid leaves part of the scope out, open its Left out list and tick those items. To correct a name or an amount, type over it in the table; the × button removes a bid. Each change is one step that Ctrl+Z takes back, and the bids are saved with the takeoff. How the bids are leveled Bids rarely cover the same scope. Leveling fills each left-out item with a plug at our own cost of it, so every bid is compared on the whole package: Leveled = the bid + the plugs The lowest leveled bid is marked Low; on a tie, the one entered first. Against our cost is the leveled bid minus our own cost of the package: negative means under it. A bid that looks lowest can lose once its missing scope is counted. The workbook gets a Bid leveling sheet with every package that has bids: our estimate, each bid, its plugs, the leveled total and the difference, as live formulas, and what each bid left out. Use a bid as the package's price Choose Use on a bid and it becomes the price of the whole package in your estimate: the package's own pricing (the items, their second conditions and assembly parts) drops out of the job total, the items stay as quantities with your own rates for reference, and one line, Chosen bid, carries the bid's amount. Items the bid leaves out stay at your own cost, which is what leveling already counted as the plug. Choose another bid, or choose the same one again to take it back; each is one step that Ctrl+Z undoes. In the bid summary the sub bids are one line inside the cost: overhead, profit and bond are added on top of them like any other cost; sales tax (on material only) and labor burden (on labor) are not. The workbook's Estimate sheet carries the chosen bid as its own row and the markups block adds it, with live formulas. The material list leaves out an awarded package's material, because the subcontractor supplies it. A package inside an alternate's bid area is not repriced: alternates and bid-area subtotals still use your own prices.","lang":"en"},{"slug":"save-and-reopen","scope":"takeoffcraft","title":"Spremanje i ponovno otvaranje predmjera","summary":"Spremite predmjer kao projektnu datoteku .takeoff.json, ponovno ga otvorite s istim PDF-ovima i saznajte što se događa kada PDF nedostaje ili je promijenjen.","section":"tasks","order":110,"keywords":["predmjer u PDF-u","ugradnja","privitak","spremi","otvori","ponovno otvori","projekt","takeoff.json","nastavi","nastavak","revidirani PDF","promijenjeni PDF","nedostajući PDF","sigurnosna kopija","automatsko spremanje","oporavak","rušenje"],"headings":[{"id":"spremanje","text":"Spremanje","level":2},{"id":"uvanje-predmjera-unutar-pdf-a","text":"Čuvanje predmjera unutar PDF-a","level":2},{"id":"ako-se-kartica-ili-preglednik-zaustavi","text":"Ako se kartica ili preglednik zaustavi","level":2},{"id":"ponovno-otvaranje","text":"Ponovno otvaranje","level":2},{"id":"kada-pdf-nedostaje","text":"Kada PDF nedostaje","level":2},{"id":"kada-se-pdf-promijenio","text":"Kada se PDF promijenio","level":2},{"id":"o-te-ena-ili-tu-a-datoteka","text":"Oštećena ili tuđa datoteka","level":2},{"id":"povijest-poni-tavanja","text":"Povijest poništavanja","level":2}],"html":"\u003Cp\u003EPredmjer se sprema kao mala projektna datoteka, \u003Ccode\u003E(name).takeoff.json\u003C/code\u003E. Sadrži vaše stavke, sklopove, cijene, mjerilo svakog lista i svaku oznaku. \u003Cstrong\u003ENe\u003C/strong\u003E sadrži PDF-ove; pronalazi ih ponovno prema njihovom sadržaju.\u003C/p\u003E\n\u003Ch2 id=\"spremanje\"\u003ESpremanje\u003C/h2\u003E\n\u003Col\u003E\u003Cli\u003EOdaberite \u003Cspan class=\"hui\"\u003ESpremi predmjer\u003C/span\u003E u grupi \u003Cspan class=\"hui\"\u003EDatoteka\u003C/span\u003E, ili pritisnite \u003Ckbd class=\"hk\"\u003E\u003Cspan class=\"k-mac\" title=\"Command S\"\u003E⌘S\u003C/span\u003E\u003Cspan class=\"k-pc\"\u003ECtrl+S\u003C/span\u003E\u003C/kbd\u003E. Vaš preglednik preuzima \u003Ccode\u003E(name).takeoff.json\u003C/code\u003E. Statusna traka kaže „Spremljeno: (name).takeoff.json. Ponovno se otvara na istim PDF-ovima (podudaraju se prema sadržaju).“\u003C/li\u003E\u003Cli\u003EPremjestite datoteku uz PDF-ove posla, da ostanu zajedno.\u003C/li\u003E\u003C/ol\u003E\n\u003Cp\u003ESvako spremanje preuzima novu datoteku. Vaš preglednik može drugu nazvati \u003Ccode\u003E(name) (1).takeoff.json\u003C/code\u003E; zadržite najnoviju.\u003C/p\u003E\n\u003Cp\u003ENaziv dolazi od prvog PDF-a koji ste otvorili u ovom predmjeru.\u003C/p\u003E\n\u003Caside class=\"hc hc-note\"\u003E\u003Cp class=\"hc-label\"\u003ENote\u003C/p\u003E\n\u003Cp\u003E\u003Cspan class=\"hui\"\u003ESpremi predmjer\u003C/span\u003E i dalje je jedini način da predmjer čuvate kao datoteku. Dok radite, TakeoffDesk također čuva kopiju za oporavak u ovom pregledniku (vidi dolje), a spremanje u oblak još nije dostupno. Ako pokušate zatvoriti karticu s nespremljenim promjenama, preglednik pita želite li otići.\u003C/p\u003E\n\u003C/aside\u003E\n\u003Ch2 id=\"uvanje-predmjera-unutar-pdf-a\"\u003EČuvanje predmjera unutar PDF-a\u003C/h2\u003E\n\u003Cp\u003E\u003Cspan class=\"hui\"\u003EIzvoz\u003C/span\u003E › \u003Cspan class=\"hui\"\u003EPDF s predmjerom unutra\u003C/span\u003E preuzima kopiju svakog otvorenog PDF-a, nazvanu poput \u003Ccode\u003EPlans (with takeoff).pdf\u003C/code\u003E, koja nosi cijeli predmjer kao privitak: stavke, oznake, mjerila, područja ponude, sve što sadrži \u003Ccode\u003E.takeoff.json\u003C/code\u003E. Stranice su netaknute, pa izgleda i ispisuje se kao izvornik, a drugi čitači PDF-a navode predmjer među svojim privicima.\u003C/p\u003E\n\u003Cp\u003EOtvorite taj PDF u TakeoffDesku (bilo kako otvarate PDF-ove) i on pita \u003Cstrong\u003EOvaj PDF ima ugrađen predmjer\u003C/strong\u003E: odaberite \u003Cspan class=\"hui\"\u003EOtvori predmjer\u003C/span\u003E da ga vratite, ili \u003Cspan class=\"hui\"\u003ESamo PDF\u003C/span\u003E da otvorite samo crtež. Kopija predstavlja PDF iz kojeg je nastala, pa se \u003Ccode\u003E.takeoff.json\u003C/code\u003E spremljen iz bilo koje od njih otvara na obje.\u003C/p\u003E\n\u003Cp\u003ES više PDF-ova svaka kopija nosi cijeli predmjer; otvorite ih zajedno. Ponovno spremanje iz kopije zamjenjuje predmjer unutar nje, ne dodaje drugi. \u003Ccode\u003E.takeoff.json\u003C/code\u003E je i dalje datoteka koju treba čuvati: mala je, i to je ono što automatsko spremanje i desktop aplikacija zapisuju.\u003C/p\u003E\n\u003Ch2 id=\"ako-se-kartica-ili-preglednik-zaustavi\"\u003EAko se kartica ili preglednik zaustavi\u003C/h2\u003E\n\u003Cp\u003ENekoliko sekundi nakon svake promjene TakeoffDesk čuva kopiju predmjera u vlastitoj pohrani ovog preglednika, zajedno s njegovim PDF-ovima ako zajedno ne prelaze 64 MB. Ništa se ne učitava. Kada spremite predmjer, započnete novi ili otvorite drugi projekt, kopija se briše.\u003C/p\u003E\n\u003Cp\u003EAko se kartica sruši, preglednik ili računalo se zaustavi, ili odete s nespremljenim promjenama, sljedeći put kada otvorite TakeoffDesk pita \u003Cstrong\u003EOporaviti vaš rad?\u003C/strong\u003E i navodi predmjer po nazivu. Odaberite \u003Cstrong\u003EOporavi\u003C/strong\u003E da ga vratite: stavke, oznake i mjerila se vraćaju, a njegovi PDF-ovi ponovno se otvaraju ako su bili sačuvani. Statusna traka kaže „Oporavljeno: (name). Još nije spremljeno u datoteku; Spremi predmjer to čuva.“ Ako su PDF-ovi bili preveliki da bi se sačuvali, otvorite ih ponovno; oznake se pojavljuju na njihovim listovima. Više: \u003Ca href=\"/tutorials/basics/recover\" data-topic=\"basics/recover\"\u003EOporavite svoj rad\u003C/a\u003E.\u003C/p\u003E\n\u003Ch2 id=\"ponovno-otvaranje\"\u003EPonovno otvaranje\u003C/h2\u003E\n\u003Col\u003E\u003Cli\u003EOtvorite TakeoffDesk.\u003C/li\u003E\u003Cli\u003EPovucite i ispustite datoteku \u003Ccode\u003E.takeoff.json\u003C/code\u003E i njezine PDF-ove zajedno na stranicu. Ili odaberite \u003Cspan class=\"hui\"\u003EOtvori nacrte\u003C/span\u003E za PDF-ove i \u003Cspan class=\"hui\"\u003EOtvori predmjer\u003C/span\u003E za projekt, bilo kojim redom. Statusna traka kaže „Otvoreno (name): 12 stavki, 340 oznaka.“ Svaki list dobiva natrag svoje mjerilo, a oznake se pojavljuju na njihovim listovima.\u003C/li\u003E\u003C/ol\u003E\n\u003Cp\u003ERedoslijed PDF-ova nije važan, kao ni njihovi nazivi datoteka ili mape. TakeoffDesk prepoznaje svaki PDF po otisku njegova sadržaja.\u003C/p\u003E\n\u003Cp\u003EAko otvorite projekt dok trenutni predmjer ima nespremljene promjene, TakeoffDesk prvo pita: \u003Cstrong\u003EOdustani\u003C/strong\u003E, \u003Cstrong\u003EOdbaci promjene\u003C/strong\u003E ili \u003Cstrong\u003EPrvo spremi predmjer\u003C/strong\u003E. Otvaranje projekta zamjenjuje trenutne stavke i oznake; PDF-ovi koji su već otvoreni ostaju otvoreni.\u003C/p\u003E\n\u003Ch2 id=\"kada-pdf-nedostaje\"\u003EKada PDF nedostaje\u003C/h2\u003E\n\u003Cp\u003EAko otvorite projekt bez svih njegovih PDF-ova, statusna traka dodaje „Otvorite njegove PDF-ove da vidite oznake (navedeno na popisu listova).“ Ispod popisa listova stoji napomena:\u003C/p\u003E\n\u003Cp\u003E„Ovaj predmjer obuhvaća i PDF-ove koji nisu otvoreni. Njihove količine se broje; otvorite ih da vidite i uredite njihove oznake:“\u003C/p\u003E\n\u003Cp\u003Enakon čega slijede nazivi datoteka i veličine. Njihove oznake i dalje se računaju u svim ukupnim iznosima i izvozima, s mjerilima kojima su izmjerene. Otvorite te PDF-ove da vidite i uredite oznake.\u003C/p\u003E\n\u003Ch2 id=\"kada-se-pdf-promijenio\"\u003EKada se PDF promijenio\u003C/h2\u003E\n\u003Cp\u003EPDF koji je revidiran ili ga je drugi program upravo ponovno spremio ima drugačiji sadržaj, pa je za TakeoffDesk \u003Cstrong\u003Edrugačija datoteka\u003C/strong\u003E, čak i s istim nazivom. U napomeni ispod popisa listova takva datoteka kaže „datoteka s ovim nazivom je otvorena, ali se sadržaj razlikuje“.\u003C/p\u003E\n\u003Cul\u003E\u003Cli\u003EOznake ostaju vezane uz staru verziju. I dalje se broje, na svojim starim položajima i mjerilima.\u003C/li\u003E\u003Cli\u003ERevidirani PDF otvara se kao novi listovi bez mjerila i bez oznaka.\u003C/li\u003E\u003C/ul\u003E\n\u003Cp\u003EDa predmjer prebacite na reviziju, otvorite oba PDF-a i na novom listu upotrijebite \u003Cspan class=\"hui\"\u003EUsporedi\u003C/span\u003E: \u003Ca href=\"/tutorials/takeoffcraft/compare-revisions\" data-topic=\"takeoffcraft/compare-revisions\"\u003EUsporedite revidirani list i prenesite predmjer\u003C/a\u003E.\u003C/p\u003E\n\u003Ch2 id=\"o-te-ena-ili-tu-a-datoteka\"\u003EOštećena ili tuđa datoteka\u003C/h2\u003E\n\u003Cp\u003ETakeoffDesk provjerava svaku projektnu datoteku prije korištenja. Poruke koje možete vidjeti:\u003C/p\u003E\n\u003Cul\u003E\u003Cli\u003E„(file) nije projekt TakeoffDesk (nije valjani JSON).“\u003C/li\u003E\u003Cli\u003E„Ovo nije projektna datoteka TakeoffDesk.“\u003C/li\u003E\u003Cli\u003E„Ovaj projekt spremljen je novijom verzijom TakeoffDesk. Otvorite ga tamo.“\u003C/li\u003E\u003Cli\u003E„3 oznake su oštećene i izostavljene.“ (ostatak se otvara)\u003C/li\u003E\u003C/ul\u003E\n\u003Ch2 id=\"povijest-poni-tavanja\"\u003EPovijest poništavanja\u003C/h2\u003E\n\u003Cp\u003EPovijest poništavanja kreće ispočetka kada otvorite projekt. Spremanje je ne briše.\u003C/p\u003E","text":"Predmjer se sprema kao mala projektna datoteka, (name).takeoff.json. Sadrži vaše stavke, sklopove, cijene, mjerilo svakog lista i svaku oznaku. Ne sadrži PDF-ove; pronalazi ih ponovno prema njihovom sadržaju. Spremanje Odaberite Spremi predmjer u grupi Datoteka, ili pritisnite Ctrl+S. Vaš preglednik preuzima (name).takeoff.json. Statusna traka kaže „Spremljeno: (name).takeoff.json. Ponovno se otvara na istim PDF-ovima (podudaraju se prema sadržaju).“ Premjestite datoteku uz PDF-ove posla, da ostanu zajedno. Svako spremanje preuzima novu datoteku. Vaš preglednik može drugu nazvati (name) (1).takeoff.json; zadržite najnoviju. Naziv dolazi od prvog PDF-a koji ste otvorili u ovom predmjeru. Spremi predmjer i dalje je jedini način da predmjer čuvate kao datoteku. Dok radite, TakeoffDesk također čuva kopiju za oporavak u ovom pregledniku (vidi dolje), a spremanje u oblak još nije dostupno. Ako pokušate zatvoriti karticu s nespremljenim promjenama, preglednik pita želite li otići. Čuvanje predmjera unutar PDF-a Izvoz › PDF s predmjerom unutra preuzima kopiju svakog otvorenog PDF-a, nazvanu poput Plans (with takeoff).pdf, koja nosi cijeli predmjer kao privitak: stavke, oznake, mjerila, područja ponude, sve što sadrži .takeoff.json. Stranice su netaknute, pa izgleda i ispisuje se kao izvornik, a drugi čitači PDF-a navode predmjer među svojim privicima. Otvorite taj PDF u TakeoffDesku (bilo kako otvarate PDF-ove) i on pita Ovaj PDF ima ugrađen predmjer: odaberite Otvori predmjer da ga vratite, ili Samo PDF da otvorite samo crtež. Kopija predstavlja PDF iz kojeg je nastala, pa se .takeoff.json spremljen iz bilo koje od njih otvara na obje. S više PDF-ova svaka kopija nosi cijeli predmjer; otvorite ih zajedno. Ponovno spremanje iz kopije zamjenjuje predmjer unutar nje, ne dodaje drugi. .takeoff.json je i dalje datoteka koju treba čuvati: mala je, i to je ono što automatsko spremanje i desktop aplikacija zapisuju. Ako se kartica ili preglednik zaustavi Nekoliko sekundi nakon svake promjene TakeoffDesk čuva kopiju predmjera u vlastitoj pohrani ovog preglednika, zajedno s njegovim PDF-ovima ako zajedno ne prelaze 64 MB. Ništa se ne učitava. Kada spremite predmjer, započnete novi ili otvorite drugi projekt, kopija se briše. Ako se kartica sruši, preglednik ili računalo se zaustavi, ili odete s nespremljenim promjenama, sljedeći put kada otvorite TakeoffDesk pita Oporaviti vaš rad? i navodi predmjer po nazivu. Odaberite Oporavi da ga vratite: stavke, oznake i mjerila se vraćaju, a njegovi PDF-ovi ponovno se otvaraju ako su bili sačuvani. Statusna traka kaže „Oporavljeno: (name). Još nije spremljeno u datoteku; Spremi predmjer to čuva.“ Ako su PDF-ovi bili preveliki da bi se sačuvali, otvorite ih ponovno; oznake se pojavljuju na njihovim listovima. Više: Oporavite svoj rad. Ponovno otvaranje Otvorite TakeoffDesk. Povucite i ispustite datoteku .takeoff.json i njezine PDF-ove zajedno na stranicu. Ili odaberite Otvori nacrte za PDF-ove i Otvori predmjer za projekt, bilo kojim redom. Statusna traka kaže „Otvoreno (name): 12 stavki, 340 oznaka.“ Svaki list dobiva natrag svoje mjerilo, a oznake se pojavljuju na njihovim listovima. Redoslijed PDF-ova nije važan, kao ni njihovi nazivi datoteka ili mape. TakeoffDesk prepoznaje svaki PDF po otisku njegova sadržaja. Ako otvorite projekt dok trenutni predmjer ima nespremljene promjene, TakeoffDesk prvo pita: Odustani, Odbaci promjene ili Prvo spremi predmjer. Otvaranje projekta zamjenjuje trenutne stavke i oznake; PDF-ovi koji su već otvoreni ostaju otvoreni. Kada PDF nedostaje Ako otvorite projekt bez svih njegovih PDF-ova, statusna traka dodaje „Otvorite njegove PDF-ove da vidite oznake (navedeno na popisu listova).“ Ispod popisa listova stoji napomena: „Ovaj predmjer obuhvaća i PDF-ove koji nisu otvoreni. Njihove količine se broje; otvorite ih da vidite i uredite njihove oznake:“ nakon čega slijede nazivi datoteka i veličine. Njihove oznake i dalje se računaju u svim ukupnim iznosima i izvozima, s mjerilima kojima su izmjerene. Otvorite te PDF-ove da vidite i uredite oznake. Kada se PDF promijenio PDF koji je revidiran ili ga je drugi program upravo ponovno spremio ima drugačiji sadržaj, pa je za TakeoffDesk drugačija datoteka, čak i s istim nazivom. U napomeni ispod popisa listova takva datoteka kaže „datoteka s ovim nazivom je otvorena, ali se sadržaj razlikuje“. Oznake ostaju vezane uz staru verziju. I dalje se broje, na svojim starim položajima i mjerilima. Revidirani PDF otvara se kao novi listovi bez mjerila i bez oznaka. Da predmjer prebacite na reviziju, otvorite oba PDF-a i na novom listu upotrijebite Usporedi: Usporedite revidirani list i prenesite predmjer. Oštećena ili tuđa datoteka TakeoffDesk provjerava svaku projektnu datoteku prije korištenja. Poruke koje možete vidjeti: „(file) nije projekt TakeoffDesk (nije valjani JSON).“ „Ovo nije projektna datoteka TakeoffDesk.“ „Ovaj projekt spremljen je novijom verzijom TakeoffDesk. Otvorite ga tamo.“ „3 oznake su oštećene i izostavljene.“ (ostatak se otvara) Povijest poništavanja Povijest poništavanja kreće ispočetka kada otvorite projekt. Spremanje je ne briše.","lang":"hr"},{"slug":"compare-revisions","scope":"takeoffcraft","title":"Usporedba revidiranog lista i prijenos predmjera","summary":"Postavite stari list preko revizije, poravnajte ih, pogledajte što se promijenilo i prenesite predmjer na novi list s oznakama za provjeru.","section":"tasks","order":115,"keywords":["revizija","revidirano","usporedi","preklapanje","staro","novo","promjene","dopuna","izmjena","ponovno izdanje","prijenos predmjera","prijenos","poravnaj","označeno","provjeri"],"headings":[{"id":"usporedba","text":"Usporedba","level":2},{"id":"poravnanje","text":"Poravnanje","level":2},{"id":"pronala-enje-promjena","text":"Pronalaženje promjena","level":2},{"id":"prijenos-predmjera","text":"Prijenos predmjera","level":2},{"id":"provjera-ozna-enih-oznaka","text":"Provjera označenih oznaka","level":2}],"html":"\u003Cp\u003EKad se list ponovno izda, ne morate ga ponovno predmjeriti. Otvorite stari PDF i novi, usporedite dva lista i prenesite predmjer. TakeoffDesk označava svaku oznaku na kojoj se crtež promijenio, pa provjerite te oznake, a ostale zadržite.\u003C/p\u003E\n\u003Ch2 id=\"usporedba\"\u003EUsporedba\u003C/h2\u003E\n\u003Col\u003E\u003Cli\u003EOtvorite oba PDF-a: stari skup i revidirani (\u003Cspan class=\"hui\"\u003EOtvori nacrte\u003C/span\u003E; mogu biti u jednoj datoteci ili u više njih).\u003C/li\u003E\u003Cli\u003EPrikažite \u003Cstrong\u003Enovi\u003C/strong\u003E list.\u003C/li\u003E\u003Cli\u003EOdaberite \u003Cspan class=\"hui\"\u003EUsporedi\u003C/span\u003E na traci lista ispod crteža.\u003C/li\u003E\u003Cli\u003EOdaberite stari list na popisu. TakeoffDesk predlaže list s istim brojem u drugom PDF-u ili istu stranicu. Odaberite \u003Cstrong\u003EUsporedi\u003C/strong\u003E.\u003C/li\u003E\u003C/ol\u003E\n\u003Cp\u003EStari crtež sada leži preko novoga u crvenoj boji. Gdje se slažu, crvene linije su na crnima; gdje se razlikuju, vidite samo crvene linije (uklonjeno) i samo crne linije (dodano). Traka na dnu lista sadrži korake u nastavku; \u003Ckbd class=\"hk\"\u003E\u003Cspan class=\"k-mac\" title=\"Esc\"\u003EEsc\u003C/span\u003E\u003Cspan class=\"k-pc\"\u003EEsc\u003C/span\u003E\u003C/kbd\u003E ili \u003Cspan class=\"hui\"\u003EZatvori\u003C/span\u003E završava usporedbu.\u003C/p\u003E\n\u003Ch2 id=\"poravnanje\"\u003EPoravnanje\u003C/h2\u003E\n\u003Cp\u003EPonovno izdani listovi često su ispisani malo pomaknuto: pomaknuti na stranici ili u nešto drugačijoj veličini. Ako crveni crtež ne leži na crnom, odaberite \u003Cstrong\u003EPoravnaj po dvije točke\u003C/strong\u003E i kliknite četiri puta:\u003C/p\u003E\n\u003Col\u003E\u003Cli\u003Etočku na starom (crvenom) crtežu, primjerice središte stupa ili kut zgrade,\u003C/li\u003E\u003Cli\u003Eistu točku na novom (crnom) crtežu,\u003C/li\u003E\u003Cli\u003Edrugu točku na crvenom crtežu, daleko od prve,\u003C/li\u003E\u003Cli\u003Eistu točku na crnom crtežu.\u003C/li\u003E\u003C/ol\u003E\n\u003Cp\u003ECrveni crtež se pomiče, okreće i skalira na crni. Statusna traka kaže koliko je novi crtež veći („veličina × 1.000“ kad je isti). Zumirajte za odabir točaka: što bliže kliknete, bolje je poklapanje.\u003C/p\u003E\n\u003Ch2 id=\"pronala-enje-promjena\"\u003EPronalaženje promjena\u003C/h2\u003E\n\u003Cp\u003EOdaberite \u003Cstrong\u003EPronađi promjene\u003C/strong\u003E. TakeoffDesk uspoređuje tintu dvaju crteža: tinta samo na starom listu postaje crvena, tinta samo na novom listu postaje plava, a statusna traka ih broji. Linije koje su se pomaknule za dlaku (ponovni ispis) ne broje se kao promjene.\u003C/p\u003E\n\u003Cp\u003ETakođer pregledava svaku oznaku na starom listu i broji one koje se nalaze tamo gdje se crtež promijenio:\u003C/p\u003E\n\u003Cul\u003E\u003Cli\u003Edionicu ili površinu kad se crtež promijenio na jednom od njezinih krajeva ili kutova, ili duž barem otprilike šestine njezine duljine;\u003C/li\u003E\u003Cli\u003Ebrojanu oznaku kad se nešto promijenilo odmah pored nje.\u003C/li\u003E\u003C/ul\u003E\n\u003Ch2 id=\"prijenos-predmjera\"\u003EPrijenos predmjera\u003C/h2\u003E\n\u003Cp\u003EOdaberite \u003Cstrong\u003EPrijenesi predmjer ovdje\u003C/strong\u003E. Svaka oznaka sa starog lista premješta se na novi, kroz poravnanje, u jednom koraku poništavanja. Oznake uz promjenu su označene: nacrtane su s narančastim obrubom, a traka lista pokazuje „(n) za provjeru“.\u003C/p\u003E\n\u003Cp\u003EAko novi list nije imao mjerilo, preuzima mjerilo starog lista (prilagođeno kad su crteži morali biti skalirani da se poklope). Ako je već imao drugo mjerilo, TakeoffDesk prvo pita: premještene oznake mjere se u mjerilu novoga lista.\u003C/p\u003E\n\u003Ch2 id=\"provjera-ozna-enih-oznaka\"\u003EProvjera označenih oznaka\u003C/h2\u003E\n\u003Col\u003E\u003Cli\u003EOdaberite „(n) za provjeru“ na traci lista. Prikaz se zumira na sljedeću označenu oznaku i odabire je; njezin panel kaže zašto je označena.\u003C/li\u003E\u003Cli\u003EIspravite oznaku ako se crtež promijenio ispod nje (povucite njezine kutove, dodajte ili izbrišite oznake ili je ponovno izmjerite).\u003C/li\u003E\u003Cli\u003EU njezinu panelu odaberite \u003Cstrong\u003EProvjereno\u003C/strong\u003E. Oznaka se uklanja, a broj na traci lista se smanjuje.\u003C/li\u003E\u003C/ol\u003E\n\u003Cp\u003EOznake se spremaju s predmjerom, pa ih možete provjeriti kasnije.\u003C/p\u003E\n\u003Caside class=\"hc hc-note\"\u003E\u003Cp class=\"hc-label\"\u003ENote\u003C/p\u003E\n\u003Cp\u003EUsporedba radi jednako na vektorskim PDF-ovima i na skeniranim crtežima, jer uspoređuje ono što je nacrtano. Skenirani crtež koji je iskošen ili rastegnut može se poklapati samo približno dvjema točkama; tada više oznaka provjerite očima.\u003C/p\u003E\n\u003C/aside\u003E","text":"Kad se list ponovno izda, ne morate ga ponovno predmjeriti. Otvorite stari PDF i novi, usporedite dva lista i prenesite predmjer. TakeoffDesk označava svaku oznaku na kojoj se crtež promijenio, pa provjerite te oznake, a ostale zadržite. Usporedba Otvorite oba PDF-a: stari skup i revidirani (Otvori nacrte; mogu biti u jednoj datoteci ili u više njih). Prikažite novi list. Odaberite Usporedi na traci lista ispod crteža. Odaberite stari list na popisu. TakeoffDesk predlaže list s istim brojem u drugom PDF-u ili istu stranicu. Odaberite Usporedi. Stari crtež sada leži preko novoga u crvenoj boji. Gdje se slažu, crvene linije su na crnima; gdje se razlikuju, vidite samo crvene linije (uklonjeno) i samo crne linije (dodano). Traka na dnu lista sadrži korake u nastavku; Esc ili Zatvori završava usporedbu. Poravnanje Ponovno izdani listovi često su ispisani malo pomaknuto: pomaknuti na stranici ili u nešto drugačijoj veličini. Ako crveni crtež ne leži na crnom, odaberite Poravnaj po dvije točke i kliknite četiri puta: točku na starom (crvenom) crtežu, primjerice središte stupa ili kut zgrade, istu točku na novom (crnom) crtežu, drugu točku na crvenom crtežu, daleko od prve, istu točku na crnom crtežu. Crveni crtež se pomiče, okreće i skalira na crni. Statusna traka kaže koliko je novi crtež veći („veličina × 1.000“ kad je isti). Zumirajte za odabir točaka: što bliže kliknete, bolje je poklapanje. Pronalaženje promjena Odaberite Pronađi promjene. TakeoffDesk uspoređuje tintu dvaju crteža: tinta samo na starom listu postaje crvena, tinta samo na novom listu postaje plava, a statusna traka ih broji. Linije koje su se pomaknule za dlaku (ponovni ispis) ne broje se kao promjene. Također pregledava svaku oznaku na starom listu i broji one koje se nalaze tamo gdje se crtež promijenio: dionicu ili površinu kad se crtež promijenio na jednom od njezinih krajeva ili kutova, ili duž barem otprilike šestine njezine duljine; brojanu oznaku kad se nešto promijenilo odmah pored nje. Prijenos predmjera Odaberite Prijenesi predmjer ovdje. Svaka oznaka sa starog lista premješta se na novi, kroz poravnanje, u jednom koraku poništavanja. Oznake uz promjenu su označene: nacrtane su s narančastim obrubom, a traka lista pokazuje „(n) za provjeru“. Ako novi list nije imao mjerilo, preuzima mjerilo starog lista (prilagođeno kad su crteži morali biti skalirani da se poklope). Ako je već imao drugo mjerilo, TakeoffDesk prvo pita: premještene oznake mjere se u mjerilu novoga lista. Provjera označenih oznaka Odaberite „(n) za provjeru“ na traci lista. Prikaz se zumira na sljedeću označenu oznaku i odabire je; njezin panel kaže zašto je označena. Ispravite oznaku ako se crtež promijenio ispod nje (povucite njezine kutove, dodajte ili izbrišite oznake ili je ponovno izmjerite). U njezinu panelu odaberite Provjereno. Oznaka se uklanja, a broj na traci lista se smanjuje. Oznake se spremaju s predmjerom, pa ih možete provjeriti kasnije. Usporedba radi jednako na vektorskim PDF-ovima i na skeniranim crtežima, jer uspoređuje ono što je nacrtano. Skenirani crtež koji je iskošen ili rastegnut može se poklapati samo približno dvjema točkama; tada više oznaka provjerite očima.","lang":"hr"},{"slug":"use-with-ai-assistants","scope":"takeoffcraft","title":"Use TakeoffDesk with an AI assistant","summary":"Let your own AI assistant or script read the takeoff's quantities and estimate, add items and marks, count and measure on a DWG or DXF, and export: permissions, connecting through the dev server, and the activity log.","section":"tasks","order":118,"keywords":["ai","assistant","agent","mcp","model context protocol","script","automation","quantities","estimate","permissions","disconnect","activity"],"headings":[{"id":"what-you-will-learn","text":"What you will learn","level":2},{"id":"turn-it-on","text":"Turn it on","level":2},{"id":"connect-your-assistant","text":"Connect your assistant","level":2},{"id":"you-stay-in-charge","text":"You stay in charge","level":2},{"id":"what-an-assistant-can-ask-for","text":"What an assistant can ask for","level":2},{"id":"if-something-doesn-t-work","text":"If something doesn't work","level":2},{"id":"see-also","text":"See also","level":2}],"html":"\u003Ch2 id=\"what-you-will-learn\"\u003EWhat you will learn\u003C/h2\u003E\n\u003Cp\u003EHow to let an AI assistant (or a script you wrote) work with TakeoffDesk, and how to decide what it is allowed to touch.\u003C/p\u003E\n\u003Cp\u003ETakeoffDesk has \u003Cstrong\u003Eno AI of its own\u003C/strong\u003E and sends nothing anywhere. You bring the assistant: any program that speaks the Model Context Protocol (MCP). TakeoffDesk only gives it tools, and you choose which.\u003C/p\u003E\n\u003Ch2 id=\"turn-it-on\"\u003ETurn it on\u003C/h2\u003E\n\u003Col\u003E\u003Cli\u003EOpen \u003Cspan class=\"hui\"\u003ESettings\u003C/span\u003E (the gear in the app bar, or \u003Ckbd class=\"hk\"\u003E\u003Cspan class=\"k-mac\" title=\"Command ,\"\u003E⌘,\u003C/span\u003E\u003Cspan class=\"k-pc\"\u003ECtrl+,\u003C/span\u003E\u003C/kbd\u003E) and go to the \u003Cspan class=\"hui\"\u003ETakeoffDesk\u003C/span\u003E tab.\u003C/li\u003E\u003Cli\u003EUnder \u003Cspan class=\"hui\"\u003EAssistants\u003C/span\u003E, tick \u003Cstrong\u003ELet AI assistants and scripts use TakeoffDesk\u003C/strong\u003E. It is off until you do.\u003C/li\u003E\u003Cli\u003EChoose what it may do: \u003Cstrong\u003ERead\u003C/strong\u003E is ticked to start with; tick \u003Cstrong\u003EEdit\u003C/strong\u003E, \u003Cstrong\u003ESave\u003C/strong\u003E or \u003Cstrong\u003EExport\u003C/strong\u003E only when you need them.\u003C/li\u003E\u003C/ol\u003E\n\u003Cp\u003ETools outside the permissions you ticked are not offered to the assistant, and if it asks for one anyway, TakeoffDesk refuses and writes it in the activity log. Turning the switch off ends every connection at once; \u003Cspan class=\"hui\"\u003EReset TakeoffDesk settings\u003C/span\u003E turns it off too.\u003C/p\u003E\n\u003Ch2 id=\"connect-your-assistant\"\u003EConnect your assistant\u003C/h2\u003E\n\u003Cp\u003EAssistants connect through the dev server on your computer. Start TakeoffDesk with \u003Ccode\u003Enpm run mcp\u003C/code\u003E instead of \u003Ccode\u003Enpm start\u003C/code\u003E: the server then also answers assistants at \u003Ccode\u003Ehttp://127.0.0.1:8000/mcp\u003C/code\u003E, only from this computer, with the token it keeps in \u003Ccode\u003Edevshell/.mcp-token\u003C/code\u003E. Keep the TakeoffDesk tab open: the assistant works through it. \u003Ccode\u003Edevshell/MCP.md\u003C/code\u003E has the exact settings for Claude Code and Claude Desktop. Never share the token.\u003C/p\u003E\n\u003Caside class=\"hc hc-note\"\u003E\u003Cp class=\"hc-label\"\u003ENote\u003C/p\u003E\n\u003Cp\u003EStarted with \u003Ccode\u003Enpm start\u003C/code\u003E, the server takes no assistants, and the switch has no effect.\u003C/p\u003E\n\u003C/aside\u003E\n\u003Ch2 id=\"you-stay-in-charge\"\u003EYou stay in charge\u003C/h2\u003E\n\u003Cul\u003E\u003Cli\u003E\u003Cstrong\u003EEvery change is one undo step\u003C/strong\u003E, labelled with the assistant&#039;s name for it (for example &quot;Assistant: …&quot;). \u003Ckbd class=\"hk\"\u003E\u003Cspan class=\"k-mac\" title=\"Command Z\"\u003E⌘Z\u003C/span\u003E\u003Cspan class=\"k-pc\"\u003ECtrl+Z\u003C/span\u003E\u003C/kbd\u003E takes back the assistant&#039;s last change as a whole.\u003C/li\u003E\u003Cli\u003E\u003Cstrong\u003EYou know when one is connected.\u003C/strong\u003E A button in the app bar names the assistant while it is connected; click it to see what it may do, or to \u003Cstrong\u003EDisconnect\u003C/strong\u003E it.\u003C/li\u003E\u003Cli\u003E\u003Cstrong\u003EActivity.\u003C/strong\u003E \u003Cspan class=\"hui\"\u003ESettings\u003C/span\u003E › \u003Cspan class=\"hui\"\u003ETakeoffDesk\u003C/span\u003E › \u003Cspan class=\"hui\"\u003EAssistants\u003C/span\u003E › \u003Cspan class=\"hui\"\u003EActivity\u003C/span\u003E lists every call: when, which tool, done or refused. \u003Cspan class=\"hui\"\u003ESave the log\u003C/span\u003E keeps a copy.\u003C/li\u003E\u003C/ul\u003E\n\u003Ch2 id=\"what-an-assistant-can-ask-for\"\u003EWhat an assistant can ask for\u003C/h2\u003E\n\u003Cdiv class=\"ht-wrap\"\u003E\u003Ctable class=\"ht\"\u003E\u003Cthead\u003E\u003Ctr\u003E\u003Cth scope=\"col\"\u003ETool\u003C/th\u003E\u003Cth scope=\"col\"\u003EPermission\u003C/th\u003E\u003Cth scope=\"col\"\u003EWhat it does\u003C/th\u003E\u003C/tr\u003E\u003C/thead\u003E\u003Ctbody\u003E\u003Ctr\u003E\u003Ctd\u003E\u003Ccode\u003Eapp_info\u003C/code\u003E, \u003Ccode\u003Esheets_list\u003C/code\u003E\u003C/td\u003E\u003Ctd\u003ERead\u003C/td\u003E\u003Ctd\u003EThe takeoff open, its PDFs and sheets, each sheet&#039;s scale and marks\u003C/td\u003E\u003C/tr\u003E\u003Ctr\u003E\u003Ctd\u003E\u003Ccode\u003Esheet_image\u003C/code\u003E\u003C/td\u003E\u003Ctd\u003ERead\u003C/td\u003E\u003Ctd\u003EA picture of a sheet, or a zoomed-in part of it, with a grid in the numbers \u003Ccode\u003Emarks_add\u003C/code\u003E takes and the marks already there, so the assistant can see where to measure on a PDF\u003C/td\u003E\u003C/tr\u003E\u003Ctr\u003E\u003Ctd\u003E\u003Ccode\u003Eitems_list\u003C/code\u003E\u003C/td\u003E\u003Ctd\u003ERead\u003C/td\u003E\u003Ctd\u003EThe items with their units, rates and assembly formulas\u003C/td\u003E\u003C/tr\u003E\u003Ctr\u003E\u003Ctd\u003E\u003Ccode\u003Etakeoff_quantities\u003C/code\u003E\u003C/td\u003E\u003Ctd\u003ERead\u003C/td\u003E\u003Ctd\u003EQuantities per item or per sheet; marks on sheets with no scale are listed, never counted as zero\u003C/td\u003E\u003C/tr\u003E\u003Ctr\u003E\u003Ctd\u003E\u003Ccode\u003Etakeoff_estimate\u003C/code\u003E\u003C/td\u003E\u003Ctd\u003ERead\u003C/td\u003E\u003Ctd\u003EThe priced estimate as TakeoffDesk computes it, with its totals\u003C/td\u003E\u003C/tr\u003E\u003Ctr\u003E\u003Ctd\u003E\u003Ccode\u003Etakeoff_export\u003C/code\u003E\u003C/td\u003E\u003Ctd\u003EExport\u003C/td\u003E\u003Ctd\u003ETakeoffDesk&#039;s own CSV or XLSX export\u003C/td\u003E\u003C/tr\u003E\u003Ctr\u003E\u003Ctd\u003E\u003Ccode\u003Eitems_add\u003C/code\u003E\u003C/td\u003E\u003Ctd\u003EEdit\u003C/td\u003E\u003Ctd\u003EAdds items with their units, rates and waste\u003C/td\u003E\u003C/tr\u003E\u003Ctr\u003E\u003Ctd\u003E\u003Ccode\u003Emarks_add\u003C/code\u003E\u003C/td\u003E\u003Ctd\u003EEdit\u003C/td\u003E\u003Ctd\u003EMeasures runs, areas and counts on a sheet. Lengths and areas only on a sheet with a scale, never on an unscaled one\u003C/td\u003E\u003C/tr\u003E\u003Ctr\u003E\u003Ctd\u003E\u003Ccode\u003Ecad_sheets\u003C/code\u003E, \u003Ccode\u003Ecad_catalog\u003C/code\u003E, \u003Ccode\u003Ecad_count\u003C/code\u003E\u003C/td\u003E\u003Ctd\u003ERead\u003C/td\u003E\u003Ctd\u003EOn a DWG or DXF you opened: its sheets and their scales, what can be counted (blocks, layers and types, texts), and exact counts, as \u003Cspan class=\"hui\"\u003ECAD count\u003C/span\u003E makes them (\u003Ca href=\"/tutorials/takeoffcraft/count-from-a-drawing\" data-topic=\"takeoffcraft/count-from-a-drawing\"\u003ECount from a drawing\u003C/a\u003E)\u003C/td\u003E\u003C/tr\u003E\u003Ctr\u003E\u003Ctd\u003E\u003Ccode\u003Ecad_count_add\u003C/code\u003E\u003C/td\u003E\u003Ctd\u003EEdit\u003C/td\u003E\u003Ctd\u003ECounts in the drawing and puts a count mark on each object found, in one step; counting again adds only what is new\u003C/td\u003E\u003C/tr\u003E\u003Ctr\u003E\u003Ctd\u003E\u003Ccode\u003Ecad_measure\u003C/code\u003E\u003C/td\u003E\u003Ctd\u003EEdit\u003C/td\u003E\u003Ctd\u003EMeasures a linear or an area item from the drawing&#039;s own lines, arcs, polylines and hatches, as \u003Cspan class=\"hui\"\u003EMeasure drawing\u003C/span\u003E does (\u003Ca href=\"/tutorials/takeoffcraft/measure-from-a-drawing\" data-topic=\"takeoffcraft/measure-from-a-drawing\"\u003EMeasure from a drawing\u003C/a\u003E); only on a sheet with a scale\u003C/td\u003E\u003C/tr\u003E\u003Ctr\u003E\u003Ctd\u003E\u003Ccode\u003Eusd_export\u003C/code\u003E\u003C/td\u003E\u003Ctd\u003EExport\u003C/td\u003E\u003Ctd\u003EA scaled sheet&#039;s measured runs, areas and counts as a 3D check model in USD (\u003Ccode\u003E.usdz\u003C/code\u003E, \u003Ccode\u003E.usda\u003C/code\u003E or \u003Ccode\u003E.usdc\u003C/code\u003E), as \u003Cspan class=\"hui\"\u003EUSD package (.usdz)\u003C/span\u003E in the 3D check view writes it (\u003Ca href=\"/tutorials/takeoffcraft/usd\" data-topic=\"takeoffcraft/usd\"\u003EExport the 3D check view as USD\u003C/a\u003E)\u003C/td\u003E\u003C/tr\u003E\u003C/tbody\u003E\u003C/table\u003E\u003C/div\u003E\n\u003Cp\u003EWith \u003Cstrong\u003EEdit\u003C/strong\u003E ticked, an assistant adds items and marks (each call one undo step); it cannot move, change or delete marks that are already there.\u003C/p\u003E\n\u003Ch2 id=\"if-something-doesn-t-work\"\u003EIf something doesn&#039;t work\u003C/h2\u003E\n\u003Cul\u003E\u003Cli\u003E\u003Cstrong\u003EThe assistant sees no TakeoffDesk tools:\u003C/strong\u003E check that the switch is on in this window, and that the server was started with \u003Ccode\u003Enpm run mcp\u003C/code\u003E.\u003C/li\u003E\u003Cli\u003E\u003Cstrong\u003E&quot;needs the export permission&quot;:\u003C/strong\u003E tick \u003Cstrong\u003EExport\u003C/strong\u003E under \u003Cspan class=\"hui\"\u003EAssistants\u003C/span\u003E, then ask again.\u003C/li\u003E\u003Cli\u003E\u003Cstrong\u003E&quot;401&quot; or &quot;token&quot; errors:\u003C/strong\u003E the token changed (\u003Ccode\u003Edevshell/.mcp-token\u003C/code\u003E was deleted and made again). Copy the new one into the assistant&#039;s settings.\u003C/li\u003E\u003C/ul\u003E\n\u003Ch2 id=\"see-also\"\u003ESee also\u003C/h2\u003E\n\u003Cul\u003E\u003Cli\u003E\u003Ca href=\"/tutorials/basics/assistants-recipes\" data-topic=\"basics/assistants-recipes\"\u003ERecipes for AI assistants\u003C/a\u003E: worked examples, each with the tools it calls.\u003C/li\u003E\u003C/ul\u003E","text":"What you will learn How to let an AI assistant (or a script you wrote) work with TakeoffDesk, and how to decide what it is allowed to touch. TakeoffDesk has no AI of its own and sends nothing anywhere. You bring the assistant: any program that speaks the Model Context Protocol (MCP). TakeoffDesk only gives it tools, and you choose which. Turn it on Open Settings (the gear in the app bar, or Ctrl+,) and go to the TakeoffDesk tab. Under Assistants, tick Let AI assistants and scripts use TakeoffDesk. It is off until you do. Choose what it may do: Read is ticked to start with; tick Edit, Save or Export only when you need them. Tools outside the permissions you ticked are not offered to the assistant, and if it asks for one anyway, TakeoffDesk refuses and writes it in the activity log. Turning the switch off ends every connection at once; Reset TakeoffDesk settings turns it off too. Connect your assistant Assistants connect through the dev server on your computer. Start TakeoffDesk with npm run mcp instead of npm start: the server then also answers assistants at http://127.0.0.1:8000/mcp, only from this computer, with the token it keeps in devshell/.mcp-token. Keep the TakeoffDesk tab open: the assistant works through it. devshell/MCP.md has the exact settings for Claude Code and Claude Desktop. Never share the token. Started with npm start, the server takes no assistants, and the switch has no effect. You stay in charge Every change is one undo step, labelled with the assistant's name for it (for example \"Assistant: …\"). Ctrl+Z takes back the assistant's last change as a whole. You know when one is connected. A button in the app bar names the assistant while it is connected; click it to see what it may do, or to Disconnect it. Activity. Settings › TakeoffDesk › Assistants › Activity lists every call: when, which tool, done or refused. Save the log keeps a copy. What an assistant can ask for Tool Permission What it does app_info, sheets_list Read The takeoff open, its PDFs and sheets, each sheet's scale and marks sheet_image Read A picture of a sheet, or a zoomed-in part of it, with a grid in the numbers marks_add takes and the marks already there, so the assistant can see where to measure on a PDF items_list Read The items with their units, rates and assembly formulas takeoff_quantities Read Quantities per item or per sheet; marks on sheets with no scale are listed, never counted as zero takeoff_estimate Read The priced estimate as TakeoffDesk computes it, with its totals takeoff_export Export TakeoffDesk's own CSV or XLSX export items_add Edit Adds items with their units, rates and waste marks_add Edit Measures runs, areas and counts on a sheet. Lengths and areas only on a sheet with a scale, never on an unscaled one cad_sheets, cad_catalog, cad_count Read On a DWG or DXF you opened: its sheets and their scales, what can be counted (blocks, layers and types, texts), and exact counts, as CAD count makes them (Count from a drawing) cad_count_add Edit Counts in the drawing and puts a count mark on each object found, in one step; counting again adds only what is new cad_measure Edit Measures a linear or an area item from the drawing's own lines, arcs, polylines and hatches, as Measure drawing does (Measure from a drawing); only on a sheet with a scale usd_export Export A scaled sheet's measured runs, areas and counts as a 3D check model in USD (.usdz, .usda or .usdc), as USD package (.usdz) in the 3D check view writes it (Export the 3D check view as USD) With Edit ticked, an assistant adds items and marks (each call one undo step); it cannot move, change or delete marks that are already there. If something doesn't work The assistant sees no TakeoffDesk tools: check that the switch is on in this window, and that the server was started with npm run mcp. \"needs the export permission\": tick Export under Assistants, then ask again. \"401\" or \"token\" errors: the token changed (devshell/.mcp-token was deleted and made again). Copy the new one into the assistant's settings. See also Recipes for AI assistants: worked examples, each with the tools it calls.","lang":"en"},{"slug":"new-takeoff","scope":"takeoffcraft","title":"Započnite novi predmjer","summary":"Očistite sve i započnite prazan predmjer bez ponovnog učitavanja stranice, a prije toga spremite svoj rad.","section":"tasks","order":120,"keywords":["novo","novi predmjer","očisti","vrati","poništi","počni ispočetka","prazno","zatvori PDF-ove","sljedeći posao"],"headings":[],"html":"\u003Cp\u003E\u003Cspan class=\"hui\"\u003ENovo\u003C/span\u003E zatvara sve PDF-ove i započinje prazan predmjer na istoj stranici.\u003C/p\u003E\n\u003Col\u003E\u003Cli\u003ESpremite trenutačni predmjer ako ga želite zadržati: \u003Cspan class=\"hui\"\u003ESpremi predmjer\u003C/span\u003E ili \u003Ckbd class=\"hk\"\u003E\u003Cspan class=\"k-mac\" title=\"Command S\"\u003E⌘S\u003C/span\u003E\u003Cspan class=\"k-pc\"\u003ECtrl+S\u003C/span\u003E\u003C/kbd\u003E.\u003C/li\u003E\u003Cli\u003EOdaberite \u003Cspan class=\"hui\"\u003ENovo\u003C/span\u003E u grupi \u003Cspan class=\"hui\"\u003EDatoteka\u003C/span\u003E.\u003C/li\u003E\u003Cli\u003EAko postoje nespremljene promjene, TakeoffDesk pita \u003Cstrong\u003ENespremljeni predmjer\u003C/strong\u003E: odaberite \u003Cspan class=\"hui\"\u003EPrvo spremi predmjer\u003C/span\u003E (preuzima projekt, pa čisti), \u003Cspan class=\"hui\"\u003EOdbaci promjene\u003C/span\u003E ili \u003Cspan class=\"hui\"\u003EOdustani\u003C/span\u003E. Prozor se vraća u prazno stanje: nema PDF-ova, stavki, oznaka ni mjerila. Statusna traka kaže „Novi predmjer. Otvorite PDF-ove za početak.“\u003C/li\u003E\u003C/ol\u003E\n\u003Cp\u003EŠto se briše:\u003C/p\u003E\n\u003Cul\u003E\u003Cli\u003Esvaki otvoreni PDF, njegovi listovi i sličice,\u003C/li\u003E\u003Cli\u003Estavke, sklopovi, oznake i mjerila,\u003C/li\u003E\u003Cli\u003Ezumiranje i položaj svakog lista,\u003C/li\u003E\u003Cli\u003Epovijest poništavanja (ne možete poništiti \u003Cspan class=\"hui\"\u003ENovo\u003C/span\u003E),\u003C/li\u003E\u003Cli\u003Enačin luka te svaka pretraga ili pregled autobrojanja.\u003C/li\u003E\u003C/ul\u003E\n\u003Cp\u003EVaše datoteke na disku se ne diraju. Da ponovno uzmete stari predmjer, otvorite njegov \u003Ccode\u003E.takeoff.json\u003C/code\u003E i PDF-ove: pogledajte \u003Ca href=\"/tutorials/takeoffcraft/save-and-reopen\" data-topic=\"takeoffcraft/save-and-reopen\"\u003ESpremanje i ponovno otvaranje predmjera\u003C/a\u003E.\u003C/p\u003E\n\u003Caside class=\"hc hc-note\"\u003E\u003Cp class=\"hc-label\"\u003ENote\u003C/p\u003E\n\u003Cp\u003ESvaki novi predmjer započinje bez stavki. Da prenesete stavke, prvo ih kopirajte: \u003Cspan class=\"hui\"\u003EKopiraj stavku\u003C/span\u003E pod \u003Cspan class=\"hui\"\u003EStavke\u003C/span\u003E (ili kopirajte oznake, koje nose svoje stavke), zatim \u003Cspan class=\"hui\"\u003EZalijepi\u003C/span\u003E u novom predmjeru. Pogledajte \u003Ca href=\"/tutorials/takeoffcraft/copy-paste\" data-topic=\"takeoffcraft/copy-paste\"\u003EKopiranje, lijepljenje i dupliciranje oznaka\u003C/a\u003E. Za stavke koje koristite na svakom poslu držite ih u \u003Ca href=\"/tutorials/takeoffcraft/price-library\" data-topic=\"takeoffcraft/price-library\"\u003Ecjeniku\u003C/a\u003E i dodajte ih odatle, ili dodajte \u003Ca href=\"/tutorials/takeoffcraft/trade-packs\" data-topic=\"takeoffcraft/trade-packs\"\u003Epaket stavki za struku\u003C/a\u003E.\u003C/p\u003E\n\u003C/aside\u003E","text":"Novo zatvara sve PDF-ove i započinje prazan predmjer na istoj stranici. Spremite trenutačni predmjer ako ga želite zadržati: Spremi predmjer ili Ctrl+S. Odaberite Novo u grupi Datoteka. Ako postoje nespremljene promjene, TakeoffDesk pita Nespremljeni predmjer: odaberite Prvo spremi predmjer (preuzima projekt, pa čisti), Odbaci promjene ili Odustani. Prozor se vraća u prazno stanje: nema PDF-ova, stavki, oznaka ni mjerila. Statusna traka kaže „Novi predmjer. Otvorite PDF-ove za početak.“ Što se briše: svaki otvoreni PDF, njegovi listovi i sličice, stavke, sklopovi, oznake i mjerila, zumiranje i položaj svakog lista, povijest poništavanja (ne možete poništiti Novo), način luka te svaka pretraga ili pregled autobrojanja. Vaše datoteke na disku se ne diraju. Da ponovno uzmete stari predmjer, otvorite njegov .takeoff.json i PDF-ove: pogledajte Spremanje i ponovno otvaranje predmjera. Svaki novi predmjer započinje bez stavki. Da prenesete stavke, prvo ih kopirajte: Kopiraj stavku pod Stavke (ili kopirajte oznake, koje nose svoje stavke), zatim Zalijepi u novom predmjeru. Pogledajte Kopiranje, lijepljenje i dupliciranje oznaka. Za stavke koje koristite na svakom poslu držite ih u cjeniku i dodajte ih odatle, ili dodajte paket stavki za struku.","lang":"hr"},{"slug":"usd","scope":"takeoffcraft","title":"Izvoz 3D prikaza provjere kao USD","summary":"Zapišite zidove, ploče, limove i dionice 3D prikaza provjere kao USD paket, svaki s njegovom stavkom i količinom.","section":"tasks","order":140,"keywords":["usd","usdz","openusd","izvoz","3d","prikaz provjere","zidovi","ploče","limovi","renderiranje"],"headings":[],"html":"\u003Cp\u003EU 3D prikazu provjere odaberite \u003Cspan class=\"hui\"\u003EUSD paket (.usdz)\u003C/span\u003E pored \u003Cspan class=\"hui\"\u003EGLB\u003C/span\u003E.\u003C/p\u003E\n\u003Cp\u003ESvaki objekt (zid, ploča, lim, stup za brojanje ili dionica) je jedan objekt u datoteci, nazvan prema svojoj stavki, i nosi naziv stavke i količinu koju je prikaz izmjerio. Ploče i limovi su prozirni kao u prikazu. Datoteka je u metrima, s osi Z prema gore.\u003C/p\u003E","text":"U 3D prikazu provjere odaberite USD paket (.usdz) pored GLB. Svaki objekt (zid, ploča, lim, stup za brojanje ili dionica) je jedan objekt u datoteci, nazvan prema svojoj stavki, i nosi naziv stavke i količinu koju je prikaz izmjerio. Ploče i limovi su prozirni kao u prikazu. Datoteka je u metrima, s osi Z prema gore.","lang":"hr"},{"slug":"coming-from","scope":"takeoffcraft","title":"Coming from other takeoff software","summary":"How the habits of dedicated takeoff programs and PDF markup tools map to TakeoffDesk, and the differences that trip people up.","section":"switching","order":10,"keywords":["switching","migrate","conditions","parts","measurement tools","markups list","quantity link","takeoff habits","differences","compare"],"headings":[{"id":"habits-mapped","text":"Habits mapped","level":2},{"id":"differences-that-trip-people-up","text":"Differences that trip people up","level":2},{"id":"not-here-yet","text":"Not here yet","level":2}],"html":"\u003Cp\u003EIf you have done takeoff in PlanSwift or with the measurement tools in Bluebeam Revu, most of TakeoffDesk will feel familiar: a plan set, a scale per sheet, things you measure, and a priced total. The way the pieces fit together is different in places, and those places are below.\u003C/p\u003E\n\u003Cp\u003EIf you know PlanSwift or On-Screen Takeoff, pick the \u003Cspan class=\"hui\"\u003ETakeoff desk\u003C/span\u003E menu style in \u003Cspan class=\"hui\"\u003ESettings\u003C/span\u003E › \u003Cspan class=\"hui\"\u003ETakeoffDesk\u003C/span\u003E › \u003Cspan class=\"hui\"\u003EMenus, keys and mouse\u003C/span\u003E: a menu bar with File, Edit, View, Scale, Takeoff, Items, Markup and Export over a row of the takeoff tools, with the scale presets on the sheet bar. See \u003Ca href=\"/tutorials/takeoffcraft/menus-keys-and-mouse\" data-topic=\"takeoffcraft/menus-keys-and-mouse\"\u003EMenus, keys and mouse\u003C/a\u003E.\u003C/p\u003E\n\u003Ch2 id=\"habits-mapped\"\u003EHabits mapped\u003C/h2\u003E\n\u003Cdiv class=\"ht-wrap\"\u003E\u003Ctable class=\"ht\"\u003E\u003Cthead\u003E\u003Ctr\u003E\u003Cth scope=\"col\"\u003EYou are used to\u003C/th\u003E\u003Cth scope=\"col\"\u003EIn TakeoffDesk\u003C/th\u003E\u003C/tr\u003E\u003C/thead\u003E\u003Ctbody\u003E\u003Ctr\u003E\u003Ctd\u003EOpening a job or project that stores the plans (PlanSwift)\u003C/td\u003E\u003Ctd\u003EOpen the PDFs and the \u003Ccode\u003E.takeoff.json\u003C/code\u003E project side by side. The project stores only the takeoff; the PDFs stay your own files.\u003C/td\u003E\u003C/tr\u003E\u003Ctr\u003E\u003Ctd\u003EA markups list with notes, clouds and highlights (Bluebeam)\u003C/td\u003E\u003Ctd\u003E\u003Cspan class=\"hui\"\u003EMarkup\u003C/span\u003E on the sheet bar: notes, clouds and highlights with a status (Open, Answered, Closed), listed under \u003Cstrong\u003EMarkups\u003C/strong\u003E, drawn in the marked PDF. See \u003Ca href=\"/tutorials/takeoffcraft/markups\" data-topic=\"takeoffcraft/markups\"\u003ENotes, clouds and highlights\u003C/a\u003E.\u003C/td\u003E\u003C/tr\u003E\u003Ctr\u003E\u003Ctd\u003EMeasurements saved as markups inside the PDF (Bluebeam)\u003C/td\u003E\u003Ctd\u003EThe takeoff lives in the \u003Ccode\u003E.takeoff.json\u003C/code\u003E file. \u003Cspan class=\"hui\"\u003EMarked PDF\u003C/span\u003E writes a copy with the takeoff drawn in, for sharing; \u003Cspan class=\"hui\"\u003EPDF with the takeoff inside\u003C/span\u003E writes a copy that carries the takeoff, to reopen in TakeoffDesk.\u003C/td\u003E\u003C/tr\u003E\u003Ctr\u003E\u003Ctd\u003ETakeoff items (PlanSwift), custom measurement tools saved in the Tool Chest (Bluebeam)\u003C/td\u003E\u003Ctd\u003E\u003Cstrong\u003EItems\u003C/strong\u003E under \u003Cspan class=\"hui\"\u003EItems\u003C/span\u003E: name, type, color, unit, height or depth, waste, rates.\u003C/td\u003E\u003C/tr\u003E\u003Ctr\u003E\u003Ctd\u003EParts and assemblies with formulas (PlanSwift)\u003C/td\u003E\u003Ctd\u003EThe item&#039;s \u003Cspan class=\"hui\"\u003EAssembly\u003C/span\u003E: components with a formula using \u003Ccode\u003EL H A N P\u003C/code\u003E.\u003C/td\u003E\u003C/tr\u003E\u003Ctr\u003E\u003Ctd\u003ESetting the page scale, or calibrating (both)\u003C/td\u003E\u003Ctd\u003E\u003Cspan class=\"hui\"\u003EPreset\u003C/span\u003E list or \u003Cspan class=\"hui\"\u003ECalibrate\u003C/span\u003E in the \u003Cspan class=\"hui\"\u003EScale\u003C/span\u003E group, per sheet. \u003Cspan class=\"hui\"\u003ECheck\u003C/span\u003E measures a known dimension.\u003C/td\u003E\u003C/tr\u003E\u003Ctr\u003E\u003Ctd\u003EApplying one scale to a page range\u003C/td\u003E\u003Ctd\u003ENot yet: set each sheet.\u003C/td\u003E\u003C/tr\u003E\u003Ctr\u003E\u003Ctd\u003EViewports with different scales on one sheet (Bluebeam)\u003C/td\u003E\u003Ctd\u003ENot yet: one scale per sheet.\u003C/td\u003E\u003C/tr\u003E\u003Ctr\u003E\u003Ctd\u003EPolylength and area tools (Bluebeam), linear and area takeoff (PlanSwift)\u003C/td\u003E\u003Ctd\u003E\u003Cspan class=\"hui\"\u003ELinear\u003C/span\u003E (\u003Ckbd class=\"hk\"\u003E\u003Cspan class=\"k-mac\" title=\"L\"\u003EL\u003C/span\u003E\u003Cspan class=\"k-pc\"\u003EL\u003C/span\u003E\u003C/kbd\u003E) and \u003Cspan class=\"hui\"\u003EArea\u003C/span\u003E (\u003Ckbd class=\"hk\"\u003E\u003Cspan class=\"k-mac\" title=\"A\"\u003EA\u003C/span\u003E\u003Cspan class=\"k-pc\"\u003EA\u003C/span\u003E\u003C/kbd\u003E).\u003C/td\u003E\u003C/tr\u003E\u003Ctr\u003E\u003Ctd\u003EHolding Shift for straight lines\u003C/td\u003E\u003Ctd\u003E\u003Ckbd class=\"hk\"\u003E\u003Cspan class=\"k-mac\" title=\"Shift\"\u003E⇧\u003C/span\u003E\u003Cspan class=\"k-pc\"\u003EShift\u003C/span\u003E\u003C/kbd\u003E snaps to 45° steps, the same idea.\u003C/td\u003E\u003C/tr\u003E\u003Ctr\u003E\u003Ctd\u003ESnapping to the drawing&#039;s lines\u003C/td\u003E\u003Ctd\u003EOn by default: ends, midpoints, intersections and the nearest point on a line, with \u003Ckbd class=\"hk\"\u003E\u003Cspan class=\"k-mac\" title=\"F3\"\u003EF3\u003C/span\u003E\u003Cspan class=\"k-pc\"\u003EF3\u003C/span\u003E\u003C/kbd\u003E to turn it off, as in CAD programs.\u003C/td\u003E\u003C/tr\u003E\u003Ctr\u003E\u003Ctd\u003ECount tool (both)\u003C/td\u003E\u003Ctd\u003E\u003Cspan class=\"hui\"\u003ECount\u003C/span\u003E (\u003Ckbd class=\"hk\"\u003E\u003Cspan class=\"k-mac\" title=\"C\"\u003EC\u003C/span\u003E\u003Cspan class=\"k-pc\"\u003EC\u003C/span\u003E\u003C/kbd\u003E).\u003C/td\u003E\u003C/tr\u003E\u003Ctr\u003E\u003Ctd\u003EVisual search for symbols (Bluebeam)\u003C/td\u003E\u003Ctd\u003E\u003Cspan class=\"hui\"\u003EAuto count\u003C/span\u003E (\u003Ckbd class=\"hk\"\u003E\u003Cspan class=\"k-mac\" title=\"S\"\u003ES\u003C/span\u003E\u003Cspan class=\"k-pc\"\u003ES\u003C/span\u003E\u003C/kbd\u003E): box one symbol, review, add.\u003C/td\u003E\u003C/tr\u003E\u003Ctr\u003E\u003Ctd\u003ECut-outs or deductions in areas\u003C/td\u003E\u003Ctd\u003E\u003Cspan class=\"hui\"\u003ECut-out\u003C/span\u003E (\u003Ckbd class=\"hk\"\u003E\u003Cspan class=\"k-mac\" title=\"X\"\u003EX\u003C/span\u003E\u003Cspan class=\"k-pc\"\u003EX\u003C/span\u003E\u003C/kbd\u003E) on a selected area, and round cut-outs.\u003C/td\u003E\u003C/tr\u003E\u003Ctr\u003E\u003Ctd\u003EDeductions on linear runs\u003C/td\u003E\u003Ctd\u003EDraw the run straight through and press \u003Ckbd class=\"hk\"\u003E\u003Cspan class=\"k-mac\" title=\"E\"\u003EE\u003C/span\u003E\u003Cspan class=\"k-pc\"\u003EE\u003C/span\u003E\u003C/kbd\u003E (\u003Cspan class=\"hui\"\u003EDeduct\u003C/span\u003E) for the opening. See \u003Ca href=\"/tutorials/takeoffcraft/measure-linear\" data-topic=\"takeoffcraft/measure-linear\"\u003EMeasure linear runs\u003C/a\u003E.\u003C/td\u003E\u003C/tr\u003E\u003Ctr\u003E\u003Ctd\u003EArc segments in a polyline\u003C/td\u003E\u003Ctd\u003E\u003Cspan class=\"hui\"\u003EArc\u003C/span\u003E (\u003Ckbd class=\"hk\"\u003E\u003Cspan class=\"k-mac\" title=\"R\"\u003ER\u003C/span\u003E\u003Cspan class=\"k-pc\"\u003ER\u003C/span\u003E\u003C/kbd\u003E): click a point on the curve, then its end.\u003C/td\u003E\u003C/tr\u003E\u003Ctr\u003E\u003Ctd\u003EThe Markups list with quantity columns (Bluebeam)\u003C/td\u003E\u003Ctd\u003EThe \u003Cspan class=\"hui\"\u003EQuantities\u003C/span\u003E table, \u003Cspan class=\"hui\"\u003EBy item\u003C/span\u003E or \u003Cspan class=\"hui\"\u003EBy sheet\u003C/span\u003E.\u003C/td\u003E\u003C/tr\u003E\u003Ctr\u003E\u003Ctd\u003EEstimating grid with pricing (PlanSwift)\u003C/td\u003E\u003Ctd\u003EThe same table: waste, material and labor per unit, extended totals, \u003Cspan class=\"hui\"\u003EJob total\u003C/span\u003E.\u003C/td\u003E\u003C/tr\u003E\u003Ctr\u003E\u003Ctd\u003EExporting to Excel\u003C/td\u003E\u003Ctd\u003E\u003Cspan class=\"hui\"\u003EXLSX\u003C/span\u003E with live formulas, or \u003Cspan class=\"hui\"\u003ECSV\u003C/span\u003E.\u003C/td\u003E\u003C/tr\u003E\u003Ctr\u003E\u003Ctd\u003EEscape to stop a tool\u003C/td\u003E\u003Ctd\u003E\u003Ckbd class=\"hk\"\u003E\u003Cspan class=\"k-mac\" title=\"Esc\"\u003EEsc\u003C/span\u003E\u003Cspan class=\"k-pc\"\u003EEsc\u003C/span\u003E\u003C/kbd\u003E cancels and returns to \u003Cspan class=\"hui\"\u003ESelect\u003C/span\u003E.\u003C/td\u003E\u003C/tr\u003E\u003Ctr\u003E\u003Ctd\u003ERight-click to finish\u003C/td\u003E\u003Ctd\u003ERight-click finishes a run or closes an area here too. There is no right-click menu.\u003C/td\u003E\u003C/tr\u003E\u003C/tbody\u003E\u003C/table\u003E\u003C/div\u003E\n\u003Ch2 id=\"differences-that-trip-people-up\"\u003EDifferences that trip people up\u003C/h2\u003E\n\u003Cp\u003E\u003Cstrong\u003EThe takeoff is not inside your PDF.\u003C/strong\u003E Nothing you do changes your PDFs. Save the \u003Ccode\u003E.takeoff.json\u003C/code\u003E file and keep it with the drawings. Sending someone the marked PDF does not send them an editable takeoff: send the project file and the original PDFs, or a \u003Ca href=\"/tutorials/takeoffcraft/save-and-reopen#keep-the-takeoff-inside-the-pdf\" data-topic=\"takeoffcraft/save-and-reopen\" data-hash=\"keep-the-takeoff-inside-the-pdf\"\u003EPDF with the takeoff inside\u003C/a\u003E.\u003C/p\u003E\n\u003Cp\u003E\u003Cstrong\u003EPDFs are matched by contents, not by name.\u003C/strong\u003E A revised sheet saved over the old file name is a new file to TakeoffDesk, with no scale and no marks. Your old marks stay on the old version and keep counting. See \u003Ca href=\"/tutorials/takeoffcraft/save-and-reopen#when-a-pdf-has-changed\" data-topic=\"takeoffcraft/save-and-reopen\" data-hash=\"when-a-pdf-has-changed\"\u003ESave and reopen a takeoff\u003C/a\u003E.\u003C/p\u003E\n\u003Cp\u003E\u003Cstrong\u003EUnscaled marks are left out, not counted as zero.\u003C/strong\u003E If a sheet has no scale, its runs and areas do not count, and the table says &quot;Incomplete&quot;. In many programs you would just see 0. See \u003Ca href=\"/tutorials/takeoffcraft/set-the-scale#why-unscaled-sheets-are-not-counted-as-zero\" data-topic=\"takeoffcraft/set-the-scale\" data-hash=\"why-unscaled-sheets-are-not-counted-as-zero\"\u003ESet the scale\u003C/a\u003E.\u003C/p\u003E\n\u003Cp\u003E\u003Cstrong\u003EThere is no page-size guessing.\u003C/strong\u003E Presets assume the PDF is printed at full size. A half-size or &quot;fit to page&quot; PDF needs \u003Cspan class=\"hui\"\u003ECalibrate\u003C/span\u003E. Always use \u003Cspan class=\"hui\"\u003ECheck\u003C/span\u003E.\u003C/p\u003E\n\u003Cp\u003E\u003Cstrong\u003EOne item, one main type, more if you ask.\u003C/strong\u003E An item is linear, area or count, and its type locks once it has marks. A condition that gives you both an area and its perimeter is an area item: its perimeter is the \u003Ccode\u003EP\u003C/code\u003E variable. A wall with both length and area is a linear item with a height. For a multi-condition item, such as a room with a floor, a base and doors, tick the other kinds under \u003Cstrong\u003EAlso measure\u003C/strong\u003E: each is priced on its own row. See \u003Ca href=\"/tutorials/takeoffcraft/create-items#one-item-several-kinds-of-marks\" data-topic=\"takeoffcraft/create-items\" data-hash=\"one-item-several-kinds-of-marks\"\u003EOne item, several kinds of marks\u003C/a\u003E.\u003C/p\u003E\n\u003Cp\u003E\u003Cstrong\u003EFormulas run on totals.\u003C/strong\u003E Assembly formulas use the item&#039;s totals across every sheet, not each run separately. \u003Ccode\u003EN\u003C/code\u003E (the number of runs or areas) is there for per-run extras, like one extra stud per wall.\u003C/p\u003E\n\u003Cp\u003E\u003Cstrong\u003EPerimeter includes cut-outs.\u003C/strong\u003E An area&#039;s \u003Ccode\u003EP\u003C/code\u003E adds the edges of its holes. See \u003Ca href=\"/tutorials/takeoffcraft/measure-areas#read-the-area\" data-topic=\"takeoffcraft/measure-areas\" data-hash=\"read-the-area\"\u003EMeasure areas with cut-outs\u003C/a\u003E.\u003C/p\u003E\n\u003Cp\u003E\u003Cstrong\u003EDragging pans.\u003C/strong\u003E A left-button drag on the sheet pans, in every tool except \u003Cspan class=\"hui\"\u003EAuto count\u003C/span\u003E. You never need to switch to a pan tool. The wheel zooms; it does not scroll.\u003C/p\u003E\n\u003Cp\u003E\u003Cstrong\u003EA recovery copy, not a cloud.\u003C/strong\u003E TakeoffDesk keeps a copy of your work in this browser and offers it back after a crash (\u003Ca href=\"/tutorials/takeoffcraft/save-and-reopen#if-the-tab-or-the-browser-stops\" data-topic=\"takeoffcraft/save-and-reopen\" data-hash=\"if-the-tab-or-the-browser-stops\"\u003EIf the tab or the browser stops\u003C/a\u003E), but the takeoff is yours to save: \u003Ckbd class=\"hk\"\u003E\u003Cspan class=\"k-mac\" title=\"Command S\"\u003E⌘S\u003C/span\u003E\u003Cspan class=\"k-pc\"\u003ECtrl+S\u003C/span\u003E\u003C/kbd\u003E. Cloud saving is not available yet.\u003C/p\u003E\n\u003Cp\u003E\u003Cstrong\u003EEverything is in the browser.\u003C/strong\u003E There is nothing to install, and the plans are never uploaded.\u003C/p\u003E\n\u003Ch2 id=\"not-here-yet\"\u003ENot here yet\u003C/h2\u003E\n\u003Cp\u003EPer-sheet scale regions are not built yet. See \u003Ca href=\"/tutorials/takeoffcraft/not-built-yet\" data-topic=\"takeoffcraft/not-built-yet\"\u003EWhat is not built yet\u003C/a\u003E for the full list and what to do instead.\u003C/p\u003E","text":"If you have done takeoff in PlanSwift or with the measurement tools in Bluebeam Revu, most of TakeoffDesk will feel familiar: a plan set, a scale per sheet, things you measure, and a priced total. The way the pieces fit together is different in places, and those places are below. If you know PlanSwift or On-Screen Takeoff, pick the Takeoff desk menu style in Settings › TakeoffDesk › Menus, keys and mouse: a menu bar with File, Edit, View, Scale, Takeoff, Items, Markup and Export over a row of the takeoff tools, with the scale presets on the sheet bar. See Menus, keys and mouse. Habits mapped You are used to In TakeoffDesk Opening a job or project that stores the plans (PlanSwift) Open the PDFs and the .takeoff.json project side by side. The project stores only the takeoff; the PDFs stay your own files. A markups list with notes, clouds and highlights (Bluebeam) Markup on the sheet bar: notes, clouds and highlights with a status (Open, Answered, Closed), listed under Markups, drawn in the marked PDF. See Notes, clouds and highlights. Measurements saved as markups inside the PDF (Bluebeam) The takeoff lives in the .takeoff.json file. Marked PDF writes a copy with the takeoff drawn in, for sharing; PDF with the takeoff inside writes a copy that carries the takeoff, to reopen in TakeoffDesk. Takeoff items (PlanSwift), custom measurement tools saved in the Tool Chest (Bluebeam) Items under Items: name, type, color, unit, height or depth, waste, rates. Parts and assemblies with formulas (PlanSwift) The item's Assembly: components with a formula using L H A N P. Setting the page scale, or calibrating (both) Preset list or Calibrate in the Scale group, per sheet. Check measures a known dimension. Applying one scale to a page range Not yet: set each sheet. Viewports with different scales on one sheet (Bluebeam) Not yet: one scale per sheet. Polylength and area tools (Bluebeam), linear and area takeoff (PlanSwift) Linear (L) and Area (A). Holding Shift for straight lines Shift snaps to 45° steps, the same idea. Snapping to the drawing's lines On by default: ends, midpoints, intersections and the nearest point on a line, with F3 to turn it off, as in CAD programs. Count tool (both) Count (C). Visual search for symbols (Bluebeam) Auto count (S): box one symbol, review, add. Cut-outs or deductions in areas Cut-out (X) on a selected area, and round cut-outs. Deductions on linear runs Draw the run straight through and press E (Deduct) for the opening. See Measure linear runs. Arc segments in a polyline Arc (R): click a point on the curve, then its end. The Markups list with quantity columns (Bluebeam) The Quantities table, By item or By sheet. Estimating grid with pricing (PlanSwift) The same table: waste, material and labor per unit, extended totals, Job total. Exporting to Excel XLSX with live formulas, or CSV. Escape to stop a tool Esc cancels and returns to Select. Right-click to finish Right-click finishes a run or closes an area here too. There is no right-click menu. Differences that trip people up The takeoff is not inside your PDF. Nothing you do changes your PDFs. Save the .takeoff.json file and keep it with the drawings. Sending someone the marked PDF does not send them an editable takeoff: send the project file and the original PDFs, or a PDF with the takeoff inside. PDFs are matched by contents, not by name. A revised sheet saved over the old file name is a new file to TakeoffDesk, with no scale and no marks. Your old marks stay on the old version and keep counting. See Save and reopen a takeoff. Unscaled marks are left out, not counted as zero. If a sheet has no scale, its runs and areas do not count, and the table says \"Incomplete\". In many programs you would just see 0. See Set the scale. There is no page-size guessing. Presets assume the PDF is printed at full size. A half-size or \"fit to page\" PDF needs Calibrate. Always use Check. One item, one main type, more if you ask. An item is linear, area or count, and its type locks once it has marks. A condition that gives you both an area and its perimeter is an area item: its perimeter is the P variable. A wall with both length and area is a linear item with a height. For a multi-condition item, such as a room with a floor, a base and doors, tick the other kinds under Also measure: each is priced on its own row. See One item, several kinds of marks. Formulas run on totals. Assembly formulas use the item's totals across every sheet, not each run separately. N (the number of runs or areas) is there for per-run extras, like one extra stud per wall. Perimeter includes cut-outs. An area's P adds the edges of its holes. See Measure areas with cut-outs. Dragging pans. A left-button drag on the sheet pans, in every tool except Auto count. You never need to switch to a pan tool. The wheel zooms; it does not scroll. A recovery copy, not a cloud. TakeoffDesk keeps a copy of your work in this browser and offers it back after a crash (If the tab or the browser stops), but the takeoff is yours to save: Ctrl+S. Cloud saving is not available yet. Everything is in the browser. There is nothing to install, and the plans are never uploaded. Not here yet Per-sheet scale regions are not built yet. See What is not built yet for the full list and what to do instead.","lang":"en"},{"slug":"settings","scope":"takeoffcraft","title":"TakeoffDesk settings","summary":"Show inches to 1/16, 1/8 or 1/4, start new items with a waste percentage, choose where the Auto count slider starts, snap to the drawing's lines or to 45° without holding Shift, set how wide a door Room fill closes, and pick the 3D view's corner indicator.","section":"reference","order":5,"keywords":["settings","preferences","options","precision","fractions","inches","rounding","waste","default waste","auto count","threshold","match","slider","snap","45","angle","shift","view cube","axis icon","corner indicator","3d"],"headings":[{"id":"feet-and-inches","text":"Feet and inches","level":2},{"id":"waste-to-start-with","text":"Waste to start with","level":2},{"id":"auto-count-where-the-match-slider-starts","text":"Auto count: where the match slider starts","level":2},{"id":"snap-to-the-drawing-s-own-lines","text":"Snap to the drawing's own lines","level":2},{"id":"room-fill-how-wide-an-opening-it-closes","text":"Room fill: how wide an opening it closes","level":2},{"id":"snap-to-45-without-holding-shift","text":"Snap to 45° without holding Shift","level":2},{"id":"count-marker-size","text":"Count marker size","level":2},{"id":"corner-indicator","text":"Corner indicator","level":2},{"id":"path-tool-the-largest-gap-it-joins","text":"Path tool: the largest gap it joins","level":2}],"html":"\u003Cp\u003EOpen \u003Cspan class=\"hui\"\u003ESettings\u003C/span\u003E with the gear in the app bar or \u003Ckbd class=\"hk\"\u003E\u003Cspan class=\"k-mac\" title=\"Command ,\"\u003E⌘,\u003C/span\u003E\u003Cspan class=\"k-pc\"\u003ECtrl+,\u003C/span\u003E\u003C/kbd\u003E. The first tab, \u003Cspan class=\"hui\"\u003ETakeoffDesk\u003C/span\u003E, holds the settings that belong to this app; \u003Cspan class=\"hui\"\u003EGeneral\u003C/span\u003E holds the general ones (theme, panels, toolbar). TakeoffDesk&#039;s settings exist only in the app: you change them here, and this browser remembers them. \u003Cspan class=\"hui\"\u003EReset TakeoffDesk settings\u003C/span\u003E puts them back to the start.\u003C/p\u003E\n\u003Ch2 id=\"feet-and-inches\"\u003EFeet and inches\u003C/h2\u003E\n\u003Cp\u003EShow lengths to the nearest \u003Cstrong\u003E1/16&quot;\u003C/strong\u003E (the start), \u003Cstrong\u003E1/8&quot;\u003C/strong\u003E or \u003Cstrong\u003E1/4&quot;\u003C/strong\u003E. This changes how lengths read on the sheet, in the panels, in the quantities and in the status bar.\u003C/p\u003E\n\u003Cp\u003EOnly the display is rounded. Quantities, costs and the exports are worked out from the exact lengths, and the exports always show 1/16&quot;.\u003C/p\u003E\n\u003Ch2 id=\"waste-to-start-with\"\u003EWaste to start with\u003C/h2\u003E\n\u003Cp\u003EThe waste percentage every new item starts with: 0% (the start), 2%, 3%, 5%, 7.5%, 10%, 15% or 20%. You can still type another waste for each item, in the item editor or straight in the quantities table. Items you already have keep their own waste.\u003C/p\u003E\n\u003Ch2 id=\"auto-count-where-the-match-slider-starts\"\u003EAuto count: where the match slider starts\u003C/h2\u003E\n\u003Cp\u003EWhere the \u003Cspan class=\"hui\"\u003EMatch\u003C/span\u003E slider sits when an \u003Ca href=\"/tutorials/takeoffcraft/auto-count\" data-topic=\"takeoffcraft/auto-count\"\u003EAuto count\u003C/a\u003E search finishes, from 50% to 95%; 75% is the start. Lower offers more look-alikes for you to reject; higher offers fewer. You can still move the slider during each review.\u003C/p\u003E\n\u003Ch2 id=\"snap-to-the-drawing-s-own-lines\"\u003ESnap to the drawing&#039;s own lines\u003C/h2\u003E\n\u003Cp\u003EOn at the start. While you measure or calibrate, a point near a line of the PDF jumps to its end, its midpoint, a crossing or the nearest point on it. \u003Ckbd class=\"hk\"\u003E\u003Cspan class=\"k-mac\" title=\"F3\"\u003EF3\u003C/span\u003E\u003Cspan class=\"k-pc\"\u003EF3\u003C/span\u003E\u003C/kbd\u003E and \u003Cspan class=\"hui\"\u003ESnap\u003C/span\u003E in the status bar turn it on and off too. More: \u003Ca href=\"/tutorials/takeoffcraft/snap-to-the-drawing\" data-topic=\"takeoffcraft/snap-to-the-drawing\"\u003ESnap to the drawing&#039;s lines\u003C/a\u003E.\u003C/p\u003E\n\u003Ch2 id=\"room-fill-how-wide-an-opening-it-closes\"\u003ERoom fill: how wide an opening it closes\u003C/h2\u003E\n\u003Cp\u003E\u003Cspan class=\"hui\"\u003ERoom fill closes openings up to\u003C/span\u003E sets how wide a door opening or gap the \u003Cspan class=\"hui\"\u003ERoom\u003C/span\u003E tool treats as closed: 3&#039;-0&quot; to 8&#039;-0&quot;, 4&#039;-0&quot; at the start. Wider than your widest door lets a room run into the next one; narrower than a door leaves the room open. See \u003Ca href=\"/tutorials/takeoffcraft/measure-areas#fill-a-room-with-one-click\" data-topic=\"takeoffcraft/measure-areas\" data-hash=\"fill-a-room-with-one-click\"\u003EFill a room with one click\u003C/a\u003E.\u003C/p\u003E\n\u003Ch2 id=\"snap-to-45-without-holding-shift\"\u003ESnap to 45° without holding Shift\u003C/h2\u003E\n\u003Cp\u003EOff at the start. When it is on, runs, outlines, cut-outs and dragged corners go at 0°, 45°, 90° or 135° from the last point without holding \u003Ckbd class=\"hk\"\u003E\u003Cspan class=\"k-mac\" title=\"Shift\"\u003E⇧\u003C/span\u003E\u003Cspan class=\"k-pc\"\u003EShift\u003C/span\u003E\u003C/kbd\u003E; hold \u003Ckbd class=\"hk\"\u003E\u003Cspan class=\"k-mac\" title=\"Shift\"\u003E⇧\u003C/span\u003E\u003Cspan class=\"k-pc\"\u003EShift\u003C/span\u003E\u003C/kbd\u003E to click at any angle. The status bar then reads &quot;Snaps to 45°; Shift frees the angle&quot;. The point you click on an arc&#039;s curve and circles are never snapped; an arc&#039;s end is.\u003C/p\u003E\n\u003Ch2 id=\"count-marker-size\"\u003ECount marker size\u003C/h2\u003E\n\u003Cp\u003EHow big the count dots are: \u003Cspan class=\"hui\"\u003EExtra small\u003C/span\u003E, \u003Cspan class=\"hui\"\u003ESmall\u003C/span\u003E, \u003Cspan class=\"hui\"\u003EMedium\u003C/span\u003E (the start: the size the dots always had) or \u003Cspan class=\"hui\"\u003ELarge\u003C/span\u003E. The size holds on screen at every zoom, and the marked PDF draws each dot at the same size on paper, whatever the sheet size, so the PDF at 100% looks as the screen does. More: \u003Ca href=\"/tutorials/takeoffcraft/count-by-hand#dot-size-on-screen-and-in-the-pdf\" data-topic=\"takeoffcraft/count-by-hand\" data-hash=\"dot-size-on-screen-and-in-the-pdf\"\u003ECount by hand\u003C/a\u003E.\u003C/p\u003E\n\u003Ch2 id=\"corner-indicator\"\u003ECorner indicator\u003C/h2\u003E\n\u003Cp\u003EFor the \u003Ca href=\"/tutorials/takeoffcraft/check-in-3d\" data-topic=\"takeoffcraft/check-in-3d\"\u003E3D check view\u003C/a\u003E only: \u003Cspan class=\"hui\"\u003EView cube\u003C/span\u003E (the start: a cube at the top right to click, drag and turn), \u003Cspan class=\"hui\"\u003EAxis icon\u003C/span\u003E (a small X, Y, Z marker at the bottom right) or \u003Cspan class=\"hui\"\u003ENone\u003C/span\u003E. It changes at once and is kept in this browser. The flat sheet never shows one.\u003C/p\u003E\n\u003Ch2 id=\"path-tool-the-largest-gap-it-joins\"\u003EPath tool: the largest gap it joins\u003C/h2\u003E\n\u003Cp\u003E\u003Cspan class=\"hui\"\u003EPath tool: largest gap to join\u003C/span\u003E is how far apart two line ends can be and still count as one path, in PDF points (0.05 to 60; 1.5 at the start). A drawing&#039;s lines often stop a hair short of each other. Larger joins more; smaller keeps lines apart. \u003Ckbd class=\"hk\"\u003E\u003Cspan class=\"k-mac\" title=\"[\"\u003E[\u003C/span\u003E\u003Cspan class=\"k-pc\"\u003E[\u003C/span\u003E\u003C/kbd\u003E and \u003Ckbd class=\"hk\"\u003E\u003Cspan class=\"k-mac\" title=\"]\"\u003E]\u003C/span\u003E\u003Cspan class=\"k-pc\"\u003E]\u003C/span\u003E\u003C/kbd\u003E change it while you pick, and this field follows. See \u003Ca href=\"/tutorials/takeoffcraft/pick-the-lines\" data-topic=\"takeoffcraft/pick-the-lines\"\u003EPick the lines\u003C/a\u003E.\u003C/p\u003E","text":"Open Settings with the gear in the app bar or Ctrl+,. The first tab, TakeoffDesk, holds the settings that belong to this app; General holds the general ones (theme, panels, toolbar). TakeoffDesk's settings exist only in the app: you change them here, and this browser remembers them. Reset TakeoffDesk settings puts them back to the start. Feet and inches Show lengths to the nearest 1/16\" (the start), 1/8\" or 1/4\". This changes how lengths read on the sheet, in the panels, in the quantities and in the status bar. Only the display is rounded. Quantities, costs and the exports are worked out from the exact lengths, and the exports always show 1/16\". Waste to start with The waste percentage every new item starts with: 0% (the start), 2%, 3%, 5%, 7.5%, 10%, 15% or 20%. You can still type another waste for each item, in the item editor or straight in the quantities table. Items you already have keep their own waste. Auto count: where the match slider starts Where the Match slider sits when an Auto count search finishes, from 50% to 95%; 75% is the start. Lower offers more look-alikes for you to reject; higher offers fewer. You can still move the slider during each review. Snap to the drawing's own lines On at the start. While you measure or calibrate, a point near a line of the PDF jumps to its end, its midpoint, a crossing or the nearest point on it. F3 and Snap in the status bar turn it on and off too. More: Snap to the drawing's lines. Room fill: how wide an opening it closes Room fill closes openings up to sets how wide a door opening or gap the Room tool treats as closed: 3'-0\" to 8'-0\", 4'-0\" at the start. Wider than your widest door lets a room run into the next one; narrower than a door leaves the room open. See Fill a room with one click. Snap to 45° without holding Shift Off at the start. When it is on, runs, outlines, cut-outs and dragged corners go at 0°, 45°, 90° or 135° from the last point without holding Shift; hold Shift to click at any angle. The status bar then reads \"Snaps to 45°; Shift frees the angle\". The point you click on an arc's curve and circles are never snapped; an arc's end is. Count marker size How big the count dots are: Extra small, Small, Medium (the start: the size the dots always had) or Large. The size holds on screen at every zoom, and the marked PDF draws each dot at the same size on paper, whatever the sheet size, so the PDF at 100% looks as the screen does. More: Count by hand. Corner indicator For the 3D check view only: View cube (the start: a cube at the top right to click, drag and turn), Axis icon (a small X, Y, Z marker at the bottom right) or None. It changes at once and is kept in this browser. The flat sheet never shows one. Path tool: the largest gap it joins Path tool: largest gap to join is how far apart two line ends can be and still count as one path, in PDF points (0.05 to 60; 1.5 at the start). A drawing's lines often stop a hair short of each other. Larger joins more; smaller keeps lines apart. [ and ] change it while you pick, and this field follows. See Pick the lines.","lang":"en"},{"slug":"menus-keys-and-mouse","scope":"takeoffcraft","title":"Izbornici, tipke i miš","summary":"Odaberite stil izbornika koji odgovara načinu na koji već radite, dodijelite bilo kojoj naredbi vlastitu tipku, premjestite naredbe među izbornicima i odredite što rade kotačić i tipke miša.","section":"reference","order":6,"keywords":["stil izbornika","izbornici","traka izbornika","vrpca","kartice vrpce","traka alata","prečaci tipkovnice","tipke","prilagodi","preraspodijeli tipke","miš","kotačić","obrni","smjer zumiranja","srednja tipka","desna tipka","pomicanje","izvoz","uvoz","prebacivanje","poznato","stol za predmjer","uvjeti"],"headings":[{"id":"tri-stila","text":"Tri stila","level":2},{"id":"prilagodite-po-svojoj-mjeri","text":"Prilagodite po svojoj mjeri","level":2},{"id":"mi","text":"Miš","level":2},{"id":"ponesite-sa-sobom","text":"Ponesite sa sobom","level":2}],"html":"\u003Cp\u003ENaredbe programa TakeoffDesk jednake su bez obzira na to kako do njih dođete. \u003Cstrong\u003EStil izbornika\u003C/strong\u003E samo određuje gdje se nalaze na zaslonu, kako se zovu i koje ih tipke pokreću. Odaberite ga u \u003Cspan class=\"hui\"\u003EPostavke\u003C/span\u003E (\u003Ckbd class=\"hk\"\u003E\u003Cspan class=\"k-mac\" title=\"Command ,\"\u003E⌘,\u003C/span\u003E\u003Cspan class=\"k-pc\"\u003ECtrl+,\u003C/span\u003E\u003C/kbd\u003E) › \u003Cspan class=\"hui\"\u003ETakeoffDesk\u003C/span\u003E › \u003Cspan class=\"hui\"\u003EIzbornici, tipke i miš\u003C/span\u003E; promjena je odmah, a ovaj preglednik je pamti.\u003C/p\u003E\n\u003Ch2 id=\"tri-stila\"\u003ETri stila\u003C/h2\u003E\n\u003Cdiv class=\"ht-wrap\"\u003E\u003Ctable class=\"ht\"\u003E\u003Cthead\u003E\u003Ctr\u003E\u003Cth scope=\"col\"\u003EStil\u003C/th\u003E\u003Cth scope=\"col\"\u003EŠto dobivate\u003C/th\u003E\u003C/tr\u003E\u003C/thead\u003E\u003Ctbody\u003E\u003Ctr\u003E\u003Ctd\u003E\u003Cspan class=\"hui\"\u003ETakeoffDesk\u003C/span\u003E\u003C/td\u003E\u003Ctd\u003EVlastita traka alata programa TakeoffDesk: \u003Cspan class=\"hui\"\u003EDatoteka\u003C/span\u003E, \u003Cspan class=\"hui\"\u003EIzvoz\u003C/span\u003E, \u003Cspan class=\"hui\"\u003EMjerilo\u003C/span\u003E, \u003Cspan class=\"hui\"\u003EPredmjer\u003C/span\u003E, \u003Cspan class=\"hui\"\u003EUređivanje\u003C/span\u003E i \u003Cspan class=\"hui\"\u003EPogled\u003C/span\u003E, s jednoslovnim tipkama alata. Polazište.\u003C/td\u003E\u003C/tr\u003E\u003Ctr\u003E\u003Ctd\u003E\u003Cspan class=\"hui\"\u003EStol za predmjer\u003C/span\u003E\u003C/td\u003E\u003Ctd\u003ETraka izbornika (\u003Cspan class=\"hui\"\u003EDatoteka\u003C/span\u003E, \u003Cspan class=\"hui\"\u003EUređivanje\u003C/span\u003E, \u003Cspan class=\"hui\"\u003EPogled\u003C/span\u003E, \u003Cspan class=\"hui\"\u003EMjerilo\u003C/span\u003E, \u003Cspan class=\"hui\"\u003EPredmjer\u003C/span\u003E, \u003Cspan class=\"hui\"\u003EStavke\u003C/span\u003E, \u003Cspan class=\"hui\"\u003EMarkup\u003C/span\u003E, \u003Cspan class=\"hui\"\u003EIzvoz\u003C/span\u003E) iznad jednog reda alata za predmjer, kako ih na zaslonu slažu programi za predmjer. Stavke se na redu zovu uvjeti. Iste tipke, plus \u003Ckbd class=\"hk\"\u003E\u003Cspan class=\"k-mac\" title=\"N\"\u003EN\u003C/span\u003E\u003Cspan class=\"k-pc\"\u003EN\u003C/span\u003E\u003C/kbd\u003E za novu stavku. Unaprijed postavljena mjerila prebacuju se na traku lista, uz mjerilo lista.\u003C/td\u003E\u003C/tr\u003E\u003Ctr\u003E\u003Ctd\u003E\u003Cspan class=\"hui\"\u003EVrpca predmjera\u003C/span\u003E\u003C/td\u003E\u003Ctd\u003EKartice vrpce nazvane prema poslu: \u003Cspan class=\"hui\"\u003EPredmjer\u003C/span\u003E (mjeri, oblikuje, mjerilo, iz crteža, uvjeti), \u003Cspan class=\"hui\"\u003EUređivanje\u003C/span\u003E, \u003Cspan class=\"hui\"\u003EPogled\u003C/span\u003E, \u003Cspan class=\"hui\"\u003EMarkup\u003C/span\u003E i \u003Cspan class=\"hui\"\u003EPredračun\u003C/span\u003E (radna knjiga, označeni PDF-ovi, ponuda), s izbornikom \u003Cspan class=\"hui\"\u003EDatoteka\u003C/span\u003E i brzim redom za otvaranje, spremanje, poništavanje i ponavljanje. Alati koje koristite cijeli dan su veliki, a njihovi susjedi mali i složeni u slojeve. Iste tipke; unaprijed postavljena mjerila prebacuju se na traku lista.\u003C/td\u003E\u003C/tr\u003E\u003C/tbody\u003E\u003C/table\u003E\u003C/div\u003E\n\u003Cp\u003ESva tri stila zadržavaju tipke programa TakeoffDesk: \u003Ckbd class=\"hk\"\u003E\u003Cspan class=\"k-mac\" title=\"V\"\u003EV\u003C/span\u003E\u003Cspan class=\"k-pc\"\u003EV\u003C/span\u003E\u003C/kbd\u003E odabir, \u003Ckbd class=\"hk\"\u003E\u003Cspan class=\"k-mac\" title=\"L\"\u003EL\u003C/span\u003E\u003Cspan class=\"k-pc\"\u003EL\u003C/span\u003E\u003C/kbd\u003E linearno, \u003Ckbd class=\"hk\"\u003E\u003Cspan class=\"k-mac\" title=\"A\"\u003EA\u003C/span\u003E\u003Cspan class=\"k-pc\"\u003EA\u003C/span\u003E\u003C/kbd\u003E površina, \u003Ckbd class=\"hk\"\u003E\u003Cspan class=\"k-mac\" title=\"O\"\u003EO\u003C/span\u003E\u003Cspan class=\"k-pc\"\u003EO\u003C/span\u003E\u003C/kbd\u003E kružnica, \u003Ckbd class=\"hk\"\u003E\u003Cspan class=\"k-mac\" title=\"B\"\u003EB\u003C/span\u003E\u003Cspan class=\"k-pc\"\u003EB\u003C/span\u003E\u003C/kbd\u003E prostorija, \u003Ckbd class=\"hk\"\u003E\u003Cspan class=\"k-mac\" title=\"P\"\u003EP\u003C/span\u003E\u003Cspan class=\"k-pc\"\u003EP\u003C/span\u003E\u003C/kbd\u003E putanja (odabir linija PDF-a), \u003Ckbd class=\"hk\"\u003E\u003Cspan class=\"k-mac\" title=\"X\"\u003EX\u003C/span\u003E\u003Cspan class=\"k-pc\"\u003EX\u003C/span\u003E\u003C/kbd\u003E otvor, \u003Ckbd class=\"hk\"\u003E\u003Cspan class=\"k-mac\" title=\"C\"\u003EC\u003C/span\u003E\u003Cspan class=\"k-pc\"\u003EC\u003C/span\u003E\u003C/kbd\u003E brojanje, \u003Ckbd class=\"hk\"\u003E\u003Cspan class=\"k-mac\" title=\"S\"\u003ES\u003C/span\u003E\u003Cspan class=\"k-pc\"\u003ES\u003C/span\u003E\u003C/kbd\u003E autobrojanje, \u003Ckbd class=\"hk\"\u003E\u003Cspan class=\"k-mac\" title=\"K\"\u003EK\u003C/span\u003E\u003Cspan class=\"k-pc\"\u003EK\u003C/span\u003E\u003C/kbd\u003E kalibriranje, \u003Ckbd class=\"hk\"\u003E\u003Cspan class=\"k-mac\" title=\"D\"\u003ED\u003C/span\u003E\u003Cspan class=\"k-pc\"\u003ED\u003C/span\u003E\u003C/kbd\u003E provjera, \u003Ckbd class=\"hk\"\u003E\u003Cspan class=\"k-mac\" title=\"R\"\u003ER\u003C/span\u003E\u003Cspan class=\"k-pc\"\u003ER\u003C/span\u003E\u003C/kbd\u003E način luka, \u003Ckbd class=\"hk\"\u003E\u003Cspan class=\"k-mac\" title=\"E\"\u003EE\u003C/span\u003E\u003Cspan class=\"k-pc\"\u003EE\u003C/span\u003E\u003C/kbd\u003E način odbitka, \u003Ckbd class=\"hk\"\u003E\u003Cspan class=\"k-mac\" title=\"F\"\u003EF\u003C/span\u003E\u003Cspan class=\"k-pc\"\u003EF\u003C/span\u003E\u003C/kbd\u003E i \u003Ckbd class=\"hk\"\u003E\u003Cspan class=\"k-mac\" title=\"W\"\u003EW\u003C/span\u003E\u003Cspan class=\"k-pc\"\u003EW\u003C/span\u003E\u003C/kbd\u003E za prilagodbu, \u003Ckbd class=\"hk\"\u003E\u003Cspan class=\"k-mac\" title=\"3\"\u003E3\u003C/span\u003E\u003Cspan class=\"k-pc\"\u003E3\u003C/span\u003E\u003C/kbd\u003E 3D pregled provjere, \u003Ckbd class=\"hk\"\u003E\u003Cspan class=\"k-mac\" title=\"F3\"\u003EF3\u003C/span\u003E\u003Cspan class=\"k-pc\"\u003EF3\u003C/span\u003E\u003C/kbd\u003E hvatanje, te \u003Ckbd class=\"hk\"\u003E\u003Cspan class=\"k-mac\" title=\"Command Z\"\u003E⌘Z\u003C/span\u003E\u003Cspan class=\"k-pc\"\u003ECtrl+Z\u003C/span\u003E\u003C/kbd\u003E, \u003Ckbd class=\"hk\"\u003E\u003Cspan class=\"k-mac\" title=\"Command Y\"\u003E⌘Y\u003C/span\u003E\u003Cspan class=\"k-pc\"\u003ECtrl+Y\u003C/span\u003E\u003C/kbd\u003E, \u003Ckbd class=\"hk\"\u003E\u003Cspan class=\"k-mac\" title=\"Command S\"\u003E⌘S\u003C/span\u003E\u003Cspan class=\"k-pc\"\u003ECtrl+S\u003C/span\u003E\u003C/kbd\u003E, \u003Ckbd class=\"hk\"\u003E\u003Cspan class=\"k-mac\" title=\"Command O\"\u003E⌘O\u003C/span\u003E\u003Cspan class=\"k-pc\"\u003ECtrl+O\u003C/span\u003E\u003C/kbd\u003E, \u003Ckbd class=\"hk\"\u003E\u003Cspan class=\"k-mac\" title=\"Command C\"\u003E⌘C\u003C/span\u003E\u003Cspan class=\"k-pc\"\u003ECtrl+C\u003C/span\u003E\u003C/kbd\u003E, \u003Ckbd class=\"hk\"\u003E\u003Cspan class=\"k-mac\" title=\"Command X\"\u003E⌘X\u003C/span\u003E\u003Cspan class=\"k-pc\"\u003ECtrl+X\u003C/span\u003E\u003C/kbd\u003E, \u003Ckbd class=\"hk\"\u003E\u003Cspan class=\"k-mac\" title=\"Command V\"\u003E⌘V\u003C/span\u003E\u003Cspan class=\"k-pc\"\u003ECtrl+V\u003C/span\u003E\u003C/kbd\u003E, \u003Ckbd class=\"hk\"\u003E\u003Cspan class=\"k-mac\" title=\"Command D\"\u003E⌘D\u003C/span\u003E\u003Cspan class=\"k-pc\"\u003ECtrl+D\u003C/span\u003E\u003C/kbd\u003E, \u003Ckbd class=\"hk\"\u003E\u003Cspan class=\"k-mac\" title=\"Command A\"\u003E⌘A\u003C/span\u003E\u003Cspan class=\"k-pc\"\u003ECtrl+A\u003C/span\u003E\u003C/kbd\u003E.\u003C/p\u003E\n\u003Cp\u003EAlati trake lista (bilješke, oblaci, isticanja, usporedba, 3D) čekaju dok nije otvoren PDF; ako ih odaberete prije toga, statusna linija to kaže.\u003C/p\u003E\n\u003Caside class=\"hc hc-tip\"\u003E\u003Cp class=\"hc-label\"\u003ETip\u003C/p\u003E\n\u003Cp\u003ETipka koja pripada rasporedu programa TakeoffDesk, ali ju vaš stil dodjeljuje drugoj naredbi, ne radi ništa, a statusna linija kaže kamo je naredba otišla („U Mojim tipkama, \u003Cspan class=\"hui\"\u003EBroji\u003C/span\u003E je Ctrl+Alt+C“). \u003Ckbd class=\"hk\"\u003E\u003Cspan class=\"k-mac\" title=\"fn Delete\"\u003Efn Delete\u003C/span\u003E\u003Cspan class=\"k-pc\"\u003EDelete\u003C/span\u003E\u003C/kbd\u003E, \u003Ckbd class=\"hk\"\u003E\u003Cspan class=\"k-mac\" title=\"Esc\"\u003EEsc\u003C/span\u003E\u003Cspan class=\"k-pc\"\u003EEsc\u003C/span\u003E\u003C/kbd\u003E, \u003Ckbd class=\"hk\"\u003E\u003Cspan class=\"k-mac\" title=\"Return\"\u003EReturn\u003C/span\u003E\u003Cspan class=\"k-pc\"\u003EEnter\u003C/span\u003E\u003C/kbd\u003E, \u003Ckbd class=\"hk\"\u003E\u003Cspan class=\"k-mac\" title=\"Tab\"\u003ETab\u003C/span\u003E\u003Cspan class=\"k-pc\"\u003ETab\u003C/span\u003E\u003C/kbd\u003E, \u003Ckbd class=\"hk\"\u003E\u003Cspan class=\"k-mac\" title=\"Space\"\u003ESpace\u003C/span\u003E\u003Cspan class=\"k-pc\"\u003ESpace\u003C/span\u003E\u003C/kbd\u003E i strelice uvijek zadržavaju svoje značenje. Dok crtate dionicu ili obris, lijepite ili pregledavate autobrojanje, slova i brojevi upisane duljine ostaju uz crtež.\u003C/p\u003E\n\u003C/aside\u003E\n\u003Ch2 id=\"prilagodite-po-svojoj-mjeri\"\u003EPrilagodite po svojoj mjeri\u003C/h2\u003E\n\u003Col\u003E\u003Cli\u003EOdaberite stil koji je najbliži onome što želite, zatim kliknite \u003Cspan class=\"hui\"\u003EPrilagodi…\u003C/span\u003E.\u003C/li\u003E\u003Cli\u003ENa \u003Cspan class=\"hui\"\u003ETipke i izbornici\u003C/span\u003E pronađite naredbu (okvir za pretragu pomaže). \u003Cspan class=\"hui\"\u003EDodaj tipku\u003C/span\u003E i pritisnite tipku, ili dvije tipke zaredom za dvoslovnu tipku. Kliknite tipku da je uklonite.\u003C/li\u003E\u003Cli\u003ES trakom izbornika, \u003Cspan class=\"hui\"\u003EGdje se nalazi\u003C/span\u003E premješta naredbu u drugi izbornik ili u \u003Cspan class=\"hui\"\u003ESamo tipke\u003C/span\u003E.\u003C/li\u003E\u003Cli\u003ENa \u003Cspan class=\"hui\"\u003EMiš\u003C/span\u003E postavite kotačić i tipke koje pomiču list.\u003C/li\u003E\u003Cli\u003EDajte mu naziv i kliknite \u003Cspan class=\"hui\"\u003ESpremi\u003C/span\u003E.\u003C/li\u003E\u003C/ol\u003E\n\u003Cp\u003ESpremanjem ugrađenog stila stvara se vaša kopija („Moj stol za predmjer“); ugrađeni se nikad ne mijenja. Tipka dodijeljena dvjema naredbama prikazuje se crveno i mora se ispraviti prije spremanja.\u003C/p\u003E\n\u003Ch2 id=\"mi\"\u003EMiš\u003C/h2\u003E\n\u003Cul\u003E\u003Cli\u003E\u003Cstrong\u003EKotačić miša\u003C/strong\u003E: \u003Cspan class=\"hui\"\u003EPomicanje prema gore približava\u003C/span\u003E (početak) ili \u003Cspan class=\"hui\"\u003EPomicanje prema gore udaljava\u003C/span\u003E, i koliko brzo. Stiskanje prstima na trackpadu uvijek zumira u smjeru kretanja prstiju.\u003C/li\u003E\u003Cli\u003E\u003Cstrong\u003EPomicanje lista pomoću\u003C/strong\u003E: srednje tipke, desne tipke ili obje. Povlačenje lijevom tipkom po praznom papiru i \u003Ckbd class=\"hk\"\u003E\u003Cspan class=\"k-mac\" title=\"Space\"\u003ESpace\u003C/span\u003E\u003Cspan class=\"k-pc\"\u003ESpace\u003C/span\u003E\u003C/kbd\u003E uz povlačenje uvijek pomiču prikaz; desni klik bez povlačenja uvijek završava dionicu ili obris.\u003C/li\u003E\u003Cli\u003E\u003Cstrong\u003EPovlačenje u 3D pregledima\u003C/strong\u003E: \u003Cspan class=\"hui\"\u003EZasebno za svaki prikaz\u003C/span\u003E zadržava gumbe 3D pregleda provjere (lijevi i srednji orbitiraju, desni pomiče). Ili postavite srednju i desnu tipku na orbitiranje, pomicanje, zumiranje ili ništa; \u003Ckbd class=\"hk\"\u003E\u003Cspan class=\"k-mac\" title=\"Shift\"\u003E⇧\u003C/span\u003E\u003Cspan class=\"k-pc\"\u003EShift\u003C/span\u003E\u003C/kbd\u003E uz tipku mijenja orbitiranje i pomicanje. Lijeva tipka uvijek orbitira i odabire.\u003C/li\u003E\u003C/ul\u003E\n\u003Ch2 id=\"ponesite-sa-sobom\"\u003EPonesite sa sobom\u003C/h2\u003E\n\u003Cp\u003E\u003Cspan class=\"hui\"\u003EIzvoz\u003C/span\u003E sprema stil u uporabi kao malu datoteku \u003Ccode\u003E.ccinput.json\u003C/code\u003E; \u003Cspan class=\"hui\"\u003EUvezi…\u003C/span\u003E dodaje jednu, s drugog računala ili od kolege. Uvezena datoteka može pokazivati samo na naredbe programa TakeoffDesk: sve ostalo u njoj se izostavlja i broji u statusnoj liniji. \u003Cspan class=\"hui\"\u003EIzbriši ovaj stil\u003C/span\u003E uklanja jedan od vaših.\u003C/p\u003E\n\u003Caside class=\"hc hc-note\"\u003E\u003Cp class=\"hc-label\"\u003ENote\u003C/p\u003E\n\u003Cp\u003EOve postavke ostaju u ovom pregledniku. \u003Cspan class=\"hui\"\u003EKoristi ovaj stil u svakoj aplikaciji\u003C/span\u003E ispod kartica stila čini da se svaka aplikacija otvara u odgovarajućem stilu (vlastita traka alata, traka izbornika ili vrpca), uz promjene koje ste napravili u svakoj aplikaciji. TakeoffDesk nema stil s naredbenim redkom: kad je odabran za svaku aplikaciju, TakeoffDesk zadržava vlastitu traku alata.\u003C/p\u003E\n\u003Cp\u003E\u003Cspan class=\"hui\"\u003EVrpca predmjera\u003C/span\u003E ujedno je vrpca rasporeda \u003Cspan class=\"hui\"\u003EVrpca i preglednik projekta\u003C/span\u003E (\u003Cspan class=\"hui\"\u003EPostavke\u003C/span\u003E › \u003Cspan class=\"hui\"\u003EGlobalne\u003C/span\u003E › \u003Cspan class=\"hui\"\u003ERaspored\u003C/span\u003E): pogledajte \u003Ca href=\"/tutorials/takeoffcraft/workspace\" data-topic=\"takeoffcraft/workspace\"\u003EZaslon programa TakeoffDesk\u003C/a\u003E.\u003C/p\u003E\n\u003C/aside\u003E\n\u003Cp\u003EPovezano: \u003Ca href=\"/tutorials/takeoffcraft/keyboard\" data-topic=\"takeoffcraft/keyboard\"\u003ETipkovnica i miš\u003C/a\u003E · \u003Ca href=\"/tutorials/takeoffcraft/settings\" data-topic=\"takeoffcraft/settings\"\u003EPostavke programa TakeoffDesk\u003C/a\u003E · \u003Ca href=\"/tutorials/takeoffcraft/coming-from\" data-topic=\"takeoffcraft/coming-from\"\u003EPrijelaz s drugih programa za predmjer\u003C/a\u003E\u003C/p\u003E","text":"Naredbe programa TakeoffDesk jednake su bez obzira na to kako do njih dođete. Stil izbornika samo određuje gdje se nalaze na zaslonu, kako se zovu i koje ih tipke pokreću. Odaberite ga u Postavke (Ctrl+,) › TakeoffDesk › Izbornici, tipke i miš; promjena je odmah, a ovaj preglednik je pamti. Tri stila Stil Što dobivate TakeoffDesk Vlastita traka alata programa TakeoffDesk: Datoteka, Izvoz, Mjerilo, Predmjer, Uređivanje i Pogled, s jednoslovnim tipkama alata. Polazište. Stol za predmjer Traka izbornika (Datoteka, Uređivanje, Pogled, Mjerilo, Predmjer, Stavke, Markup, Izvoz) iznad jednog reda alata za predmjer, kako ih na zaslonu slažu programi za predmjer. Stavke se na redu zovu uvjeti. Iste tipke, plus N za novu stavku. Unaprijed postavljena mjerila prebacuju se na traku lista, uz mjerilo lista. Vrpca predmjera Kartice vrpce nazvane prema poslu: Predmjer (mjeri, oblikuje, mjerilo, iz crteža, uvjeti), Uređivanje, Pogled, Markup i Predračun (radna knjiga, označeni PDF-ovi, ponuda), s izbornikom Datoteka i brzim redom za otvaranje, spremanje, poništavanje i ponavljanje. Alati koje koristite cijeli dan su veliki, a njihovi susjedi mali i složeni u slojeve. Iste tipke; unaprijed postavljena mjerila prebacuju se na traku lista. Sva tri stila zadržavaju tipke programa TakeoffDesk: V odabir, L linearno, A površina, O kružnica, B prostorija, P putanja (odabir linija PDF-a), X otvor, C brojanje, S autobrojanje, K kalibriranje, D provjera, R način luka, E način odbitka, F i W za prilagodbu, 3 3D pregled provjere, F3 hvatanje, te Ctrl+Z, Ctrl+Y, Ctrl+S, Ctrl+O, Ctrl+C, Ctrl+X, Ctrl+V, Ctrl+D, Ctrl+A. Alati trake lista (bilješke, oblaci, isticanja, usporedba, 3D) čekaju dok nije otvoren PDF; ako ih odaberete prije toga, statusna linija to kaže. Tipka koja pripada rasporedu programa TakeoffDesk, ali ju vaš stil dodjeljuje drugoj naredbi, ne radi ništa, a statusna linija kaže kamo je naredba otišla („U Mojim tipkama, Broji je Ctrl+Alt+C“). Delete, Esc, Enter, Tab, Space i strelice uvijek zadržavaju svoje značenje. Dok crtate dionicu ili obris, lijepite ili pregledavate autobrojanje, slova i brojevi upisane duljine ostaju uz crtež. Prilagodite po svojoj mjeri Odaberite stil koji je najbliži onome što želite, zatim kliknite Prilagodi…. Na Tipke i izbornici pronađite naredbu (okvir za pretragu pomaže). Dodaj tipku i pritisnite tipku, ili dvije tipke zaredom za dvoslovnu tipku. Kliknite tipku da je uklonite. S trakom izbornika, Gdje se nalazi premješta naredbu u drugi izbornik ili u Samo tipke. Na Miš postavite kotačić i tipke koje pomiču list. Dajte mu naziv i kliknite Spremi. Spremanjem ugrađenog stila stvara se vaša kopija („Moj stol za predmjer“); ugrađeni se nikad ne mijenja. Tipka dodijeljena dvjema naredbama prikazuje se crveno i mora se ispraviti prije spremanja. Miš Kotačić miša: Pomicanje prema gore približava (početak) ili Pomicanje prema gore udaljava, i koliko brzo. Stiskanje prstima na trackpadu uvijek zumira u smjeru kretanja prstiju. Pomicanje lista pomoću: srednje tipke, desne tipke ili obje. Povlačenje lijevom tipkom po praznom papiru i Space uz povlačenje uvijek pomiču prikaz; desni klik bez povlačenja uvijek završava dionicu ili obris. Povlačenje u 3D pregledima: Zasebno za svaki prikaz zadržava gumbe 3D pregleda provjere (lijevi i srednji orbitiraju, desni pomiče). Ili postavite srednju i desnu tipku na orbitiranje, pomicanje, zumiranje ili ništa; Shift uz tipku mijenja orbitiranje i pomicanje. Lijeva tipka uvijek orbitira i odabire. Ponesite sa sobom Izvoz sprema stil u uporabi kao malu datoteku .ccinput.json; Uvezi… dodaje jednu, s drugog računala ili od kolege. Uvezena datoteka može pokazivati samo na naredbe programa TakeoffDesk: sve ostalo u njoj se izostavlja i broji u statusnoj liniji. Izbriši ovaj stil uklanja jedan od vaših. Ove postavke ostaju u ovom pregledniku. Koristi ovaj stil u svakoj aplikaciji ispod kartica stila čini da se svaka aplikacija otvara u odgovarajućem stilu (vlastita traka alata, traka izbornika ili vrpca), uz promjene koje ste napravili u svakoj aplikaciji. TakeoffDesk nema stil s naredbenim redkom: kad je odabran za svaku aplikaciju, TakeoffDesk zadržava vlastitu traku alata. Vrpca predmjera ujedno je vrpca rasporeda Vrpca i preglednik projekta (Postavke › Globalne › Raspored): pogledajte Zaslon programa TakeoffDesk. Povezano: Tipkovnica i miš · Postavke programa TakeoffDesk · Prijelaz s drugih programa za predmjer","lang":"hr"},{"slug":"keyboard","scope":"takeoffcraft","title":"Tipkovnica i miš","summary":"Svaka tipka, miš, trackpad i radnja dodirom u TakeoffDesku, grupirano, s razlikama među platformama.","section":"reference","order":10,"keywords":["tipke","prečaci","tipkovnički prečaci","tipkovnica","miš","trackpad","dodir","pomicanje","zumiranje","kotačić","desni klik","dvostruki klik","razmaknica","shift","kopiraj","zalijepi","izreži","dupliciraj","odaberi sve"],"headings":[{"id":"alati","text":"Alati","level":2},{"id":"tijekom-crtanja","text":"Tijekom crtanja","level":2},{"id":"odabir-i-ure-ivanje","text":"Odabir i uređivanje","level":2},{"id":"kopiranje-i-lijepljenje","text":"Kopiranje i lijepljenje","level":2},{"id":"datoteke","text":"Datoteke","level":2},{"id":"prikaz-i-listovi","text":"Prikaz i listovi","level":2},{"id":"prikaz-3d","text":"Prikaz 3D","level":2},{"id":"autobrojanje","text":"Autobrojanje","level":2},{"id":"pomo","text":"Pomoć","level":2},{"id":"dijalozi-i-polja","text":"Dijalozi i polja","level":2},{"id":"napomene-o-platformi","text":"Napomene o platformi","level":2},{"id":"tipke-koje-preglednik-zadr-ava","text":"Tipke koje preglednik zadržava","level":2},{"id":"gdje-je-naredba-pomakni","text":"Gdje je naredba Pomakni","level":2}],"html":"\u003Cp\u003ETipke slova rade kad je pokazivač bilo gdje na stranici i ne upisujete u polje. Dok je dijaloški okvir otvoren, primjenjuju se njegove vlastite tipke. Slova rade s \u003Ckbd class=\"hk\"\u003E\u003Cspan class=\"k-mac\" title=\"Shift\"\u003E⇧\u003C/span\u003E\u003Cspan class=\"k-pc\"\u003EShift\u003C/span\u003E\u003C/kbd\u003E ili bez njega.\u003C/p\u003E\n\u003Ch2 id=\"alati\"\u003EAlati\u003C/h2\u003E\n\u003Cdiv class=\"ht-wrap\"\u003E\u003Ctable class=\"ht\"\u003E\u003Cthead\u003E\u003Ctr\u003E\u003Cth scope=\"col\"\u003ETipka\u003C/th\u003E\u003Cth scope=\"col\"\u003EAlat\u003C/th\u003E\u003C/tr\u003E\u003C/thead\u003E\u003Ctbody\u003E\u003Ctr\u003E\u003Ctd\u003E\u003Ckbd class=\"hk\"\u003E\u003Cspan class=\"k-mac\" title=\"V\"\u003EV\u003C/span\u003E\u003Cspan class=\"k-pc\"\u003EV\u003C/span\u003E\u003C/kbd\u003E\u003C/td\u003E\u003Ctd\u003E\u003Cspan class=\"hui\"\u003EOdaberi\u003C/span\u003E\u003C/td\u003E\u003C/tr\u003E\u003Ctr\u003E\u003Ctd\u003E\u003Ckbd class=\"hk\"\u003E\u003Cspan class=\"k-mac\" title=\"L\"\u003EL\u003C/span\u003E\u003Cspan class=\"k-pc\"\u003EL\u003C/span\u003E\u003C/kbd\u003E\u003C/td\u003E\u003Ctd\u003E\u003Cspan class=\"hui\"\u003ELinearno\u003C/span\u003E\u003C/td\u003E\u003C/tr\u003E\u003Ctr\u003E\u003Ctd\u003E\u003Ckbd class=\"hk\"\u003E\u003Cspan class=\"k-mac\" title=\"A\"\u003EA\u003C/span\u003E\u003Cspan class=\"k-pc\"\u003EA\u003C/span\u003E\u003C/kbd\u003E\u003C/td\u003E\u003Ctd\u003E\u003Cspan class=\"hui\"\u003EPovršina\u003C/span\u003E\u003C/td\u003E\u003C/tr\u003E\u003Ctr\u003E\u003Ctd\u003E\u003Ckbd class=\"hk\"\u003E\u003Cspan class=\"k-mac\" title=\"O\"\u003EO\u003C/span\u003E\u003Cspan class=\"k-pc\"\u003EO\u003C/span\u003E\u003C/kbd\u003E\u003C/td\u003E\u003Ctd\u003E\u003Cspan class=\"hui\"\u003EKružnica\u003C/span\u003E\u003C/td\u003E\u003C/tr\u003E\u003Ctr\u003E\u003Ctd\u003E\u003Ckbd class=\"hk\"\u003E\u003Cspan class=\"k-mac\" title=\"B\"\u003EB\u003C/span\u003E\u003Cspan class=\"k-pc\"\u003EB\u003C/span\u003E\u003C/kbd\u003E\u003C/td\u003E\u003Ctd\u003E\u003Cspan class=\"hui\"\u003EProstorija\u003C/span\u003E (ispuni prostoriju jednim klikom)\u003C/td\u003E\u003C/tr\u003E\u003Ctr\u003E\u003Ctd\u003E\u003Ckbd class=\"hk\"\u003E\u003Cspan class=\"k-mac\" title=\"R\"\u003ER\u003C/span\u003E\u003Cspan class=\"k-pc\"\u003ER\u003C/span\u003E\u003C/kbd\u003E\u003C/td\u003E\u003Ctd\u003E\u003Cspan class=\"hui\"\u003ELuk\u003C/span\u003E uključeno ili isključeno (u alatima Linearno, Površina i Otvor)\u003C/td\u003E\u003C/tr\u003E\u003Ctr\u003E\u003Ctd\u003E\u003Ckbd class=\"hk\"\u003E\u003Cspan class=\"k-mac\" title=\"E\"\u003EE\u003C/span\u003E\u003Cspan class=\"k-pc\"\u003EE\u003C/span\u003E\u003C/kbd\u003E\u003C/td\u003E\u003Ctd\u003E\u003Cspan class=\"hui\"\u003EOdbitak\u003C/span\u003E uključeno ili isključeno: sljedeći segmenti dionice crtaju se, ali se ne broje\u003C/td\u003E\u003C/tr\u003E\u003Ctr\u003E\u003Ctd\u003EZnamenka, \u003Ccode\u003E@\u003C/code\u003E ili \u003Ccode\u003E#\u003C/code\u003E tijekom crtanja\u003C/td\u003E\u003Ctd\u003EOtvara okvir \u003Cspan class=\"hui\"\u003EUpis\u003C/span\u003E: upišite duljinu ili koordinate, \u003Ckbd class=\"hk\"\u003E\u003Cspan class=\"k-mac\" title=\"Return\"\u003EReturn\u003C/span\u003E\u003Cspan class=\"k-pc\"\u003EEnter\u003C/span\u003E\u003C/kbd\u003E postavlja točku (\u003Ca href=\"/tutorials/takeoffcraft/measure-linear#type-lengths-and-coordinates\" data-topic=\"takeoffcraft/measure-linear\" data-hash=\"type-lengths-and-coordinates\"\u003EMjerenje linearnih dionica\u003C/a\u003E)\u003C/td\u003E\u003C/tr\u003E\u003Ctr\u003E\u003Ctd\u003E\u003Ckbd class=\"hk\"\u003E\u003Cspan class=\"k-mac\" title=\"X\"\u003EX\u003C/span\u003E\u003Cspan class=\"k-pc\"\u003EX\u003C/span\u003E\u003C/kbd\u003E\u003C/td\u003E\u003Ctd\u003E\u003Cspan class=\"hui\"\u003EOtvor\u003C/span\u003E (prvo odaberite površinu)\u003C/td\u003E\u003C/tr\u003E\u003Ctr\u003E\u003Ctd\u003E\u003Ckbd class=\"hk\"\u003E\u003Cspan class=\"k-mac\" title=\"C\"\u003EC\u003C/span\u003E\u003Cspan class=\"k-pc\"\u003EC\u003C/span\u003E\u003C/kbd\u003E\u003C/td\u003E\u003Ctd\u003E\u003Cspan class=\"hui\"\u003EBroji\u003C/span\u003E\u003C/td\u003E\u003C/tr\u003E\u003Ctr\u003E\u003Ctd\u003E\u003Ckbd class=\"hk\"\u003E\u003Cspan class=\"k-mac\" title=\"S\"\u003ES\u003C/span\u003E\u003Cspan class=\"k-pc\"\u003ES\u003C/span\u003E\u003C/kbd\u003E\u003C/td\u003E\u003Ctd\u003E\u003Cspan class=\"hui\"\u003EAutobrojanje\u003C/span\u003E\u003C/td\u003E\u003C/tr\u003E\u003Ctr\u003E\u003Ctd\u003E\u003Ckbd class=\"hk\"\u003E\u003Cspan class=\"k-mac\" title=\"K\"\u003EK\u003C/span\u003E\u003Cspan class=\"k-pc\"\u003EK\u003C/span\u003E\u003C/kbd\u003E\u003C/td\u003E\u003Ctd\u003E\u003Cspan class=\"hui\"\u003EKalibriraj\u003C/span\u003E\u003C/td\u003E\u003C/tr\u003E\u003Ctr\u003E\u003Ctd\u003E\u003Ckbd class=\"hk\"\u003E\u003Cspan class=\"k-mac\" title=\"D\"\u003ED\u003C/span\u003E\u003Cspan class=\"k-pc\"\u003ED\u003C/span\u003E\u003C/kbd\u003E\u003C/td\u003E\u003Ctd\u003E\u003Cspan class=\"hui\"\u003EProvjeri\u003C/span\u003E mjerilo\u003C/td\u003E\u003C/tr\u003E\u003C/tbody\u003E\u003C/table\u003E\u003C/div\u003E\n\u003Ch2 id=\"tijekom-crtanja\"\u003ETijekom crtanja\u003C/h2\u003E\n\u003Cdiv class=\"ht-wrap\"\u003E\u003Ctable class=\"ht\"\u003E\u003Cthead\u003E\u003Ctr\u003E\u003Cth scope=\"col\"\u003ETipka ili radnja\u003C/th\u003E\u003Cth scope=\"col\"\u003EŠto radi\u003C/th\u003E\u003C/tr\u003E\u003C/thead\u003E\u003Ctbody\u003E\u003Ctr\u003E\u003Ctd\u003EKlik\u003C/td\u003E\u003Ctd\u003EPostavlja točku (točku, uz \u003Cspan class=\"hui\"\u003EBroji\u003C/span\u003E).\u003C/td\u003E\u003C/tr\u003E\u003Ctr\u003E\u003Ctd\u003E\u003Ckbd class=\"hk\"\u003E\u003Cspan class=\"k-mac\" title=\"P\"\u003EP\u003C/span\u003E\u003Cspan class=\"k-pc\"\u003EP\u003C/span\u003E\u003C/kbd\u003E\u003C/td\u003E\u003Ctd\u003EPutanja: odaberite cijelu povezanu putanju linije PDF-a ili obris oko klika (\u003Ca href=\"/tutorials/takeoffcraft/pick-the-lines\" data-topic=\"takeoffcraft/pick-the-lines\"\u003EOdabir linija PDF-a\u003C/a\u003E).\u003C/td\u003E\u003C/tr\u003E\u003Ctr\u003E\u003Ctd\u003E\u003Ckbd class=\"hk\"\u003E\u003Cspan class=\"k-mac\" title=\"F3\"\u003EF3\u003C/span\u003E\u003Cspan class=\"k-pc\"\u003EF3\u003C/span\u003E\u003C/kbd\u003E\u003C/td\u003E\u003Ctd\u003EHvatanje na linije crteža uključeno ili isključeno (\u003Ca href=\"/tutorials/takeoffcraft/snap-to-the-drawing\" data-topic=\"takeoffcraft/snap-to-the-drawing\"\u003EHvatanje na linije crteža\u003C/a\u003E).\u003C/td\u003E\u003C/tr\u003E\u003Ctr\u003E\u003Ctd\u003E\u003Ckbd class=\"hk\"\u003E\u003Cspan class=\"k-mac\" title=\"Shift\"\u003E⇧\u003C/span\u003E\u003Cspan class=\"k-pc\"\u003EShift\u003C/span\u003E\u003C/kbd\u003E držan dok kliknete\u003C/td\u003E\u003Ctd\u003EHvata segment na 0°, 45°, 90° ili 135° od zadnje točke. Ne vrijedi za točke luka ni za kružnice.\u003C/td\u003E\u003C/tr\u003E\u003Ctr\u003E\u003Ctd\u003EDvostruki klik\u003C/td\u003E\u003Ctd\u003EZavršava dionicu ili zatvara površinu ili otvor.\u003C/td\u003E\u003C/tr\u003E\u003Ctr\u003E\u003Ctd\u003E\u003Ckbd class=\"hk\"\u003E\u003Cspan class=\"k-mac\" title=\"Return\"\u003EReturn\u003C/span\u003E\u003Cspan class=\"k-pc\"\u003EEnter\u003C/span\u003E\u003C/kbd\u003E\u003C/td\u003E\u003Ctd\u003EZavršava dionicu ili zatvara površinu ili otvor.\u003C/td\u003E\u003C/tr\u003E\u003Ctr\u003E\u003Ctd\u003EDesni klik (bez pomicanja)\u003C/td\u003E\u003Ctd\u003EZavršava dionicu ili zatvara površinu ili otvor.\u003C/td\u003E\u003C/tr\u003E\u003Ctr\u003E\u003Ctd\u003EKlik na prvu točku\u003C/td\u003E\u003Ctd\u003EZatvara površinu ili otvor (od treće točke).\u003C/td\u003E\u003C/tr\u003E\u003Ctr\u003E\u003Ctd\u003E\u003Ckbd class=\"hk\"\u003E\u003Cspan class=\"k-mac\" title=\"Delete\"\u003EDelete\u003C/span\u003E\u003Cspan class=\"k-pc\"\u003EBackspace\u003C/span\u003E\u003C/kbd\u003E ili \u003Ckbd class=\"hk\"\u003E\u003Cspan class=\"k-mac\" title=\"fn Delete\"\u003Efn Delete\u003C/span\u003E\u003Cspan class=\"k-pc\"\u003EDelete\u003C/span\u003E\u003C/kbd\u003E\u003C/td\u003E\u003Ctd\u003EUklanja zadnju točku (prvo točku luka na čekanju).\u003C/td\u003E\u003C/tr\u003E\u003Ctr\u003E\u003Ctd\u003E\u003Ckbd class=\"hk\"\u003E\u003Cspan class=\"k-mac\" title=\"Esc\"\u003EEsc\u003C/span\u003E\u003Cspan class=\"k-pc\"\u003EEsc\u003C/span\u003E\u003C/kbd\u003E\u003C/td\u003E\u003Ctd\u003EOdbacuje točku luka na čekanju; zatim poništava nedovršenu oznaku; zatim se vraća na \u003Cspan class=\"hui\"\u003EOdaberi\u003C/span\u003E.\u003C/td\u003E\u003C/tr\u003E\u003C/tbody\u003E\u003C/table\u003E\u003C/div\u003E\n\u003Ch2 id=\"odabir-i-ure-ivanje\"\u003EOdabir i uređivanje\u003C/h2\u003E\n\u003Cdiv class=\"ht-wrap\"\u003E\u003Ctable class=\"ht\"\u003E\u003Cthead\u003E\u003Ctr\u003E\u003Cth scope=\"col\"\u003ETipka ili radnja\u003C/th\u003E\u003Cth scope=\"col\"\u003EŠto radi\u003C/th\u003E\u003C/tr\u003E\u003C/thead\u003E\u003Ctbody\u003E\u003Ctr\u003E\u003Ctd\u003EKlik na oznaku (alat \u003Cspan class=\"hui\"\u003EOdaberi\u003C/span\u003E)\u003C/td\u003E\u003Ctd\u003EOdabire je i čini njezinu stavku aktivnom.\u003C/td\u003E\u003C/tr\u003E\u003Ctr\u003E\u003Ctd\u003E\u003Ckbd class=\"hk\"\u003E\u003Cspan class=\"k-mac\" title=\"Shift\"\u003E⇧\u003C/span\u003E\u003Cspan class=\"k-pc\"\u003EShift\u003C/span\u003E\u003C/kbd\u003E + klik na oznaku\u003C/td\u003E\u003Ctd\u003EDodaje je u odabir ili je uklanja iz njega.\u003C/td\u003E\u003C/tr\u003E\u003Ctr\u003E\u003Ctd\u003E\u003Ckbd class=\"hk\"\u003E\u003Cspan class=\"k-mac\" title=\"Command A\"\u003E⌘A\u003C/span\u003E\u003Cspan class=\"k-pc\"\u003ECtrl+A\u003C/span\u003E\u003C/kbd\u003E\u003C/td\u003E\u003Ctd\u003EOdabire sve oznake na otvorenom listu.\u003C/td\u003E\u003C/tr\u003E\u003Ctr\u003E\u003Ctd\u003EPovucite ručku kuta\u003C/td\u003E\u003Ctd\u003EPomiče tu točku (\u003Ckbd class=\"hk\"\u003E\u003Cspan class=\"k-mac\" title=\"Shift\"\u003E⇧\u003C/span\u003E\u003Cspan class=\"k-pc\"\u003EShift\u003C/span\u003E\u003C/kbd\u003E hvata na 45°). Radi kad je odabrana jedna oznaka.\u003C/td\u003E\u003C/tr\u003E\u003Ctr\u003E\u003Ctd\u003E\u003Ckbd class=\"hk\"\u003E\u003Cspan class=\"k-mac\" title=\"fn Delete\"\u003Efn Delete\u003C/span\u003E\u003Cspan class=\"k-pc\"\u003EDelete\u003C/span\u003E\u003C/kbd\u003E ili \u003Ckbd class=\"hk\"\u003E\u003Cspan class=\"k-mac\" title=\"Delete\"\u003EDelete\u003C/span\u003E\u003Cspan class=\"k-pc\"\u003EBackspace\u003C/span\u003E\u003C/kbd\u003E\u003C/td\u003E\u003Ctd\u003EBriše odabrane oznake (kad ne crtate).\u003C/td\u003E\u003C/tr\u003E\u003Ctr\u003E\u003Ctd\u003E\u003Ckbd class=\"hk\"\u003E\u003Cspan class=\"k-mac\" title=\"Esc\"\u003EEsc\u003C/span\u003E\u003Cspan class=\"k-pc\"\u003EEsc\u003C/span\u003E\u003C/kbd\u003E\u003C/td\u003E\u003Ctd\u003EPoništava odabir: briše odabir i crtu provjere.\u003C/td\u003E\u003C/tr\u003E\u003Ctr\u003E\u003Ctd\u003E\u003Ckbd class=\"hk\"\u003E\u003Cspan class=\"k-mac\" title=\"Command Z\"\u003E⌘Z\u003C/span\u003E\u003Cspan class=\"k-pc\"\u003ECtrl+Z\u003C/span\u003E\u003C/kbd\u003E\u003C/td\u003E\u003Ctd\u003EPoništi.\u003C/td\u003E\u003C/tr\u003E\u003Ctr\u003E\u003Ctd\u003E\u003Ckbd class=\"hk\"\u003E\u003Cspan class=\"k-mac\" title=\"Command Y\"\u003E⌘Y\u003C/span\u003E\u003Cspan class=\"k-pc\"\u003ECtrl+Y\u003C/span\u003E\u003C/kbd\u003E ili \u003Ckbd class=\"hk\"\u003E\u003Cspan class=\"k-mac\" title=\"Shift Command Z\"\u003E⇧⌘Z\u003C/span\u003E\u003Cspan class=\"k-pc\"\u003ECtrl+Shift+Z\u003C/span\u003E\u003C/kbd\u003E\u003C/td\u003E\u003Ctd\u003EPonovi.\u003C/td\u003E\u003C/tr\u003E\u003C/tbody\u003E\u003C/table\u003E\u003C/div\u003E\n\u003Ch2 id=\"kopiranje-i-lijepljenje\"\u003EKopiranje i lijepljenje\u003C/h2\u003E\n\u003Cdiv class=\"ht-wrap\"\u003E\u003Ctable class=\"ht\"\u003E\u003Cthead\u003E\u003Ctr\u003E\u003Cth scope=\"col\"\u003ETipka\u003C/th\u003E\u003Cth scope=\"col\"\u003EŠto radi\u003C/th\u003E\u003C/tr\u003E\u003C/thead\u003E\u003Ctbody\u003E\u003Ctr\u003E\u003Ctd\u003E\u003Ckbd class=\"hk\"\u003E\u003Cspan class=\"k-mac\" title=\"Command C\"\u003E⌘C\u003C/span\u003E\u003Cspan class=\"k-pc\"\u003ECtrl+C\u003C/span\u003E\u003C/kbd\u003E\u003C/td\u003E\u003Ctd\u003EKopira odabrane oznake, sa stavkama.\u003C/td\u003E\u003C/tr\u003E\u003Ctr\u003E\u003Ctd\u003E\u003Ckbd class=\"hk\"\u003E\u003Cspan class=\"k-mac\" title=\"Command X\"\u003E⌘X\u003C/span\u003E\u003Cspan class=\"k-pc\"\u003ECtrl+X\u003C/span\u003E\u003C/kbd\u003E\u003C/td\u003E\u003Ctd\u003EIzrezuje: kopira odabrane oznake, zatim ih briše.\u003C/td\u003E\u003C/tr\u003E\u003Ctr\u003E\u003Ctd\u003E\u003Ckbd class=\"hk\"\u003E\u003Cspan class=\"k-mac\" title=\"Command V\"\u003E⌘V\u003C/span\u003E\u003Cspan class=\"k-pc\"\u003ECtrl+V\u003C/span\u003E\u003C/kbd\u003E\u003C/td\u003E\u003Ctd\u003EZalijepi: kopija prati pokazivač; kliknite gdje ide.\u003C/td\u003E\u003C/tr\u003E\u003Ctr\u003E\u003Ctd\u003E\u003Ckbd class=\"hk\"\u003E\u003Cspan class=\"k-mac\" title=\"Shift Command V\"\u003E⇧⌘V\u003C/span\u003E\u003Cspan class=\"k-pc\"\u003ECtrl+Shift+V\u003C/span\u003E\u003C/kbd\u003E\u003C/td\u003E\u003Ctd\u003EZalijepi na isto mjesto: isto mjesto na otvorenom listu.\u003C/td\u003E\u003C/tr\u003E\u003Ctr\u003E\u003Ctd\u003E\u003Ckbd class=\"hk\"\u003E\u003Cspan class=\"k-mac\" title=\"Command D\"\u003E⌘D\u003C/span\u003E\u003Cspan class=\"k-pc\"\u003ECtrl+D\u003C/span\u003E\u003C/kbd\u003E\u003C/td\u003E\u003Ctd\u003EDupliciraj odabrane oznake: kopija prati pokazivač; kliknite gdje ide.\u003C/td\u003E\u003C/tr\u003E\u003Ctr\u003E\u003Ctd\u003E\u003Ckbd class=\"hk\"\u003E\u003Cspan class=\"k-mac\" title=\"Esc\"\u003EEsc\u003C/span\u003E\u003Cspan class=\"k-pc\"\u003EEsc\u003C/span\u003E\u003C/kbd\u003E\u003C/td\u003E\u003Ctd\u003ENe ostavlja ništa: odustaje od lijepljenja ili dupliciranja koje je na pokazivaču.\u003C/td\u003E\u003C/tr\u003E\u003C/tbody\u003E\u003C/table\u003E\u003C/div\u003E\n\u003Cp\u003ESame slova i dalje biraju alate (\u003Ckbd class=\"hk\"\u003E\u003Cspan class=\"k-mac\" title=\"C\"\u003EC\u003C/span\u003E\u003Cspan class=\"k-pc\"\u003EC\u003C/span\u003E\u003C/kbd\u003E je \u003Cspan class=\"hui\"\u003EBroji\u003C/span\u003E, \u003Ckbd class=\"hk\"\u003E\u003Cspan class=\"k-mac\" title=\"D\"\u003ED\u003C/span\u003E\u003Cspan class=\"k-pc\"\u003ED\u003C/span\u003E\u003C/kbd\u003E je \u003Cspan class=\"hui\"\u003EProvjeri\u003C/span\u003E, \u003Ckbd class=\"hk\"\u003E\u003Cspan class=\"k-mac\" title=\"X\"\u003EX\u003C/span\u003E\u003Cspan class=\"k-pc\"\u003EX\u003C/span\u003E\u003C/kbd\u003E je \u003Cspan class=\"hui\"\u003EOtvor\u003C/span\u003E, \u003Ckbd class=\"hk\"\u003E\u003Cspan class=\"k-mac\" title=\"V\"\u003EV\u003C/span\u003E\u003Cspan class=\"k-pc\"\u003EV\u003C/span\u003E\u003C/kbd\u003E je \u003Cspan class=\"hui\"\u003EOdaberi\u003C/span\u003E, \u003Ckbd class=\"hk\"\u003E\u003Cspan class=\"k-mac\" title=\"A\"\u003EA\u003C/span\u003E\u003Cspan class=\"k-pc\"\u003EA\u003C/span\u003E\u003C/kbd\u003E je \u003Cspan class=\"hui\"\u003EPovršina\u003C/span\u003E); tek \u003Ckbd class=\"hk\"\u003E\u003Cspan class=\"k-mac\" title=\"Command\"\u003E⌘\u003C/span\u003E\u003Cspan class=\"k-pc\"\u003ECtrl\u003C/span\u003E\u003C/kbd\u003E uz njih kopira i lijepi. U polju za tekst ove tipke kopiraju i lijepe tekst kao i obično. Pogledajte \u003Ca href=\"/tutorials/takeoffcraft/copy-paste\" data-topic=\"takeoffcraft/copy-paste\"\u003EKopiranje, lijepljenje i dupliciranje oznaka\u003C/a\u003E.\u003C/p\u003E\n\u003Caside class=\"hc hc-warning\"\u003E\u003Cp class=\"hc-label\"\u003EWarning\u003C/p\u003E\n\u003Cp\u003E\u003Ckbd class=\"hk\"\u003E\u003Cspan class=\"k-mac\" title=\"Delete\"\u003EDelete\u003C/span\u003E\u003Cspan class=\"k-pc\"\u003EBackspace\u003C/span\u003E\u003C/kbd\u003E briše odabranu oznaku kad ne crtate. Ako se to dogodi slučajno, \u003Ckbd class=\"hk\"\u003E\u003Cspan class=\"k-mac\" title=\"Command Z\"\u003E⌘Z\u003C/span\u003E\u003Cspan class=\"k-pc\"\u003ECtrl+Z\u003C/span\u003E\u003C/kbd\u003E je vraća.\u003C/p\u003E\n\u003C/aside\u003E\n\u003Ch2 id=\"datoteke\"\u003EDatoteke\u003C/h2\u003E\n\u003Cdiv class=\"ht-wrap\"\u003E\u003Ctable class=\"ht\"\u003E\u003Cthead\u003E\u003Ctr\u003E\u003Cth scope=\"col\"\u003ETipka\u003C/th\u003E\u003Cth scope=\"col\"\u003EŠto radi\u003C/th\u003E\u003C/tr\u003E\u003C/thead\u003E\u003Ctbody\u003E\u003Ctr\u003E\u003Ctd\u003E\u003Ckbd class=\"hk\"\u003E\u003Cspan class=\"k-mac\" title=\"Command O\"\u003E⌘O\u003C/span\u003E\u003Cspan class=\"k-pc\"\u003ECtrl+O\u003C/span\u003E\u003C/kbd\u003E\u003C/td\u003E\u003Ctd\u003E\u003Cspan class=\"hui\"\u003EOtvori nacrte\u003C/span\u003E\u003C/td\u003E\u003C/tr\u003E\u003Ctr\u003E\u003Ctd\u003E\u003Ckbd class=\"hk\"\u003E\u003Cspan class=\"k-mac\" title=\"Command S\"\u003E⌘S\u003C/span\u003E\u003Cspan class=\"k-pc\"\u003ECtrl+S\u003C/span\u003E\u003C/kbd\u003E\u003C/td\u003E\u003Ctd\u003E\u003Cspan class=\"hui\"\u003ESpremi predmjer\u003C/span\u003E\u003C/td\u003E\u003C/tr\u003E\u003C/tbody\u003E\u003C/table\u003E\u003C/div\u003E\n\u003Cp\u003EOve dvije tipke rade i dok upisujete u polje.\u003C/p\u003E\n\u003Ch2 id=\"prikaz-i-listovi\"\u003EPrikaz i listovi\u003C/h2\u003E\n\u003Cdiv class=\"ht-wrap\"\u003E\u003Ctable class=\"ht\"\u003E\u003Cthead\u003E\u003Ctr\u003E\u003Cth scope=\"col\"\u003ETipka ili radnja\u003C/th\u003E\u003Cth scope=\"col\"\u003EŠto radi\u003C/th\u003E\u003C/tr\u003E\u003C/thead\u003E\u003Ctbody\u003E\u003Ctr\u003E\u003Ctd\u003EKotačić miša\u003C/td\u003E\u003Ctd\u003EZumira prema unutra i van na pokazivaču.\u003C/td\u003E\u003C/tr\u003E\u003Ctr\u003E\u003Ctd\u003EPovlačenje (lijevom, srednjom ili desnom tipkom)\u003C/td\u003E\u003Ctd\u003EPomicanje prikaza. U \u003Cspan class=\"hui\"\u003EAutobrojanje\u003C/span\u003E povlačenje lijevom tipkom crta okvir za pretragu.\u003C/td\u003E\u003C/tr\u003E\u003Ctr\u003E\u003Ctd\u003E\u003Ckbd class=\"hk\"\u003E\u003Cspan class=\"k-mac\" title=\"Space\"\u003ESpace\u003C/span\u003E\u003Cspan class=\"k-pc\"\u003ESpace\u003C/span\u003E\u003C/kbd\u003E držan + povlačenje\u003C/td\u003E\u003Ctd\u003EPomicanje prikaza, u bilo kojem alatu.\u003C/td\u003E\u003C/tr\u003E\u003Ctr\u003E\u003Ctd\u003E\u003Ckbd class=\"hk\"\u003E\u003Cspan class=\"k-mac\" title=\"F\"\u003EF\u003C/span\u003E\u003Cspan class=\"k-pc\"\u003EF\u003C/span\u003E\u003C/kbd\u003E\u003C/td\u003E\u003Ctd\u003E\u003Cspan class=\"hui\"\u003EPrilagodi stranicu\u003C/span\u003E\u003C/td\u003E\u003C/tr\u003E\u003Ctr\u003E\u003Ctd\u003E\u003Ckbd class=\"hk\"\u003E\u003Cspan class=\"k-mac\" title=\"W\"\u003EW\u003C/span\u003E\u003Cspan class=\"k-pc\"\u003EW\u003C/span\u003E\u003C/kbd\u003E\u003C/td\u003E\u003Ctd\u003E\u003Cspan class=\"hui\"\u003EPrilagodi širinu\u003C/span\u003E\u003C/td\u003E\u003C/tr\u003E\u003Ctr\u003E\u003Ctd\u003E\u003Ckbd class=\"hk\"\u003E\u003Cspan class=\"k-mac\" title=\"+\"\u003E+\u003C/span\u003E\u003Cspan class=\"k-pc\"\u003E+\u003C/span\u003E\u003C/kbd\u003E ili \u003Ckbd class=\"hk\"\u003E\u003Cspan class=\"k-mac\" title=\"=\"\u003E=\u003C/span\u003E\u003Cspan class=\"k-pc\"\u003E=\u003C/span\u003E\u003C/kbd\u003E\u003C/td\u003E\u003Ctd\u003EZumira prema unutra u sredini prikaza.\u003C/td\u003E\u003C/tr\u003E\u003Ctr\u003E\u003Ctd\u003E\u003Ckbd class=\"hk\"\u003E\u003Cspan class=\"k-mac\" title=\"−\"\u003E−\u003C/span\u003E\u003Cspan class=\"k-pc\"\u003E−\u003C/span\u003E\u003C/kbd\u003E\u003C/td\u003E\u003Ctd\u003EZumira van u sredini prikaza.\u003C/td\u003E\u003C/tr\u003E\u003Ctr\u003E\u003Ctd\u003E\u003Ckbd class=\"hk\"\u003E\u003Cspan class=\"k-mac\" title=\"fn ↓\"\u003Efn ↓\u003C/span\u003E\u003Cspan class=\"k-pc\"\u003EPage Down\u003C/span\u003E\u003C/kbd\u003E / \u003Ckbd class=\"hk\"\u003E\u003Cspan class=\"k-mac\" title=\"fn ↑\"\u003Efn ↑\u003C/span\u003E\u003Cspan class=\"k-pc\"\u003EPage Up\u003C/span\u003E\u003C/kbd\u003E\u003C/td\u003E\u003Ctd\u003ESljedeći ili prethodni list u popisu listova.\u003C/td\u003E\u003C/tr\u003E\u003Ctr\u003E\u003Ctd\u003E\u003Ckbd class=\"hk\"\u003E\u003Cspan class=\"k-mac\" title=\"Control Shift F\"\u003E⌃⇧F\u003C/span\u003E\u003Cspan class=\"k-pc\"\u003ECtrl+Shift+F\u003C/span\u003E\u003C/kbd\u003E\u003C/td\u003E\u003Ctd\u003EMijenja načine cijelog zaslona (Control na svim platformama, pa i na Macu).\u003C/td\u003E\u003C/tr\u003E\u003Ctr\u003E\u003Ctd\u003E\u003Ckbd class=\"hk\"\u003E\u003Cspan class=\"k-mac\" title=\"F1\"\u003EF1\u003C/span\u003E\u003Cspan class=\"k-pc\"\u003EF1\u003C/span\u003E\u003C/kbd\u003E\u003C/td\u003E\u003Ctd\u003EOtvara ili zatvara ovu pomoć, bočnu ploču.\u003C/td\u003E\u003C/tr\u003E\u003Ctr\u003E\u003Ctd\u003E\u003Ckbd class=\"hk\"\u003E\u003Cspan class=\"k-mac\" title=\"3\"\u003E3\u003C/span\u003E\u003Cspan class=\"k-pc\"\u003E3\u003C/span\u003E\u003C/kbd\u003E\u003C/td\u003E\u003Ctd\u003E3D pregled provjere lista, uključeno ili isključeno.\u003C/td\u003E\u003C/tr\u003E\u003C/tbody\u003E\u003C/table\u003E\u003C/div\u003E\n\u003Ch2 id=\"prikaz-3d\"\u003EPrikaz 3D\u003C/h2\u003E\n\u003Cdiv class=\"ht-wrap\"\u003E\u003Ctable class=\"ht\"\u003E\u003Cthead\u003E\u003Ctr\u003E\u003Cth scope=\"col\"\u003ETipka ili radnja\u003C/th\u003E\u003Cth scope=\"col\"\u003EŠto radi\u003C/th\u003E\u003C/tr\u003E\u003C/thead\u003E\u003Ctbody\u003E\u003Ctr\u003E\u003Ctd\u003EPovlačenje ili povlačenje srednjom tipkom\u003C/td\u003E\u003Ctd\u003EOrbitiranje.\u003C/td\u003E\u003C/tr\u003E\u003Ctr\u003E\u003Ctd\u003E\u003Ckbd class=\"hk\"\u003E\u003Cspan class=\"k-mac\" title=\"Shift\"\u003E⇧\u003C/span\u003E\u003Cspan class=\"k-pc\"\u003EShift\u003C/span\u003E\u003C/kbd\u003E + povlačenje ili povlačenje desnom tipkom\u003C/td\u003E\u003Ctd\u003EPomicanje prikaza.\u003C/td\u003E\u003C/tr\u003E\u003Ctr\u003E\u003Ctd\u003EKotačić miša\u003C/td\u003E\u003Ctd\u003EZumiranje na pokazivaču. Na trackpadu dvoprsni pomak orbitira, a stiskanje prstima zumira.\u003C/td\u003E\u003C/tr\u003E\u003Ctr\u003E\u003Ctd\u003EKlik\u003C/td\u003E\u003Ctd\u003EOdabire oznaku ispod pokazivača (\u003Ckbd class=\"hk\"\u003E\u003Cspan class=\"k-mac\" title=\"Shift\"\u003E⇧\u003C/span\u003E\u003Cspan class=\"k-pc\"\u003EShift\u003C/span\u003E\u003C/kbd\u003E + klik dodaje ili uklanja).\u003C/td\u003E\u003C/tr\u003E\u003Ctr\u003E\u003Ctd\u003E\u003Ckbd class=\"hk\"\u003E\u003Cspan class=\"k-mac\" title=\"F\"\u003EF\u003C/span\u003E\u003Cspan class=\"k-pc\"\u003EF\u003C/span\u003E\u003C/kbd\u003E ili \u003Ckbd class=\"hk\"\u003E\u003Cspan class=\"k-mac\" title=\"W\"\u003EW\u003C/span\u003E\u003Cspan class=\"k-pc\"\u003EW\u003C/span\u003E\u003C/kbd\u003E\u003C/td\u003E\u003Ctd\u003EZumiraj opseg.\u003C/td\u003E\u003C/tr\u003E\u003Ctr\u003E\u003Ctd\u003E\u003Ckbd class=\"hk\"\u003E\u003Cspan class=\"k-mac\" title=\"3\"\u003E3\u003C/span\u003E\u003Cspan class=\"k-pc\"\u003E3\u003C/span\u003E\u003C/kbd\u003E\u003C/td\u003E\u003Ctd\u003ENatrag na ravni list.\u003C/td\u003E\u003C/tr\u003E\u003C/tbody\u003E\u003C/table\u003E\u003C/div\u003E\n\u003Cp\u003EPogledajte \u003Ca href=\"/tutorials/takeoffcraft/check-in-3d\" data-topic=\"takeoffcraft/check-in-3d\"\u003EProvjera predmjera u 3D\u003C/a\u003E.\u003C/p\u003E\n\u003Ch2 id=\"autobrojanje\"\u003EAutobrojanje\u003C/h2\u003E\n\u003Cdiv class=\"ht-wrap\"\u003E\u003Ctable class=\"ht\"\u003E\u003Cthead\u003E\u003Ctr\u003E\u003Cth scope=\"col\"\u003ETipka ili radnja\u003C/th\u003E\u003Cth scope=\"col\"\u003EŠto radi\u003C/th\u003E\u003C/tr\u003E\u003C/thead\u003E\u003Ctbody\u003E\u003Ctr\u003E\u003Ctd\u003EPovucite okvir\u003C/td\u003E\u003Ctd\u003EObuhvaća simbol za pretragu (pokreće pretragu).\u003C/td\u003E\u003C/tr\u003E\u003Ctr\u003E\u003Ctd\u003EKlik na okvir podudaranja\u003C/td\u003E\u003Ctd\u003EOdbacuje ga ili vraća.\u003C/td\u003E\u003C/tr\u003E\u003Ctr\u003E\u003Ctd\u003E\u003Ckbd class=\"hk\"\u003E\u003Cspan class=\"k-mac\" title=\"Esc\"\u003EEsc\u003C/span\u003E\u003Cspan class=\"k-pc\"\u003EEsc\u003C/span\u003E\u003C/kbd\u003E\u003C/td\u003E\u003Ctd\u003EOdustaje od pokrenute pretrage ili odbacuje pregled.\u003C/td\u003E\u003C/tr\u003E\u003C/tbody\u003E\u003C/table\u003E\u003C/div\u003E\n\u003Ch2 id=\"pomo\"\u003EPomoć\u003C/h2\u003E\n\u003Cdiv class=\"ht-wrap\"\u003E\u003Ctable class=\"ht\"\u003E\u003Cthead\u003E\u003Ctr\u003E\u003Cth scope=\"col\"\u003ETipka\u003C/th\u003E\u003Cth scope=\"col\"\u003EŠto radi\u003C/th\u003E\u003C/tr\u003E\u003C/thead\u003E\u003Ctbody\u003E\u003Ctr\u003E\u003Ctd\u003E\u003Ckbd class=\"hk\"\u003E\u003Cspan class=\"k-mac\" title=\"F1\"\u003EF1\u003C/span\u003E\u003Cspan class=\"k-pc\"\u003EF1\u003C/span\u003E\u003C/kbd\u003E\u003C/td\u003E\u003Ctd\u003EOtvara ili zatvara ploču pomoći (također gumb \u003Cspan class=\"hui\"\u003EPomoć\u003C/span\u003E u traci aplikacije). Radi u svim alatima, čak i dok upisujete u polje.\u003C/td\u003E\u003C/tr\u003E\u003Ctr\u003E\u003Ctd\u003E\u003Ckbd class=\"hk\"\u003E\u003Cspan class=\"k-mac\" title=\"Esc\"\u003EEsc\u003C/span\u003E\u003Cspan class=\"k-pc\"\u003EEsc\u003C/span\u003E\u003C/kbd\u003E\u003C/td\u003E\u003Ctd\u003EZatvara ploču pomoći. U njezinu okviru za pretragu prvi Esc briše pretragu. Dok je ploča otvorena, Esc pritisnut nakon klika na list najprije zatvara ploču; pritisnite ga ponovno da odustanete u TakeoffDesku.\u003C/td\u003E\u003C/tr\u003E\u003C/tbody\u003E\u003C/table\u003E\u003C/div\u003E\n\u003Cdiv class=\"hv\" data-v=\"os:mac\"\u003E\u003Cp class=\"hv-label\"\u003EMac\u003C/p\u003E\n\u003Cp\u003ENa mnogim Mac tipkovnicama gornji red upravlja svjetlinom i zvukom. Pritisnite fn s F1 ili uključite „Koristi tipke F1, F2 itd. kao standardne funkcijske tipke“ u Postavkama sustava, pod Tipkovnica.\u003C/p\u003E\n\u003C/div\u003E\n\u003Ch2 id=\"dijalozi-i-polja\"\u003EDijalozi i polja\u003C/h2\u003E\n\u003Cdiv class=\"ht-wrap\"\u003E\u003Ctable class=\"ht\"\u003E\u003Cthead\u003E\u003Ctr\u003E\u003Cth scope=\"col\"\u003ETipka\u003C/th\u003E\u003Cth scope=\"col\"\u003EŠto radi\u003C/th\u003E\u003C/tr\u003E\u003C/thead\u003E\u003Ctbody\u003E\u003Ctr\u003E\u003Ctd\u003E\u003Ckbd class=\"hk\"\u003E\u003Cspan class=\"k-mac\" title=\"Return\"\u003EReturn\u003C/span\u003E\u003Cspan class=\"k-pc\"\u003EEnter\u003C/span\u003E\u003C/kbd\u003E\u003C/td\u003E\u003Ctd\u003EU polju: primjenjuje vrijednost. U dijaloškom okviru za kalibraciju: \u003Cspan class=\"hui\"\u003EPostavi mjerilo\u003C/span\u003E.\u003C/td\u003E\u003C/tr\u003E\u003Ctr\u003E\u003Ctd\u003E\u003Ckbd class=\"hk\"\u003E\u003Cspan class=\"k-mac\" title=\"Esc\"\u003EEsc\u003C/span\u003E\u003Cspan class=\"k-pc\"\u003EEsc\u003C/span\u003E\u003C/kbd\u003E\u003C/td\u003E\u003Ctd\u003EZatvara dijaloški okvir (kao \u003Cspan class=\"hui\"\u003EOdustani\u003C/span\u003E); zatvara obrazac \u003Cspan class=\"hui\"\u003ENova stavka\u003C/span\u003E.\u003C/td\u003E\u003C/tr\u003E\u003Ctr\u003E\u003Ctd\u003E\u003Ckbd class=\"hk\"\u003E\u003Cspan class=\"k-mac\" title=\"Tab\"\u003ETab\u003C/span\u003E\u003Cspan class=\"k-pc\"\u003ETab\u003C/span\u003E\u003C/kbd\u003E\u003C/td\u003E\u003Ctd\u003EPrelazi na sljedeće polje.\u003C/td\u003E\u003C/tr\u003E\u003C/tbody\u003E\u003C/table\u003E\u003C/div\u003E\n\u003Ch2 id=\"napomene-o-platformi\"\u003ENapomene o platformi\u003C/h2\u003E\n\u003Cdiv class=\"hv\" data-v=\"os:mac\"\u003E\u003Cp class=\"hv-label\"\u003EMac\u003C/p\u003E\n\u003Cul\u003E\u003Cli\u003E\u003Ckbd class=\"hk\"\u003E\u003Cspan class=\"k-mac\" title=\"Command\"\u003E⌘\u003C/span\u003E\u003Cspan class=\"k-pc\"\u003ECtrl\u003C/span\u003E\u003C/kbd\u003E je tipka Command: \u003Ckbd class=\"hk\"\u003E\u003Cspan class=\"k-mac\" title=\"Command Z\"\u003E⌘Z\u003C/span\u003E\u003Cspan class=\"k-pc\"\u003ECtrl+Z\u003C/span\u003E\u003C/kbd\u003E, \u003Ckbd class=\"hk\"\u003E\u003Cspan class=\"k-mac\" title=\"Command S\"\u003E⌘S\u003C/span\u003E\u003Cspan class=\"k-pc\"\u003ECtrl+S\u003C/span\u003E\u003C/kbd\u003E, \u003Ckbd class=\"hk\"\u003E\u003Cspan class=\"k-mac\" title=\"Command O\"\u003E⌘O\u003C/span\u003E\u003Cspan class=\"k-pc\"\u003ECtrl+O\u003C/span\u003E\u003C/kbd\u003E. Cijeli zaslon je iznimka: Control+Shift+F.\u003C/li\u003E\u003Cli\u003EDesni klik je klik dvama prstima na trackpadu, kad je sekundarni klik uključen u Postavkama sustava, pod Trackpad. TakeoffDesk čita samo sekundarnu tipku; Control-klik može se uzeti kao običan klik i dodati točku.\u003C/li\u003E\u003Cli\u003EPomicanje dvama prstima na trackpadu zumira list (ne pomiče ga). Za pomicanje pritisnite i povucite ili držite \u003Ckbd class=\"hk\"\u003E\u003Cspan class=\"k-mac\" title=\"Space\"\u003ESpace\u003C/span\u003E\u003Cspan class=\"k-pc\"\u003ESpace\u003C/span\u003E\u003C/kbd\u003E i povucite.\u003C/li\u003E\u003Cli\u003EPage Up i Page Down su fn sa strelicama gore i dolje na tipkovnicama bez njih.\u003C/li\u003E\u003Cli\u003EBackspace je tipka označena oznakom delete.\u003C/li\u003E\u003C/ul\u003E\n\u003C/div\u003E\n\u003Cdiv class=\"hv\" data-v=\"os:windows\"\u003E\u003Cp class=\"hv-label\"\u003EWindows\u003C/p\u003E\n\u003Cul\u003E\u003Cli\u003E\u003Ckbd class=\"hk\"\u003E\u003Cspan class=\"k-mac\" title=\"Command\"\u003E⌘\u003C/span\u003E\u003Cspan class=\"k-pc\"\u003ECtrl\u003C/span\u003E\u003C/kbd\u003E je Ctrl: \u003Ckbd class=\"hk\"\u003E\u003Cspan class=\"k-mac\" title=\"Command Z\"\u003E⌘Z\u003C/span\u003E\u003Cspan class=\"k-pc\"\u003ECtrl+Z\u003C/span\u003E\u003C/kbd\u003E, \u003Ckbd class=\"hk\"\u003E\u003Cspan class=\"k-mac\" title=\"Command S\"\u003E⌘S\u003C/span\u003E\u003Cspan class=\"k-pc\"\u003ECtrl+S\u003C/span\u003E\u003C/kbd\u003E, \u003Ckbd class=\"hk\"\u003E\u003Cspan class=\"k-mac\" title=\"Command O\"\u003E⌘O\u003C/span\u003E\u003Cspan class=\"k-pc\"\u003ECtrl+O\u003C/span\u003E\u003C/kbd\u003E.\u003C/li\u003E\u003Cli\u003ENa prijenosnom trackpadu dvoprsni pomak zumira list. Za pomicanje pritisnite i povucite.\u003C/li\u003E\u003C/ul\u003E\n\u003C/div\u003E\n\u003Cdiv class=\"hv\" data-v=\"os:linux\"\u003E\u003Cp class=\"hv-label\"\u003ELinux\u003C/p\u003E\n\u003Cul\u003E\u003Cli\u003E\u003Ckbd class=\"hk\"\u003E\u003Cspan class=\"k-mac\" title=\"Command\"\u003E⌘\u003C/span\u003E\u003Cspan class=\"k-pc\"\u003ECtrl\u003C/span\u003E\u003C/kbd\u003E je Ctrl. Neke radne površine imaju vlastite prečace Ctrl+Alt ili Super; TakeoffDesk ne koristi nijedan od njih.\u003C/li\u003E\u003Cli\u003ENa touchpadu dvoprsni pomak zumira list. Za pomicanje pritisnite i povucite.\u003C/li\u003E\u003C/ul\u003E\n\u003C/div\u003E\n\u003Cdiv class=\"hv\" data-v=\"input:touch\"\u003E\u003Cp class=\"hv-label\"\u003ETouch\u003C/p\u003E\n\u003Cp\u003ETakeoffDesk čita dodir kao jedan pokazivač:\u003C/p\u003E\n\u003Cul\u003E\u003Cli\u003EDodir postavlja točku, odabire oznaku ili dodaje točku brojanja.\u003C/li\u003E\u003Cli\u003EPovlačenje jednim prstom pomiče list (u \u003Cspan class=\"hui\"\u003EAutobrojanje\u003C/span\u003E crta okvir za pretragu).\u003C/li\u003E\u003Cli\u003EStiskanje prstima za zumiranje još nije podržano. Koristite \u003Cspan class=\"hui\"\u003EPrilagodi stranicu\u003C/span\u003E i \u003Cspan class=\"hui\"\u003EPrilagodi širinu\u003C/span\u003E ili \u003Ckbd class=\"hk\"\u003E\u003Cspan class=\"k-mac\" title=\"+\"\u003E+\u003C/span\u003E\u003Cspan class=\"k-pc\"\u003E+\u003C/span\u003E\u003C/kbd\u003E i \u003Ckbd class=\"hk\"\u003E\u003Cspan class=\"k-mac\" title=\"−\"\u003E−\u003C/span\u003E\u003Cspan class=\"k-pc\"\u003E−\u003C/span\u003E\u003C/kbd\u003E na tipkovnici.\u003C/li\u003E\u003Cli\u003EZa zatvaranje površine dodirnite njezinu prvu točku. Za završetak dionice dvaput dodirnite tamo gdje preglednik dvostruki dodir pretvara u dvostruki klik, ili pritisnite \u003Ckbd class=\"hk\"\u003E\u003Cspan class=\"k-mac\" title=\"Return\"\u003EReturn\u003C/span\u003E\u003Cspan class=\"k-pc\"\u003EEnter\u003C/span\u003E\u003C/kbd\u003E na tipkovnici.\u003C/li\u003E\u003Cli\u003ENema očitanja duljine uživo dok ne dodirnete, jer nema lebdenja pokazivača.\u003C/li\u003E\u003C/ul\u003E\n\u003Cp\u003EZa predmjer danas je bolji način tipkovnica i miš ili trackpad.\u003C/p\u003E\n\u003C/div\u003E\n\u003Ch2 id=\"tipke-koje-preglednik-zadr-ava\"\u003ETipke koje preglednik zadržava\u003C/h2\u003E\n\u003Cp\u003EPreglednici zadržavaju neke prečace za sebe i stranica ih ne može koristiti: zatvaranje kartice (\u003Ckbd class=\"hk\"\u003E\u003Cspan class=\"k-mac\" title=\"Command W\"\u003E⌘W\u003C/span\u003E\u003Cspan class=\"k-pc\"\u003ECtrl+W\u003C/span\u003E\u003C/kbd\u003E), nova kartica ili prozor (\u003Ckbd class=\"hk\"\u003E\u003Cspan class=\"k-mac\" title=\"Command T\"\u003E⌘T\u003C/span\u003E\u003Cspan class=\"k-pc\"\u003ECtrl+T\u003C/span\u003E\u003C/kbd\u003E, \u003Ckbd class=\"hk\"\u003E\u003Cspan class=\"k-mac\" title=\"Command N\"\u003E⌘N\u003C/span\u003E\u003Cspan class=\"k-pc\"\u003ECtrl+N\u003C/span\u003E\u003C/kbd\u003E) i zumiranje preglednika (\u003Ckbd class=\"hk\"\u003E\u003Cspan class=\"k-mac\" title=\"Command +\"\u003E⌘+\u003C/span\u003E\u003Cspan class=\"k-pc\"\u003ECtrl++\u003C/span\u003E\u003C/kbd\u003E, \u003Ckbd class=\"hk\"\u003E\u003Cspan class=\"k-mac\" title=\"Command −\"\u003E⌘−\u003C/span\u003E\u003Cspan class=\"k-pc\"\u003ECtrl+−\u003C/span\u003E\u003C/kbd\u003E). Zato TakeoffDesk zumira list kotačićem te običnim tipkama \u003Ckbd class=\"hk\"\u003E\u003Cspan class=\"k-mac\" title=\"+\"\u003E+\u003C/span\u003E\u003Cspan class=\"k-pc\"\u003E+\u003C/span\u003E\u003C/kbd\u003E i \u003Ckbd class=\"hk\"\u003E\u003Cspan class=\"k-mac\" title=\"−\"\u003E−\u003C/span\u003E\u003Cspan class=\"k-pc\"\u003E−\u003C/span\u003E\u003C/kbd\u003E. Ako slučajno pritisnete \u003Ckbd class=\"hk\"\u003E\u003Cspan class=\"k-mac\" title=\"Command +\"\u003E⌘+\u003C/span\u003E\u003Cspan class=\"k-pc\"\u003ECtrl++\u003C/span\u003E\u003C/kbd\u003E, cijela stranica se povećava; \u003Ckbd class=\"hk\"\u003E\u003Cspan class=\"k-mac\" title=\"Command 0\"\u003E⌘0\u003C/span\u003E\u003Cspan class=\"k-pc\"\u003ECtrl+0\u003C/span\u003E\u003C/kbd\u003E je vraća. Pogledajte \u003Ca href=\"/tutorials/basics/keys\" data-topic=\"basics/keys\"\u003ETipke, miševi i trackpadi\u003C/a\u003E.\u003C/p\u003E\n\u003Ch2 id=\"gdje-je-naredba-pomakni\"\u003EGdje je naredba Pomakni\u003C/h2\u003E\n\u003Cp\u003ENaredba Pomakni ne postoji: odaberite točku brojanja i povucite je, ili odaberite površinu ili liniju i povucite njezine ručke kuta.\u003C/p\u003E","text":"Tipke slova rade kad je pokazivač bilo gdje na stranici i ne upisujete u polje. Dok je dijaloški okvir otvoren, primjenjuju se njegove vlastite tipke. Slova rade s Shift ili bez njega. Alati Tipka Alat V Odaberi L Linearno A Površina O Kružnica B Prostorija (ispuni prostoriju jednim klikom) R Luk uključeno ili isključeno (u alatima Linearno, Površina i Otvor) E Odbitak uključeno ili isključeno: sljedeći segmenti dionice crtaju se, ali se ne broje Znamenka, @ ili # tijekom crtanja Otvara okvir Upis: upišite duljinu ili koordinate, Enter postavlja točku (Mjerenje linearnih dionica) X Otvor (prvo odaberite površinu) C Broji S Autobrojanje K Kalibriraj D Provjeri mjerilo Tijekom crtanja Tipka ili radnja Što radi Klik Postavlja točku (točku, uz Broji). P Putanja: odaberite cijelu povezanu putanju linije PDF-a ili obris oko klika (Odabir linija PDF-a). F3 Hvatanje na linije crteža uključeno ili isključeno (Hvatanje na linije crteža). Shift držan dok kliknete Hvata segment na 0°, 45°, 90° ili 135° od zadnje točke. Ne vrijedi za točke luka ni za kružnice. Dvostruki klik Završava dionicu ili zatvara površinu ili otvor. Enter Završava dionicu ili zatvara površinu ili otvor. Desni klik (bez pomicanja) Završava dionicu ili zatvara površinu ili otvor. Klik na prvu točku Zatvara površinu ili otvor (od treće točke). Backspace ili Delete Uklanja zadnju točku (prvo točku luka na čekanju). Esc Odbacuje točku luka na čekanju; zatim poništava nedovršenu oznaku; zatim se vraća na Odaberi. Odabir i uređivanje Tipka ili radnja Što radi Klik na oznaku (alat Odaberi) Odabire je i čini njezinu stavku aktivnom. Shift + klik na oznaku Dodaje je u odabir ili je uklanja iz njega. Ctrl+A Odabire sve oznake na otvorenom listu. Povucite ručku kuta Pomiče tu točku (Shift hvata na 45°). Radi kad je odabrana jedna oznaka. Delete ili Backspace Briše odabrane oznake (kad ne crtate). Esc Poništava odabir: briše odabir i crtu provjere. Ctrl+Z Poništi. Ctrl+Y ili Ctrl+Shift+Z Ponovi. Kopiranje i lijepljenje Tipka Što radi Ctrl+C Kopira odabrane oznake, sa stavkama. Ctrl+X Izrezuje: kopira odabrane oznake, zatim ih briše. Ctrl+V Zalijepi: kopija prati pokazivač; kliknite gdje ide. Ctrl+Shift+V Zalijepi na isto mjesto: isto mjesto na otvorenom listu. Ctrl+D Dupliciraj odabrane oznake: kopija prati pokazivač; kliknite gdje ide. Esc Ne ostavlja ništa: odustaje od lijepljenja ili dupliciranja koje je na pokazivaču. Same slova i dalje biraju alate (C je Broji, D je Provjeri, X je Otvor, V je Odaberi, A je Površina); tek Ctrl uz njih kopira i lijepi. U polju za tekst ove tipke kopiraju i lijepe tekst kao i obično. Pogledajte Kopiranje, lijepljenje i dupliciranje oznaka. Backspace briše odabranu oznaku kad ne crtate. Ako se to dogodi slučajno, Ctrl+Z je vraća. Datoteke Tipka Što radi Ctrl+O Otvori nacrte Ctrl+S Spremi predmjer Ove dvije tipke rade i dok upisujete u polje. Prikaz i listovi Tipka ili radnja Što radi Kotačić miša Zumira prema unutra i van na pokazivaču. Povlačenje (lijevom, srednjom ili desnom tipkom) Pomicanje prikaza. U Autobrojanje povlačenje lijevom tipkom crta okvir za pretragu. Space držan + povlačenje Pomicanje prikaza, u bilo kojem alatu. F Prilagodi stranicu W Prilagodi širinu + ili = Zumira prema unutra u sredini prikaza. − Zumira van u sredini prikaza. Page Down / Page Up Sljedeći ili prethodni list u popisu listova. Ctrl+Shift+F Mijenja načine cijelog zaslona (Control na svim platformama, pa i na Macu). F1 Otvara ili zatvara ovu pomoć, bočnu ploču. 3 3D pregled provjere lista, uključeno ili isključeno. Prikaz 3D Tipka ili radnja Što radi Povlačenje ili povlačenje srednjom tipkom Orbitiranje. Shift + povlačenje ili povlačenje desnom tipkom Pomicanje prikaza. Kotačić miša Zumiranje na pokazivaču. Na trackpadu dvoprsni pomak orbitira, a stiskanje prstima zumira. Klik Odabire oznaku ispod pokazivača (Shift + klik dodaje ili uklanja). F ili W Zumiraj opseg. 3 Natrag na ravni list. Pogledajte Provjera predmjera u 3D. Autobrojanje Tipka ili radnja Što radi Povucite okvir Obuhvaća simbol za pretragu (pokreće pretragu). Klik na okvir podudaranja Odbacuje ga ili vraća. Esc Odustaje od pokrenute pretrage ili odbacuje pregled. Pomoć Tipka Što radi F1 Otvara ili zatvara ploču pomoći (također gumb Pomoć u traci aplikacije). Radi u svim alatima, čak i dok upisujete u polje. Esc Zatvara ploču pomoći. U njezinu okviru za pretragu prvi Esc briše pretragu. Dok je ploča otvorena, Esc pritisnut nakon klika na list najprije zatvara ploču; pritisnite ga ponovno da odustanete u TakeoffDesku. Na mnogim Mac tipkovnicama gornji red upravlja svjetlinom i zvukom. Pritisnite fn s F1 ili uključite „Koristi tipke F1, F2 itd. kao standardne funkcijske tipke“ u Postavkama sustava, pod Tipkovnica. Dijalozi i polja Tipka Što radi Enter U polju: primjenjuje vrijednost. U dijaloškom okviru za kalibraciju: Postavi mjerilo. Esc Zatvara dijaloški okvir (kao Odustani); zatvara obrazac Nova stavka. Tab Prelazi na sljedeće polje. Napomene o platformi Ctrl je tipka Command: Ctrl+Z, Ctrl+S, Ctrl+O. Cijeli zaslon je iznimka: Control+Shift+F. Desni klik je klik dvama prstima na trackpadu, kad je sekundarni klik uključen u Postavkama sustava, pod Trackpad. TakeoffDesk čita samo sekundarnu tipku; Control-klik može se uzeti kao običan klik i dodati točku. Pomicanje dvama prstima na trackpadu zumira list (ne pomiče ga). Za pomicanje pritisnite i povucite ili držite Space i povucite. Page Up i Page Down su fn sa strelicama gore i dolje na tipkovnicama bez njih. Backspace je tipka označena oznakom delete. Ctrl je Ctrl: Ctrl+Z, Ctrl+S, Ctrl+O. Na prijenosnom trackpadu dvoprsni pomak zumira list. Za pomicanje pritisnite i povucite. Ctrl je Ctrl. Neke radne površine imaju vlastite prečace Ctrl+Alt ili Super; TakeoffDesk ne koristi nijedan od njih. Na touchpadu dvoprsni pomak zumira list. Za pomicanje pritisnite i povucite. TakeoffDesk čita dodir kao jedan pokazivač: Dodir postavlja točku, odabire oznaku ili dodaje točku brojanja. Povlačenje jednim prstom pomiče list (u Autobrojanje crta okvir za pretragu). Stiskanje prstima za zumiranje još nije podržano. Koristite Prilagodi stranicu i Prilagodi širinu ili + i − na tipkovnici. Za zatvaranje površine dodirnite njezinu prvu točku. Za završetak dionice dvaput dodirnite tamo gdje preglednik dvostruki dodir pretvara u dvostruki klik, ili pritisnite Enter na tipkovnici. Nema očitanja duljine uživo dok ne dodirnete, jer nema lebdenja pokazivača. Za predmjer danas je bolji način tipkovnica i miš ili trackpad. Tipke koje preglednik zadržava Preglednici zadržavaju neke prečace za sebe i stranica ih ne može koristiti: zatvaranje kartice (Ctrl+W), nova kartica ili prozor (Ctrl+T, Ctrl+N) i zumiranje preglednika (Ctrl++, Ctrl+−). Zato TakeoffDesk zumira list kotačićem te običnim tipkama + i −. Ako slučajno pritisnete Ctrl++, cijela stranica se povećava; Ctrl+0 je vraća. Pogledajte Tipke, miševi i trackpadi. Gdje je naredba Pomakni Naredba Pomakni ne postoji: odaberite točku brojanja i povucite je, ili odaberite površinu ili liniju i povucite njezine ručke kuta.","lang":"hr"},{"slug":"entry-formats","scope":"takeoffcraft","title":"Unos duljina, cijena i postotaka","summary":"Što možete upisati za udaljenosti, visine, novčane cijene i postotke gubitka, s primjerima i porukama za unos koji TakeoffDesk ne može pročitati.","section":"reference","order":20,"keywords":["unos","format","stope","inči","razlomci","decimalne stope","metrički","metri","milimetri","cijena","novac","dolari","postotak","gubitak","tipkanje"],"headings":[{"id":"duljine","text":"Duljine","level":2},{"id":"aritmetika","text":"Aritmetika","level":3},{"id":"kako-se-duljine-prikazuju","text":"Kako se duljine prikazuju","level":2},{"id":"cijene-materijal-i-rad-po-jedinici","text":"Cijene (materijal i rad po jedinici)","level":2},{"id":"postotak-gubitka","text":"Postotak gubitka","level":2},{"id":"nazivi-i-jedinice","text":"Nazivi i jedinice","level":2},{"id":"formule","text":"Formule","level":2}],"html":"\u003Ch2 id=\"duljine\"\u003EDuljine\u003C/h2\u003E\n\u003Cp\u003EKoriste ih \u003Cstrong\u003EStvarna udaljenost\u003C/strong\u003E u \u003Cspan class=\"hui\"\u003EKalibriraj\u003C/span\u003E te \u003Cspan class=\"hui\"\u003EVisina\u003C/span\u003E i \u003Cspan class=\"hui\"\u003EDubina\u003C/span\u003E u uređivaču stavke.\u003C/p\u003E\n\u003Cdiv class=\"ht-wrap\"\u003E\u003Ctable class=\"ht\"\u003E\u003Cthead\u003E\u003Ctr\u003E\u003Cth scope=\"col\"\u003EUpišete\u003C/th\u003E\u003Cth scope=\"col\"\u003EZnači\u003C/th\u003E\u003C/tr\u003E\u003C/thead\u003E\u003Ctbody\u003E\u003Ctr\u003E\u003Ctd\u003E\u003Ccode\u003E24&#039;-0&quot;\u003C/code\u003E\u003C/td\u003E\u003Ctd\u003E24 stope\u003C/td\u003E\u003C/tr\u003E\u003Ctr\u003E\u003Ctd\u003E\u003Ccode\u003E24&#039;-6 1/2&quot;\u003C/code\u003E\u003C/td\u003E\u003Ctd\u003E24 stope i 6½ inča\u003C/td\u003E\u003C/tr\u003E\u003Ctr\u003E\u003Ctd\u003E\u003Ccode\u003E12&#039; 6 1/2&quot;\u003C/code\u003E\u003C/td\u003E\u003Ctd\u003E12 stopa i 6½ inča (razmak umjesto crtice)\u003C/td\u003E\u003C/tr\u003E\u003Ctr\u003E\u003Ctd\u003E\u003Ccode\u003E12&#039;-6-1/2&quot;\u003C/code\u003E\u003C/td\u003E\u003Ctd\u003E12 stopa i 6½ inča (crtice između dijelova)\u003C/td\u003E\u003C/tr\u003E\u003Ctr\u003E\u003Ctd\u003E\u003Ccode\u003E24&#039;\u003C/code\u003E\u003C/td\u003E\u003Ctd\u003E24 stope\u003C/td\u003E\u003C/tr\u003E\u003Ctr\u003E\u003Ctd\u003E\u003Ccode\u003E30&quot;\u003C/code\u003E\u003C/td\u003E\u003Ctd\u003E30 inča\u003C/td\u003E\u003C/tr\u003E\u003Ctr\u003E\u003Ctd\u003E\u003Ccode\u003E6 1/2&quot;\u003C/code\u003E\u003C/td\u003E\u003Ctd\u003E6½ inča\u003C/td\u003E\u003C/tr\u003E\u003Ctr\u003E\u003Ctd\u003E\u003Ccode\u003E3/4&quot;\u003C/code\u003E\u003C/td\u003E\u003Ctd\u003E¾ inča\u003C/td\u003E\u003C/tr\u003E\u003Ctr\u003E\u003Ctd\u003E\u003Ccode\u003E24 ft 6 in\u003C/code\u003E\u003C/td\u003E\u003Ctd\u003E24 stope i 6 inča (također \u003Ccode\u003Efoot\u003C/code\u003E, \u003Ccode\u003Efeet\u003C/code\u003E, \u003Ccode\u003Einch\u003C/code\u003E, \u003Ccode\u003Einches\u003C/code\u003E)\u003C/td\u003E\u003C/tr\u003E\u003Ctr\u003E\u003Ctd\u003E\u003Ccode\u003E24.5\u003C/code\u003E\u003C/td\u003E\u003Ctd\u003E24.5 u zadanoj jedinici (vidi dolje)\u003C/td\u003E\u003C/tr\u003E\u003Ctr\u003E\u003Ctd\u003E\u003Ccode\u003E24.5&#039;\u003C/code\u003E\u003C/td\u003E\u003Ctd\u003E24.5 stopa\u003C/td\u003E\u003C/tr\u003E\u003Ctr\u003E\u003Ctd\u003E\u003Ccode\u003E7.5 m\u003C/code\u003E\u003C/td\u003E\u003Ctd\u003E7.5 metara\u003C/td\u003E\u003C/tr\u003E\u003Ctr\u003E\u003Ctd\u003E\u003Ccode\u003E750 cm\u003C/code\u003E\u003C/td\u003E\u003Ctd\u003E750 centimetara\u003C/td\u003E\u003C/tr\u003E\u003Ctr\u003E\u003Ctd\u003E\u003Ccode\u003E7500 mm\u003C/code\u003E\u003C/td\u003E\u003Ctd\u003E7,500 milimetara\u003C/td\u003E\u003C/tr\u003E\u003C/tbody\u003E\u003C/table\u003E\u003C/div\u003E\n\u003Cul\u003E\u003Cli\u003EObičan broj je u \u003Cstrong\u003Estopama\u003C/strong\u003E za kalibraciju i za stavke u LF, SF ili SY, a u \u003Cstrong\u003Emetrima\u003C/strong\u003E za stavke u m ili m².\u003C/li\u003E\u003Cli\u003EKosi navodnici i oznake minuta iz tekst-procesora (′ ″ ’ ”) rade kao \u003Ccode\u003E&#039;\u003C/code\u003E i \u003Ccode\u003E&quot;\u003C/code\u003E. Dvije apostrofe \u003Ccode\u003E&#039;&#039;\u003C/code\u003E vrijede kao \u003Ccode\u003E&quot;\u003C/code\u003E.\u003C/li\u003E\u003Cli\u003EZarezi se zanemaruju: \u003Ccode\u003E1,200 mm\u003C/code\u003E je 1200 mm.\u003C/li\u003E\u003Cli\u003ERazlomci zahtijevaju cijele brojeve s obje strane: \u003Ccode\u003E6 1/2&quot;\u003C/code\u003E radi, \u003Ccode\u003E6.5 1/2&quot;\u003C/code\u003E ne.\u003C/li\u003E\u003Cli\u003ENulte i negativne udaljenosti se odbijaju.\u003C/li\u003E\u003C/ul\u003E\n\u003Cp\u003EPoruke:\u003C/p\u003E\n\u003Cul\u003E\u003Cli\u003E„Upišite udaljenost, npr. 24&#039;-0&quot; ili 7.5 m.“ (polje je prazno)\u003C/li\u003E\u003Cli\u003E„Upišite udaljenost veću od nule.“\u003C/li\u003E\u003Cli\u003E„Upotrijebite stope i inče (24&#039;-6 1/2&quot;), decimalne stope, m, cm ili mm.“ (nepoznata jedinica)\u003C/li\u003E\u003Cli\u003E„Tu udaljenost nije moguće pročitati. Pokušajte 24&#039;-6 1/2&quot; ili 24.5.“\u003C/li\u003E\u003C/ul\u003E\n\u003Cp\u003EDa obrišete visinu ili dubinu stavke, ispraznite polje.\u003C/p\u003E\n\u003Ch3 id=\"aritmetika\"\u003EAritmetika\u003C/h3\u003E\n\u003Cp\u003ESvako polje za duljinu, kao i okvir za upis dok crtate, prihvaća i račun sa \u003Ccode\u003E+\u003C/code\u003E, \u003Ccode\u003E-\u003C/code\u003E, \u003Ccode\u003E*\u003C/code\u003E, \u003Ccode\u003E/\u003C/code\u003E i zagradama: \u003Ccode\u003E4+7/16\u003C/code\u003E (4.4375 u zadanoj jedinici), \u003Ccode\u003E12&#039;6&quot; + 3/4&quot;\u003C/code\u003E, \u003Ccode\u003E(24&#039;-0&quot;)/3\u003C/code\u003E (8 stopa), \u003Ccode\u003E2*450mm\u003C/code\u003E.\u003C/p\u003E\n\u003Cul\u003E\u003Cli\u003ECrtica upisana u duljinu i dalje je njezin dio: \u003Ccode\u003E24&#039;-6&quot;\u003C/code\u003E je 24 stope i 6 inča, a \u003Ccode\u003E6-1/2\u003C/code\u003E je 6½. Za oduzimanje stavite razmake oko crtice: \u003Ccode\u003E24&#039; - 6&quot;\u003C/code\u003E je 23&#039;-6&quot;.\u003C/li\u003E\u003Cli\u003EObičan broj množi ili dijeli duljinu kao broj; dodan duljini, u zadanoj je jedinici.\u003C/li\u003E\u003Cli\u003ERade i \u003Ccode\u003Eabs\u003C/code\u003E, \u003Ccode\u003Eround\u003C/code\u003E, \u003Ccode\u003Eceil\u003C/code\u003E i \u003Ccode\u003Efloor\u003C/code\u003E. Račun koji se ne može pročitati odbija se uz navod gdje je pogriješeno.\u003C/li\u003E\u003C/ul\u003E\n\u003Ch2 id=\"kako-se-duljine-prikazuju\"\u003EKako se duljine prikazuju\u003C/h2\u003E\n\u003Cp\u003EDuljine se prikazuju u stopama, inčima i šesnaestinama: \u003Ccode\u003E12&#039;-6 1/2&quot;\u003C/code\u003E, \u003Ccode\u003E0&#039;-0 3/4&quot;\u003C/code\u003E. Vrijednosti se za prikaz zaokružuju na najbližu 1/16 inča; same količine nisu zaokružene. Decimalne vrijednosti prikazuju se s dvije decimale i separatorima tisućica, npr. \u003Ccode\u003E1,234.50 LF\u003C/code\u003E.\u003C/p\u003E\n\u003Ch2 id=\"cijene-materijal-i-rad-po-jedinici\"\u003ECijene (materijal i rad po jedinici)\u003C/h2\u003E\n\u003Cdiv class=\"ht-wrap\"\u003E\u003Ctable class=\"ht\"\u003E\u003Cthead\u003E\u003Ctr\u003E\u003Cth scope=\"col\"\u003EUpišete\u003C/th\u003E\u003Cth scope=\"col\"\u003EZnači\u003C/th\u003E\u003C/tr\u003E\u003C/thead\u003E\u003Ctbody\u003E\u003Ctr\u003E\u003Ctd\u003E\u003Ccode\u003E12.5\u003C/code\u003E\u003C/td\u003E\u003Ctd\u003E$12.50\u003C/td\u003E\u003C/tr\u003E\u003Ctr\u003E\u003Ctd\u003E\u003Ccode\u003E$12.50\u003C/code\u003E\u003C/td\u003E\u003Ctd\u003E$12.50\u003C/td\u003E\u003C/tr\u003E\u003Ctr\u003E\u003Ctd\u003E\u003Ccode\u003E1,250\u003C/code\u003E\u003C/td\u003E\u003Ctd\u003E$1,250.00\u003C/td\u003E\u003C/tr\u003E\u003Ctr\u003E\u003Ctd\u003E\u003Ccode\u003E0.385\u003C/code\u003E\u003C/td\u003E\u003Ctd\u003E$0.385 (do četiri decimale; više se zaokružuje)\u003C/td\u003E\u003C/tr\u003E\u003Ctr\u003E\u003Ctd\u003E(prazno)\u003C/td\u003E\u003Ctd\u003E$0\u003C/td\u003E\u003C/tr\u003E\u003C/tbody\u003E\u003C/table\u003E\u003C/div\u003E\n\u003Cp\u003EPoruka: „Upišite iznos, npr. 12.50.“ ili „Taj iznos je prevelik.“ Negativne cijene se ne prihvaćaju.\u003C/p\u003E\n\u003Cp\u003EProšireni iznosi (materijal, rad, ukupni zbrojevi) izračunavaju se do centa: količina s gubitkom × cijena, zaokruženo polovine od nule, točno kao \u003Ccode\u003EROUND(x, 2)\u003C/code\u003E u proračunskoj tablici.\u003C/p\u003E\n\u003Ch2 id=\"postotak-gubitka\"\u003EPostotak gubitka\u003C/h2\u003E\n\u003Cdiv class=\"ht-wrap\"\u003E\u003Ctable class=\"ht\"\u003E\u003Cthead\u003E\u003Ctr\u003E\u003Cth scope=\"col\"\u003EUpišete\u003C/th\u003E\u003Cth scope=\"col\"\u003EZnači\u003C/th\u003E\u003C/tr\u003E\u003C/thead\u003E\u003Ctbody\u003E\u003Ctr\u003E\u003Ctd\u003E\u003Ccode\u003E10\u003C/code\u003E\u003C/td\u003E\u003Ctd\u003E10%\u003C/td\u003E\u003C/tr\u003E\u003Ctr\u003E\u003Ctd\u003E\u003Ccode\u003E7.5%\u003C/code\u003E\u003C/td\u003E\u003Ctd\u003E7.5%\u003C/td\u003E\u003C/tr\u003E\u003Ctr\u003E\u003Ctd\u003E(prazno)\u003C/td\u003E\u003Ctd\u003E0%\u003C/td\u003E\u003C/tr\u003E\u003C/tbody\u003E\u003C/table\u003E\u003C/div\u003E\n\u003Cp\u003EDo dvije decimale, od 0% do 1000%. Poruke: „Upišite postotak, npr. 10 ili 7.5.“ ili „Gubitak iznad 1000% nije dopušten.“\u003C/p\u003E\n\u003Ch2 id=\"nazivi-i-jedinice\"\u003ENazivi i jedinice\u003C/h2\u003E\n\u003Cul\u003E\u003Cli\u003ENazivi stavki i komponenti: do 200 znakova.\u003C/li\u003E\u003Cli\u003E\u003Cspan class=\"hui\"\u003EJedinica\u003C/span\u003E komponente: bilo koji tekst do 20 znakova, npr. \u003Ccode\u003EEA\u003C/code\u003E, \u003Ccode\u003Esheets\u003C/code\u003E, \u003Ccode\u003ECY\u003C/code\u003E, \u003Ccode\u003Egal\u003C/code\u003E. To je samo oznaka; TakeoffDesk je ne pretvara.\u003C/li\u003E\u003C/ul\u003E\n\u003Ch2 id=\"formule\"\u003EFormule\u003C/h2\u003E\n\u003Cp\u003EFormule sklopova imaju vlastita pravila: vidi \u003Ca href=\"/tutorials/takeoffcraft/formulas\" data-topic=\"takeoffcraft/formulas\"\u003EJezik formula\u003C/a\u003E.\u003C/p\u003E","text":"Duljine Koriste ih Stvarna udaljenost u Kalibriraj te Visina i Dubina u uređivaču stavke. Upišete Znači 24'-0\" 24 stope 24'-6 1/2\" 24 stope i 6½ inča 12' 6 1/2\" 12 stopa i 6½ inča (razmak umjesto crtice) 12'-6-1/2\" 12 stopa i 6½ inča (crtice između dijelova) 24' 24 stope 30\" 30 inča 6 1/2\" 6½ inča 3/4\" ¾ inča 24 ft 6 in 24 stope i 6 inča (također foot, feet, inch, inches) 24.5 24.5 u zadanoj jedinici (vidi dolje) 24.5' 24.5 stopa 7.5 m 7.5 metara 750 cm 750 centimetara 7500 mm 7,500 milimetara Običan broj je u stopama za kalibraciju i za stavke u LF, SF ili SY, a u metrima za stavke u m ili m². Kosi navodnici i oznake minuta iz tekst-procesora (′ ″ ’ ”) rade kao ' i \". Dvije apostrofe '' vrijede kao \". Zarezi se zanemaruju: 1,200 mm je 1200 mm. Razlomci zahtijevaju cijele brojeve s obje strane: 6 1/2\" radi, 6.5 1/2\" ne. Nulte i negativne udaljenosti se odbijaju. Poruke: „Upišite udaljenost, npr. 24'-0\" ili 7.5 m.“ (polje je prazno) „Upišite udaljenost veću od nule.“ „Upotrijebite stope i inče (24'-6 1/2\"), decimalne stope, m, cm ili mm.“ (nepoznata jedinica) „Tu udaljenost nije moguće pročitati. Pokušajte 24'-6 1/2\" ili 24.5.“ Da obrišete visinu ili dubinu stavke, ispraznite polje. Aritmetika Svako polje za duljinu, kao i okvir za upis dok crtate, prihvaća i račun sa +, -, *, / i zagradama: 4+7/16 (4.4375 u zadanoj jedinici), 12'6\" + 3/4\", (24'-0\")/3 (8 stopa), 2*450mm. Crtica upisana u duljinu i dalje je njezin dio: 24'-6\" je 24 stope i 6 inča, a 6-1/2 je 6½. Za oduzimanje stavite razmake oko crtice: 24' - 6\" je 23'-6\". Običan broj množi ili dijeli duljinu kao broj; dodan duljini, u zadanoj je jedinici. Rade i abs, round, ceil i floor. Račun koji se ne može pročitati odbija se uz navod gdje je pogriješeno. Kako se duljine prikazuju Duljine se prikazuju u stopama, inčima i šesnaestinama: 12'-6 1/2\", 0'-0 3/4\". Vrijednosti se za prikaz zaokružuju na najbližu 1/16 inča; same količine nisu zaokružene. Decimalne vrijednosti prikazuju se s dvije decimale i separatorima tisućica, npr. 1,234.50 LF. Cijene (materijal i rad po jedinici) Upišete Znači 12.5 $12.50 $12.50 $12.50 1,250 $1,250.00 0.385 $0.385 (do četiri decimale; više se zaokružuje) (prazno) $0 Poruka: „Upišite iznos, npr. 12.50.“ ili „Taj iznos je prevelik.“ Negativne cijene se ne prihvaćaju. Prošireni iznosi (materijal, rad, ukupni zbrojevi) izračunavaju se do centa: količina s gubitkom × cijena, zaokruženo polovine od nule, točno kao ROUND(x, 2) u proračunskoj tablici. Postotak gubitka Upišete Znači 10 10% 7.5% 7.5% (prazno) 0% Do dvije decimale, od 0% do 1000%. Poruke: „Upišite postotak, npr. 10 ili 7.5.“ ili „Gubitak iznad 1000% nije dopušten.“ Nazivi i jedinice Nazivi stavki i komponenti: do 200 znakova. Jedinica komponente: bilo koji tekst do 20 znakova, npr. EA, sheets, CY, gal. To je samo oznaka; TakeoffDesk je ne pretvara. Formule Formule sklopova imaju vlastita pravila: vidi Jezik formula.","lang":"hr"},{"slug":"scale-presets","scope":"takeoffcraft","title":"Predlošci mjerila","summary":"Svaki predložak na popisu Predložak, arhitektonski, inženjerski i metrički, i što svaki pretpostavlja o PDF-u.","section":"reference","order":30,"keywords":["mjerilo","predlošci","arhitektonsko mjerilo","inženjersko mjerilo","metričko mjerilo","omjer","1/4 palca","1/8 palca","1:100","puna veličina"],"headings":[{"id":"arhitektonsko","text":"Arhitektonsko","level":2},{"id":"in-enjersko","text":"Inženjersko","level":2},{"id":"metri-ko","text":"Metričko","level":2},{"id":"kalibrirana-mjerila","text":"Kalibrirana mjerila","level":2},{"id":"neobi-ni-pdf-ovi","text":"Neobični PDF-ovi","level":2}],"html":"\u003Cp\u003EPopis \u003Cspan class=\"hui\"\u003EPredložak\u003C/span\u003E u grupi \u003Cspan class=\"hui\"\u003EMjerilo\u003C/span\u003E ima 32 mjerila u tri skupine. Predložak postavlja mjerilo otvorenog lista točno.\u003C/p\u003E\n\u003Cp\u003ESvaki predložak pretpostavlja da je stranica PDF-a stvarna papirna veličina crteža: jedan palac na stranici PDF-a je jedan palac papira (stranice PDF-a mjere 72 točke po palcu). Ako je PDF promijenjene veličine, upotrijebite \u003Cspan class=\"hui\"\u003EKalibriraj\u003C/span\u003E. Nakon postavljanja bilo kojeg mjerila upotrijebite \u003Cspan class=\"hui\"\u003EProvjeri\u003C/span\u003E. Vidi \u003Ca href=\"/tutorials/takeoffcraft/set-the-scale\" data-topic=\"takeoffcraft/set-the-scale\"\u003EPostavljanje mjerila\u003C/a\u003E.\u003C/p\u003E\n\u003Ch2 id=\"arhitektonsko\"\u003EArhitektonsko\u003C/h2\u003E\n\u003Cdiv class=\"ht-wrap\"\u003E\u003Ctable class=\"ht\"\u003E\u003Cthead\u003E\u003Ctr\u003E\u003Cth scope=\"col\"\u003EPredložak\u003C/th\u003E\u003Cth scope=\"col\"\u003EJedan papirni palac je\u003C/th\u003E\u003C/tr\u003E\u003C/thead\u003E\u003Ctbody\u003E\u003Ctr\u003E\u003Ctd\u003E\u003Ccode\u003E1/16&quot; = 1&#039;-0&quot;\u003C/code\u003E\u003C/td\u003E\u003Ctd\u003E16 ft\u003C/td\u003E\u003C/tr\u003E\u003Ctr\u003E\u003Ctd\u003E\u003Ccode\u003E3/32&quot; = 1&#039;-0&quot;\u003C/code\u003E\u003C/td\u003E\u003Ctd\u003E10 ft 8 in\u003C/td\u003E\u003C/tr\u003E\u003Ctr\u003E\u003Ctd\u003E\u003Ccode\u003E1/8&quot; = 1&#039;-0&quot;\u003C/code\u003E\u003C/td\u003E\u003Ctd\u003E8 ft\u003C/td\u003E\u003C/tr\u003E\u003Ctr\u003E\u003Ctd\u003E\u003Ccode\u003E3/16&quot; = 1&#039;-0&quot;\u003C/code\u003E\u003C/td\u003E\u003Ctd\u003E5 ft 4 in\u003C/td\u003E\u003C/tr\u003E\u003Ctr\u003E\u003Ctd\u003E\u003Ccode\u003E1/4&quot; = 1&#039;-0&quot;\u003C/code\u003E\u003C/td\u003E\u003Ctd\u003E4 ft\u003C/td\u003E\u003C/tr\u003E\u003Ctr\u003E\u003Ctd\u003E\u003Ccode\u003E3/8&quot; = 1&#039;-0&quot;\u003C/code\u003E\u003C/td\u003E\u003Ctd\u003E2 ft 8 in\u003C/td\u003E\u003C/tr\u003E\u003Ctr\u003E\u003Ctd\u003E\u003Ccode\u003E1/2&quot; = 1&#039;-0&quot;\u003C/code\u003E\u003C/td\u003E\u003Ctd\u003E2 ft\u003C/td\u003E\u003C/tr\u003E\u003Ctr\u003E\u003Ctd\u003E\u003Ccode\u003E3/4&quot; = 1&#039;-0&quot;\u003C/code\u003E\u003C/td\u003E\u003Ctd\u003E1 ft 4 in\u003C/td\u003E\u003C/tr\u003E\u003Ctr\u003E\u003Ctd\u003E\u003Ccode\u003E1&quot; = 1&#039;-0&quot;\u003C/code\u003E\u003C/td\u003E\u003Ctd\u003E1 ft\u003C/td\u003E\u003C/tr\u003E\u003Ctr\u003E\u003Ctd\u003E\u003Ccode\u003E1 1/2&quot; = 1&#039;-0&quot;\u003C/code\u003E\u003C/td\u003E\u003Ctd\u003E8 in\u003C/td\u003E\u003C/tr\u003E\u003Ctr\u003E\u003Ctd\u003E\u003Ccode\u003E3&quot; = 1&#039;-0&quot;\u003C/code\u003E\u003C/td\u003E\u003Ctd\u003E4 in\u003C/td\u003E\u003C/tr\u003E\u003C/tbody\u003E\u003C/table\u003E\u003C/div\u003E\n\u003Ch2 id=\"in-enjersko\"\u003EInženjersko\u003C/h2\u003E\n\u003Cdiv class=\"ht-wrap\"\u003E\u003Ctable class=\"ht\"\u003E\u003Cthead\u003E\u003Ctr\u003E\u003Cth scope=\"col\"\u003EPredložak\u003C/th\u003E\u003Cth scope=\"col\"\u003EJedan papirni palac je\u003C/th\u003E\u003C/tr\u003E\u003C/thead\u003E\u003Ctbody\u003E\u003Ctr\u003E\u003Ctd\u003E\u003Ccode\u003E1&quot; = 10&#039;\u003C/code\u003E\u003C/td\u003E\u003Ctd\u003E10 ft\u003C/td\u003E\u003C/tr\u003E\u003Ctr\u003E\u003Ctd\u003E\u003Ccode\u003E1&quot; = 20&#039;\u003C/code\u003E\u003C/td\u003E\u003Ctd\u003E20 ft\u003C/td\u003E\u003C/tr\u003E\u003Ctr\u003E\u003Ctd\u003E\u003Ccode\u003E1&quot; = 30&#039;\u003C/code\u003E\u003C/td\u003E\u003Ctd\u003E30 ft\u003C/td\u003E\u003C/tr\u003E\u003Ctr\u003E\u003Ctd\u003E\u003Ccode\u003E1&quot; = 40&#039;\u003C/code\u003E\u003C/td\u003E\u003Ctd\u003E40 ft\u003C/td\u003E\u003C/tr\u003E\u003Ctr\u003E\u003Ctd\u003E\u003Ccode\u003E1&quot; = 50&#039;\u003C/code\u003E\u003C/td\u003E\u003Ctd\u003E50 ft\u003C/td\u003E\u003C/tr\u003E\u003Ctr\u003E\u003Ctd\u003E\u003Ccode\u003E1&quot; = 60&#039;\u003C/code\u003E\u003C/td\u003E\u003Ctd\u003E60 ft\u003C/td\u003E\u003C/tr\u003E\u003Ctr\u003E\u003Ctd\u003E\u003Ccode\u003E1&quot; = 100&#039;\u003C/code\u003E\u003C/td\u003E\u003Ctd\u003E100 ft\u003C/td\u003E\u003C/tr\u003E\u003C/tbody\u003E\u003C/table\u003E\u003C/div\u003E\n\u003Ch2 id=\"metri-ko\"\u003EMetričko\u003C/h2\u003E\n\u003Cp\u003E\u003Ccode\u003E1:1\u003C/code\u003E, \u003Ccode\u003E1:2\u003C/code\u003E, \u003Ccode\u003E1:5\u003C/code\u003E, \u003Ccode\u003E1:10\u003C/code\u003E, \u003Ccode\u003E1:20\u003C/code\u003E, \u003Ccode\u003E1:25\u003C/code\u003E, \u003Ccode\u003E1:50\u003C/code\u003E, \u003Ccode\u003E1:75\u003C/code\u003E, \u003Ccode\u003E1:100\u003C/code\u003E, \u003Ccode\u003E1:150\u003C/code\u003E, \u003Ccode\u003E1:200\u003C/code\u003E, \u003Ccode\u003E1:250\u003C/code\u003E, \u003Ccode\u003E1:500\u003C/code\u003E, \u003Ccode\u003E1:1000\u003C/code\u003E.\u003C/p\u003E\n\u003Cp\u003EMetrički omjer znači da je jedna jedinica na papiru toliko jedinica u stvarnosti: pri \u003Ccode\u003E1:100\u003C/code\u003E, 10 mm na stranici je 1 m.\u003C/p\u003E\n\u003Ch2 id=\"kalibrirana-mjerila\"\u003EKalibrirana mjerila\u003C/h2\u003E\n\u003Cp\u003EKalibrirano mjerilo prikazuje se kao „Kalibrirano 1&quot; = 4.002&#039; na 24&#039;-6&quot;&quot;“ u traci ispod lista: stvarne stope po papirnom palcu i udaljenost koju ste upisali. Kada je unutar 0.5% nekog predloška, traka dodaje „(odgovara 1/4&quot; = 1&#039;-0&quot;)“, a popis listova prikazuje naziv predloška.\u003C/p\u003E\n\u003Ch2 id=\"neobi-ni-pdf-ovi\"\u003ENeobični PDF-ovi\u003C/h2\u003E\n\u003Cp\u003ENeki PDF-ovi navode veću jedinicu stranice (korisnička jedinica); TakeoffDesk to uzima u obzir za predloške i za prikazano mjerilo. Stranice zakrenute u PDF-u mjere se jednako kao uspravne.\u003C/p\u003E","text":"Popis Predložak u grupi Mjerilo ima 32 mjerila u tri skupine. Predložak postavlja mjerilo otvorenog lista točno. Svaki predložak pretpostavlja da je stranica PDF-a stvarna papirna veličina crteža: jedan palac na stranici PDF-a je jedan palac papira (stranice PDF-a mjere 72 točke po palcu). Ako je PDF promijenjene veličine, upotrijebite Kalibriraj. Nakon postavljanja bilo kojeg mjerila upotrijebite Provjeri. Vidi Postavljanje mjerila. Arhitektonsko Predložak Jedan papirni palac je 1/16\" = 1'-0\" 16 ft 3/32\" = 1'-0\" 10 ft 8 in 1/8\" = 1'-0\" 8 ft 3/16\" = 1'-0\" 5 ft 4 in 1/4\" = 1'-0\" 4 ft 3/8\" = 1'-0\" 2 ft 8 in 1/2\" = 1'-0\" 2 ft 3/4\" = 1'-0\" 1 ft 4 in 1\" = 1'-0\" 1 ft 1 1/2\" = 1'-0\" 8 in 3\" = 1'-0\" 4 in Inženjersko Predložak Jedan papirni palac je 1\" = 10' 10 ft 1\" = 20' 20 ft 1\" = 30' 30 ft 1\" = 40' 40 ft 1\" = 50' 50 ft 1\" = 60' 60 ft 1\" = 100' 100 ft Metričko 1:1, 1:2, 1:5, 1:10, 1:20, 1:25, 1:50, 1:75, 1:100, 1:150, 1:200, 1:250, 1:500, 1:1000. Metrički omjer znači da je jedna jedinica na papiru toliko jedinica u stvarnosti: pri 1:100, 10 mm na stranici je 1 m. Kalibrirana mjerila Kalibrirano mjerilo prikazuje se kao „Kalibrirano 1\" = 4.002' na 24'-6\"\"“ u traci ispod lista: stvarne stope po papirnom palcu i udaljenost koju ste upisali. Kada je unutar 0.5% nekog predloška, traka dodaje „(odgovara 1/4\" = 1'-0\")“, a popis listova prikazuje naziv predloška. Neobični PDF-ovi Neki PDF-ovi navode veću jedinicu stranice (korisnička jedinica); TakeoffDesk to uzima u obzir za predloške i za prikazano mjerilo. Stranice zakrenute u PDF-u mjere se jednako kao uspravne.","lang":"hr"},{"slug":"formulas","scope":"takeoffcraft","title":"Jezik formula","summary":"Pravila za formule količina sklopova: varijable, operatori, funkcije, zaokruživanje i svaka poruka o greškama.","section":"reference","order":40,"keywords":["formula","izraz","sintaksa","funkcije","ceil","floor","round","min","max","abs","varijable","operatori","račun"],"headings":[{"id":"varijable","text":"Varijable","level":2},{"id":"operatori","text":"Operatori","level":2},{"id":"funkcije","text":"Funkcije","level":2},{"id":"gre-ke","text":"Greške","level":2},{"id":"sigurno-po-zamisli","text":"Sigurno po zamisli","level":2}],"html":"\u003Cp\u003EKomponente sklopova dobivaju količinu iz formule. Formula je mali aritmetički izraz nad izmjerenim vrijednostima stavke. Za radne primjere vidi \u003Ca href=\"/tutorials/takeoffcraft/assemblies\" data-topic=\"takeoffcraft/assemblies\"\u003ESklopovi i formule\u003C/a\u003E.\u003C/p\u003E\n\u003Ch2 id=\"varijable\"\u003EVarijable\u003C/h2\u003E\n\u003Cdiv class=\"ht-wrap\"\u003E\u003Ctable class=\"ht\"\u003E\u003Cthead\u003E\u003Ctr\u003E\u003Cth scope=\"col\"\u003EVrsta stavke\u003C/th\u003E\u003Cth scope=\"col\"\u003EVarijabla\u003C/th\u003E\u003Cth scope=\"col\"\u003EZnačenje\u003C/th\u003E\u003C/tr\u003E\u003C/thead\u003E\u003Ctbody\u003E\u003Ctr\u003E\u003Ctd\u003ELinearna\u003C/td\u003E\u003Ctd\u003E\u003Ccode\u003EL\u003C/code\u003E\u003C/td\u003E\u003Ctd\u003EUkupna duljina\u003C/td\u003E\u003C/tr\u003E\u003Ctr\u003E\u003Ctd\u003ELinearna\u003C/td\u003E\u003Ctd\u003E\u003Ccode\u003EH\u003C/code\u003E\u003C/td\u003E\u003Ctd\u003EVisina stavke\u003C/td\u003E\u003C/tr\u003E\u003Ctr\u003E\u003Ctd\u003ELinearna\u003C/td\u003E\u003Ctd\u003E\u003Ccode\u003EA\u003C/code\u003E\u003C/td\u003E\u003Ctd\u003EPovršina zida, L × H, umanjena za otvore dionica koje ih imaju (predmjer iz programa BimCraft). Kad taj predmjer navodi metodu mjerenja, \u003Ccode\u003EA\u003C/code\u003E se mjeri njome: otvori ne veći od najmanje veličine metode ostaju uračunati, a ono što metoda oduzima na spojevima zidova izostavlja se. Napomena ispod stavke navodi metodu\u003C/td\u003E\u003C/tr\u003E\u003Ctr\u003E\u003Ctd\u003ELinearna\u003C/td\u003E\u003Ctd\u003E\u003Ccode\u003EN\u003C/code\u003E\u003C/td\u003E\u003Ctd\u003EBroj dionica\u003C/td\u003E\u003C/tr\u003E\u003Ctr\u003E\u003Ctd\u003EPovršina\u003C/td\u003E\u003Ctd\u003E\u003Ccode\u003EA\u003C/code\u003E\u003C/td\u003E\u003Ctd\u003EUkupna neto površina (konture minus izrezi)\u003C/td\u003E\u003C/tr\u003E\u003Ctr\u003E\u003Ctd\u003EPovršina\u003C/td\u003E\u003Ctd\u003E\u003Ccode\u003EP\u003C/code\u003E\u003C/td\u003E\u003Ctd\u003EUkupni opseg, uključujući rubove izreza\u003C/td\u003E\u003C/tr\u003E\u003Ctr\u003E\u003Ctd\u003EPovršina\u003C/td\u003E\u003Ctd\u003E\u003Ccode\u003EH\u003C/code\u003E\u003C/td\u003E\u003Ctd\u003EDubina ili debljina stavke\u003C/td\u003E\u003C/tr\u003E\u003Ctr\u003E\u003Ctd\u003EPovršina\u003C/td\u003E\u003Ctd\u003E\u003Ccode\u003EN\u003C/code\u003E\u003C/td\u003E\u003Ctd\u003EBroj površina\u003C/td\u003E\u003C/tr\u003E\u003Ctr\u003E\u003Ctd\u003EBroj\u003C/td\u003E\u003Ctd\u003E\u003Ccode\u003EN\u003C/code\u003E\u003C/td\u003E\u003Ctd\u003EBroj\u003C/td\u003E\u003C/tr\u003E\u003C/tbody\u003E\u003C/table\u003E\u003C/div\u003E\n\u003Cul\u003E\u003Cli\u003EVarijable su u jedinicama stavke: vidi \u003Ca href=\"/tutorials/takeoffcraft/units\" data-topic=\"takeoffcraft/units\"\u003EJedinice\u003C/a\u003E.\u003C/li\u003E\u003Cli\u003EVelika i mala slova su ista: \u003Ccode\u003El\u003C/code\u003E je \u003Ccode\u003EL\u003C/code\u003E.\u003C/li\u003E\u003Cli\u003ERade samo varijable vrste same stavke. \u003Ccode\u003EP\u003C/code\u003E kod linearne stavke daje \u003Ccode\u003E&quot;P&quot; ovdje nije izmjerena vrijednost. Upotrijebite L, H, A, N.\u003C/code\u003E\u003C/li\u003E\u003Cli\u003EPrazna visina ili dubina je 0.\u003C/li\u003E\u003C/ul\u003E\n\u003Ch2 id=\"operatori\"\u003EOperatori\u003C/h2\u003E\n\u003Cdiv class=\"ht-wrap\"\u003E\u003Ctable class=\"ht\"\u003E\u003Cthead\u003E\u003Ctr\u003E\u003Cth scope=\"col\"\u003EUpišete\u003C/th\u003E\u003Cth scope=\"col\"\u003EZnačenje\u003C/th\u003E\u003C/tr\u003E\u003C/thead\u003E\u003Ctbody\u003E\u003Ctr\u003E\u003Ctd\u003E\u003Ccode\u003E+\u003C/code\u003E\u003C/td\u003E\u003Ctd\u003EZbrajanje\u003C/td\u003E\u003C/tr\u003E\u003Ctr\u003E\u003Ctd\u003E\u003Ccode\u003E-\u003C/code\u003E ili \u003Ccode\u003E−\u003C/code\u003E\u003C/td\u003E\u003Ctd\u003EOduzimanje ili negativna vrijednost\u003C/td\u003E\u003C/tr\u003E\u003Ctr\u003E\u003Ctd\u003E\u003Ccode\u003E*\u003C/code\u003E ili \u003Ccode\u003E×\u003C/code\u003E\u003C/td\u003E\u003Ctd\u003EMnoženje\u003C/td\u003E\u003C/tr\u003E\u003Ctr\u003E\u003Ctd\u003E\u003Ccode\u003E/\u003C/code\u003E ili \u003Ccode\u003E÷\u003C/code\u003E\u003C/td\u003E\u003Ctd\u003EDijeljenje\u003C/td\u003E\u003C/tr\u003E\u003Ctr\u003E\u003Ctd\u003E\u003Ccode\u003E( )\u003C/code\u003E\u003C/td\u003E\u003Ctd\u003EGrupiranje\u003C/td\u003E\u003C/tr\u003E\u003C/tbody\u003E\u003C/table\u003E\u003C/div\u003E\n\u003Cp\u003EMnoženje i dijeljenje imaju prednost pred zbrajanjem i oduzimanjem: \u003Ccode\u003EL * 2 + 4\u003C/code\u003E je (L × 2) + 4. Kad niste sigurni, koristite zagrade.\u003C/p\u003E\n\u003Cp\u003EBrojevi mogu imati decimale (\u003Ccode\u003E1.333\u003C/code\u003E, \u003Ccode\u003E.5\u003C/code\u003E) i eksponente (\u003Ccode\u003E1e3\u003C/code\u003E = 1000). Razmaci se zanemaruju.\u003C/p\u003E\n\u003Ch2 id=\"funkcije\"\u003EFunkcije\u003C/h2\u003E\n\u003Cdiv class=\"ht-wrap\"\u003E\u003Ctable class=\"ht\"\u003E\u003Cthead\u003E\u003Ctr\u003E\u003Cth scope=\"col\"\u003EFunkcija\u003C/th\u003E\u003Cth scope=\"col\"\u003ERezultat\u003C/th\u003E\u003Cth scope=\"col\"\u003EPrimjer\u003C/th\u003E\u003C/tr\u003E\u003C/thead\u003E\u003Ctbody\u003E\u003Ctr\u003E\u003Ctd\u003E\u003Ccode\u003Eceil(x)\u003C/code\u003E\u003C/td\u003E\u003Ctd\u003EZaokruži na više do cijelog broja\u003C/td\u003E\u003Ctd\u003E\u003Ccode\u003Eceil(67.5)\u003C/code\u003E = 68\u003C/td\u003E\u003C/tr\u003E\u003Ctr\u003E\u003Ctd\u003E\u003Ccode\u003Efloor(x)\u003C/code\u003E\u003C/td\u003E\u003Ctd\u003EZaokruži na niže do cijelog broja\u003C/td\u003E\u003Ctd\u003E\u003Ccode\u003Efloor(67.5)\u003C/code\u003E = 67\u003C/td\u003E\u003C/tr\u003E\u003Ctr\u003E\u003Ctd\u003E\u003Ccode\u003Eround(x)\u003C/code\u003E\u003C/td\u003E\u003Ctd\u003EZaokruži na najbliži cijeli broj, polovine od nule\u003C/td\u003E\u003Ctd\u003E\u003Ccode\u003Eround(2.5)\u003C/code\u003E = 3\u003C/td\u003E\u003C/tr\u003E\u003Ctr\u003E\u003Ctd\u003E\u003Ccode\u003Eround(x, d)\u003C/code\u003E\u003C/td\u003E\u003Ctd\u003EZaokruži na d decimala (0 do 10)\u003C/td\u003E\u003Ctd\u003E\u003Ccode\u003Eround(3.14159, 2)\u003C/code\u003E = 3.14\u003C/td\u003E\u003C/tr\u003E\u003Ctr\u003E\u003Ctd\u003E\u003Ccode\u003Emin(a, b, …)\u003C/code\u003E\u003C/td\u003E\u003Ctd\u003ENajmanja vrijednost\u003C/td\u003E\u003Ctd\u003E\u003Ccode\u003Emin(N, 10)\u003C/code\u003E\u003C/td\u003E\u003C/tr\u003E\u003Ctr\u003E\u003Ctd\u003E\u003Ccode\u003Emax(a, b, …)\u003C/code\u003E\u003C/td\u003E\u003Ctd\u003ENajveća vrijednost\u003C/td\u003E\u003Ctd\u003E\u003Ccode\u003Emax(1, ceil(N / 12))\u003C/code\u003E\u003C/td\u003E\u003C/tr\u003E\u003Ctr\u003E\u003Ctd\u003E\u003Ccode\u003Eabs(x)\u003C/code\u003E\u003C/td\u003E\u003Ctd\u003EVrijednost bez predznaka\u003C/td\u003E\u003Ctd\u003E\u003Ccode\u003Eabs(-3)\u003C/code\u003E = 3\u003C/td\u003E\u003C/tr\u003E\u003C/tbody\u003E\u003C/table\u003E\u003C/div\u003E\n\u003Cp\u003E\u003Ccode\u003Eceil\u003C/code\u003E i \u003Ccode\u003Efloor\u003C/code\u003E zanemaruju sitni šum zaokruživanja računala, pa vrijednost koja treba biti točno 1 nikad ne postaje 2.\u003C/p\u003E\n\u003Ch2 id=\"gre-ke\"\u003EGreške\u003C/h2\u003E\n\u003Cp\u003EFormula koja se ne može pročitati ili izračunati prikazuje svoju grešku ispod polja, a komponenta se ne uračunava u zbrojeve (zaglavlje \u003Cspan class=\"hui\"\u003EKoličine\u003C/span\u003E piše „Nepotpuno“). Poruke:\u003C/p\u003E\n\u003Cdiv class=\"ht-wrap\"\u003E\u003Ctable class=\"ht\"\u003E\u003Cthead\u003E\u003Ctr\u003E\u003Cth scope=\"col\"\u003EPoruka\u003C/th\u003E\u003Cth scope=\"col\"\u003EIspravak\u003C/th\u003E\u003C/tr\u003E\u003C/thead\u003E\u003Ctbody\u003E\u003Ctr\u003E\u003Ctd\u003EUpišite formulu, npr. L ili ceil(L / 1.333) + 1.\u003C/td\u003E\u003Ctd\u003EFormula je prazna.\u003C/td\u003E\u003C/tr\u003E\u003Ctr\u003E\u003Ctd\u003E„X“ ovdje nije izmjerena vrijednost. Upotrijebite …\u003C/td\u003E\u003Ctd\u003EUpotrijebite jednu od navedenih varijabli.\u003C/td\u003E\u003C/tr\u003E\u003Ctr\u003E\u003Ctd\u003E„X“ ovdje nije funkcija. Upotrijebite ceil, floor, round, min, max, abs.\u003C/td\u003E\u003Ctd\u003EUpotrijebite jednu od tih funkcija.\u003C/td\u003E\u003C/tr\u003E\u003Ctr\u003E\u003Ctd\u003E„#“ nije dopušten u formuli.\u003C/td\u003E\u003Ctd\u003EUklonite taj znak (jedinice, \u003Ccode\u003E%\u003C/code\u003E, \u003Ccode\u003E$\u003C/code\u003E i \u003Ccode\u003E=\u003C/code\u003E nisu dopušteni).\u003C/td\u003E\u003C/tr\u003E\u003Ctr\u003E\u003Ctd\u003ENedostaje „)“. / Postoji „)“ bez svoje „(“.\u003C/td\u003E\u003Ctd\u003EUravnotežite zagrade.\u003C/td\u003E\u003C/tr\u003E\u003Ctr\u003E\u003Ctd\u003EPred „)“ nedostaje vrijednost.\u003C/td\u003E\u003Ctd\u003ENešto poput \u003Ccode\u003Emax(1, )\u003C/code\u003E: upišite vrijednost.\u003C/td\u003E\u003C/tr\u003E\u003Ctr\u003E\u003Ctd\u003EFormula završava prerano.\u003C/td\u003E\u003Ctd\u003ENešto poput \u003Ccode\u003EL *\u003C/code\u003E: dovršite je.\u003C/td\u003E\u003C/tr\u003E\u003Ctr\u003E\u003Ctd\u003ENeočekivano „…“. Nedostaje li operator?\u003C/td\u003E\u003Ctd\u003EDvije vrijednosti jedna uz drugu, poput \u003Ccode\u003E2L\u003C/code\u003E: napišite \u003Ccode\u003E2 * L\u003C/code\u003E.\u003C/td\u003E\u003C/tr\u003E\u003Ctr\u003E\u003Ctd\u003Eceil() prima 1 vrijednost.\u003C/td\u003E\u003Ctd\u003EDajte funkciji ispravan broj vrijednosti.\u003C/td\u003E\u003C/tr\u003E\u003Ctr\u003E\u003Ctd\u003Eround(x, digits) treba cijele decimale od 0 do 10.\u003C/td\u003E\u003Ctd\u003EUpotrijebite cijeli broj decimala.\u003C/td\u003E\u003C/tr\u003E\u003Ctr\u003E\u003Ctd\u003EFormula dijeli s nulom.\u003C/td\u003E\u003Ctd\u003EObično je H 0: postavite visinu ili dubinu stavke.\u003C/td\u003E\u003C/tr\u003E\u003Ctr\u003E\u003Ctd\u003EFormula ne daje broj.\u003C/td\u003E\u003Ctd\u003ERezultat je prevelik da bi bio broj.\u003C/td\u003E\u003C/tr\u003E\u003Ctr\u003E\u003Ctd\u003ETa formula je predugačka (najviše 500 znakova).\u003C/td\u003E\u003Ctd\u003ESkratite je.\u003C/td\u003E\u003C/tr\u003E\u003C/tbody\u003E\u003C/table\u003E\u003C/div\u003E\n\u003Ch2 id=\"sigurno-po-zamisli\"\u003ESigurno po zamisli\u003C/h2\u003E\n\u003Cp\u003EFormula može obavljati samo aritmetiku s gore navedenim varijablama i funkcijama. Ne može pokretati kod niti čitati išta drugo, pa je formula u projektnoj datoteci koju vam netko pošalje bezopasna.\u003C/p\u003E","text":"Komponente sklopova dobivaju količinu iz formule. Formula je mali aritmetički izraz nad izmjerenim vrijednostima stavke. Za radne primjere vidi Sklopovi i formule. Varijable Vrsta stavke Varijabla Značenje Linearna L Ukupna duljina Linearna H Visina stavke Linearna A Površina zida, L × H, umanjena za otvore dionica koje ih imaju (predmjer iz programa BimCraft). Kad taj predmjer navodi metodu mjerenja, A se mjeri njome: otvori ne veći od najmanje veličine metode ostaju uračunati, a ono što metoda oduzima na spojevima zidova izostavlja se. Napomena ispod stavke navodi metodu Linearna N Broj dionica Površina A Ukupna neto površina (konture minus izrezi) Površina P Ukupni opseg, uključujući rubove izreza Površina H Dubina ili debljina stavke Površina N Broj površina Broj N Broj Varijable su u jedinicama stavke: vidi Jedinice. Velika i mala slova su ista: l je L. Rade samo varijable vrste same stavke. P kod linearne stavke daje \"P\" ovdje nije izmjerena vrijednost. Upotrijebite L, H, A, N. Prazna visina ili dubina je 0. Operatori Upišete Značenje + Zbrajanje - ili − Oduzimanje ili negativna vrijednost * ili × Množenje / ili ÷ Dijeljenje ( ) Grupiranje Množenje i dijeljenje imaju prednost pred zbrajanjem i oduzimanjem: L * 2 + 4 je (L × 2) + 4. Kad niste sigurni, koristite zagrade. Brojevi mogu imati decimale (1.333, .5) i eksponente (1e3 = 1000). Razmaci se zanemaruju. Funkcije Funkcija Rezultat Primjer ceil(x) Zaokruži na više do cijelog broja ceil(67.5) = 68 floor(x) Zaokruži na niže do cijelog broja floor(67.5) = 67 round(x) Zaokruži na najbliži cijeli broj, polovine od nule round(2.5) = 3 round(x, d) Zaokruži na d decimala (0 do 10) round(3.14159, 2) = 3.14 min(a, b, …) Najmanja vrijednost min(N, 10) max(a, b, …) Najveća vrijednost max(1, ceil(N / 12)) abs(x) Vrijednost bez predznaka abs(-3) = 3 ceil i floor zanemaruju sitni šum zaokruživanja računala, pa vrijednost koja treba biti točno 1 nikad ne postaje 2. Greške Formula koja se ne može pročitati ili izračunati prikazuje svoju grešku ispod polja, a komponenta se ne uračunava u zbrojeve (zaglavlje Količine piše „Nepotpuno“). Poruke: Poruka Ispravak Upišite formulu, npr. L ili ceil(L / 1.333) + 1. Formula je prazna. „X“ ovdje nije izmjerena vrijednost. Upotrijebite … Upotrijebite jednu od navedenih varijabli. „X“ ovdje nije funkcija. Upotrijebite ceil, floor, round, min, max, abs. Upotrijebite jednu od tih funkcija. „#“ nije dopušten u formuli. Uklonite taj znak (jedinice, %, $ i = nisu dopušteni). Nedostaje „)“. / Postoji „)“ bez svoje „(“. Uravnotežite zagrade. Pred „)“ nedostaje vrijednost. Nešto poput max(1, ): upišite vrijednost. Formula završava prerano. Nešto poput L *: dovršite je. Neočekivano „…“. Nedostaje li operator? Dvije vrijednosti jedna uz drugu, poput 2L: napišite 2 * L. ceil() prima 1 vrijednost. Dajte funkciji ispravan broj vrijednosti. round(x, digits) treba cijele decimale od 0 do 10. Upotrijebite cijeli broj decimala. Formula dijeli s nulom. Obično je H 0: postavite visinu ili dubinu stavke. Formula ne daje broj. Rezultat je prevelik da bi bio broj. Ta formula je predugačka (najviše 500 znakova). Skratite je. Sigurno po zamisli Formula može obavljati samo aritmetiku s gore navedenim varijablama i funkcijama. Ne može pokretati kod niti čitati išta drugo, pa je formula u projektnoj datoteci koju vam netko pošalje bezopasna.","lang":"hr"},{"slug":"units","scope":"takeoffcraft","title":"Jedinice","summary":"Jedinice u kojima stavka može prijaviti, jedinice varijabli formule i kako se imperijalne i metričke jedinice miješaju.","section":"reference","order":50,"keywords":["jedinice","lf","sf","sy","sq","kvadratni jardi","krovni kvadrati","akri","hektari","metri","kvadratni metri","ea","svaki","metrički","imperijalni","pretvorba","zadana jedinica"],"headings":[{"id":"jedinice-stavke","text":"Jedinice stavke","level":2},{"id":"jedinice-varijabli-formule","text":"Jedinice varijabli formule","level":2},{"id":"gdje-su-jedinice-fiksne","text":"Gdje su jedinice fiksne","level":2},{"id":"mjerila-i-jedinice-su-odvojeni","text":"Mjerila i jedinice su odvojeni","level":2},{"id":"preciznost","text":"Preciznost","level":2}],"html":"\u003Ch2 id=\"jedinice-stavke\"\u003EJedinice stavke\u003C/h2\u003E\n\u003Cdiv class=\"ht-wrap\"\u003E\u003Ctable class=\"ht\"\u003E\u003Cthead\u003E\u003Ctr\u003E\u003Cth scope=\"col\"\u003EVrsta stavke\u003C/th\u003E\u003Cth scope=\"col\"\u003EJedinica\u003C/th\u003E\u003Cth scope=\"col\"\u003ENaziv\u003C/th\u003E\u003C/tr\u003E\u003C/thead\u003E\u003Ctbody\u003E\u003Ctr\u003E\u003Ctd\u003ELinearno\u003C/td\u003E\u003Ctd\u003ELF\u003C/td\u003E\u003Ctd\u003Elinearne stope (zadano)\u003C/td\u003E\u003C/tr\u003E\u003Ctr\u003E\u003Ctd\u003ELinearno\u003C/td\u003E\u003Ctd\u003Em\u003C/td\u003E\u003Ctd\u003Emetri\u003C/td\u003E\u003C/tr\u003E\u003Ctr\u003E\u003Ctd\u003EPovršina\u003C/td\u003E\u003Ctd\u003ESF\u003C/td\u003E\u003Ctd\u003Ekvadratne stope (zadano)\u003C/td\u003E\u003C/tr\u003E\u003Ctr\u003E\u003Ctd\u003EPovršina\u003C/td\u003E\u003Ctd\u003ESY\u003C/td\u003E\u003Ctd\u003Ekvadratni jardi\u003C/td\u003E\u003C/tr\u003E\u003Ctr\u003E\u003Ctd\u003EPovršina\u003C/td\u003E\u003Ctd\u003ESQ\u003C/td\u003E\u003Ctd\u003Ekrovni kvadrati (100 kvadratnih stopa)\u003C/td\u003E\u003C/tr\u003E\u003Ctr\u003E\u003Ctd\u003EPovršina\u003C/td\u003E\u003Ctd\u003Eac\u003C/td\u003E\u003Ctd\u003Eakri\u003C/td\u003E\u003C/tr\u003E\u003Ctr\u003E\u003Ctd\u003EPovršina\u003C/td\u003E\u003Ctd\u003Em²\u003C/td\u003E\u003Ctd\u003Ekvadratni metri\u003C/td\u003E\u003C/tr\u003E\u003Ctr\u003E\u003Ctd\u003EPovršina\u003C/td\u003E\u003Ctd\u003Eha\u003C/td\u003E\u003Ctd\u003Ehektari\u003C/td\u003E\u003C/tr\u003E\u003Ctr\u003E\u003Ctd\u003EBrojanje\u003C/td\u003E\u003Ctd\u003EEA\u003C/td\u003E\u003Ctd\u003Esvaki\u003C/td\u003E\u003C/tr\u003E\u003C/tbody\u003E\u003C/table\u003E\u003C/div\u003E\n\u003Cp\u003EPromijenite je pomoću \u003Cspan class=\"hui\"\u003EJedinica\u003C/span\u003E u uređivaču stavke u bilo kojem trenutku, čak i nakon mjerenja; količina se odmah pretvara.\u003C/p\u003E\n\u003Cp\u003EPopis \u003Cspan class=\"hui\"\u003EJedinica\u003C/span\u003E prikazuje jedinice uključene u \u003Cspan class=\"hui\"\u003EPostavke\u003C/span\u003E › \u003Cspan class=\"hui\"\u003EOpćenito\u003C/span\u003E › \u003Cspan class=\"hui\"\u003EJedinice\u003C/span\u003E, i uvijek jedinicu same stavke. Nova stavka počinje u jedinici duljine ili površine označenoj zvjezdicom, ako je ona jedna od jedinica stavke; inače u LF ili SF. Vidi \u003Ca href=\"/tutorials/basics/unit-lists\" data-topic=\"basics/unit-lists\"\u003EJedinice, upisane vrijednosti i popisi jedinica\u003C/a\u003E.\u003C/p\u003E\n\u003Ch2 id=\"jedinice-varijabli-formule\"\u003EJedinice varijabli formule\u003C/h2\u003E\n\u003Cdiv class=\"ht-wrap\"\u003E\u003Ctable class=\"ht\"\u003E\u003Cthead\u003E\u003Ctr\u003E\u003Cth scope=\"col\"\u003EJedinica stavke\u003C/th\u003E\u003Cth scope=\"col\"\u003EL, P, H\u003C/th\u003E\u003Cth scope=\"col\"\u003EA\u003C/th\u003E\u003C/tr\u003E\u003C/thead\u003E\u003Ctbody\u003E\u003Ctr\u003E\u003Ctd\u003ELF\u003C/td\u003E\u003Ctd\u003Estope\u003C/td\u003E\u003Ctd\u003Ekvadratne stope (površina zida)\u003C/td\u003E\u003C/tr\u003E\u003Ctr\u003E\u003Ctd\u003Em\u003C/td\u003E\u003Ctd\u003Emetri\u003C/td\u003E\u003Ctd\u003Ekvadratni metri (površina zida)\u003C/td\u003E\u003C/tr\u003E\u003Ctr\u003E\u003Ctd\u003ESF\u003C/td\u003E\u003Ctd\u003Estope\u003C/td\u003E\u003Ctd\u003Ekvadratne stope\u003C/td\u003E\u003C/tr\u003E\u003Ctr\u003E\u003Ctd\u003ESY\u003C/td\u003E\u003Ctd\u003Estope\u003C/td\u003E\u003Ctd\u003Ekvadratni jardi\u003C/td\u003E\u003C/tr\u003E\u003Ctr\u003E\u003Ctd\u003ESQ\u003C/td\u003E\u003Ctd\u003Estope\u003C/td\u003E\u003Ctd\u003Ekvadrati\u003C/td\u003E\u003C/tr\u003E\u003Ctr\u003E\u003Ctd\u003Eac\u003C/td\u003E\u003Ctd\u003Estope\u003C/td\u003E\u003Ctd\u003Eakri\u003C/td\u003E\u003C/tr\u003E\u003Ctr\u003E\u003Ctd\u003Em²\u003C/td\u003E\u003Ctd\u003Emetri\u003C/td\u003E\u003Ctd\u003Ekvadratni metri\u003C/td\u003E\u003C/tr\u003E\u003Ctr\u003E\u003Ctd\u003Eha\u003C/td\u003E\u003Ctd\u003Emetri\u003C/td\u003E\u003Ctd\u003Ehektari\u003C/td\u003E\u003C/tr\u003E\u003C/tbody\u003E\u003C/table\u003E\u003C/div\u003E\n\u003Cp\u003EZa stavke u SY, \u003Ccode\u003EA\u003C/code\u003E je u kvadratnim jardima, dok \u003Ccode\u003EP\u003C/code\u003E i \u003Ccode\u003EH\u003C/code\u003E ostaju u stopama. Volumen iz stavke u SY je \u003Ccode\u003EA * 9 * H / 27\u003C/code\u003E kubičnih jardi; za ploče je jednostavnije koristiti SF.\u003C/p\u003E\n\u003Ch2 id=\"gdje-su-jedinice-fiksne\"\u003EGdje su jedinice fiksne\u003C/h2\u003E\n\u003Cp\u003ENeki očitci uvijek koriste stope:\u003C/p\u003E\n\u003Cul\u003E\u003Cli\u003Euživo očitanje u statusnoj traci dok crtate (stope-palci, SF),\u003C/li\u003E\u003Cli\u003E\u003Cstrong\u003EOdabrana oznaka\u003C/strong\u003E (stope-palci, LF i SF),\u003C/li\u003E\u003Cli\u003Erezultat provjere (stope-palci, s decimalnim stopama i metrima),\u003C/li\u003E\u003Cli\u003Eduljine segmenata i opsezi na listu Oznake proračunske tablice (stope-palci).\u003C/li\u003E\u003C/ul\u003E\n\u003Cp\u003EUkupne vrijednosti stavki, tablica \u003Cspan class=\"hui\"\u003EKoličine\u003C/span\u003E, formule i list Procjena koriste jedinicu same stavke.\u003C/p\u003E\n\u003Ch2 id=\"mjerila-i-jedinice-su-odvojeni\"\u003EMjerila i jedinice su odvojeni\u003C/h2\u003E\n\u003Cp\u003EMjerilo lista kaže koliko je crtež velik; jedinica stavke kaže kako ga prijaviti. Metrički crtež u \u003Ccode\u003E1:100\u003C/code\u003E može se predmjeriti u LF, a imperijalni crtež u m². Kalibracija prihvaća bilo koju jedinicu: \u003Ccode\u003E24&#039;-6&quot;\u003C/code\u003E, \u003Ccode\u003E7.5 m\u003C/code\u003E, \u003Ccode\u003E7500 mm\u003C/code\u003E.\u003C/p\u003E\n\u003Ch2 id=\"preciznost\"\u003EPreciznost\u003C/h2\u003E\n\u003Cp\u003ETakeoffDesk mjeri točno iz točaka na koje kliknete, uključujući stvarne duljine lukova i površine, i ne zaokružuje količine. Prikaz zaokružuje duljine na 1/16 in, a decimale na dva mjesta. Novac se zaokružuje tek kod proširenih iznosa, na cent.\u003C/p\u003E","text":"Jedinice stavke Vrsta stavke Jedinica Naziv Linearno LF linearne stope (zadano) Linearno m metri Površina SF kvadratne stope (zadano) Površina SY kvadratni jardi Površina SQ krovni kvadrati (100 kvadratnih stopa) Površina ac akri Površina m² kvadratni metri Površina ha hektari Brojanje EA svaki Promijenite je pomoću Jedinica u uređivaču stavke u bilo kojem trenutku, čak i nakon mjerenja; količina se odmah pretvara. Popis Jedinica prikazuje jedinice uključene u Postavke › Općenito › Jedinice, i uvijek jedinicu same stavke. Nova stavka počinje u jedinici duljine ili površine označenoj zvjezdicom, ako je ona jedna od jedinica stavke; inače u LF ili SF. Vidi Jedinice, upisane vrijednosti i popisi jedinica. Jedinice varijabli formule Jedinica stavke L, P, H A LF stope kvadratne stope (površina zida) m metri kvadratni metri (površina zida) SF stope kvadratne stope SY stope kvadratni jardi SQ stope kvadrati ac stope akri m² metri kvadratni metri ha metri hektari Za stavke u SY, A je u kvadratnim jardima, dok P i H ostaju u stopama. Volumen iz stavke u SY je A * 9 * H / 27 kubičnih jardi; za ploče je jednostavnije koristiti SF. Gdje su jedinice fiksne Neki očitci uvijek koriste stope: uživo očitanje u statusnoj traci dok crtate (stope-palci, SF), Odabrana oznaka (stope-palci, LF i SF), rezultat provjere (stope-palci, s decimalnim stopama i metrima), duljine segmenata i opsezi na listu Oznake proračunske tablice (stope-palci). Ukupne vrijednosti stavki, tablica Količine, formule i list Procjena koriste jedinicu same stavke. Mjerila i jedinice su odvojeni Mjerilo lista kaže koliko je crtež velik; jedinica stavke kaže kako ga prijaviti. Metrički crtež u 1:100 može se predmjeriti u LF, a imperijalni crtež u m². Kalibracija prihvaća bilo koju jedinicu: 24'-6\", 7.5 m, 7500 mm. Preciznost TakeoffDesk mjeri točno iz točaka na koje kliknete, uključujući stvarne duljine lukova i površine, i ne zaokružuje količine. Prikaz zaokružuje duljine na 1/16 in, a decimale na dva mjesta. Novac se zaokružuje tek kod proširenih iznosa, na cent.","lang":"hr"},{"slug":"export-columns","scope":"takeoffcraft","title":"Stupci izvoza","summary":"Svaki radni list i stupac XLSX izvoza te CSV, s formulama koje radni list Predračun sadrži.","section":"reference","order":60,"keywords":["izvoz","stupci","xlsx","csv","radni list","predračun","po listu","oznake","mjerila","formule","polja"],"headings":[{"id":"predra-un-radni-list-xlsx-i-csv","text":"Predračun (radni list XLSX i CSV)","level":2},{"id":"po-listu-samo-xlsx","text":"Po listu (samo XLSX)","level":2},{"id":"oznake-samo-xlsx","text":"Oznake (samo XLSX)","level":2},{"id":"po-podru-ju-ponude-samo-xlsx-kad-predmjer-ima-podru-ja-ponude","text":"Po području ponude (samo XLSX, kad predmjer ima područja ponude)","level":2},{"id":"mjerila-samo-xlsx","text":"Mjerila (samo XLSX)","level":2},{"id":"nazivi-datoteka","text":"Nazivi datoteka","level":2}],"html":"\u003Ch2 id=\"predra-un-radni-list-xlsx-i-csv\"\u003EPredračun (radni list XLSX i CSV)\u003C/h2\u003E\n\u003Cp\u003EJedan redak po stavci, a zatim redak po komponenti njezina sklopa (uvučen). Zatim prazan redak i ukupni zbroj posla.\u003C/p\u003E\n\u003Cdiv class=\"ht-wrap\"\u003E\u003Ctable class=\"ht\"\u003E\u003Cthead\u003E\u003Ctr\u003E\u003Cth scope=\"col\"\u003EStupac\u003C/th\u003E\u003Cth scope=\"col\"\u003ESadržaj\u003C/th\u003E\u003Cth scope=\"col\"\u003EU XLSX-u\u003C/th\u003E\u003C/tr\u003E\u003C/thead\u003E\u003Ctbody\u003E\u003Ctr\u003E\u003Ctd\u003EA Stavka\u003C/td\u003E\u003Ctd\u003ENaziv stavke (podebljano) ili naziv komponente (uvučen)\u003C/td\u003E\u003Ctd\u003ETekst\u003C/td\u003E\u003C/tr\u003E\u003Ctr\u003E\u003Ctd\u003EB Vrsta\u003C/td\u003E\u003Ctd\u003ELinearna, Površina, Broj ili Komponenta\u003C/td\u003E\u003Ctd\u003ETekst\u003C/td\u003E\u003C/tr\u003E\u003Ctr\u003E\u003Ctd\u003EC Jedinica\u003C/td\u003E\u003Ctd\u003ELF, m, SF, SY, m², EA ili jedinica komponente\u003C/td\u003E\u003Ctd\u003ETekst\u003C/td\u003E\u003C/tr\u003E\u003Ctr\u003E\u003Ctd\u003ED Količina\u003C/td\u003E\u003Ctd\u003EIzmjereni zbroj ili rezultat formule\u003C/td\u003E\u003Ctd\u003EBroj\u003C/td\u003E\u003C/tr\u003E\u003Ctr\u003E\u003Ctd\u003EE Gubitak %\u003C/td\u003E\u003Ctd\u003EGubitak\u003C/td\u003E\u003Ctd\u003EPostotak (0.10 = 10%)\u003C/td\u003E\u003C/tr\u003E\u003Ctr\u003E\u003Ctd\u003EF Količina s gubitkom\u003C/td\u003E\u003Ctd\u003EKoličina × (1 + gubitak)\u003C/td\u003E\u003Ctd\u003EFormula \u003Ccode\u003ED*(1+E)\u003C/code\u003E\u003C/td\u003E\u003C/tr\u003E\u003Ctr\u003E\u003Ctd\u003EG Materijal po jedinici\u003C/td\u003E\u003Ctd\u003ECijena materijala\u003C/td\u003E\u003Ctd\u003EBroj\u003C/td\u003E\u003C/tr\u003E\u003Ctr\u003E\u003Ctd\u003EH Rad po jedinici\u003C/td\u003E\u003Ctd\u003ECijena rada\u003C/td\u003E\u003Ctd\u003EBroj\u003C/td\u003E\u003C/tr\u003E\u003Ctr\u003E\u003Ctd\u003EI Materijal\u003C/td\u003E\u003Ctd\u003EProšireni iznos materijala\u003C/td\u003E\u003Ctd\u003EFormula \u003Ccode\u003EROUND(F*G,2)\u003C/code\u003E\u003C/td\u003E\u003C/tr\u003E\u003Ctr\u003E\u003Ctd\u003EJ Rad\u003C/td\u003E\u003Ctd\u003EProšireni iznos rada\u003C/td\u003E\u003Ctd\u003EFormula \u003Ccode\u003EROUND(F*H,2)\u003C/code\u003E\u003C/td\u003E\u003C/tr\u003E\u003Ctr\u003E\u003Ctd\u003EK Ukupno\u003C/td\u003E\u003Ctd\u003EMaterijal + rad\u003C/td\u003E\u003Ctd\u003EFormula \u003Ccode\u003EI+J\u003C/code\u003E\u003C/td\u003E\u003C/tr\u003E\u003Ctr\u003E\u003Ctd\u003EL Napomene\u003C/td\u003E\u003Ctd\u003EKorištena formula, greška formule, oznake na listovima bez mjerila, površina zida, opseg\u003C/td\u003E\u003Ctd\u003ETekst\u003C/td\u003E\u003C/tr\u003E\u003C/tbody\u003E\u003C/table\u003E\u003C/div\u003E\n\u003Cp\u003ERedak ukupnog zbroja posla: \u003Ccode\u003ESUM\u003C/code\u003E nad stupcima I, J i K za svaki redak iznad, a u Napomenama „Nepotpuno: vidi napomene iznad“ kad je nešto izostavljeno.\u003C/p\u003E\n\u003Cp\u003ERedak s greškom formule nema količinu ni iznose; njegova napomena navodi grešku. Redak zaglavlja je zamrznut.\u003C/p\u003E\n\u003Cp\u003EU CSV-u isti stupci sadrže obične vrijednosti, Gubitak % je broj postotka (10 za 10%), a novac je u dolarima s dvije decimale. Tekst koji proračunska tablica može shvatiti kao formulu (počinje s \u003Ccode\u003E=\u003C/code\u003E, \u003Ccode\u003E+\u003C/code\u003E, \u003Ccode\u003E-\u003C/code\u003E ili \u003Ccode\u003E@\u003C/code\u003E) dobiva vodeći \u003Ccode\u003E&#039;\u003C/code\u003E da ostane tekst.\u003C/p\u003E\n\u003Ch2 id=\"po-listu-samo-xlsx\"\u003EPo listu (samo XLSX)\u003C/h2\u003E\n\u003Cdiv class=\"ht-wrap\"\u003E\u003Ctable class=\"ht\"\u003E\u003Cthead\u003E\u003Ctr\u003E\u003Cth scope=\"col\"\u003EStupac\u003C/th\u003E\u003Cth scope=\"col\"\u003ESadržaj\u003C/th\u003E\u003C/tr\u003E\u003C/thead\u003E\u003Ctbody\u003E\u003Ctr\u003E\u003Ctd\u003EList\u003C/td\u003E\u003Ctd\u003ENaziv lista (uz naziv PDF-a kad nije otvoren)\u003C/td\u003E\u003C/tr\u003E\u003Ctr\u003E\u003Ctd\u003EStavka\u003C/td\u003E\u003Ctd\u003ENaziv stavke\u003C/td\u003E\u003C/tr\u003E\u003Ctr\u003E\u003Ctd\u003EKoličina\u003C/td\u003E\u003Ctd\u003EKoličina te stavke na tom listu, u njezinoj jedinici\u003C/td\u003E\u003C/tr\u003E\u003Ctr\u003E\u003Ctd\u003EJedinica\u003C/td\u003E\u003Ctd\u003EJedinica stavke\u003C/td\u003E\u003C/tr\u003E\u003Ctr\u003E\u003Ctd\u003EOznake\u003C/td\u003E\u003Ctd\u003EBroj oznaka\u003C/td\u003E\u003C/tr\u003E\u003C/tbody\u003E\u003C/table\u003E\u003C/div\u003E\n\u003Ch2 id=\"oznake-samo-xlsx\"\u003EOznake (samo XLSX)\u003C/h2\u003E\n\u003Cp\u003EJedan redak po oznaci.\u003C/p\u003E\n\u003Cdiv class=\"ht-wrap\"\u003E\u003Ctable class=\"ht\"\u003E\u003Cthead\u003E\u003Ctr\u003E\u003Cth scope=\"col\"\u003EStupac\u003C/th\u003E\u003Cth scope=\"col\"\u003ESadržaj\u003C/th\u003E\u003C/tr\u003E\u003C/thead\u003E\u003Ctbody\u003E\u003Ctr\u003E\u003Ctd\u003EList\u003C/td\u003E\u003Ctd\u003ENaziv lista\u003C/td\u003E\u003C/tr\u003E\u003Ctr\u003E\u003Ctd\u003EStavka\u003C/td\u003E\u003Ctd\u003ENaziv stavke\u003C/td\u003E\u003C/tr\u003E\u003Ctr\u003E\u003Ctd\u003EVrsta\u003C/td\u003E\u003Ctd\u003ELinearna, Površina ili Broj\u003C/td\u003E\u003C/tr\u003E\u003Ctr\u003E\u003Ctd\u003EKoličina\u003C/td\u003E\u003Ctd\u003EDuljina, neto površina ili 1\u003C/td\u003E\u003C/tr\u003E\u003Ctr\u003E\u003Ctd\u003EJedinica\u003C/td\u003E\u003Ctd\u003ELF ili m; SF, SY ili m²; EA\u003C/td\u003E\u003C/tr\u003E\u003Ctr\u003E\u003Ctd\u003EPojedinosti\u003C/td\u003E\u003Ctd\u003ELinearna: duljine dionica, oduzete označene „(oduzeto)“ i „oduzima (duljina) od nacrtane (duljine)“. Površina: bruto i izrezane površine kad postoje izrezi, te opseg. „List nema mjerilo“ za oznake bez mjerila.\u003C/td\u003E\u003C/tr\u003E\u003Ctr\u003E\u003Ctd\u003EPodručje ponude\u003C/td\u003E\u003Ctd\u003ESamo kad predmjer ima područja ponude: područje oznake ili „Nema područja ponude“\u003C/td\u003E\u003C/tr\u003E\u003C/tbody\u003E\u003C/table\u003E\u003C/div\u003E\n\u003Ch2 id=\"po-podru-ju-ponude-samo-xlsx-kad-predmjer-ima-podru-ja-ponude\"\u003EPo području ponude (samo XLSX, kad predmjer ima područja ponude)\u003C/h2\u003E\n\u003Cdiv class=\"ht-wrap\"\u003E\u003Ctable class=\"ht\"\u003E\u003Cthead\u003E\u003Ctr\u003E\u003Cth scope=\"col\"\u003EStupac\u003C/th\u003E\u003Cth scope=\"col\"\u003ESadržaj\u003C/th\u003E\u003C/tr\u003E\u003C/thead\u003E\u003Ctbody\u003E\u003Ctr\u003E\u003Ctd\u003EPodručje ponude\u003C/td\u003E\u003Ctd\u003ENaziv područja ili „Nema područja ponude“\u003C/td\u003E\u003C/tr\u003E\u003Ctr\u003E\u003Ctd\u003EStavka\u003C/td\u003E\u003Ctd\u003EStavka ili komponenta uvučena ispod nje\u003C/td\u003E\u003C/tr\u003E\u003Ctr\u003E\u003Ctd\u003EJedinica\u003C/td\u003E\u003Ctd\u003EJedinica stavke ili komponente\u003C/td\u003E\u003C/tr\u003E\u003Ctr\u003E\u003Ctd\u003EKoličina\u003C/td\u003E\u003Ctd\u003EIzmjereno u tom području (komponente: formula nad zbrojevima područja)\u003C/td\u003E\u003C/tr\u003E\u003Ctr\u003E\u003Ctd\u003EKoličina s gubitkom\u003C/td\u003E\u003Ctd\u003EKoličina × (1 + gubitak)\u003C/td\u003E\u003C/tr\u003E\u003Ctr\u003E\u003Ctd\u003EMaterijal, Rad, Ukupno\u003C/td\u003E\u003Ctd\u003EProšireno do centa, kao u Predračunu\u003C/td\u003E\u003C/tr\u003E\u003Ctr\u003E\u003Ctd\u003ENapomene\u003C/td\u003E\u003Ctd\u003EFormula, greške i neizmjerena mjerila, kao u Predračunu\u003C/td\u003E\u003C/tr\u003E\u003C/tbody\u003E\u003C/table\u003E\u003C/div\u003E\n\u003Cp\u003ESvako područje završava retkom „(naziv) međuzbroj“ čiji su troškovi formule \u003Ccode\u003ESUM\u003C/code\u003E nad njegovim recima. Posljednji redak, \u003Cstrong\u003ESva područja ponude\u003C/strong\u003E, zbraja međuzbrojeve. Radni list \u003Cstrong\u003EOznake\u003C/strong\u003E tada ima sedmi stupac, \u003Cstrong\u003EPodručje ponude\u003C/strong\u003E.\u003C/p\u003E\n\u003Ch2 id=\"mjerila-samo-xlsx\"\u003EMjerila (samo XLSX)\u003C/h2\u003E\n\u003Cp\u003EJedan redak po listu koji ima mjerilo ili oznake.\u003C/p\u003E\n\u003Cdiv class=\"ht-wrap\"\u003E\u003Ctable class=\"ht\"\u003E\u003Cthead\u003E\u003Ctr\u003E\u003Cth scope=\"col\"\u003EStupac\u003C/th\u003E\u003Cth scope=\"col\"\u003ESadržaj\u003C/th\u003E\u003C/tr\u003E\u003C/thead\u003E\u003Ctbody\u003E\u003Ctr\u003E\u003Ctd\u003EList\u003C/td\u003E\u003Ctd\u003ENaziv lista\u003C/td\u003E\u003C/tr\u003E\u003Ctr\u003E\u003Ctd\u003EMjerilo\u003C/td\u003E\u003Ctd\u003ENaziv predloška, kalibrirano mjerilo ili „Nema mjerila“\u003C/td\u003E\u003C/tr\u003E\u003Ctr\u003E\u003Ctd\u003EKako\u003C/td\u003E\u003Ctd\u003E„Predložak“ ili „Kalibrirano prema udaljenosti koju ste upisali“\u003C/td\u003E\u003C/tr\u003E\u003Ctr\u003E\u003Ctd\u003EStope po jedinici PDF-a\u003C/td\u003E\u003Ctd\u003ETočan faktor mjerila koji TakeoffDesk koristi\u003C/td\u003E\u003C/tr\u003E\u003C/tbody\u003E\u003C/table\u003E\u003C/div\u003E\n\u003Ch2 id=\"nazivi-datoteka\"\u003ENazivi datoteka\u003C/h2\u003E\n\u003Cul\u003E\u003Cli\u003E\u003Ccode\u003E(name).xlsx\u003C/code\u003E i \u003Ccode\u003E(name).csv\u003C/code\u003E, gdje naziv dolazi od prvog PDF-a otvorenog u predmjeru.\u003C/li\u003E\u003Cli\u003ECSV je UTF-8 s oznakom redoslijeda bajtova (BOM) i Windows završecima redaka, što čitaju programi za proračunske tablice na svim platformama.\u003C/li\u003E\u003C/ul\u003E","text":"Predračun (radni list XLSX i CSV) Jedan redak po stavci, a zatim redak po komponenti njezina sklopa (uvučen). Zatim prazan redak i ukupni zbroj posla. Stupac Sadržaj U XLSX-u A Stavka Naziv stavke (podebljano) ili naziv komponente (uvučen) Tekst B Vrsta Linearna, Površina, Broj ili Komponenta Tekst C Jedinica LF, m, SF, SY, m², EA ili jedinica komponente Tekst D Količina Izmjereni zbroj ili rezultat formule Broj E Gubitak % Gubitak Postotak (0.10 = 10%) F Količina s gubitkom Količina × (1 + gubitak) Formula D*(1+E) G Materijal po jedinici Cijena materijala Broj H Rad po jedinici Cijena rada Broj I Materijal Prošireni iznos materijala Formula ROUND(F*G,2) J Rad Prošireni iznos rada Formula ROUND(F*H,2) K Ukupno Materijal + rad Formula I+J L Napomene Korištena formula, greška formule, oznake na listovima bez mjerila, površina zida, opseg Tekst Redak ukupnog zbroja posla: SUM nad stupcima I, J i K za svaki redak iznad, a u Napomenama „Nepotpuno: vidi napomene iznad“ kad je nešto izostavljeno. Redak s greškom formule nema količinu ni iznose; njegova napomena navodi grešku. Redak zaglavlja je zamrznut. U CSV-u isti stupci sadrže obične vrijednosti, Gubitak % je broj postotka (10 za 10%), a novac je u dolarima s dvije decimale. Tekst koji proračunska tablica može shvatiti kao formulu (počinje s =, +, - ili @) dobiva vodeći ' da ostane tekst. Po listu (samo XLSX) Stupac Sadržaj List Naziv lista (uz naziv PDF-a kad nije otvoren) Stavka Naziv stavke Količina Količina te stavke na tom listu, u njezinoj jedinici Jedinica Jedinica stavke Oznake Broj oznaka Oznake (samo XLSX) Jedan redak po oznaci. Stupac Sadržaj List Naziv lista Stavka Naziv stavke Vrsta Linearna, Površina ili Broj Količina Duljina, neto površina ili 1 Jedinica LF ili m; SF, SY ili m²; EA Pojedinosti Linearna: duljine dionica, oduzete označene „(oduzeto)“ i „oduzima (duljina) od nacrtane (duljine)“. Površina: bruto i izrezane površine kad postoje izrezi, te opseg. „List nema mjerilo“ za oznake bez mjerila. Područje ponude Samo kad predmjer ima područja ponude: područje oznake ili „Nema područja ponude“ Po području ponude (samo XLSX, kad predmjer ima područja ponude) Stupac Sadržaj Područje ponude Naziv područja ili „Nema područja ponude“ Stavka Stavka ili komponenta uvučena ispod nje Jedinica Jedinica stavke ili komponente Količina Izmjereno u tom području (komponente: formula nad zbrojevima područja) Količina s gubitkom Količina × (1 + gubitak) Materijal, Rad, Ukupno Prošireno do centa, kao u Predračunu Napomene Formula, greške i neizmjerena mjerila, kao u Predračunu Svako područje završava retkom „(naziv) međuzbroj“ čiji su troškovi formule SUM nad njegovim recima. Posljednji redak, Sva područja ponude, zbraja međuzbrojeve. Radni list Oznake tada ima sedmi stupac, Područje ponude. Mjerila (samo XLSX) Jedan redak po listu koji ima mjerilo ili oznake. Stupac Sadržaj List Naziv lista Mjerilo Naziv predloška, kalibrirano mjerilo ili „Nema mjerila“ Kako „Predložak“ ili „Kalibrirano prema udaljenosti koju ste upisali“ Stope po jedinici PDF-a Točan faktor mjerila koji TakeoffDesk koristi Nazivi datoteka (name).xlsx i (name).csv, gdje naziv dolazi od prvog PDF-a otvorenog u predmjeru. CSV je UTF-8 s oznakom redoslijeda bajtova (BOM) i Windows završecima redaka, što čitaju programi za proračunske tablice na svim platformama.","lang":"hr"},{"slug":"troubleshooting","scope":"takeoffcraft","title":"Rješavanje problema","summary":"Simptomi, uzroci i rješenja za poruke i iznenađenja na koja možete naići u TakeoffDesku, citirani onako kako ih aplikacija prikazuje.","section":"trouble","order":10,"keywords":["problemi","pogreške","ne radi","rješenje","pomoć","odbijeno","ne mjeri","nema mjerila","nedostaju oznake","izvoz nije uspio","offline","dodir"],"headings":[{"id":"otvaranje-datoteka","text":"Otvaranje datoteka","level":2},{"id":"mjerenje","text":"Mjerenje","level":2},{"id":"mjerilo","text":"Mjerilo","level":2},{"id":"koli-ine-i-formule","text":"Količine i formule","level":2},{"id":"autobrojanje","text":"Autobrojanje","level":2},{"id":"spremanje-i-izvoz","text":"Spremanje i izvoz","level":2},{"id":"tipke-i-mi","text":"Tipke i miš","level":2},{"id":"zasloni-osjetljivi-na-dodir","text":"Zasloni osjetljivi na dodir","level":2},{"id":"rad-izvan-mre-e","text":"Rad izvan mreže","level":2},{"id":"jo-uvijek-imate-problema","text":"Još uvijek imate problema","level":2}],"html":"\u003Cp\u003ETakeoffDesk objašnjava većinu odbijanja u statusnoj traci na dnu prozora. Pronađite poruku u nastavku.\u003C/p\u003E\n\u003Ch2 id=\"otvaranje-datoteka\"\u003EOtvaranje datoteka\u003C/h2\u003E\n\u003Cdiv class=\"ht-wrap\"\u003E\u003Ctable class=\"ht\"\u003E\u003Cthead\u003E\u003Ctr\u003E\u003Cth scope=\"col\"\u003EPoruka ili pojava\u003C/th\u003E\u003Cth scope=\"col\"\u003EUzrok\u003C/th\u003E\u003Cth scope=\"col\"\u003ERješenje\u003C/th\u003E\u003C/tr\u003E\u003C/thead\u003E\u003Ctbody\u003E\u003Ctr\u003E\u003Ctd\u003EČitač PDF-a nije se mogao učitati. Ponovno učitajte stranicu za novi pokušaj.\u003C/td\u003E\u003Ctd\u003EČitač PDF-a aplikacije nije se učitao, obično zato što ste izvan mreže, a aplikacija nikad nije spremljena za rad izvan mreže.\u003C/td\u003E\u003Ctd\u003ESpojite se na mrežu i ponovno učitajte. Zatim odaberite \u003Cspan class=\"hui\"\u003ESpremi za offline\u003C/span\u003E i pričekajte \u003Cspan class=\"hui\"\u003ESpremno za offline\u003C/span\u003E; vidi \u003Ca href=\"/tutorials/basics/offline\" data-topic=\"basics/offline\"\u003ERad izvan mreže\u003C/a\u003E.\u003C/td\u003E\u003C/tr\u003E\u003Ctr\u003E\u003Ctd\u003E(naziv) je zaštićen lozinkom. Otvorite kopiju bez zaštite.\u003C/td\u003E\u003Ctd\u003EPDF za otvaranje traži lozinku.\u003C/td\u003E\u003Ctd\u003EZatražite kopiju bez zaštite ili uklonite lozinku u PDF programu kojem vjerujete.\u003C/td\u003E\u003C/tr\u003E\u003Ctr\u003E\u003Ctd\u003E(naziv) nije moguće pročitati kao PDF (…)\u003C/td\u003E\u003Ctd\u003EDatoteka je oštećena ili zapravo nije PDF.\u003C/td\u003E\u003Ctd\u003EPreuzmite je ponovno ili je ponovno spremite iz programa koji ju je napravio.\u003C/td\u003E\u003C/tr\u003E\u003Ctr\u003E\u003Ctd\u003EVeć otvoreno: (naziv).\u003C/td\u003E\u003Ctd\u003EIsti PDF (isti sadržaj) je već otvoren.\u003C/td\u003E\u003Ctd\u003ENišta ne treba učiniti.\u003C/td\u003E\u003C/tr\u003E\u003Ctr\u003E\u003Ctd\u003ETakeoffDesk otvara PDF-ove i .takeoff.json projekte. Preskočeno: …\u003C/td\u003E\u003Ctd\u003EOstale vrste datoteka su odbačene.\u003C/td\u003E\u003Ctd\u003EPrvo pretvorite crteže u PDF.\u003C/td\u003E\u003C/tr\u003E\u003Ctr\u003E\u003Ctd\u003ENišta se ne događa kad ispustim datoteke\u003C/td\u003E\u003Ctd\u003EDatoteke su ispuštene izvan prozora preglednika ili je preglednik otvorio PDF u novoj kartici.\u003C/td\u003E\u003Ctd\u003EIspustite ih na samu stranicu TakeoffDesk; okvir „Ispusti PDF-ove ili .takeoff.json“ pokazuje kad će to raditi.\u003C/td\u003E\u003C/tr\u003E\u003Ctr\u003E\u003Ctd\u003EOtvaranje velikog skupa traje neko vrijeme\u003C/td\u003E\u003Ctd\u003ESvaki PDF se u cijelosti čita radi identifikacije.\u003C/td\u003E\u003Ctd\u003EPričekajte da nestane poruka „Otvaram (naziv)…“. Sličice se popunjavaju dok se pomičete.\u003C/td\u003E\u003C/tr\u003E\u003C/tbody\u003E\u003C/table\u003E\u003C/div\u003E\n\u003Ch2 id=\"mjerenje\"\u003EMjerenje\u003C/h2\u003E\n\u003Cdiv class=\"ht-wrap\"\u003E\u003Ctable class=\"ht\"\u003E\u003Cthead\u003E\u003Ctr\u003E\u003Cth scope=\"col\"\u003EPoruka ili pojava\u003C/th\u003E\u003Cth scope=\"col\"\u003EUzrok\u003C/th\u003E\u003Cth scope=\"col\"\u003ERješenje\u003C/th\u003E\u003C/tr\u003E\u003C/thead\u003E\u003Ctbody\u003E\u003Ctr\u003E\u003Ctd\u003EPrvo otvorite PDF.\u003C/td\u003E\u003Ctd\u003ENijedan list nije otvoren.\u003C/td\u003E\u003Ctd\u003EOtvorite PDF.\u003C/td\u003E\u003C/tr\u003E\u003Ctr\u003E\u003Ctd\u003EOvaj list još nema mjerilo, pa se ne može mjeriti. Odaberite predložak mjerila ili prvo kalibrirajte (brojanje radi i bez njega).\u003C/td\u003E\u003Ctd\u003EAlati za linearno, površinu, kružnicu i otvor trebaju mjerilo.\u003C/td\u003E\u003Ctd\u003E\u003Ca href=\"/tutorials/takeoffcraft/set-the-scale\" data-topic=\"takeoffcraft/set-the-scale\"\u003EPostavite mjerilo\u003C/a\u003E.\u003C/td\u003E\u003C/tr\u003E\u003Ctr\u003E\u003Ctd\u003EPrvo izradite linearnu stavku (nazovite je pod Stavke), pa kliknite na list.\u003C/td\u003E\u003Ctd\u003ENema stavke te vrste.\u003C/td\u003E\u003Ctd\u003EIspunite obrazac \u003Cspan class=\"hui\"\u003ENova stavka\u003C/span\u003E koji se otvorio i odaberite \u003Cspan class=\"hui\"\u003EDodaj\u003C/span\u003E.\u003C/td\u003E\u003C/tr\u003E\u003Ctr\u003E\u003Ctd\u003EPrvo odaberite stavku za predmjer (ploča Stavke).\u003C/td\u003E\u003Ctd\u003ETrenutna stavka je izbrisana.\u003C/td\u003E\u003Ctd\u003EKliknite stavku pod \u003Cspan class=\"hui\"\u003EStavke\u003C/span\u003E.\u003C/td\u003E\u003C/tr\u003E\u003Ctr\u003E\u003Ctd\u003ETrasa treba najmanje dvije točke.\u003C/td\u003E\u003Ctd\u003EZavršili ste nakon jednog klika.\u003C/td\u003E\u003Ctd\u003EKliknite najmanje dvije točke.\u003C/td\u003E\u003C/tr\u003E\u003Ctr\u003E\u003Ctd\u003EPovršina treba najmanje tri točke.\u003C/td\u003E\u003Ctd\u003EPremalo kutova.\u003C/td\u003E\u003Ctd\u003EKliknite najmanje tri kuta.\u003C/td\u003E\u003C/tr\u003E\u003Ctr\u003E\u003Ctd\u003EObris siječe sam sebe, pa bi mu površina bila pogrešna. Nacrtajte ga ponovno bez sjecišta.\u003C/td\u003E\u003Ctd\u003EOblik u obliku osmice.\u003C/td\u003E\u003Ctd\u003ENacrtajte ga kao dvije površine ili obiđite rub redom.\u003C/td\u003E\u003C/tr\u003E\u003Ctr\u003E\u003Ctd\u003ETe točke ne zatvaraju nikakvu površinu.\u003C/td\u003E\u003Ctd\u003ESve točke su na jednoj liniji.\u003C/td\u003E\u003Ctd\u003EKliknite kutove koji zatvaraju prostor.\u003C/td\u003E\u003C/tr\u003E\u003Ctr\u003E\u003Ctd\u003EPrvo odaberite oznaku površine (alat Odaberi), zatim odaberite \u003Cspan class=\"hui\"\u003EOtvor\u003C/span\u003E i nacrtajte rupu unutar nje.\u003C/td\u003E\u003Ctd\u003E\u003Cspan class=\"hui\"\u003EOtvor\u003C/span\u003E treba odabranu površinu.\u003C/td\u003E\u003Ctd\u003EPritisnite \u003Ckbd class=\"hk\"\u003E\u003Cspan class=\"k-mac\" title=\"V\"\u003EV\u003C/span\u003E\u003Cspan class=\"k-pc\"\u003EV\u003C/span\u003E\u003C/kbd\u003E, kliknite površinu, pa \u003Ckbd class=\"hk\"\u003E\u003Cspan class=\"k-mac\" title=\"X\"\u003EX\u003C/span\u003E\u003Cspan class=\"k-pc\"\u003EX\u003C/span\u003E\u003C/kbd\u003E.\u003C/td\u003E\u003C/tr\u003E\u003Ctr\u003E\u003Ctd\u003EOtvor mora biti potpuno unutar površine.\u003C/td\u003E\u003Ctd\u003ERupa siječe ili izlazi iz obrisa.\u003C/td\u003E\u003Ctd\u003ENacrtajte rupu unutar površine.\u003C/td\u003E\u003C/tr\u003E\u003Ctr\u003E\u003Ctd\u003EOtvori se ne mogu preklapati.\u003C/td\u003E\u003Ctd\u003EDvije rupe se preklapaju.\u003C/td\u003E\u003Ctd\u003ENacrtajte jednu rupu oko obje ili ih držite razdvojenima.\u003C/td\u003E\u003C/tr\u003E\u003Ctr\u003E\u003Ctd\u003E… Točka je vraćena na mjesto.\u003C/td\u003E\u003Ctd\u003EPovučeni kut bi učinio da obris siječe sam sebe ili bi gurnuo rupu van.\u003C/td\u003E\u003Ctd\u003EPovucite na mjesto koje održava valjan oblik.\u003C/td\u003E\u003C/tr\u003E\u003Ctr\u003E\u003Ctd\u003EKliknite točku na rubu kružnice, dalje od središta.\u003C/td\u003E\u003Ctd\u003EDrugi klik bio je preblizu središtu.\u003C/td\u003E\u003Ctd\u003EKliknite dalje od središta.\u003C/td\u003E\u003C/tr\u003E\u003Ctr\u003E\u003Ctd\u003EKlikovi pomiču list umjesto da dodaju točke\u003C/td\u003E\u003Ctd\u003EPokazivač se pomaknuo više od nekoliko piksela dok je tipka bila pritisnuta; to se smatra povlačenjem.\u003C/td\u003E\u003Ctd\u003EKliknite bez pomicanja, posebno na dodirnoj podlozi (trackpad).\u003C/td\u003E\u003C/tr\u003E\u003Ctr\u003E\u003Ctd\u003EShift ne hvata\u003C/td\u003E\u003Ctd\u003EPostavljate točku na luk ili crtate kružnicu.\u003C/td\u003E\u003Ctd\u003EHvatanje pod 45° vrijedi samo za ravne dužine.\u003C/td\u003E\u003C/tr\u003E\u003Ctr\u003E\u003Ctd\u003ETočke skaču na obližnju liniju\u003C/td\u003E\u003Ctd\u003EHvatanje na linije crteža je uključeno.\u003C/td\u003E\u003Ctd\u003EUvećajte da kliknete između linija ili pritisnite \u003Ckbd class=\"hk\"\u003E\u003Cspan class=\"k-mac\" title=\"F3\"\u003EF3\u003C/span\u003E\u003Cspan class=\"k-pc\"\u003EF3\u003C/span\u003E\u003C/kbd\u003E za isključivanje hvatanja.\u003C/td\u003E\u003C/tr\u003E\u003Ctr\u003E\u003Ctd\u003ENema oznake hvatanja\u003C/td\u003E\u003Ctd\u003EHvatanje je isključeno, list je skeniran ili alat ne hvata (\u003Cspan class=\"hui\"\u003EBroji\u003C/span\u003E, \u003Cspan class=\"hui\"\u003EAutobrojanje\u003C/span\u003E, lijepljenje).\u003C/td\u003E\u003Ctd\u003EPritisnite \u003Ckbd class=\"hk\"\u003E\u003Cspan class=\"k-mac\" title=\"F3\"\u003EF3\u003C/span\u003E\u003Cspan class=\"k-pc\"\u003EF3\u003C/span\u003E\u003C/kbd\u003E; na skeniranom listu nema linija za hvatanje.\u003C/td\u003E\u003C/tr\u003E\u003Ctr\u003E\u003Ctd\u003EDuljina je pogrešna\u003C/td\u003E\u003Ctd\u003EMjerilo je pogrešno (često promijenjena veličina PDF-a s predloškom).\u003C/td\u003E\u003Ctd\u003EUpotrijebite \u003Cspan class=\"hui\"\u003EProvjeri\u003C/span\u003E na poznatoj koti, zatim \u003Cspan class=\"hui\"\u003EKalibriraj\u003C/span\u003E.\u003C/td\u003E\u003C/tr\u003E\u003C/tbody\u003E\u003C/table\u003E\u003C/div\u003E\n\u003Ch2 id=\"mjerilo\"\u003EMjerilo\u003C/h2\u003E\n\u003Cdiv class=\"ht-wrap\"\u003E\u003Ctable class=\"ht\"\u003E\u003Cthead\u003E\u003Ctr\u003E\u003Cth scope=\"col\"\u003EPoruka ili pojava\u003C/th\u003E\u003Cth scope=\"col\"\u003EUzrok\u003C/th\u003E\u003Cth scope=\"col\"\u003ERješenje\u003C/th\u003E\u003C/tr\u003E\u003C/thead\u003E\u003Ctbody\u003E\u003Ctr\u003E\u003Ctd\u003EOdaberite dvije točke dalje jednu od druge.\u003C/td\u003E\u003Ctd\u003ETočke za kalibraciju su gotovo jedna na drugoj.\u003C/td\u003E\u003Ctd\u003EKalibrirajte na dužoj koti.\u003C/td\u003E\u003C/tr\u003E\u003Ctr\u003E\u003Ctd\u003EPoruka u dijaloškom okviru za kalibraciju, npr. „Tu udaljenost nije moguće pročitati“\u003C/td\u003E\u003Ctd\u003EUdaljenost je u obliku koji TakeoffDesk ne može pročitati.\u003C/td\u003E\u003Ctd\u003EVidi \u003Ca href=\"/tutorials/takeoffcraft/entry-formats\" data-topic=\"takeoffcraft/entry-formats\"\u003EUnos duljine, cijene i postotka\u003C/a\u003E.\u003C/td\u003E\u003C/tr\u003E\u003Ctr\u003E\u003Ctd\u003EOvaj list još nema mjerilo, pa nema što provjeriti. Kalibrirajte ga ili odaberite predložak.\u003C/td\u003E\u003Ctd\u003E\u003Cspan class=\"hui\"\u003EProvjeri\u003C/span\u003E na listu bez mjerila.\u003C/td\u003E\u003Ctd\u003EPrvo postavite mjerilo.\u003C/td\u003E\u003C/tr\u003E\u003Ctr\u003E\u003Ctd\u003EPopis \u003Cspan class=\"hui\"\u003EPredložak\u003C/span\u003E je zasivljen\u003C/td\u003E\u003Ctd\u003ENijedan list nije otvoren.\u003C/td\u003E\u003Ctd\u003EOtvorite PDF.\u003C/td\u003E\u003C/tr\u003E\u003C/tbody\u003E\u003C/table\u003E\u003C/div\u003E\n\u003Ch2 id=\"koli-ine-i-formule\"\u003EKoličine i formule\u003C/h2\u003E\n\u003Cdiv class=\"ht-wrap\"\u003E\u003Ctable class=\"ht\"\u003E\u003Cthead\u003E\u003Ctr\u003E\u003Cth scope=\"col\"\u003EPoruka ili pojava\u003C/th\u003E\u003Cth scope=\"col\"\u003EUzrok\u003C/th\u003E\u003Cth scope=\"col\"\u003ERješenje\u003C/th\u003E\u003C/tr\u003E\u003C/thead\u003E\u003Ctbody\u003E\u003Ctr\u003E\u003Ctd\u003ENepotpuno: … (nije u zbrojevima)\u003C/td\u003E\u003Ctd\u003EPogreška u formuli ili oznake na listovima bez mjerila.\u003C/td\u003E\u003Ctd\u003EVidi \u003Ca href=\"/tutorials/takeoffcraft/read-quantities#the-incomplete-warning\" data-topic=\"takeoffcraft/read-quantities\" data-hash=\"the-incomplete-warning\"\u003EČitanje količina i procjene\u003C/a\u003E.\u003C/td\u003E\u003C/tr\u003E\u003Ctr\u003E\u003Ctd\u003E+(n) bez mjerila uz stavku\u003C/td\u003E\u003Ctd\u003ENeke od njezinih oznaka su na listovima bez mjerila.\u003C/td\u003E\u003Ctd\u003EDajte tim listovima mjerilo.\u003C/td\u003E\u003C/tr\u003E\u003Ctr\u003E\u003Ctd\u003EPogreška u formuli: …\u003C/td\u003E\u003Ctd\u003EFormulu nije moguće izračunati.\u003C/td\u003E\u003Ctd\u003EVidi \u003Ca href=\"/tutorials/takeoffcraft/formulas#errors\" data-topic=\"takeoffcraft/formulas\" data-hash=\"errors\"\u003EJezik formula\u003C/a\u003E.\u003C/td\u003E\u003C/tr\u003E\u003Ctr\u003E\u003Ctd\u003EOva stavka ima oznake, pa se njezina vrsta ne može promijeniti.\u003C/td\u003E\u003Ctd\u003EVrsta je zaključana čim postoje oznake.\u003C/td\u003E\u003Ctd\u003ENapravite novu stavku druge vrste i ponovno nacrtajte oznake njome.\u003C/td\u003E\u003C/tr\u003E\u003Ctr\u003E\u003Ctd\u003EStavka treba naziv.\u003C/td\u003E\u003Ctd\u003EPolje za naziv je ispražnjeno.\u003C/td\u003E\u003Ctd\u003EUpišite naziv.\u003C/td\u003E\u003C/tr\u003E\u003Ctr\u003E\u003Ctd\u003EUpišite iznos poput 12.50. / Upišite postotak poput 10 ili 7.5.\u003C/td\u003E\u003Ctd\u003ECijena ili gubitak nisu se mogli pročitati.\u003C/td\u003E\u003Ctd\u003EVidi \u003Ca href=\"/tutorials/takeoffcraft/entry-formats\" data-topic=\"takeoffcraft/entry-formats\"\u003EUnos duljine, cijene i postotka\u003C/a\u003E.\u003C/td\u003E\u003C/tr\u003E\u003Ctr\u003E\u003Ctd\u003EUkupno izgleda udvostručeno\u003C/td\u003E\u003Ctd\u003EStavka ima vlastite cijene i komponente koje nose isti trošak.\u003C/td\u003E\u003Ctd\u003EPostavite vlastite cijene stavke na 0 kad komponente nose trošak.\u003C/td\u003E\u003C/tr\u003E\u003Ctr\u003E\u003Ctd\u003EOznake ove stavke su na PDF-ovima koji nisu otvoreni.\u003C/td\u003E\u003Ctd\u003EKliknuli ste stavku čije su sve oznake na PDF-ovima koje niste otvorili.\u003C/td\u003E\u003Ctd\u003EOtvorite te PDF-ove; njihovi nazivi su navedeni pod \u003Cspan class=\"hui\"\u003EListovi\u003C/span\u003E.\u003C/td\u003E\u003C/tr\u003E\u003C/tbody\u003E\u003C/table\u003E\u003C/div\u003E\n\u003Ch2 id=\"autobrojanje\"\u003EAutobrojanje\u003C/h2\u003E\n\u003Cdiv class=\"ht-wrap\"\u003E\u003Ctable class=\"ht\"\u003E\u003Cthead\u003E\u003Ctr\u003E\u003Cth scope=\"col\"\u003EPoruka ili pojava\u003C/th\u003E\u003Cth scope=\"col\"\u003EUzrok\u003C/th\u003E\u003Cth scope=\"col\"\u003ERješenje\u003C/th\u003E\u003C/tr\u003E\u003C/thead\u003E\u003Ctbody\u003E\u003Ctr\u003E\u003Ctd\u003ETaj okvir je premalen. Nacrtajte ga oko cijelog simbola.\u003C/td\u003E\u003Ctd\u003EOkvir je sitan.\u003C/td\u003E\u003Ctd\u003EUvećajte i obuhvatite cijeli simbol okvirom.\u003C/td\u003E\u003C/tr\u003E\u003Ctr\u003E\u003Ctd\u003ETaj okvir je gotovo prazan. Nacrtajte ga oko simbola.\u003C/td\u003E\u003Ctd\u003EOkvir sadrži samo papir.\u003C/td\u003E\u003Ctd\u003EObuhvatite okvirom sam simbol.\u003C/td\u003E\u003C/tr\u003E\u003Ctr\u003E\u003Ctd\u003ENema podudaranja. Spustite klizač \u003Cspan class=\"hui\"\u003EPodudaranje\u003C/span\u003E ili suzite okvir oko simbola.\u003C/td\u003E\u003Ctd\u003ENišta nije dobilo dovoljno visoku ocjenu.\u003C/td\u003E\u003Ctd\u003EObuhvatite simbol bliže ili povucite klizač \u003Cspan class=\"hui\"\u003EPodudaranje\u003C/span\u003E niže.\u003C/td\u003E\u003C/tr\u003E\u003Ctr\u003E\u003Ctd\u003EPreviše podudaranja, uključujući pogrešne simbole\u003C/td\u003E\u003Ctd\u003ESlični simboli dobivaju ocjenu blisku pravom.\u003C/td\u003E\u003Ctd\u003EPodignite klizač \u003Cspan class=\"hui\"\u003EPodudaranje\u003C/span\u003E i kliknite pogrešne okvire da ih odbacite.\u003C/td\u003E\u003C/tr\u003E\u003Ctr\u003E\u003Ctd\u003ENedostaju podudaranja na drugim listovima\u003C/td\u003E\u003Ctd\u003ETi listovi crtaju simbol drugom veličinom ili pod kutom koji nije korak od 90°.\u003C/td\u003E\u003Ctd\u003EPretražite te listove okvirom nacrtanim tamo ili brojite ručno.\u003C/td\u003E\u003C/tr\u003E\u003Ctr\u003E\u003Ctd\u003E(n) listova je preveliko za pretragu pri ovoj veličini simbola.\u003C/td\u003E\u003Ctd\u003EList bi bio prevelik pri radnoj veličini.\u003C/td\u003E\u003Ctd\u003EObuhvatite veći simbol ili taj list prebrojite ručno.\u003C/td\u003E\u003C/tr\u003E\u003Ctr\u003E\u003Ctd\u003EPretraga nije uspjela: …\u003C/td\u003E\u003Ctd\u003EPretraga u pozadini je prekinuta.\u003C/td\u003E\u003Ctd\u003EPokušajte ponovno; ponovno učitajte stranicu ako se ponavlja (prvo spremite). Izvan mreže radi tek kad traka aplikacije prikaže \u003Cspan class=\"hui\"\u003ESpremno za offline\u003C/span\u003E.\u003C/td\u003E\u003C/tr\u003E\u003Ctr\u003E\u003Ctd\u003EPovlačenje crta okvir umjesto pomicanja\u003C/td\u003E\u003Ctd\u003ETako radi \u003Cspan class=\"hui\"\u003EAutobrojanje\u003C/span\u003E.\u003C/td\u003E\u003Ctd\u003EDržite \u003Ckbd class=\"hk\"\u003E\u003Cspan class=\"k-mac\" title=\"Space\"\u003ESpace\u003C/span\u003E\u003Cspan class=\"k-pc\"\u003ESpace\u003C/span\u003E\u003C/kbd\u003E i povucite ili povucite srednjom tipkom.\u003C/td\u003E\u003C/tr\u003E\u003C/tbody\u003E\u003C/table\u003E\u003C/div\u003E\n\u003Ch2 id=\"spremanje-i-izvoz\"\u003ESpremanje i izvoz\u003C/h2\u003E\n\u003Cdiv class=\"ht-wrap\"\u003E\u003Ctable class=\"ht\"\u003E\u003Cthead\u003E\u003Ctr\u003E\u003Cth scope=\"col\"\u003EPoruka ili pojava\u003C/th\u003E\u003Cth scope=\"col\"\u003EUzrok\u003C/th\u003E\u003Cth scope=\"col\"\u003ERješenje\u003C/th\u003E\u003C/tr\u003E\u003C/thead\u003E\u003Ctbody\u003E\u003Ctr\u003E\u003Ctd\u003EJoš nema što izvesti: napravite stavku i uzmite je za predmjer.\u003C/td\u003E\u003Ctd\u003ENema stavki.\u003C/td\u003E\u003Ctd\u003EPrvo napravite stavku.\u003C/td\u003E\u003C/tr\u003E\u003Ctr\u003E\u003Ctd\u003ENa otvorenim PDF-ovima još nema oznaka.\u003C/td\u003E\u003Ctd\u003E\u003Cspan class=\"hui\"\u003EOznačeni PDF\u003C/span\u003E nema što nacrtati na otvorenim PDF-ovima.\u003C/td\u003E\u003Ctd\u003EOtvorite PDF-ove koji imaju oznake.\u003C/td\u003E\u003C/tr\u003E\u003Ctr\u003E\u003Ctd\u003EOvaj PDF je zaštićen lozinkom ili šifriran, pa se označena kopija ne može zapisati. …\u003C/td\u003E\u003Ctd\u003EPDF je šifriran.\u003C/td\u003E\u003Ctd\u003EIzvezite \u003Cspan class=\"hui\"\u003EXLSX\u003C/span\u003E umjesto toga ili upotrijebite nešifriranu kopiju PDF-a (tada treba vlastiti predmjer, jer je to druga datoteka).\u003C/td\u003E\u003C/tr\u003E\u003Ctr\u003E\u003Ctd\u003EOznačeni PDF nije moguće zapisati: …\u003C/td\u003E\u003Ctd\u003EČesto: izvan mreže, a aplikacija nije spremljena za rad izvan mreže, pa nedostaje pisač PDF-a.\u003C/td\u003E\u003Ctd\u003EIdite na mrežu i ponovno odaberite \u003Cspan class=\"hui\"\u003EOznačeni PDF\u003C/span\u003E. Da to izbjegnete, odaberite \u003Cspan class=\"hui\"\u003ESpremi za offline\u003C/span\u003E i pričekajte \u003Cspan class=\"hui\"\u003ESpremno za offline\u003C/span\u003E.\u003C/td\u003E\u003C/tr\u003E\u003Ctr\u003E\u003Ctd\u003EPreuzet je samo jedan označeni PDF\u003C/td\u003E\u003Ctd\u003EPreglednik je blokirao više preuzimanja istodobno.\u003C/td\u003E\u003Ctd\u003EDopustite višestruka preuzimanja za ovu stranicu i izvezite ponovno.\u003C/td\u003E\u003C/tr\u003E\u003Ctr\u003E\u003Ctd\u003E(datoteka) nije TakeoffDesk projekt (nije ispravan JSON). / Ovo nije datoteka TakeoffDesk projekta.\u003C/td\u003E\u003Ctd\u003EKriva datoteka ili oštećena.\u003C/td\u003E\u003Ctd\u003EOdaberite datoteku \u003Ccode\u003E.takeoff.json\u003C/code\u003E.\u003C/td\u003E\u003C/tr\u003E\u003Ctr\u003E\u003Ctd\u003EOvaj projekt je spremio noviji TakeoffDesk. Otvorite ga tamo.\u003C/td\u003E\u003Ctd\u003EDatoteka potječe iz novije verzije.\u003C/td\u003E\u003Ctd\u003EOtvorite je u novijoj verziji.\u003C/td\u003E\u003C/tr\u003E\u003Ctr\u003E\u003Ctd\u003E(n) oznaka je oštećeno i izostavljeno.\u003C/td\u003E\u003Ctd\u003EDio datoteke je oštećen ili ručno uređen.\u003C/td\u003E\u003Ctd\u003EOstatak se otvorio. Ponovno nacrtajte nedostajuće oznake ili otvorite stariju kopiju.\u003C/td\u003E\u003C/tr\u003E\u003Ctr\u003E\u003Ctd\u003ENedostaju oznake nakon ponovnog otvaranja\u003C/td\u003E\u003Ctd\u003EPDF-ovi nisu otvoreni ili se jedan od njih promijenio.\u003C/td\u003E\u003Ctd\u003EVidi \u003Ca href=\"/tutorials/takeoffcraft/save-and-reopen#when-a-pdf-has-changed\" data-topic=\"takeoffcraft/save-and-reopen\" data-hash=\"when-a-pdf-has-changed\"\u003ESpremanje i ponovno otvaranje predmjera\u003C/a\u003E.\u003C/td\u003E\u003C/tr\u003E\u003Ctr\u003E\u003Ctd\u003EPreglednik pita „Napustiti stranicu?“\u003C/td\u003E\u003Ctd\u003EIma nespremljenih promjena.\u003C/td\u003E\u003Ctd\u003EOstanite i spremite pomoću \u003Ckbd class=\"hk\"\u003E\u003Cspan class=\"k-mac\" title=\"Command S\"\u003E⌘S\u003C/span\u003E\u003Cspan class=\"k-pc\"\u003ECtrl+S\u003C/span\u003E\u003C/kbd\u003E.\u003C/td\u003E\u003C/tr\u003E\u003C/tbody\u003E\u003C/table\u003E\u003C/div\u003E\n\u003Ch2 id=\"tipke-i-mi\"\u003ETipke i miš\u003C/h2\u003E\n\u003Cdiv class=\"ht-wrap\"\u003E\u003Ctable class=\"ht\"\u003E\u003Cthead\u003E\u003Ctr\u003E\u003Cth scope=\"col\"\u003EPojava\u003C/th\u003E\u003Cth scope=\"col\"\u003EUzrok\u003C/th\u003E\u003Cth scope=\"col\"\u003ERješenje\u003C/th\u003E\u003C/tr\u003E\u003C/thead\u003E\u003Ctbody\u003E\u003Ctr\u003E\u003Ctd\u003ETipke slova ne rade ništa\u003C/td\u003E\u003Ctd\u003EKursor je u polju (pretraga, uređivač stavki, tablica).\u003C/td\u003E\u003Ctd\u003EKliknite na list ili pritisnite \u003Ckbd class=\"hk\"\u003E\u003Cspan class=\"k-mac\" title=\"Tab\"\u003ETab\u003C/span\u003E\u003Cspan class=\"k-pc\"\u003ETab\u003C/span\u003E\u003C/kbd\u003E za izlazak iz polja.\u003C/td\u003E\u003C/tr\u003E\u003Ctr\u003E\u003Ctd\u003EKotačić zumira umjesto pomicanja\u003C/td\u003E\u003Ctd\u003EKotačić uvijek zumira list.\u003C/td\u003E\u003Ctd\u003EPovucite za pomicanje.\u003C/td\u003E\u003C/tr\u003E\u003Ctr\u003E\u003Ctd\u003ECijela stranica je postala veća ili manja\u003C/td\u003E\u003Ctd\u003EZumiranje preglednika (\u003Ckbd class=\"hk\"\u003E\u003Cspan class=\"k-mac\" title=\"Command +\"\u003E⌘+\u003C/span\u003E\u003Cspan class=\"k-pc\"\u003ECtrl++\u003C/span\u003E\u003C/kbd\u003E ili \u003Ckbd class=\"hk\"\u003E\u003Cspan class=\"k-mac\" title=\"Command −\"\u003E⌘−\u003C/span\u003E\u003Cspan class=\"k-pc\"\u003ECtrl+−\u003C/span\u003E\u003C/kbd\u003E).\u003C/td\u003E\u003Ctd\u003EPritisnite \u003Ckbd class=\"hk\"\u003E\u003Cspan class=\"k-mac\" title=\"Command 0\"\u003E⌘0\u003C/span\u003E\u003Cspan class=\"k-pc\"\u003ECtrl+0\u003C/span\u003E\u003C/kbd\u003E. Zumirajte list kotačićem ili običnim \u003Ckbd class=\"hk\"\u003E\u003Cspan class=\"k-mac\" title=\"+\"\u003E+\u003C/span\u003E\u003Cspan class=\"k-pc\"\u003E+\u003C/span\u003E\u003C/kbd\u003E i \u003Ckbd class=\"hk\"\u003E\u003Cspan class=\"k-mac\" title=\"−\"\u003E−\u003C/span\u003E\u003Cspan class=\"k-pc\"\u003E−\u003C/span\u003E\u003C/kbd\u003E.\u003C/td\u003E\u003C/tr\u003E\u003Ctr\u003E\u003Ctd\u003EOznaka je nestala kad sam pritisnuo Backspace\u003C/td\u003E\u003Ctd\u003EBackspace briše odabranu oznaku kad ne crtate.\u003C/td\u003E\u003Ctd\u003E\u003Ckbd class=\"hk\"\u003E\u003Cspan class=\"k-mac\" title=\"Command Z\"\u003E⌘Z\u003C/span\u003E\u003Cspan class=\"k-pc\"\u003ECtrl+Z\u003C/span\u003E\u003C/kbd\u003E je vraća.\u003C/td\u003E\u003C/tr\u003E\u003Ctr\u003E\u003Ctd\u003EDesni klik ne završava na Macu\u003C/td\u003E\u003Ctd\u003EControl-klik stigne kao običan klik.\u003C/td\u003E\u003Ctd\u003EUpotrijebite klik dvama prstima uz uključen sekundarni klik ili pritisnite \u003Ckbd class=\"hk\"\u003E\u003Cspan class=\"k-mac\" title=\"Return\"\u003EReturn\u003C/span\u003E\u003Cspan class=\"k-pc\"\u003EEnter\u003C/span\u003E\u003C/kbd\u003E.\u003C/td\u003E\u003C/tr\u003E\u003C/tbody\u003E\u003C/table\u003E\u003C/div\u003E\n\u003Ch2 id=\"zasloni-osjetljivi-na-dodir\"\u003EZasloni osjetljivi na dodir\u003C/h2\u003E\n\u003Cp\u003ENa zaslonu osjetljivom na dodir:\u003C/p\u003E\n\u003Cul\u003E\u003Cli\u003E\u003Cstrong\u003EDodir\u003C/strong\u003E postavlja točku (ili odabire oznaku pomoću \u003Cspan class=\"hui\"\u003EOdaberi\u003C/span\u003E). Povlačenje jednim prstom pomiče prikaz.\u003C/li\u003E\u003Cli\u003E\u003Cstrong\u003EDva prsta\u003C/strong\u003E štipanjem zumiraju oko točke između njih, a pomiču kad se zajedno pomiču. Spuštanje drugog prsta poništava ono što je započeo prvi, pa štipanje nikad ne ostavlja točku.\u003C/li\u003E\u003Cli\u003E\u003Cstrong\u003EZavršite\u003C/strong\u003E trasu ili obris \u003Cstrong\u003Edugim pritiskom\u003C/strong\u003E (desni klik), \u003Cstrong\u003Edvostrukim dodirom\u003C/strong\u003E ili \u003Cspan class=\"hui\"\u003EZavrši\u003C/span\u003E u traci na dnu lista. Ista traka ima \u003Cspan class=\"hui\"\u003EStraga\u003C/span\u003E (vraća zadnju točku) i \u003Cspan class=\"hui\"\u003EOdustani\u003C/span\u003E. Površine se također zatvaraju dodirom prve točke.\u003C/li\u003E\u003Cli\u003EPrsti dobivaju veće mete: točke se hvataju, zatvaraju i biraju s veće udaljenosti, a ručke kutova su veće.\u003C/li\u003E\u003C/ul\u003E\n\u003Cp\u003EUpisivanje duljina treba tipkovnicu; zaslonska tipkovnica radi kad je okvir \u003Cspan class=\"hui\"\u003EUpis\u003C/span\u003E aktivan.\u003C/p\u003E\n\u003Cp\u003ENa tabletu tipkovnica i miš ili dodirna podloga znatno olakšavaju predmjer.\u003C/p\u003E\n\u003Ch2 id=\"rad-izvan-mre-e\"\u003ERad izvan mreže\u003C/h2\u003E\n\u003Cdiv class=\"ht-wrap\"\u003E\u003Ctable class=\"ht\"\u003E\u003Cthead\u003E\u003Ctr\u003E\u003Cth scope=\"col\"\u003EGumb ili pojava\u003C/th\u003E\u003Cth scope=\"col\"\u003EUzrok\u003C/th\u003E\u003Cth scope=\"col\"\u003ERješenje\u003C/th\u003E\u003C/tr\u003E\u003C/thead\u003E\u003Ctbody\u003E\u003Ctr\u003E\u003Ctd\u003E\u003Cspan class=\"hui\"\u003ESpremanje nije uspjelo\u003C/span\u003E\u003C/td\u003E\u003Ctd\u003ENeke datoteke aplikacije nisu se preuzele tijekom spremanja za rad izvan mreže.\u003C/td\u003E\u003Ctd\u003EProvjerite vezu i ponovno odaberite gumb.\u003C/td\u003E\u003C/tr\u003E\u003Ctr\u003E\u003Ctd\u003E\u003Cspan class=\"hui\"\u003EOffline nije dostupan\u003C/span\u003E\u003C/td\u003E\u003Ctd\u003EPrivatni prozori i neka upravljana računala blokiraju kopije za rad izvan mreže.\u003C/td\u003E\u003Ctd\u003EUpotrijebite običan prozor ili drugi preglednik.\u003C/td\u003E\u003C/tr\u003E\u003Ctr\u003E\u003Ctd\u003E„Spremanje…“ se nikad ne pokreće\u003C/td\u003E\u003Ctd\u003ENiste na mreži; spremanje treba vezu.\u003C/td\u003E\u003Ctd\u003ESpremite dok ste na mreži.\u003C/td\u003E\u003C/tr\u003E\u003Ctr\u003E\u003Ctd\u003EAplikacija je stara nakon ažuriranja\u003C/td\u003E\u003Ctd\u003EKopija za rad izvan mreže je iz ranijeg dana.\u003C/td\u003E\u003Ctd\u003ENa mreži odaberite \u003Cspan class=\"hui\"\u003ESpremno za offline\u003C/span\u003E, zatim \u003Cspan class=\"hui\"\u003ESpremi ponovno (preuzmi najnoviju verziju)\u003C/span\u003E.\u003C/td\u003E\u003C/tr\u003E\u003Ctr\u003E\u003Ctd\u003EŽelite natrag prostor\u003C/td\u003E\u003Ctd\u003EKopija za rad izvan mreže zauzima oko 6 MB.\u003C/td\u003E\u003Ctd\u003EOdaberite \u003Cspan class=\"hui\"\u003ESpremno za offline\u003C/span\u003E, zatim \u003Cspan class=\"hui\"\u003EUkloni offline kopiju\u003C/span\u003E.\u003C/td\u003E\u003C/tr\u003E\u003C/tbody\u003E\u003C/table\u003E\u003C/div\u003E\n\u003Cp\u003EVidi \u003Ca href=\"/tutorials/basics/offline\" data-topic=\"basics/offline\"\u003ERad izvan mreže\u003C/a\u003E.\u003C/p\u003E\n\u003Ch2 id=\"jo-uvijek-imate-problema\"\u003EJoš uvijek imate problema\u003C/h2\u003E\n\u003Cp\u003EPonovno učitajte stranicu ako aplikacija prestane reagirati. Predmjer se gubi pri ponovnom učitavanju, osim ako ste ga spremili, pa prvo spremite pomoću \u003Ckbd class=\"hk\"\u003E\u003Cspan class=\"k-mac\" title=\"Command S\"\u003E⌘S\u003C/span\u003E\u003Cspan class=\"k-pc\"\u003ECtrl+S\u003C/span\u003E\u003C/kbd\u003E ako možete. Za pitanja o pregledniku vidi \u003Ca href=\"/tutorials/basics/browsers\" data-topic=\"basics/browsers\"\u003EPreglednici i računala\u003C/a\u003E.\u003C/p\u003E","text":"TakeoffDesk objašnjava većinu odbijanja u statusnoj traci na dnu prozora. Pronađite poruku u nastavku. Otvaranje datoteka Poruka ili pojava Uzrok Rješenje Čitač PDF-a nije se mogao učitati. Ponovno učitajte stranicu za novi pokušaj. Čitač PDF-a aplikacije nije se učitao, obično zato što ste izvan mreže, a aplikacija nikad nije spremljena za rad izvan mreže. Spojite se na mrežu i ponovno učitajte. Zatim odaberite Spremi za offline i pričekajte Spremno za offline; vidi Rad izvan mreže. (naziv) je zaštićen lozinkom. Otvorite kopiju bez zaštite. PDF za otvaranje traži lozinku. Zatražite kopiju bez zaštite ili uklonite lozinku u PDF programu kojem vjerujete. (naziv) nije moguće pročitati kao PDF (…) Datoteka je oštećena ili zapravo nije PDF. Preuzmite je ponovno ili je ponovno spremite iz programa koji ju je napravio. Već otvoreno: (naziv). Isti PDF (isti sadržaj) je već otvoren. Ništa ne treba učiniti. TakeoffDesk otvara PDF-ove i .takeoff.json projekte. Preskočeno: … Ostale vrste datoteka su odbačene. Prvo pretvorite crteže u PDF. Ništa se ne događa kad ispustim datoteke Datoteke su ispuštene izvan prozora preglednika ili je preglednik otvorio PDF u novoj kartici. Ispustite ih na samu stranicu TakeoffDesk; okvir „Ispusti PDF-ove ili .takeoff.json“ pokazuje kad će to raditi. Otvaranje velikog skupa traje neko vrijeme Svaki PDF se u cijelosti čita radi identifikacije. Pričekajte da nestane poruka „Otvaram (naziv)…“. Sličice se popunjavaju dok se pomičete. Mjerenje Poruka ili pojava Uzrok Rješenje Prvo otvorite PDF. Nijedan list nije otvoren. Otvorite PDF. Ovaj list još nema mjerilo, pa se ne može mjeriti. Odaberite predložak mjerila ili prvo kalibrirajte (brojanje radi i bez njega). Alati za linearno, površinu, kružnicu i otvor trebaju mjerilo. Postavite mjerilo. Prvo izradite linearnu stavku (nazovite je pod Stavke), pa kliknite na list. Nema stavke te vrste. Ispunite obrazac Nova stavka koji se otvorio i odaberite Dodaj. Prvo odaberite stavku za predmjer (ploča Stavke). Trenutna stavka je izbrisana. Kliknite stavku pod Stavke. Trasa treba najmanje dvije točke. Završili ste nakon jednog klika. Kliknite najmanje dvije točke. Površina treba najmanje tri točke. Premalo kutova. Kliknite najmanje tri kuta. Obris siječe sam sebe, pa bi mu površina bila pogrešna. Nacrtajte ga ponovno bez sjecišta. Oblik u obliku osmice. Nacrtajte ga kao dvije površine ili obiđite rub redom. Te točke ne zatvaraju nikakvu površinu. Sve točke su na jednoj liniji. Kliknite kutove koji zatvaraju prostor. Prvo odaberite oznaku površine (alat Odaberi), zatim odaberite Otvor i nacrtajte rupu unutar nje. Otvor treba odabranu površinu. Pritisnite V, kliknite površinu, pa X. Otvor mora biti potpuno unutar površine. Rupa siječe ili izlazi iz obrisa. Nacrtajte rupu unutar površine. Otvori se ne mogu preklapati. Dvije rupe se preklapaju. Nacrtajte jednu rupu oko obje ili ih držite razdvojenima. … Točka je vraćena na mjesto. Povučeni kut bi učinio da obris siječe sam sebe ili bi gurnuo rupu van. Povucite na mjesto koje održava valjan oblik. Kliknite točku na rubu kružnice, dalje od središta. Drugi klik bio je preblizu središtu. Kliknite dalje od središta. Klikovi pomiču list umjesto da dodaju točke Pokazivač se pomaknuo više od nekoliko piksela dok je tipka bila pritisnuta; to se smatra povlačenjem. Kliknite bez pomicanja, posebno na dodirnoj podlozi (trackpad). Shift ne hvata Postavljate točku na luk ili crtate kružnicu. Hvatanje pod 45° vrijedi samo za ravne dužine. Točke skaču na obližnju liniju Hvatanje na linije crteža je uključeno. Uvećajte da kliknete između linija ili pritisnite F3 za isključivanje hvatanja. Nema oznake hvatanja Hvatanje je isključeno, list je skeniran ili alat ne hvata (Broji, Autobrojanje, lijepljenje). Pritisnite F3; na skeniranom listu nema linija za hvatanje. Duljina je pogrešna Mjerilo je pogrešno (često promijenjena veličina PDF-a s predloškom). Upotrijebite Provjeri na poznatoj koti, zatim Kalibriraj. Mjerilo Poruka ili pojava Uzrok Rješenje Odaberite dvije točke dalje jednu od druge. Točke za kalibraciju su gotovo jedna na drugoj. Kalibrirajte na dužoj koti. Poruka u dijaloškom okviru za kalibraciju, npr. „Tu udaljenost nije moguće pročitati“ Udaljenost je u obliku koji TakeoffDesk ne može pročitati. Vidi Unos duljine, cijene i postotka. Ovaj list još nema mjerilo, pa nema što provjeriti. Kalibrirajte ga ili odaberite predložak. Provjeri na listu bez mjerila. Prvo postavite mjerilo. Popis Predložak je zasivljen Nijedan list nije otvoren. Otvorite PDF. Količine i formule Poruka ili pojava Uzrok Rješenje Nepotpuno: … (nije u zbrojevima) Pogreška u formuli ili oznake na listovima bez mjerila. Vidi Čitanje količina i procjene. +(n) bez mjerila uz stavku Neke od njezinih oznaka su na listovima bez mjerila. Dajte tim listovima mjerilo. Pogreška u formuli: … Formulu nije moguće izračunati. Vidi Jezik formula. Ova stavka ima oznake, pa se njezina vrsta ne može promijeniti. Vrsta je zaključana čim postoje oznake. Napravite novu stavku druge vrste i ponovno nacrtajte oznake njome. Stavka treba naziv. Polje za naziv je ispražnjeno. Upišite naziv. Upišite iznos poput 12.50. / Upišite postotak poput 10 ili 7.5. Cijena ili gubitak nisu se mogli pročitati. Vidi Unos duljine, cijene i postotka. Ukupno izgleda udvostručeno Stavka ima vlastite cijene i komponente koje nose isti trošak. Postavite vlastite cijene stavke na 0 kad komponente nose trošak. Oznake ove stavke su na PDF-ovima koji nisu otvoreni. Kliknuli ste stavku čije su sve oznake na PDF-ovima koje niste otvorili. Otvorite te PDF-ove; njihovi nazivi su navedeni pod Listovi. Autobrojanje Poruka ili pojava Uzrok Rješenje Taj okvir je premalen. Nacrtajte ga oko cijelog simbola. Okvir je sitan. Uvećajte i obuhvatite cijeli simbol okvirom. Taj okvir je gotovo prazan. Nacrtajte ga oko simbola. Okvir sadrži samo papir. Obuhvatite okvirom sam simbol. Nema podudaranja. Spustite klizač Podudaranje ili suzite okvir oko simbola. Ništa nije dobilo dovoljno visoku ocjenu. Obuhvatite simbol bliže ili povucite klizač Podudaranje niže. Previše podudaranja, uključujući pogrešne simbole Slični simboli dobivaju ocjenu blisku pravom. Podignite klizač Podudaranje i kliknite pogrešne okvire da ih odbacite. Nedostaju podudaranja na drugim listovima Ti listovi crtaju simbol drugom veličinom ili pod kutom koji nije korak od 90°. Pretražite te listove okvirom nacrtanim tamo ili brojite ručno. (n) listova je preveliko za pretragu pri ovoj veličini simbola. List bi bio prevelik pri radnoj veličini. Obuhvatite veći simbol ili taj list prebrojite ručno. Pretraga nije uspjela: … Pretraga u pozadini je prekinuta. Pokušajte ponovno; ponovno učitajte stranicu ako se ponavlja (prvo spremite). Izvan mreže radi tek kad traka aplikacije prikaže Spremno za offline. Povlačenje crta okvir umjesto pomicanja Tako radi Autobrojanje. Držite Space i povucite ili povucite srednjom tipkom. Spremanje i izvoz Poruka ili pojava Uzrok Rješenje Još nema što izvesti: napravite stavku i uzmite je za predmjer. Nema stavki. Prvo napravite stavku. Na otvorenim PDF-ovima još nema oznaka. Označeni PDF nema što nacrtati na otvorenim PDF-ovima. Otvorite PDF-ove koji imaju oznake. Ovaj PDF je zaštićen lozinkom ili šifriran, pa se označena kopija ne može zapisati. … PDF je šifriran. Izvezite XLSX umjesto toga ili upotrijebite nešifriranu kopiju PDF-a (tada treba vlastiti predmjer, jer je to druga datoteka). Označeni PDF nije moguće zapisati: … Često: izvan mreže, a aplikacija nije spremljena za rad izvan mreže, pa nedostaje pisač PDF-a. Idite na mrežu i ponovno odaberite Označeni PDF. Da to izbjegnete, odaberite Spremi za offline i pričekajte Spremno za offline. Preuzet je samo jedan označeni PDF Preglednik je blokirao više preuzimanja istodobno. Dopustite višestruka preuzimanja za ovu stranicu i izvezite ponovno. (datoteka) nije TakeoffDesk projekt (nije ispravan JSON). / Ovo nije datoteka TakeoffDesk projekta. Kriva datoteka ili oštećena. Odaberite datoteku .takeoff.json. Ovaj projekt je spremio noviji TakeoffDesk. Otvorite ga tamo. Datoteka potječe iz novije verzije. Otvorite je u novijoj verziji. (n) oznaka je oštećeno i izostavljeno. Dio datoteke je oštećen ili ručno uređen. Ostatak se otvorio. Ponovno nacrtajte nedostajuće oznake ili otvorite stariju kopiju. Nedostaju oznake nakon ponovnog otvaranja PDF-ovi nisu otvoreni ili se jedan od njih promijenio. Vidi Spremanje i ponovno otvaranje predmjera. Preglednik pita „Napustiti stranicu?“ Ima nespremljenih promjena. Ostanite i spremite pomoću Ctrl+S. Tipke i miš Pojava Uzrok Rješenje Tipke slova ne rade ništa Kursor je u polju (pretraga, uređivač stavki, tablica). Kliknite na list ili pritisnite Tab za izlazak iz polja. Kotačić zumira umjesto pomicanja Kotačić uvijek zumira list. Povucite za pomicanje. Cijela stranica je postala veća ili manja Zumiranje preglednika (Ctrl++ ili Ctrl+−). Pritisnite Ctrl+0. Zumirajte list kotačićem ili običnim + i −. Oznaka je nestala kad sam pritisnuo Backspace Backspace briše odabranu oznaku kad ne crtate. Ctrl+Z je vraća. Desni klik ne završava na Macu Control-klik stigne kao običan klik. Upotrijebite klik dvama prstima uz uključen sekundarni klik ili pritisnite Enter. Zasloni osjetljivi na dodir Na zaslonu osjetljivom na dodir: Dodir postavlja točku (ili odabire oznaku pomoću Odaberi). Povlačenje jednim prstom pomiče prikaz. Dva prsta štipanjem zumiraju oko točke između njih, a pomiču kad se zajedno pomiču. Spuštanje drugog prsta poništava ono što je započeo prvi, pa štipanje nikad ne ostavlja točku. Završite trasu ili obris dugim pritiskom (desni klik), dvostrukim dodirom ili Završi u traci na dnu lista. Ista traka ima Straga (vraća zadnju točku) i Odustani. Površine se također zatvaraju dodirom prve točke. Prsti dobivaju veće mete: točke se hvataju, zatvaraju i biraju s veće udaljenosti, a ručke kutova su veće. Upisivanje duljina treba tipkovnicu; zaslonska tipkovnica radi kad je okvir Upis aktivan. Na tabletu tipkovnica i miš ili dodirna podloga znatno olakšavaju predmjer. Rad izvan mreže Gumb ili pojava Uzrok Rješenje Spremanje nije uspjelo Neke datoteke aplikacije nisu se preuzele tijekom spremanja za rad izvan mreže. Provjerite vezu i ponovno odaberite gumb. Offline nije dostupan Privatni prozori i neka upravljana računala blokiraju kopije za rad izvan mreže. Upotrijebite običan prozor ili drugi preglednik. „Spremanje…“ se nikad ne pokreće Niste na mreži; spremanje treba vezu. Spremite dok ste na mreži. Aplikacija je stara nakon ažuriranja Kopija za rad izvan mreže je iz ranijeg dana. Na mreži odaberite Spremno za offline, zatim Spremi ponovno (preuzmi najnoviju verziju). Želite natrag prostor Kopija za rad izvan mreže zauzima oko 6 MB. Odaberite Spremno za offline, zatim Ukloni offline kopiju. Vidi Rad izvan mreže. Još uvijek imate problema Ponovno učitajte stranicu ako aplikacija prestane reagirati. Predmjer se gubi pri ponovnom učitavanju, osim ako ste ga spremili, pa prvo spremite pomoću Ctrl+S ako možete. Za pitanja o pregledniku vidi Preglednici i računala.","lang":"hr"},{"slug":"not-built-yet","scope":"takeoffcraft","title":"What is not built yet","summary":"Takeoff features this build does not have, and what to do instead today.","section":"trouble","order":20,"keywords":["limits","missing","not yet","roadmap","planned","workaround","per run","cloud","desktop"],"headings":[{"id":"measuring","text":"Measuring","level":2},{"id":"items-and-pricing","text":"Items and pricing","level":2},{"id":"drawings-dwg-and-dxf","text":"Drawings (DWG and DXF)","level":2},{"id":"auto-count","text":"Auto count","level":2},{"id":"files-and-sharing","text":"Files and sharing","level":2},{"id":"screen-and-input","text":"Screen and input","level":2},{"id":"3d-view","text":"3D view","level":2},{"id":"bidding","text":"Bidding","level":2},{"id":"panels","text":"Panels","level":2},{"id":"spreadsheets","text":"Spreadsheets","level":2}],"html":"\u003Cp\u003ETakeoffDesk is in development. This list is what the current build does not do, and how to get the job done anyway.\u003C/p\u003E\n\u003Ch2 id=\"measuring\"\u003EMeasuring\u003C/h2\u003E\n\u003Cdiv class=\"ht-wrap\"\u003E\u003Ctable class=\"ht\"\u003E\u003Cthead\u003E\u003Ctr\u003E\u003Cth scope=\"col\"\u003ENot built yet\u003C/th\u003E\u003Cth scope=\"col\"\u003EInstead, today\u003C/th\u003E\u003C/tr\u003E\u003C/thead\u003E\u003Ctbody\u003E\u003Ctr\u003E\u003Ctd\u003EInserting a point in the middle of a run or outline\u003C/td\u003E\u003Ctd\u003EDelete the mark and draw it again.\u003C/td\u003E\u003C/tr\u003E\u003Ctr\u003E\u003Ctd\u003EBox (window) selection\u003C/td\u003E\u003Ctd\u003E\u003Ckbd class=\"hk\"\u003E\u003Cspan class=\"k-mac\" title=\"Shift\"\u003E⇧\u003C/span\u003E\u003Cspan class=\"k-pc\"\u003EShift\u003C/span\u003E\u003C/kbd\u003E + click each mark, or \u003Ckbd class=\"hk\"\u003E\u003Cspan class=\"k-mac\" title=\"Command A\"\u003E⌘A\u003C/span\u003E\u003Cspan class=\"k-pc\"\u003ECtrl+A\u003C/span\u003E\u003C/kbd\u003E for every mark on the sheet. See \u003Ca href=\"/tutorials/takeoffcraft/copy-paste\" data-topic=\"takeoffcraft/copy-paste\"\u003ECopy, paste and duplicate marks\u003C/a\u003E.\u003C/td\u003E\u003C/tr\u003E\u003Ctr\u003E\u003Ctd\u003ERotating, mirroring or rescaling a pasted copy\u003C/td\u003E\u003Ctd\u003EPaste on a sheet at the same scale and in the same orientation; draw the rest by hand.\u003C/td\u003E\u003C/tr\u003E\u003Ctr\u003E\u003Ctd\u003EReading a scale from a scanned sheet, or from a graphic scale bar\u003C/td\u003E\u003Ctd\u003EPick the preset, or calibrate on the bar&#039;s length.\u003C/td\u003E\u003C/tr\u003E\u003Ctr\u003E\u003Ctd\u003EMore than one scale per sheet (detail areas, enlarged plans)\u003C/td\u003E\u003Ctd\u003EMeasure the part at the sheet&#039;s scale, and take off the detail on its own enlarged sheet if the set has one.\u003C/td\u003E\u003C/tr\u003E\u003C/tbody\u003E\u003C/table\u003E\u003C/div\u003E\n\u003Ch2 id=\"items-and-pricing\"\u003EItems and pricing\u003C/h2\u003E\n\u003Cdiv class=\"ht-wrap\"\u003E\u003Ctable class=\"ht\"\u003E\u003Cthead\u003E\u003Ctr\u003E\u003Cth scope=\"col\"\u003ENot built yet\u003C/th\u003E\u003Cth scope=\"col\"\u003EInstead, today\u003C/th\u003E\u003C/tr\u003E\u003C/thead\u003E\u003Ctbody\u003E\u003Ctr\u003E\u003Ctd\u003EAssembly formulas that use an item&#039;s other kinds of marks (the doors of a room item in its floor&#039;s formulas)\u003C/td\u003E\u003Ctd\u003EFormulas use the main type&#039;s totals; price the other kinds on their own rows.\u003C/td\u003E\u003C/tr\u003E\u003Ctr\u003E\u003Ctd\u003EAssembly formulas worked out run by run\u003C/td\u003E\u003Ctd\u003EFormulas use the item&#039;s totals; use \u003Ccode\u003EN\u003C/code\u003E for per-run extras.\u003C/td\u003E\u003C/tr\u003E\u003Ctr\u003E\u003Ctd\u003EFormulas that use another item&#039;s quantities\u003C/td\u003E\u003Ctd\u003ERepeat the measurement in that item, or work it out in the spreadsheet export.\u003C/td\u003E\u003C/tr\u003E\u003Ctr\u003E\u003Ctd\u003ECrews on assembly components, or a working day other than 8 hours\u003C/td\u003E\u003Ctd\u003EGive the crew to the item; read crew-days for another day length as crew-hours ÷ your day.\u003C/td\u003E\u003C/tr\u003E\u003Ctr\u003E\u003Ctd\u003EMarkups other than notes, clouds and highlights (arrows, dimensions, stamps), or replies on a note\u003C/td\u003E\u003Ctd\u003EWrite it in the note&#039;s text; change its status as it is settled.\u003C/td\u003E\u003C/tr\u003E\u003Ctr\u003E\u003Ctd\u003EA price library shared by a team, or kept with your account\u003C/td\u003E\u003Ctd\u003EThe library is kept in this browser: export it as a CSV and import it on the other computer.\u003C/td\u003E\u003C/tr\u003E\u003Ctr\u003E\u003Ctd\u003ETrade packs reviewed by working estimators\u003C/td\u003E\u003Ctd\u003EEvery pack is a starter: check its assumptions against your job and your products before you price with it. See \u003Ca href=\"/tutorials/takeoffcraft/trade-packs\" data-topic=\"takeoffcraft/trade-packs\"\u003ETrade packs\u003C/a\u003E.\u003C/td\u003E\u003C/tr\u003E\u003Ctr\u003E\u003Ctd\u003EPrices in trade packs\u003C/td\u003E\u003Ctd\u003EPacks bring assemblies only: set your own rates, or import your price list as a CSV.\u003C/td\u003E\u003C/tr\u003E\u003Ctr\u003E\u003Ctd\u003ERenaming the takeoff\u003C/td\u003E\u003Ctd\u003EThe name comes from the first PDF; rename the downloaded files.\u003C/td\u003E\u003C/tr\u003E\u003Ctr\u003E\u003Ctd\u003ENaming sheets by hand\u003C/td\u003E\u003Ctd\u003ESheets are named from the PDF&#039;s page labels; search by file name and page.\u003C/td\u003E\u003C/tr\u003E\u003C/tbody\u003E\u003C/table\u003E\u003C/div\u003E\n\u003Ch2 id=\"drawings-dwg-and-dxf\"\u003EDrawings (DWG and DXF)\u003C/h2\u003E\n\u003Cdiv class=\"ht-wrap\"\u003E\u003Ctable class=\"ht\"\u003E\u003Cthead\u003E\u003Ctr\u003E\u003Cth scope=\"col\"\u003ENot built yet\u003C/th\u003E\u003Cth scope=\"col\"\u003EInstead, today\u003C/th\u003E\u003C/tr\u003E\u003C/thead\u003E\u003Ctbody\u003E\u003Ctr\u003E\u003Ctd\u003EPlot style tables, pen assignments and CTB files on a drawing&#039;s sheets\u003C/td\u003E\u003Ctd\u003EA drawing is drawn black, or in its colors darkened for paper; line weights come from the drawing.\u003C/td\u003E\u003C/tr\u003E\u003Ctr\u003E\u003Ctd\u003EOpening a binary DXF, or a DWG older than AutoCAD 2000\u003C/td\u003E\u003Ctd\u003ESave it as an ASCII DXF or a newer DWG.\u003C/td\u003E\u003C/tr\u003E\u003Ctr\u003E\u003Ctd\u003EFinding a linked drawing (xref) by the folder it sits in\u003C/td\u003E\u003Ctd\u003EOpen the linked drawing&#039;s file too, with the host: it is found by file name among the open files.\u003C/td\u003E\u003C/tr\u003E\u003Ctr\u003E\u003Ctd\u003EMeasuring 3D polylines, meshes, solids and regions\u003C/td\u003E\u003Ctd\u003ECount them by layer and type, or measure the plan view with the Linear and Area tools.\u003C/td\u003E\u003C/tr\u003E\u003Ctr\u003E\u003Ctd\u003EText in a marked PDF from a drawing in scripts other than Latin\u003C/td\u003E\u003Ctd\u003ECharacters Helvetica has no glyph for print as &quot;?&quot; in the marked PDF; the drawing on screen is unaffected.\u003C/td\u003E\u003C/tr\u003E\u003Ctr\u003E\u003Ctd\u003EA hand-over of a drawing to another app from the sheet bar\u003C/td\u003E\u003Ctd\u003EOpen the same file in that app.\u003C/td\u003E\u003C/tr\u003E\u003Ctr\u003E\u003Ctd\u003EA drawing that carries the takeoff inside it, as \u003Cspan class=\"hui\"\u003EPDF with the takeoff inside\u003C/span\u003E does for PDFs\u003C/td\u003E\u003Ctd\u003E\u003Cspan class=\"hui\"\u003ESave takeoff\u003C/span\u003E: the \u003Ccode\u003E.takeoff.json\u003C/code\u003E reopens on the same drawing, found by its contents.\u003C/td\u003E\u003C/tr\u003E\u003Ctr\u003E\u003Ctd\u003EDrawing or counting PDF underlays, images and OLE objects placed in a drawing\u003C/td\u003E\u003Ctd\u003EImages show as a frame only. Open the underlay PDF itself as a sheet.\u003C/td\u003E\u003C/tr\u003E\u003C/tbody\u003E\u003C/table\u003E\u003C/div\u003E\n\u003Ch2 id=\"auto-count\"\u003EAuto count\u003C/h2\u003E\n\u003Cdiv class=\"ht-wrap\"\u003E\u003Ctable class=\"ht\"\u003E\u003Cthead\u003E\u003Ctr\u003E\u003Cth scope=\"col\"\u003ENot built yet\u003C/th\u003E\u003Cth scope=\"col\"\u003EInstead, today\u003C/th\u003E\u003C/tr\u003E\u003C/thead\u003E\u003Ctbody\u003E\u003Ctr\u003E\u003Ctd\u003EFinding symbols on a sheet with no scale drawn at another size\u003C/td\u003E\u003Ctd\u003EGive the sheet its scale, or search it with a box drawn there.\u003C/td\u003E\u003C/tr\u003E\u003Ctr\u003E\u003Ctd\u003EFinding mirrored symbols\u003C/td\u003E\u003Ctd\u003ECount those by hand, or search again with a box around a mirrored one.\u003C/td\u003E\u003C/tr\u003E\u003C/tbody\u003E\u003C/table\u003E\u003C/div\u003E\n\u003Ch2 id=\"files-and-sharing\"\u003EFiles and sharing\u003C/h2\u003E\n\u003Cdiv class=\"ht-wrap\"\u003E\u003Ctable class=\"ht\"\u003E\u003Cthead\u003E\u003Ctr\u003E\u003Cth scope=\"col\"\u003ENot built yet\u003C/th\u003E\u003Cth scope=\"col\"\u003EInstead, today\u003C/th\u003E\u003C/tr\u003E\u003C/thead\u003E\u003Ctbody\u003E\u003Ctr\u003E\u003Ctd\u003EOne PDF that both shows the marks and carries the takeoff\u003C/td\u003E\u003Ctd\u003E\u003Cspan class=\"hui\"\u003EMarked PDF\u003C/span\u003E for people to see the marks; \u003Cspan class=\"hui\"\u003EPDF with the takeoff inside\u003C/span\u003E to reopen in TakeoffDesk.\u003C/td\u003E\u003C/tr\u003E\u003Ctr\u003E\u003Ctd\u003EA CSV of quantities by sheet or of the marks\u003C/td\u003E\u003Ctd\u003EUse \u003Cspan class=\"hui\"\u003EXLSX\u003C/span\u003E: its By sheet and Marks worksheets have them.\u003C/td\u003E\u003C/tr\u003E\u003Ctr\u003E\u003Ctd\u003ECloud saving\u003C/td\u003E\u003Ctd\u003ENot available yet. Save project files to your computer and back them up.\u003C/td\u003E\u003C/tr\u003E\u003Ctr\u003E\u003Ctd\u003EA desktop app\u003C/td\u003E\u003Ctd\u003ETakeoffDesk runs in the browser, served from your own computer (\u003Ccode\u003Enpm start\u003C/code\u003E) or any web server (the browser edition).\u003C/td\u003E\u003C/tr\u003E\u003C/tbody\u003E\u003C/table\u003E\u003C/div\u003E\n\u003Ch2 id=\"screen-and-input\"\u003EScreen and input\u003C/h2\u003E\n\u003Cdiv class=\"ht-wrap\"\u003E\u003Ctable class=\"ht\"\u003E\u003Cthead\u003E\u003Ctr\u003E\u003Cth scope=\"col\"\u003ENot built yet\u003C/th\u003E\u003Cth scope=\"col\"\u003EInstead, today\u003C/th\u003E\u003C/tr\u003E\u003C/thead\u003E\u003Ctbody\u003E\u003Ctr\u003E\u003Ctd\u003EA right-click (or long-press) menu\u003C/td\u003E\u003Ctd\u003EUse the toolbar, the panels and the keys. A long press finishes a run or an outline.\u003C/td\u003E\u003C/tr\u003E\u003Ctr\u003E\u003Ctd\u003ERotating the view\u003C/td\u003E\u003Ctd\u003EPages rotated in the PDF already show upright.\u003C/td\u003E\u003C/tr\u003E\u003C/tbody\u003E\u003C/table\u003E\u003C/div\u003E\n\u003Ch2 id=\"3d-view\"\u003E3D view\u003C/h2\u003E\n\u003Cdiv class=\"ht-wrap\"\u003E\u003Ctable class=\"ht\"\u003E\u003Cthead\u003E\u003Ctr\u003E\u003Cth scope=\"col\"\u003ENot built yet\u003C/th\u003E\u003Cth scope=\"col\"\u003EInstead, today\u003C/th\u003E\u003C/tr\u003E\u003C/thead\u003E\u003Ctbody\u003E\u003Ctr\u003E\u003Ctd\u003EDrawing or editing marks in 3D\u003C/td\u003E\u003Ctd\u003EGo back to the sheet (\u003Ckbd class=\"hk\"\u003E\u003Cspan class=\"k-mac\" title=\"3\"\u003E3\u003C/span\u003E\u003Cspan class=\"k-pc\"\u003E3\u003C/span\u003E\u003C/kbd\u003E) to draw; select and delete work in 3D.\u003C/td\u003E\u003C/tr\u003E\u003Ctr\u003E\u003Ctd\u003ELining up stacked floors plotted at different places on their pages\u003C/td\u003E\u003Ctd\u003EStack floors plotted alike; check the others one sheet at a time.\u003C/td\u003E\u003C/tr\u003E\u003Ctr\u003E\u003Ctd\u003ECount posts sized like the counted object\u003C/td\u003E\u003Ctd\u003EEvery post on a sheet is the same size; it marks where a count is, not what it is.\u003C/td\u003E\u003C/tr\u003E\u003C/tbody\u003E\u003C/table\u003E\u003C/div\u003E\n\u003Ch2 id=\"bidding\"\u003EBidding\u003C/h2\u003E\n\u003Cdiv class=\"ht-wrap\"\u003E\u003Ctable class=\"ht\"\u003E\u003Cthead\u003E\u003Ctr\u003E\u003Cth scope=\"col\"\u003ENot built yet\u003C/th\u003E\u003Cth scope=\"col\"\u003EInstead, today\u003C/th\u003E\u003C/tr\u003E\u003C/thead\u003E\u003Ctbody\u003E\u003Ctr\u003E\u003Ctd\u003ESending a package to subcontractors from the app, addenda, award letters\u003C/td\u003E\u003Ctd\u003EExport the package&#039;s CSV (or the bid PDF), send it yourself, and type the bids that come back into the leveling table.\u003C/td\u003E\u003C/tr\u003E\u003Ctr\u003E\u003Ctd\u003ERepricing an alternate&#039;s bid area with a chosen bid\u003C/td\u003E\u003Ctd\u003EAlternates and bid-area subtotals use your own prices; adjust the alternate by hand.\u003C/td\u003E\u003C/tr\u003E\u003Ctr\u003E\u003Ctd\u003EAutomatic reminders before a subcontractor&#039;s insurance or license date runs out\u003C/td\u003E\u003Ctd\u003EThe date is flagged on the Subcontractors page once it is past or within 30 days; check it when you invite.\u003C/td\u003E\u003C/tr\u003E\u003C/tbody\u003E\u003C/table\u003E\u003C/div\u003E\n\u003Ch2 id=\"panels\"\u003EPanels\u003C/h2\u003E\n\u003Cdiv class=\"ht-wrap\"\u003E\u003Ctable class=\"ht\"\u003E\u003Cthead\u003E\u003Ctr\u003E\u003Cth scope=\"col\"\u003ENot built yet\u003C/th\u003E\u003Cth scope=\"col\"\u003EInstead, today\u003C/th\u003E\u003C/tr\u003E\u003C/thead\u003E\u003Ctbody\u003E\u003Ctr\u003E\u003Ctd\u003EMoving the \u003Cspan class=\"hui\"\u003EQuantities\u003C/span\u003E table\u003C/td\u003E\u003Ctd\u003EOnly the \u003Cspan class=\"hui\"\u003ESheets\u003C/span\u003E and \u003Cspan class=\"hui\"\u003EItems\u003C/span\u003E panels move. See \u003Ca href=\"/tutorials/basics/arrange-panels\" data-topic=\"basics/arrange-panels\"\u003EArrange the panels\u003C/a\u003E.\u003C/td\u003E\u003C/tr\u003E\u003C/tbody\u003E\u003C/table\u003E\u003C/div\u003E\n\u003Ch2 id=\"spreadsheets\"\u003ESpreadsheets\u003C/h2\u003E\n\u003Cp\u003EThe XLSX workbook has been checked in LibreOffice Calc, which recalculated every total to the same cent as TakeoffDesk. It has not been opened in Excel yet. If a spreadsheet program shows something unexpected, the CSV export holds the same estimate as plain values.\u003C/p\u003E","text":"TakeoffDesk is in development. This list is what the current build does not do, and how to get the job done anyway. Measuring Not built yet Instead, today Inserting a point in the middle of a run or outline Delete the mark and draw it again. Box (window) selection Shift + click each mark, or Ctrl+A for every mark on the sheet. See Copy, paste and duplicate marks. Rotating, mirroring or rescaling a pasted copy Paste on a sheet at the same scale and in the same orientation; draw the rest by hand. Reading a scale from a scanned sheet, or from a graphic scale bar Pick the preset, or calibrate on the bar's length. More than one scale per sheet (detail areas, enlarged plans) Measure the part at the sheet's scale, and take off the detail on its own enlarged sheet if the set has one. Items and pricing Not built yet Instead, today Assembly formulas that use an item's other kinds of marks (the doors of a room item in its floor's formulas) Formulas use the main type's totals; price the other kinds on their own rows. Assembly formulas worked out run by run Formulas use the item's totals; use N for per-run extras. Formulas that use another item's quantities Repeat the measurement in that item, or work it out in the spreadsheet export. Crews on assembly components, or a working day other than 8 hours Give the crew to the item; read crew-days for another day length as crew-hours ÷ your day. Markups other than notes, clouds and highlights (arrows, dimensions, stamps), or replies on a note Write it in the note's text; change its status as it is settled. A price library shared by a team, or kept with your account The library is kept in this browser: export it as a CSV and import it on the other computer. Trade packs reviewed by working estimators Every pack is a starter: check its assumptions against your job and your products before you price with it. See Trade packs. Prices in trade packs Packs bring assemblies only: set your own rates, or import your price list as a CSV. Renaming the takeoff The name comes from the first PDF; rename the downloaded files. Naming sheets by hand Sheets are named from the PDF's page labels; search by file name and page. Drawings (DWG and DXF) Not built yet Instead, today Plot style tables, pen assignments and CTB files on a drawing's sheets A drawing is drawn black, or in its colors darkened for paper; line weights come from the drawing. Opening a binary DXF, or a DWG older than AutoCAD 2000 Save it as an ASCII DXF or a newer DWG. Finding a linked drawing (xref) by the folder it sits in Open the linked drawing's file too, with the host: it is found by file name among the open files. Measuring 3D polylines, meshes, solids and regions Count them by layer and type, or measure the plan view with the Linear and Area tools. Text in a marked PDF from a drawing in scripts other than Latin Characters Helvetica has no glyph for print as \"?\" in the marked PDF; the drawing on screen is unaffected. A hand-over of a drawing to another app from the sheet bar Open the same file in that app. A drawing that carries the takeoff inside it, as PDF with the takeoff inside does for PDFs Save takeoff: the .takeoff.json reopens on the same drawing, found by its contents. Drawing or counting PDF underlays, images and OLE objects placed in a drawing Images show as a frame only. Open the underlay PDF itself as a sheet. Auto count Not built yet Instead, today Finding symbols on a sheet with no scale drawn at another size Give the sheet its scale, or search it with a box drawn there. Finding mirrored symbols Count those by hand, or search again with a box around a mirrored one. Files and sharing Not built yet Instead, today One PDF that both shows the marks and carries the takeoff Marked PDF for people to see the marks; PDF with the takeoff inside to reopen in TakeoffDesk. A CSV of quantities by sheet or of the marks Use XLSX: its By sheet and Marks worksheets have them. Cloud saving Not available yet. Save project files to your computer and back them up. A desktop app TakeoffDesk runs in the browser, served from your own computer (npm start) or any web server (the browser edition). Screen and input Not built yet Instead, today A right-click (or long-press) menu Use the toolbar, the panels and the keys. A long press finishes a run or an outline. Rotating the view Pages rotated in the PDF already show upright. 3D view Not built yet Instead, today Drawing or editing marks in 3D Go back to the sheet (3) to draw; select and delete work in 3D. Lining up stacked floors plotted at different places on their pages Stack floors plotted alike; check the others one sheet at a time. Count posts sized like the counted object Every post on a sheet is the same size; it marks where a count is, not what it is. Bidding Not built yet Instead, today Sending a package to subcontractors from the app, addenda, award letters Export the package's CSV (or the bid PDF), send it yourself, and type the bids that come back into the leveling table. Repricing an alternate's bid area with a chosen bid Alternates and bid-area subtotals use your own prices; adjust the alternate by hand. Automatic reminders before a subcontractor's insurance or license date runs out The date is flagged on the Subcontractors page once it is past or within 30 days; check it when you invite. Panels Not built yet Instead, today Moving the Quantities table Only the Sheets and Items panels move. See Arrange the panels. Spreadsheets The XLSX workbook has been checked in LibreOffice Calc, which recalculated every total to the same cent as TakeoffDesk. It has not been opened in Excel yet. If a spreadsheet program shows something unexpected, the CSV export holds the same estimate as plain values.","lang":"en"},{"slug":"help","scope":"basics","title":"Korištenje ove pomoći","summary":"Otvorite pomoć, pretražujte je i pogledajte korake za svoje računalo.","section":"start","order":10,"keywords":["pomoć","f1","pretraga","vodiči","priručnik"],"headings":[{"id":"otvorite-pomo","text":"Otvorite pomoć","level":2},{"id":"prona-ite-temu","text":"Pronađite temu","level":2},{"id":"koraci-za-va-e-ra-unalo","text":"Koraci za vaše računalo","level":2},{"id":"ista-pomo-na-web-mjestu","text":"Ista pomoć na web-mjestu","level":2}],"html":"\u003Cp\u003ESvaka aplikacija nosi vlastitu pomoć. Dio je aplikacije, pa se otvara bez veze i uvijek opisuje verziju koju koristite.\u003C/p\u003E\n\u003Ch2 id=\"otvorite-pomo\"\u003EOtvorite pomoć\u003C/h2\u003E\n\u003Cul\u003E\u003Cli\u003EPritisnite \u003Ckbd class=\"hk\"\u003E\u003Cspan class=\"k-mac\" title=\"F1\"\u003EF1\u003C/span\u003E\u003Cspan class=\"k-pc\"\u003EF1\u003C/span\u003E\u003C/kbd\u003E ili odaberite \u003Cspan class=\"hui\"\u003EPomoć\u003C/span\u003E u traci na vrhu aplikacije.\u003C/li\u003E\u003Cli\u003EPritisnite \u003Ckbd class=\"hk\"\u003E\u003Cspan class=\"k-mac\" title=\"Esc\"\u003EEsc\u003C/span\u003E\u003Cspan class=\"k-pc\"\u003EEsc\u003C/span\u003E\u003C/kbd\u003E ili odaberite \u003Cspan class=\"hui\"\u003EZatvori\u003C/span\u003E da je sklonite. Vaš crtež ostaje kakav je bio.\u003C/li\u003E\u003C/ul\u003E\n\u003Cdiv class=\"hv\" data-v=\"os:mac\"\u003E\u003Cp class=\"hv-label\"\u003EMac\u003C/p\u003E\n\u003Cp\u003ENa većini Mac tipkovnica gornji redak upravlja svjetlinom i zvukom. Pritisnite \u003Ckbd class=\"hk\"\u003E\u003Cspan class=\"k-mac\" title=\"F1\"\u003EF1\u003C/span\u003E\u003Cspan class=\"k-pc\"\u003EF1\u003C/span\u003E\u003C/kbd\u003E zajedno s tipkom \u003Cstrong\u003Efn\u003C/strong\u003E (ili tipkom globusa) ili koristite gumb \u003Cspan class=\"hui\"\u003EPomoć\u003C/span\u003E. Vidi \u003Ca href=\"/tutorials/basics/keys#function-keys-on-a-mac\" data-topic=\"basics/keys\" data-hash=\"function-keys-on-a-mac\"\u003ETipke na Macu\u003C/a\u003E.\u003C/p\u003E\n\u003C/div\u003E\n\u003Ch2 id=\"prona-ite-temu\"\u003EPronađite temu\u003C/h2\u003E\n\u003Cul\u003E\u003Cli\u003EUpišite u okvir za pretragu na vrhu pomoći. Rezultati se osvježavaju dok tipkate i uključuju nazive naredbi drugih programa, pa upisivanje onoga što biste upisali drugdje obično pronađe pravu stranicu.\u003C/li\u003E\u003Cli\u003ETeme su u svakoj aplikaciji grupirane na isti način: prvi koraci, vodiči korak po korak, prelazak s drugog softvera, referenca i rješavanje problema.\u003C/li\u003E\u003Cli\u003EPoveznice unutar teme otvaraju sljedeću temu u istoj ploči. \u003Cspan class=\"hui\"\u003ENatrag\u003C/span\u003E vraća vas gdje ste bili.\u003C/li\u003E\u003C/ul\u003E\n\u003Ch2 id=\"koraci-za-va-e-ra-unalo\"\u003EKoraci za vaše računalo\u003C/h2\u003E\n\u003Cp\u003ENeki se koraci razlikuju između Maca, Windowsa i Linuxa, između preglednika te između rada online i offline. Pomoć sama utvrđuje što se odnosi na vas i prikazuje te korake. Redak na vrhu teme kaže što je odabrala, na primjer „Prikazani su koraci za Mac, Chrome ili Edge, online“.\u003C/p\u003E\n\u003Cul\u003E\u003Cli\u003EOdaberite \u003Cspan class=\"hui\"\u003EPromijeni\u003C/span\u003E u tom retku da odaberete drugo računalo ili preglednik, na primjer da pomognete kolegi.\u003C/li\u003E\u003Cli\u003EOdaberite \u003Cspan class=\"hui\"\u003EPrikaži sve\u003C/span\u003E da vidite svaku verziju svakog koraka, svaku s oznakom.\u003C/li\u003E\u003C/ul\u003E\n\u003Cp\u003EPrečaci se pišu onako kako ih označava vaša tipkovnica: \u003Ckbd class=\"hk\"\u003E\u003Cspan class=\"k-mac\" title=\"Command S\"\u003E⌘S\u003C/span\u003E\u003Cspan class=\"k-pc\"\u003ECtrl+S\u003C/span\u003E\u003C/kbd\u003E čita se kao ⌘S na Macu i Ctrl+S u Windowsima i Linuxu.\u003C/p\u003E\n\u003Ch2 id=\"ista-pomo-na-web-mjestu\"\u003EIsta pomoć na web-mjestu\u003C/h2\u003E\n\u003Cp\u003EWeb-mjesto prikazuje iste teme na getcadcraft.com/tutorials, s koracima za svaku platformu. U aplikaciji \u003Cspan class=\"hui\"\u003EOtvori na web-mjestu\u003C/span\u003E pri dnu teme otvara tu stranicu kad ste online.\u003C/p\u003E","text":"Svaka aplikacija nosi vlastitu pomoć. Dio je aplikacije, pa se otvara bez veze i uvijek opisuje verziju koju koristite. Otvorite pomoć Pritisnite F1 ili odaberite Pomoć u traci na vrhu aplikacije. Pritisnite Esc ili odaberite Zatvori da je sklonite. Vaš crtež ostaje kakav je bio. Na većini Mac tipkovnica gornji redak upravlja svjetlinom i zvukom. Pritisnite F1 zajedno s tipkom fn (ili tipkom globusa) ili koristite gumb Pomoć. Vidi Tipke na Macu. Pronađite temu Upišite u okvir za pretragu na vrhu pomoći. Rezultati se osvježavaju dok tipkate i uključuju nazive naredbi drugih programa, pa upisivanje onoga što biste upisali drugdje obično pronađe pravu stranicu. Teme su u svakoj aplikaciji grupirane na isti način: prvi koraci, vodiči korak po korak, prelazak s drugog softvera, referenca i rješavanje problema. Poveznice unutar teme otvaraju sljedeću temu u istoj ploči. Natrag vraća vas gdje ste bili. Koraci za vaše računalo Neki se koraci razlikuju između Maca, Windowsa i Linuxa, između preglednika te između rada online i offline. Pomoć sama utvrđuje što se odnosi na vas i prikazuje te korake. Redak na vrhu teme kaže što je odabrala, na primjer „Prikazani su koraci za Mac, Chrome ili Edge, online“. Odaberite Promijeni u tom retku da odaberete drugo računalo ili preglednik, na primjer da pomognete kolegi. Odaberite Prikaži sve da vidite svaku verziju svakog koraka, svaku s oznakom. Prečaci se pišu onako kako ih označava vaša tipkovnica: Ctrl+S čita se kao ⌘S na Macu i Ctrl+S u Windowsima i Linuxu. Ista pomoć na web-mjestu Web-mjesto prikazuje iste teme na getcadcraft.com/tutorials, s koracima za svaku platformu. U aplikaciji Otvori na web-mjestu pri dnu teme otvara tu stranicu kad ste online.","lang":"hr"},{"slug":"browsers","scope":"basics","title":"Preglednici i računala","summary":"U kojim se preglednicima aplikacije pokreću, po čemu se razlikuju i što vaše računalo treba.","section":"start","order":20,"keywords":["chrome","edge","firefox","safari","brave","preglednik","mac","windows","linux","ipad","tablet","webgl","zahtjevi","memorija"],"headings":[{"id":"koji-preglednik","text":"Koji preglednik","level":2},{"id":"po-emu-se-preglednici-razlikuju","text":"Po čemu se preglednici razlikuju","level":2},{"id":"mac-windows-i-linux","text":"Mac, Windows i Linux","level":2},{"id":"tableti-i-zasloni-osjetljivi-na-dodir","text":"Tableti i zasloni osjetljivi na dodir","level":2},{"id":"najstariji-preglednik-i-sustav","text":"Najstariji preglednik i sustav","level":2},{"id":"to-va-e-ra-unalo-treba","text":"Što vaše računalo treba","level":2}],"html":"\u003Cp\u003EAplikacije se pokreću u web-pregledniku. Posao obavljaju na vašem računalu: vaše se datoteke ondje otvaraju i nikad se ne šalju nama (vidi \u003Ca href=\"/tutorials/basics/your-files\" data-topic=\"basics/your-files\"\u003EKamo idu vaše datoteke\u003C/a\u003E).\u003C/p\u003E\n\u003Ch2 id=\"koji-preglednik\"\u003EKoji preglednik\u003C/h2\u003E\n\u003Cp\u003EKoristite ažurnu verziju nekog od ovih:\u003C/p\u003E\n\u003Cdiv class=\"ht-wrap\"\u003E\u003Ctable class=\"ht\"\u003E\u003Cthead\u003E\u003Ctr\u003E\u003Cth scope=\"col\"\u003EPreglednik\u003C/th\u003E\u003Cth scope=\"col\"\u003EPogon\u003C/th\u003E\u003Cth scope=\"col\"\u003ENapomene\u003C/th\u003E\u003C/tr\u003E\u003C/thead\u003E\u003Ctbody\u003E\u003Ctr\u003E\u003Ctd\u003EChrome, Edge, Brave, Opera, Vivaldi\u003C/td\u003E\u003Ctd\u003EChromium\u003C/td\u003E\u003Ctd\u003ENajpotpuniji: odabir mape, spremanje za korištenje offline, rukovanje datotekama.\u003C/td\u003E\u003C/tr\u003E\u003Ctr\u003E\u003Ctd\u003EFirefox\u003C/td\u003E\u003Ctd\u003EGecko\u003C/td\u003E\u003Ctd\u003ERadi. Otvaranje cijele mape koristi jednostavniji birač. Spremanje za offline možda ne radi u privatnim prozorima.\u003C/td\u003E\u003C/tr\u003E\u003Ctr\u003E\u003Ctd\u003ESafari\u003C/td\u003E\u003Ctd\u003EWebKit\u003C/td\u003E\u003Ctd\u003ERadi na Macu i iPadu. Otvaranje cijele mape koristi jednostavniji birač. Safari može izbrisati offline kopiju koju nekoliko tjedana niste koristili.\u003C/td\u003E\u003C/tr\u003E\u003C/tbody\u003E\u003C/table\u003E\u003C/div\u003E\n\u003Cp\u003ESva tri pogona dobro služe za svakodnevni rad. Gdje aplikacija nešto radi drukčije u jednom od njih, njezina pomoć prikazuje korake za vaš preglednik.\u003C/p\u003E\n\u003Ch2 id=\"po-emu-se-preglednici-razlikuju\"\u003EPo čemu se preglednici razlikuju\u003C/h2\u003E\n\u003Cul\u003E\u003Cli\u003E\u003Cstrong\u003EOtvaranje mape.\u003C/strong\u003E Chromium preglednici prikazuju pravi birač mapa i mogu izravno čitati mapu. Firefox i Safari traže da odaberete mapu, a zatim čitaju svaku datoteku u njoj, što traje dulje za velike projektne mape; povlačenje mape na aplikaciju radi u sva tri.\u003C/li\u003E\u003Cli\u003E\u003Cstrong\u003ESpremanje.\u003C/strong\u003E Aplikacije spremaju preuzimanjem datoteke. Vaš preglednik odlučuje kamo idu preuzimanja i pita li prethodno.\u003C/li\u003E\u003C/ul\u003E\n\u003Cdiv class=\"hv\" data-v=\"browser:chromium\"\u003E\u003Cp class=\"hv-label\"\u003EChrome or Edge\u003C/p\u003E\n\u003Cp\u003EU Chromeu ili Edgeu uključite „Pitaj gdje spremiti svaku datoteku prije preuzimanja“ (u Postavkama, pod Preuzimanja) da svaki put odaberete mapu.\u003C/p\u003E\n\u003C/div\u003E\n\u003Cdiv class=\"hv\" data-v=\"browser:firefox\"\u003E\u003Cp class=\"hv-label\"\u003EFirefox\u003C/p\u003E\n\u003Cp\u003EU Firefoxu otvorite Postavke, zatim Općenito, zatim Preuzimanja i odaberite „Uvijek pitaj gdje spremiti datoteke“ da svaki put odaberete mapu.\u003C/p\u003E\n\u003C/div\u003E\n\u003Cdiv class=\"hv\" data-v=\"browser:safari\"\u003E\u003Cp class=\"hv-label\"\u003ESafari\u003C/p\u003E\n\u003Cp\u003EU Safariju otvorite Postavke, zatim Općenito i postavite „Lokacija preuzetih datoteka“ na „Pitaj za svako preuzimanje“ da svaki put odaberete mapu.\u003C/p\u003E\n\u003C/div\u003E\n\u003Ch2 id=\"mac-windows-i-linux\"\u003EMac, Windows i Linux\u003C/h2\u003E\n\u003Cp\u003EAplikacije su iste na svakom računalu. Mijenja se tipkovnica: prečaci se automatski pišu za vaše računalo. Vidi \u003Ca href=\"/tutorials/basics/keys\" data-topic=\"basics/keys\"\u003ETipke, miševi i trackpadovi\u003C/a\u003E.\u003C/p\u003E\n\u003Ch2 id=\"tableti-i-zasloni-osjetljivi-na-dodir\"\u003ETableti i zasloni osjetljivi na dodir\u003C/h2\u003E\n\u003Cp\u003ENeke aplikacije prihvaćaju dodir (jedan prst crta ili odabire, dva prsta štipanjem zumiraju i pomiču prikaz). Pomoć svake aplikacije kaže radi li to. Na iPadu koristite Safari ili Chrome. Tipkovnica pomaže kod aplikacija koje koriste upisane naredbe.\u003C/p\u003E\n\u003Ch2 id=\"najstariji-preglednik-i-sustav\"\u003ENajstariji preglednik i sustav\u003C/h2\u003E\n\u003Cp\u003EOvo smo pročitali iz koda aplikacija 0.7, ne pogodili: svaka je datoteka raščlanjena, a svaka jezična značajka koju koristi potražena je u objavljenim podacima o kompatibilnosti preglednika. Ispod ovih verzija aplikacije se ne mogu ni pokrenuti jer preglednik ne razumije kod.\u003C/p\u003E\n\u003Cdiv class=\"ht-wrap\"\u003E\u003Ctable class=\"ht\"\u003E\u003Cthead\u003E\u003Ctr\u003E\u003Cth scope=\"col\"\u003E\u003C/th\u003E\u003Cth scope=\"col\"\u003ENajstarija verzija koja može pokrenuti aplikacije\u003C/th\u003E\u003C/tr\u003E\u003C/thead\u003E\u003Ctbody\u003E\u003Ctr\u003E\u003Ctd\u003EChrome, Edge, Brave, Opera, Vivaldi\u003C/td\u003E\u003Ctd\u003EChromium 94\u003C/td\u003E\u003C/tr\u003E\u003Ctr\u003E\u003Ctd\u003EFirefox\u003C/td\u003E\u003Ctd\u003E93\u003C/td\u003E\u003C/tr\u003E\u003Ctr\u003E\u003Ctd\u003ESafari (Mac, iPad, iPhone)\u003C/td\u003E\u003Ctd\u003E16.4 (macOS 13.3, iPadOS i iOS 16.4)\u003C/td\u003E\u003C/tr\u003E\u003C/tbody\u003E\u003C/table\u003E\u003C/div\u003E\n\u003Cp\u003ECadCraft Studio na Windowsima nosi vlastiti web-pogon, pa treba Windows 10 ili 11; na Macu koristi sistemski, pa treba macOS 13.3 ili noviji. Postavke › Ažuriranja u Studiju pokazuju na čemu radi vaša kopija.\u003C/p\u003E\n\u003Cp\u003EOvo je najstarija verzija koja \u003Cem\u003Ese pokreće\u003C/em\u003E, pročitana iz koda. Nije popis starih preglednika u kojima smo pokretali aplikacije, pa starijem koji se pokrene i dalje može nedostajati neka značajka.\u003C/p\u003E\n\u003Ch2 id=\"to-va-e-ra-unalo-treba\"\u003EŠto vaše računalo treba\u003C/h2\u003E\n\u003Cp\u003EOvo su planirani minimumi za aplikacije, a ne izmjereni zahtjevi:\u003C/p\u003E\n\u003Cul\u003E\u003Cli\u003E8 GB memorije (16 GB preporučuje se za velike federirane modele).\u003C/li\u003E\u003Cli\u003EGrafički čip s WebGL 2 za 3D aplikacije. Ako 3D prikaz ostane prazan, provjerite je li hardversko ubrzanje uključeno u postavkama preglednika.\u003C/li\u003E\u003Cli\u003EZaslon širok najmanje 1280 piksela za pune alatne trake; manji zasloni prelamaju ih u više redaka.\u003C/li\u003E\u003C/ul\u003E\n\u003Cp\u003EVrlo velike datoteke (veliki skupovi planova, veliki modeli) troše mnogo memorije u kartici preglednika. Zatvorite druge teške kartice ako se aplikacija uspori.\u003C/p\u003E","text":"Aplikacije se pokreću u web-pregledniku. Posao obavljaju na vašem računalu: vaše se datoteke ondje otvaraju i nikad se ne šalju nama (vidi Kamo idu vaše datoteke). Koji preglednik Koristite ažurnu verziju nekog od ovih: Preglednik Pogon Napomene Chrome, Edge, Brave, Opera, Vivaldi Chromium Najpotpuniji: odabir mape, spremanje za korištenje offline, rukovanje datotekama. Firefox Gecko Radi. Otvaranje cijele mape koristi jednostavniji birač. Spremanje za offline možda ne radi u privatnim prozorima. Safari WebKit Radi na Macu i iPadu. Otvaranje cijele mape koristi jednostavniji birač. Safari može izbrisati offline kopiju koju nekoliko tjedana niste koristili. Sva tri pogona dobro služe za svakodnevni rad. Gdje aplikacija nešto radi drukčije u jednom od njih, njezina pomoć prikazuje korake za vaš preglednik. Po čemu se preglednici razlikuju Otvaranje mape. Chromium preglednici prikazuju pravi birač mapa i mogu izravno čitati mapu. Firefox i Safari traže da odaberete mapu, a zatim čitaju svaku datoteku u njoj, što traje dulje za velike projektne mape; povlačenje mape na aplikaciju radi u sva tri. Spremanje. Aplikacije spremaju preuzimanjem datoteke. Vaš preglednik odlučuje kamo idu preuzimanja i pita li prethodno. U Chromeu ili Edgeu uključite „Pitaj gdje spremiti svaku datoteku prije preuzimanja“ (u Postavkama, pod Preuzimanja) da svaki put odaberete mapu. U Firefoxu otvorite Postavke, zatim Općenito, zatim Preuzimanja i odaberite „Uvijek pitaj gdje spremiti datoteke“ da svaki put odaberete mapu. U Safariju otvorite Postavke, zatim Općenito i postavite „Lokacija preuzetih datoteka“ na „Pitaj za svako preuzimanje“ da svaki put odaberete mapu. Mac, Windows i Linux Aplikacije su iste na svakom računalu. Mijenja se tipkovnica: prečaci se automatski pišu za vaše računalo. Vidi Tipke, miševi i trackpadovi. Tableti i zasloni osjetljivi na dodir Neke aplikacije prihvaćaju dodir (jedan prst crta ili odabire, dva prsta štipanjem zumiraju i pomiču prikaz). Pomoć svake aplikacije kaže radi li to. Na iPadu koristite Safari ili Chrome. Tipkovnica pomaže kod aplikacija koje koriste upisane naredbe. Najstariji preglednik i sustav Ovo smo pročitali iz koda aplikacija 0.7, ne pogodili: svaka je datoteka raščlanjena, a svaka jezična značajka koju koristi potražena je u objavljenim podacima o kompatibilnosti preglednika. Ispod ovih verzija aplikacije se ne mogu ni pokrenuti jer preglednik ne razumije kod. Najstarija verzija koja može pokrenuti aplikacije Chrome, Edge, Brave, Opera, Vivaldi Chromium 94 Firefox 93 Safari (Mac, iPad, iPhone) 16.4 (macOS 13.3, iPadOS i iOS 16.4) CadCraft Studio na Windowsima nosi vlastiti web-pogon, pa treba Windows 10 ili 11; na Macu koristi sistemski, pa treba macOS 13.3 ili noviji. Postavke › Ažuriranja u Studiju pokazuju na čemu radi vaša kopija. Ovo je najstarija verzija koja se pokreće, pročitana iz koda. Nije popis starih preglednika u kojima smo pokretali aplikacije, pa starijem koji se pokrene i dalje može nedostajati neka značajka. Što vaše računalo treba Ovo su planirani minimumi za aplikacije, a ne izmjereni zahtjevi: 8 GB memorije (16 GB preporučuje se za velike federirane modele). Grafički čip s WebGL 2 za 3D aplikacije. Ako 3D prikaz ostane prazan, provjerite je li hardversko ubrzanje uključeno u postavkama preglednika. Zaslon širok najmanje 1280 piksela za pune alatne trake; manji zasloni prelamaju ih u više redaka. Vrlo velike datoteke (veliki skupovi planova, veliki modeli) troše mnogo memorije u kartici preglednika. Zatvorite druge teške kartice ako se aplikacija uspori.","lang":"hr"},{"slug":"keys","scope":"basics","title":"Tipke, miševi i trackpadovi","summary":"Kako se pišu prečaci, funkcijske tipke na Macu, desni klik i pomicanje prikaza bez miša.","section":"start","order":30,"keywords":["tipkovnica","prečac","ctrl","command","cmd","option","fn","funkcijske tipke","trackpad","desni klik","srednja tipka","magic mouse"],"headings":[{"id":"kako-se-pi-u-pre-aci","text":"Kako se pišu prečaci","level":2},{"id":"funkcijske-tipke-na-macu","text":"Funkcijske tipke na Macu","level":2},{"id":"pre-aci-koje-zadr-ava-preglednik","text":"Prečaci koje zadržava preglednik","level":2},{"id":"tipke-mi-a-na-trackpadu","text":"Tipke miša na trackpadu","level":2},{"id":"tipkanje-u-tekstnom-polju","text":"Tipkanje u tekstnom polju","level":2}],"html":"\u003Ch2 id=\"kako-se-pi-u-pre-aci\"\u003EKako se pišu prečaci\u003C/h2\u003E\n\u003Cp\u003EPomoć piše svaki prečac onako kako ga označava vaša tipkovnica.\u003C/p\u003E\n\u003Cdiv class=\"ht-wrap\"\u003E\u003Ctable class=\"ht\"\u003E\u003Cthead\u003E\u003Ctr\u003E\u003Cth scope=\"col\"\u003ENapisano\u003C/th\u003E\u003Cth scope=\"col\"\u003ENa Macu\u003C/th\u003E\u003Cth scope=\"col\"\u003EU Windowsima i Linuxu\u003C/th\u003E\u003C/tr\u003E\u003C/thead\u003E\u003Ctbody\u003E\u003Ctr\u003E\u003Ctd\u003E\u003Ckbd class=\"hk\"\u003E\u003Cspan class=\"k-mac\" title=\"Command S\"\u003E⌘S\u003C/span\u003E\u003Cspan class=\"k-pc\"\u003ECtrl+S\u003C/span\u003E\u003C/kbd\u003E\u003C/td\u003E\u003Ctd\u003ECommand (⌘) i S\u003C/td\u003E\u003Ctd\u003ECtrl i S\u003C/td\u003E\u003C/tr\u003E\u003Ctr\u003E\u003Ctd\u003E\u003Ckbd class=\"hk\"\u003E\u003Cspan class=\"k-mac\" title=\"Control Shift F\"\u003E⌃⇧F\u003C/span\u003E\u003Cspan class=\"k-pc\"\u003ECtrl+Shift+F\u003C/span\u003E\u003C/kbd\u003E\u003C/td\u003E\u003Ctd\u003EControl (⌃), Shift (⇧) i F\u003C/td\u003E\u003Ctd\u003ECtrl, Shift i F\u003C/td\u003E\u003C/tr\u003E\u003Ctr\u003E\u003Ctd\u003E\u003Ckbd class=\"hk\"\u003E\u003Cspan class=\"k-mac\" title=\"Option ←\"\u003E⌥←\u003C/span\u003E\u003Cspan class=\"k-pc\"\u003EAlt+←\u003C/span\u003E\u003C/kbd\u003E\u003C/td\u003E\u003Ctd\u003EOption (⌥) i ←\u003C/td\u003E\u003Ctd\u003EAlt i ←\u003C/td\u003E\u003C/tr\u003E\u003Ctr\u003E\u003Ctd\u003E\u003Ckbd class=\"hk\"\u003E\u003Cspan class=\"k-mac\" title=\"Delete\"\u003EDelete\u003C/span\u003E\u003Cspan class=\"k-pc\"\u003EBackspace\u003C/span\u003E\u003C/kbd\u003E\u003C/td\u003E\u003Ctd\u003Etipka Delete\u003C/td\u003E\u003Ctd\u003EBackspace\u003C/td\u003E\u003C/tr\u003E\u003Ctr\u003E\u003Ctd\u003E\u003Ckbd class=\"hk\"\u003E\u003Cspan class=\"k-mac\" title=\"fn Delete\"\u003Efn Delete\u003C/span\u003E\u003Cspan class=\"k-pc\"\u003EDelete\u003C/span\u003E\u003C/kbd\u003E\u003C/td\u003E\u003Ctd\u003Efn i Delete (brisanje unaprijed)\u003C/td\u003E\u003Ctd\u003EDelete\u003C/td\u003E\u003C/tr\u003E\u003Ctr\u003E\u003Ctd\u003E\u003Ckbd class=\"hk\"\u003E\u003Cspan class=\"k-mac\" title=\"Return\"\u003EReturn\u003C/span\u003E\u003Cspan class=\"k-pc\"\u003EEnter\u003C/span\u003E\u003C/kbd\u003E\u003C/td\u003E\u003Ctd\u003EReturn\u003C/td\u003E\u003Ctd\u003EEnter\u003C/td\u003E\u003C/tr\u003E\u003C/tbody\u003E\u003C/table\u003E\u003C/div\u003E\n\u003Cp\u003EZnak plus znači da tipke držite zajedno. „Zatim“ znači da pritišćete jednu za drugom.\u003C/p\u003E\n\u003Cp\u003EVećina prečaca u aplikacijama na Macu prihvaća Command ili Control, pa \u003Ckbd class=\"hk\"\u003E\u003Cspan class=\"k-mac\" title=\"Command Z\"\u003E⌘Z\u003C/span\u003E\u003Cspan class=\"k-pc\"\u003ECtrl+Z\u003C/span\u003E\u003C/kbd\u003E radi na oba načina. Nekoliko njih, na primjer cijeli zaslon (\u003Ckbd class=\"hk\"\u003E\u003Cspan class=\"k-mac\" title=\"Control Shift F\"\u003E⌃⇧F\u003C/span\u003E\u003Cspan class=\"k-pc\"\u003ECtrl+Shift+F\u003C/span\u003E\u003C/kbd\u003E), koristi tipku Control na svakom računalu; pomoć to kaže gdje se odnosi.\u003C/p\u003E\n\u003Ch2 id=\"funkcijske-tipke-na-macu\"\u003EFunkcijske tipke na Macu\u003C/h2\u003E\n\u003Cp\u003ENa većini Mac tipkovnica gornji redak mijenja svjetlinu, glasnoću i medije. Da pošaljete F1 do F12:\u003C/p\u003E\n\u003Cul\u003E\u003Cli\u003Edržite \u003Cstrong\u003Efn\u003C/strong\u003E (ili tipku globusa) dok pritišćete tipku, ili\u003C/li\u003E\u003Cli\u003Eotvorite \u003Cstrong\u003EPostavke sustava\u003C/strong\u003E, zatim \u003Cstrong\u003ETipkovnica\u003C/strong\u003E, zatim \u003Cstrong\u003ETipkovnički prečaci\u003C/strong\u003E, zatim \u003Cstrong\u003EFunkcijske tipke\u003C/strong\u003E i uključite „Koristi tipke F1, F2 itd. kao standardne funkcijske tipke“.\u003C/li\u003E\u003C/ul\u003E\n\u003Cp\u003ENeke F-tipke zauzima i sam macOS (na primjer Mission Control). Ako tipka ne radi ništa u aplikaciji, pokušajte je s fn ili umjesto toga koristite gumb u alatnoj traci.\u003C/p\u003E\n\u003Ch2 id=\"pre-aci-koje-zadr-ava-preglednik\"\u003EPrečaci koje zadržava preglednik\u003C/h2\u003E\n\u003Cp\u003EWeb-stranica ne može preuzeti neke prečace od preglednika, što god radila. U svim aplikacijama:\u003C/p\u003E\n\u003Cul\u003E\u003Cli\u003E\u003Ckbd class=\"hk\"\u003E\u003Cspan class=\"k-mac\" title=\"Command N\"\u003E⌘N\u003C/span\u003E\u003Cspan class=\"k-pc\"\u003ECtrl+N\u003C/span\u003E\u003C/kbd\u003E, \u003Ckbd class=\"hk\"\u003E\u003Cspan class=\"k-mac\" title=\"Command T\"\u003E⌘T\u003C/span\u003E\u003Cspan class=\"k-pc\"\u003ECtrl+T\u003C/span\u003E\u003C/kbd\u003E i \u003Ckbd class=\"hk\"\u003E\u003Cspan class=\"k-mac\" title=\"Command W\"\u003E⌘W\u003C/span\u003E\u003Cspan class=\"k-pc\"\u003ECtrl+W\u003C/span\u003E\u003C/kbd\u003E uvijek otvaraju ili zatvaraju prozore i kartice preglednika. Aplikacije umjesto toga koriste gumbe za Novo i Zatvori.\u003C/li\u003E\u003Cli\u003E\u003Ckbd class=\"hk\"\u003E\u003Cspan class=\"k-mac\" title=\"Command Q\"\u003E⌘Q\u003C/span\u003E\u003Cspan class=\"k-pc\"\u003ECtrl+Q\u003C/span\u003E\u003C/kbd\u003E na Macu i \u003Ckbd class=\"hk\"\u003E\u003Cspan class=\"k-mac\" title=\"Option F4\"\u003E⌥ F4\u003C/span\u003E\u003Cspan class=\"k-pc\"\u003EAlt+F4\u003C/span\u003E\u003C/kbd\u003E u Windowsima zatvaraju preglednik. Ako imate nespremljen rad, preglednik prvo pita („Napustiti web-mjesto?“); odaberite da ostanete, pa spremite.\u003C/li\u003E\u003Cli\u003EVlastiti cijeli zaslon preglednika (\u003Cspan class=\"hp\"\u003E\u003Cspan class=\"hpv\" data-v=\"os:mac\" title=\"Mac\"\u003EControl-Command-F, or the green button on the window\u003C/span\u003E\u003Cspan class=\"hp-sep\"\u003E / \u003C/span\u003E\u003Cspan class=\"hpv\" data-v=\"os:windows,linux\" title=\"Windows or Linux\"\u003EF11\u003C/span\u003E\u003C/span\u003E) i dalje radi. Aplikacije imaju i vlastite načine prikaza na zaslonu na \u003Ckbd class=\"hk\"\u003E\u003Cspan class=\"k-mac\" title=\"Control Shift F\"\u003E⌃⇧F\u003C/span\u003E\u003Cspan class=\"k-pc\"\u003ECtrl+Shift+F\u003C/span\u003E\u003C/kbd\u003E, koji mogu sakriti i trake aplikacije.\u003C/li\u003E\u003C/ul\u003E\n\u003Ch2 id=\"tipke-mi-a-na-trackpadu\"\u003ETipke miša na trackpadu\u003C/h2\u003E\n\u003Cp\u003EAplikacije koriste desnu i srednju tipku. Bez miša s tri tipke:\u003C/p\u003E\n\u003Cdiv class=\"hv\" data-v=\"os:mac\"\u003E\u003Cp class=\"hv-label\"\u003EMac\u003C/p\u003E\n\u003Cul\u003E\u003Cli\u003E\u003Cstrong\u003EDesni klik:\u003C/strong\u003E kliknite s dva prsta. Uključite „Sekundarni klik“ u \u003Cstrong\u003EPostavkama sustava\u003C/strong\u003E, zatim \u003Cstrong\u003ETrackpad\u003C/strong\u003E, ako klik s dva prsta ne radi ništa. Držanje \u003Ckbd class=\"hk\"\u003E\u003Cspan class=\"k-mac\" title=\"Control\"\u003E⌃\u003C/span\u003E\u003Cspan class=\"k-pc\"\u003ECtrl\u003C/span\u003E\u003C/kbd\u003E pri kliku otvara izbornik preglednika, ali unutar crteža neke ga aplikacije čitaju kao običan klik (s pritisnutim Controlom), pa radije koristite klik s dva prsta.\u003C/li\u003E\u003Cli\u003E\u003Cstrong\u003EPovlačenje srednjom tipkom (pomicanje prikaza):\u003C/strong\u003E svaka aplikacija nudi drugi način za pomicanje prikaza, na primjer držanje \u003Ckbd class=\"hk\"\u003E\u003Cspan class=\"k-mac\" title=\"Space\"\u003ESpace\u003C/span\u003E\u003Cspan class=\"k-pc\"\u003ESpace\u003C/span\u003E\u003C/kbd\u003E dok povlačite ili povlačenje desnom tipkom. Stranica aplikacije o tipkovnici kaže koji.\u003C/li\u003E\u003Cli\u003E\u003Cstrong\u003EZumiranje kotačićem:\u003C/strong\u003E pomicanje s dva prsta po trackpadu zumira u većini aplikacija. Štipanje također zumira gdje to aplikacija podržava.\u003C/li\u003E\u003C/ul\u003E\n\u003C/div\u003E\n\u003Cdiv class=\"hv\" data-v=\"os:windows,linux\"\u003E\u003Cp class=\"hv-label\"\u003EWindows or Linux\u003C/p\u003E\n\u003Cul\u003E\u003Cli\u003E\u003Cstrong\u003EDesni klik:\u003C/strong\u003E kliknite s dva prsta ili kliknite donji desni kut touchpada. To ovisi o postavkama vašeg touchpada.\u003C/li\u003E\u003Cli\u003E\u003Cstrong\u003EPovlačenje srednjom tipkom (pomicanje prikaza):\u003C/strong\u003E svaka aplikacija nudi drugi način za pomicanje prikaza, na primjer držanje \u003Ckbd class=\"hk\"\u003E\u003Cspan class=\"k-mac\" title=\"Space\"\u003ESpace\u003C/span\u003E\u003Cspan class=\"k-pc\"\u003ESpace\u003C/span\u003E\u003C/kbd\u003E dok povlačite ili povlačenje desnom tipkom. Stranica aplikacije o tipkovnici kaže koji.\u003C/li\u003E\u003Cli\u003E\u003Cstrong\u003EZumiranje kotačićem:\u003C/strong\u003E pomicanje s dva prsta po touchpadu zumira u većini aplikacija.\u003C/li\u003E\u003C/ul\u003E\n\u003C/div\u003E\n\u003Ch2 id=\"tipkanje-u-tekstnom-polju\"\u003ETipkanje u tekstnom polju\u003C/h2\u003E\n\u003Cp\u003EDok tipkate u polje (naziv, bilješku, pretragu), jednoslovni prečaci aplikacije su isključeni, pa tipkanje „L“ upisuje slovo L. Pritisnite \u003Ckbd class=\"hk\"\u003E\u003Cspan class=\"k-mac\" title=\"Esc\"\u003EEsc\u003C/span\u003E\u003Cspan class=\"k-pc\"\u003EEsc\u003C/span\u003E\u003C/kbd\u003E ili kliknite crtež da tipke vratite aplikaciji.\u003C/p\u003E","text":"Kako se pišu prečaci Pomoć piše svaki prečac onako kako ga označava vaša tipkovnica. Napisano Na Macu U Windowsima i Linuxu Ctrl+S Command (⌘) i S Ctrl i S Ctrl+Shift+F Control (⌃), Shift (⇧) i F Ctrl, Shift i F Alt+← Option (⌥) i ← Alt i ← Backspace tipka Delete Backspace Delete fn i Delete (brisanje unaprijed) Delete Enter Return Enter Znak plus znači da tipke držite zajedno. „Zatim“ znači da pritišćete jednu za drugom. Većina prečaca u aplikacijama na Macu prihvaća Command ili Control, pa Ctrl+Z radi na oba načina. Nekoliko njih, na primjer cijeli zaslon (Ctrl+Shift+F), koristi tipku Control na svakom računalu; pomoć to kaže gdje se odnosi. Funkcijske tipke na Macu Na većini Mac tipkovnica gornji redak mijenja svjetlinu, glasnoću i medije. Da pošaljete F1 do F12: držite fn (ili tipku globusa) dok pritišćete tipku, ili otvorite Postavke sustava, zatim Tipkovnica, zatim Tipkovnički prečaci, zatim Funkcijske tipke i uključite „Koristi tipke F1, F2 itd. kao standardne funkcijske tipke“. Neke F-tipke zauzima i sam macOS (na primjer Mission Control). Ako tipka ne radi ništa u aplikaciji, pokušajte je s fn ili umjesto toga koristite gumb u alatnoj traci. Prečaci koje zadržava preglednik Web-stranica ne može preuzeti neke prečace od preglednika, što god radila. U svim aplikacijama: Ctrl+N, Ctrl+T i Ctrl+W uvijek otvaraju ili zatvaraju prozore i kartice preglednika. Aplikacije umjesto toga koriste gumbe za Novo i Zatvori. Ctrl+Q na Macu i Alt+F4 u Windowsima zatvaraju preglednik. Ako imate nespremljen rad, preglednik prvo pita („Napustiti web-mjesto?“); odaberite da ostanete, pa spremite. Vlastiti cijeli zaslon preglednika (Control-Command-F, or the green button on the window / F11) i dalje radi. Aplikacije imaju i vlastite načine prikaza na zaslonu na Ctrl+Shift+F, koji mogu sakriti i trake aplikacije. Tipke miša na trackpadu Aplikacije koriste desnu i srednju tipku. Bez miša s tri tipke: Desni klik: kliknite s dva prsta. Uključite „Sekundarni klik“ u Postavkama sustava, zatim Trackpad, ako klik s dva prsta ne radi ništa. Držanje Ctrl pri kliku otvara izbornik preglednika, ali unutar crteža neke ga aplikacije čitaju kao običan klik (s pritisnutim Controlom), pa radije koristite klik s dva prsta. Povlačenje srednjom tipkom (pomicanje prikaza): svaka aplikacija nudi drugi način za pomicanje prikaza, na primjer držanje Space dok povlačite ili povlačenje desnom tipkom. Stranica aplikacije o tipkovnici kaže koji. Zumiranje kotačićem: pomicanje s dva prsta po trackpadu zumira u većini aplikacija. Štipanje također zumira gdje to aplikacija podržava. Desni klik: kliknite s dva prsta ili kliknite donji desni kut touchpada. To ovisi o postavkama vašeg touchpada. Povlačenje srednjom tipkom (pomicanje prikaza): svaka aplikacija nudi drugi način za pomicanje prikaza, na primjer držanje Space dok povlačite ili povlačenje desnom tipkom. Stranica aplikacije o tipkovnici kaže koji. Zumiranje kotačićem: pomicanje s dva prsta po touchpadu zumira u većini aplikacija. Tipkanje u tekstnom polju Dok tipkate u polje (naziv, bilješku, pretragu), jednoslovni prečaci aplikacije su isključeni, pa tipkanje „L“ upisuje slovo L. Pritisnite Esc ili kliknite crtež da tipke vratite aplikaciji.","lang":"hr"},{"slug":"find-tools","scope":"basics","title":"Pronađite alat ili postavku","summary":"Pritisnite Ctrl+K i upišite nekoliko slova da pokrenete bilo koji alat, promijenite postavku ili otvorite temu pomoći.","section":"start","order":32,"keywords":["pronađi","pretraga","paleta naredbi","brzo otvaranje","pokreni naredbu","ctrl k","cmd k","alat","postavka","prečac"],"headings":[{"id":"prona-ite-i-pokrenite","text":"Pronađite i pokrenite","level":2},{"id":"dobro-je-znati","text":"Dobro je znati","level":2}],"html":"\u003Cp\u003ESvaka aplikacija ima okvir za pretragu svojih alata, postavki i ove pomoći. Ne morate znati gdje se alat nalazi u alatnoj traci.\u003C/p\u003E\n\u003Ch2 id=\"prona-ite-i-pokrenite\"\u003EPronađite i pokrenite\u003C/h2\u003E\n\u003Col\u003E\u003Cli\u003EPritisnite \u003Ckbd class=\"hk\"\u003E\u003Cspan class=\"k-mac\" title=\"Command K\"\u003E⌘K\u003C/span\u003E\u003Cspan class=\"k-pc\"\u003ECtrl+K\u003C/span\u003E\u003C/kbd\u003E ili odaberite \u003Cspan class=\"hui\"\u003EPronađi\u003C/span\u003E u traci na vrhu.\u003C/li\u003E\u003Cli\u003EUpišite nekoliko slova onoga što želite: „zaobli“, „tekst ploče“, „jedinice“. Svaka upisana riječ mora odgovarati, pa dodajte drugu riječ da suzite popis.\u003C/li\u003E\u003Cli\u003EPritisnite \u003Ckbd class=\"hk\"\u003E\u003Cspan class=\"k-mac\" title=\"Return\"\u003EReturn\u003C/span\u003E\u003Cspan class=\"k-pc\"\u003EEnter\u003C/span\u003E\u003C/kbd\u003E da pokrenete prvi pogodak ili se prije toga krećite strelicama. \u003Ckbd class=\"hk\"\u003E\u003Cspan class=\"k-mac\" title=\"Esc\"\u003EEsc\u003C/span\u003E\u003Cspan class=\"k-pc\"\u003EEsc\u003C/span\u003E\u003C/kbd\u003E zatvara okvir.\u003C/li\u003E\u003C/ol\u003E\n\u003Cp\u003EAlat se pokreće kao da ste ga kliknuli u alatnoj traci. Postavka otvara \u003Cspan class=\"hui\"\u003EPostavke\u003C/span\u003E na toj postavci. Tema pomoći otvara se ovdje, u ploči pomoći.\u003C/p\u003E\n\u003Ch2 id=\"dobro-je-znati\"\u003EDobro je znati\u003C/h2\u003E\n\u003Cul\u003E\u003Cli\u003EOno što ste zadnje koristili idući je put na vrhu, pa je alat koji često koristite udaljen jedan pritisak tipke.\u003C/li\u003E\u003Cli\u003EAlati koji se trenutačno ne mogu pokrenuti, na primjer prije otvaranja datoteke, nalaze se na popisu, ali su zasivljeni.\u003C/li\u003E\u003Cli\u003EAlati iz dodataka također su na popisu, čim se dodatak uključi.\u003C/li\u003E\u003C/ul\u003E","text":"Svaka aplikacija ima okvir za pretragu svojih alata, postavki i ove pomoći. Ne morate znati gdje se alat nalazi u alatnoj traci. Pronađite i pokrenite Pritisnite Ctrl+K ili odaberite Pronađi u traci na vrhu. Upišite nekoliko slova onoga što želite: „zaobli“, „tekst ploče“, „jedinice“. Svaka upisana riječ mora odgovarati, pa dodajte drugu riječ da suzite popis. Pritisnite Enter da pokrenete prvi pogodak ili se prije toga krećite strelicama. Esc zatvara okvir. Alat se pokreće kao da ste ga kliknuli u alatnoj traci. Postavka otvara Postavke na toj postavci. Tema pomoći otvara se ovdje, u ploči pomoći. Dobro je znati Ono što ste zadnje koristili idući je put na vrhu, pa je alat koji često koristite udaljen jedan pritisak tipke. Alati koji se trenutačno ne mogu pokrenuti, na primjer prije otvaranja datoteke, nalaze se na popisu, ali su zasivljeni. Alati iz dodataka također su na popisu, čim se dodatak uključi.","lang":"hr"},{"slug":"arrange-panels","scope":"basics","title":"Raspored ploča i drugi monitor","summary":"Usidrite bočne ploče lijevo, desno ili na dnu, složite ih, grupirajte kao kartice, prikvačite ili sakrijte, odvojite ih iznad crteža, zgusnite raspored, odaberite broj redaka alatne trake ili ih premjestite u vlastiti prozor na drugom zaslonu.","section":"start","order":35,"keywords":["ploče","usidri","odvoji","premjesti ploču","povuci","raspored","kartice","skupina kartica","slaganje","prikvači","automatsko skrivanje","sakrij","zatvori ploču","zbijeno","gustoća rasporeda","gusto","redci alatne trake","prelomi","1 redak","2 retka","drugi monitor","dva zaslona","dvostruki monitor","više monitora","prozor","skočni prozor","vrati raspored na zadano"],"headings":[{"id":"premjesti-plo-u-u-prozoru","text":"Premjesti ploču u prozoru","level":2},{"id":"grupiraj-plo-e-kao-kartice","text":"Grupiraj ploče kao kartice","level":2},{"id":"prikva-i-sakrij-i-vrati","text":"Prikvači, sakrij i vrati","level":2},{"id":"zgusnite-raspored","text":"Zgusnite raspored","level":2},{"id":"odaberite-broj-redaka-alatne-trake","text":"Odaberite broj redaka alatne trake","level":2},{"id":"koristite-tipkovnicu","text":"Koristite tipkovnicu","level":2},{"id":"stavite-plo-e-na-drugi-monitor","text":"Stavite ploče na drugi monitor","level":2},{"id":"vi-e-prozora-s-plo-ama","text":"Više prozora s pločama","level":2},{"id":"isto-za-svaki-dio-rasporeda","text":"Isto za svaki dio rasporeda","level":2},{"id":"premjestite-dijalo-ki-okvir","text":"Premjestite dijaloški okvir","level":2},{"id":"vratite-plo-e","text":"Vratite ploče","level":2}],"html":"\u003Cp\u003EPloče uz crtež mogu se premještati. Postavite ih gdje vam odgovara ili im dajte vlastiti prozor na drugom monitoru da crtež dobije cijeli prvi.\u003C/p\u003E\n\u003Caside class=\"hc hc-note\"\u003E\u003Cp class=\"hc-label\"\u003ENote\u003C/p\u003E\n\u003Cp\u003ESvaka ploča ima naslovnu traku: tanku traku s nazivom ploče, izbornikom \u003Cspan class=\"hui\"\u003E⋯\u003C/span\u003E, gumbom za prikvačivanje i gumbom za zatvaranje na vrhu ploče. Verzije prije 0.7 imaju samo naziv i izbornik \u003Cspan class=\"hui\"\u003E⋯\u003C/span\u003E.\u003C/p\u003E\n\u003C/aside\u003E\n\u003Ch2 id=\"premjesti-plo-u-u-prozoru\"\u003EPremjesti ploču u prozoru\u003C/h2\u003E\n\u003Col\u003E\u003Cli\u003EPovucite ploču za njezin naziv na vrhu.\u003C/li\u003E\u003Cli\u003EDok povlačite, na lijevoj, desnoj i donjoj strani crteža pojavljuju se označena područja. Ispustite ploču na jedno od njih da se usidri ondje. Područje nad kojim se nalazite potamni.\u003C/li\u003E\u003Cli\u003EIspustite je bilo gdje drugdje iznad crteža da postane plutajuća.\u003C/li\u003E\u003C/ol\u003E\n\u003Cp\u003EPloče mogu dijeliti jednu stranu: slažu se jedna iznad druge, a svaka linija između dviju ploča povlači se da podijeli prostor (kad je linija u fokusu, tipke sa strelicama je pomiču, a dvostruki klik na nju podijeli prostor ravnomjerno). Povucite unutarnji rub usidrene strane da je učinite širom ili užom; dvostruki klik na rub vraća ga na zadano.\u003C/p\u003E\n\u003Cp\u003EPlutajuća ploča ostaje iznad crteža. Pomičite je za naziv, a mijenjate joj veličinu povlačenjem donjeg desnog kuta (ili tabulatorom dođite do kuta i koristite tipke sa strelicama). Dvostruki klik na naziv usidruje je ponovo tamo gdje je bila.\u003C/p\u003E\n\u003Cdiv class=\"hv\" data-v=\"input:touch\"\u003E\u003Cp class=\"hv-label\"\u003ETouch\u003C/p\u003E\n\u003Cp\u003EPovucite jednim prstom za naziv ploče. Donji desni kut plutajuće ploče povucite jednim prstom da joj promijenite veličinu, kao i rubove između usidrenih ploča. Za odvajanje ili usidrivanje bez povlačenja koristite izbornik \u003Cspan class=\"hui\"\u003E⋯\u003C/span\u003E.\u003C/p\u003E\n\u003C/div\u003E\n\u003Ch2 id=\"grupiraj-plo-e-kao-kartice\"\u003EGrupiraj ploče kao kartice\u003C/h2\u003E\n\u003Cp\u003EDvije ploče mogu dijeliti jedan okvir i prikazivati jednu po jednu. Povucite ploču za njezin naziv na naslovnu traku druge ploče (traka je označena dok ste iznad nje) i pustite: okvir sada ima karticu za svaku ploču, u svojoj naslovnoj traci. Kliknite karticu da prikažete tu ploču. Kad je kartica u fokusu, \u003Ckbd class=\"hk\"\u003E\u003Cspan class=\"k-mac\" title=\"←\"\u003E←\u003C/span\u003E\u003Cspan class=\"k-pc\"\u003E←\u003C/span\u003E\u003C/kbd\u003E i \u003Ckbd class=\"hk\"\u003E\u003Cspan class=\"k-mac\" title=\"→\"\u003E→\u003C/span\u003E\u003Cspan class=\"k-pc\"\u003E→\u003C/span\u003E\u003C/kbd\u003E mijenjaju kartice, a \u003Ckbd class=\"hk\"\u003E\u003Cspan class=\"k-mac\" title=\"fn ←\"\u003Efn ←\u003C/span\u003E\u003Cspan class=\"k-pc\"\u003EHome\u003C/span\u003E\u003C/kbd\u003E i \u003Ckbd class=\"hk\"\u003E\u003Cspan class=\"k-mac\" title=\"fn →\"\u003Efn →\u003C/span\u003E\u003Cspan class=\"k-pc\"\u003EEnd\u003C/span\u003E\u003C/kbd\u003E idu na prvu i zadnju.\u003C/p\u003E\n\u003Cp\u003EDa izvučete ploču iz skupine, odaberite \u003Cspan class=\"hui\"\u003EPremjesti iz skupine kartica\u003C/span\u003E u njezinom izborniku \u003Cspan class=\"hui\"\u003E⋯\u003C/span\u003E ili je povucite negdje drugdje. Odaberite \u003Cspan class=\"hui\"\u003EKartica s\u003C/span\u003E i naziv ploče da ih grupirate bez povlačenja.\u003C/p\u003E\n\u003Ch2 id=\"prikva-i-sakrij-i-vrati\"\u003EPrikvači, sakrij i vrati\u003C/h2\u003E\n\u003Cul\u003E\u003Cli\u003EGumb za prikvačivanje na naslovnoj traci ploče čini je \u003Cstrong\u003Eautomatski skrivenom\u003C/strong\u003E: ploča napušta svoj položaj i postaje mala kartica na tom rubu. Pokažite na karticu, fokusirajte je ili kliknite pa ploča kliže preko crteža; kad odmaknete miš (ili pritisnete \u003Ckbd class=\"hk\"\u003E\u003Cspan class=\"k-mac\" title=\"Esc\"\u003EEsc\u003C/span\u003E\u003Cspan class=\"k-pc\"\u003EEsc\u003C/span\u003E\u003C/kbd\u003E) vraća se. Ponovno pritisnite gumb ili odaberite \u003Cspan class=\"hui\"\u003EOtkvači\u003C/span\u003E da je trajno usidrite.\u003C/li\u003E\u003Cli\u003EGumb za zatvaranje ili \u003Cspan class=\"hui\"\u003ESakrij ovu ploču\u003C/span\u003E u izborniku sakriva ploču i zatvara njezin položaj. Isprekidana kartica na rubu vraća je: kliknite je ili je fokusirajte i pritisnite \u003Ckbd class=\"hk\"\u003E\u003Cspan class=\"k-mac\" title=\"Return\"\u003EReturn\u003C/span\u003E\u003Cspan class=\"k-pc\"\u003EEnter\u003C/span\u003E\u003C/kbd\u003E.\u003C/li\u003E\u003C/ul\u003E\n\u003Ch2 id=\"zgusnite-raspored\"\u003EZgusnite raspored\u003C/h2\u003E\n\u003Cp\u003E\u003Cspan class=\"hui\"\u003EPostavke\u003C/span\u003E › \u003Cspan class=\"hui\"\u003EOpćenito\u003C/span\u003E › \u003Cspan class=\"hui\"\u003EGustoća rasporeda\u003C/span\u003E ima dva izbora. \u003Cspan class=\"hui\"\u003EUdobno\u003C/span\u003E je zadano. \u003Cspan class=\"hui\"\u003EZbijeno\u003C/span\u003E sužava visine redaka, razmake ploča, gumbe alatne trake i tekst ploča te aplikacije tako da stane više na zaslonu. Postavka se čuva za svaku aplikaciju. Zaslon osjetljiv na dodir u oba slučaja zadržava velike gumbe, a telefon zadržava vlastiti raspored. \u003Cspan class=\"hui\"\u003EVrati raspored na zadano\u003C/span\u003E ne mijenja gustoću koju ste postavili.\u003C/p\u003E\n\u003Ch2 id=\"odaberite-broj-redaka-alatne-trake\"\u003EOdaberite broj redaka alatne trake\u003C/h2\u003E\n\u003Cp\u003E\u003Cspan class=\"hui\"\u003EPostavke\u003C/span\u003E › \u003Cspan class=\"hui\"\u003EOpćenito\u003C/span\u003E › \u003Cspan class=\"hui\"\u003ERedci alatne trake\u003C/span\u003E ima tri izbora. \u003Cspan class=\"hui\"\u003EPrelomi\u003C/span\u003E je zadano: svaka skupina alata prikazuje se, u onoliko redaka koliko treba. \u003Cspan class=\"hui\"\u003E2 retka\u003C/span\u003E drži alatnu traku na dva retka, a \u003Cspan class=\"hui\"\u003E1 redak\u003C/span\u003E na jednom, pa crtež dobiva visinu; skupine koje ne stanu pomiču se bočno unutar alatne trake (koristite kotačić miša, dvoprstni pomak ili \u003Ckbd class=\"hk\"\u003E\u003Cspan class=\"k-mac\" title=\"Tab\"\u003ETab\u003C/span\u003E\u003Cspan class=\"k-pc\"\u003ETab\u003C/span\u003E\u003C/kbd\u003E do alata). Traka koja već stane u dva retka ostaje kakva jest pod \u003Cspan class=\"hui\"\u003E2 retka\u003C/span\u003E, jer bi mreža samo bila viša. Izbor se čuva za svaku aplikaciju. Zaslon osjetljiv na dodir i telefon zadržavaju vlastiti raspored. CadCraft ima vlastitu postavku za svoju alatnu traku, pod \u003Cspan class=\"hui\"\u003EPostavke\u003C/span\u003E › \u003Cspan class=\"hui\"\u003ECadCraft\u003C/span\u003E.\u003C/p\u003E\n\u003Ch2 id=\"koristite-tipkovnicu\"\u003EKoristite tipkovnicu\u003C/h2\u003E\n\u003Cp\u003EIzbornik \u003Cspan class=\"hui\"\u003E⋯\u003C/span\u003E svake ploče otvara izbornik: \u003Cspan class=\"hui\"\u003EUsidri s lijeve strane\u003C/span\u003E, \u003Cspan class=\"hui\"\u003EUsidri s desne strane\u003C/span\u003E, \u003Cspan class=\"hui\"\u003EUsidri na dnu\u003C/span\u003E, \u003Cspan class=\"hui\"\u003EOdvoji iznad crteža\u003C/span\u003E, \u003Cspan class=\"hui\"\u003EPrikvači uz rub\u003C/span\u003E, \u003Cspan class=\"hui\"\u003ESakrij ovu ploču\u003C/span\u003E, \u003Cspan class=\"hui\"\u003EKartica s\u003C/span\u003E drugom pločom, \u003Cspan class=\"hui\"\u003EPremjesti u novi prozor\u003C/span\u003E i \u003Cspan class=\"hui\"\u003EVrati je\u003C/span\u003E. Tabulatorom dođite do gumba, pritisnite \u003Ckbd class=\"hk\"\u003E\u003Cspan class=\"k-mac\" title=\"Return\"\u003EReturn\u003C/span\u003E\u003Cspan class=\"k-pc\"\u003EEnter\u003C/span\u003E\u003C/kbd\u003E, krećite se tipkama sa strelicama i ponovno pritisnite \u003Ckbd class=\"hk\"\u003E\u003Cspan class=\"k-mac\" title=\"Return\"\u003EReturn\u003C/span\u003E\u003Cspan class=\"k-pc\"\u003EEnter\u003C/span\u003E\u003C/kbd\u003E. \u003Ckbd class=\"hk\"\u003E\u003Cspan class=\"k-mac\" title=\"Esc\"\u003EEsc\u003C/span\u003E\u003Cspan class=\"k-pc\"\u003EEsc\u003C/span\u003E\u003C/kbd\u003E zatvara izbornik.\u003C/p\u003E\n\u003Ch2 id=\"stavite-plo-e-na-drugi-monitor\"\u003EStavite ploče na drugi monitor\u003C/h2\u003E\n\u003Col\u003E\u003Cli\u003EOdaberite \u003Cspan class=\"hui\"\u003E⋯\u003C/span\u003E na ploči, pa \u003Cspan class=\"hui\"\u003EPremjesti sve ploče u novi prozor\u003C/span\u003E. Možete odabrati i \u003Cspan class=\"hui\"\u003EPremjesti ploče u novi prozor\u003C/span\u003E u \u003Cspan class=\"hui\"\u003EPostavke\u003C/span\u003E.\u003C/li\u003E\u003Cli\u003EOtvara se mali prozor s pločama. Povucite ga na drugi monitor i povećajte koliko želite.\u003C/li\u003E\u003Cli\u003ERadite dalje: ploče djeluju na crtež kao i prije, a crtež ispunjava glavni prozor.\u003C/li\u003E\u003C/ol\u003E\n\u003Cp\u003EPrečaci i dalje rade dok je prozor ploča ispred: tipke koje pritisnete tamo, osim kad upisujete u polje, idu crtežu. Pitanja i dijaloške okvire koje aplikacija traži i dalje se otvaraju u glavnom prozoru, pa ih tamo potražite kad se pojave. Tema i veličina teksta ploča prate glavni prozor.\u003C/p\u003E\n\u003Cdiv class=\"hv\" data-v=\"browser:chromium\"\u003E\u003Cp class=\"hv-label\"\u003EChrome or Edge\u003C/p\u003E\n\u003Cp\u003EChrome i Edge mogu sami postaviti prozor na drugi zaslon. Kad je drugi zaslon spojen, u prozoru ploča odaberite \u003Cspan class=\"hui\"\u003EStavi ga na moj drugi zaslon\u003C/span\u003E (ili \u003Cspan class=\"hui\"\u003EStavi ploče na moj drugi zaslon\u003C/span\u003E u izborniku \u003Cspan class=\"hui\"\u003E⋯\u003C/span\u003E ploče). Preglednik jednom pita smije li ova stranica vidjeti vaše zaslone; nakon što dopustite, prozor ploča otvara se na tom zaslonu svaki put.\u003C/p\u003E\n\u003C/div\u003E\n\u003Cdiv class=\"hv\" data-v=\"browser:firefox,safari\"\u003E\u003Cp class=\"hv-label\"\u003EFirefox or Safari\u003C/p\u003E\n\u003Cp\u003EPovucite prozor ploča na drugi monitor sami. Sljedeći put otvara se na istom mjestu i u istoj veličini.\u003C/p\u003E\n\u003C/div\u003E\n\u003Ch2 id=\"vi-e-prozora-s-plo-ama\"\u003EViše prozora s pločama\u003C/h2\u003E\n\u003Cp\u003ESvaka ploča može imati vlastiti prozor: do četiri prozora ploča, na primjer jedan po monitoru.\u003C/p\u003E\n\u003Cul\u003E\u003Cli\u003EU izborniku \u003Cspan class=\"hui\"\u003E⋯\u003C/span\u003E ploče, \u003Cspan class=\"hui\"\u003EPremjesti u novi prozor\u003C/span\u003E otvara još jedan prozor za tu ploču, a \u003Cspan class=\"hui\"\u003EPremjesti u prozor ploča 2\u003C/span\u003E (i tako dalje) premješta je u prozor koji je već otvoren. Drugi prozor zove se „ploče 2“.\u003C/li\u003E\u003Cli\u003EPovucite ploču za naziv iz jednog prozora u drugi: pustite iznad glavnog prozora da se usidri ondje (označena područja vidljiva su dok ste iznad njega) ili da postane plutajuća, ili iznad drugog prozora s pločama da se premjesti u njega. Pustite bilo gdje drugdje i ostaje gdje je bila.\u003C/li\u003E\u003Cli\u003EProzor ploča bez ploča preostalih u njemu sam se zatvara.\u003C/li\u003E\u003C/ul\u003E\n\u003Cp\u003ENakon ponovnog učitavanja aplikacija vam nudi prozore ploča ponovno. Preglednici otvaraju jedan prozor po kliku, pa odaberite \u003Cspan class=\"hui\"\u003EOtvori sljedeći\u003C/span\u003E jednom za svaki prozor.\u003C/p\u003E\n\u003Ch2 id=\"isto-za-svaki-dio-rasporeda\"\u003EIsto za svaki dio rasporeda\u003C/h2\u003E\n\u003Cp\u003EVrpca, alatnica, redovi alata i statusna traka odlaze u vlastiti prozor na isti način kao ploča: otvorite izbornik \u003Cspan class=\"hui\"\u003E⋯\u003C/span\u003E na tom dijelu i odaberite \u003Cspan class=\"hui\"\u003EPremjesti u novi prozor\u003C/span\u003E; \u003Cspan class=\"hui\"\u003EVrati je\u003C/span\u003E (ili zatvaranje prozora) vraća je kući. Tipke koje pritisnete u tom prozoru stižu do aplikacije, kao i iz prozora ploča. Svaki dio ima jedan takav izbornik.\u003C/p\u003E\n\u003Ch2 id=\"premjestite-dijalo-ki-okvir\"\u003EPremjestite dijaloški okvir\u003C/h2\u003E\n\u003Cp\u003ESvaki dijaloški okvir može se maknuti s puta crteža: pritisnite i povucite njegovu naslovnu traku. Dijaloški okvir pamti gdje ste ga ostavili, svaki zasebno, i vraća se na to mjesto kad se sljedeći put otvori. Dvostruki klik na naslovnu traku vraća ga u sredinu.\u003C/p\u003E\n\u003Cp\u003ES tipkovnice, s fokusom unutar dijaloškog okvira, pritisnite \u003Ckbd class=\"hk\"\u003E\u003Cspan class=\"k-mac\" title=\"Option\"\u003E⌥\u003C/span\u003E\u003Cspan class=\"k-pc\"\u003EAlt\u003C/span\u003E\u003C/kbd\u003E+\u003Ckbd class=\"hk\"\u003E\u003Cspan class=\"k-mac\" title=\"Shift\"\u003E⇧\u003C/span\u003E\u003Cspan class=\"k-pc\"\u003EShift\u003C/span\u003E\u003C/kbd\u003E+tipku sa strelicom da ga pomaknete za 16 piksela; dodajte \u003Ckbd class=\"hk\"\u003E\u003Cspan class=\"k-mac\" title=\"Control\"\u003E⌃\u003C/span\u003E\u003Cspan class=\"k-pc\"\u003ECtrl\u003C/span\u003E\u003C/kbd\u003E za 64. Dijaloški okvir koji završi izvan zaslona (nakon manjeg prozora ili zaslona) vraća se.\u003C/p\u003E\n\u003Cp\u003ENa telefonu dijaloški okviri ostaju listovi preko cijelog zaslona i ne pomiču se.\u003C/p\u003E\n\u003Cp\u003EU programu CadCraft Studio dijaloški okvir \u003Cspan class=\"hui\"\u003EPlotanje u PDF\u003C/span\u003E programa CadCraft, koji možete držati otvorenim dok radite, ima gumb u naslovnoj traci, \u003Cspan class=\"hui\"\u003EOtvori u vlastitom prozoru\u003C/span\u003E. Dijaloški okvir prelazi u vlastiti prozor koji možete staviti na drugi monitor. Zatvaranje dijaloga zatvara prozor, a zatvaranje prozora zatvara dijalog.\u003C/p\u003E\n\u003Ch2 id=\"vratite-plo-e\"\u003EVratite ploče\u003C/h2\u003E\n\u003Cul\u003E\u003Cli\u003EOdaberite \u003Cspan class=\"hui\"\u003EVrati ploče\u003C/span\u003E u prozoru ploča ili jednostavno zatvorite prozor. Ploče se vraćaju gdje su bile.\u003C/li\u003E\u003Cli\u003EZatvaranje ili ponovno učitavanje glavnog prozora zatvara i prozor ploča. Kad se aplikacija ponovno otvori, kaže da su vaše ploče bile u vlastitom prozoru; odaberite \u003Cspan class=\"hui\"\u003EOtvori ga\u003C/span\u003E da vratite prozor ili \u003Cspan class=\"hui\"\u003EZadrži ih ovdje\u003C/span\u003E.\u003C/li\u003E\u003Cli\u003E\u003Cspan class=\"hui\"\u003EPostavke\u003C/span\u003E › \u003Cspan class=\"hui\"\u003EOpćenito\u003C/span\u003E › \u003Cspan class=\"hui\"\u003EVrati raspored na zadano\u003C/span\u003E vraća svaku ploču na mjesto gdje je počela.\u003C/li\u003E\u003C/ul\u003E\n\u003Caside class=\"hc hc-tip\"\u003E\u003Cp class=\"hc-label\"\u003ETip\u003C/p\u003E\n\u003Cp\u003EAko se ništa ne otvori kad premjestite ploče u novi prozor, preglednik je blokirao skočni prozor. Aplikacija to kaže i ostavlja ploče gdje su bile. Dopustite skočne prozore za getcadcraft.com, pa pokušajte ponovno.\u003C/p\u003E\n\u003C/aside\u003E\n\u003Cp\u003ERaspored se za svaku aplikaciju čuva u ovom pregledniku, zajedno s ostalim postavkama.\u003C/p\u003E","text":"Ploče uz crtež mogu se premještati. Postavite ih gdje vam odgovara ili im dajte vlastiti prozor na drugom monitoru da crtež dobije cijeli prvi. Svaka ploča ima naslovnu traku: tanku traku s nazivom ploče, izbornikom ⋯, gumbom za prikvačivanje i gumbom za zatvaranje na vrhu ploče. Verzije prije 0.7 imaju samo naziv i izbornik ⋯. Premjesti ploču u prozoru Povucite ploču za njezin naziv na vrhu. Dok povlačite, na lijevoj, desnoj i donjoj strani crteža pojavljuju se označena područja. Ispustite ploču na jedno od njih da se usidri ondje. Područje nad kojim se nalazite potamni. Ispustite je bilo gdje drugdje iznad crteža da postane plutajuća. Ploče mogu dijeliti jednu stranu: slažu se jedna iznad druge, a svaka linija između dviju ploča povlači se da podijeli prostor (kad je linija u fokusu, tipke sa strelicama je pomiču, a dvostruki klik na nju podijeli prostor ravnomjerno). Povucite unutarnji rub usidrene strane da je učinite širom ili užom; dvostruki klik na rub vraća ga na zadano. Plutajuća ploča ostaje iznad crteža. Pomičite je za naziv, a mijenjate joj veličinu povlačenjem donjeg desnog kuta (ili tabulatorom dođite do kuta i koristite tipke sa strelicama). Dvostruki klik na naziv usidruje je ponovo tamo gdje je bila. Povucite jednim prstom za naziv ploče. Donji desni kut plutajuće ploče povucite jednim prstom da joj promijenite veličinu, kao i rubove između usidrenih ploča. Za odvajanje ili usidrivanje bez povlačenja koristite izbornik ⋯. Grupiraj ploče kao kartice Dvije ploče mogu dijeliti jedan okvir i prikazivati jednu po jednu. Povucite ploču za njezin naziv na naslovnu traku druge ploče (traka je označena dok ste iznad nje) i pustite: okvir sada ima karticu za svaku ploču, u svojoj naslovnoj traci. Kliknite karticu da prikažete tu ploču. Kad je kartica u fokusu, ← i → mijenjaju kartice, a Home i End idu na prvu i zadnju. Da izvučete ploču iz skupine, odaberite Premjesti iz skupine kartica u njezinom izborniku ⋯ ili je povucite negdje drugdje. Odaberite Kartica s i naziv ploče da ih grupirate bez povlačenja. Prikvači, sakrij i vrati Gumb za prikvačivanje na naslovnoj traci ploče čini je automatski skrivenom: ploča napušta svoj položaj i postaje mala kartica na tom rubu. Pokažite na karticu, fokusirajte je ili kliknite pa ploča kliže preko crteža; kad odmaknete miš (ili pritisnete Esc) vraća se. Ponovno pritisnite gumb ili odaberite Otkvači da je trajno usidrite. Gumb za zatvaranje ili Sakrij ovu ploču u izborniku sakriva ploču i zatvara njezin položaj. Isprekidana kartica na rubu vraća je: kliknite je ili je fokusirajte i pritisnite Enter. Zgusnite raspored Postavke › Općenito › Gustoća rasporeda ima dva izbora. Udobno je zadano. Zbijeno sužava visine redaka, razmake ploča, gumbe alatne trake i tekst ploča te aplikacije tako da stane više na zaslonu. Postavka se čuva za svaku aplikaciju. Zaslon osjetljiv na dodir u oba slučaja zadržava velike gumbe, a telefon zadržava vlastiti raspored. Vrati raspored na zadano ne mijenja gustoću koju ste postavili. Odaberite broj redaka alatne trake Postavke › Općenito › Redci alatne trake ima tri izbora. Prelomi je zadano: svaka skupina alata prikazuje se, u onoliko redaka koliko treba. 2 retka drži alatnu traku na dva retka, a 1 redak na jednom, pa crtež dobiva visinu; skupine koje ne stanu pomiču se bočno unutar alatne trake (koristite kotačić miša, dvoprstni pomak ili Tab do alata). Traka koja već stane u dva retka ostaje kakva jest pod 2 retka, jer bi mreža samo bila viša. Izbor se čuva za svaku aplikaciju. Zaslon osjetljiv na dodir i telefon zadržavaju vlastiti raspored. CadCraft ima vlastitu postavku za svoju alatnu traku, pod Postavke › CadCraft. Koristite tipkovnicu Izbornik ⋯ svake ploče otvara izbornik: Usidri s lijeve strane, Usidri s desne strane, Usidri na dnu, Odvoji iznad crteža, Prikvači uz rub, Sakrij ovu ploču, Kartica s drugom pločom, Premjesti u novi prozor i Vrati je. Tabulatorom dođite do gumba, pritisnite Enter, krećite se tipkama sa strelicama i ponovno pritisnite Enter. Esc zatvara izbornik. Stavite ploče na drugi monitor Odaberite ⋯ na ploči, pa Premjesti sve ploče u novi prozor. Možete odabrati i Premjesti ploče u novi prozor u Postavke. Otvara se mali prozor s pločama. Povucite ga na drugi monitor i povećajte koliko želite. Radite dalje: ploče djeluju na crtež kao i prije, a crtež ispunjava glavni prozor. Prečaci i dalje rade dok je prozor ploča ispred: tipke koje pritisnete tamo, osim kad upisujete u polje, idu crtežu. Pitanja i dijaloške okvire koje aplikacija traži i dalje se otvaraju u glavnom prozoru, pa ih tamo potražite kad se pojave. Tema i veličina teksta ploča prate glavni prozor. Chrome i Edge mogu sami postaviti prozor na drugi zaslon. Kad je drugi zaslon spojen, u prozoru ploča odaberite Stavi ga na moj drugi zaslon (ili Stavi ploče na moj drugi zaslon u izborniku ⋯ ploče). Preglednik jednom pita smije li ova stranica vidjeti vaše zaslone; nakon što dopustite, prozor ploča otvara se na tom zaslonu svaki put. Povucite prozor ploča na drugi monitor sami. Sljedeći put otvara se na istom mjestu i u istoj veličini. Više prozora s pločama Svaka ploča može imati vlastiti prozor: do četiri prozora ploča, na primjer jedan po monitoru. U izborniku ⋯ ploče, Premjesti u novi prozor otvara još jedan prozor za tu ploču, a Premjesti u prozor ploča 2 (i tako dalje) premješta je u prozor koji je već otvoren. Drugi prozor zove se „ploče 2“. Povucite ploču za naziv iz jednog prozora u drugi: pustite iznad glavnog prozora da se usidri ondje (označena područja vidljiva su dok ste iznad njega) ili da postane plutajuća, ili iznad drugog prozora s pločama da se premjesti u njega. Pustite bilo gdje drugdje i ostaje gdje je bila. Prozor ploča bez ploča preostalih u njemu sam se zatvara. Nakon ponovnog učitavanja aplikacija vam nudi prozore ploča ponovno. Preglednici otvaraju jedan prozor po kliku, pa odaberite Otvori sljedeći jednom za svaki prozor. Isto za svaki dio rasporeda Vrpca, alatnica, redovi alata i statusna traka odlaze u vlastiti prozor na isti način kao ploča: otvorite izbornik ⋯ na tom dijelu i odaberite Premjesti u novi prozor; Vrati je (ili zatvaranje prozora) vraća je kući. Tipke koje pritisnete u tom prozoru stižu do aplikacije, kao i iz prozora ploča. Svaki dio ima jedan takav izbornik. Premjestite dijaloški okvir Svaki dijaloški okvir može se maknuti s puta crteža: pritisnite i povucite njegovu naslovnu traku. Dijaloški okvir pamti gdje ste ga ostavili, svaki zasebno, i vraća se na to mjesto kad se sljedeći put otvori. Dvostruki klik na naslovnu traku vraća ga u sredinu. S tipkovnice, s fokusom unutar dijaloškog okvira, pritisnite Alt+Shift+tipku sa strelicom da ga pomaknete za 16 piksela; dodajte Ctrl za 64. Dijaloški okvir koji završi izvan zaslona (nakon manjeg prozora ili zaslona) vraća se. Na telefonu dijaloški okviri ostaju listovi preko cijelog zaslona i ne pomiču se. U programu CadCraft Studio dijaloški okvir Plotanje u PDF programa CadCraft, koji možete držati otvorenim dok radite, ima gumb u naslovnoj traci, Otvori u vlastitom prozoru. Dijaloški okvir prelazi u vlastiti prozor koji možete staviti na drugi monitor. Zatvaranje dijaloga zatvara prozor, a zatvaranje prozora zatvara dijalog. Vratite ploče Odaberite Vrati ploče u prozoru ploča ili jednostavno zatvorite prozor. Ploče se vraćaju gdje su bile. Zatvaranje ili ponovno učitavanje glavnog prozora zatvara i prozor ploča. Kad se aplikacija ponovno otvori, kaže da su vaše ploče bile u vlastitom prozoru; odaberite Otvori ga da vratite prozor ili Zadrži ih ovdje. Postavke › Općenito › Vrati raspored na zadano vraća svaku ploču na mjesto gdje je počela. Ako se ništa ne otvori kad premjestite ploče u novi prozor, preglednik je blokirao skočni prozor. Aplikacija to kaže i ostavlja ploče gdje su bile. Dopustite skočne prozore za getcadcraft.com, pa pokušajte ponovno. Raspored se za svaku aplikaciju čuva u ovom pregledniku, zajedno s ostalim postavkama.","lang":"hr"},{"slug":"dock-tool-groups","scope":"basics","title":"Dock a group of tools beside the drawing, and bring your windows back","summary":"Turn a ribbon group, a tool-row group or a toolbox group into a palette in a side panel or a column of the drawing, with tabs and collapse, and put it back; every bar has the same grip and close; the windows you tore off come back in one click.","section":"start","order":36,"keywords":["dock","palette","ribbon group","tool group","toolbox group","tool rows","side panel","tabs","collapse","grip","handle","drag","close","open in a window","restore my windows","second monitor","two screens","remembered windows"],"headings":[{"id":"the-grip-and-the-close-button","text":"The grip and the close button","level":2},{"id":"dock-a-group-as-a-palette","text":"Dock a group as a palette","level":2},{"id":"put-it-back","text":"Put it back","level":2},{"id":"arrange-mode","text":"Arrange mode","level":2},{"id":"your-windows-next-time","text":"Your windows, next time","level":2}],"html":"\u003Cp\u003E&lt;!-- SPDX-License-Identifier: Apache-2.0 --&gt; &lt;!-- DRAFT (session ui-dock2-10, 2026-11-15). Not in assets/help/: what it describes shows only with the owner&#039;s switch (html[data-cc-ws-edit=&quot;1&quot;]). Move it to assets/help/common/ and run php bin/build-help.php &lt;app&gt; for the eight apps in the same step that turns the switch on; other languages are lang-10&#039;s. --&gt;\u003C/p\u003E\n\u003Cp\u003EIn a layout with a ribbon, tool rows or a toolbox, any group of tools can leave its bar and become a palette at the side, as a column of tools.\u003C/p\u003E\n\u003Ch2 id=\"the-grip-and-the-close-button\"\u003EThe grip and the close button\u003C/h2\u003E\n\u003Cp\u003EEvery bar that can move has the same head: a grip \u003Cspan class=\"hui\"\u003E⠿\u003C/span\u003E at the far left and a close button \u003Cspan class=\"hui\"\u003E×\u003C/span\u003E at the far right. Click the grip for its menu: \u003Cstrong\u003EOpen in a window\u003C/strong\u003E, the bar&#039;s own choices (such as \u003Cstrong\u003ECollapse the ribbon\u003C/strong\u003E) and \u003Cstrong\u003EHide\u003C/strong\u003E. You can also right-click the head.\u003C/p\u003E\n\u003Cp\u003EEach group of tools has a small grip at the left of its name.\u003C/p\u003E\n\u003Ch2 id=\"dock-a-group-as-a-palette\"\u003EDock a group as a palette\u003C/h2\u003E\n\u003Col\u003E\u003Cli\u003EDrag the group&#039;s grip. Outlined areas appear: the left panel, the right panel, and the drawing&#039;s left and right columns.\u003C/li\u003E\u003Cli\u003EDrop the group on one of them. Its tools now stand in a column there, under a head with the group&#039;s name.\u003C/li\u003E\u003C/ol\u003E\n\u003Cp\u003EOr click the grip and pick \u003Cstrong\u003EDock to\u003C/strong\u003E and a place.\u003C/p\u003E\n\u003Cp\u003ETwo groups in the same place become tabs. The \u003Cspan class=\"hui\"\u003E⌃\u003C/span\u003E button folds the palette to its head and opens it again.\u003C/p\u003E\n\u003Ch2 id=\"put-it-back\"\u003EPut it back\u003C/h2\u003E\n\u003Cp\u003EClick the palette&#039;s \u003Cspan class=\"hui\"\u003E×\u003C/span\u003E, pick \u003Cstrong\u003EPut it back\u003C/strong\u003E in its grip menu, or drag its grip onto the bar it came from. The group goes back to its place in the ribbon, the tool rows or the toolbox.\u003C/p\u003E\n\u003Cp\u003EWhere you docked each group is remembered for this app and this layout.\u003C/p\u003E\n\u003Ch2 id=\"arrange-mode\"\u003EArrange mode\u003C/h2\u003E\n\u003Cp\u003EWhile you arrange the layout (Settings › Layout › Arrange), the places where a group can dock are outlined.\u003C/p\u003E\n\u003Ch2 id=\"your-windows-next-time\"\u003EYour windows, next time\u003C/h2\u003E\n\u003Cp\u003EA bar you moved to its own window remembers where that window was, and on which screen, for this app and layout. When you open the app again, a note offers \u003Cstrong\u003ERestore my windows\u003C/strong\u003E: one click opens them where they were. A browser may open only one window per click; if one stays closed, click \u003Cstrong\u003ERestore my windows\u003C/strong\u003E again. \u003Cstrong\u003EKeep them here\u003C/strong\u003E forgets them.\u003C/p\u003E","text":"\u003C!-- SPDX-License-Identifier: Apache-2.0 --\u003E \u003C!-- DRAFT (session ui-dock2-10, 2026-11-15). Not in assets/help/: what it describes shows only with the owner's switch (html[data-cc-ws-edit=\"1\"]). Move it to assets/help/common/ and run php bin/build-help.php \u003Capp\u003E for the eight apps in the same step that turns the switch on; other languages are lang-10's. --\u003E In a layout with a ribbon, tool rows or a toolbox, any group of tools can leave its bar and become a palette at the side, as a column of tools. The grip and the close button Every bar that can move has the same head: a grip ⠿ at the far left and a close button × at the far right. Click the grip for its menu: Open in a window, the bar's own choices (such as Collapse the ribbon) and Hide. You can also right-click the head. Each group of tools has a small grip at the left of its name. Dock a group as a palette Drag the group's grip. Outlined areas appear: the left panel, the right panel, and the drawing's left and right columns. Drop the group on one of them. Its tools now stand in a column there, under a head with the group's name. Or click the grip and pick Dock to and a place. Two groups in the same place become tabs. The ⌃ button folds the palette to its head and opens it again. Put it back Click the palette's ×, pick Put it back in its grip menu, or drag its grip onto the bar it came from. The group goes back to its place in the ribbon, the tool rows or the toolbox. Where you docked each group is remembered for this app and this layout. Arrange mode While you arrange the layout (Settings › Layout › Arrange), the places where a group can dock are outlined. Your windows, next time A bar you moved to its own window remembers where that window was, and on which screen, for this app and layout. When you open the app again, a note offers Restore my windows: one click opens them where they were. A browser may open only one window per click; if one stays closed, click Restore my windows again. Keep them here forgets them.","lang":"en"},{"slug":"layout-ribbon","scope":"basics","title":"Rad s rasporedom s vrpcom i pregledom projekta","summary":"Prebacite aplikaciju na vrpcu kartica iznad crteža, sa Svojstvima i preglednikom projekta lijevo te karticom za svaki otvoreni pogled, i vratite se na klasični raspored kad god želite.","section":"start","order":36,"keywords":["raspored","radni prostor","vrpca","kartice vrpce","preglednik projekta","preglednik","palete","paleta svojstava","kartice pogleda","statusna traka","brzi pristup","sklopi vrpcu","minimiziraj vrpcu","prozor vrpce","klasični raspored","promijeni raspored","prebaci raspored","usidreno"],"headings":[{"id":"odaberite-ga","text":"Odaberite ga","level":2},{"id":"to-je-gdje","text":"Što je gdje","level":2},{"id":"koristite-vrpcu-s-tipkovnice","text":"Koristite vrpcu s tipkovnice","level":2},{"id":"sklopite-vrpcu-ili-joj-dajte-vlastiti-prozor","text":"Sklopite vrpcu ili joj dajte vlastiti prozor","level":2},{"id":"va-e-plo-e-ostaju-va-e","text":"Vaše ploče ostaju vaše","level":2},{"id":"vratite-se-na-klasi-ni-raspored","text":"Vratite se na klasični raspored","level":2}],"html":"\u003Cp\u003E\u003Cstrong\u003EVrpca i preglednik projekta\u003C/strong\u003E jedan je od tri radna rasporeda aplikacije. Vrpca kartica prolazi pri vrhu, Svojstva i preglednik projekta dijele lijevu ploču, svaki otvoreni pogled dobiva karticu iznad crteža, a statusna traka je na dnu. Alati su aplikacijski: sve što možete raditi u klasičnom rasporedu radi i ovdje, a vaš crtež, stil izbornika i prečaci ostaju isti.\u003C/p\u003E\n\u003Ch2 id=\"odaberite-ga\"\u003EOdaberite ga\u003C/h2\u003E\n\u003Col\u003E\u003Cli\u003EOtvorite \u003Cspan class=\"hui\"\u003EPostavke\u003C/span\u003E (zupčanik ili \u003Ckbd class=\"hk\"\u003E\u003Cspan class=\"k-mac\" title=\"Command ,\"\u003E⌘,\u003C/span\u003E\u003Cspan class=\"k-pc\"\u003ECtrl+,\u003C/span\u003E\u003C/kbd\u003E).\u003C/li\u003E\u003Cli\u003EOdaberite karticu \u003Cspan class=\"hui\"\u003EGlobalne\u003C/span\u003E, pa idite na \u003Cspan class=\"hui\"\u003ERaspored\u003C/span\u003E › \u003Cspan class=\"hui\"\u003ERadni prostor\u003C/span\u003E.\u003C/li\u003E\u003Cli\u003EOdaberite \u003Cspan class=\"hui\"\u003EVrpca i preglednik projekta\u003C/span\u003E.\u003C/li\u003E\u003C/ol\u003E\n\u003Cp\u003ERaspored se mijenja odmah. Izbor vrijedi za sve aplikacije u ovom pregledniku: svaka aplikacija se od tada otvara u njemu, a postavljen je prije nego se stranica iscrta, pa nikad ne vidite klasični raspored prvi.\u003C/p\u003E\n\u003Ch2 id=\"to-je-gdje\"\u003EŠto je gdje\u003C/h2\u003E\n\u003Cul\u003E\u003Cli\u003E\u003Cstrong\u003ENaslovna traka:\u003C/strong\u003E naziv aplikacije, gumbi brzog pristupa (otvori, spremi, poništi, ponovi), naziv otvorene datoteke, \u003Cspan class=\"hui\"\u003EŠto svaki alat ovdje radi\u003C/span\u003E (popis svih alata s poljem za pretragu, koji su spremni sada i zašto ostali nisu), cijeli zaslon, \u003Cspan class=\"hui\"\u003EPomoć\u003C/span\u003E i \u003Cspan class=\"hui\"\u003EPostavke\u003C/span\u003E. U ovom rasporedu naslovna traka zamjenjuje traku aplikacije.\u003C/li\u003E\u003Cli\u003E\u003Cstrong\u003EVrpca:\u003C/strong\u003E alati aplikacije u karticama, svaka kartica u skupinama. \u003Cspan class=\"hui\"\u003EDatoteka\u003C/span\u003E lijevo otvara, sprema i ostalo. Neke aplikacije dodaju vlastitu karticu dok radite u određenom načinu ili radnom prostoru; svijetli dok vrijedi i nestaje nakon toga.\u003C/li\u003E\u003Cli\u003E\u003Cstrong\u003ETraka opcija:\u003C/strong\u003E ispod vrpce, ono što pokrenuti alat traži od vas ili što je odabrano.\u003C/li\u003E\u003Cli\u003E\u003Cstrong\u003ELijeva ploča:\u003C/strong\u003E \u003Cspan class=\"hui\"\u003ESvojstva\u003C/span\u003E na vrhu, a ispod nje palete (preglednik projekta i vlastiti sadržaj ploče) kao kartice. Povucite crtu između njih da podijelite prostor.\u003C/li\u003E\u003Cli\u003E\u003Cstrong\u003EKartice pogleda:\u003C/strong\u003E jedna kartica za svaki pogled koji ste otvorili (list, tlocrt, scena…). Zatvorite je njezinim gumbom za zatvaranje; datoteka ostaje otvorena.\u003C/li\u003E\u003Cli\u003E\u003Cstrong\u003ETraka pogleda i statusna traka:\u003C/strong\u003E ispod crteža, kontrole samog pogleda (mjerilo, zumiranje); pri dnu poruke aplikacije.\u003C/li\u003E\u003C/ul\u003E\n\u003Cp\u003EAlat koji trenutno nije moguće pokrenuti osivi se, a njegov savjet kaže zašto (na primjer „Najprije otvorite datoteku“ ili da aplikacija još nema taj alat). Kliknite ga ili pritisnite \u003Ckbd class=\"hk\"\u003E\u003Cspan class=\"k-mac\" title=\"Return\"\u003EReturn\u003C/span\u003E\u003Cspan class=\"k-pc\"\u003EEnter\u003C/span\u003E\u003C/kbd\u003E na njemu da u okviru pročitate razlog.\u003C/p\u003E\n\u003Ch2 id=\"koristite-vrpcu-s-tipkovnice\"\u003EKoristite vrpcu s tipkovnice\u003C/h2\u003E\n\u003Cp\u003ES fokusom na kartici vrpce, \u003Ckbd class=\"hk\"\u003E\u003Cspan class=\"k-mac\" title=\"←\"\u003E←\u003C/span\u003E\u003Cspan class=\"k-pc\"\u003E←\u003C/span\u003E\u003C/kbd\u003E i \u003Ckbd class=\"hk\"\u003E\u003Cspan class=\"k-mac\" title=\"→\"\u003E→\u003C/span\u003E\u003Cspan class=\"k-pc\"\u003E→\u003C/span\u003E\u003C/kbd\u003E idu između kartica, a \u003Ckbd class=\"hk\"\u003E\u003Cspan class=\"k-mac\" title=\"fn ←\"\u003Efn ←\u003C/span\u003E\u003Cspan class=\"k-pc\"\u003EHome\u003C/span\u003E\u003C/kbd\u003E i \u003Ckbd class=\"hk\"\u003E\u003Cspan class=\"k-mac\" title=\"fn →\"\u003Efn →\u003C/span\u003E\u003Cspan class=\"k-pc\"\u003EEnd\u003C/span\u003E\u003C/kbd\u003E na prvu i zadnju. \u003Ckbd class=\"hk\"\u003E\u003Cspan class=\"k-mac\" title=\"Esc\"\u003EEsc\u003C/span\u003E\u003Cspan class=\"k-pc\"\u003EEsc\u003C/span\u003E\u003C/kbd\u003E prvo završava pokrenuti alat, kao u klasičnom rasporedu, a svaki prečac i \u003Ckbd class=\"hk\"\u003E\u003Cspan class=\"k-mac\" title=\"Control Shift F\"\u003E⌃⇧F\u003C/span\u003E\u003Cspan class=\"k-pc\"\u003ECtrl+Shift+F\u003C/span\u003E\u003C/kbd\u003E (načini prikaza cijelog zaslona) rade kao i prije.\u003C/p\u003E\n\u003Ch2 id=\"sklopite-vrpcu-ili-joj-dajte-vlastiti-prozor\"\u003ESklopite vrpcu ili joj dajte vlastiti prozor\u003C/h2\u003E\n\u003Cul\u003E\u003Cli\u003EDvostruki klik na karticu vrpce sklapa vrpcu na njezine kartice; klik na karticu tada prikazuje njezine alate dok ne prijeđete dalje. Ponovni dvostruki klik zadržava je otvorenom. Gumb \u003Cspan class=\"hui\"\u003EPremjesti vrpcu\u003C/span\u003E na desnom kraju vrpce ima i \u003Cspan class=\"hui\"\u003ESklopi vrpcu\u003C/span\u003E i \u003Cspan class=\"hui\"\u003EZadrži vrpcu otvorenom\u003C/span\u003E. Svaka aplikacija to pamti.\u003C/li\u003E\u003Cli\u003E\u003Cspan class=\"hui\"\u003EPremjesti vrpcu\u003C/span\u003E › \u003Cspan class=\"hui\"\u003EPremjesti u novi prozor\u003C/span\u003E stavlja vrpcu u vlastiti prozor, na primjer na drugi monitor. Tipke pritisnute tamo stižu do aplikacije. \u003Cspan class=\"hui\"\u003EVrati vrpcu\u003C/span\u003E, ili zatvaranje tog prozora, vraća je kući.\u003C/li\u003E\u003C/ul\u003E\n\u003Cp\u003EPostavke alatne trake vrijede i za vrpcu: \u003Cspan class=\"hui\"\u003EPostavke\u003C/span\u003E › \u003Cspan class=\"hui\"\u003EGlobalne\u003C/span\u003E › \u003Cspan class=\"hui\"\u003EAlatna traka\u003C/span\u003E › \u003Cspan class=\"hui\"\u003EIkone i oznake\u003C/span\u003E, \u003Cspan class=\"hui\"\u003ESamo ikone\u003C/span\u003E (vrpca tada prikazuje dva retka sitnih ikona po skupini) ili \u003Cspan class=\"hui\"\u003ESamo oznake\u003C/span\u003E, te \u003Cspan class=\"hui\"\u003EPrikaži nazive skupina (Datoteka, Crtanje, …)\u003C/span\u003E.\u003C/p\u003E\n\u003Ch2 id=\"va-e-plo-e-ostaju-va-e\"\u003EVaše ploče ostaju vaše\u003C/h2\u003E\n\u003Cp\u003ELijeve i desne ploče zadržavaju sve opisano u \u003Ca href=\"/tutorials/basics/arrange-panels\" data-topic=\"basics/arrange-panels\"\u003ERaspored ploča i drugi monitor\u003C/a\u003E: usidrivanje, odvajanje, prikvačivanje, skrivanje, kartice, \u003Cspan class=\"hui\"\u003EPremjesti u novi prozor\u003C/span\u003E i \u003Cspan class=\"hui\"\u003EVrati raspored na zadano\u003C/span\u003E.\u003C/p\u003E\n\u003Ch2 id=\"vratite-se-na-klasi-ni-raspored\"\u003EVratite se na klasični raspored\u003C/h2\u003E\n\u003Cp\u003EOtvorite \u003Cspan class=\"hui\"\u003EPostavke\u003C/span\u003E › \u003Cspan class=\"hui\"\u003EGlobalne\u003C/span\u003E › \u003Cspan class=\"hui\"\u003ERaspored\u003C/span\u003E › \u003Cspan class=\"hui\"\u003ERadni prostor\u003C/span\u003E i odaberite \u003Cspan class=\"hui\"\u003ECadCraft klasik\u003C/span\u003E. Svaka alatna traka, kartica i ploča vraća se gdje je bila.\u003C/p\u003E\n\u003Caside class=\"hc hc-note\"\u003E\u003Cp class=\"hc-label\"\u003ENote\u003C/p\u003E\n\u003Cp\u003ENa telefonu, ili u prozoru širine 760 piksela ili manje, aplikacija koristi raspored za telefon bez obzira na to što ste odabrali. Širi prozor vraća vaš raspored.\u003C/p\u003E\n\u003C/aside\u003E\n\u003Cp\u003EZa isprobavanje drugog rasporeda pogledajte \u003Ca href=\"/tutorials/basics/layout-toolbox\" data-topic=\"basics/layout-toolbox\"\u003Eraspored s alatnicom i info okvirom\u003C/a\u003E.\u003C/p\u003E\n\u003Cp\u003EZa promjenu onoga što ovaj raspored prikazuje pogledajte \u003Ca href=\"/tutorials/basics/layout-edit\" data-topic=\"basics/layout-edit\"\u003EPromjena rasporeda na zaslonu\u003C/a\u003E; za tamni raspored s izbornikom i vrpcom pogledajte \u003Ca href=\"/tutorials/basics/layout-drafting\" data-topic=\"basics/layout-drafting\"\u003Eraspored Drafting\u003C/a\u003E.\u003C/p\u003E","text":"Vrpca i preglednik projekta jedan je od tri radna rasporeda aplikacije. Vrpca kartica prolazi pri vrhu, Svojstva i preglednik projekta dijele lijevu ploču, svaki otvoreni pogled dobiva karticu iznad crteža, a statusna traka je na dnu. Alati su aplikacijski: sve što možete raditi u klasičnom rasporedu radi i ovdje, a vaš crtež, stil izbornika i prečaci ostaju isti. Odaberite ga Otvorite Postavke (zupčanik ili Ctrl+,). Odaberite karticu Globalne, pa idite na Raspored › Radni prostor. Odaberite Vrpca i preglednik projekta. Raspored se mijenja odmah. Izbor vrijedi za sve aplikacije u ovom pregledniku: svaka aplikacija se od tada otvara u njemu, a postavljen je prije nego se stranica iscrta, pa nikad ne vidite klasični raspored prvi. Što je gdje Naslovna traka: naziv aplikacije, gumbi brzog pristupa (otvori, spremi, poništi, ponovi), naziv otvorene datoteke, Što svaki alat ovdje radi (popis svih alata s poljem za pretragu, koji su spremni sada i zašto ostali nisu), cijeli zaslon, Pomoć i Postavke. U ovom rasporedu naslovna traka zamjenjuje traku aplikacije. Vrpca: alati aplikacije u karticama, svaka kartica u skupinama. Datoteka lijevo otvara, sprema i ostalo. Neke aplikacije dodaju vlastitu karticu dok radite u određenom načinu ili radnom prostoru; svijetli dok vrijedi i nestaje nakon toga. Traka opcija: ispod vrpce, ono što pokrenuti alat traži od vas ili što je odabrano. Lijeva ploča: Svojstva na vrhu, a ispod nje palete (preglednik projekta i vlastiti sadržaj ploče) kao kartice. Povucite crtu između njih da podijelite prostor. Kartice pogleda: jedna kartica za svaki pogled koji ste otvorili (list, tlocrt, scena…). Zatvorite je njezinim gumbom za zatvaranje; datoteka ostaje otvorena. Traka pogleda i statusna traka: ispod crteža, kontrole samog pogleda (mjerilo, zumiranje); pri dnu poruke aplikacije. Alat koji trenutno nije moguće pokrenuti osivi se, a njegov savjet kaže zašto (na primjer „Najprije otvorite datoteku“ ili da aplikacija još nema taj alat). Kliknite ga ili pritisnite Enter na njemu da u okviru pročitate razlog. Koristite vrpcu s tipkovnice S fokusom na kartici vrpce, ← i → idu između kartica, a Home i End na prvu i zadnju. Esc prvo završava pokrenuti alat, kao u klasičnom rasporedu, a svaki prečac i Ctrl+Shift+F (načini prikaza cijelog zaslona) rade kao i prije. Sklopite vrpcu ili joj dajte vlastiti prozor Dvostruki klik na karticu vrpce sklapa vrpcu na njezine kartice; klik na karticu tada prikazuje njezine alate dok ne prijeđete dalje. Ponovni dvostruki klik zadržava je otvorenom. Gumb Premjesti vrpcu na desnom kraju vrpce ima i Sklopi vrpcu i Zadrži vrpcu otvorenom. Svaka aplikacija to pamti. Premjesti vrpcu › Premjesti u novi prozor stavlja vrpcu u vlastiti prozor, na primjer na drugi monitor. Tipke pritisnute tamo stižu do aplikacije. Vrati vrpcu, ili zatvaranje tog prozora, vraća je kući. Postavke alatne trake vrijede i za vrpcu: Postavke › Globalne › Alatna traka › Ikone i oznake, Samo ikone (vrpca tada prikazuje dva retka sitnih ikona po skupini) ili Samo oznake, te Prikaži nazive skupina (Datoteka, Crtanje, …). Vaše ploče ostaju vaše Lijeve i desne ploče zadržavaju sve opisano u Raspored ploča i drugi monitor: usidrivanje, odvajanje, prikvačivanje, skrivanje, kartice, Premjesti u novi prozor i Vrati raspored na zadano. Vratite se na klasični raspored Otvorite Postavke › Globalne › Raspored › Radni prostor i odaberite CadCraft klasik. Svaka alatna traka, kartica i ploča vraća se gdje je bila. Na telefonu, ili u prozoru širine 760 piksela ili manje, aplikacija koristi raspored za telefon bez obzira na to što ste odabrali. Širi prozor vraća vaš raspored. Za isprobavanje drugog rasporeda pogledajte raspored s alatnicom i info okvirom. Za promjenu onoga što ovaj raspored prikazuje pogledajte Promjena rasporeda na zaslonu; za tamni raspored s izbornikom i vrpcom pogledajte raspored Drafting.","lang":"hr"},{"slug":"icons-one-set","scope":"basics","title":"One set of icons in every layout","summary":"Every tool in the ribbon, the tool rows, the toolbox, the menus and the palettes is drawn from one icon set, in the same style in every layout; choose full colour, an outline in your own colour, or the app's own drawings under Settings.","section":"start","order":37,"keywords":["icons","icon set","icon style","full colour","outline","colorized","each app's own drawings","ribbon icons","toolbar icons","toolbox icons","menu icons","palette icons","consistent icons","layout icons","tool pictures","icon colour"],"headings":[{"id":"choose-how-the-icons-look","text":"Choose how the icons look","level":2},{"id":"what-stays-the-same","text":"What stays the same","level":2},{"id":"if-a-picture-is-wrong","text":"If a picture is wrong","level":2}],"html":"\u003Cp\u003EEvery tool has one picture, and the picture is the same wherever you meet the tool: in the ribbon, in a row of tool buttons, in the toolbox, in the File menu, in a menu opened from a panel&#039;s \u003Cspan class=\"hui\"\u003E⋯\u003C/span\u003E button, and in the palettes of the Vector and Sketch layouts. Switch the layout and the picture stays put, so you learn each tool once.\u003C/p\u003E\n\u003Caside class=\"hc hc-note\"\u003E\u003Cp class=\"hc-label\"\u003ENote\u003C/p\u003E\n\u003Cp\u003EThis is in the lab builds first. A tool the set has no drawing for yet shows its old picture until the drawing is added, and the lab keeps a list of those so none is forgotten.\u003C/p\u003E\n\u003C/aside\u003E\n\u003Ch2 id=\"choose-how-the-icons-look\"\u003EChoose how the icons look\u003C/h2\u003E\n\u003Col\u003E\u003Cli\u003EOpen \u003Cspan class=\"hui\"\u003ESettings\u003C/span\u003E (Ctrl+,) and find \u003Cspan class=\"hui\"\u003EIcons\u003C/span\u003E.\u003C/li\u003E\u003Cli\u003EPick one:\u003Cul\u003E\u003Cli\u003E\u003Cspan class=\"hui\"\u003EFull colour\u003C/span\u003E: two-tone drawings with colour fills.\u003C/li\u003E\u003Cli\u003E\u003Cspan class=\"hui\"\u003EOutline\u003C/span\u003E: line drawings in one colour. \u003Cspan class=\"hui\"\u003EOutline colour\u003C/span\u003E sets the colour; \u003Cspan class=\"hui\"\u003EUse the theme colour\u003C/span\u003E puts it back.\u003C/li\u003E\u003Cli\u003E\u003Cspan class=\"hui\"\u003EEach app&#039;s own drawings\u003C/span\u003E: the pictures the app drew for itself, as before. Every layout then shows those instead of the set.\u003C/li\u003E\u003C/ul\u003E\u003C/li\u003E\u003C/ol\u003E\n\u003Cp\u003EThe drawings are vectors, so they stay sharp at any size and follow \u003Cspan class=\"hui\"\u003EInterface size\u003C/span\u003E. They follow the light and dark theme too.\u003C/p\u003E\n\u003Ch2 id=\"what-stays-the-same\"\u003EWhat stays the same\u003C/h2\u003E\n\u003Cul\u003E\u003Cli\u003EThe tool&#039;s name, tooltip, keys and position do not change; only its picture.\u003C/li\u003E\u003Cli\u003EArrows that open or close a list (the small carets) are not tool pictures and keep their own shape.\u003C/li\u003E\u003Cli\u003EThe pictures inside a drawing or a model (symbols, hatches, textures) are yours or the library&#039;s and are not touched.\u003C/li\u003E\u003C/ul\u003E\n\u003Ch2 id=\"if-a-picture-is-wrong\"\u003EIf a picture is wrong\u003C/h2\u003E\n\u003Cp\u003EHover the tool to read its name, then use \u003Cspan class=\"hui\"\u003EReport a problem\u003C/span\u003E from the Help menu and name the tool; the name tells us which drawing to change.\u003C/p\u003E","text":"Every tool has one picture, and the picture is the same wherever you meet the tool: in the ribbon, in a row of tool buttons, in the toolbox, in the File menu, in a menu opened from a panel's ⋯ button, and in the palettes of the Vector and Sketch layouts. Switch the layout and the picture stays put, so you learn each tool once. This is in the lab builds first. A tool the set has no drawing for yet shows its old picture until the drawing is added, and the lab keeps a list of those so none is forgotten. Choose how the icons look Open Settings (Ctrl+,) and find Icons. Pick one: Full colour: two-tone drawings with colour fills. Outline: line drawings in one colour. Outline colour sets the colour; Use the theme colour puts it back. Each app's own drawings: the pictures the app drew for itself, as before. Every layout then shows those instead of the set. The drawings are vectors, so they stay sharp at any size and follow Interface size. They follow the light and dark theme too. What stays the same The tool's name, tooltip, keys and position do not change; only its picture. Arrows that open or close a list (the small carets) are not tool pictures and keep their own shape. The pictures inside a drawing or a model (symbols, hatches, textures) are yours or the library's and are not touched. If a picture is wrong Hover the tool to read its name, then use Report a problem from the Help menu and name the tool; the name tells us which drawing to change.","lang":"en"},{"slug":"layout-toolbox","scope":"basics","title":"Rad s rasporedom s alatnicom i info okvirom","summary":"Prebacite aplikaciju na stupac alata lijevo s mjestima za vaše, info okvir pri vrhu koji prati aktivni alat ili ono što ste odabrali, navigator desno, karticu za svaki pogled, brze opcije i paletu za uređivanje, i vratite se na klasični raspored kad god želite.","section":"start","order":37,"keywords":["raspored","radni prostor","alatnica","stupac alata","info okvir","info traka","navigator","karta projekta","brza traka","brze opcije","paleta za uređivanje","moji alati","omiljeni alati","kartice pogleda","prozor alatnice","klasični raspored","promijeni raspored","prebaci raspored"],"headings":[{"id":"odaberite-ga","text":"Odaberite ga","level":2},{"id":"to-je-gdje","text":"Što je gdje","level":2},{"id":"dajte-alatnici-vlastiti-prozor","text":"Dajte alatnici vlastiti prozor","level":2},{"id":"va-e-plo-e-ostaju-va-e","text":"Vaše ploče ostaju vaše","level":2},{"id":"vratite-se-na-klasi-ni-raspored","text":"Vratite se na klasični raspored","level":2}],"html":"\u003Cp\u003E\u003Cstrong\u003EAlatnica i info okvir\u003C/strong\u003E jedan je od tri radna rasporeda aplikacije. Alati crtanja stoje u stupcu lijevo, info okvir pri vrhu prikazuje što pokrenuti alat traži ili što ste odabrali, svaki pogled ima karticu, a brza traka ispod crteža sadrži nekoliko svakodnevnih opcija. Alati su aplikacijski: sve što možete raditi u klasičnom rasporedu radi i ovdje, a vaš crtež, stil izbornika i prečaci ostaju isti.\u003C/p\u003E\n\u003Ch2 id=\"odaberite-ga\"\u003EOdaberite ga\u003C/h2\u003E\n\u003Col\u003E\u003Cli\u003EOtvorite \u003Cspan class=\"hui\"\u003EPostavke\u003C/span\u003E (zupčanik ili \u003Ckbd class=\"hk\"\u003E\u003Cspan class=\"k-mac\" title=\"Command ,\"\u003E⌘,\u003C/span\u003E\u003Cspan class=\"k-pc\"\u003ECtrl+,\u003C/span\u003E\u003C/kbd\u003E).\u003C/li\u003E\u003Cli\u003EOdaberite karticu \u003Cspan class=\"hui\"\u003EGlobalne\u003C/span\u003E, pa idite na \u003Cspan class=\"hui\"\u003ERaspored\u003C/span\u003E › \u003Cspan class=\"hui\"\u003ERadni prostor\u003C/span\u003E.\u003C/li\u003E\u003Cli\u003EOdaberite \u003Cspan class=\"hui\"\u003EAlatnica i info okvir\u003C/span\u003E.\u003C/li\u003E\u003C/ol\u003E\n\u003Cp\u003ERaspored se mijenja odmah. Izbor vrijedi za sve aplikacije u ovom pregledniku: svaka aplikacija se od tada otvara u njemu, a postavljen je prije nego se stranica iscrta, pa nikad ne vidite klasični raspored prvi.\u003C/p\u003E\n\u003Ch2 id=\"to-je-gdje\"\u003EŠto je gdje\u003C/h2\u003E\n\u003Cul\u003E\u003Cli\u003E\u003Cstrong\u003EAlatna traka:\u003C/strong\u003E alatna traka aplikacije ostaje pri vrhu područja crteža, s izbornicima.\u003C/li\u003E\u003Cli\u003E\u003Cstrong\u003EInfo okvir:\u003C/strong\u003E ispod alatne trake. Dok alat radi, prikazuje alat i što traži. Kad nešto odaberete, prikazuje njegove glavne postavke (za zid: tip, debljinu, duljinu, liniju položaja i visinu), a možete ih ondje mijenjati: promjena je ista kao u \u003Cspan class=\"hui\"\u003ESvojstva\u003C/span\u003E, a \u003Ckbd class=\"hk\"\u003E\u003Cspan class=\"k-mac\" title=\"Command Z\"\u003E⌘Z\u003C/span\u003E\u003Cspan class=\"k-pc\"\u003ECtrl+Z\u003C/span\u003E\u003C/kbd\u003E je poništava. Bez odabira piše „Ništa nije odabrano“. Svaka aplikacija dodaje vlastite okvire ovdje, poput trenutnog sloja ili etaže ili otvorenog dokumenta.\u003C/li\u003E\u003Cli\u003E\u003Cstrong\u003EAlatnica:\u003C/strong\u003E stupac lijevo, alati aplikacije u skupinama. Kliknite naziv skupine da je sklopite ili ponovno otvorite. Alat koji radi je osvijetljen.\u003C/li\u003E\u003Cli\u003E\u003Cstrong\u003EMoji alati:\u003C/strong\u003E prva skupina alatnice, osam praznih mjesta za alate koje najčešće koristite. Kliknite prazno mjesto da odaberete bilo koji alat ili naredbu aplikacije; ili desnom tipkom kliknite alat u alatnici i odaberite \u003Cspan class=\"hui\"\u003EDodaj u Moje alate\u003C/span\u003E; ili povucite alat na mjesto. Desnom tipkom kliknite mjesto da ga promijenite ili ispraznite. Vaša mjesta čuvaju se za svaku aplikaciju u ovom pregledniku.\u003C/li\u003E\u003Cli\u003E\u003Cstrong\u003ENavigator:\u003C/strong\u003E desna ploča. Preglednik projekta aplikacije je na vrhu (tlocrti, presjeci, pročelja, 3D pogledi, specifikacije, listovi, koliko ih aplikacija ima): kliknite jedan da ga otvorite. Ispod njega su \u003Cspan class=\"hui\"\u003ESvojstva\u003C/span\u003E i kartica s ostalim sadržajem desne ploče.\u003C/li\u003E\u003Cli\u003E\u003Cstrong\u003EKartice pogleda:\u003C/strong\u003E kartica za svaki pogled otvorene datoteke (list, tlocrt, scena…), iznad crteža.\u003C/li\u003E\u003Cli\u003E\u003Cstrong\u003EBrza traka:\u003C/strong\u003E ispod crteža, postavke pogleda i svakodnevne opcije koje aplikacija ima, poput mjerila, razine detalja, raspona pogleda, prilagodbe, tlocrta, podjele ili 3D-a, hvatanja i jedinica.\u003C/li\u003E\u003Cli\u003E\u003Cstrong\u003EPaleta za uređivanje:\u003C/strong\u003E kliknite nešto u crtežu pa se uz pokazivač pojavi mala paleta s naredbama za uređivanje, poput pomicanja, kopiranja, zakretanja, zrcaljenja, dupliciranja ili brisanja, te \u003Cspan class=\"hui\"\u003ESvojstva\u003C/span\u003E. \u003Ckbd class=\"hk\"\u003E\u003Cspan class=\"k-mac\" title=\"Esc\"\u003EEsc\u003C/span\u003E\u003Cspan class=\"k-pc\"\u003EEsc\u003C/span\u003E\u003C/kbd\u003E, kotačić miša, drugi klik ili njezin gumb za zatvaranje je sklanjaju.\u003C/li\u003E\u003C/ul\u003E\n\u003Cp\u003EAlat koji trenutno nije moguće pokrenuti osivi se, a njegov savjet kaže zašto. Kliknite ga ili pritisnite \u003Ckbd class=\"hk\"\u003E\u003Cspan class=\"k-mac\" title=\"Return\"\u003EReturn\u003C/span\u003E\u003Cspan class=\"k-pc\"\u003EEnter\u003C/span\u003E\u003C/kbd\u003E na njemu da u okviru pročitate razlog.\u003C/p\u003E\n\u003Cp\u003E\u003Ckbd class=\"hk\"\u003E\u003Cspan class=\"k-mac\" title=\"Esc\"\u003EEsc\u003C/span\u003E\u003Cspan class=\"k-pc\"\u003EEsc\u003C/span\u003E\u003C/kbd\u003E prvo završava pokrenuti alat, kao u klasičnom rasporedu, a svaki prečac i \u003Ckbd class=\"hk\"\u003E\u003Cspan class=\"k-mac\" title=\"Control Shift F\"\u003E⌃⇧F\u003C/span\u003E\u003Cspan class=\"k-pc\"\u003ECtrl+Shift+F\u003C/span\u003E\u003C/kbd\u003E (načini prikaza cijelog zaslona) rade kao i prije.\u003C/p\u003E\n\u003Ch2 id=\"dajte-alatnici-vlastiti-prozor\"\u003EDajte alatnici vlastiti prozor\u003C/h2\u003E\n\u003Cp\u003EGumb \u003Cspan class=\"hui\"\u003EPremjesti alatnicu\u003C/span\u003E pri vrhu alatnice ima \u003Cspan class=\"hui\"\u003EPremjesti u novi prozor\u003C/span\u003E: alatnica se otvara u uskom vlastitom prozoru koji možete staviti uz aplikaciju ili na drugi monitor. Tipke pritisnute tamo stižu do aplikacije. \u003Cspan class=\"hui\"\u003EVrati alatnicu\u003C/span\u003E, ili zatvaranje tog prozora, vraća je kući.\u003C/p\u003E\n\u003Cp\u003EPostavke alatne trake vrijede i za alatnicu: \u003Cspan class=\"hui\"\u003EPostavke\u003C/span\u003E › \u003Cspan class=\"hui\"\u003EGlobalne\u003C/span\u003E › \u003Cspan class=\"hui\"\u003EAlatna traka\u003C/span\u003E › \u003Cspan class=\"hui\"\u003EIkone i oznake\u003C/span\u003E, \u003Cspan class=\"hui\"\u003ESamo ikone\u003C/span\u003E ili \u003Cspan class=\"hui\"\u003ESamo oznake\u003C/span\u003E, te \u003Cspan class=\"hui\"\u003EPrikaži nazive skupina (Datoteka, Crtanje, …)\u003C/span\u003E.\u003C/p\u003E\n\u003Ch2 id=\"va-e-plo-e-ostaju-va-e\"\u003EVaše ploče ostaju vaše\u003C/h2\u003E\n\u003Cp\u003ELijeve i desne ploče zadržavaju sve opisano u \u003Ca href=\"/tutorials/basics/arrange-panels\" data-topic=\"basics/arrange-panels\"\u003ERaspored ploča i drugi monitor\u003C/a\u003E: usidrivanje, odvajanje, prikvačivanje, skrivanje, kartice, \u003Cspan class=\"hui\"\u003EPremjesti u novi prozor\u003C/span\u003E i \u003Cspan class=\"hui\"\u003EVrati raspored na zadano\u003C/span\u003E.\u003C/p\u003E\n\u003Ch2 id=\"vratite-se-na-klasi-ni-raspored\"\u003EVratite se na klasični raspored\u003C/h2\u003E\n\u003Cp\u003EOtvorite \u003Cspan class=\"hui\"\u003EPostavke\u003C/span\u003E › \u003Cspan class=\"hui\"\u003EGlobalne\u003C/span\u003E › \u003Cspan class=\"hui\"\u003ERaspored\u003C/span\u003E › \u003Cspan class=\"hui\"\u003ERadni prostor\u003C/span\u003E i odaberite \u003Cspan class=\"hui\"\u003ECadCraft klasik\u003C/span\u003E. Svaka alatna traka, kartica i ploča vraća se gdje je bila.\u003C/p\u003E\n\u003Caside class=\"hc hc-note\"\u003E\u003Cp class=\"hc-label\"\u003ENote\u003C/p\u003E\n\u003Cp\u003ENa telefonu, ili u prozoru širine 760 piksela ili manje, aplikacija koristi raspored za telefon bez obzira na to što ste odabrali. Širi prozor vraća vaš raspored.\u003C/p\u003E\n\u003C/aside\u003E\n\u003Cp\u003EZa isprobavanje drugog rasporeda pogledajte \u003Ca href=\"/tutorials/basics/layout-ribbon\" data-topic=\"basics/layout-ribbon\"\u003Eraspored s vrpcom i pregledom projekta\u003C/a\u003E.\u003C/p\u003E\n\u003Cp\u003EZa promjenu onoga što ovaj raspored prikazuje pogledajte \u003Ca href=\"/tutorials/basics/layout-edit\" data-topic=\"basics/layout-edit\"\u003EPromjena rasporeda na zaslonu\u003C/a\u003E; za tamni raspored s izbornikom i vrpcom pogledajte \u003Ca href=\"/tutorials/basics/layout-drafting\" data-topic=\"basics/layout-drafting\"\u003Eraspored Drafting\u003C/a\u003E.\u003C/p\u003E","text":"Alatnica i info okvir jedan je od tri radna rasporeda aplikacije. Alati crtanja stoje u stupcu lijevo, info okvir pri vrhu prikazuje što pokrenuti alat traži ili što ste odabrali, svaki pogled ima karticu, a brza traka ispod crteža sadrži nekoliko svakodnevnih opcija. Alati su aplikacijski: sve što možete raditi u klasičnom rasporedu radi i ovdje, a vaš crtež, stil izbornika i prečaci ostaju isti. Odaberite ga Otvorite Postavke (zupčanik ili Ctrl+,). Odaberite karticu Globalne, pa idite na Raspored › Radni prostor. Odaberite Alatnica i info okvir. Raspored se mijenja odmah. Izbor vrijedi za sve aplikacije u ovom pregledniku: svaka aplikacija se od tada otvara u njemu, a postavljen je prije nego se stranica iscrta, pa nikad ne vidite klasični raspored prvi. Što je gdje Alatna traka: alatna traka aplikacije ostaje pri vrhu područja crteža, s izbornicima. Info okvir: ispod alatne trake. Dok alat radi, prikazuje alat i što traži. Kad nešto odaberete, prikazuje njegove glavne postavke (za zid: tip, debljinu, duljinu, liniju položaja i visinu), a možete ih ondje mijenjati: promjena je ista kao u Svojstva, a Ctrl+Z je poništava. Bez odabira piše „Ništa nije odabrano“. Svaka aplikacija dodaje vlastite okvire ovdje, poput trenutnog sloja ili etaže ili otvorenog dokumenta. Alatnica: stupac lijevo, alati aplikacije u skupinama. Kliknite naziv skupine da je sklopite ili ponovno otvorite. Alat koji radi je osvijetljen. Moji alati: prva skupina alatnice, osam praznih mjesta za alate koje najčešće koristite. Kliknite prazno mjesto da odaberete bilo koji alat ili naredbu aplikacije; ili desnom tipkom kliknite alat u alatnici i odaberite Dodaj u Moje alate; ili povucite alat na mjesto. Desnom tipkom kliknite mjesto da ga promijenite ili ispraznite. Vaša mjesta čuvaju se za svaku aplikaciju u ovom pregledniku. Navigator: desna ploča. Preglednik projekta aplikacije je na vrhu (tlocrti, presjeci, pročelja, 3D pogledi, specifikacije, listovi, koliko ih aplikacija ima): kliknite jedan da ga otvorite. Ispod njega su Svojstva i kartica s ostalim sadržajem desne ploče. Kartice pogleda: kartica za svaki pogled otvorene datoteke (list, tlocrt, scena…), iznad crteža. Brza traka: ispod crteža, postavke pogleda i svakodnevne opcije koje aplikacija ima, poput mjerila, razine detalja, raspona pogleda, prilagodbe, tlocrta, podjele ili 3D-a, hvatanja i jedinica. Paleta za uređivanje: kliknite nešto u crtežu pa se uz pokazivač pojavi mala paleta s naredbama za uređivanje, poput pomicanja, kopiranja, zakretanja, zrcaljenja, dupliciranja ili brisanja, te Svojstva. Esc, kotačić miša, drugi klik ili njezin gumb za zatvaranje je sklanjaju. Alat koji trenutno nije moguće pokrenuti osivi se, a njegov savjet kaže zašto. Kliknite ga ili pritisnite Enter na njemu da u okviru pročitate razlog. Esc prvo završava pokrenuti alat, kao u klasičnom rasporedu, a svaki prečac i Ctrl+Shift+F (načini prikaza cijelog zaslona) rade kao i prije. Dajte alatnici vlastiti prozor Gumb Premjesti alatnicu pri vrhu alatnice ima Premjesti u novi prozor: alatnica se otvara u uskom vlastitom prozoru koji možete staviti uz aplikaciju ili na drugi monitor. Tipke pritisnute tamo stižu do aplikacije. Vrati alatnicu, ili zatvaranje tog prozora, vraća je kući. Postavke alatne trake vrijede i za alatnicu: Postavke › Globalne › Alatna traka › Ikone i oznake, Samo ikone ili Samo oznake, te Prikaži nazive skupina (Datoteka, Crtanje, …). Vaše ploče ostaju vaše Lijeve i desne ploče zadržavaju sve opisano u Raspored ploča i drugi monitor: usidrivanje, odvajanje, prikvačivanje, skrivanje, kartice, Premjesti u novi prozor i Vrati raspored na zadano. Vratite se na klasični raspored Otvorite Postavke › Globalne › Raspored › Radni prostor i odaberite CadCraft klasik. Svaka alatna traka, kartica i ploča vraća se gdje je bila. Na telefonu, ili u prozoru širine 760 piksela ili manje, aplikacija koristi raspored za telefon bez obzira na to što ste odabrali. Širi prozor vraća vaš raspored. Za isprobavanje drugog rasporeda pogledajte raspored s vrpcom i pregledom projekta. Za promjenu onoga što ovaj raspored prikazuje pogledajte Promjena rasporeda na zaslonu; za tamni raspored s izbornikom i vrpcom pogledajte raspored Drafting.","lang":"hr"},{"slug":"layout-own","scope":"basics","title":"Složite vlastiti raspored i spremite postave","summary":"Odaberite koja ploča prikazuje preglednik projekta, Svojstva ili vlastiti sadržaj ploče, gdje je alatnica i što sadrže trake, spremite to kao vlastiti raspored i čuvajte cijele postave pod nazivom između kojih možete prebacivati.","section":"start","order":39,"keywords":["raspored","radni prostor","složi","prilagodba","moj raspored","vlastiti raspored","ploče","uređivači","preglednik projekta","svojstva","alatnica","brza traka","info okvir","radno okruženje","postava","profil","spremi postavu","prebaci postavu","izvezi postavu","uvezi postavu","ccenv"],"headings":[{"id":"slo-ite-vlastiti-raspored","text":"Složite vlastiti raspored","level":2},{"id":"spremite-postavu-kao-radno-okru-enje","text":"Spremite postavu kao radno okruženje","level":2}],"html":"\u003Cp\u003EOsim tri ugrađena rasporeda možete složiti vlastiti i cijelu postavu spremiti pod nazivom pa se u jednom koraku možete vratiti na nju.\u003C/p\u003E\n\u003Ch2 id=\"slo-ite-vlastiti-raspored\"\u003ESložite vlastiti raspored\u003C/h2\u003E\n\u003Col\u003E\u003Cli\u003EOtvorite \u003Cspan class=\"hui\"\u003EPostavke\u003C/span\u003E (zupčanik ili \u003Ckbd class=\"hk\"\u003E\u003Cspan class=\"k-mac\" title=\"Command ,\"\u003E⌘,\u003C/span\u003E\u003Cspan class=\"k-pc\"\u003ECtrl+,\u003C/span\u003E\u003C/kbd\u003E), odaberite \u003Cspan class=\"hui\"\u003EGlobalne\u003C/span\u003E, pa \u003Cspan class=\"hui\"\u003ERaspored\u003C/span\u003E.\u003C/li\u003E\u003Cli\u003EOdaberite \u003Cspan class=\"hui\"\u003ERasporedite vlastiti raspored…\u003C/span\u003E. Dijaloški okvir kreće od rasporeda koji sada koristite.\u003C/li\u003E\u003Cli\u003EDajte mu naziv, pa odaberite:\u003Cul\u003E\u003Cli\u003E\u003Cstrong\u003EIznad crteža:\u003C/strong\u003E alatnu traku aplikacije, vrpcu ili ništa; naslovnu traku; info okvir i koje kontrole sadrži.\u003C/li\u003E\u003Cli\u003E\u003Cstrong\u003EUz crtež:\u003C/strong\u003E alatnica lijevo, desno ili nikako, s \u003Cspan class=\"hui\"\u003EMoji alati\u003C/span\u003E ili bez njih; koja ploča drži palete, koja je na vrhu (preglednik projekta ili Svojstva, na primjer), a koje su kartice ispod nje.\u003C/li\u003E\u003Cli\u003E\u003Cstrong\u003EPodručje crteža:\u003C/strong\u003E kartice pogleda, brza traka i traka pogleda s kontrolama koje označite, paleta za uređivanje, statusna traka.\u003C/li\u003E\u003Cli\u003E\u003Cstrong\u003EIzgled:\u003C/strong\u003E veličina, obrubi gumba i stil kartica.\u003C/li\u003E\u003C/ul\u003E\u003C/li\u003E\u003Cli\u003EOdaberite \u003Cspan class=\"hui\"\u003EKoristi ovaj raspored\u003C/span\u003E. Aplikacija se odmah prebacuje na njega, a svaka aplikacija koja ima rasporede također ga koristi.\u003C/li\u003E\u003C/ol\u003E\n\u003Cp\u003ENudi se samo ono što ova aplikacija ima. Vaš raspored naveden je pod \u003Cspan class=\"hui\"\u003EIz dodataka i datoteka\u003C/span\u003E; \u003Cspan class=\"hui\"\u003EIzvezi ovaj raspored\u003C/span\u003E sprema ga kao datoteku koju možete dati kolegi, a gumb za uklanjanje ga briše. Ploče koje ispunjava i dalje se usidruju, odvajaju i premještaju u vlastite prozore, kao u \u003Ca href=\"/tutorials/basics/arrange-panels\" data-topic=\"basics/arrange-panels\"\u003ERaspored ploča i drugi monitor\u003C/a\u003E.\u003C/p\u003E\n\u003Ch2 id=\"spremite-postavu-kao-radno-okru-enje\"\u003ESpremite postavu kao radno okruženje\u003C/h2\u003E\n\u003Cp\u003ERadno okruženje je vaša cijela postava za svaku aplikaciju u ovom pregledniku: raspored, stil izbornika i prečaci, stil alatne trake, ploče i njihove veličine te \u003Cspan class=\"hui\"\u003EMoji alati\u003C/span\u003E. Tema i jezik nisu dio toga.\u003C/p\u003E\n\u003Cul\u003E\u003Cli\u003E\u003Cstrong\u003ESpremanje:\u003C/strong\u003E upišite naziv pod \u003Cspan class=\"hui\"\u003ERadna okruženja\u003C/span\u003E i odaberite \u003Cspan class=\"hui\"\u003ESpremi moju postavu\u003C/span\u003E. Spremanje pod nazivom koji postoji zamjenjuje tu postavu.\u003C/li\u003E\u003Cli\u003E\u003Cstrong\u003EPrebacivanje:\u003C/strong\u003E odaberite postavu na popisu i odaberite \u003Cspan class=\"hui\"\u003EPrebaci se na nju\u003C/span\u003E. Aplikacija se ponovno učitava u toj postavi; ako imate nespremljene promjene, aplikacija prvo pita, kao i kod svakog ponovnog učitavanja.\u003C/li\u003E\u003Cli\u003E\u003Cstrong\u003EDijeljenje:\u003C/strong\u003E \u003Cspan class=\"hui\"\u003EIzvezi\u003C/span\u003E sprema odabranu postavu kao datoteku \u003Ccode\u003E.ccenv.json\u003C/code\u003E; \u003Cspan class=\"hui\"\u003EUvezi postavu…\u003C/span\u003E dodaje postavu iz datoteke. Datoteka postavlja samo ove izbore i ništa drugo.\u003C/li\u003E\u003Cli\u003E\u003Cstrong\u003EUklanjanje:\u003C/strong\u003E odaberite postavu i odaberite \u003Cspan class=\"hui\"\u003EUkloni\u003C/span\u003E.\u003C/li\u003E\u003C/ul\u003E\n\u003Cp\u003EMožete čuvati do dvanaest postava.\u003C/p\u003E\n\u003Cp\u003EDa promijenite raspored bez otvaranja dijaloga (povucite blok, desnom tipkom kliknite alat), pogledajte \u003Ca href=\"/tutorials/basics/layout-edit\" data-topic=\"basics/layout-edit\"\u003EPromjena rasporeda na zaslonu\u003C/a\u003E. Da prvo isprobate ugrađene rasporede, pogledajte \u003Ca href=\"/tutorials/basics/layout-toolbox\" data-topic=\"basics/layout-toolbox\"\u003Eraspored s alatnicom i info okvirom\u003C/a\u003E, \u003Ca href=\"/tutorials/basics/layout-ribbon\" data-topic=\"basics/layout-ribbon\"\u003Eraspored s vrpcom i pregledom projekta\u003C/a\u003E i \u003Ca href=\"/tutorials/basics/layout-drafting\" data-topic=\"basics/layout-drafting\"\u003Eraspored Drafting\u003C/a\u003E.\u003C/p\u003E","text":"Osim tri ugrađena rasporeda možete složiti vlastiti i cijelu postavu spremiti pod nazivom pa se u jednom koraku možete vratiti na nju. Složite vlastiti raspored Otvorite Postavke (zupčanik ili Ctrl+,), odaberite Globalne, pa Raspored. Odaberite Rasporedite vlastiti raspored…. Dijaloški okvir kreće od rasporeda koji sada koristite. Dajte mu naziv, pa odaberite: Iznad crteža: alatnu traku aplikacije, vrpcu ili ništa; naslovnu traku; info okvir i koje kontrole sadrži. Uz crtež: alatnica lijevo, desno ili nikako, s Moji alati ili bez njih; koja ploča drži palete, koja je na vrhu (preglednik projekta ili Svojstva, na primjer), a koje su kartice ispod nje. Područje crteža: kartice pogleda, brza traka i traka pogleda s kontrolama koje označite, paleta za uređivanje, statusna traka. Izgled: veličina, obrubi gumba i stil kartica. Odaberite Koristi ovaj raspored. Aplikacija se odmah prebacuje na njega, a svaka aplikacija koja ima rasporede također ga koristi. Nudi se samo ono što ova aplikacija ima. Vaš raspored naveden je pod Iz dodataka i datoteka; Izvezi ovaj raspored sprema ga kao datoteku koju možete dati kolegi, a gumb za uklanjanje ga briše. Ploče koje ispunjava i dalje se usidruju, odvajaju i premještaju u vlastite prozore, kao u Raspored ploča i drugi monitor. Spremite postavu kao radno okruženje Radno okruženje je vaša cijela postava za svaku aplikaciju u ovom pregledniku: raspored, stil izbornika i prečaci, stil alatne trake, ploče i njihove veličine te Moji alati. Tema i jezik nisu dio toga. Spremanje: upišite naziv pod Radna okruženja i odaberite Spremi moju postavu. Spremanje pod nazivom koji postoji zamjenjuje tu postavu. Prebacivanje: odaberite postavu na popisu i odaberite Prebaci se na nju. Aplikacija se ponovno učitava u toj postavi; ako imate nespremljene promjene, aplikacija prvo pita, kao i kod svakog ponovnog učitavanja. Dijeljenje: Izvezi sprema odabranu postavu kao datoteku .ccenv.json; Uvezi postavu… dodaje postavu iz datoteke. Datoteka postavlja samo ove izbore i ništa drugo. Uklanjanje: odaberite postavu i odaberite Ukloni. Možete čuvati do dvanaest postava. Da promijenite raspored bez otvaranja dijaloga (povucite blok, desnom tipkom kliknite alat), pogledajte Promjena rasporeda na zaslonu. Da prvo isprobate ugrađene rasporede, pogledajte raspored s alatnicom i info okvirom, raspored s vrpcom i pregledom projekta i raspored Drafting.","lang":"hr"},{"slug":"addons-basics","scope":"basics","title":"Add-ons and your account list","summary":"How add-ons work in every app and edition. Add one once in the Library and it follows your account, loads the first time an app needs it, and updates inside its major version. Sign in on a computer, pin a version, add a package from a file, or keep working offline.","section":"start","order":40,"keywords":["add-ons","library","add","remove","update","pin","lab channel","your add-ons","sign in","offline","offline on this device","use offline","add from a file","download as a file","drag and drop","ccaddon","package","paid","licence","entitlement","this file uses","engine","needs","orphan","team add-ons"],"headings":[{"id":"what-an-add-on-is","text":"What an add-on is","level":2},{"id":"your-list","text":"Your list","level":2},{"id":"needs","text":"Needs","level":2},{"id":"files-that-use-add-ons","text":"Files that use add-ons","level":2},{"id":"skill-packs-and-agents","text":"Skill packs and agents","level":2},{"id":"offline","text":"Offline","level":2},{"id":"add-from-a-file","text":"Add from a file","level":2},{"id":"paid-add-ons-offline","text":"Paid add-ons offline","level":2},{"id":"ipad-and-iphone","text":"iPad and iPhone","level":2}],"html":"\u003Ch2 id=\"what-an-add-on-is\"\u003EWhat an add-on is\u003C/h2\u003E\n\u003Cp\u003EAn add-on adds features (a new tool or panel) or data (regulation packs, materials, trade packs) to an app. You add it once in the \u003Cspan class=\"hui\"\u003ELibrary\u003C/span\u003E and it is on your account list, so it follows you to every edition: the browser, Studio, the portable build and the apps on a tablet.\u003C/p\u003E\n\u003Ch2 id=\"your-list\"\u003EYour list\u003C/h2\u003E\n\u003Cp\u003EOpen \u003Cspan class=\"hui\"\u003ESettings\u003C/span\u003E › \u003Cspan class=\"hui\"\u003EAdd-ons\u003C/span\u003E › \u003Cspan class=\"hui\"\u003EYour add-ons\u003C/span\u003E.\u003C/p\u003E\n\u003Cul\u003E\u003Cli\u003E\u003Cstrong\u003ESign in\u003C/strong\u003E connects this app to your account. Signed out, the app keeps a list for this device only, and offers to merge it into your account when you sign in. In Studio the sign-in shows a short code to approve in your browser.\u003C/li\u003E\u003Cli\u003E\u003Cstrong\u003ERemove\u003C/strong\u003E takes an add-on off the list. It is refused while another add-on you keep needs it, and the screen names that add-on. When you remove something, anything that was brought in only for it is taken off too, and the screen says which.\u003C/li\u003E\u003Cli\u003E\u003Cstrong\u003ECheck for updates\u003C/strong\u003E lists every change together. Updates inside the same major version arrive by themselves. A new major version, a changed permission, a pinned version or a lab version always asks you first, and an update is all or nothing: if one file fails its check, nothing changes.\u003C/li\u003E\u003Cli\u003E\u003Cstrong\u003EKeep a version\u003C/strong\u003E pins it. \u003Cstrong\u003EFollow newest\u003C/strong\u003E unpins it. \u003Cstrong\u003ETry lab versions\u003C/strong\u003E moves one add-on to the lab channel.\u003C/li\u003E\u003Cli\u003E\u003Cstrong\u003ERoll back\u003C/strong\u003E returns to the version you had.\u003C/li\u003E\u003C/ul\u003E\n\u003Ch2 id=\"needs\"\u003ENeeds\u003C/h2\u003E\n\u003Cp\u003EAn add-on can need other add-ons or a shared engine. Add brings them along and tells you what it also adds, how big it is and which permissions it asks for. Engines are shared: one copy serves everything that needs it, and a copy nothing needs is freed after 30 days.\u003C/p\u003E\n\u003Ch2 id=\"files-that-use-add-ons\"\u003EFiles that use add-ons\u003C/h2\u003E\n\u003Cp\u003EA drawing remembers the add-ons whose data it holds. Open it on a computer that does not have them and the app says &quot;This file uses ...&quot; and offers to add them. Until you do, the data stays in the file untouched.\u003C/p\u003E\n\u003Ch2 id=\"skill-packs-and-agents\"\u003ESkill packs and agents\u003C/h2\u003E\n\u003Cp\u003EThe add-on directory at \u003Cspan class=\"hui\"\u003EAdd-ons\u003C/span\u003E on getcadcraft.com also lists skill packs and agents for your own AI assistant. They are text only: a skill pack is instructions your assistant reads, an agent is a listing that describes a program someone wrote that uses the apps&#039; tools. We host, run and vouch for none of an outside maker&#039;s code, and they have no price here. Open them with the \u003Cspan class=\"hui\"\u003ESkill packs\u003C/span\u003E and \u003Cspan class=\"hui\"\u003EAgents\u003C/span\u003E filters.\u003C/p\u003E\n\u003Cp\u003ETo offer one, a verified member or lab tester uses \u003Cspan class=\"hui\"\u003ESend a skill pack\u003C/span\u003E or \u003Cspan class=\"hui\"\u003ESend an agent listing\u003C/span\u003E in the directory once submissions are open. A person on our team reads every submission before it is listed, and the same review decides it as for any add-on.\u003C/p\u003E\n\u003Ch2 id=\"offline\"\u003EOffline\u003C/h2\u003E\n\u003Cp\u003E\u003Cspan class=\"hui\"\u003EDownload everything for offline\u003C/span\u003E fetches every add-on on your list. Once fetched, Studio and the portable build work with no connection. Each download is checked against its checksum and its signature before it is used.\u003C/p\u003E\n\u003Cp\u003EIn a browser, the website does the same for your whole list in one go: open \u003Cstrong\u003EYour add-ons\u003C/strong\u003E on getcadcraft.com and choose \u003Cstrong\u003EMake my add-ons available offline\u003C/strong\u003E under \u003Cstrong\u003EOffline on this device\u003C/strong\u003E, in the browser you will take with you. The check below it says how many are ready, how much is stored and when, and names anything missing or out of date. Add-ons that come inside an app are ready once that app is saved for offline (\u003Cspan class=\"hui\"\u003ESave for offline\u003C/span\u003E in the app bar). Browsers can clear stored files when space runs low, so look at that check before you go.\u003C/p\u003E\n\u003Cp\u003EWith no account, the Library keeps a list for this browser (&quot;Your add-ons in this browser&quot;) with the same button; \u003Cstrong\u003EUse offline\u003C/strong\u003E on an add-on&#039;s page adds it there and fetches it at once. Free add-ons only. Sign up and the list moves onto your account.\u003C/p\u003E\n\u003Ch2 id=\"add-from-a-file\"\u003EAdd from a file\u003C/h2\u003E\n\u003Cp\u003EOn an add-on&#039;s page, \u003Cstrong\u003EDownload as a file\u003C/strong\u003E saves its signed package (a \u003Ccode\u003E.ccaddon.json\u003C/code\u003E file). In the app, \u003Cspan class=\"hui\"\u003EAdd from a file\u003C/span\u003E under \u003Cspan class=\"hui\"\u003EYour add-ons\u003C/span\u003E takes that file with no connection needed, or drop the file onto the app&#039;s window. The app checks the signature first and refuses a file that was changed, is not signed by getcadcraft.com, or is made for another app. Reload the app to use it.\u003C/p\u003E\n\u003Ch2 id=\"paid-add-ons-offline\"\u003EPaid add-ons offline\u003C/h2\u003E\n\u003Cp\u003EA paid add-on keeps working offline through its licence on the device: a signed entitlement that lasts up to 30 days from the last time the app (or the Your add-ons page) was online, and never past the end of what you bought. Going online again renews it. A paid package file only installs on a device that holds a licence for it.\u003C/p\u003E\n\u003Ch2 id=\"ipad-and-iphone\"\u003EiPad and iPhone\u003C/h2\u003E\n\u003Cp\u003EAdd-ons that are only data download as usual. Code add-ons made by CadCraft are already inside the app and are switched on from your list. Code add-ons from outside makers are not offered on the iPad and iPhone apps; the browser app (Add to Home Screen) has them.\u003C/p\u003E","text":"What an add-on is An add-on adds features (a new tool or panel) or data (regulation packs, materials, trade packs) to an app. You add it once in the Library and it is on your account list, so it follows you to every edition: the browser, Studio, the portable build and the apps on a tablet. Your list Open Settings › Add-ons › Your add-ons. Sign in connects this app to your account. Signed out, the app keeps a list for this device only, and offers to merge it into your account when you sign in. In Studio the sign-in shows a short code to approve in your browser. Remove takes an add-on off the list. It is refused while another add-on you keep needs it, and the screen names that add-on. When you remove something, anything that was brought in only for it is taken off too, and the screen says which. Check for updates lists every change together. Updates inside the same major version arrive by themselves. A new major version, a changed permission, a pinned version or a lab version always asks you first, and an update is all or nothing: if one file fails its check, nothing changes. Keep a version pins it. Follow newest unpins it. Try lab versions moves one add-on to the lab channel. Roll back returns to the version you had. Needs An add-on can need other add-ons or a shared engine. Add brings them along and tells you what it also adds, how big it is and which permissions it asks for. Engines are shared: one copy serves everything that needs it, and a copy nothing needs is freed after 30 days. Files that use add-ons A drawing remembers the add-ons whose data it holds. Open it on a computer that does not have them and the app says \"This file uses ...\" and offers to add them. Until you do, the data stays in the file untouched. Skill packs and agents The add-on directory at Add-ons on getcadcraft.com also lists skill packs and agents for your own AI assistant. They are text only: a skill pack is instructions your assistant reads, an agent is a listing that describes a program someone wrote that uses the apps' tools. We host, run and vouch for none of an outside maker's code, and they have no price here. Open them with the Skill packs and Agents filters. To offer one, a verified member or lab tester uses Send a skill pack or Send an agent listing in the directory once submissions are open. A person on our team reads every submission before it is listed, and the same review decides it as for any add-on. Offline Download everything for offline fetches every add-on on your list. Once fetched, Studio and the portable build work with no connection. Each download is checked against its checksum and its signature before it is used. In a browser, the website does the same for your whole list in one go: open Your add-ons on getcadcraft.com and choose Make my add-ons available offline under Offline on this device, in the browser you will take with you. The check below it says how many are ready, how much is stored and when, and names anything missing or out of date. Add-ons that come inside an app are ready once that app is saved for offline (Save for offline in the app bar). Browsers can clear stored files when space runs low, so look at that check before you go. With no account, the Library keeps a list for this browser (\"Your add-ons in this browser\") with the same button; Use offline on an add-on's page adds it there and fetches it at once. Free add-ons only. Sign up and the list moves onto your account. Add from a file On an add-on's page, Download as a file saves its signed package (a .ccaddon.json file). In the app, Add from a file under Your add-ons takes that file with no connection needed, or drop the file onto the app's window. The app checks the signature first and refuses a file that was changed, is not signed by getcadcraft.com, or is made for another app. Reload the app to use it. Paid add-ons offline A paid add-on keeps working offline through its licence on the device: a signed entitlement that lasts up to 30 days from the last time the app (or the Your add-ons page) was online, and never past the end of what you bought. Going online again renews it. A paid package file only installs on a device that holds a licence for it. iPad and iPhone Add-ons that are only data download as usual. Code add-ons made by CadCraft are already inside the app and are switched on from your list. Code add-ons from outside makers are not offered on the iPad and iPhone apps; the browser app (Add to Home Screen) has them.","lang":"en"},{"slug":"layout-edit","scope":"basics","title":"Change a layout on the screen","summary":"Drag a block to another place, right-click a tool to remove, move or add one, and keep the result as a layout of your own that you can export.","section":"start","order":40,"keywords":["layout","arrange","drag","handle","move block","right-click","tool","remove tool","add tool","new group","rename group","my layout","reset","undo","workspace","customize ribbon","customize toolbox"],"headings":[{"id":"move-a-block","text":"Move a block","level":2},{"id":"change-what-a-block-holds","text":"Change what a block holds","level":2},{"id":"switch-layouts","text":"Switch layouts","level":2},{"id":"keep-it","text":"Keep it","level":2}],"html":"\u003Cp\u003EYou can change a layout without leaving the drawing. The built-in layout is never changed: your first change makes a copy named \u003Cspan class=\"hui\"\u003EMy\u003C/span\u003E and the layout&#039;s name, and every later change edits that copy.\u003C/p\u003E\n\u003Ch2 id=\"move-a-block\"\u003EMove a block\u003C/h2\u003E\n\u003Col\u003E\u003Cli\u003EOpen \u003Cspan class=\"hui\"\u003ESettings\u003C/span\u003E (the gear, or \u003Ckbd class=\"hk\"\u003E\u003Cspan class=\"k-mac\" title=\"Command ,\"\u003E⌘,\u003C/span\u003E\u003Cspan class=\"k-pc\"\u003ECtrl+,\u003C/span\u003E\u003C/kbd\u003E), choose \u003Cspan class=\"hui\"\u003EGlobal\u003C/span\u003E, then \u003Cspan class=\"hui\"\u003ELayout\u003C/span\u003E, and choose \u003Cspan class=\"hui\"\u003EArrange your own layout…\u003C/span\u003E. With a layout on, the screen goes into Arrange mode and the dialog closes.\u003C/li\u003E\u003Cli\u003EEvery block (the ribbon, the tool rows, the toolbox, the palettes, the status bar and the others) has a small handle at its corner. Drag a handle: a map of the places appears. The places the block can go to are outlined; the others are dimmed and say why.\u003C/li\u003E\u003Cli\u003EDrop the block on a place. The layout changes at once.\u003C/li\u003E\u003Cli\u003EThe bar at the bottom has \u003Cspan class=\"hui\"\u003EUndo\u003C/span\u003E and \u003Cspan class=\"hui\"\u003ERedo\u003C/span\u003E for each move, \u003Cspan class=\"hui\"\u003EReset\u003C/span\u003E to bring the built-in layout back, and \u003Cspan class=\"hui\"\u003EDone\u003C/span\u003E.\u003C/li\u003E\u003C/ol\u003E\n\u003Cp\u003EWithout a mouse: put the focus on a handle and press \u003Ckbd class=\"hk\"\u003E\u003Cspan class=\"k-mac\" title=\"Return\"\u003EReturn\u003C/span\u003E\u003Cspan class=\"k-pc\"\u003EEnter\u003C/span\u003E\u003C/kbd\u003E. A list of the places that block may go to opens; choose one.\u003C/p\u003E\n\u003Ch2 id=\"change-what-a-block-holds\"\u003EChange what a block holds\u003C/h2\u003E\n\u003Cp\u003ERight-click a tool in the ribbon, the tool rows or the toolbox:\u003C/p\u003E\n\u003Cul\u003E\u003Cli\u003E\u003Cspan class=\"hui\"\u003ERemove from here\u003C/span\u003E takes the tool out of its group (the tool is still in the app; it is only not shown here).\u003C/li\u003E\u003Cli\u003E\u003Cspan class=\"hui\"\u003EMove earlier\u003C/span\u003E and \u003Cspan class=\"hui\"\u003EMove later\u003C/span\u003E change its place in the group.\u003C/li\u003E\u003Cli\u003E\u003Cspan class=\"hui\"\u003EAdd a tool\u003C/span\u003E lists the app&#039;s tools and then every command the app has; the one you pick goes after the tool you clicked.\u003C/li\u003E\u003Cli\u003E\u003Cspan class=\"hui\"\u003ENew group\u003C/span\u003E and \u003Cspan class=\"hui\"\u003ERename the group\u003C/span\u003E make a group and name it.\u003C/li\u003E\u003Cli\u003E\u003Cspan class=\"hui\"\u003EReset this block\u003C/span\u003E gives the block back the tools the app offers.\u003C/li\u003E\u003C/ul\u003E\n\u003Ch2 id=\"switch-layouts\"\u003ESwitch layouts\u003C/h2\u003E\n\u003Cp\u003ELayouts are chosen in \u003Cspan class=\"hui\"\u003ESettings\u003C/span\u003E › \u003Cspan class=\"hui\"\u003EGlobal\u003C/span\u003E › \u003Cspan class=\"hui\"\u003ELayout\u003C/span\u003E: your own layouts first, then the built-in ones and \u003Cspan class=\"hui\"\u003EClassic\u003C/span\u003E. Choosing one does not reload the app.\u003C/p\u003E\n\u003Ch2 id=\"keep-it\"\u003EKeep it\u003C/h2\u003E\n\u003Cp\u003EYour layout is listed in Settings under \u003Cspan class=\"hui\"\u003EFrom add-ons and files\u003C/span\u003E. \u003Cspan class=\"hui\"\u003EExport this layout\u003C/span\u003E saves it as a file you can give a colleague or check on the developers&#039; layouts page. The file only says where blocks go and which tools they hold: no code.\u003C/p\u003E\n\u003Cp\u003ESee also \u003Ca href=\"/tutorials/basics/layout-own\" data-topic=\"basics/layout-own\"\u003EArrange your own layout and save your setups\u003C/a\u003E.\u003C/p\u003E","text":"You can change a layout without leaving the drawing. The built-in layout is never changed: your first change makes a copy named My and the layout's name, and every later change edits that copy. Move a block Open Settings (the gear, or Ctrl+,), choose Global, then Layout, and choose Arrange your own layout…. With a layout on, the screen goes into Arrange mode and the dialog closes. Every block (the ribbon, the tool rows, the toolbox, the palettes, the status bar and the others) has a small handle at its corner. Drag a handle: a map of the places appears. The places the block can go to are outlined; the others are dimmed and say why. Drop the block on a place. The layout changes at once. The bar at the bottom has Undo and Redo for each move, Reset to bring the built-in layout back, and Done. Without a mouse: put the focus on a handle and press Enter. A list of the places that block may go to opens; choose one. Change what a block holds Right-click a tool in the ribbon, the tool rows or the toolbox: Remove from here takes the tool out of its group (the tool is still in the app; it is only not shown here). Move earlier and Move later change its place in the group. Add a tool lists the app's tools and then every command the app has; the one you pick goes after the tool you clicked. New group and Rename the group make a group and name it. Reset this block gives the block back the tools the app offers. Switch layouts Layouts are chosen in Settings › Global › Layout: your own layouts first, then the built-in ones and Classic. Choosing one does not reload the app. Keep it Your layout is listed in Settings under From add-ons and files. Export this layout saves it as a file you can give a colleague or check on the developers' layouts page. The file only says where blocks go and which tools they hold: no code. See also Arrange your own layout and save your setups.","lang":"en"},{"slug":"offline","scope":"basics","title":"Rad offline","summary":"Spremite aplikaciju za korištenje offline, što radi bez veze i što je treba.","section":"start","order":40,"keywords":["offline","bez interneta","zrakoplovni način","posjet gradilištu","predmemorija","service worker","instalacija","preuzimanje","veza"],"headings":[{"id":"spremite-aplikaciju-za-kori-tenje-offline","text":"Spremite aplikaciju za korištenje offline","level":2},{"id":"to-radi-offline","text":"Što radi offline","level":2},{"id":"to-treba-vezu","text":"Što treba vezu","level":2},{"id":"dobro-je-znati","text":"Dobro je znati","level":2}],"html":"\u003Cp\u003EAplikacije obavljaju posao na vašem računalu, pa većina njih radi bez veze. Preglednik samo prije mora imati spremljene datoteke aplikacije.\u003C/p\u003E\n\u003Ch2 id=\"spremite-aplikaciju-za-kori-tenje-offline\"\u003ESpremite aplikaciju za korištenje offline\u003C/h2\u003E\n\u003Col\u003E\u003Cli\u003EOtvorite aplikaciju dok ste online.\u003C/li\u003E\u003Cli\u003EOdaberite \u003Cspan class=\"hui\"\u003ESpremi za offline\u003C/span\u003E u traci na vrhu.\u003C/li\u003E\u003Cli\u003EPričekajte „Spremno za offline“. Datoteke aplikacije, njezini čitači datoteka i ova pomoć sada su spremljeni u vašem pregledniku. Aplikacije koje čitaju DWG ili PDF datoteke spremaju i svoje čitače, pa to prvi put može potrajati minutu.\u003C/li\u003E\u003C/ol\u003E\n\u003Cp\u003EUčinite to jednom za svaku aplikaciju u svakom pregledniku koji koristite. Da se aplikaciji kasnije vratite bez veze, otvorite istu adresu kao prije ili njezinu zabilješku.\u003C/p\u003E\n\u003Cdiv class=\"hv\" data-v=\"net:offline\"\u003E\u003Cp class=\"hv-label\"\u003EOffline\u003C/p\u003E\n\u003Cp\u003ESada ste offline. Ako je ova aplikacija spremljena za korištenje offline, sve ispod radi. Ako nije, i dalje možete koristiti ono što je već učitano u ovoj kartici, ali ne učitavajte je ponovno dok opet ne budete online.\u003C/p\u003E\n\u003C/div\u003E\n\u003Ch2 id=\"to-radi-offline\"\u003EŠto radi offline\u003C/h2\u003E\n\u003Cul\u003E\u003Cli\u003EOtvaranje datoteka s vašeg računala, crtanje, uređivanje, mjerenje i provjera.\u003C/li\u003E\u003Cli\u003ESpremanje i izvoz: svako spremanje je preuzimanje na vaše računalo.\u003C/li\u003E\u003Cli\u003EOva pomoć, uključujući pretragu.\u003C/li\u003E\u003C/ul\u003E\n\u003Ch2 id=\"to-treba-vezu\"\u003EŠto treba vezu\u003C/h2\u003E\n\u003Cul\u003E\u003Cli\u003EPrvo otvaranje aplikacije i njezino spremanje za korištenje offline.\u003C/li\u003E\u003Cli\u003EDobivanje novije verzije aplikacije. Kad ste online, aplikacija preuzima najnoviju verziju idući put kad se otvori, a \u003Cspan class=\"hui\"\u003ESpremi za offline\u003C/span\u003E osvježava spremljenu kopiju.\u003C/li\u003E\u003Cli\u003EPoveznice na web-mjesto, kao što je \u003Cspan class=\"hui\"\u003EOtvori na web-mjestu\u003C/span\u003E, i poveznice na druge stranice.\u003C/li\u003E\u003Cli\u003ESpremanje u oblak i sinkronizacija među računalima, koji još nisu dostupni.\u003C/li\u003E\u003C/ul\u003E\n\u003Ch2 id=\"dobro-je-znati\"\u003EDobro je znati\u003C/h2\u003E\n\u003Cul\u003E\u003Cli\u003ESpremljena kopija pripada jednom pregledniku na jednom računalu. Brisanjem podataka web-mjesta u pregledniku uklanja se.\u003C/li\u003E\u003Cli\u003EPrivatni prozori u nekim preglednicima i neka zaključana radna računala ne dopuštaju spremanje za offline. Gumb javlja kad ne može spremiti.\u003C/li\u003E\u003C/ul\u003E\n\u003Cdiv class=\"hv\" data-v=\"browser:safari\"\u003E\u003Cp class=\"hv-label\"\u003ESafari\u003C/p\u003E\n\u003Cp\u003ESafari uklanja spremljene podatke web-mjesta koja niste posjetili nekoliko tjedana. Povremeno otvorite aplikaciju dok ste online ili je ponovno spremite prije puta.\u003C/p\u003E\n\u003C/div\u003E\n\u003Cul\u003E\u003Cli\u003ECadCraft Studio, desktop aplikacija sa svih osam aplikacija u jednoj instalaciji, nalazi se na getcadcraft.com/download.\u003C/li\u003E\u003C/ul\u003E","text":"Aplikacije obavljaju posao na vašem računalu, pa većina njih radi bez veze. Preglednik samo prije mora imati spremljene datoteke aplikacije. Spremite aplikaciju za korištenje offline Otvorite aplikaciju dok ste online. Odaberite Spremi za offline u traci na vrhu. Pričekajte „Spremno za offline“. Datoteke aplikacije, njezini čitači datoteka i ova pomoć sada su spremljeni u vašem pregledniku. Aplikacije koje čitaju DWG ili PDF datoteke spremaju i svoje čitače, pa to prvi put može potrajati minutu. Učinite to jednom za svaku aplikaciju u svakom pregledniku koji koristite. Da se aplikaciji kasnije vratite bez veze, otvorite istu adresu kao prije ili njezinu zabilješku. Sada ste offline. Ako je ova aplikacija spremljena za korištenje offline, sve ispod radi. Ako nije, i dalje možete koristiti ono što je već učitano u ovoj kartici, ali ne učitavajte je ponovno dok opet ne budete online. Što radi offline Otvaranje datoteka s vašeg računala, crtanje, uređivanje, mjerenje i provjera. Spremanje i izvoz: svako spremanje je preuzimanje na vaše računalo. Ova pomoć, uključujući pretragu. Što treba vezu Prvo otvaranje aplikacije i njezino spremanje za korištenje offline. Dobivanje novije verzije aplikacije. Kad ste online, aplikacija preuzima najnoviju verziju idući put kad se otvori, a Spremi za offline osvježava spremljenu kopiju. Poveznice na web-mjesto, kao što je Otvori na web-mjestu, i poveznice na druge stranice. Spremanje u oblak i sinkronizacija među računalima, koji još nisu dostupni. Dobro je znati Spremljena kopija pripada jednom pregledniku na jednom računalu. Brisanjem podataka web-mjesta u pregledniku uklanja se. Privatni prozori u nekim preglednicima i neka zaključana radna računala ne dopuštaju spremanje za offline. Gumb javlja kad ne može spremiti. Safari uklanja spremljene podatke web-mjesta koja niste posjetili nekoliko tjedana. Povremeno otvorite aplikaciju dok ste online ili je ponovno spremite prije puta. CadCraft Studio, desktop aplikacija sa svih osam aplikacija u jednoj instalaciji, nalazi se na getcadcraft.com/download.","lang":"hr"},{"slug":"layout-drafting","scope":"basics","title":"The Drafting layout: a 2D drafting workspace","summary":"A workspace with a menu bar, a ribbon, file tabs, a viewport label, navigation bar and axes over the drawing, Model and sheet tabs and a row of drawing-mode toggles, in dark chrome.","section":"start","order":42,"keywords":["drafting","layout","workspace","menu bar","ribbon","quick access","navigation bar","axes","viewport label","command line","model tab","sheet tab","status bar","toggles","grid","snap","ortho","polar","dark","2D"],"headings":[{"id":"what-is-where","text":"What is where","level":2},{"id":"choose-it","text":"Choose it","level":2},{"id":"good-to-know","text":"Good to know","level":2}],"html":"\u003Cp\u003EDrafting is a layout for people who draw in 2D all day: the whole chrome is dark, and the controls sit where drafting programs have taught people to look for them. It is built from the same blocks as every other layout, so it works in every app that has the parts it asks for and leaves out, with a note, the parts an app does not have (a view cube in an app with no 3D view, for example).\u003C/p\u003E\n\u003Ch2 id=\"what-is-where\"\u003EWhat is where\u003C/h2\u003E\n\u003Cul\u003E\u003Cli\u003E\u003Cstrong\u003ETop row:\u003C/strong\u003E the app mark and name, your quick-access tools (the ones this app has), the document name and the window buttons. The document name shows a dot while there are unsaved changes.\u003C/li\u003E\u003Cli\u003E\u003Cstrong\u003EMenu bar\u003C/strong\u003E under it, with the menus drafting programs use: \u003Cspan class=\"hui\"\u003EFile\u003C/span\u003E, \u003Cspan class=\"hui\"\u003EEdit\u003C/span\u003E, \u003Cspan class=\"hui\"\u003EView\u003C/span\u003E, \u003Cspan class=\"hui\"\u003EModify\u003C/span\u003E, \u003Cspan class=\"hui\"\u003ETools\u003C/span\u003E and the rest the app has.\u003C/li\u003E\u003Cli\u003E\u003Cstrong\u003ERibbon\u003C/strong\u003E under the menu bar. A tab that appears when something is selected lights up in the app&#039;s colour. The ribbon never wraps: what does not fit goes behind a \u003Cspan class=\"hui\"\u003E⋯\u003C/span\u003E button.\u003C/li\u003E\u003Cli\u003E\u003Cstrong\u003EOver the drawing:\u003C/strong\u003E the view label at the top left, the navigation bar at the right edge and the axes at the bottom left. An app with a 3D view also gets a view cube at the top right. Between them the drawing keeps the pointer.\u003C/li\u003E\u003Cli\u003E\u003Cstrong\u003ECommand line:\u003C/strong\u003E in an app that has one (CadCraft), the app&#039;s own command bar stays where it was: Drafting does not add a second one.\u003C/li\u003E\u003Cli\u003E\u003Cstrong\u003EBottom:\u003C/strong\u003E the Model and sheet tabs, and a row of mode toggles (\u003Cspan class=\"hui\"\u003EGrid\u003C/span\u003E, \u003Cspan class=\"hui\"\u003ESnap\u003C/span\u003E, \u003Cspan class=\"hui\"\u003EOrtho\u003C/span\u003E, \u003Cspan class=\"hui\"\u003EPolar\u003C/span\u003E and the others the app has) with the app&#039;s messages beside them. A toggle the app does not have is simply not there.\u003C/li\u003E\u003C/ul\u003E\n\u003Cp\u003EThe app&#039;s name and logo show once, in the top row, whatever the width of the window.\u003C/p\u003E\n\u003Ch2 id=\"choose-it\"\u003EChoose it\u003C/h2\u003E\n\u003Cp\u003E\u003Cspan class=\"hui\"\u003ESettings\u003C/span\u003E › \u003Cspan class=\"hui\"\u003EGlobal\u003C/span\u003E › \u003Cspan class=\"hui\"\u003ELayout\u003C/span\u003E › \u003Cspan class=\"hui\"\u003EDrafting\u003C/span\u003E. \u003Cspan class=\"hui\"\u003EClassic\u003C/span\u003E always brings back the layout you had. To move a block or change what a block holds, see \u003Ca href=\"/tutorials/basics/layout-edit\" data-topic=\"basics/layout-edit\"\u003EChange a layout on the screen\u003C/a\u003E.\u003C/p\u003E\n\u003Ch2 id=\"good-to-know\"\u003EGood to know\u003C/h2\u003E\n\u003Cul\u003E\u003Cli\u003EOn a phone, or in a window 760 pixels wide or narrower, the app uses its phone layout whatever you picked. A wider window brings Drafting back.\u003C/li\u003E\u003Cli\u003EThis layout is in the lab (the version for testing) and is not released yet.\u003C/li\u003E\u003C/ul\u003E","text":"Drafting is a layout for people who draw in 2D all day: the whole chrome is dark, and the controls sit where drafting programs have taught people to look for them. It is built from the same blocks as every other layout, so it works in every app that has the parts it asks for and leaves out, with a note, the parts an app does not have (a view cube in an app with no 3D view, for example). What is where Top row: the app mark and name, your quick-access tools (the ones this app has), the document name and the window buttons. The document name shows a dot while there are unsaved changes. Menu bar under it, with the menus drafting programs use: File, Edit, View, Modify, Tools and the rest the app has. Ribbon under the menu bar. A tab that appears when something is selected lights up in the app's colour. The ribbon never wraps: what does not fit goes behind a ⋯ button. Over the drawing: the view label at the top left, the navigation bar at the right edge and the axes at the bottom left. An app with a 3D view also gets a view cube at the top right. Between them the drawing keeps the pointer. Command line: in an app that has one (CadCraft), the app's own command bar stays where it was: Drafting does not add a second one. Bottom: the Model and sheet tabs, and a row of mode toggles (Grid, Snap, Ortho, Polar and the others the app has) with the app's messages beside them. A toggle the app does not have is simply not there. The app's name and logo show once, in the top row, whatever the width of the window. Choose it Settings › Global › Layout › Drafting. Classic always brings back the layout you had. To move a block or change what a block holds, see Change a layout on the screen. Good to know On a phone, or in a window 760 pixels wide or narrower, the app uses its phone layout whatever you picked. A wider window brings Drafting back. This layout is in the lab (the version for testing) and is not released yet.","lang":"en"},{"slug":"interface-sizes","scope":"basics","title":"The interface on a small laptop and on a very large screen","summary":"The interface picks a compact, normal or comfortable step for your window by itself, keeps side panels at a width that suits it, and folds extra tools into a menu instead of wrapping.","section":"start","order":43,"keywords":["density","compact","comfortable","small screen","laptop","13 inch","large screen","ultrawide","4k","panel width","toolbar wrap","scale","window size","responsive"],"headings":[{"id":"three-steps","text":"Three steps","level":2},{"id":"panels-and-bars","text":"Panels and bars","level":2},{"id":"good-to-know","text":"Good to know","level":2}],"html":"\u003Cp\u003EThe interface follows the size of your window. You do not have to set anything.\u003C/p\u003E\n\u003Ch2 id=\"three-steps\"\u003EThree steps\u003C/h2\u003E\n\u003Cul\u003E\u003Cli\u003E\u003Cstrong\u003ECompact\u003C/strong\u003E on a small laptop screen (a window under 1600 pixels wide or 900 high), so the drawing gets the room.\u003C/li\u003E\u003Cli\u003E\u003Cstrong\u003ENormal\u003C/strong\u003E on a regular monitor.\u003C/li\u003E\u003Cli\u003E\u003Cstrong\u003EComfortable\u003C/strong\u003E on a very wide, large screen (3000 pixels wide and 1200 high or more), where targets and type grow a little.\u003C/li\u003E\u003C/ul\u003E\n\u003Cp\u003EThe step is chosen again when you resize the window or move it to another screen. It is separate from the Comfortable / Compact choice in the panels (see \u003Ca href=\"/tutorials/basics/arrange-panels\" data-topic=\"basics/arrange-panels\"\u003EArrange the panels\u003C/a\u003E). A touch screen is never made compact.\u003C/p\u003E\n\u003Ch2 id=\"panels-and-bars\"\u003EPanels and bars\u003C/h2\u003E\n\u003Cp\u003ESide panels keep a width that fits the step and the window, so a panel is never a third of a small screen and never a sliver on an ultrawide. A bar of tools never wraps onto a second line: the tools that do not fit fold into a \u003Cspan class=\"hui\"\u003E⋯\u003C/span\u003E menu at its end, and come back when the window is wider.\u003C/p\u003E\n\u003Ch2 id=\"good-to-know\"\u003EGood to know\u003C/h2\u003E\n\u003Cp\u003EThis is in the lab (the version for testing) and is not released yet. There is no setting to pick a step yourself, and no presentation mode, yet.\u003C/p\u003E","text":"The interface follows the size of your window. You do not have to set anything. Three steps Compact on a small laptop screen (a window under 1600 pixels wide or 900 high), so the drawing gets the room. Normal on a regular monitor. Comfortable on a very wide, large screen (3000 pixels wide and 1200 high or more), where targets and type grow a little. The step is chosen again when you resize the window or move it to another screen. It is separate from the Comfortable / Compact choice in the panels (see Arrange the panels). A touch screen is never made compact. Panels and bars Side panels keep a width that fits the step and the window, so a panel is never a third of a small screen and never a sliver on an ultrawide. A bar of tools never wraps onto a second line: the tools that do not fit fold into a ⋯ menu at its end, and come back when the window is wider. Good to know This is in the lab (the version for testing) and is not released yet. There is no setting to pick a step yourself, and no presentation mode, yet.","lang":"en"},{"slug":"your-files","scope":"basics","title":"Kamo idu vaše datoteke","summary":"Datoteke ostaju na vašem računalu, kako radi spremanje i što preglednik pamti.","section":"start","order":50,"keywords":["privatnost","učitavanje","oblak","spremanje","preuzimanje","pohrana","lokalno","sigurnost","povjerljivo"],"headings":[{"id":"va-e-datoteke-ostaju-na-va-em-ra-unalu","text":"Vaše datoteke ostaju na vašem računalu","level":2},{"id":"kako-radi-spremanje","text":"Kako radi spremanje","level":2},{"id":"to-preglednik-pamti","text":"Što preglednik pamti","level":2},{"id":"spremanje-u-oblak","text":"Spremanje u oblak","level":2}],"html":"\u003Ch2 id=\"va-e-datoteke-ostaju-na-va-em-ra-unalu\"\u003EVaše datoteke ostaju na vašem računalu\u003C/h2\u003E\n\u003Cp\u003EKad otvorite crtež, model ili PDF, aplikacija ga čita unutar vašeg preglednika. \u003Cstrong\u003EDatoteka se ne učitava na poslužitelj.\u003C/strong\u003E Mi je nikad ne vidimo i radi jednako bez veze.\u003C/p\u003E\n\u003Ch2 id=\"kako-radi-spremanje\"\u003EKako radi spremanje\u003C/h2\u003E\n\u003Cp\u003EStranica u pregledniku ne može sama prepisati datoteke na vašem računalu, pa aplikacije spremaju \u003Cstrong\u003Epreuzimanjem\u003C/strong\u003E nove datoteke:\u003C/p\u003E\n\u003Cul\u003E\u003Cli\u003EPreuzimanje ide ondje kamo vaš preglednik stavlja preuzimanja, obično u mapu Preuzimanja, osim ako ste postavili da preglednik pita svaki put (vidi \u003Ca href=\"/tutorials/basics/browsers#what-differs-between-browsers\" data-topic=\"basics/browsers\" data-hash=\"what-differs-between-browsers\"\u003EPreglednici i računala\u003C/a\u003E).\u003C/li\u003E\u003Cli\u003EAplikacije koje mijenjaju datoteku spremaju kopiju s novim imenom, na primjer „(edited)“ ili „(marked up)“, pa vaš original ostaje netaknut.\u003C/li\u003E\u003Cli\u003EAko zatvorite karticu s nespremljenim radom, preglednik prvo pita („Napustiti web-mjesto?“).\u003C/li\u003E\u003C/ul\u003E\n\u003Ch2 id=\"to-preglednik-pamti\"\u003EŠto preglednik pamti\u003C/h2\u003E\n\u003Cp\u003ENeke aplikacije pamte male postavke u vašem pregledniku, kao što su ime autora ili stilovi alata. Ostaju u tom pregledniku na tom računalu, a brisanjem podataka web-mjesta uklanjaju se. Pomoć svake aplikacije kaže što čuva.\u003C/p\u003E\n\u003Ch2 id=\"spremanje-u-oblak\"\u003ESpremanje u oblak\u003C/h2\u003E\n\u003Cp\u003ESpremanje u oblak i sinkronizacija među računalima dio su komercijalne licence. Još nisu dostupni. Do tada čuvajte datoteke ondje gdje čuvate ostale projektne datoteke i izrađujte sigurnosne kopije uobičajenim putem.\u003C/p\u003E","text":"Vaše datoteke ostaju na vašem računalu Kad otvorite crtež, model ili PDF, aplikacija ga čita unutar vašeg preglednika. Datoteka se ne učitava na poslužitelj. Mi je nikad ne vidimo i radi jednako bez veze. Kako radi spremanje Stranica u pregledniku ne može sama prepisati datoteke na vašem računalu, pa aplikacije spremaju preuzimanjem nove datoteke: Preuzimanje ide ondje kamo vaš preglednik stavlja preuzimanja, obično u mapu Preuzimanja, osim ako ste postavili da preglednik pita svaki put (vidi Preglednici i računala). Aplikacije koje mijenjaju datoteku spremaju kopiju s novim imenom, na primjer „(edited)“ ili „(marked up)“, pa vaš original ostaje netaknut. Ako zatvorite karticu s nespremljenim radom, preglednik prvo pita („Napustiti web-mjesto?“). Što preglednik pamti Neke aplikacije pamte male postavke u vašem pregledniku, kao što su ime autora ili stilovi alata. Ostaju u tom pregledniku na tom računalu, a brisanjem podataka web-mjesta uklanjaju se. Pomoć svake aplikacije kaže što čuva. Spremanje u oblak Spremanje u oblak i sinkronizacija među računalima dio su komercijalne licence. Još nisu dostupni. Do tada čuvajte datoteke ondje gdje čuvate ostale projektne datoteke i izrađujte sigurnosne kopije uobičajenim putem.","lang":"hr"},{"slug":"connect-ai-windows","scope":"basics","title":"Connect your AI on Windows","summary":"Let your own AI app work with the CadCraft apps: one click in CadCraft Studio, or a short paste for each AI app. Includes the one-line test that proves it works.","section":"start","order":63,"keywords":["ai","assistant","connect","mcp","claude","cursor","vs code","windsurf","codex","gemini","set up","test","windows"],"headings":[{"id":"what-you-will-learn","text":"What you will learn","level":2},{"id":"the-easy-way","text":"The easy way","level":2},{"id":"prove-it-works","text":"Prove it works","level":2},{"id":"or-paste-it-yourself","text":"Or paste it yourself","level":2},{"id":"claude-desktop","text":"Claude Desktop","level":3},{"id":"claude-code","text":"Claude Code","level":3},{"id":"cursor","text":"Cursor","level":3},{"id":"windsurf","text":"Windsurf","level":3},{"id":"visual-studio-code","text":"Visual Studio Code","level":3},{"id":"codex-cli","text":"Codex CLI","level":3},{"id":"google-antigravity","text":"Google Antigravity","level":3},{"id":"gemini-cli","text":"Gemini CLI","level":3},{"id":"browser-ai-and-phones","text":"Browser AI and phones","level":2},{"id":"if-it-does-not-work","text":"If it does not work","level":2}],"html":"\u003Ch2 id=\"what-you-will-learn\"\u003EWhat you will learn\u003C/h2\u003E\n\u003Cp\u003EHow to let the AI app you already use (Claude, Cursor, Visual Studio Code, Windsurf, Codex, Gemini…) reach your CadCraft apps, how to check that it works in under a minute, and how to take it out again. The apps contain no AI; your AI app asks them to do things, and you decide what it may do. (For those who search for it: this uses the Model Context Protocol, &quot;MCP&quot;.)\u003C/p\u003E\n\u003Ch2 id=\"the-easy-way\"\u003EThe easy way\u003C/h2\u003E\n\u003Cp\u003EOpen \u003Cstrong\u003ECadCraft Studio › Connect your AI\u003C/strong\u003E. Studio looks for the AI apps on this computer, shows you in plain words what it would add to each one&#039;s settings, and writes it only after you press \u003Cstrong\u003EYes\u003C/strong\u003E. \u003Cstrong\u003EDisconnect\u003C/strong\u003E takes it out again. Nothing secret is written into the AI app&#039;s settings.\u003C/p\u003E\n\u003Ch2 id=\"prove-it-works\"\u003EProve it works\u003C/h2\u003E\n\u003Cp\u003EIn your AI app, paste this:\u003C/p\u003E\n\u003Cpre class=\"hcode\"\u003E\u003Ccode\u003EUse the CadCraft tools: list the apps you can reach, then open the sample drawing in my CadCraft folder and tell me how many objects it has, by layer.\u003C/code\u003E\u003C/pre\u003E\n\u003Cp\u003EIt should list the CadCraft apps it can reach and then give you a count by layer. It only reads, so it needs no extra permission beyond the \u003Cstrong\u003ERead\u003C/strong\u003E that is on to begin with. In Studio, \u003Cstrong\u003ECheck the connection\u003C/strong\u003E tests each step without the AI and says which one failed.\u003C/p\u003E\n\u003Ch2 id=\"or-paste-it-yourself\"\u003EOr paste it yourself\u003C/h2\u003E\n\u003Cp\u003EOne card for each AI app. Each one adds a single entry named \u003Ccode\u003Ecadcraft\u003C/code\u003E and nothing else.\u003C/p\u003E\n\u003Ch3 id=\"claude-desktop\"\u003EClaude Desktop\u003C/h3\u003E\n\u003Col\u003E\u003Cli\u003EOpen %APPDATA%\\Claude\\claude_desktop_config.json (it is made if it does not exist; keep anything already in it).\u003C/li\u003E\u003Cli\u003EAdd the CadCraft entry below (inside &quot;mcpServers&quot; if the file has one).\u003C/li\u003E\u003Cli\u003ERestart Claude Desktop completely, then ask it the test prompt.\u003C/li\u003E\u003C/ol\u003E\n\u003Cpre class=\"hcode\"\u003E\u003Ccode\u003E{\n  &quot;mcpServers&quot;: {\n    &quot;cadcraft&quot;: {\n      &quot;command&quot;: &quot;npx&quot;,\n      &quot;args&quot;: [\n        &quot;-y&quot;,\n        &quot;@getcadcraft/mcp&quot;,\n        &quot;connect&quot;\n      ]\n    }\n  }\n}\u003C/code\u003E\u003C/pre\u003E\n\u003Cp\u003E\u003Cstrong\u003EUndo:\u003C/strong\u003E Delete the &quot;cadcraft&quot; entry from %APPDATA%\\Claude\\claude_desktop_config.json.\u003C/p\u003E\n\u003Ch3 id=\"claude-code\"\u003EClaude Code\u003C/h3\u003E\n\u003Col\u003E\u003Cli\u003EOpen a terminal.\u003C/li\u003E\u003Cli\u003ERun the command below.\u003C/li\u003E\u003Cli\u003EStart Claude Code and ask it the test prompt.\u003C/li\u003E\u003C/ol\u003E\n\u003Cpre class=\"hcode\"\u003E\u003Ccode\u003Eclaude mcp add cadcraft --scope user -- npx -y @getcadcraft/mcp connect\u003C/code\u003E\u003C/pre\u003E\n\u003Cp\u003E\u003Cstrong\u003EUndo:\u003C/strong\u003E claude mcp remove cadcraft --scope user\u003C/p\u003E\n\u003Ch3 id=\"cursor\"\u003ECursor\u003C/h3\u003E\n\u003Col\u003E\u003Cli\u003EOpen %USERPROFILE%\\.cursor\\mcp.json (it is made if it does not exist; keep anything already in it).\u003C/li\u003E\u003Cli\u003EAdd the CadCraft entry below (inside &quot;mcpServers&quot; if the file has one).\u003C/li\u003E\u003Cli\u003EStart Cursor and ask it the test prompt.\u003C/li\u003E\u003C/ol\u003E\n\u003Cpre class=\"hcode\"\u003E\u003Ccode\u003E{\n  &quot;mcpServers&quot;: {\n    &quot;cadcraft&quot;: {\n      &quot;command&quot;: &quot;npx&quot;,\n      &quot;args&quot;: [\n        &quot;-y&quot;,\n        &quot;@getcadcraft/mcp&quot;,\n        &quot;connect&quot;\n      ]\n    }\n  }\n}\u003C/code\u003E\u003C/pre\u003E\n\u003Cp\u003E\u003Cstrong\u003EUndo:\u003C/strong\u003E Delete the &quot;cadcraft&quot; entry from %USERPROFILE%\\.cursor\\mcp.json.\u003C/p\u003E\n\u003Caside class=\"hc hc-tip\"\u003E\u003Cp class=\"hc-label\"\u003ETip\u003C/p\u003E\n\u003Cp\u003EThis path comes from the AI app&#039;s public guides. If it does not match your install, use Studio&#039;s Connect, which looks first.\u003C/p\u003E\n\u003C/aside\u003E\n\u003Ch3 id=\"windsurf\"\u003EWindsurf\u003C/h3\u003E\n\u003Col\u003E\u003Cli\u003EOpen %USERPROFILE%\\.codeium\\windsurf\\mcp_config.json (it is made if it does not exist; keep anything already in it).\u003C/li\u003E\u003Cli\u003EAdd the CadCraft entry below (inside &quot;mcpServers&quot; if the file has one).\u003C/li\u003E\u003Cli\u003EStart Windsurf and ask it the test prompt.\u003C/li\u003E\u003C/ol\u003E\n\u003Cpre class=\"hcode\"\u003E\u003Ccode\u003E{\n  &quot;mcpServers&quot;: {\n    &quot;cadcraft&quot;: {\n      &quot;command&quot;: &quot;npx&quot;,\n      &quot;args&quot;: [\n        &quot;-y&quot;,\n        &quot;@getcadcraft/mcp&quot;,\n        &quot;connect&quot;\n      ]\n    }\n  }\n}\u003C/code\u003E\u003C/pre\u003E\n\u003Cp\u003E\u003Cstrong\u003EUndo:\u003C/strong\u003E Delete the &quot;cadcraft&quot; entry from %USERPROFILE%\\.codeium\\windsurf\\mcp_config.json.\u003C/p\u003E\n\u003Caside class=\"hc hc-tip\"\u003E\u003Cp class=\"hc-label\"\u003ETip\u003C/p\u003E\n\u003Cp\u003EThis path comes from the AI app&#039;s public guides. If it does not match your install, use Studio&#039;s Connect, which looks first.\u003C/p\u003E\n\u003C/aside\u003E\n\u003Ch3 id=\"visual-studio-code\"\u003EVisual Studio Code\u003C/h3\u003E\n\u003Col\u003E\u003Cli\u003EOpen %APPDATA%\\Code\\User\\mcp.json (it is made if it does not exist; keep anything already in it).\u003C/li\u003E\u003Cli\u003EAdd the CadCraft entry below (inside &quot;servers&quot; if the file has one).\u003C/li\u003E\u003Cli\u003EStart Visual Studio Code and ask it the test prompt.\u003C/li\u003E\u003C/ol\u003E\n\u003Cpre class=\"hcode\"\u003E\u003Ccode\u003E{\n  &quot;servers&quot;: {\n    &quot;cadcraft&quot;: {\n      &quot;type&quot;: &quot;stdio&quot;,\n      &quot;command&quot;: &quot;npx&quot;,\n      &quot;args&quot;: [\n        &quot;-y&quot;,\n        &quot;@getcadcraft/mcp&quot;,\n        &quot;connect&quot;\n      ]\n    }\n  }\n}\u003C/code\u003E\u003C/pre\u003E\n\u003Cp\u003E\u003Cstrong\u003EUndo:\u003C/strong\u003E Delete the &quot;cadcraft&quot; entry from %APPDATA%\\Code\\User\\mcp.json.\u003C/p\u003E\n\u003Caside class=\"hc hc-tip\"\u003E\u003Cp class=\"hc-label\"\u003ETip\u003C/p\u003E\n\u003Cp\u003EThis path comes from the AI app&#039;s public guides. If it does not match your install, use Studio&#039;s Connect, which looks first.\u003C/p\u003E\n\u003C/aside\u003E\n\u003Ch3 id=\"codex-cli\"\u003ECodex CLI\u003C/h3\u003E\n\u003Col\u003E\u003Cli\u003EOpen %USERPROFILE%\\.codex\\config.toml (it is made if it does not exist; keep anything already in it).\u003C/li\u003E\u003Cli\u003EAdd the CadCraft entry below (inside &quot;mcp_servers&quot; if the file has one).\u003C/li\u003E\u003Cli\u003EStart Codex CLI and ask it the test prompt.\u003C/li\u003E\u003C/ol\u003E\n\u003Cpre class=\"hcode\"\u003E\u003Ccode\u003E[mcp_servers.cadcraft]\ncommand = &quot;npx&quot;\nargs = [&quot;-y&quot;,&quot;@getcadcraft/mcp&quot;,&quot;connect&quot;]\u003C/code\u003E\u003C/pre\u003E\n\u003Cp\u003E\u003Cstrong\u003EUndo:\u003C/strong\u003E Delete the &quot;cadcraft&quot; entry from %USERPROFILE%\\.codex\\config.toml.\u003C/p\u003E\n\u003Caside class=\"hc hc-tip\"\u003E\u003Cp class=\"hc-label\"\u003ETip\u003C/p\u003E\n\u003Cp\u003EThis path comes from the AI app&#039;s public guides. If it does not match your install, use Studio&#039;s Connect, which looks first.\u003C/p\u003E\n\u003C/aside\u003E\n\u003Ch3 id=\"google-antigravity\"\u003EGoogle Antigravity\u003C/h3\u003E\n\u003Col\u003E\u003Cli\u003EOpen %USERPROFILE%\\.gemini\\config\\mcp_config.json (it is made if it does not exist; keep anything already in it).\u003C/li\u003E\u003Cli\u003EAdd the CadCraft entry below (inside &quot;mcpServers&quot; if the file has one).\u003C/li\u003E\u003Cli\u003EStart Google Antigravity and ask it the test prompt.\u003C/li\u003E\u003C/ol\u003E\n\u003Cpre class=\"hcode\"\u003E\u003Ccode\u003E{\n  &quot;mcpServers&quot;: {\n    &quot;cadcraft&quot;: {\n      &quot;command&quot;: &quot;npx&quot;,\n      &quot;args&quot;: [\n        &quot;-y&quot;,\n        &quot;@getcadcraft/mcp&quot;,\n        &quot;connect&quot;\n      ]\n    }\n  }\n}\u003C/code\u003E\u003C/pre\u003E\n\u003Cp\u003E\u003Cstrong\u003EUndo:\u003C/strong\u003E Delete the &quot;cadcraft&quot; entry from %USERPROFILE%\\.gemini\\config\\mcp_config.json.\u003C/p\u003E\n\u003Caside class=\"hc hc-tip\"\u003E\u003Cp class=\"hc-label\"\u003ETip\u003C/p\u003E\n\u003Cp\u003EThis path comes from the AI app&#039;s public guides. If it does not match your install, use Studio&#039;s Connect, which looks first.\u003C/p\u003E\n\u003C/aside\u003E\n\u003Ch3 id=\"gemini-cli\"\u003EGemini CLI\u003C/h3\u003E\n\u003Col\u003E\u003Cli\u003EOpen %USERPROFILE%\\.gemini\\settings.json (it is made if it does not exist; keep anything already in it).\u003C/li\u003E\u003Cli\u003EAdd the CadCraft entry below (inside &quot;mcpServers&quot; if the file has one).\u003C/li\u003E\u003Cli\u003EStart Gemini CLI and ask it the test prompt.\u003C/li\u003E\u003C/ol\u003E\n\u003Cpre class=\"hcode\"\u003E\u003Ccode\u003E{\n  &quot;mcpServers&quot;: {\n    &quot;cadcraft&quot;: {\n      &quot;command&quot;: &quot;npx&quot;,\n      &quot;args&quot;: [\n        &quot;-y&quot;,\n        &quot;@getcadcraft/mcp&quot;,\n        &quot;connect&quot;\n      ]\n    }\n  }\n}\u003C/code\u003E\u003C/pre\u003E\n\u003Cp\u003E\u003Cstrong\u003EUndo:\u003C/strong\u003E Delete the &quot;cadcraft&quot; entry from %USERPROFILE%\\.gemini\\settings.json.\u003C/p\u003E\n\u003Caside class=\"hc hc-tip\"\u003E\u003Cp class=\"hc-label\"\u003ETip\u003C/p\u003E\n\u003Cp\u003EThis path comes from the AI app&#039;s public guides. If it does not match your install, use Studio&#039;s Connect, which looks first.\u003C/p\u003E\n\u003C/aside\u003E\n\u003Ch2 id=\"browser-ai-and-phones\"\u003EBrowser AI and phones\u003C/h2\u003E\n\u003Cp\u003EAI apps in a web browser, and on phones and tablets, cannot read a settings file on your computer. They use the \u003Cstrong\u003Ehosted connector\u003C/strong\u003E instead (needs CadCraft Studio open on a computer). Studio › Connect your AI shows the link.\u003C/p\u003E\n\u003Ch2 id=\"if-it-does-not-work\"\u003EIf it does not work\u003C/h2\u003E\n\u003Cul\u003E\u003Cli\u003E\u003Cstrong\u003EThe AI app does not list CadCraft:\u003C/strong\u003E restart it fully (quit, not just close the window), then check the entry is in its settings.\u003C/li\u003E\u003Cli\u003E\u003Cstrong\u003E&quot;Could not reach CadCraft Studio&quot;:\u003C/strong\u003E open Studio and the app you want; each app has Settings › Assistants to turn on.\u003C/li\u003E\u003Cli\u003E\u003Cstrong\u003EIt can look but not change:\u003C/strong\u003E Edit, Save and Export are separate permissions you turn on per app in Studio.\u003C/li\u003E\u003C/ul\u003E","text":"What you will learn How to let the AI app you already use (Claude, Cursor, Visual Studio Code, Windsurf, Codex, Gemini…) reach your CadCraft apps, how to check that it works in under a minute, and how to take it out again. The apps contain no AI; your AI app asks them to do things, and you decide what it may do. (For those who search for it: this uses the Model Context Protocol, \"MCP\".) The easy way Open CadCraft Studio › Connect your AI. Studio looks for the AI apps on this computer, shows you in plain words what it would add to each one's settings, and writes it only after you press Yes. Disconnect takes it out again. Nothing secret is written into the AI app's settings. Prove it works In your AI app, paste this: Use the CadCraft tools: list the apps you can reach, then open the sample drawing in my CadCraft folder and tell me how many objects it has, by layer. It should list the CadCraft apps it can reach and then give you a count by layer. It only reads, so it needs no extra permission beyond the Read that is on to begin with. In Studio, Check the connection tests each step without the AI and says which one failed. Or paste it yourself One card for each AI app. Each one adds a single entry named cadcraft and nothing else. Claude Desktop Open %APPDATA%\\Claude\\claude_desktop_config.json (it is made if it does not exist; keep anything already in it). Add the CadCraft entry below (inside \"mcpServers\" if the file has one). Restart Claude Desktop completely, then ask it the test prompt. { \"mcpServers\": { \"cadcraft\": { \"command\": \"npx\", \"args\": [ \"-y\", \"@getcadcraft/mcp\", \"connect\" ] } } } Undo: Delete the \"cadcraft\" entry from %APPDATA%\\Claude\\claude_desktop_config.json. Claude Code Open a terminal. Run the command below. Start Claude Code and ask it the test prompt. claude mcp add cadcraft --scope user -- npx -y @getcadcraft/mcp connect Undo: claude mcp remove cadcraft --scope user Cursor Open %USERPROFILE%\\.cursor\\mcp.json (it is made if it does not exist; keep anything already in it). Add the CadCraft entry below (inside \"mcpServers\" if the file has one). Start Cursor and ask it the test prompt. { \"mcpServers\": { \"cadcraft\": { \"command\": \"npx\", \"args\": [ \"-y\", \"@getcadcraft/mcp\", \"connect\" ] } } } Undo: Delete the \"cadcraft\" entry from %USERPROFILE%\\.cursor\\mcp.json. This path comes from the AI app's public guides. If it does not match your install, use Studio's Connect, which looks first. Windsurf Open %USERPROFILE%\\.codeium\\windsurf\\mcp_config.json (it is made if it does not exist; keep anything already in it). Add the CadCraft entry below (inside \"mcpServers\" if the file has one). Start Windsurf and ask it the test prompt. { \"mcpServers\": { \"cadcraft\": { \"command\": \"npx\", \"args\": [ \"-y\", \"@getcadcraft/mcp\", \"connect\" ] } } } Undo: Delete the \"cadcraft\" entry from %USERPROFILE%\\.codeium\\windsurf\\mcp_config.json. This path comes from the AI app's public guides. If it does not match your install, use Studio's Connect, which looks first. Visual Studio Code Open %APPDATA%\\Code\\User\\mcp.json (it is made if it does not exist; keep anything already in it). Add the CadCraft entry below (inside \"servers\" if the file has one). Start Visual Studio Code and ask it the test prompt. { \"servers\": { \"cadcraft\": { \"type\": \"stdio\", \"command\": \"npx\", \"args\": [ \"-y\", \"@getcadcraft/mcp\", \"connect\" ] } } } Undo: Delete the \"cadcraft\" entry from %APPDATA%\\Code\\User\\mcp.json. This path comes from the AI app's public guides. If it does not match your install, use Studio's Connect, which looks first. Codex CLI Open %USERPROFILE%\\.codex\\config.toml (it is made if it does not exist; keep anything already in it). Add the CadCraft entry below (inside \"mcp_servers\" if the file has one). Start Codex CLI and ask it the test prompt. [mcp_servers.cadcraft] command = \"npx\" args = [\"-y\",\"@getcadcraft/mcp\",\"connect\"] Undo: Delete the \"cadcraft\" entry from %USERPROFILE%\\.codex\\config.toml. This path comes from the AI app's public guides. If it does not match your install, use Studio's Connect, which looks first. Google Antigravity Open %USERPROFILE%\\.gemini\\config\\mcp_config.json (it is made if it does not exist; keep anything already in it). Add the CadCraft entry below (inside \"mcpServers\" if the file has one). Start Google Antigravity and ask it the test prompt. { \"mcpServers\": { \"cadcraft\": { \"command\": \"npx\", \"args\": [ \"-y\", \"@getcadcraft/mcp\", \"connect\" ] } } } Undo: Delete the \"cadcraft\" entry from %USERPROFILE%\\.gemini\\config\\mcp_config.json. This path comes from the AI app's public guides. If it does not match your install, use Studio's Connect, which looks first. Gemini CLI Open %USERPROFILE%\\.gemini\\settings.json (it is made if it does not exist; keep anything already in it). Add the CadCraft entry below (inside \"mcpServers\" if the file has one). Start Gemini CLI and ask it the test prompt. { \"mcpServers\": { \"cadcraft\": { \"command\": \"npx\", \"args\": [ \"-y\", \"@getcadcraft/mcp\", \"connect\" ] } } } Undo: Delete the \"cadcraft\" entry from %USERPROFILE%\\.gemini\\settings.json. This path comes from the AI app's public guides. If it does not match your install, use Studio's Connect, which looks first. Browser AI and phones AI apps in a web browser, and on phones and tablets, cannot read a settings file on your computer. They use the hosted connector instead (needs CadCraft Studio open on a computer). Studio › Connect your AI shows the link. If it does not work The AI app does not list CadCraft: restart it fully (quit, not just close the window), then check the entry is in its settings. \"Could not reach CadCraft Studio\": open Studio and the app you want; each app has Settings › Assistants to turn on. It can look but not change: Edit, Save and Export are separate permissions you turn on per app in Studio.","lang":"en"},{"slug":"connect-ai-macos","scope":"basics","title":"Connect your AI on a Mac","summary":"Let your own AI app work with the CadCraft apps: one click in CadCraft Studio, or a short paste for each AI app. Includes the one-line test that proves it works.","section":"start","order":64,"keywords":["ai","assistant","connect","mcp","claude","cursor","vs code","windsurf","codex","gemini","set up","test","macos"],"headings":[{"id":"what-you-will-learn","text":"What you will learn","level":2},{"id":"the-easy-way","text":"The easy way","level":2},{"id":"prove-it-works","text":"Prove it works","level":2},{"id":"or-paste-it-yourself","text":"Or paste it yourself","level":2},{"id":"claude-desktop","text":"Claude Desktop","level":3},{"id":"claude-code","text":"Claude Code","level":3},{"id":"cursor","text":"Cursor","level":3},{"id":"windsurf","text":"Windsurf","level":3},{"id":"visual-studio-code","text":"Visual Studio Code","level":3},{"id":"codex-cli","text":"Codex CLI","level":3},{"id":"google-antigravity","text":"Google Antigravity","level":3},{"id":"gemini-cli","text":"Gemini CLI","level":3},{"id":"browser-ai-and-phones","text":"Browser AI and phones","level":2},{"id":"if-it-does-not-work","text":"If it does not work","level":2}],"html":"\u003Ch2 id=\"what-you-will-learn\"\u003EWhat you will learn\u003C/h2\u003E\n\u003Cp\u003EHow to let the AI app you already use (Claude, Cursor, Visual Studio Code, Windsurf, Codex, Gemini…) reach your CadCraft apps, how to check that it works in under a minute, and how to take it out again. The apps contain no AI; your AI app asks them to do things, and you decide what it may do. (For those who search for it: this uses the Model Context Protocol, &quot;MCP&quot;.)\u003C/p\u003E\n\u003Ch2 id=\"the-easy-way\"\u003EThe easy way\u003C/h2\u003E\n\u003Cp\u003EOpen \u003Cstrong\u003ECadCraft Studio › Connect your AI\u003C/strong\u003E. Studio looks for the AI apps on this computer, shows you in plain words what it would add to each one&#039;s settings, and writes it only after you press \u003Cstrong\u003EYes\u003C/strong\u003E. \u003Cstrong\u003EDisconnect\u003C/strong\u003E takes it out again. Nothing secret is written into the AI app&#039;s settings.\u003C/p\u003E\n\u003Ch2 id=\"prove-it-works\"\u003EProve it works\u003C/h2\u003E\n\u003Cp\u003EIn your AI app, paste this:\u003C/p\u003E\n\u003Cpre class=\"hcode\"\u003E\u003Ccode\u003EUse the CadCraft tools: list the apps you can reach, then open the sample drawing in my CadCraft folder and tell me how many objects it has, by layer.\u003C/code\u003E\u003C/pre\u003E\n\u003Cp\u003EIt should list the CadCraft apps it can reach and then give you a count by layer. It only reads, so it needs no extra permission beyond the \u003Cstrong\u003ERead\u003C/strong\u003E that is on to begin with. In Studio, \u003Cstrong\u003ECheck the connection\u003C/strong\u003E tests each step without the AI and says which one failed.\u003C/p\u003E\n\u003Ch2 id=\"or-paste-it-yourself\"\u003EOr paste it yourself\u003C/h2\u003E\n\u003Cp\u003EOne card for each AI app. Each one adds a single entry named \u003Ccode\u003Ecadcraft\u003C/code\u003E and nothing else.\u003C/p\u003E\n\u003Ch3 id=\"claude-desktop\"\u003EClaude Desktop\u003C/h3\u003E\n\u003Col\u003E\u003Cli\u003EOpen ~/Library/Application Support/Claude/claude_desktop_config.json (it is made if it does not exist; keep anything already in it).\u003C/li\u003E\u003Cli\u003EAdd the CadCraft entry below (inside &quot;mcpServers&quot; if the file has one).\u003C/li\u003E\u003Cli\u003ERestart Claude Desktop completely, then ask it the test prompt.\u003C/li\u003E\u003C/ol\u003E\n\u003Cpre class=\"hcode\"\u003E\u003Ccode\u003E{\n  &quot;mcpServers&quot;: {\n    &quot;cadcraft&quot;: {\n      &quot;command&quot;: &quot;npx&quot;,\n      &quot;args&quot;: [\n        &quot;-y&quot;,\n        &quot;@getcadcraft/mcp&quot;,\n        &quot;connect&quot;\n      ]\n    }\n  }\n}\u003C/code\u003E\u003C/pre\u003E\n\u003Cp\u003E\u003Cstrong\u003EUndo:\u003C/strong\u003E Delete the &quot;cadcraft&quot; entry from ~/Library/Application Support/Claude/claude_desktop_config.json.\u003C/p\u003E\n\u003Ch3 id=\"claude-code\"\u003EClaude Code\u003C/h3\u003E\n\u003Col\u003E\u003Cli\u003EOpen a terminal.\u003C/li\u003E\u003Cli\u003ERun the command below.\u003C/li\u003E\u003Cli\u003EStart Claude Code and ask it the test prompt.\u003C/li\u003E\u003C/ol\u003E\n\u003Cpre class=\"hcode\"\u003E\u003Ccode\u003Eclaude mcp add cadcraft --scope user -- npx -y @getcadcraft/mcp connect\u003C/code\u003E\u003C/pre\u003E\n\u003Cp\u003E\u003Cstrong\u003EUndo:\u003C/strong\u003E claude mcp remove cadcraft --scope user\u003C/p\u003E\n\u003Ch3 id=\"cursor\"\u003ECursor\u003C/h3\u003E\n\u003Col\u003E\u003Cli\u003EOpen ~/.cursor/mcp.json (it is made if it does not exist; keep anything already in it).\u003C/li\u003E\u003Cli\u003EAdd the CadCraft entry below (inside &quot;mcpServers&quot; if the file has one).\u003C/li\u003E\u003Cli\u003EStart Cursor and ask it the test prompt.\u003C/li\u003E\u003C/ol\u003E\n\u003Cpre class=\"hcode\"\u003E\u003Ccode\u003E{\n  &quot;mcpServers&quot;: {\n    &quot;cadcraft&quot;: {\n      &quot;command&quot;: &quot;npx&quot;,\n      &quot;args&quot;: [\n        &quot;-y&quot;,\n        &quot;@getcadcraft/mcp&quot;,\n        &quot;connect&quot;\n      ]\n    }\n  }\n}\u003C/code\u003E\u003C/pre\u003E\n\u003Cp\u003E\u003Cstrong\u003EUndo:\u003C/strong\u003E Delete the &quot;cadcraft&quot; entry from ~/.cursor/mcp.json.\u003C/p\u003E\n\u003Caside class=\"hc hc-tip\"\u003E\u003Cp class=\"hc-label\"\u003ETip\u003C/p\u003E\n\u003Cp\u003EThis path comes from the AI app&#039;s public guides. If it does not match your install, use Studio&#039;s Connect, which looks first.\u003C/p\u003E\n\u003C/aside\u003E\n\u003Ch3 id=\"windsurf\"\u003EWindsurf\u003C/h3\u003E\n\u003Col\u003E\u003Cli\u003EOpen ~/.codeium/windsurf/mcp_config.json (it is made if it does not exist; keep anything already in it).\u003C/li\u003E\u003Cli\u003EAdd the CadCraft entry below (inside &quot;mcpServers&quot; if the file has one).\u003C/li\u003E\u003Cli\u003EStart Windsurf and ask it the test prompt.\u003C/li\u003E\u003C/ol\u003E\n\u003Cpre class=\"hcode\"\u003E\u003Ccode\u003E{\n  &quot;mcpServers&quot;: {\n    &quot;cadcraft&quot;: {\n      &quot;command&quot;: &quot;npx&quot;,\n      &quot;args&quot;: [\n        &quot;-y&quot;,\n        &quot;@getcadcraft/mcp&quot;,\n        &quot;connect&quot;\n      ]\n    }\n  }\n}\u003C/code\u003E\u003C/pre\u003E\n\u003Cp\u003E\u003Cstrong\u003EUndo:\u003C/strong\u003E Delete the &quot;cadcraft&quot; entry from ~/.codeium/windsurf/mcp_config.json.\u003C/p\u003E\n\u003Caside class=\"hc hc-tip\"\u003E\u003Cp class=\"hc-label\"\u003ETip\u003C/p\u003E\n\u003Cp\u003EThis path comes from the AI app&#039;s public guides. If it does not match your install, use Studio&#039;s Connect, which looks first.\u003C/p\u003E\n\u003C/aside\u003E\n\u003Ch3 id=\"visual-studio-code\"\u003EVisual Studio Code\u003C/h3\u003E\n\u003Col\u003E\u003Cli\u003EOpen ~/Library/Application Support/Code/User/mcp.json (it is made if it does not exist; keep anything already in it).\u003C/li\u003E\u003Cli\u003EAdd the CadCraft entry below (inside &quot;servers&quot; if the file has one).\u003C/li\u003E\u003Cli\u003EStart Visual Studio Code and ask it the test prompt.\u003C/li\u003E\u003C/ol\u003E\n\u003Cpre class=\"hcode\"\u003E\u003Ccode\u003E{\n  &quot;servers&quot;: {\n    &quot;cadcraft&quot;: {\n      &quot;type&quot;: &quot;stdio&quot;,\n      &quot;command&quot;: &quot;npx&quot;,\n      &quot;args&quot;: [\n        &quot;-y&quot;,\n        &quot;@getcadcraft/mcp&quot;,\n        &quot;connect&quot;\n      ]\n    }\n  }\n}\u003C/code\u003E\u003C/pre\u003E\n\u003Cp\u003E\u003Cstrong\u003EUndo:\u003C/strong\u003E Delete the &quot;cadcraft&quot; entry from ~/Library/Application Support/Code/User/mcp.json.\u003C/p\u003E\n\u003Caside class=\"hc hc-tip\"\u003E\u003Cp class=\"hc-label\"\u003ETip\u003C/p\u003E\n\u003Cp\u003EThis path comes from the AI app&#039;s public guides. If it does not match your install, use Studio&#039;s Connect, which looks first.\u003C/p\u003E\n\u003C/aside\u003E\n\u003Ch3 id=\"codex-cli\"\u003ECodex CLI\u003C/h3\u003E\n\u003Col\u003E\u003Cli\u003EOpen ~/.codex/config.toml (it is made if it does not exist; keep anything already in it).\u003C/li\u003E\u003Cli\u003EAdd the CadCraft entry below (inside &quot;mcp_servers&quot; if the file has one).\u003C/li\u003E\u003Cli\u003EStart Codex CLI and ask it the test prompt.\u003C/li\u003E\u003C/ol\u003E\n\u003Cpre class=\"hcode\"\u003E\u003Ccode\u003E[mcp_servers.cadcraft]\ncommand = &quot;npx&quot;\nargs = [&quot;-y&quot;,&quot;@getcadcraft/mcp&quot;,&quot;connect&quot;]\u003C/code\u003E\u003C/pre\u003E\n\u003Cp\u003E\u003Cstrong\u003EUndo:\u003C/strong\u003E Delete the &quot;cadcraft&quot; entry from ~/.codex/config.toml.\u003C/p\u003E\n\u003Caside class=\"hc hc-tip\"\u003E\u003Cp class=\"hc-label\"\u003ETip\u003C/p\u003E\n\u003Cp\u003EThis path comes from the AI app&#039;s public guides. If it does not match your install, use Studio&#039;s Connect, which looks first.\u003C/p\u003E\n\u003C/aside\u003E\n\u003Ch3 id=\"google-antigravity\"\u003EGoogle Antigravity\u003C/h3\u003E\n\u003Col\u003E\u003Cli\u003EOpen ~/.gemini/config/mcp_config.json (it is made if it does not exist; keep anything already in it).\u003C/li\u003E\u003Cli\u003EAdd the CadCraft entry below (inside &quot;mcpServers&quot; if the file has one).\u003C/li\u003E\u003Cli\u003EStart Google Antigravity and ask it the test prompt.\u003C/li\u003E\u003C/ol\u003E\n\u003Cpre class=\"hcode\"\u003E\u003Ccode\u003E{\n  &quot;mcpServers&quot;: {\n    &quot;cadcraft&quot;: {\n      &quot;command&quot;: &quot;npx&quot;,\n      &quot;args&quot;: [\n        &quot;-y&quot;,\n        &quot;@getcadcraft/mcp&quot;,\n        &quot;connect&quot;\n      ]\n    }\n  }\n}\u003C/code\u003E\u003C/pre\u003E\n\u003Cp\u003E\u003Cstrong\u003EUndo:\u003C/strong\u003E Delete the &quot;cadcraft&quot; entry from ~/.gemini/config/mcp_config.json.\u003C/p\u003E\n\u003Caside class=\"hc hc-tip\"\u003E\u003Cp class=\"hc-label\"\u003ETip\u003C/p\u003E\n\u003Cp\u003EThis path comes from the AI app&#039;s public guides. If it does not match your install, use Studio&#039;s Connect, which looks first.\u003C/p\u003E\n\u003C/aside\u003E\n\u003Ch3 id=\"gemini-cli\"\u003EGemini CLI\u003C/h3\u003E\n\u003Col\u003E\u003Cli\u003EOpen ~/.gemini/settings.json (it is made if it does not exist; keep anything already in it).\u003C/li\u003E\u003Cli\u003EAdd the CadCraft entry below (inside &quot;mcpServers&quot; if the file has one).\u003C/li\u003E\u003Cli\u003EStart Gemini CLI and ask it the test prompt.\u003C/li\u003E\u003C/ol\u003E\n\u003Cpre class=\"hcode\"\u003E\u003Ccode\u003E{\n  &quot;mcpServers&quot;: {\n    &quot;cadcraft&quot;: {\n      &quot;command&quot;: &quot;npx&quot;,\n      &quot;args&quot;: [\n        &quot;-y&quot;,\n        &quot;@getcadcraft/mcp&quot;,\n        &quot;connect&quot;\n      ]\n    }\n  }\n}\u003C/code\u003E\u003C/pre\u003E\n\u003Cp\u003E\u003Cstrong\u003EUndo:\u003C/strong\u003E Delete the &quot;cadcraft&quot; entry from ~/.gemini/settings.json.\u003C/p\u003E\n\u003Caside class=\"hc hc-tip\"\u003E\u003Cp class=\"hc-label\"\u003ETip\u003C/p\u003E\n\u003Cp\u003EThis path comes from the AI app&#039;s public guides. If it does not match your install, use Studio&#039;s Connect, which looks first.\u003C/p\u003E\n\u003C/aside\u003E\n\u003Ch2 id=\"browser-ai-and-phones\"\u003EBrowser AI and phones\u003C/h2\u003E\n\u003Cp\u003EAI apps in a web browser, and on phones and tablets, cannot read a settings file on your computer. They use the \u003Cstrong\u003Ehosted connector\u003C/strong\u003E instead (needs CadCraft Studio open on a computer). Studio › Connect your AI shows the link.\u003C/p\u003E\n\u003Ch2 id=\"if-it-does-not-work\"\u003EIf it does not work\u003C/h2\u003E\n\u003Cul\u003E\u003Cli\u003E\u003Cstrong\u003EThe AI app does not list CadCraft:\u003C/strong\u003E restart it fully (quit, not just close the window), then check the entry is in its settings.\u003C/li\u003E\u003Cli\u003E\u003Cstrong\u003E&quot;Could not reach CadCraft Studio&quot;:\u003C/strong\u003E open Studio and the app you want; each app has Settings › Assistants to turn on.\u003C/li\u003E\u003Cli\u003E\u003Cstrong\u003EIt can look but not change:\u003C/strong\u003E Edit, Save and Export are separate permissions you turn on per app in Studio.\u003C/li\u003E\u003C/ul\u003E","text":"What you will learn How to let the AI app you already use (Claude, Cursor, Visual Studio Code, Windsurf, Codex, Gemini…) reach your CadCraft apps, how to check that it works in under a minute, and how to take it out again. The apps contain no AI; your AI app asks them to do things, and you decide what it may do. (For those who search for it: this uses the Model Context Protocol, \"MCP\".) The easy way Open CadCraft Studio › Connect your AI. Studio looks for the AI apps on this computer, shows you in plain words what it would add to each one's settings, and writes it only after you press Yes. Disconnect takes it out again. Nothing secret is written into the AI app's settings. Prove it works In your AI app, paste this: Use the CadCraft tools: list the apps you can reach, then open the sample drawing in my CadCraft folder and tell me how many objects it has, by layer. It should list the CadCraft apps it can reach and then give you a count by layer. It only reads, so it needs no extra permission beyond the Read that is on to begin with. In Studio, Check the connection tests each step without the AI and says which one failed. Or paste it yourself One card for each AI app. Each one adds a single entry named cadcraft and nothing else. Claude Desktop Open ~/Library/Application Support/Claude/claude_desktop_config.json (it is made if it does not exist; keep anything already in it). Add the CadCraft entry below (inside \"mcpServers\" if the file has one). Restart Claude Desktop completely, then ask it the test prompt. { \"mcpServers\": { \"cadcraft\": { \"command\": \"npx\", \"args\": [ \"-y\", \"@getcadcraft/mcp\", \"connect\" ] } } } Undo: Delete the \"cadcraft\" entry from ~/Library/Application Support/Claude/claude_desktop_config.json. Claude Code Open a terminal. Run the command below. Start Claude Code and ask it the test prompt. claude mcp add cadcraft --scope user -- npx -y @getcadcraft/mcp connect Undo: claude mcp remove cadcraft --scope user Cursor Open ~/.cursor/mcp.json (it is made if it does not exist; keep anything already in it). Add the CadCraft entry below (inside \"mcpServers\" if the file has one). Start Cursor and ask it the test prompt. { \"mcpServers\": { \"cadcraft\": { \"command\": \"npx\", \"args\": [ \"-y\", \"@getcadcraft/mcp\", \"connect\" ] } } } Undo: Delete the \"cadcraft\" entry from ~/.cursor/mcp.json. This path comes from the AI app's public guides. If it does not match your install, use Studio's Connect, which looks first. Windsurf Open ~/.codeium/windsurf/mcp_config.json (it is made if it does not exist; keep anything already in it). Add the CadCraft entry below (inside \"mcpServers\" if the file has one). Start Windsurf and ask it the test prompt. { \"mcpServers\": { \"cadcraft\": { \"command\": \"npx\", \"args\": [ \"-y\", \"@getcadcraft/mcp\", \"connect\" ] } } } Undo: Delete the \"cadcraft\" entry from ~/.codeium/windsurf/mcp_config.json. This path comes from the AI app's public guides. If it does not match your install, use Studio's Connect, which looks first. Visual Studio Code Open ~/Library/Application Support/Code/User/mcp.json (it is made if it does not exist; keep anything already in it). Add the CadCraft entry below (inside \"servers\" if the file has one). Start Visual Studio Code and ask it the test prompt. { \"servers\": { \"cadcraft\": { \"type\": \"stdio\", \"command\": \"npx\", \"args\": [ \"-y\", \"@getcadcraft/mcp\", \"connect\" ] } } } Undo: Delete the \"cadcraft\" entry from ~/Library/Application Support/Code/User/mcp.json. This path comes from the AI app's public guides. If it does not match your install, use Studio's Connect, which looks first. Codex CLI Open ~/.codex/config.toml (it is made if it does not exist; keep anything already in it). Add the CadCraft entry below (inside \"mcp_servers\" if the file has one). Start Codex CLI and ask it the test prompt. [mcp_servers.cadcraft] command = \"npx\" args = [\"-y\",\"@getcadcraft/mcp\",\"connect\"] Undo: Delete the \"cadcraft\" entry from ~/.codex/config.toml. This path comes from the AI app's public guides. If it does not match your install, use Studio's Connect, which looks first. Google Antigravity Open ~/.gemini/config/mcp_config.json (it is made if it does not exist; keep anything already in it). Add the CadCraft entry below (inside \"mcpServers\" if the file has one). Start Google Antigravity and ask it the test prompt. { \"mcpServers\": { \"cadcraft\": { \"command\": \"npx\", \"args\": [ \"-y\", \"@getcadcraft/mcp\", \"connect\" ] } } } Undo: Delete the \"cadcraft\" entry from ~/.gemini/config/mcp_config.json. This path comes from the AI app's public guides. If it does not match your install, use Studio's Connect, which looks first. Gemini CLI Open ~/.gemini/settings.json (it is made if it does not exist; keep anything already in it). Add the CadCraft entry below (inside \"mcpServers\" if the file has one). Start Gemini CLI and ask it the test prompt. { \"mcpServers\": { \"cadcraft\": { \"command\": \"npx\", \"args\": [ \"-y\", \"@getcadcraft/mcp\", \"connect\" ] } } } Undo: Delete the \"cadcraft\" entry from ~/.gemini/settings.json. This path comes from the AI app's public guides. If it does not match your install, use Studio's Connect, which looks first. Browser AI and phones AI apps in a web browser, and on phones and tablets, cannot read a settings file on your computer. They use the hosted connector instead (needs CadCraft Studio open on a computer). Studio › Connect your AI shows the link. If it does not work The AI app does not list CadCraft: restart it fully (quit, not just close the window), then check the entry is in its settings. \"Could not reach CadCraft Studio\": open Studio and the app you want; each app has Settings › Assistants to turn on. It can look but not change: Edit, Save and Export are separate permissions you turn on per app in Studio.","lang":"en"},{"slug":"connect-ai-linux","scope":"basics","title":"Connect your AI on Linux","summary":"Let your own AI app work with the CadCraft apps: one click in CadCraft Studio, or a short paste for each AI app. Includes the one-line test that proves it works.","section":"start","order":65,"keywords":["ai","assistant","connect","mcp","claude","cursor","vs code","windsurf","codex","gemini","set up","test","linux"],"headings":[{"id":"what-you-will-learn","text":"What you will learn","level":2},{"id":"the-easy-way","text":"The easy way","level":2},{"id":"prove-it-works","text":"Prove it works","level":2},{"id":"or-paste-it-yourself","text":"Or paste it yourself","level":2},{"id":"claude-desktop","text":"Claude Desktop","level":3},{"id":"claude-code","text":"Claude Code","level":3},{"id":"cursor","text":"Cursor","level":3},{"id":"windsurf","text":"Windsurf","level":3},{"id":"visual-studio-code","text":"Visual Studio Code","level":3},{"id":"codex-cli","text":"Codex CLI","level":3},{"id":"google-antigravity","text":"Google Antigravity","level":3},{"id":"gemini-cli","text":"Gemini CLI","level":3},{"id":"browser-ai-and-phones","text":"Browser AI and phones","level":2},{"id":"if-it-does-not-work","text":"If it does not work","level":2}],"html":"\u003Ch2 id=\"what-you-will-learn\"\u003EWhat you will learn\u003C/h2\u003E\n\u003Cp\u003EHow to let the AI app you already use (Claude, Cursor, Visual Studio Code, Windsurf, Codex, Gemini…) reach your CadCraft apps, how to check that it works in under a minute, and how to take it out again. The apps contain no AI; your AI app asks them to do things, and you decide what it may do. (For those who search for it: this uses the Model Context Protocol, &quot;MCP&quot;.)\u003C/p\u003E\n\u003Ch2 id=\"the-easy-way\"\u003EThe easy way\u003C/h2\u003E\n\u003Cp\u003EOpen \u003Cstrong\u003ECadCraft Studio › Connect your AI\u003C/strong\u003E. Studio looks for the AI apps on this computer, shows you in plain words what it would add to each one&#039;s settings, and writes it only after you press \u003Cstrong\u003EYes\u003C/strong\u003E. \u003Cstrong\u003EDisconnect\u003C/strong\u003E takes it out again. Nothing secret is written into the AI app&#039;s settings.\u003C/p\u003E\n\u003Ch2 id=\"prove-it-works\"\u003EProve it works\u003C/h2\u003E\n\u003Cp\u003EIn your AI app, paste this:\u003C/p\u003E\n\u003Cpre class=\"hcode\"\u003E\u003Ccode\u003EUse the CadCraft tools: list the apps you can reach, then open the sample drawing in my CadCraft folder and tell me how many objects it has, by layer.\u003C/code\u003E\u003C/pre\u003E\n\u003Cp\u003EIt should list the CadCraft apps it can reach and then give you a count by layer. It only reads, so it needs no extra permission beyond the \u003Cstrong\u003ERead\u003C/strong\u003E that is on to begin with. In Studio, \u003Cstrong\u003ECheck the connection\u003C/strong\u003E tests each step without the AI and says which one failed.\u003C/p\u003E\n\u003Ch2 id=\"or-paste-it-yourself\"\u003EOr paste it yourself\u003C/h2\u003E\n\u003Cp\u003EOne card for each AI app. Each one adds a single entry named \u003Ccode\u003Ecadcraft\u003C/code\u003E and nothing else.\u003C/p\u003E\n\u003Ch3 id=\"claude-desktop\"\u003EClaude Desktop\u003C/h3\u003E\n\u003Col\u003E\u003Cli\u003EOpen ~/.config/Claude/claude_desktop_config.json (it is made if it does not exist; keep anything already in it).\u003C/li\u003E\u003Cli\u003EAdd the CadCraft entry below (inside &quot;mcpServers&quot; if the file has one).\u003C/li\u003E\u003Cli\u003ERestart Claude Desktop completely, then ask it the test prompt.\u003C/li\u003E\u003C/ol\u003E\n\u003Cpre class=\"hcode\"\u003E\u003Ccode\u003E{\n  &quot;mcpServers&quot;: {\n    &quot;cadcraft&quot;: {\n      &quot;command&quot;: &quot;npx&quot;,\n      &quot;args&quot;: [\n        &quot;-y&quot;,\n        &quot;@getcadcraft/mcp&quot;,\n        &quot;connect&quot;\n      ]\n    }\n  }\n}\u003C/code\u003E\u003C/pre\u003E\n\u003Cp\u003E\u003Cstrong\u003EUndo:\u003C/strong\u003E Delete the &quot;cadcraft&quot; entry from ~/.config/Claude/claude_desktop_config.json.\u003C/p\u003E\n\u003Ch3 id=\"claude-code\"\u003EClaude Code\u003C/h3\u003E\n\u003Col\u003E\u003Cli\u003EOpen a terminal.\u003C/li\u003E\u003Cli\u003ERun the command below.\u003C/li\u003E\u003Cli\u003EStart Claude Code and ask it the test prompt.\u003C/li\u003E\u003C/ol\u003E\n\u003Cpre class=\"hcode\"\u003E\u003Ccode\u003Eclaude mcp add cadcraft --scope user -- npx -y @getcadcraft/mcp connect\u003C/code\u003E\u003C/pre\u003E\n\u003Cp\u003E\u003Cstrong\u003EUndo:\u003C/strong\u003E claude mcp remove cadcraft --scope user\u003C/p\u003E\n\u003Ch3 id=\"cursor\"\u003ECursor\u003C/h3\u003E\n\u003Col\u003E\u003Cli\u003EOpen ~/.cursor/mcp.json (it is made if it does not exist; keep anything already in it).\u003C/li\u003E\u003Cli\u003EAdd the CadCraft entry below (inside &quot;mcpServers&quot; if the file has one).\u003C/li\u003E\u003Cli\u003EStart Cursor and ask it the test prompt.\u003C/li\u003E\u003C/ol\u003E\n\u003Cpre class=\"hcode\"\u003E\u003Ccode\u003E{\n  &quot;mcpServers&quot;: {\n    &quot;cadcraft&quot;: {\n      &quot;command&quot;: &quot;npx&quot;,\n      &quot;args&quot;: [\n        &quot;-y&quot;,\n        &quot;@getcadcraft/mcp&quot;,\n        &quot;connect&quot;\n      ]\n    }\n  }\n}\u003C/code\u003E\u003C/pre\u003E\n\u003Cp\u003E\u003Cstrong\u003EUndo:\u003C/strong\u003E Delete the &quot;cadcraft&quot; entry from ~/.cursor/mcp.json.\u003C/p\u003E\n\u003Caside class=\"hc hc-tip\"\u003E\u003Cp class=\"hc-label\"\u003ETip\u003C/p\u003E\n\u003Cp\u003EThis path comes from the AI app&#039;s public guides. If it does not match your install, use Studio&#039;s Connect, which looks first.\u003C/p\u003E\n\u003C/aside\u003E\n\u003Ch3 id=\"windsurf\"\u003EWindsurf\u003C/h3\u003E\n\u003Col\u003E\u003Cli\u003EOpen ~/.codeium/windsurf/mcp_config.json (it is made if it does not exist; keep anything already in it).\u003C/li\u003E\u003Cli\u003EAdd the CadCraft entry below (inside &quot;mcpServers&quot; if the file has one).\u003C/li\u003E\u003Cli\u003EStart Windsurf and ask it the test prompt.\u003C/li\u003E\u003C/ol\u003E\n\u003Cpre class=\"hcode\"\u003E\u003Ccode\u003E{\n  &quot;mcpServers&quot;: {\n    &quot;cadcraft&quot;: {\n      &quot;command&quot;: &quot;npx&quot;,\n      &quot;args&quot;: [\n        &quot;-y&quot;,\n        &quot;@getcadcraft/mcp&quot;,\n        &quot;connect&quot;\n      ]\n    }\n  }\n}\u003C/code\u003E\u003C/pre\u003E\n\u003Cp\u003E\u003Cstrong\u003EUndo:\u003C/strong\u003E Delete the &quot;cadcraft&quot; entry from ~/.codeium/windsurf/mcp_config.json.\u003C/p\u003E\n\u003Caside class=\"hc hc-tip\"\u003E\u003Cp class=\"hc-label\"\u003ETip\u003C/p\u003E\n\u003Cp\u003EThis path comes from the AI app&#039;s public guides. If it does not match your install, use Studio&#039;s Connect, which looks first.\u003C/p\u003E\n\u003C/aside\u003E\n\u003Ch3 id=\"visual-studio-code\"\u003EVisual Studio Code\u003C/h3\u003E\n\u003Col\u003E\u003Cli\u003EOpen ~/.config/Code/User/mcp.json (it is made if it does not exist; keep anything already in it).\u003C/li\u003E\u003Cli\u003EAdd the CadCraft entry below (inside &quot;servers&quot; if the file has one).\u003C/li\u003E\u003Cli\u003EStart Visual Studio Code and ask it the test prompt.\u003C/li\u003E\u003C/ol\u003E\n\u003Cpre class=\"hcode\"\u003E\u003Ccode\u003E{\n  &quot;servers&quot;: {\n    &quot;cadcraft&quot;: {\n      &quot;type&quot;: &quot;stdio&quot;,\n      &quot;command&quot;: &quot;npx&quot;,\n      &quot;args&quot;: [\n        &quot;-y&quot;,\n        &quot;@getcadcraft/mcp&quot;,\n        &quot;connect&quot;\n      ]\n    }\n  }\n}\u003C/code\u003E\u003C/pre\u003E\n\u003Cp\u003E\u003Cstrong\u003EUndo:\u003C/strong\u003E Delete the &quot;cadcraft&quot; entry from ~/.config/Code/User/mcp.json.\u003C/p\u003E\n\u003Caside class=\"hc hc-tip\"\u003E\u003Cp class=\"hc-label\"\u003ETip\u003C/p\u003E\n\u003Cp\u003EThis path comes from the AI app&#039;s public guides. If it does not match your install, use Studio&#039;s Connect, which looks first.\u003C/p\u003E\n\u003C/aside\u003E\n\u003Ch3 id=\"codex-cli\"\u003ECodex CLI\u003C/h3\u003E\n\u003Col\u003E\u003Cli\u003EOpen ~/.codex/config.toml (it is made if it does not exist; keep anything already in it).\u003C/li\u003E\u003Cli\u003EAdd the CadCraft entry below (inside &quot;mcp_servers&quot; if the file has one).\u003C/li\u003E\u003Cli\u003EStart Codex CLI and ask it the test prompt.\u003C/li\u003E\u003C/ol\u003E\n\u003Cpre class=\"hcode\"\u003E\u003Ccode\u003E[mcp_servers.cadcraft]\ncommand = &quot;npx&quot;\nargs = [&quot;-y&quot;,&quot;@getcadcraft/mcp&quot;,&quot;connect&quot;]\u003C/code\u003E\u003C/pre\u003E\n\u003Cp\u003E\u003Cstrong\u003EUndo:\u003C/strong\u003E Delete the &quot;cadcraft&quot; entry from ~/.codex/config.toml.\u003C/p\u003E\n\u003Caside class=\"hc hc-tip\"\u003E\u003Cp class=\"hc-label\"\u003ETip\u003C/p\u003E\n\u003Cp\u003EThis path comes from the AI app&#039;s public guides. If it does not match your install, use Studio&#039;s Connect, which looks first.\u003C/p\u003E\n\u003C/aside\u003E\n\u003Ch3 id=\"google-antigravity\"\u003EGoogle Antigravity\u003C/h3\u003E\n\u003Col\u003E\u003Cli\u003EOpen ~/.gemini/config/mcp_config.json (it is made if it does not exist; keep anything already in it).\u003C/li\u003E\u003Cli\u003EAdd the CadCraft entry below (inside &quot;mcpServers&quot; if the file has one).\u003C/li\u003E\u003Cli\u003EStart Google Antigravity and ask it the test prompt.\u003C/li\u003E\u003C/ol\u003E\n\u003Cpre class=\"hcode\"\u003E\u003Ccode\u003E{\n  &quot;mcpServers&quot;: {\n    &quot;cadcraft&quot;: {\n      &quot;command&quot;: &quot;npx&quot;,\n      &quot;args&quot;: [\n        &quot;-y&quot;,\n        &quot;@getcadcraft/mcp&quot;,\n        &quot;connect&quot;\n      ]\n    }\n  }\n}\u003C/code\u003E\u003C/pre\u003E\n\u003Cp\u003E\u003Cstrong\u003EUndo:\u003C/strong\u003E Delete the &quot;cadcraft&quot; entry from ~/.gemini/config/mcp_config.json.\u003C/p\u003E\n\u003Caside class=\"hc hc-tip\"\u003E\u003Cp class=\"hc-label\"\u003ETip\u003C/p\u003E\n\u003Cp\u003EThis path comes from the AI app&#039;s public guides. If it does not match your install, use Studio&#039;s Connect, which looks first.\u003C/p\u003E\n\u003C/aside\u003E\n\u003Ch3 id=\"gemini-cli\"\u003EGemini CLI\u003C/h3\u003E\n\u003Col\u003E\u003Cli\u003EOpen ~/.gemini/settings.json (it is made if it does not exist; keep anything already in it).\u003C/li\u003E\u003Cli\u003EAdd the CadCraft entry below (inside &quot;mcpServers&quot; if the file has one).\u003C/li\u003E\u003Cli\u003EStart Gemini CLI and ask it the test prompt.\u003C/li\u003E\u003C/ol\u003E\n\u003Cpre class=\"hcode\"\u003E\u003Ccode\u003E{\n  &quot;mcpServers&quot;: {\n    &quot;cadcraft&quot;: {\n      &quot;command&quot;: &quot;npx&quot;,\n      &quot;args&quot;: [\n        &quot;-y&quot;,\n        &quot;@getcadcraft/mcp&quot;,\n        &quot;connect&quot;\n      ]\n    }\n  }\n}\u003C/code\u003E\u003C/pre\u003E\n\u003Cp\u003E\u003Cstrong\u003EUndo:\u003C/strong\u003E Delete the &quot;cadcraft&quot; entry from ~/.gemini/settings.json.\u003C/p\u003E\n\u003Caside class=\"hc hc-tip\"\u003E\u003Cp class=\"hc-label\"\u003ETip\u003C/p\u003E\n\u003Cp\u003EThis path comes from the AI app&#039;s public guides. If it does not match your install, use Studio&#039;s Connect, which looks first.\u003C/p\u003E\n\u003C/aside\u003E\n\u003Ch2 id=\"browser-ai-and-phones\"\u003EBrowser AI and phones\u003C/h2\u003E\n\u003Cp\u003EAI apps in a web browser, and on phones and tablets, cannot read a settings file on your computer. They use the \u003Cstrong\u003Ehosted connector\u003C/strong\u003E instead (needs CadCraft Studio open on a computer). Studio › Connect your AI shows the link.\u003C/p\u003E\n\u003Ch2 id=\"if-it-does-not-work\"\u003EIf it does not work\u003C/h2\u003E\n\u003Cul\u003E\u003Cli\u003E\u003Cstrong\u003EThe AI app does not list CadCraft:\u003C/strong\u003E restart it fully (quit, not just close the window), then check the entry is in its settings.\u003C/li\u003E\u003Cli\u003E\u003Cstrong\u003E&quot;Could not reach CadCraft Studio&quot;:\u003C/strong\u003E open Studio and the app you want; each app has Settings › Assistants to turn on.\u003C/li\u003E\u003Cli\u003E\u003Cstrong\u003EIt can look but not change:\u003C/strong\u003E Edit, Save and Export are separate permissions you turn on per app in Studio.\u003C/li\u003E\u003C/ul\u003E","text":"What you will learn How to let the AI app you already use (Claude, Cursor, Visual Studio Code, Windsurf, Codex, Gemini…) reach your CadCraft apps, how to check that it works in under a minute, and how to take it out again. The apps contain no AI; your AI app asks them to do things, and you decide what it may do. (For those who search for it: this uses the Model Context Protocol, \"MCP\".) The easy way Open CadCraft Studio › Connect your AI. Studio looks for the AI apps on this computer, shows you in plain words what it would add to each one's settings, and writes it only after you press Yes. Disconnect takes it out again. Nothing secret is written into the AI app's settings. Prove it works In your AI app, paste this: Use the CadCraft tools: list the apps you can reach, then open the sample drawing in my CadCraft folder and tell me how many objects it has, by layer. It should list the CadCraft apps it can reach and then give you a count by layer. It only reads, so it needs no extra permission beyond the Read that is on to begin with. In Studio, Check the connection tests each step without the AI and says which one failed. Or paste it yourself One card for each AI app. Each one adds a single entry named cadcraft and nothing else. Claude Desktop Open ~/.config/Claude/claude_desktop_config.json (it is made if it does not exist; keep anything already in it). Add the CadCraft entry below (inside \"mcpServers\" if the file has one). Restart Claude Desktop completely, then ask it the test prompt. { \"mcpServers\": { \"cadcraft\": { \"command\": \"npx\", \"args\": [ \"-y\", \"@getcadcraft/mcp\", \"connect\" ] } } } Undo: Delete the \"cadcraft\" entry from ~/.config/Claude/claude_desktop_config.json. Claude Code Open a terminal. Run the command below. Start Claude Code and ask it the test prompt. claude mcp add cadcraft --scope user -- npx -y @getcadcraft/mcp connect Undo: claude mcp remove cadcraft --scope user Cursor Open ~/.cursor/mcp.json (it is made if it does not exist; keep anything already in it). Add the CadCraft entry below (inside \"mcpServers\" if the file has one). Start Cursor and ask it the test prompt. { \"mcpServers\": { \"cadcraft\": { \"command\": \"npx\", \"args\": [ \"-y\", \"@getcadcraft/mcp\", \"connect\" ] } } } Undo: Delete the \"cadcraft\" entry from ~/.cursor/mcp.json. This path comes from the AI app's public guides. If it does not match your install, use Studio's Connect, which looks first. Windsurf Open ~/.codeium/windsurf/mcp_config.json (it is made if it does not exist; keep anything already in it). Add the CadCraft entry below (inside \"mcpServers\" if the file has one). Start Windsurf and ask it the test prompt. { \"mcpServers\": { \"cadcraft\": { \"command\": \"npx\", \"args\": [ \"-y\", \"@getcadcraft/mcp\", \"connect\" ] } } } Undo: Delete the \"cadcraft\" entry from ~/.codeium/windsurf/mcp_config.json. This path comes from the AI app's public guides. If it does not match your install, use Studio's Connect, which looks first. Visual Studio Code Open ~/.config/Code/User/mcp.json (it is made if it does not exist; keep anything already in it). Add the CadCraft entry below (inside \"servers\" if the file has one). Start Visual Studio Code and ask it the test prompt. { \"servers\": { \"cadcraft\": { \"type\": \"stdio\", \"command\": \"npx\", \"args\": [ \"-y\", \"@getcadcraft/mcp\", \"connect\" ] } } } Undo: Delete the \"cadcraft\" entry from ~/.config/Code/User/mcp.json. This path comes from the AI app's public guides. If it does not match your install, use Studio's Connect, which looks first. Codex CLI Open ~/.codex/config.toml (it is made if it does not exist; keep anything already in it). Add the CadCraft entry below (inside \"mcp_servers\" if the file has one). Start Codex CLI and ask it the test prompt. [mcp_servers.cadcraft] command = \"npx\" args = [\"-y\",\"@getcadcraft/mcp\",\"connect\"] Undo: Delete the \"cadcraft\" entry from ~/.codex/config.toml. This path comes from the AI app's public guides. If it does not match your install, use Studio's Connect, which looks first. Google Antigravity Open ~/.gemini/config/mcp_config.json (it is made if it does not exist; keep anything already in it). Add the CadCraft entry below (inside \"mcpServers\" if the file has one). Start Google Antigravity and ask it the test prompt. { \"mcpServers\": { \"cadcraft\": { \"command\": \"npx\", \"args\": [ \"-y\", \"@getcadcraft/mcp\", \"connect\" ] } } } Undo: Delete the \"cadcraft\" entry from ~/.gemini/config/mcp_config.json. This path comes from the AI app's public guides. If it does not match your install, use Studio's Connect, which looks first. Gemini CLI Open ~/.gemini/settings.json (it is made if it does not exist; keep anything already in it). Add the CadCraft entry below (inside \"mcpServers\" if the file has one). Start Gemini CLI and ask it the test prompt. { \"mcpServers\": { \"cadcraft\": { \"command\": \"npx\", \"args\": [ \"-y\", \"@getcadcraft/mcp\", \"connect\" ] } } } Undo: Delete the \"cadcraft\" entry from ~/.gemini/settings.json. This path comes from the AI app's public guides. If it does not match your install, use Studio's Connect, which looks first. Browser AI and phones AI apps in a web browser, and on phones and tablets, cannot read a settings file on your computer. They use the hosted connector instead (needs CadCraft Studio open on a computer). Studio › Connect your AI shows the link. If it does not work The AI app does not list CadCraft: restart it fully (quit, not just close the window), then check the entry is in its settings. \"Could not reach CadCraft Studio\": open Studio and the app you want; each app has Settings › Assistants to turn on. It can look but not change: Edit, Save and Export are separate permissions you turn on per app in Studio.","lang":"en"},{"slug":"connect-ai-mobile","scope":"basics","title":"Connect your AI on a phone or tablet","summary":"How your own AI app reaches the CadCraft apps from a phone or tablet: through the hosted connector, with CadCraft Studio open on a computer. Includes the one-line test.","section":"start","order":66,"keywords":["ai","assistant","connect","android","ipad","phone","tablet","hosted connector","test"],"headings":[{"id":"what-you-will-learn","text":"What you will learn","level":2},{"id":"how","text":"How","level":2},{"id":"prove-it-works","text":"Prove it works","level":2},{"id":"what-it-can-and-cannot-do","text":"What it can and cannot do","level":2}],"html":"\u003Ch2 id=\"what-you-will-learn\"\u003EWhat you will learn\u003C/h2\u003E\n\u003Cp\u003EAn AI app on a phone or tablet cannot read a settings file on your computer, so it does not use the paste cards. It connects to a \u003Cstrong\u003Ehosted connector\u003C/strong\u003E instead, and CadCraft Studio must be open on a computer you own to answer.\u003C/p\u003E\n\u003Ch2 id=\"how\"\u003EHow\u003C/h2\u003E\n\u003Col\u003E\u003Cli\u003EOn the computer, open \u003Cstrong\u003ECadCraft Studio › Connect your AI\u003C/strong\u003E and choose \u003Cstrong\u003EHosted connector\u003C/strong\u003E. Studio shows the address to add and asks you to sign in.\u003C/li\u003E\u003Cli\u003EIn your AI app, add a connector (a &quot;remote&quot; or &quot;custom&quot; connector) with that address and sign in when asked.\u003C/li\u003E\u003Cli\u003EKeep Studio open. When it is closed the AI app says CadCraft is not reachable.\u003C/li\u003E\u003C/ol\u003E\n\u003Ch2 id=\"prove-it-works\"\u003EProve it works\u003C/h2\u003E\n\u003Cp\u003EIn your AI app, paste this:\u003C/p\u003E\n\u003Cpre class=\"hcode\"\u003E\u003Ccode\u003EUse the CadCraft tools: list the apps you can reach, then open the sample drawing in my CadCraft folder and tell me how many objects it has, by layer.\u003C/code\u003E\u003C/pre\u003E\n\u003Ch2 id=\"what-it-can-and-cannot-do\"\u003EWhat it can and cannot do\u003C/h2\u003E\n\u003Cp\u003EThe hosted connector carries only the tool calls and their answers for the apps and permissions you allowed. It never holds your files, and the answers are marked as data from your files, not as instructions. You can disconnect it in Studio at any time.\u003C/p\u003E","text":"What you will learn An AI app on a phone or tablet cannot read a settings file on your computer, so it does not use the paste cards. It connects to a hosted connector instead, and CadCraft Studio must be open on a computer you own to answer. How On the computer, open CadCraft Studio › Connect your AI and choose Hosted connector. Studio shows the address to add and asks you to sign in. In your AI app, add a connector (a \"remote\" or \"custom\" connector) with that address and sign in when asked. Keep Studio open. When it is closed the AI app says CadCraft is not reachable. Prove it works In your AI app, paste this: Use the CadCraft tools: list the apps you can reach, then open the sample drawing in my CadCraft folder and tell me how many objects it has, by layer. What it can and cannot do The hosted connector carries only the tool calls and their answers for the apps and permissions you allowed. It never holds your files, and the answers are marked as data from your files, not as instructions. You can disconnect it in Studio at any time.","lang":"en"},{"slug":"local-models","scope":"basics","title":"Use an AI that runs on your own computer","summary":"Work with a local AI model and no network: through an AI app that can use tools, .","section":"start","order":66,"keywords":["ai","assistant","local","offline","ollama","lm studio","llama.cpp","jan","air-gapped","private","model","ask box"],"headings":[{"id":"what-you-will-learn","text":"What you will learn","level":2},{"id":"how","text":"How","level":2},{"id":"good-to-know","text":"Good to know","level":2}],"html":"\u003Ch2 id=\"what-you-will-learn\"\u003EWhat you will learn\u003C/h2\u003E\n\u003Cp\u003EHow to use an AI model that runs on your own computer, so nothing you ask leaves it. This suits firms that cannot send drawings to an outside service. The apps contain no AI; the model asks them to do things, and you decide what it may do.\u003C/p\u003E\n\u003Ch2 id=\"how\"\u003EHow\u003C/h2\u003E\n\u003Cp\u003EUse an AI app on this computer that can use tools. LM Studio, Jan and llama.cpp&#039;s server can each use tools through the Model Context Protocol (&quot;MCP&quot;). Add the single \u003Ccode\u003Ecadcraft\u003C/code\u003E entry shown in \u003Cstrong\u003EConnect your AI\u003C/strong\u003E, open CadCraft Studio, then ask your question in that app.\u003C/p\u003E\n\u003Cdiv class=\"ht-wrap\"\u003E\u003Ctable class=\"ht\"\u003E\u003Cthead\u003E\u003Ctr\u003E\u003Cth scope=\"col\"\u003EProgram\u003C/th\u003E\u003Cth scope=\"col\"\u003ECan use tools through MCP\u003C/th\u003E\u003C/tr\u003E\u003C/thead\u003E\u003Ctbody\u003E\u003Ctr\u003E\u003Ctd\u003ELM Studio\u003C/td\u003E\u003Ctd\u003EYes\u003C/td\u003E\u003C/tr\u003E\u003Ctr\u003E\u003Ctd\u003Ellama.cpp (llama-server)\u003C/td\u003E\u003Ctd\u003EYes, start it with \u003Ccode\u003E--jinja\u003C/code\u003E\u003C/td\u003E\u003C/tr\u003E\u003Ctr\u003E\u003Ctd\u003EJan\u003C/td\u003E\u003Ctd\u003EYes, turn on tool calling for the model\u003C/td\u003E\u003C/tr\u003E\u003Ctr\u003E\u003Ctd\u003EOllama\u003C/td\u003E\u003Ctd\u003ENot on its own: use it as the model, with Jan or an editor in front\u003C/td\u003E\u003C/tr\u003E\u003C/tbody\u003E\u003C/table\u003E\u003C/div\u003E\n\u003Cp\u003EThis list is taken from each program&#039;s own documentation. It has not yet been tried with every program on every system.\u003C/p\u003E\n\u003Ch2 id=\"good-to-know\"\u003EGood to know\u003C/h2\u003E\n\u003Cul\u003E\u003Cli\u003ERaise the model&#039;s context length before you start; the default in some programs is small and tool descriptions will not fit.\u003C/li\u003E\u003Cli\u003ESmall models call tools less reliably than large hosted ones. If the answer says what it would do but nothing changes, try a larger model or a model marked as able to use tools.\u003C/li\u003E\u003Cli\u003EEverything else stays the same: the permission levels, \u003Cstrong\u003ESuggest\u003C/strong\u003E mode, the folders you allowed and the activity list. A model on this computer sends nothing out.\u003C/li\u003E\u003C/ul\u003E","text":"What you will learn How to use an AI model that runs on your own computer, so nothing you ask leaves it. This suits firms that cannot send drawings to an outside service. The apps contain no AI; the model asks them to do things, and you decide what it may do. How Use an AI app on this computer that can use tools. LM Studio, Jan and llama.cpp's server can each use tools through the Model Context Protocol (\"MCP\"). Add the single cadcraft entry shown in Connect your AI, open CadCraft Studio, then ask your question in that app. Program Can use tools through MCP LM Studio Yes llama.cpp (llama-server) Yes, start it with --jinja Jan Yes, turn on tool calling for the model Ollama Not on its own: use it as the model, with Jan or an editor in front This list is taken from each program's own documentation. It has not yet been tried with every program on every system. Good to know Raise the model's context length before you start; the default in some programs is small and tool descriptions will not fit. Small models call tools less reliably than large hosted ones. If the answer says what it would do but nothing changes, try a larger model or a model marked as able to use tools. Everything else stays the same: the permission levels, Suggest mode, the folders you allowed and the activity list. A model on this computer sends nothing out.","lang":"en"},{"slug":"engines","scope":"basics","title":"Run an engine on a model","summary":"The Engines panel runs the shared calculation engines (schematics, pipe and power networks, motion, queues, schedule and cost, requirements, risk, live data, circuits, boards, systems, PLC) on a model you paste.","section":"tasks","order":40,"keywords":["engines","schematic","network","power","load flow","robot","kinematics","queue","simulation","schedule","critical path","requirements","risk","fault tree","modbus","circuit","spice","board","pcb","modelica","plc"],"headings":[{"id":"run-one","text":"Run one","level":2},{"id":"controls-on-a-model-or-on-the-3d-scene","text":"Controls on a model, or on the 3D scene","level":2},{"id":"things-to-know","text":"Things to know","level":2}],"html":"\u003Cp\u003ESome calculations are the same in every app, so they live in one panel instead of eight. Open \u003Cstrong\u003EEngines\u003C/strong\u003E from the button in the bar at the top, or press \u003Ckbd class=\"hk\"\u003E\u003Cspan class=\"k-mac\" title=\"Command K\"\u003E⌘K\u003C/span\u003E\u003Cspan class=\"k-pc\"\u003ECtrl+K\u003C/span\u003E\u003C/kbd\u003E and type &quot;engines&quot;.\u003C/p\u003E\n\u003Ch2 id=\"run-one\"\u003ERun one\u003C/h2\u003E\n\u003Col\u003E\u003Cli\u003EChoose an engine from the list: schematics, pipe networks and power systems, motion and robots, queues, schedule and cost, requirements, risk, live data, circuits, boards, systems or controls.\u003C/li\u003E\u003Cli\u003EChoose a worked example, or replace the text with your own model. Most engines read JSON; circuits, systems and controls read their own text (a circuit deck, Modelica, structured text).\u003C/li\u003E\u003Cli\u003EPress \u003Cspan class=\"hui\"\u003ERun\u003C/span\u003E. The results come back as tables, with the engine&#039;s own problems above them and the limits of its method below.\u003C/li\u003E\u003C/ol\u003E\n\u003Cp\u003E\u003Cspan class=\"hui\"\u003EReset\u003C/span\u003E puts the example text back.\u003C/p\u003E\n\u003Ch2 id=\"controls-on-a-model-or-on-the-3d-scene\"\u003EControls on a model, or on the 3D scene\u003C/h2\u003E\n\u003Cp\u003EThe controls engine also takes a JSON input that ties a structured-text program to something it can sense and command. \u003Cspan class=\"hui\"\u003EThe program bound to a flow model\u003C/span\u003E is the queues engine&#039;s model. In ModelCraft, \u003Cspan class=\"hui\"\u003EThe program bound to the 3D scene\u003C/span\u003E ties it to the placements (groups and components) of the open model: a sensor reads \u003Ccode\u003EName.x\u003C/code\u003E, \u003Ccode\u003EName.y\u003C/code\u003E, \u003Ccode\u003EName.z\u003C/code\u003E, \u003Ccode\u003EName.rotZ\u003C/code\u003E or \u003Ccode\u003EName.hidden\u003C/code\u003E, a command writes one of them, and the program decides. Position sensors are whole numbers, so give each a \u003Ccode\u003Escale\u003C/code\u003E (1000 turns metres into millimetres); a command is on or off, and \u003Ccode\u003Evalues\u003C/code\u003E says what off and on mean (\u003Ccode\u003E[0, 2]\u003C/code\u003E puts the placement at 0 or 2 m). A run changes nothing in the model: the results table shows where each placement would end up. Add \u003Ccode\u003E&quot;keep&quot;: true\u003C/code\u003E to write the final state into the model as one undo step. A placement that is not in the model is reported by name.\u003C/p\u003E\n\u003Ch2 id=\"things-to-know\"\u003EThings to know\u003C/h2\u003E\n\u003Cul\u003E\u003Cli\u003EEverything runs in this page. Nothing is uploaded, and nothing is saved in your file.\u003C/li\u003E\u003Cli\u003EProblems the engine finds also appear in the Problems panel, under their own source.\u003C/li\u003E\u003Cli\u003EThe examples are small on purpose, with answers you can check by hand. They are a way to see what an engine does, not a design.\u003C/li\u003E\u003Cli\u003EThe results are calculation aids. A person who is responsible for the design checks them.\u003C/li\u003E\u003C/ul\u003E","text":"Some calculations are the same in every app, so they live in one panel instead of eight. Open Engines from the button in the bar at the top, or press Ctrl+K and type \"engines\". Run one Choose an engine from the list: schematics, pipe networks and power systems, motion and robots, queues, schedule and cost, requirements, risk, live data, circuits, boards, systems or controls. Choose a worked example, or replace the text with your own model. Most engines read JSON; circuits, systems and controls read their own text (a circuit deck, Modelica, structured text). Press Run. The results come back as tables, with the engine's own problems above them and the limits of its method below. Reset puts the example text back. Controls on a model, or on the 3D scene The controls engine also takes a JSON input that ties a structured-text program to something it can sense and command. The program bound to a flow model is the queues engine's model. In ModelCraft, The program bound to the 3D scene ties it to the placements (groups and components) of the open model: a sensor reads Name.x, Name.y, Name.z, Name.rotZ or Name.hidden, a command writes one of them, and the program decides. Position sensors are whole numbers, so give each a scale (1000 turns metres into millimetres); a command is on or off, and values says what off and on mean ([0, 2] puts the placement at 0 or 2 m). A run changes nothing in the model: the results table shows where each placement would end up. Add \"keep\": true to write the final state into the model as one undo step. A placement that is not in the model is reported by name. Things to know Everything runs in this page. Nothing is uploaded, and nothing is saved in your file. Problems the engine finds also appear in the Problems panel, under their own source. The examples are small on purpose, with answers you can check by hand. They are a way to see what an engine does, not a design. The results are calculation aids. A person who is responsible for the design checks them.","lang":"en"},{"slug":"assistant-in-the-app","scope":"basics","title":"Ask for help inside the app","summary":"Open the Ask box from Help, see why something happened from the steps you took, report a problem with those steps, and see exactly what an assistant was sent.","section":"tasks","order":62,"keywords":["show me how","teacher","walk me through","how do i","sign off","signed off","unsigned","unverified","figures","rules","ask","assistant","ai","help button","why did this happen","history","steps","undo","report a problem","bug report","model excerpt","model data only","personal data","sent back","held back","project stage","brief","concept","tender","step by step","teacher","knowledge pack"],"headings":[{"id":"open-it-from-help","text":"Open it from Help","level":2},{"id":"why-did-this-happen","text":"Why did this happen?","level":2},{"id":"report-a-problem-with-the-steps","text":"Report a problem with the steps","level":2},{"id":"what-an-assistant-is-sent","text":"What an assistant is sent","level":2},{"id":"project-stage","text":"Project stage","level":2},{"id":"show-me-how-with-no-assistant","text":"Show me how, with no assistant","level":2},{"id":"rules-every-assistant-follows","text":"Rules every assistant follows","level":2},{"id":"sign-off-an-estimate-or-an-audit","text":"Sign off an estimate or an audit","level":2},{"id":"step-by-step-on-your-screen","text":"Step by step on your screen","level":2}],"html":"\u003Cp\u003EThe apps contain no AI. The Ask box sends a question to the assistant you connected, which answers by using the app&#039;s own tools. This page covers what is around that box. It is in the lab builds.\u003C/p\u003E\n\u003Ch2 id=\"open-it-from-help\"\u003EOpen it from Help\u003C/h2\u003E\n\u003Col\u003E\u003Cli\u003EPress \u003Ckbd class=\"hk\"\u003E\u003Cspan class=\"k-mac\" title=\"F1\"\u003EF1\u003C/span\u003E\u003Cspan class=\"k-pc\"\u003EF1\u003C/span\u003E\u003C/kbd\u003E or choose \u003Cspan class=\"hui\"\u003EHelp\u003C/span\u003E.\u003C/li\u003E\u003Cli\u003EChoose \u003Cspan class=\"hui\"\u003EAsk the assistant\u003C/span\u003E at the top of the Help panel. The Ask box opens.\u003C/li\u003E\u003Cli\u003EType your question and choose \u003Cspan class=\"hui\"\u003EAsk\u003C/span\u003E.\u003C/li\u003E\u003C/ol\u003E\n\u003Cp\u003EWith a question goes a short note of where you are: the file&#039;s name, how much is selected, the screen layout, the tool in use and the project stage. It never holds text from the file.\u003C/p\u003E\n\u003Ch2 id=\"why-did-this-happen\"\u003EWhy did this happen?\u003C/h2\u003E\n\u003Col\u003E\u003Cli\u003EIn the Ask box choose \u003Cspan class=\"hui\"\u003EWhy did this happen?\u003C/span\u003E.\u003C/li\u003E\u003Cli\u003ERead the list. It is the last steps in this window, oldest first: the commands you started, each change to the model by its name in the undo list, steps you took back or put back, and what an assistant did or was refused.\u003C/li\u003E\u003Cli\u003EWith an assistant connected, choose \u003Cspan class=\"hui\"\u003EAsk the assistant to explain\u003C/span\u003E and it explains from those same steps.\u003C/li\u003E\u003C/ol\u003E\n\u003Cp\u003EThe list works with no assistant connected. It is a record of steps, not a judgement.\u003C/p\u003E\n\u003Ch2 id=\"report-a-problem-with-the-steps\"\u003EReport a problem with the steps\u003C/h2\u003E\n\u003Col\u003E\u003Cli\u003EIn the Ask box, type what went wrong and choose \u003Cspan class=\"hui\"\u003EReport a problem\u003C/span\u003E. The app&#039;s own About box opens with your words in it.\u003C/li\u003E\u003Cli\u003ELeave \u003Cspan class=\"hui\"\u003EAdd the steps I took before it happened\u003C/span\u003E ticked. Open \u003Cspan class=\"hui\"\u003ESee the steps\u003C/span\u003E to read them first.\u003C/li\u003E\u003Cli\u003EOnly if you want to, tick the model excerpt. It holds what the app counts and how much is selected: no names, no emails, no folders and never the file itself. Open \u003Cspan class=\"hui\"\u003ESee the excerpt\u003C/span\u003E to read it first.\u003C/li\u003E\u003Cli\u003EAdd your name and email and choose \u003Cspan class=\"hui\"\u003ESend report\u003C/span\u003E. The report goes to our Submit a problem page, and the box gives you the link to follow it.\u003C/li\u003E\u003C/ol\u003E\n\u003Cp\u003EAn assistant can write the draft for you. It can only put the draft in this box: sending is always yours.\u003C/p\u003E\n\u003Ch2 id=\"what-an-assistant-is-sent\"\u003EWhat an assistant is sent\u003C/h2\u003E\n\u003Cp\u003EAssistants get model data only. People&#039;s names (author, drawn by, last saved by), contact details, account and licence details and your user name in a folder path are held back before anything leaves the app.\u003C/p\u003E\n\u003Col\u003E\u003Cli\u003EChoose \u003Cspan class=\"hui\"\u003EActivity\u003C/span\u003E in the bar at the top.\u003C/li\u003E\u003Cli\u003ESet the list to \u003Cspan class=\"hui\"\u003EEverything\u003C/span\u003E.\u003C/li\u003E\u003Cli\u003EUnder each line read \u003Cstrong\u003ESent back\u003C/strong\u003E: the size of the answer and the names of its fields. \u003Cstrong\u003EHeld back\u003C/strong\u003E lists each value that was kept, with the reason.\u003C/li\u003E\u003C/ol\u003E\n\u003Cp\u003EThe log never keeps the answer itself.\u003C/p\u003E\n\u003Ch2 id=\"project-stage\"\u003EProject stage\u003C/h2\u003E\n\u003Col\u003E\u003Cli\u003EChoose \u003Cspan class=\"hui\"\u003EDrawing details\u003C/span\u003E in the bar at the top.\u003C/li\u003E\u003Cli\u003EPick the \u003Cspan class=\"hui\"\u003EProject stage\u003C/span\u003E: Brief, Concept, Design development, Submission, Working drawings, Tender or Close-out.\u003C/li\u003E\u003Cli\u003EChoose \u003Cspan class=\"hui\"\u003ESave details\u003C/span\u003E. The stage is kept in the file with the other details.\u003C/li\u003E\u003C/ol\u003E\n\u003Cp\u003EAn assistant reads the stage so its help fits where the project is.\u003C/p\u003E\n\u003Ch2 id=\"show-me-how-with-no-assistant\"\u003EShow me how, with no assistant\u003C/h2\u003E\n\u003Cp\u003EThe teacher works from the app&#039;s own Help. It needs no assistant and sends nothing anywhere.\u003C/p\u003E\n\u003Col\u003E\u003Cli\u003EIn the Ask box type what you want to do, for example &quot;how do I draw a wall&quot;.\u003C/li\u003E\u003Cli\u003EChoose \u003Cspan class=\"hui\"\u003EShow me how\u003C/span\u003E. The Help topics that answer it are listed. The tool you are using and the project stage move the best fit to the top.\u003C/li\u003E\u003Cli\u003EChoose a topic. A step card opens with the topic&#039;s first step, and a ring marks the real button when the layout you use has one.\u003C/li\u003E\u003Cli\u003EDo the step, then choose \u003Cspan class=\"hui\"\u003ENext\u003C/span\u003E. \u003Cspan class=\"hui\"\u003EBack\u003C/span\u003E goes to the step before. Nothing is pressed for you.\u003C/li\u003E\u003C/ol\u003E\n\u003Cp\u003EA topic with no numbered steps says so: open it in Help instead.\u003C/p\u003E\n\u003Ch2 id=\"rules-every-assistant-follows\"\u003ERules every assistant follows\u003C/h2\u003E\n\u003Cul\u003E\u003Cli\u003E\u003Cstrong\u003EOptional.\u003C/strong\u003E Everything works without an assistant and offline.\u003C/li\u003E\u003Cli\u003E\u003Cstrong\u003EThe app calculates.\u003C/strong\u003E An assistant explains, arranges and checks, and never writes a figure. Under each answer the box says whether every figure in it is in a result the app returned, and lists the ones it cannot find. A figure on that list is not to be trusted until the app has calculated it.\u003C/li\u003E\u003Cli\u003E\u003Cstrong\u003ETrust but verify.\u003C/strong\u003E What an assistant makes is marked unverified until you check it. Estimates and audits an assistant hands back say &quot;Not signed off by a person&quot; until you sign them off. Open the list under \u003Cspan class=\"hui\"\u003ERules every assistant follows\u003C/span\u003E in the Ask box.\u003C/li\u003E\u003Cli\u003E\u003Cstrong\u003EModel data only.\u003C/strong\u003E Your personal and account details are never sent.\u003C/li\u003E\u003C/ul\u003E\n\u003Ch2 id=\"sign-off-an-estimate-or-an-audit\"\u003ESign off an estimate or an audit\u003C/h2\u003E\n\u003Col\u003E\u003Cli\u003EChoose \u003Cspan class=\"hui\"\u003EDrawing details\u003C/span\u003E in the bar at the top.\u003C/li\u003E\u003Cli\u003EUnder \u003Cspan class=\"hui\"\u003ESign-off\u003C/span\u003E, check your name, add a note if you like and choose \u003Cspan class=\"hui\"\u003ESign off\u003C/span\u003E beside \u003Cspan class=\"hui\"\u003EEstimate\u003C/span\u003E or \u003Cspan class=\"hui\"\u003EAudit\u003C/span\u003E.\u003C/li\u003E\u003Cli\u003EWho signed and when are kept in the file with the other details. If the drawing is saved after you sign, the panel says so: sign off again.\u003C/li\u003E\u003C/ol\u003E\n\u003Cp\u003EOnly you can sign off. No assistant can do it, or take your sign-off back. \u003Cspan class=\"hui\"\u003ETake my sign-off back\u003C/span\u003E removes it.\u003C/p\u003E\n\u003Ch2 id=\"step-by-step-on-your-screen\"\u003EStep by step on your screen\u003C/h2\u003E\n\u003Cp\u003EAn assistant, or a lesson, can show a task one step at a time. A small card says what to do, and a ring marks the real button on your screen. Nothing is pressed for you. Close the card with its \u003Cspan class=\"hui\"\u003EClose the step\u003C/span\u003E button.\u003C/p\u003E\n\u003Caside class=\"hc hc-note\"\u003E\u003Cp class=\"hc-label\"\u003ENote\u003C/p\u003E\n\u003Cp\u003EAn assistant answers better when it knows this version of the app. The knowledge pack holds the manuals, the step-by-step help, every command and the skills as plain text, with a version that matches the app. The Ask box says so when a connected pack is for another version.\u003C/p\u003E\n\u003C/aside\u003E","text":"The apps contain no AI. The Ask box sends a question to the assistant you connected, which answers by using the app's own tools. This page covers what is around that box. It is in the lab builds. Open it from Help Press F1 or choose Help. Choose Ask the assistant at the top of the Help panel. The Ask box opens. Type your question and choose Ask. With a question goes a short note of where you are: the file's name, how much is selected, the screen layout, the tool in use and the project stage. It never holds text from the file. Why did this happen? In the Ask box choose Why did this happen?. Read the list. It is the last steps in this window, oldest first: the commands you started, each change to the model by its name in the undo list, steps you took back or put back, and what an assistant did or was refused. With an assistant connected, choose Ask the assistant to explain and it explains from those same steps. The list works with no assistant connected. It is a record of steps, not a judgement. Report a problem with the steps In the Ask box, type what went wrong and choose Report a problem. The app's own About box opens with your words in it. Leave Add the steps I took before it happened ticked. Open See the steps to read them first. Only if you want to, tick the model excerpt. It holds what the app counts and how much is selected: no names, no emails, no folders and never the file itself. Open See the excerpt to read it first. Add your name and email and choose Send report. The report goes to our Submit a problem page, and the box gives you the link to follow it. An assistant can write the draft for you. It can only put the draft in this box: sending is always yours. What an assistant is sent Assistants get model data only. People's names (author, drawn by, last saved by), contact details, account and licence details and your user name in a folder path are held back before anything leaves the app. Choose Activity in the bar at the top. Set the list to Everything. Under each line read Sent back: the size of the answer and the names of its fields. Held back lists each value that was kept, with the reason. The log never keeps the answer itself. Project stage Choose Drawing details in the bar at the top. Pick the Project stage: Brief, Concept, Design development, Submission, Working drawings, Tender or Close-out. Choose Save details. The stage is kept in the file with the other details. An assistant reads the stage so its help fits where the project is. Show me how, with no assistant The teacher works from the app's own Help. It needs no assistant and sends nothing anywhere. In the Ask box type what you want to do, for example \"how do I draw a wall\". Choose Show me how. The Help topics that answer it are listed. The tool you are using and the project stage move the best fit to the top. Choose a topic. A step card opens with the topic's first step, and a ring marks the real button when the layout you use has one. Do the step, then choose Next. Back goes to the step before. Nothing is pressed for you. A topic with no numbered steps says so: open it in Help instead. Rules every assistant follows Optional. Everything works without an assistant and offline. The app calculates. An assistant explains, arranges and checks, and never writes a figure. Under each answer the box says whether every figure in it is in a result the app returned, and lists the ones it cannot find. A figure on that list is not to be trusted until the app has calculated it. Trust but verify. What an assistant makes is marked unverified until you check it. Estimates and audits an assistant hands back say \"Not signed off by a person\" until you sign them off. Open the list under Rules every assistant follows in the Ask box. Model data only. Your personal and account details are never sent. Sign off an estimate or an audit Choose Drawing details in the bar at the top. Under Sign-off, check your name, add a note if you like and choose Sign off beside Estimate or Audit. Who signed and when are kept in the file with the other details. If the drawing is saved after you sign, the panel says so: sign off again. Only you can sign off. No assistant can do it, or take your sign-off back. Take my sign-off back removes it. Step by step on your screen An assistant, or a lesson, can show a task one step at a time. A small card says what to do, and a ring marks the real button on your screen. Nothing is pressed for you. Close the card with its Close the step button. An assistant answers better when it knows this version of the app. The knowledge pack holds the manuals, the step-by-step help, every command and the skills as plain text, with a version that matches the app. The Ask box says so when a connected pack is for another version.","lang":"en"},{"slug":"assistants-recipes","scope":"basics","title":"Recipes for AI assistants","summary":"Worked examples for using your own AI assistant with the CadCraft apps: what to ask, the tools it calls, and the permissions each needs. Every recipe here is run by our tests with the same calls.","section":"tasks","order":62,"keywords":["ai","assistant","mcp","recipes","examples","prompts","automation","batch","convert","plot","check","takeoff","cut","fill","parameters","script"],"headings":[{"id":"what-you-will-learn","text":"What you will learn","level":2},{"id":"recipes","text":"Recipes","level":2},{"id":"tidy-a-drawing","text":"Tidy a drawing","level":3},{"id":"plot-a-set-of-sheets","text":"Plot a set of sheets","level":3},{"id":"convert-drawings-for-a-consultant","text":"Convert drawings for a consultant","level":3},{"id":"check-drawings-before-sending-them","text":"Check drawings before sending them","level":3},{"id":"ask-a-building-model-questions","text":"Ask a building model questions","level":3},{"id":"draw-a-room-in-bimcraft","text":"Draw a room in BimCraft","level":3},{"id":"total-a-takeoff","text":"Total a takeoff","level":3},{"id":"site-numbers","text":"Site numbers","level":3},{"id":"try-a-part-variant","text":"Try a part variant","level":3},{"id":"fill-in-a-title-block","text":"Fill in a title block","level":3},{"id":"your-files-and-your-assistant","text":"Your files and your assistant","level":2}],"html":"\u003Ch2 id=\"what-you-will-learn\"\u003EWhat you will learn\u003C/h2\u003E\n\u003Cp\u003EReady-made requests for your own AI assistant, and what it does with them. The apps contain no AI: your assistant reads the files and calls the apps&#039; tools, and you decide which permissions it has. Each recipe names the tools it calls, so you can check its work in the activity log, and each one is run by our tests with exactly these calls, so they keep working.\u003C/p\u003E\n\u003Cp\u003EThere are two ways in. In \u003Cstrong\u003ECadCraft Studio\u003C/strong\u003E, an assistant works with the apps you have open (Settings › Assistants in each app). \u003Cstrong\u003EWithout a window\u003C/strong\u003E, the CadCraft file server for assistants (\u003Ccode\u003Enpx @getcadcraft/mcp --root &lt;folder&gt;\u003C/code\u003E) works on files in folders you name; the \u003Ccode\u003Ecadcraft\u003C/code\u003E command line does the same jobs for your own scripts. The recipes say which way they use; most work both ways.\u003C/p\u003E\n\u003Caside class=\"hc hc-tip\"\u003E\u003Cp class=\"hc-label\"\u003ETip\u003C/p\u003E\n\u003Cp\u003EStart read-only. Ask the assistant to describe a file before it changes anything; its answers are better when it has looked first, and Read is the only permission that is on to begin with.\u003C/p\u003E\n\u003C/aside\u003E\n\u003Ch2 id=\"recipes\"\u003ERecipes\u003C/h2\u003E\n\u003Ch3 id=\"tidy-a-drawing\"\u003ETidy a drawing\u003C/h3\u003E\n\u003Cp\u003E\u003Cstrong\u003EAsk:\u003C/strong\u003E &quot;List the layers with nothing on them and the blocks nobody uses, then purge the unused blocks.&quot;\u003C/p\u003E\n\u003Cp\u003EThe assistant opens the drawing and reads it, then runs PURGE:\u003C/p\u003E\n\u003Cpre class=\"hcode\"\u003E\u003Ccode\u003Edrawing_open {path: &quot;Kitchen/kitchen-equipment.dwg&quot;}            → d1\ndrawing_describe {doc: &quot;d1&quot;}                                    layers with 0 objects, blocks with 0 uses\ncommand_run {doc: &quot;d1&quot;, input: &quot;PURGE&quot;}                         one undo step: &quot;Assistant: PURGE&quot;\ndrawing_save {doc: &quot;d1&quot;, path: &quot;Kitchen/kitchen-tidy.dwg&quot;}\u003C/code\u003E\u003C/pre\u003E\n\u003Cp\u003ENeeds Read and Edit, and Save to write the result. Dimension arrowheads count as used, so they stay.\u003C/p\u003E\n\u003Ch3 id=\"plot-a-set-of-sheets\"\u003EPlot a set of sheets\u003C/h3\u003E\n\u003Cp\u003E\u003Cstrong\u003EAsk:\u003C/strong\u003E &quot;Plot every sheet of every drawing in the Kitchen folder to PDF.&quot;\u003C/p\u003E\n\u003Cpre class=\"hcode\"\u003E\u003Ccode\u003Efiles_list {folder: &quot;Kitchen&quot;, extensions: [&quot;dwg&quot;, &quot;dxf&quot;]}\ndrawing_open {path: …}  ·  drawing_describe {doc}                the sheets of each drawing\ndrawing_plot {doc, layout: &quot;&lt;sheet&gt;&quot;, out: &quot;Plots/&lt;drawing&gt; &lt;sheet&gt;.pdf&quot;}\u003C/code\u003E\u003C/pre\u003E\n\u003Cp\u003ENeeds Read and Export. From the command line, one PDF per drawing with all its sheets: \u003Ccode\u003Ecadcraft plot Kitchen/*.dwg Plots --all\u003C/code\u003E.\u003C/p\u003E\n\u003Ch3 id=\"convert-drawings-for-a-consultant\"\u003EConvert drawings for a consultant\u003C/h3\u003E\n\u003Cp\u003E\u003Cstrong\u003EAsk:\u003C/strong\u003E &quot;Save copies of the drawings in Kitchen as AutoCAD 2013 DWG in the Out folder.&quot;\u003C/p\u003E\n\u003Cpre class=\"hcode\"\u003E\u003Ccode\u003Efiles_list {folder: &quot;Kitchen&quot;, extensions: [&quot;dwg&quot;, &quot;dxf&quot;]}\ndrawing_convert {path: &quot;Kitchen/&lt;file&gt;&quot;, out: &quot;Out/&lt;file&gt;.dwg&quot;, version: &quot;2013&quot;}\u003C/code\u003E\u003C/pre\u003E\n\u003Cp\u003ENeeds Read and Export; the originals are not changed. From the command line: \u003Ccode\u003Ecadcraft convert Kitchen/*.dwg Kitchen/*.dxf Out --to dwg --version 2013\u003C/code\u003E.\u003C/p\u003E\n\u003Ch3 id=\"check-drawings-before-sending-them\"\u003ECheck drawings before sending them\u003C/h3\u003E\n\u003Cp\u003E\u003Cstrong\u003EAsk:\u003C/strong\u003E &quot;Check the drawings in Kitchen: nothing on layer 0, colours by layer, no unused blocks. Give me a table of what fails.&quot;\u003C/p\u003E\n\u003Cpre class=\"hcode\"\u003E\u003Ccode\u003Edrawing_check {doc, rules: {layers: {noObjectsOn: [&quot;0&quot;]}, objects: {colorByLayer: true}, blocks: {noUnused: true}}}\u003C/code\u003E\u003C/pre\u003E\n\u003Cp\u003ENeeds Read. Keep your office&#039;s rules in a file and the command line checks a whole folder: \u003Ccode\u003Ecadcraft check Kitchen/*.dwg --rules office-standards.json\u003C/code\u003E (exit code 1 when something fails, so it fits in a script).\u003C/p\u003E\n\u003Ch3 id=\"ask-a-building-model-questions\"\u003EAsk a building model questions\u003C/h3\u003E\n\u003Cp\u003E\u003Cstrong\u003EAsk:\u003C/strong\u003E &quot;How many doors does the house have on each level, and which are external?&quot;\u003C/p\u003E\n\u003Cpre class=\"hcode\"\u003E\u003Ccode\u003Eifc_open {path: &quot;house.ifc&quot;}                                    → d1\nifc_query {doc: &quot;d1&quot;, class: &quot;IfcDoor&quot;}                         each door with its level\nifc_properties {doc: &quot;d1&quot;, id: &lt;door&gt;}                          Pset_DoorCommon.IsExternal\u003C/code\u003E\u003C/pre\u003E\n\u003Cp\u003ENeeds Read. In Studio, BimCraft&#039;s own tools answer the same about the model you have open.\u003C/p\u003E\n\u003Ch3 id=\"draw-a-room-in-bimcraft\"\u003EDraw a room in BimCraft\u003C/h3\u003E\n\u003Cp\u003E\u003Cstrong\u003EAsk:\u003C/strong\u003E &quot;Draw a 6 by 4 metre room on Level 1 with a single door in the south wall.&quot;\u003C/p\u003E\n\u003Cpre class=\"hcode\"\u003E\u003Ccode\u003Ewalls_add {points: [[0, 0], [6000, 0], [6000, 4000], [0, 4000]], closed: true}     one undo step\nopening_add {wall: &quot;&lt;the first wall&#039;s GlobalId&gt;&quot;, kind: &quot;door&quot;}                    one undo step\u003C/code\u003E\u003C/pre\u003E\n\u003Cp\u003ENeeds Edit. Walls join and the room follows, as with the Draw tools. Without a window, \u003Ccode\u003Eifc_new\u003C/code\u003E starts a building first and \u003Ccode\u003Eifc_save\u003C/code\u003E writes it.\u003C/p\u003E\n\u003Ch3 id=\"total-a-takeoff\"\u003ETotal a takeoff\u003C/h3\u003E\n\u003Cp\u003E\u003Cstrong\u003EAsk:\u003C/strong\u003E &quot;Give me the estimate by item and export it to XLSX.&quot;\u003C/p\u003E\n\u003Cpre class=\"hcode\"\u003E\u003Ccode\u003Etakeoff_open {path: &quot;job.takeoff.json&quot;}  ·  takeoff_estimate {doc}  ·  takeoff_export {doc, out: &quot;job.xlsx&quot;}\u003C/code\u003E\u003C/pre\u003E\n\u003Cp\u003ENeeds Read, and Export for the file. Marks on sheets with no scale are listed and never counted as zero, so an incomplete estimate says so.\u003C/p\u003E\n\u003Ch3 id=\"site-numbers\"\u003ESite numbers\u003C/h3\u003E\n\u003Cp\u003E\u003Cstrong\u003EAsk:\u003C/strong\u003E &quot;How much cut and fill does the pad need?&quot;\u003C/p\u003E\n\u003Cpre class=\"hcode\"\u003E\u003Ccode\u003Esite_open {path: &quot;site.civilcraft.json&quot;}  ·  surface_volume {doc}       cut, fill and net, per pad\u003C/code\u003E\u003C/pre\u003E\n\u003Cp\u003ENeeds Read. With a level instead of a design: \u003Ccode\u003Esurface_volume {doc, datum: 100}\u003C/code\u003E.\u003C/p\u003E\n\u003Ch3 id=\"try-a-part-variant\"\u003ETry a part variant\u003C/h3\u003E\n\u003Cp\u003E\u003Cstrong\u003EAsk:\u003C/strong\u003E &quot;Set the length to 40 mm, rebuild, and give me the mass.&quot;\u003C/p\u003E\n\u003Cpre class=\"hcode\"\u003E\u003Ccode\u003Epart_open {path: &quot;screw.partcraft.json&quot;}  ·  params_list {doc}\nparam_set {doc, name: &quot;l&quot;, value: 40}                           one undo step, the part rebuilt\nmass_properties {doc}                                            volume, mass from the material, centre, inertia\u003C/code\u003E\u003C/pre\u003E\n\u003Cp\u003ENeeds Read and Edit; Save (\u003Ccode\u003Epart_save\u003C/code\u003E) to keep it.\u003C/p\u003E\n\u003Ch3 id=\"fill-in-a-title-block\"\u003EFill in a title block\u003C/h3\u003E\n\u003Cp\u003E\u003Cstrong\u003EAsk:\u003C/strong\u003E &quot;Insert the title block at 0,0 with sheet number A-101 and the title Kitchen plan.&quot;\u003C/p\u003E\n\u003Cpre class=\"hcode\"\u003E\u003Ccode\u003Eblock_insert {doc, block: &quot;TITLEBLOCK-ARCHD&quot;, at: [0, 0], attributes: {&quot;SHEET-NO&quot;: &quot;A-101&quot;, &quot;SHEET-TITLE&quot;: &quot;Kitchen plan&quot;}}\u003C/code\u003E\u003C/pre\u003E\n\u003Cp\u003ENeeds Edit. One undo step; the attributes it does not name keep their defaults.\u003C/p\u003E\n\u003Ch2 id=\"your-files-and-your-assistant\"\u003EYour files and your assistant\u003C/h2\u003E\n\u003Cp\u003EThe apps never send your files anywhere. \u003Cstrong\u003EBut what your assistant reads goes to whoever runs that assistant:\u003C/strong\u003E a cloud assistant&#039;s maker sees the parts of the drawing it is shown. If that matters for a job, use an assistant that runs on your own computer, or keep that job&#039;s folders out of the ones you allow.\u003C/p\u003E","text":"What you will learn Ready-made requests for your own AI assistant, and what it does with them. The apps contain no AI: your assistant reads the files and calls the apps' tools, and you decide which permissions it has. Each recipe names the tools it calls, so you can check its work in the activity log, and each one is run by our tests with exactly these calls, so they keep working. There are two ways in. In CadCraft Studio, an assistant works with the apps you have open (Settings › Assistants in each app). Without a window, the CadCraft file server for assistants (npx @getcadcraft/mcp --root \u003Cfolder\u003E) works on files in folders you name; the cadcraft command line does the same jobs for your own scripts. The recipes say which way they use; most work both ways. Start read-only. Ask the assistant to describe a file before it changes anything; its answers are better when it has looked first, and Read is the only permission that is on to begin with. Recipes Tidy a drawing Ask: \"List the layers with nothing on them and the blocks nobody uses, then purge the unused blocks.\" The assistant opens the drawing and reads it, then runs PURGE: drawing_open {path: \"Kitchen/kitchen-equipment.dwg\"} → d1 drawing_describe {doc: \"d1\"} layers with 0 objects, blocks with 0 uses command_run {doc: \"d1\", input: \"PURGE\"} one undo step: \"Assistant: PURGE\" drawing_save {doc: \"d1\", path: \"Kitchen/kitchen-tidy.dwg\"} Needs Read and Edit, and Save to write the result. Dimension arrowheads count as used, so they stay. Plot a set of sheets Ask: \"Plot every sheet of every drawing in the Kitchen folder to PDF.\" files_list {folder: \"Kitchen\", extensions: [\"dwg\", \"dxf\"]} drawing_open {path: …} · drawing_describe {doc} the sheets of each drawing drawing_plot {doc, layout: \"\u003Csheet\u003E\", out: \"Plots/\u003Cdrawing\u003E \u003Csheet\u003E.pdf\"} Needs Read and Export. From the command line, one PDF per drawing with all its sheets: cadcraft plot Kitchen/*.dwg Plots --all. Convert drawings for a consultant Ask: \"Save copies of the drawings in Kitchen as AutoCAD 2013 DWG in the Out folder.\" files_list {folder: \"Kitchen\", extensions: [\"dwg\", \"dxf\"]} drawing_convert {path: \"Kitchen/\u003Cfile\u003E\", out: \"Out/\u003Cfile\u003E.dwg\", version: \"2013\"} Needs Read and Export; the originals are not changed. From the command line: cadcraft convert Kitchen/*.dwg Kitchen/*.dxf Out --to dwg --version 2013. Check drawings before sending them Ask: \"Check the drawings in Kitchen: nothing on layer 0, colours by layer, no unused blocks. Give me a table of what fails.\" drawing_check {doc, rules: {layers: {noObjectsOn: [\"0\"]}, objects: {colorByLayer: true}, blocks: {noUnused: true}}} Needs Read. Keep your office's rules in a file and the command line checks a whole folder: cadcraft check Kitchen/*.dwg --rules office-standards.json (exit code 1 when something fails, so it fits in a script). Ask a building model questions Ask: \"How many doors does the house have on each level, and which are external?\" ifc_open {path: \"house.ifc\"} → d1 ifc_query {doc: \"d1\", class: \"IfcDoor\"} each door with its level ifc_properties {doc: \"d1\", id: \u003Cdoor\u003E} Pset_DoorCommon.IsExternal Needs Read. In Studio, BimCraft's own tools answer the same about the model you have open. Draw a room in BimCraft Ask: \"Draw a 6 by 4 metre room on Level 1 with a single door in the south wall.\" walls_add {points: [[0, 0], [6000, 0], [6000, 4000], [0, 4000]], closed: true} one undo step opening_add {wall: \"\u003Cthe first wall's GlobalId\u003E\", kind: \"door\"} one undo step Needs Edit. Walls join and the room follows, as with the Draw tools. Without a window, ifc_new starts a building first and ifc_save writes it. Total a takeoff Ask: \"Give me the estimate by item and export it to XLSX.\" takeoff_open {path: \"job.takeoff.json\"} · takeoff_estimate {doc} · takeoff_export {doc, out: \"job.xlsx\"} Needs Read, and Export for the file. Marks on sheets with no scale are listed and never counted as zero, so an incomplete estimate says so. Site numbers Ask: \"How much cut and fill does the pad need?\" site_open {path: \"site.civilcraft.json\"} · surface_volume {doc} cut, fill and net, per pad Needs Read. With a level instead of a design: surface_volume {doc, datum: 100}. Try a part variant Ask: \"Set the length to 40 mm, rebuild, and give me the mass.\" part_open {path: \"screw.partcraft.json\"} · params_list {doc} param_set {doc, name: \"l\", value: 40} one undo step, the part rebuilt mass_properties {doc} volume, mass from the material, centre, inertia Needs Read and Edit; Save (part_save) to keep it. Fill in a title block Ask: \"Insert the title block at 0,0 with sheet number A-101 and the title Kitchen plan.\" block_insert {doc, block: \"TITLEBLOCK-ARCHD\", at: [0, 0], attributes: {\"SHEET-NO\": \"A-101\", \"SHEET-TITLE\": \"Kitchen plan\"}} Needs Edit. One undo step; the attributes it does not name keep their defaults. Your files and your assistant The apps never send your files anywhere. But what your assistant reads goes to whoever runs that assistant: a cloud assistant's maker sees the parts of the drawing it is shown. If that matters for a job, use an assistant that runs on your own computer, or keep that job's folders out of the ones you allow.","lang":"en"},{"slug":"community-testing","scope":"basics","title":"Community testing","summary":"How to try a test on the Community testing page and send your result.","section":"tasks","order":90,"keywords":["community","testing","test","results","report","feedback","files","passed","failing"],"headings":[{"id":"send-a-result","text":"Send a result","level":2},{"id":"sending-files","text":"Sending files","level":2},{"id":"your-privacy","text":"Your privacy","level":2},{"id":"what-counts-as-known-not-to-work","text":"What counts as \"known not to work\"","level":2}],"html":"\u003Cp\u003ESome checks need a real computer, a real file or a real device. The Community testing page lists them so anyone can help.\u003C/p\u003E\n\u003Ch2 id=\"send-a-result\"\u003ESend a result\u003C/h2\u003E\n\u003Col\u003E\u003Cli\u003EOpen the \u003Cstrong\u003ECommunity testing\u003C/strong\u003E page on the website and choose a test.\u003C/li\u003E\u003Cli\u003EUse the public build named in \u003Cstrong\u003EBefore you start\u003C/strong\u003E, never a lab build.\u003C/li\u003E\u003Cli\u003EFollow the \u003Cstrong\u003ESteps\u003C/strong\u003E and compare with the \u003Cstrong\u003EExpected result\u003C/strong\u003E.\u003C/li\u003E\u003Cli\u003EFill in \u003Cstrong\u003ESend a result\u003C/strong\u003E: passed, still failing, partly works, or could not run it. Say which system you used and what happened.\u003C/li\u003E\u003C/ol\u003E\n\u003Cp\u003EYou do not need an account to send a result. A signed-in account is needed only to send files.\u003C/p\u003E\n\u003Ch2 id=\"sending-files\"\u003ESending files\u003C/h2\u003E\n\u003Cp\u003EWhen a test asks for files, drag them into the framed area (or click it, or press Enter or Space on it to choose them). You can send several at once; each shows its name and size and a Remove button. The form says which file types and sizes we take. We never take programs, scripts or web pages.\u003C/p\u003E\n\u003Ch2 id=\"your-privacy\"\u003EYour privacy\u003C/h2\u003E\n\u003Cul\u003E\u003Cli\u003EA result sent while you are signed in carries your account so we can write back. It is never shown on the page.\u003C/li\u003E\u003Cli\u003EYour first name is shown next to a result only if you tick \u003Cstrong\u003EShow my first name\u003C/strong\u003E.\u003C/li\u003E\u003Cli\u003ENotes are shown to others only if you tick \u003Cstrong\u003EAnyone may read my notes\u003C/strong\u003E.\u003C/li\u003E\u003Cli\u003EFiles are seen only by the CadCraft team, kept privately and deleted automatically after the number of days the form states. Remove anything private from a file first.\u003C/li\u003E\u003C/ul\u003E\n\u003Ch2 id=\"what-counts-as-known-not-to-work\"\u003EWhat counts as &quot;known not to work&quot;\u003C/h2\u003E\n\u003Cp\u003EEach test lists what is not built yet. Please do not report those as bugs.\u003C/p\u003E","text":"Some checks need a real computer, a real file or a real device. The Community testing page lists them so anyone can help. Send a result Open the Community testing page on the website and choose a test. Use the public build named in Before you start, never a lab build. Follow the Steps and compare with the Expected result. Fill in Send a result: passed, still failing, partly works, or could not run it. Say which system you used and what happened. You do not need an account to send a result. A signed-in account is needed only to send files. Sending files When a test asks for files, drag them into the framed area (or click it, or press Enter or Space on it to choose them). You can send several at once; each shows its name and size and a Remove button. The form says which file types and sizes we take. We never take programs, scripts or web pages. Your privacy A result sent while you are signed in carries your account so we can write back. It is never shown on the page. Your first name is shown next to a result only if you tick Show my first name. Notes are shown to others only if you tick Anyone may read my notes. Files are seen only by the CadCraft team, kept privately and deleted automatically after the number of days the form states. Remove anything private from a file first. What counts as \"known not to work\" Each test lists what is not built yet. Please do not report those as bugs.","lang":"en"},{"slug":"work-together-live","scope":"basics","title":"Work together live","summary":"Share the file open in an app so teammates edit it with you on your own network with a short code, and join someone else's session. Invite links over the internet are not open yet.","section":"tasks","order":90,"keywords":["live","studio live","work together","collaborate","share live","join","code","qr","invite link","link","host","approve","guest","network","relay","license","many people","limit","allow anyway","slow","recent edits","edit log","who changed","history"],"headings":[{"id":"what-you-will-learn","text":"What you will learn","level":2},{"id":"share-the-file-you-have-open","text":"Share the file you have open","level":2},{"id":"let-people-in","text":"Let people in","level":2},{"id":"when-many-people-join","text":"When many people join","level":2},{"id":"codes-on-your-own-network","text":"Codes on your own network","level":2},{"id":"invite-links-over-the-internet-not-open-yet","text":"Invite links over the internet: not open yet","level":2},{"id":"join-someone-else-s-session","text":"Join someone else's session","level":2},{"id":"who-changed-what-recent-edits","text":"Who changed what: Recent edits","level":2},{"id":"assistants-in-a-session","text":"Assistants in a session","level":2},{"id":"when-the-session-ends","text":"When the session ends","level":2}],"html":"\u003Ch2 id=\"what-you-will-learn\"\u003EWhat you will learn\u003C/h2\u003E\n\u003Cp\u003EHow to share a file live from CadCraft Studio, let people in, and join a session someone else shares. What you see in the drawing itself while you work together is on the app&#039;s own page about live sessions.\u003C/p\u003E\n\u003Ch2 id=\"share-the-file-you-have-open\"\u003EShare the file you have open\u003C/h2\u003E\n\u003Col\u003E\u003Cli\u003EOpen the file in its app inside CadCraft Studio on a computer.\u003C/li\u003E\u003Cli\u003EChoose \u003Cspan class=\"hui\"\u003ELive\u003C/span\u003E in the app&#039;s bar, type the name others should see, then choose \u003Cspan class=\"hui\"\u003EShare live\u003C/span\u003E.\u003C/li\u003E\u003Cli\u003EStudio shows a code like \u003Ccode\u003EK7-Q4M2X\u003C/code\u003E with a picture to scan and the computer&#039;s address. Give the code to the people you want to invite.\u003C/li\u003E\u003C/ol\u003E\n\u003Cp\u003EYour file stays on your computer. Only you save it, and everyone sees your saves.\u003C/p\u003E\n\u003Ch2 id=\"let-people-in\"\u003ELet people in\u003C/h2\u003E\n\u003Cp\u003ENobody gets in without you. When someone knocks, a card shows their name and device and whether they came on this network or through the internet:\u003C/p\u003E\n\u003Cul\u003E\u003Cli\u003E\u003Cspan class=\"hui\"\u003EEdit\u003C/span\u003E lets them change the file with you.\u003C/li\u003E\u003Cli\u003E\u003Cspan class=\"hui\"\u003EView only\u003C/span\u003E lets them watch; anything they try to change is taken back.\u003C/li\u003E\u003Cli\u003E\u003Cspan class=\"hui\"\u003EDeny\u003C/span\u003E turns them away.\u003C/li\u003E\u003C/ul\u003E\n\u003Cp\u003EThe list under \u003Cspan class=\"hui\"\u003EIn the session\u003C/span\u003E shows everyone. Change a person&#039;s role there, or \u003Cspan class=\"hui\"\u003ERemove\u003C/span\u003E them: they keep a copy of what they had, and they can&#039;t come back without a new invitation.\u003C/p\u003E\n\u003Ch2 id=\"when-many-people-join\"\u003EWhen many people join\u003C/h2\u003E\n\u003Cp\u003EA session&#039;s usual size is up to 20 people besides you. It is not a hard limit: how many people can work well together depends on their computers, the file and the network, so Studio asks you before a session grows past it instead of deciding for you.\u003C/p\u003E\n\u003Cp\u003EWhen someone knocks and would make more than 20, their card says so, and Studio explains what to expect: every change goes to everyone, so with many people each change takes longer to reach each person, and slower laptops and connections fall behind first. Then you choose:\u003C/p\u003E\n\u003Cul\u003E\u003Cli\u003E\u003Cspan class=\"hui\"\u003EAllow anyway\u003C/span\u003E lets more people in for this session. Each person still waits for your \u003Cspan class=\"hui\"\u003EEdit\u003C/span\u003E, \u003Cspan class=\"hui\"\u003EView only\u003C/span\u003E or \u003Cspan class=\"hui\"\u003EDeny\u003C/span\u003E.\u003C/li\u003E\u003Cli\u003E\u003Cspan class=\"hui\"\u003EKeep it at 20\u003C/span\u003E turns away the people waiting over the limit; they are told you are keeping the session small.\u003C/li\u003E\u003C/ul\u003E\n\u003Cp\u003ETo allow more before anyone knocks, choose \u003Cspan class=\"hui\"\u003EAllow more people…\u003C/span\u003E under \u003Cspan class=\"hui\"\u003EIn the session\u003C/span\u003E. \u003Cspan class=\"hui\"\u003EBack to 20\u003C/span\u003E puts the usual size back. Your choice lasts for this session only; the next one starts at 20 again.\u003C/p\u003E\n\u003Cp\u003EIf things slow down, fewer people, a quieter file (fewer people changing it at the same moment) or a better connection (a cable instead of Wi-Fi) helps.\u003C/p\u003E\n\u003Ch2 id=\"codes-on-your-own-network\"\u003ECodes on your own network\u003C/h2\u003E\n\u003Cul\u003E\u003Cli\u003EA code works for 10 minutes. \u003Cspan class=\"hui\"\u003ENew code\u003C/span\u003E makes another; \u003Cspan class=\"hui\"\u003EStop inviting\u003C/span\u003E closes it. People already in stay.\u003C/li\u003E\u003Cli\u003E\u003Cspan class=\"hui\"\u003EOne-time code\u003C/span\u003E lets one person in per code.\u003C/li\u003E\u003Cli\u003EAfter 3 wrong codes in a row, Studio closes the code and makes a new one, and tells you.\u003C/li\u003E\u003C/ul\u003E\n\u003Cp\u003ESessions on your own network are free, for everyone.\u003C/p\u003E\n\u003Ch2 id=\"invite-links-over-the-internet-not-open-yet\"\u003EInvite links over the internet: not open yet\u003C/h2\u003E\n\u003Cp\u003EInvite links aren&#039;t open yet. Sessions on your own network are free. Today the \u003Cspan class=\"hui\"\u003EOver the internet\u003C/span\u003E part of the \u003Cspan class=\"hui\"\u003ELive\u003C/span\u003E panel says so in a plain sentence instead of offering a link.\u003C/p\u003E\n\u003Cp\u003EWhen invite links open, this is how they will work:\u003C/p\u003E\n\u003Col\u003E\u003Cli\u003EUnder \u003Cspan class=\"hui\"\u003EOver the internet\u003C/span\u003E, choose how long the link works (1 hour, 8 hours, or until you end the session), then \u003Cspan class=\"hui\"\u003EInvite by link\u003C/span\u003E.\u003C/li\u003E\u003Cli\u003ECopy the link and send it like a meeting link.\u003C/li\u003E\u003C/ol\u003E\n\u003Cp\u003EThe link&#039;s secret part (after \u003Ccode\u003E#\u003C/code\u003E) never reaches getcadcraft.com: the site only passes on encrypted messages it can&#039;t read, and you still approve each person. \u003Cspan class=\"hui\"\u003ENew link\u003C/span\u003E makes the old one stop working at once; \u003Cspan class=\"hui\"\u003EStop the link\u003C/span\u003E ends it.\u003C/p\u003E\n\u003Cp\u003EMaking an invite link will need you signed in, with a commercial license in force for the app. Guests will need nothing: no account, no license.\u003C/p\u003E\n\u003Ch2 id=\"join-someone-else-s-session\"\u003EJoin someone else&#039;s session\u003C/h2\u003E\n\u003Col\u003E\u003Cli\u003EIn CadCraft Studio&#039;s home screen, find \u003Cspan class=\"hui\"\u003EJoin a live session\u003C/span\u003E.\u003C/li\u003E\u003Cli\u003EType the code the host gave you, or type the address shown under their code followed by the code. (Once invite links open, you will paste the host&#039;s link here too.)\u003C/li\u003E\u003Cli\u003EType your name and choose \u003Cspan class=\"hui\"\u003EJoin\u003C/span\u003E. Studio opens the right app; it fills with the host&#039;s file once the host lets you in.\u003C/li\u003E\u003C/ol\u003E\n\u003Cp\u003EWithout Studio, scan the picture under the host&#039;s code with a device on the same network: the app opens in the browser.\u003C/p\u003E\n\u003Cp\u003EIn CadCraft, if you already have the same file open in a Studio window, you can join from that window instead: choose \u003Cspan class=\"hui\"\u003ELive\u003C/span\u003E, then under \u003Cspan class=\"hui\"\u003EJoin with the drawing open here\u003C/span\u003E type the code or the address and code, and choose \u003Cspan class=\"hui\"\u003EJoin here\u003C/span\u003E. Only the changes made since the file was opened travel. If the host&#039;s drawing is a different one, it replaces the one in that window; your file on disk stays as it is.\u003C/p\u003E\n\u003Caside class=\"hc hc-note\"\u003E\u003Cp class=\"hc-label\"\u003ENote\u003C/p\u003E\n\u003Cp\u003EGuest, hotel and school Wi-Fi often keep devices apart, so a code can&#039;t find the host there. Use a network that lets devices see each other, such as the office network. Invite links, for when you are not on the same network, are not open yet.\u003C/p\u003E\n\u003C/aside\u003E\n\u003Ch2 id=\"who-changed-what-recent-edits\"\u003EWho changed what: Recent edits\u003C/h2\u003E\n\u003Cp\u003EThe Live panel lists \u003Cstrong\u003ERecent edits\u003C/strong\u003E: who made each change and what it was (the step&#039;s name, such as Line or Move), newest first, with how long ago. \u003Cspan class=\"hui\"\u003EShow more\u003C/span\u003E lists more of them. With something selected in CadCraft or MarkupCraft, the panel also says who changed it last, and \u003Cspan class=\"hui\"\u003EOnly what is selected\u003C/span\u003E keeps just the edits that touched it.\u003C/p\u003E\n\u003Cp\u003EThe list is made in your own window from the session&#039;s edits while the session runs. It is gone when the session ends: it is never saved in the file or sent anywhere. Everyone in the session can see who made each change. If you joined after people had started, or were away for a while, the edits from before are not in your list, and the panel says so.\u003C/p\u003E\n\u003Ch2 id=\"assistants-in-a-session\"\u003EAssistants in a session\u003C/h2\u003E\n\u003Cp\u003EIf someone turned on assistants in their app&#039;s settings, their AI assistant can ask to work in the session too. The host&#039;s own assistant joins at once; anyone else&#039;s waits for the host, with a card saying whose assistant it is: \u003Cspan class=\"hui\"\u003EAllow\u003C/span\u003E or \u003Cspan class=\"hui\"\u003EDeny\u003C/span\u003E. An assistant edits like its person, with its own undo, and leaves the session when its person leaves.\u003C/p\u003E\n\u003Ch2 id=\"when-the-session-ends\"\u003EWhen the session ends\u003C/h2\u003E\n\u003Cp\u003EThe host chooses \u003Cspan class=\"hui\"\u003EEnd the session\u003C/span\u003E, or closes the file. Everyone else keeps an unsaved copy of the file as it was: save it if you want to keep it. \u003Cspan class=\"hui\"\u003ELeave\u003C/span\u003E does the same for you alone.\u003C/p\u003E","text":"What you will learn How to share a file live from CadCraft Studio, let people in, and join a session someone else shares. What you see in the drawing itself while you work together is on the app's own page about live sessions. Share the file you have open Open the file in its app inside CadCraft Studio on a computer. Choose Live in the app's bar, type the name others should see, then choose Share live. Studio shows a code like K7-Q4M2X with a picture to scan and the computer's address. Give the code to the people you want to invite. Your file stays on your computer. Only you save it, and everyone sees your saves. Let people in Nobody gets in without you. When someone knocks, a card shows their name and device and whether they came on this network or through the internet: Edit lets them change the file with you. View only lets them watch; anything they try to change is taken back. Deny turns them away. The list under In the session shows everyone. Change a person's role there, or Remove them: they keep a copy of what they had, and they can't come back without a new invitation. When many people join A session's usual size is up to 20 people besides you. It is not a hard limit: how many people can work well together depends on their computers, the file and the network, so Studio asks you before a session grows past it instead of deciding for you. When someone knocks and would make more than 20, their card says so, and Studio explains what to expect: every change goes to everyone, so with many people each change takes longer to reach each person, and slower laptops and connections fall behind first. Then you choose: Allow anyway lets more people in for this session. Each person still waits for your Edit, View only or Deny. Keep it at 20 turns away the people waiting over the limit; they are told you are keeping the session small. To allow more before anyone knocks, choose Allow more people… under In the session. Back to 20 puts the usual size back. Your choice lasts for this session only; the next one starts at 20 again. If things slow down, fewer people, a quieter file (fewer people changing it at the same moment) or a better connection (a cable instead of Wi-Fi) helps. Codes on your own network A code works for 10 minutes. New code makes another; Stop inviting closes it. People already in stay. One-time code lets one person in per code. After 3 wrong codes in a row, Studio closes the code and makes a new one, and tells you. Sessions on your own network are free, for everyone. Invite links over the internet: not open yet Invite links aren't open yet. Sessions on your own network are free. Today the Over the internet part of the Live panel says so in a plain sentence instead of offering a link. When invite links open, this is how they will work: Under Over the internet, choose how long the link works (1 hour, 8 hours, or until you end the session), then Invite by link. Copy the link and send it like a meeting link. The link's secret part (after #) never reaches getcadcraft.com: the site only passes on encrypted messages it can't read, and you still approve each person. New link makes the old one stop working at once; Stop the link ends it. Making an invite link will need you signed in, with a commercial license in force for the app. Guests will need nothing: no account, no license. Join someone else's session In CadCraft Studio's home screen, find Join a live session. Type the code the host gave you, or type the address shown under their code followed by the code. (Once invite links open, you will paste the host's link here too.) Type your name and choose Join. Studio opens the right app; it fills with the host's file once the host lets you in. Without Studio, scan the picture under the host's code with a device on the same network: the app opens in the browser. In CadCraft, if you already have the same file open in a Studio window, you can join from that window instead: choose Live, then under Join with the drawing open here type the code or the address and code, and choose Join here. Only the changes made since the file was opened travel. If the host's drawing is a different one, it replaces the one in that window; your file on disk stays as it is. Guest, hotel and school Wi-Fi often keep devices apart, so a code can't find the host there. Use a network that lets devices see each other, such as the office network. Invite links, for when you are not on the same network, are not open yet. Who changed what: Recent edits The Live panel lists Recent edits: who made each change and what it was (the step's name, such as Line or Move), newest first, with how long ago. Show more lists more of them. With something selected in CadCraft or MarkupCraft, the panel also says who changed it last, and Only what is selected keeps just the edits that touched it. The list is made in your own window from the session's edits while the session runs. It is gone when the session ends: it is never saved in the file or sent anywhere. Everyone in the session can see who made each change. If you joined after people had started, or were away for a while, the edits from before are not in your list, and the panel says so. Assistants in a session If someone turned on assistants in their app's settings, their AI assistant can ask to work in the session too. The host's own assistant joins at once; anyone else's waits for the host, with a card saying whose assistant it is: Allow or Deny. An assistant edits like its person, with its own undo, and leaves the session when its person leaves. When the session ends The host chooses End the session, or closes the file. Everyone else keeps an unsaved copy of the file as it was: save it if you want to keep it. Leave does the same for you alone.","lang":"en"},{"slug":"pen-and-touch","scope":"basics","title":"Draw with a pen on a tablet","summary":"What the app does when you draw with a pen on a touch screen: it ignores your palm, can leave the drawing to the pen while your fingers move the view, and lets the pen's buttons and a two-finger tap undo.","section":"tasks","order":94,"keywords":["pen","stylus","tablet","touch","palm","palm rejection","finger","fingers","two fingers","tap","undo","redo","side button","barrel button","eraser","pressure","hover","phone"],"headings":[{"id":"what-you-will-learn","text":"What you will learn","level":2},{"id":"a-pen-is-noticed-the-first-time","text":"A pen is noticed the first time","level":2},{"id":"your-palm-is-ignored","text":"Your palm is ignored","level":2},{"id":"let-the-pen-draw-and-your-fingers-move-the-view","text":"Let the pen draw and your fingers move the view","level":2},{"id":"undo-with-a-tap","text":"Undo with a tap","level":2},{"id":"the-pen-s-buttons","text":"The pen's buttons","level":2},{"id":"these-are-the-device-s-settings","text":"These are the device's settings","level":2},{"id":"not-built-yet","text":"Not built yet","level":2}],"html":"\u003Ch2 id=\"what-you-will-learn\"\u003EWhat you will learn\u003C/h2\u003E\n\u003Cp\u003EHow the app works with a pen on a tablet or a touch-screen laptop, and the settings that change it. They are in \u003Cspan class=\"hui\"\u003ESettings\u003C/span\u003E › \u003Cspan class=\"hui\"\u003EGeneral\u003C/span\u003E › \u003Cspan class=\"hui\"\u003EPen and touch\u003C/span\u003E, which shows on a touch screen, or once you have used a pen.\u003C/p\u003E\n\u003Ch2 id=\"a-pen-is-noticed-the-first-time\"\u003EA pen is noticed the first time\u003C/h2\u003E\n\u003Cp\u003ENothing changes until you touch the drawing with a pen. From then on the app remembers, on this device, that you draw with one, and the choices below start to apply. Before that, your fingers draw and select as usual.\u003C/p\u003E\n\u003Ch2 id=\"your-palm-is-ignored\"\u003EYour palm is ignored\u003C/h2\u003E\n\u003Cp\u003EWith \u003Cspan class=\"hui\"\u003EIgnore my palm while I use a pen\u003C/span\u003E on (it starts on), a touch on the drawing is ignored while the pen touches the screen, for a moment after you lift it or while it hovers just above the screen, and whenever the contact is as big as a palm. Rest your hand on the screen and draw.\u003C/p\u003E\n\u003Cp\u003EIf a quick finger right after the pen does nothing, wait a moment: that moment is the palm rule at work.\u003C/p\u003E\n\u003Ch2 id=\"let-the-pen-draw-and-your-fingers-move-the-view\"\u003ELet the pen draw and your fingers move the view\u003C/h2\u003E\n\u003Cp\u003EUnder \u003Cspan class=\"hui\"\u003EFingers on the drawing, once you use a pen here\u003C/span\u003E:\u003C/p\u003E\n\u003Cul\u003E\u003Cli\u003E\u003Cspan class=\"hui\"\u003EDraw and select\u003C/span\u003E (the start): a finger does what the pen does.\u003C/li\u003E\u003Cli\u003E\u003Cspan class=\"hui\"\u003EOnly move the view\u003C/span\u003E: one finger on the drawing does nothing, so a stray touch never draws or picks. Two fingers still move and zoom the view as usual.\u003C/li\u003E\u003C/ul\u003E\n\u003Cp\u003EThe toolbars, panels and dialogs work with your fingers either way.\u003C/p\u003E\n\u003Ch2 id=\"undo-with-a-tap\"\u003EUndo with a tap\u003C/h2\u003E\n\u003Cp\u003EWith \u003Cspan class=\"hui\"\u003ETap with two fingers to undo, three to redo\u003C/span\u003E on (it starts on), tap the drawing with two fingers together to undo your last step, and with three to redo it. It works with or without a pen. Moving the fingers is a pan or a zoom, never a tap.\u003C/p\u003E\n\u003Ch2 id=\"the-pen-s-buttons\"\u003EThe pen&#039;s buttons\u003C/h2\u003E\n\u003Cul\u003E\u003Cli\u003E\u003Cspan class=\"hui\"\u003EPen side button\u003C/span\u003E: \u003Cspan class=\"hui\"\u003EWhat the app does (a right click)\u003C/span\u003E at the start, or \u003Cspan class=\"hui\"\u003EUndo\u003C/span\u003E or \u003Cspan class=\"hui\"\u003ERedo\u003C/span\u003E.\u003C/li\u003E\u003Cli\u003E\u003Cspan class=\"hui\"\u003EPen eraser end\u003C/span\u003E (on pens that have one): \u003Cspan class=\"hui\"\u003EWhat the app does\u003C/span\u003E at the start, or \u003Cspan class=\"hui\"\u003EUndo\u003C/span\u003E or \u003Cspan class=\"hui\"\u003ERedo\u003C/span\u003E. In ModelCraft, what the app does is to erase while the eraser end touches.\u003C/li\u003E\u003C/ul\u003E\n\u003Ch2 id=\"these-are-the-device-s-settings\"\u003EThese are the device&#039;s settings\u003C/h2\u003E\n\u003Cp\u003EThe pen and touch choices are kept for this device and apply in every app on it, so you set them once. \u003Cspan class=\"hui\"\u003EReset the layout\u003C/span\u003E and resetting an app&#039;s settings leave them as they are.\u003C/p\u003E\n\u003Ch2 id=\"not-built-yet\"\u003ENot built yet\u003C/h2\u003E\n\u003Cp\u003EPen pressure and tilt don&#039;t change line weights yet, and no app has a handwriting or sketch-to-shape tool. The app reads the pen&#039;s pressure, tilt and hover, so these can come later per app.\u003C/p\u003E","text":"What you will learn How the app works with a pen on a tablet or a touch-screen laptop, and the settings that change it. They are in Settings › General › Pen and touch, which shows on a touch screen, or once you have used a pen. A pen is noticed the first time Nothing changes until you touch the drawing with a pen. From then on the app remembers, on this device, that you draw with one, and the choices below start to apply. Before that, your fingers draw and select as usual. Your palm is ignored With Ignore my palm while I use a pen on (it starts on), a touch on the drawing is ignored while the pen touches the screen, for a moment after you lift it or while it hovers just above the screen, and whenever the contact is as big as a palm. Rest your hand on the screen and draw. If a quick finger right after the pen does nothing, wait a moment: that moment is the palm rule at work. Let the pen draw and your fingers move the view Under Fingers on the drawing, once you use a pen here: Draw and select (the start): a finger does what the pen does. Only move the view: one finger on the drawing does nothing, so a stray touch never draws or picks. Two fingers still move and zoom the view as usual. The toolbars, panels and dialogs work with your fingers either way. Undo with a tap With Tap with two fingers to undo, three to redo on (it starts on), tap the drawing with two fingers together to undo your last step, and with three to redo it. It works with or without a pen. Moving the fingers is a pan or a zoom, never a tap. The pen's buttons Pen side button: What the app does (a right click) at the start, or Undo or Redo. Pen eraser end (on pens that have one): What the app does at the start, or Undo or Redo. In ModelCraft, what the app does is to erase while the eraser end touches. These are the device's settings The pen and touch choices are kept for this device and apply in every app on it, so you set them once. Reset the layout and resetting an app's settings leave them as they are. Not built yet Pen pressure and tilt don't change line weights yet, and no app has a handwriting or sketch-to-shape tool. The app reads the pen's pressure, tilt and hover, so these can come later per app.","lang":"en"},{"slug":"input-devices","scope":"basics","title":"Use a trackpad, 3D mouse or controller","summary":"Set what a trackpad, your mouse's side buttons, a pen, finger taps, a 3D mouse, a game controller or a MIDI controller does, for every app or for one app.","section":"tasks","order":95,"keywords":["trackpad","touchpad","two fingers","pinch","scroll","mouse","side button","back button","forward button","tilt wheel","pen","stylus","eraser","tap","3D mouse","space mouse","6 axis","game controller","gamepad","joystick","MIDI","knob","fader","pad","input device","customize","assign"],"headings":[{"id":"what-you-will-learn","text":"What you will learn","level":2},{"id":"every-app-or-only-this-app","text":"Every app, or only this app","level":2},{"id":"trackpad","text":"Trackpad","level":2},{"id":"mouse-buttons","text":"Mouse buttons","level":2},{"id":"pen-and-finger-taps","text":"Pen and finger taps","level":2},{"id":"3d-mouse","text":"3D mouse","level":2},{"id":"game-controller","text":"Game controller","level":2},{"id":"midi-controller","text":"MIDI controller","level":2},{"id":"share-your-settings","text":"Share your settings","level":2},{"id":"not-built-yet","text":"Not built yet","level":2}],"html":"\u003Ch2 id=\"what-you-will-learn\"\u003EWhat you will learn\u003C/h2\u003E\n\u003Cp\u003EHow to choose what each of your input devices does in the app. The settings are in \u003Cspan class=\"hui\"\u003ESettings\u003C/span\u003E › \u003Cspan class=\"hui\"\u003EGlobal\u003C/span\u003E › \u003Cspan class=\"hui\"\u003EInput devices\u003C/span\u003E, one card per device. Until you change something, every device works as it did before.\u003C/p\u003E\n\u003Ch2 id=\"every-app-or-only-this-app\"\u003EEvery app, or only this app\u003C/h2\u003E\n\u003Cp\u003EAt the top, \u003Cspan class=\"hui\"\u003EThese settings are for\u003C/span\u003E:\u003C/p\u003E\n\u003Cul\u003E\u003Cli\u003E\u003Cspan class=\"hui\"\u003EEvery app\u003C/span\u003E (the start): what you set applies in every app that has no settings of its own.\u003C/li\u003E\u003Cli\u003E\u003Cspan class=\"hui\"\u003EOnly\u003C/span\u003E this app: the app takes a copy of the shared settings and keeps its own from then on. Change them here without touching the other apps.\u003C/li\u003E\u003C/ul\u003E\n\u003Cp\u003EChoose \u003Cspan class=\"hui\"\u003EEvery app\u003C/span\u003E again to drop this app&#039;s own settings and go back to the shared ones. The settings are kept on this device, in every app window and in the desktop app&#039;s apps.\u003C/p\u003E\n\u003Ch2 id=\"trackpad\"\u003ETrackpad\u003C/h2\u003E\n\u003Cul\u003E\u003Cli\u003E\u003Cspan class=\"hui\"\u003ETwo-finger scroll\u003C/span\u003E: \u003Cspan class=\"hui\"\u003EWhat the app does\u003C/span\u003E, \u003Cspan class=\"hui\"\u003EPan the view\u003C/span\u003E, \u003Cspan class=\"hui\"\u003EZoom\u003C/span\u003E or \u003Cspan class=\"hui\"\u003EOrbit (3D views)\u003C/span\u003E.\u003C/li\u003E\u003Cli\u003E\u003Cspan class=\"hui\"\u003EPinch\u003C/span\u003E: zoom, as the app does, or \u003Cspan class=\"hui\"\u003ENothing\u003C/span\u003E.\u003C/li\u003E\u003Cli\u003E\u003Cspan class=\"hui\"\u003ESpeed\u003C/span\u003E and \u003Cspan class=\"hui\"\u003EReverse the direction\u003C/span\u003E apply when you have chosen pan, zoom or orbit.\u003C/li\u003E\u003C/ul\u003E\n\u003Cp\u003EThe app tells a trackpad from a mouse wheel by the way it scrolls, so a mouse wheel keeps doing what it does.\u003C/p\u003E\n\u003Ch2 id=\"mouse-buttons\"\u003EMouse buttons\u003C/h2\u003E\n\u003Cul\u003E\u003Cli\u003E\u003Cspan class=\"hui\"\u003EBack side button\u003C/span\u003E and \u003Cspan class=\"hui\"\u003EForward side button\u003C/span\u003E: run any command, such as Undo and Redo, or \u003Cspan class=\"hui\"\u003EFit everything in view\u003C/span\u003E. A side button set to a command no longer takes the browser back a page.\u003C/li\u003E\u003Cli\u003E\u003Cspan class=\"hui\"\u003EWheel tilted sideways\u003C/span\u003E: what the app does, pan the view, or nothing.\u003C/li\u003E\u003C/ul\u003E\n\u003Cp\u003EThe wheel&#039;s zoom direction and which buttons pan or orbit are in the app&#039;s own tab, under \u003Cspan class=\"hui\"\u003EMenus, keys and mouse\u003C/span\u003E.\u003C/p\u003E\n\u003Ch2 id=\"pen-and-finger-taps\"\u003EPen and finger taps\u003C/h2\u003E\n\u003Cul\u003E\u003Cli\u003E\u003Cspan class=\"hui\"\u003ESide button\u003C/span\u003E and \u003Cspan class=\"hui\"\u003EEraser end\u003C/span\u003E: what the app does, or any command.\u003C/li\u003E\u003Cli\u003E\u003Cspan class=\"hui\"\u003ETwo-finger tap\u003C/span\u003E and \u003Cspan class=\"hui\"\u003EThree-finger tap\u003C/span\u003E (they start as Undo and Redo): any command, or \u003Cspan class=\"hui\"\u003ENothing\u003C/span\u003E.\u003C/li\u003E\u003C/ul\u003E\n\u003Cp\u003EPalm rejection and what your fingers do once you use a pen stay under \u003Cspan class=\"hui\"\u003EPen and touch\u003C/span\u003E.\u003C/p\u003E\n\u003Ch2 id=\"3d-mouse\"\u003E3D mouse\u003C/h2\u003E\n\u003Cp\u003EChoose \u003Cspan class=\"hui\"\u003EConnect a 3D mouse\u003C/span\u003E and pick it in the browser&#039;s list; the browser remembers it for this site. Then push, lift, tilt and twist the cap to move the view under the pointer:\u003C/p\u003E\n\u003Cul\u003E\u003Cli\u003EEach movement (\u003Cspan class=\"hui\"\u003EPush left and right\u003C/span\u003E, \u003Cspan class=\"hui\"\u003EPush forward and back\u003C/span\u003E, \u003Cspan class=\"hui\"\u003ELift and press\u003C/span\u003E, \u003Cspan class=\"hui\"\u003ETilt forward and back\u003C/span\u003E, \u003Cspan class=\"hui\"\u003ETilt left and right\u003C/span\u003E, \u003Cspan class=\"hui\"\u003ETwist\u003C/span\u003E) can pan, zoom, orbit or do nothing, and \u003Cspan class=\"hui\"\u003EReverse\u003C/span\u003E turns it round.\u003C/li\u003E\u003Cli\u003E\u003Cspan class=\"hui\"\u003ESpeed\u003C/span\u003E, \u003Cspan class=\"hui\"\u003EDead zone\u003C/span\u003E (how far the cap moves before anything happens) and \u003Cspan class=\"hui\"\u003EOnly the strongest movement at a time\u003C/span\u003E.\u003C/li\u003E\u003Cli\u003EEach button runs a command or fits the view.\u003C/li\u003E\u003C/ul\u003E\n\u003Cp\u003EA 3D mouse needs Chrome or Edge in the browser.\u003C/p\u003E\n\u003Ch2 id=\"game-controller\"\u003EGame controller\u003C/h2\u003E\n\u003Cp\u003EPlug in a controller and press any button so the browser shows it to the app. The sticks pan, orbit or zoom; the triggers zoom in and out; every button can run a command. \u003Cspan class=\"hui\"\u003ESpeed\u003C/span\u003E, \u003Cspan class=\"hui\"\u003EDead zone\u003C/span\u003E and \u003Cspan class=\"hui\"\u003EReverse up and down on the sticks\u003C/span\u003E are there too.\u003C/p\u003E\n\u003Ch2 id=\"midi-controller\"\u003EMIDI controller\u003C/h2\u003E\n\u003Cp\u003EChoose \u003Cspan class=\"hui\"\u003EConnect MIDI\u003C/span\u003E. Then, for each control: pick what it should do under \u003Cspan class=\"hui\"\u003EAdd a control for\u003C/span\u003E (a knob or fader pans, zooms or orbits; a pad or key runs a command), choose \u003Cspan class=\"hui\"\u003ELearn it\u003C/span\u003E, and turn the knob or press the pad. Each learned control is listed, with a button to remove it. MIDI needs Chrome or Edge in the browser.\u003C/p\u003E\n\u003Ch2 id=\"share-your-settings\"\u003EShare your settings\u003C/h2\u003E\n\u003Cp\u003E\u003Cspan class=\"hui\"\u003EExport\u003C/span\u003E saves the settings shown as a file; \u003Cspan class=\"hui\"\u003EImport\u003C/span\u003E reads one back (settings this version doesn&#039;t know are left out, and you&#039;re told how many). \u003Cspan class=\"hui\"\u003EBack to the defaults\u003C/span\u003E undoes every change for the settings shown.\u003C/p\u003E\n\u003Ch2 id=\"not-built-yet\"\u003ENot built yet\u003C/h2\u003E\n\u003Cp\u003EA wheel dial (such as the ones on Windows) and the desktop app&#039;s own drivers for 3D mice are not supported yet. A 3D mouse, controller or knob moves the view only in apps that have handed their views over; their buttons work everywhere.\u003C/p\u003E","text":"What you will learn How to choose what each of your input devices does in the app. The settings are in Settings › Global › Input devices, one card per device. Until you change something, every device works as it did before. Every app, or only this app At the top, These settings are for: Every app (the start): what you set applies in every app that has no settings of its own. Only this app: the app takes a copy of the shared settings and keeps its own from then on. Change them here without touching the other apps. Choose Every app again to drop this app's own settings and go back to the shared ones. The settings are kept on this device, in every app window and in the desktop app's apps. Trackpad Two-finger scroll: What the app does, Pan the view, Zoom or Orbit (3D views). Pinch: zoom, as the app does, or Nothing. Speed and Reverse the direction apply when you have chosen pan, zoom or orbit. The app tells a trackpad from a mouse wheel by the way it scrolls, so a mouse wheel keeps doing what it does. Mouse buttons Back side button and Forward side button: run any command, such as Undo and Redo, or Fit everything in view. A side button set to a command no longer takes the browser back a page. Wheel tilted sideways: what the app does, pan the view, or nothing. The wheel's zoom direction and which buttons pan or orbit are in the app's own tab, under Menus, keys and mouse. Pen and finger taps Side button and Eraser end: what the app does, or any command. Two-finger tap and Three-finger tap (they start as Undo and Redo): any command, or Nothing. Palm rejection and what your fingers do once you use a pen stay under Pen and touch. 3D mouse Choose Connect a 3D mouse and pick it in the browser's list; the browser remembers it for this site. Then push, lift, tilt and twist the cap to move the view under the pointer: Each movement (Push left and right, Push forward and back, Lift and press, Tilt forward and back, Tilt left and right, Twist) can pan, zoom, orbit or do nothing, and Reverse turns it round. Speed, Dead zone (how far the cap moves before anything happens) and Only the strongest movement at a time. Each button runs a command or fits the view. A 3D mouse needs Chrome or Edge in the browser. Game controller Plug in a controller and press any button so the browser shows it to the app. The sticks pan, orbit or zoom; the triggers zoom in and out; every button can run a command. Speed, Dead zone and Reverse up and down on the sticks are there too. MIDI controller Choose Connect MIDI. Then, for each control: pick what it should do under Add a control for (a knob or fader pans, zooms or orbits; a pad or key runs a command), choose Learn it, and turn the knob or press the pad. Each learned control is listed, with a button to remove it. MIDI needs Chrome or Edge in the browser. Share your settings Export saves the settings shown as a file; Import reads one back (settings this version doesn't know are left out, and you're told how many). Back to the defaults undoes every change for the settings shown. Not built yet A wheel dial (such as the ones on Windows) and the desktop app's own drivers for 3D mice are not supported yet. A 3D mouse, controller or knob moves the view only in apps that have handed their views over; their buttons work everywhere.","lang":"en"},{"slug":"undo-across-windows","scope":"basics","title":"Undo the last step across windows","summary":"In CadCraft Studio, take back the last thing you did in any app window from the Studio window, in the order you worked, without changing windows first.","section":"tasks","order":140,"keywords":["undo","undo across apps","undo last step","last step","project undo","studio undo","order I worked","undo in another app","windows","journal"],"headings":[{"id":"what-you-will-do","text":"What you will do","level":2},{"id":"how-it-works","text":"How it works","level":2},{"id":"what-it-will-not-do","text":"What it will not do","level":2}],"html":"\u003Ch2 id=\"what-you-will-do\"\u003EWhat you will do\u003C/h2\u003E\n\u003Cp\u003EYou drew a wall in BimCraft, then moved a mark in TakeoffDesk, and you want the last one back without hunting for the right window. In the Studio window, under \u003Cstrong\u003EOpen windows\u003C/strong\u003E, choose \u003Cspan class=\"hui\"\u003EUndo last step\u003C/span\u003E.\u003C/p\u003E\n\u003Ch2 id=\"how-it-works\"\u003EHow it works\u003C/h2\u003E\n\u003Cp\u003EEach app window tells Studio when it finishes a step, with the name you see in its own Undo. Studio keeps the newest step of every window and the order between them. The line beside the button names the newest one, for example &quot;Rename the takeoff in TakeoffDesk&quot;.\u003C/p\u003E\n\u003Col\u003E\u003Cli\u003EChoose \u003Cspan class=\"hui\"\u003EUndo last step\u003C/span\u003E in the Studio window. Studio asks &quot;Undo this step in that app?&quot;; nothing happens until you say \u003Cspan class=\"hui\"\u003EUndo it\u003C/span\u003E.\u003C/li\u003E\u003Cli\u003EStudio asks that window for its own next undo and the window runs it, exactly as if you had pressed Undo there. Choose the button again for the step before.\u003C/li\u003E\u003C/ol\u003E\n\u003Ch2 id=\"what-it-will-not-do\"\u003EWhat it will not do\u003C/h2\u003E\n\u003Cul\u003E\u003Cli\u003EIt takes back \u003Cstrong\u003Eone window&#039;s own last step\u003C/strong\u003E only. It does not undo the effects of that step in another app: a change in BimCraft that fed a takeoff is not undone in TakeoffDesk by this.\u003C/li\u003E\u003Cli\u003EIf you have changed that window since (typed in it, opened another file, or undone by hand there), Studio does not force anything. It skips that window and says nothing was undone; use Undo inside the app.\u003C/li\u003E\u003Cli\u003EA closed window&#039;s steps are gone. Steps older than half an hour are not offered.\u003C/li\u003E\u003Cli\u003EIt does not undo a save, and it is not offered in a browser tab on its own: it needs the apps open as windows of one Studio.\u003C/li\u003E\u003C/ul\u003E\n\u003Cp\u003EEach app&#039;s own Undo (\u003Ckbd class=\"hk\"\u003E\u003Cspan class=\"k-mac\" title=\"Control\"\u003E⌃\u003C/span\u003E\u003Cspan class=\"k-pc\"\u003ECtrl\u003C/span\u003E\u003C/kbd\u003E+\u003Ckbd class=\"hk\"\u003E\u003Cspan class=\"k-mac\" title=\"Z\"\u003EZ\u003C/span\u003E\u003Cspan class=\"k-pc\"\u003EZ\u003C/span\u003E\u003C/kbd\u003E) works as before, and is told to Studio too, so the two never disagree.\u003C/p\u003E","text":"What you will do You drew a wall in BimCraft, then moved a mark in TakeoffDesk, and you want the last one back without hunting for the right window. In the Studio window, under Open windows, choose Undo last step. How it works Each app window tells Studio when it finishes a step, with the name you see in its own Undo. Studio keeps the newest step of every window and the order between them. The line beside the button names the newest one, for example \"Rename the takeoff in TakeoffDesk\". Choose Undo last step in the Studio window. Studio asks \"Undo this step in that app?\"; nothing happens until you say Undo it. Studio asks that window for its own next undo and the window runs it, exactly as if you had pressed Undo there. Choose the button again for the step before. What it will not do It takes back one window's own last step only. It does not undo the effects of that step in another app: a change in BimCraft that fed a takeoff is not undone in TakeoffDesk by this. If you have changed that window since (typed in it, opened another file, or undone by hand there), Studio does not force anything. It skips that window and says nothing was undone; use Undo inside the app. A closed window's steps are gone. Steps older than half an hour are not offered. It does not undo a save, and it is not offered in a browser tab on its own: it needs the apps open as windows of one Studio. Each app's own Undo (Ctrl+Z) works as before, and is told to Studio too, so the two never disagree.","lang":"en"},{"slug":"full-screen-crosshair","scope":"basics","title":"Full-screen crosshair","summary":"Two thin lines through the pointer, edge to edge across the drawing or view, to check by eye that things line up. One switch turns it on in every app.","section":"reference","order":30,"keywords":["full screen crosshair","full-screen cursor","crosshair","cursor","cursorsize","cursorsize 100","edge to edge","line up","alignment","align","guide lines","cross hairs"],"headings":[{"id":"turn-it-on","text":"Turn it on","level":2},{"id":"what-it-does","text":"What it does","level":2}],"html":"\u003Cp\u003EThe full-screen crosshair draws two thin lines through the pointer: one across the whole width of the drawing or view under it, one down its whole height. Move the pointer to an edge or a corner and you can see at once whether other things sit on the same line. It is the same as AutoCAD&#039;s \u003Ccode class=\"hcmd\"\u003ECURSORSIZE\u003C/code\u003E 100.\u003C/p\u003E\n\u003Ch2 id=\"turn-it-on\"\u003ETurn it on\u003C/h2\u003E\n\u003Cp\u003EOpen \u003Cspan class=\"hui\"\u003ESettings\u003C/span\u003E (the gear in the app bar, or \u003Ckbd class=\"hk\"\u003E\u003Cspan class=\"k-mac\" title=\"Command ,\"\u003E⌘,\u003C/span\u003E\u003Cspan class=\"k-pc\"\u003ECtrl+,\u003C/span\u003E\u003C/kbd\u003E), go to \u003Cspan class=\"hui\"\u003EGeneral\u003C/span\u003E and tick \u003Cstrong\u003ECrosshair from edge to edge in every app\u003C/strong\u003E under \u003Cstrong\u003EFull-screen crosshair\u003C/strong\u003E. It is one switch for all eight apps on this computer: turn it on in one app and the others have it too, also in tabs that are already open.\u003C/p\u003E\n\u003Ch2 id=\"what-it-does\"\u003EWhat it does\u003C/h2\u003E\n\u003Cul\u003E\u003Cli\u003EThe lines show while the pointer is over a drawing or a view, also when no tool is running.\u003C/li\u003E\u003Cli\u003EToolbars, cards and hints that sit over the view stay on top of the lines; a dialog never gets them.\u003C/li\u003E\u003Cli\u003EWith a finger nothing changes: the lines follow a mouse, a trackpad or a pen.\u003C/li\u003E\u003Cli\u003EIn CadCraft the crosshair is drawn by the drawing itself: it turns with the coordinate system (UCS), and with the view split it stays in the pane you are working in. CadCraft also has it as a cursor size of its own: \u003Cspan class=\"hui\"\u003ESettings\u003C/span\u003E › \u003Cspan class=\"hui\"\u003ECadCraft\u003C/span\u003E › \u003Cstrong\u003ECursor\u003C/strong\u003E › \u003Cstrong\u003EFull screen\u003C/strong\u003E, or type \u003Ccode class=\"hcmd\"\u003ECURSORSIZE\u003C/code\u003E and 100.\u003C/li\u003E\u003C/ul\u003E","text":"The full-screen crosshair draws two thin lines through the pointer: one across the whole width of the drawing or view under it, one down its whole height. Move the pointer to an edge or a corner and you can see at once whether other things sit on the same line. It is the same as AutoCAD's CURSORSIZE 100. Turn it on Open Settings (the gear in the app bar, or Ctrl+,), go to General and tick Crosshair from edge to edge in every app under Full-screen crosshair. It is one switch for all eight apps on this computer: turn it on in one app and the others have it too, also in tabs that are already open. What it does The lines show while the pointer is over a drawing or a view, also when no tool is running. Toolbars, cards and hints that sit over the view stay on top of the lines; a dialog never gets them. With a finger nothing changes: the lines follow a mouse, a trackpad or a pen. In CadCraft the crosshair is drawn by the drawing itself: it turns with the coordinate system (UCS), and with the view split it stays in the pane you are working in. CadCraft also has it as a cursor size of its own: Settings › CadCraft › Cursor › Full screen, or type CURSORSIZE and 100.","lang":"en"},{"slug":"unit-lists","scope":"basics","title":"Units, typed values and the unit lists","summary":"Type a length in any unit with its mark, choose which units the unit lists show, and star the unit new work starts in. A file always keeps its own unit.","section":"reference","order":60,"keywords":["units","unit list","metric","imperial","feet","inches","feet and inches","meters","millimeters","US survey foot","survey feet","international foot","yards","miles","nautical mile","chain","rod","link","furlong","fathom","point","pica","acre","hectare","square","roofing square","acre-foot","board foot","gallon","gon","grad","radian","degrees minutes seconds","slope","percent","H:V","rise run","default unit","star","INSUNITS"],"headings":[{"id":"what-you-will-learn","text":"What you will learn","level":2},{"id":"type-a-length-in-any-unit","text":"Type a length in any unit","level":2},{"id":"choose-the-units-the-lists-show","text":"Choose the units the lists show","level":2},{"id":"where-the-lists-and-the-star-are-used","text":"Where the lists and the star are used","level":2},{"id":"a-file-keeps-its-own-unit","text":"A file keeps its own unit","level":2}],"html":"\u003Ch2 id=\"what-you-will-learn\"\u003EWhat you will learn\u003C/h2\u003E\n\u003Cp\u003EHow to type a value in any unit, and how to choose which units the unit lists in the apps show and which one new work starts in. Every app shares one table of units, with the exact sizes their legal definitions give.\u003C/p\u003E\n\u003Ch2 id=\"type-a-length-in-any-unit\"\u003EType a length in any unit\u003C/h2\u003E\n\u003Cp\u003EIn a box that takes a length, type the number and the unit&#039;s mark after it. The app turns it into the unit the box is in.\u003C/p\u003E\n\u003Cdiv class=\"ht-wrap\"\u003E\u003Ctable class=\"ht\"\u003E\u003Cthead\u003E\u003Ctr\u003E\u003Cth scope=\"col\"\u003EType\u003C/th\u003E\u003Cth scope=\"col\"\u003EMeans\u003C/th\u003E\u003C/tr\u003E\u003C/thead\u003E\u003Ctbody\u003E\u003Ctr\u003E\u003Ctd\u003E\u003Ccode\u003E12&#039;6&quot;\u003C/code\u003E, \u003Ccode\u003E12&#039; 6 1/2&quot;\u003C/code\u003E, \u003Ccode\u003E12&#039;-6&quot;\u003C/code\u003E, \u003Ccode\u003E3 ft 6 in\u003C/code\u003E\u003C/td\u003E\u003Ctd\u003Efeet and inches\u003C/td\u003E\u003C/tr\u003E\u003Ctr\u003E\u003Ctd\u003E\u003Ccode\u003E450 mm\u003C/code\u003E, \u003Ccode\u003E3.2 m\u003C/code\u003E, \u003Ccode\u003E1.5 km\u003C/code\u003E, \u003Ccode\u003E2 dm\u003C/code\u003E, \u003Ccode\u003E400 nm\u003C/code\u003E\u003C/td\u003E\u003Ctd\u003Emetric lengths (\u003Ccode\u003Enm\u003C/code\u003E is the nanometer)\u003C/td\u003E\u003C/tr\u003E\u003Ctr\u003E\u003Ctd\u003E\u003Ccode\u003E3 yd\u003C/code\u003E, \u003Ccode\u003E2.5 mi\u003C/code\u003E, \u003Ccode\u003E250 mil\u003C/code\u003E\u003C/td\u003E\u003Ctd\u003Eyards, miles, thousandths of an inch\u003C/td\u003E\u003C/tr\u003E\u003Ctr\u003E\u003Ctd\u003E\u003Ccode\u003E10 US ft\u003C/code\u003E, \u003Ccode\u003E1 US mi\u003C/code\u003E\u003C/td\u003E\u003Ctd\u003Ethe US survey foot and mile\u003C/td\u003E\u003C/tr\u003E\u003Ctr\u003E\u003Ctd\u003E\u003Ccode\u003E2 rd\u003C/code\u003E, \u003Ccode\u003E100 li\u003C/code\u003E, \u003Ccode\u003E3 ch\u003C/code\u003E, \u003Ccode\u003E1 fur\u003C/code\u003E\u003C/td\u003E\u003Ctd\u003Erods, links, chains, furlongs\u003C/td\u003E\u003C/tr\u003E\u003Ctr\u003E\u003Ctd\u003E\u003Ccode\u003E1 nmi\u003C/code\u003E or \u003Ccode\u003E1 NM\u003C/code\u003E, \u003Ccode\u003E6 ftm\u003C/code\u003E\u003C/td\u003E\u003Ctd\u003Enautical miles, fathoms\u003C/td\u003E\u003C/tr\u003E\u003Ctr\u003E\u003Ctd\u003E\u003Ccode\u003E12 pt\u003C/code\u003E, \u003Ccode\u003E3 pc\u003C/code\u003E\u003C/td\u003E\u003Ctd\u003Epoints and picas (1/72 and 1/6 of an inch)\u003C/td\u003E\u003C/tr\u003E\u003C/tbody\u003E\u003C/table\u003E\u003C/div\u003E\n\u003Cul\u003E\u003Cli\u003E\u003Ccode\u003Enm\u003C/code\u003E is always the nanometer. For the nautical mile type \u003Ccode\u003Enmi\u003C/code\u003E or \u003Ccode\u003ENM\u003C/code\u003E. \u003Ccode\u003ENm\u003C/code\u003E is refused, because it could be either.\u003C/li\u003E\u003Cli\u003E\u003Ccode\u003Eft\u003C/code\u003E is the international foot (0.3048 m). The US survey foot (1200/3937 m) is a different unit: type \u003Ccode\u003EUS ft\u003C/code\u003E, \u003Ccode\u003Eusft\u003C/code\u003E or \u003Ccode\u003Esurvey ft\u003C/code\u003E. Rods, links, chains, furlongs and acres are the international-foot ones.\u003C/li\u003E\u003Cli\u003ESums work as before where the app takes them, with any of these marks: \u003Ccode\u003E2*3 yd\u003C/code\u003E, \u003Ccode\u003E12&#039;6&quot; + 3 ch\u003C/code\u003E.\u003C/li\u003E\u003Cli\u003EIn CadCraft a mark is read when the drawing has units (its $INSUNITS). A drawing with no units reads one only when its length format is Engineering or Architectural, where one drawing unit is an inch.\u003C/li\u003E\u003Cli\u003EIn CivilCraft a project in feet is in US survey feet, as it always was, so \u003Ccode\u003E10 US ft\u003C/code\u003E is 10 and \u003Ccode\u003E10 ft\u003C/code\u003E is 10 project feet.\u003C/li\u003E\u003C/ul\u003E\n\u003Ch2 id=\"choose-the-units-the-lists-show\"\u003EChoose the units the lists show\u003C/h2\u003E\n\u003Cp\u003EOpen \u003Cspan class=\"hui\"\u003ESettings\u003C/span\u003E (the gear on the app bar, or \u003Ckbd class=\"hk\"\u003E\u003Cspan class=\"k-mac\" title=\"Command ,\"\u003E⌘,\u003C/span\u003E\u003Cspan class=\"k-pc\"\u003ECtrl+,\u003C/span\u003E\u003C/kbd\u003E), choose \u003Cspan class=\"hui\"\u003EGeneral\u003C/span\u003E, and find \u003Cspan class=\"hui\"\u003EUnits\u003C/span\u003E. There is one list for each kind: \u003Cspan class=\"hui\"\u003ELength\u003C/span\u003E, \u003Cspan class=\"hui\"\u003EArea\u003C/span\u003E, \u003Cspan class=\"hui\"\u003EVolume\u003C/span\u003E, \u003Cspan class=\"hui\"\u003EAngle\u003C/span\u003E and \u003Cspan class=\"hui\"\u003ESlope\u003C/span\u003E.\u003C/p\u003E\n\u003Cul\u003E\u003Cli\u003EEach unit has a switch. A unit that is off is left out of the unit lists in the apps.\u003C/li\u003E\u003Cli\u003EClick the star beside a unit to make it the default for new work. Click it again to take the star away. With no star, each app keeps its own default (the file&#039;s unit, or the one for your region).\u003C/li\u003E\u003Cli\u003E\u003Cspan class=\"hui\"\u003EReset the unit lists\u003C/span\u003E puts the starting lists back, with no stars.\u003C/li\u003E\u003Cli\u003EThe choices are the same in every app in this browser, and they are saved as you make them.\u003C/li\u003E\u003C/ul\u003E\n\u003Ch2 id=\"where-the-lists-and-the-star-are-used\"\u003EWhere the lists and the star are used\u003C/h2\u003E\n\u003Cdiv class=\"ht-wrap\"\u003E\u003Ctable class=\"ht\"\u003E\u003Cthead\u003E\u003Ctr\u003E\u003Cth scope=\"col\"\u003EApp\u003C/th\u003E\u003Cth scope=\"col\"\u003EWhat follows the switches\u003C/th\u003E\u003Cth scope=\"col\"\u003EWhat the star sets\u003C/th\u003E\u003C/tr\u003E\u003C/thead\u003E\u003Ctbody\u003E\u003Ctr\u003E\u003Ctd\u003ECadCraft\u003C/td\u003E\u003Ctd\u003E\u003C/td\u003E\u003Ctd\u003EThe units ($INSUNITS) of a new drawing, when it is a unit a drawing can carry\u003C/td\u003E\u003C/tr\u003E\u003Ctr\u003E\u003Ctd\u003ECivilCraft\u003C/td\u003E\u003Ctd\u003EThe project&#039;s units list\u003C/td\u003E\u003Ctd\u003ELength: a new project in meters (a metric star) or feet. Area and volume: the unit areas and volumes are reported in\u003C/td\u003E\u003C/tr\u003E\u003Ctr\u003E\u003Ctd\u003EModelCraft\u003C/td\u003E\u003Ctd\u003EThe units list beside the value box\u003C/td\u003E\u003Ctd\u003EThe unit of a new model\u003C/td\u003E\u003C/tr\u003E\u003Ctr\u003E\u003Ctd\u003EBimCraft\u003C/td\u003E\u003Ctd\u003EThe units list on the plan toolbar\u003C/td\u003E\u003Ctd\u003EThe display units, until you pick them on the toolbar (your earlier pick is kept)\u003C/td\u003E\u003C/tr\u003E\u003Ctr\u003E\u003Ctd\u003EMarkupCraft\u003C/td\u003E\u003Ctd\u003EThe measuring and position units in \u003Cspan class=\"hui\"\u003ESettings\u003C/span\u003E, and the unit in the calibrate dialog\u003C/td\u003E\u003Ctd\u003EThe measuring unit, until MarkupCraft&#039;s own settings have been saved\u003C/td\u003E\u003C/tr\u003E\u003Ctr\u003E\u003Ctd\u003ETakeoffDesk\u003C/td\u003E\u003Ctd\u003EThe unit lists of an item\u003C/td\u003E\u003Ctd\u003ELength and area: the unit of a new item\u003C/td\u003E\u003C/tr\u003E\u003C/tbody\u003E\u003C/table\u003E\u003C/div\u003E\n\u003Cp\u003EThe angle and slope lists are saved, but no app&#039;s box follows them yet.\u003C/p\u003E\n\u003Ch2 id=\"a-file-keeps-its-own-unit\"\u003EA file keeps its own unit\u003C/h2\u003E\n\u003Cp\u003EThe settings never change a file. A drawing keeps its units, a CivilCraft project its feet or meters, a model its unit. The unit a file uses is always in its list, even when it is turned off in \u003Cspan class=\"hui\"\u003ESettings\u003C/span\u003E.\u003C/p\u003E","text":"What you will learn How to type a value in any unit, and how to choose which units the unit lists in the apps show and which one new work starts in. Every app shares one table of units, with the exact sizes their legal definitions give. Type a length in any unit In a box that takes a length, type the number and the unit's mark after it. The app turns it into the unit the box is in. Type Means 12'6\", 12' 6 1/2\", 12'-6\", 3 ft 6 in feet and inches 450 mm, 3.2 m, 1.5 km, 2 dm, 400 nm metric lengths (nm is the nanometer) 3 yd, 2.5 mi, 250 mil yards, miles, thousandths of an inch 10 US ft, 1 US mi the US survey foot and mile 2 rd, 100 li, 3 ch, 1 fur rods, links, chains, furlongs 1 nmi or 1 NM, 6 ftm nautical miles, fathoms 12 pt, 3 pc points and picas (1/72 and 1/6 of an inch) nm is always the nanometer. For the nautical mile type nmi or NM. Nm is refused, because it could be either. ft is the international foot (0.3048 m). The US survey foot (1200/3937 m) is a different unit: type US ft, usft or survey ft. Rods, links, chains, furlongs and acres are the international-foot ones. Sums work as before where the app takes them, with any of these marks: 2*3 yd, 12'6\" + 3 ch. In CadCraft a mark is read when the drawing has units (its $INSUNITS). A drawing with no units reads one only when its length format is Engineering or Architectural, where one drawing unit is an inch. In CivilCraft a project in feet is in US survey feet, as it always was, so 10 US ft is 10 and 10 ft is 10 project feet. Choose the units the lists show Open Settings (the gear on the app bar, or Ctrl+,), choose General, and find Units. There is one list for each kind: Length, Area, Volume, Angle and Slope. Each unit has a switch. A unit that is off is left out of the unit lists in the apps. Click the star beside a unit to make it the default for new work. Click it again to take the star away. With no star, each app keeps its own default (the file's unit, or the one for your region). Reset the unit lists puts the starting lists back, with no stars. The choices are the same in every app in this browser, and they are saved as you make them. Where the lists and the star are used App What follows the switches What the star sets CadCraft The units ($INSUNITS) of a new drawing, when it is a unit a drawing can carry CivilCraft The project's units list Length: a new project in meters (a metric star) or feet. Area and volume: the unit areas and volumes are reported in ModelCraft The units list beside the value box The unit of a new model BimCraft The units list on the plan toolbar The display units, until you pick them on the toolbar (your earlier pick is kept) MarkupCraft The measuring and position units in Settings, and the unit in the calibrate dialog The measuring unit, until MarkupCraft's own settings have been saved TakeoffDesk The unit lists of an item Length and area: the unit of a new item The angle and slope lists are saved, but no app's box follows them yet. A file keeps its own unit The settings never change a file. A drawing keeps its units, a CivilCraft project its feet or meters, a model its unit. The unit a file uses is always in its list, even when it is turned off in Settings.","lang":"en"},{"slug":"lost-toolbar","scope":"basics","title":"Where did my toolbar go?","summary":"The bars, menus or panels went missing. Here is what hides them on purpose, the keys that bring them back, and one button that puts the whole layout back.","section":"trouble","order":5,"keywords":["toolbar gone","toolbar missing","lost toolbar","lost menu","menu disappeared","ribbon disappeared","bars hidden","show bars","full screen","panels gone","reset layout","layout","ribbon","collapsed","locked toolbar"],"headings":[{"id":"the-quickest-fix-reset-the-layout","text":"The quickest fix: reset the layout","level":2},{"id":"the-bars-are-hidden-full-screen","text":"The bars are hidden (full screen)","level":2},{"id":"the-toolbar-looks-different","text":"The toolbar looks different","level":2},{"id":"the-toolbar-s-own-menu","text":"The toolbar's own menu","level":2},{"id":"everything-is-too-big-or-too-small","text":"Everything is too big or too small","level":2},{"id":"the-panels-are-gone","text":"The panels are gone","level":2},{"id":"on-a-phone","text":"On a phone","level":2},{"id":"still-missing","text":"Still missing?","level":2}],"html":"\u003Cp\u003ENothing is deleted when a bar or a panel goes away: the app only hides or moves it. Each of these ways is on purpose, and each has a way back.\u003C/p\u003E\n\u003Ch2 id=\"the-quickest-fix-reset-the-layout\"\u003EThe quickest fix: reset the layout\u003C/h2\u003E\n\u003Col\u003E\u003Cli\u003EOpen \u003Cspan class=\"hui\"\u003ESettings\u003C/span\u003E with the gear button in the app bar, or press \u003Ckbd class=\"hk\"\u003E\u003Cspan class=\"k-mac\" title=\"Command ,\"\u003E⌘,\u003C/span\u003E\u003Cspan class=\"k-pc\"\u003ECtrl+,\u003C/span\u003E\u003C/kbd\u003E.\u003C/li\u003E\u003Cli\u003EChoose the \u003Cspan class=\"hui\"\u003EGeneral\u003C/span\u003E tab.\u003C/li\u003E\u003Cli\u003EUnder \u003Cspan class=\"hui\"\u003ELayout\u003C/span\u003E, choose \u003Cspan class=\"hui\"\u003EReset the layout\u003C/span\u003E.\u003C/li\u003E\u003C/ol\u003E\n\u003Cp\u003EThe toolbar goes back to its first order and buttons, the panels go back to their sides, the screen mode goes back to the normal view and the menu style goes back to the one the app starts with. Your theme, language, sizes and the app&#039;s own settings stay as they are, and so do any menu styles you made yourself (choose them again under \u003Cspan class=\"hui\"\u003EMenus, keys and mouse\u003C/span\u003E).\u003C/p\u003E\n\u003Caside class=\"hc hc-note\"\u003E\u003Cp class=\"hc-label\"\u003ENote\u003C/p\u003E\n\u003Cp\u003EIn CadCraft Studio, \u003Cspan class=\"hui\"\u003ESettings\u003C/span\u003E in Studio&#039;s own window also has \u003Cspan class=\"hui\"\u003EReset the layout in every app\u003C/span\u003E. Each app&#039;s windows follow at once, and an app you open later starts from its first layout.\u003C/p\u003E\n\u003C/aside\u003E\n\u003Ch2 id=\"the-bars-are-hidden-full-screen\"\u003EThe bars are hidden (full screen)\u003C/h2\u003E\n\u003Cp\u003EThe screen-mode button in the app bar, and \u003Ckbd class=\"hk\"\u003E\u003Cspan class=\"k-mac\" title=\"Control Shift F\"\u003E⌃⇧F\u003C/span\u003E\u003Cspan class=\"k-pc\"\u003ECtrl+Shift+F\u003C/span\u003E\u003C/kbd\u003E, go from the normal view to full screen, then to full screen with the bars hidden, then back.\u003C/p\u003E\n\u003Cp\u003EWhile the bars are hidden, a small \u003Cspan class=\"hui\"\u003EShow bars\u003C/span\u003E tab stays at the top middle of the window. Choose it, or point at the top edge of the window, and the bars slide down; they hide again a moment after you move away. Press \u003Ckbd class=\"hk\"\u003E\u003Cspan class=\"k-mac\" title=\"Control Shift F\"\u003E⌃⇧F\u003C/span\u003E\u003Cspan class=\"k-pc\"\u003ECtrl+Shift+F\u003C/span\u003E\u003C/kbd\u003E to leave this mode, or \u003Ckbd class=\"hk\"\u003E\u003Cspan class=\"k-mac\" title=\"Esc\"\u003EEsc\u003C/span\u003E\u003Cspan class=\"k-pc\"\u003EEsc\u003C/span\u003E\u003C/kbd\u003E to leave full screen.\u003C/p\u003E\n\u003Cp\u003EIf the app opens with its bars hidden every time, look at \u003Cspan class=\"hui\"\u003ESettings\u003C/span\u003E › \u003Cspan class=\"hui\"\u003EGeneral\u003C/span\u003E › \u003Cspan class=\"hui\"\u003EScreen\u003C/span\u003E: the app does what is chosen there when it opens.\u003C/p\u003E\n\u003Cdiv class=\"hv\" data-v=\"input:touch\"\u003E\u003Cp class=\"hv-label\"\u003ETouch\u003C/p\u003E\n\u003Cp\u003ETap the \u003Cspan class=\"hui\"\u003EShow bars\u003C/span\u003E tab, or tap the top edge of the screen.\u003C/p\u003E\n\u003C/div\u003E\n\u003Ch2 id=\"the-toolbar-looks-different\"\u003EThe toolbar looks different\u003C/h2\u003E\n\u003Cul\u003E\u003Cli\u003E\u003Cstrong\u003ETools in another order, or tools you can&#039;t find:\u003C/strong\u003E someone arranged the toolbar. Choose \u003Cspan class=\"hui\"\u003EOriginal order\u003C/span\u003E under \u003Cspan class=\"hui\"\u003ESettings\u003C/span\u003E › \u003Cspan class=\"hui\"\u003EGeneral\u003C/span\u003E › \u003Cspan class=\"hui\"\u003EToolbar\u003C/span\u003E.\u003C/li\u003E\u003Cli\u003E\u003Cstrong\u003EOnly icons, or only words:\u003C/strong\u003E \u003Cspan class=\"hui\"\u003EToolbar buttons\u003C/span\u003E in the same place picks icons and labels, icons only or labels only. Hold the pointer over an icon to see its name.\u003C/li\u003E\u003Cli\u003E\u003Cstrong\u003ETools won&#039;t move:\u003C/strong\u003E the toolbar is locked. Right-click the toolbar (or press and hold it) and choose \u003Cspan class=\"hui\"\u003EUnlock the toolbar\u003C/span\u003E, or clear \u003Cspan class=\"hui\"\u003ELock the toolbar\u003C/span\u003E under \u003Cspan class=\"hui\"\u003ESettings\u003C/span\u003E › \u003Cspan class=\"hui\"\u003EGeneral\u003C/span\u003E › \u003Cspan class=\"hui\"\u003EToolbar\u003C/span\u003E.\u003C/li\u003E\u003Cli\u003E\u003Cstrong\u003EA ribbon that shows only its tab names:\u003C/strong\u003E it is collapsed. Choose a tab name to open its tools for one command, or double-click a tab name (or choose the pin at the end of the tab row) to keep the ribbon open.\u003C/li\u003E\u003Cli\u003E\u003Cstrong\u003EMenus or a ribbon instead of the toolbar:\u003C/strong\u003E a menu style is on. Pick the app&#039;s own style under \u003Cspan class=\"hui\"\u003ESettings\u003C/span\u003E › the app&#039;s tab › \u003Cspan class=\"hui\"\u003EMenus, keys and mouse\u003C/span\u003E. Every command is in every style; \u003Ckbd class=\"hk\"\u003E\u003Cspan class=\"k-mac\" title=\"Command K\"\u003E⌘K\u003C/span\u003E\u003Cspan class=\"k-pc\"\u003ECtrl+K\u003C/span\u003E\u003C/kbd\u003E finds any of them by name.\u003C/li\u003E\u003C/ul\u003E\n\u003Ch2 id=\"the-toolbar-s-own-menu\"\u003EThe toolbar&#039;s own menu\u003C/h2\u003E\n\u003Cp\u003ERight-click the toolbar, or press and hold it on a touch screen, for a short menu:\u003C/p\u003E\n\u003Cul\u003E\u003Cli\u003E\u003Cspan class=\"hui\"\u003EArrange the toolbar\u003C/span\u003E: drag tools within their group and groups by their name, or move the focused one with the arrow keys. Choose \u003Cspan class=\"hui\"\u003EDone arranging\u003C/span\u003E in the same menu, or press \u003Ckbd class=\"hk\"\u003E\u003Cspan class=\"k-mac\" title=\"Esc\"\u003EEsc\u003C/span\u003E\u003Cspan class=\"k-pc\"\u003EEsc\u003C/span\u003E\u003C/kbd\u003E, when it looks right.\u003C/li\u003E\u003Cli\u003E\u003Cspan class=\"hui\"\u003ELock the toolbar\u003C/span\u003E / \u003Cspan class=\"hui\"\u003EUnlock the toolbar\u003C/span\u003E: a locked toolbar can&#039;t be arranged or reset by accident.\u003C/li\u003E\u003Cli\u003E\u003Cspan class=\"hui\"\u003EReset the toolbar\u003C/span\u003E: tools back in their first order.\u003C/li\u003E\u003Cli\u003EWith a ribbon menu style: \u003Cspan class=\"hui\"\u003ECollapse the ribbon\u003C/span\u003E or \u003Cspan class=\"hui\"\u003EPin the ribbon open\u003C/span\u003E.\u003C/li\u003E\u003C/ul\u003E\n\u003Cp\u003EOn a keyboard, the menu key (or \u003Ckbd class=\"hk\"\u003E\u003Cspan class=\"k-mac\" title=\"Shift F10\"\u003E⇧ F10\u003C/span\u003E\u003Cspan class=\"k-pc\"\u003EShift+F10\u003C/span\u003E\u003C/kbd\u003E) opens it for the tool that has the focus.\u003C/p\u003E\n\u003Ch2 id=\"everything-is-too-big-or-too-small\"\u003EEverything is too big or too small\u003C/h2\u003E\n\u003Cp\u003E\u003Cspan class=\"hui\"\u003ESettings\u003C/span\u003E › \u003Cspan class=\"hui\"\u003EGeneral\u003C/span\u003E › \u003Cspan class=\"hui\"\u003EInterface size\u003C/span\u003E makes the bars, toolbars, panels and dialogs of this app bigger or smaller, from 80 % to 140 %. The drawing keeps its own zoom, so a smaller interface leaves more room for it, for example with two apps side by side on one monitor. \u003Cspan class=\"hui\"\u003EPanel text size\u003C/span\u003E beside it changes only the text in the side panels, on top of the interface size. Each app keeps its own size; CadCraft Studio&#039;s own window has one in its \u003Cspan class=\"hui\"\u003ESettings\u003C/span\u003E too.\u003C/p\u003E\n\u003Ch2 id=\"the-panels-are-gone\"\u003EThe panels are gone\u003C/h2\u003E\n\u003Cp\u003EPanels can float over the drawing, dock on another side, or move to a window of their own (often on a second monitor, or behind this window).\u003C/p\u003E\n\u003Cul\u003E\u003Cli\u003ELook for a second window called after the app with &quot;panels&quot;, and choose \u003Cspan class=\"hui\"\u003EPut the panels back\u003C/span\u003E in it.\u003C/li\u003E\u003Cli\u003EOr choose \u003Cspan class=\"hui\"\u003EReset layout\u003C/span\u003E under \u003Cspan class=\"hui\"\u003ESettings\u003C/span\u003E › \u003Cspan class=\"hui\"\u003EGeneral\u003C/span\u003E › \u003Cspan class=\"hui\"\u003EPanels\u003C/span\u003E, which brings every panel home.\u003C/li\u003E\u003C/ul\u003E\n\u003Ch2 id=\"on-a-phone\"\u003EOn a phone\u003C/h2\u003E\n\u003Cp\u003EOn a phone the panels are sheets: open one from the bar at the bottom of the screen. The \u003Cspan class=\"hui\"\u003ETools\u003C/span\u003E button in that bar hides and shows the toolbar, and \u003Cspan class=\"hui\"\u003EMove\u003C/span\u003E puts it at the top or the bottom of the screen.\u003C/p\u003E\n\u003Ch2 id=\"still-missing\"\u003EStill missing?\u003C/h2\u003E\n\u003Cp\u003EFind any tool by name with \u003Ckbd class=\"hk\"\u003E\u003Cspan class=\"k-mac\" title=\"Command K\"\u003E⌘K\u003C/span\u003E\u003Cspan class=\"k-pc\"\u003ECtrl+K\u003C/span\u003E\u003C/kbd\u003E, even while its bar is hidden. If something is still not where it should be after resetting the layout, tell us on the support page with the app&#039;s name and what you were doing.\u003C/p\u003E","text":"Nothing is deleted when a bar or a panel goes away: the app only hides or moves it. Each of these ways is on purpose, and each has a way back. The quickest fix: reset the layout Open Settings with the gear button in the app bar, or press Ctrl+,. Choose the General tab. Under Layout, choose Reset the layout. The toolbar goes back to its first order and buttons, the panels go back to their sides, the screen mode goes back to the normal view and the menu style goes back to the one the app starts with. Your theme, language, sizes and the app's own settings stay as they are, and so do any menu styles you made yourself (choose them again under Menus, keys and mouse). In CadCraft Studio, Settings in Studio's own window also has Reset the layout in every app. Each app's windows follow at once, and an app you open later starts from its first layout. The bars are hidden (full screen) The screen-mode button in the app bar, and Ctrl+Shift+F, go from the normal view to full screen, then to full screen with the bars hidden, then back. While the bars are hidden, a small Show bars tab stays at the top middle of the window. Choose it, or point at the top edge of the window, and the bars slide down; they hide again a moment after you move away. Press Ctrl+Shift+F to leave this mode, or Esc to leave full screen. If the app opens with its bars hidden every time, look at Settings › General › Screen: the app does what is chosen there when it opens. Tap the Show bars tab, or tap the top edge of the screen. The toolbar looks different Tools in another order, or tools you can't find: someone arranged the toolbar. Choose Original order under Settings › General › Toolbar. Only icons, or only words: Toolbar buttons in the same place picks icons and labels, icons only or labels only. Hold the pointer over an icon to see its name. Tools won't move: the toolbar is locked. Right-click the toolbar (or press and hold it) and choose Unlock the toolbar, or clear Lock the toolbar under Settings › General › Toolbar. A ribbon that shows only its tab names: it is collapsed. Choose a tab name to open its tools for one command, or double-click a tab name (or choose the pin at the end of the tab row) to keep the ribbon open. Menus or a ribbon instead of the toolbar: a menu style is on. Pick the app's own style under Settings › the app's tab › Menus, keys and mouse. Every command is in every style; Ctrl+K finds any of them by name. The toolbar's own menu Right-click the toolbar, or press and hold it on a touch screen, for a short menu: Arrange the toolbar: drag tools within their group and groups by their name, or move the focused one with the arrow keys. Choose Done arranging in the same menu, or press Esc, when it looks right. Lock the toolbar / Unlock the toolbar: a locked toolbar can't be arranged or reset by accident. Reset the toolbar: tools back in their first order. With a ribbon menu style: Collapse the ribbon or Pin the ribbon open. On a keyboard, the menu key (or Shift+F10) opens it for the tool that has the focus. Everything is too big or too small Settings › General › Interface size makes the bars, toolbars, panels and dialogs of this app bigger or smaller, from 80 % to 140 %. The drawing keeps its own zoom, so a smaller interface leaves more room for it, for example with two apps side by side on one monitor. Panel text size beside it changes only the text in the side panels, on top of the interface size. Each app keeps its own size; CadCraft Studio's own window has one in its Settings too. The panels are gone Panels can float over the drawing, dock on another side, or move to a window of their own (often on a second monitor, or behind this window). Look for a second window called after the app with \"panels\", and choose Put the panels back in it. Or choose Reset layout under Settings › General › Panels, which brings every panel home. On a phone On a phone the panels are sheets: open one from the bar at the bottom of the screen. The Tools button in that bar hides and shows the toolbar, and Move puts it at the top or the bottom of the screen. Still missing? Find any tool by name with Ctrl+K, even while its bar is hidden. If something is still not where it should be after resetting the layout, tell us on the support page with the app's name and what you were doing.","lang":"en"},{"slug":"recover","scope":"basics","title":"Recover unsaved work","summary":"How the apps keep a recovery copy while you work, and how to get your work back after a crash or a closed tab.","section":"trouble","order":55,"keywords":["autosave","recover","recovery","crash","lost work","closed tab","unsaved","restore","backup"],"headings":[{"id":"when-the-copy-is-kept","text":"When the copy is kept","level":2},{"id":"get-your-work-back","text":"Get your work back","level":2},{"id":"things-to-know","text":"Things to know","level":2}],"html":"\u003Cp\u003EWhile you work, each app keeps a recovery copy of what you have not saved yet. It is not a save: your file on your computer only changes when you save it. The copy is there so a crash, a closed tab or a computer that turns off does not cost you your work.\u003C/p\u003E\n\u003Ch2 id=\"when-the-copy-is-kept\"\u003EWhen the copy is kept\u003C/h2\u003E\n\u003Cul\u003E\u003Cli\u003EA few seconds after you stop editing, and at least every 30 seconds while you keep going.\u003C/li\u003E\u003Cli\u003EWhen you switch to another tab or window.\u003C/li\u003E\u003C/ul\u003E\n\u003Cp\u003EThe copy stays in this browser, on this computer. Nothing is uploaded.\u003C/p\u003E\n\u003Ch2 id=\"get-your-work-back\"\u003EGet your work back\u003C/h2\u003E\n\u003Col\u003E\u003Cli\u003EOpen the same app again, in the same browser.\u003C/li\u003E\u003Cli\u003EIf it closed before your work was saved, it asks \u003Cspan class=\"hui\"\u003ERecover your work?\u003C/span\u003E and lists what it kept, with the time of the last copy.\u003C/li\u003E\u003Cli\u003EChoose \u003Cspan class=\"hui\"\u003ERecover\u003C/span\u003E to open it, or \u003Cspan class=\"hui\"\u003EDiscard\u003C/span\u003E to throw it away.\u003C/li\u003E\u003Cli\u003ESave it to a file as soon as it opens.\u003C/li\u003E\u003C/ol\u003E\n\u003Cp\u003E\u003Cspan class=\"hui\"\u003ENot now\u003C/span\u003E keeps the copies for 30 days, and the app asks again the next time it opens. A reload counts too: reload a tab with unsaved work and the app offers it back.\u003C/p\u003E\n\u003Ch2 id=\"things-to-know\"\u003EThings to know\u003C/h2\u003E\n\u003Cul\u003E\u003Cli\u003EWhen you save, or close a file on purpose, its recovery copy is removed.\u003C/li\u003E\u003Cli\u003EAnother tab of the same app that is still open never offers your copies. It only offers work from a tab that has gone.\u003C/li\u003E\u003Cli\u003EPrivate windows in some browsers, and a browser with no space left, cannot keep a copy. The app tells you when that happens, so save to a file more often.\u003C/li\u003E\u003Cli\u003EClearing your browser&#039;s site data removes the copies.\u003C/li\u003E\u003Cli\u003ENot every app keeps a recovery copy yet. Each app&#039;s own help says whether it does.\u003C/li\u003E\u003C/ul\u003E","text":"While you work, each app keeps a recovery copy of what you have not saved yet. It is not a save: your file on your computer only changes when you save it. The copy is there so a crash, a closed tab or a computer that turns off does not cost you your work. When the copy is kept A few seconds after you stop editing, and at least every 30 seconds while you keep going. When you switch to another tab or window. The copy stays in this browser, on this computer. Nothing is uploaded. Get your work back Open the same app again, in the same browser. If it closed before your work was saved, it asks Recover your work? and lists what it kept, with the time of the last copy. Choose Recover to open it, or Discard to throw it away. Save it to a file as soon as it opens. Not now keeps the copies for 30 days, and the app asks again the next time it opens. A reload counts too: reload a tab with unsaved work and the app offers it back. Things to know When you save, or close a file on purpose, its recovery copy is removed. Another tab of the same app that is still open never offers your copies. It only offers work from a tab that has gone. Private windows in some browsers, and a browser with no space left, cannot keep a copy. The app tells you when that happens, so save to a file more often. Clearing your browser's site data removes the copies. Not every app keeps a recovery copy yet. Each app's own help says whether it does.","lang":"en"}],"locale":"hr","chain":["hr","en"]};
